        StaticItem("Pot O' Honey", "A carefully made ceramic pot filled with\nthick cloudy honey from Crann Saili's\napiaries. The raw honey is as thick as muck\nand sweet. Made in Belvitz, on the shores of\nthe Baltas River.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
