        StaticItem("Pumpkin", "A Pumpkin made of Bronze, good for\nDecorating, maybe Lighting a Candle in it? It\nis 15In By 15In. A Black Top Hat made of\nBronze even Adornes the Pumpkin! Its so...\nCUTE! ((I Can Alos Do THIS!))", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Tribal Kharajyr Short Spear", "A decorative weapon used for hunting a varity\nof game. The tip of the spear would be\nroughly 6 inches in length and made of a\nhardened yet polished steel. The shaft of the\nweapon would only bring its full length up to\nthree feet from tip to butt. Trailing down\nthe length of this weapons oaken staff would\nbe carvings of the moon phases and a varity\nof animals. The wood seems to be rubbed in\nsomething to make it green and a trident with\na line through its shaft would be engraved in\nthe steel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Y", "This bread is fresh and delicious", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Grain Gang", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Comb Sword", "A single edged bronze shortsword, with comb\nlike ridges on the unsharpened side. The\nsword bears an oakwood handle, treated with\nlinseed oil. The sword from tip to pommel is\n40 inches long. The single edge of the blade\nhas been honed to being shaving sharp. The\ncomb like ridges on the unsharpened side of\nthe blade start 7 inches up the blade, and\nend 2 inches before the tip of the blade. The\nbronze the blade is made from has been well\nshined, and is quite lustrous under light.\nThe sword's handle bears a small, L shaped\ncrossguard, creating a 'w' shape around the\nblade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tea", "A Variety of tea leaves from the Alnorid\nSultanate and the Far East Oyashima", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pelt", "This pelt would be heavy and sodden with\nblood, as if from a large creature.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("A Krugsmas Diamond!", "A rare gift from Saint Krug himself!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HopeSky123.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Hook", "Weathered by signs of age, the thick,\nrelatively dulled hook would be half a foot\nlong. Carved from solid bone, of what you\ncouldn't tell, it would be all but consumed\nunder some type of wild vine, enduring the\nbleakest of conditions. If one checked\nclosely, they’d notice that the bone was\nsprawling with numbered etches.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ThatGuy_777.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Dha'kyr'vhetine, Scythe of the Great Sequoia", "", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Kuila-Infused Resin Pendant", "A pendant of oak wood and a dull green\ntranslucent resin. Shaped into a rhombus, the\nwood and resin have been sanded down smooth\nto the touch and the join between wood and\nresin is virtually seamless. Strung upon a\nslim leather cord threaded through a hole\ndrilled into the wood, it may be worn about\nthe neck. Should a Druid touch the resin of\nthe pendant and utilise their Gifts, it would\nglow a soft emerald in colour, due to it\ncontaining pulverised Kuila dust.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Mark", "A circular gold coin, its face stamped with a\nbearded human face. The number 420.3 is\nimprinted along the edge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("~Silver Leaf Brooch~", "An intricately designed brooch in the shape\nof a leaf, made from polished and refined\nsilver. A few small green emeralds are\ninlaid, giving off a beautiful sparkle when\nlight passes through them. On the back of the\nbrooch, if one looked close enough, they\nwould see the shape of a leaf, signifying the\nmakers signature.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Wandering Leaf Shoppe.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cask of Cream Beer, 1652", "A thick, smooth, bubbly drink with with a low\nalchohol content, a tannish white color and a\ncreamy vanilla taste in a oakwood cask with a\nsilver spigot. The contained drink has a low\nalchohol content, less than a beer, with a\nsweet vanilla cream taste, comparable to root\nbeer, or cream soda.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("✿Potted Fern✿", "A leafy potted fern in a very Krugsmassy pot!\nIt has little reindeers and snowflakes\npainted all over it! The plant itself is\ndecorated with mini baubles shaped like\nstars, painted in gleaming gold. A specially\nshaped watering can has been attached to the\nside of the pot with hinges, so that even\npeople with limited movement can water the\nfern! Merry Krugsmas and Happy Holidays! ✿\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｔｒａｉｎｅｄ Ｍｅｓｓｅｎｇｅｒ Ｒａｖｅｎ", "A large raven trained to bring letters from\nplace to place. The raven weighs 2 kilograms.\nThe raven bears large talons on the end of\nit’s featherless grey legs, and can aptly\nhold any letter or scroll it is given to\ndeliver without dropping it. The raven is a\ndeep black that appears a shade of blue in\ncertain light, and bears deep brownish black\neyes. The raven bears a small parchment tag\non it’s leg, tied onto it’s ankle with\nstring, with the name “Ｚａｅｉｍ“ written on it.\nThe raven bears a congenial disposition, and\ntends to not get into fights with other\nbirds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by []ＡＶＩＡＲＹ[] \".", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("☀ᴮᴬᴿᴷ☀ Ｆｏｘ Ｓｈｉｂａ Ｉｎｕ ☀ᴮᴬᴿᴷ☀", "A male fox colored shiba inu. The shiba is\nlarge and weighs 20 pounds, and stands at 16\ninches tall. The shiba is orange and white,\nwith black furred legs, and dark brown eyes.\nThe dog bears tall pointed ears, and an\nexpressive face, alongside a short, curled\ntail. The shiba is well groomed, and is\nrather clean, with its nails and fur properly\ntrimmed, its teeth clean. The shiba bears a\nleather collar, with a tag on it, though no\nname. The shiba bears a a general happiness\nto it, and enjoys attention. It will many\ntimes put itself in the middle of any group\nof people, most of the time ignoring its\nowner unless it can gain large amounts of\npraise through following commands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [] ＫＥＮＮＥＬ [] \".", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Cookie", "A golden cookie with a warm, gooey chocolate\nchip center.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Claru's Stunning Chef's Knife", "A stunning looking knife, made from a sturdy\nmix of Steel and silver, the handle is made\nfrom polished dark oak wood. The blade is\namazingly sharp, and is something that\nVegetables, meat, and fruit would never want\nto go against.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ruben.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Supremely Scrumptious Medieval Kit-Kat Bars", "Oh what a joy! The smell arising from this\ndelicate staple of the Dominion lands is\nintoxicating, as it is a fusion of fresh\ncocoa converted into dark, mature chocolate\ncombined with freshly baked wafers! It melts\nin your mouth.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("A Spinel Snake Brooch", "This decorative piece of jewellery consists\nof crown gold and blue spinel. The shape is\nthat of a snake, coiled so that it looks\nasleep, decorated with gemstones in a diamond\nshaped patterning. The polished gold setting\nis textured with small punctures to give this\nreptile a distinctive look. This slithering\nlittle friend is ideal on clothes and bags,\ngiving you a distinctive and professional\nlook!", "minecraft:lapis_lazuli", ""),
        StaticItem("Wavebreaker", "A weapon equal parts deadly and stunning. The\ntips of this weapons prongs would be cased in\na polished slayersteel casing that was\nhammered into place, bands of this steel\nwould be down the length of the weapon to\nhelp strengthen the wood. The wood for this\nweapon in fact being an earthy red ironwood\nsealed in wax for a nice polished look. The\ncrowning jewel of the weapon would be a large\ncarved piece of lapis where the prongs met,\nthe lapis carving looks like a sun enclosed\nby a cresent moon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Winterleaf Aurum Blade", "Soulbound I\nThis gladius-styled short blade is made of an\nalloy of ferrum and aurum, producing a\nsufficiently sturdy and finely sharpenned\nblade. The hilt is wrapped in bleached white\nleather strips woven around the base of the\nfull tang blade. The pommel has an emerald\nset on each side, with lapis filigree\nsurrounding it to make the Winterleaf symbol.\nThe blade itself is etched with a design of a\nflowing breeze carrying leaves upon the wind,\nglinting golden in reflected light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lohrahn Winterleaf.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Claru's Board of Slicing", "A stunning masterpiece of a cutting board.\nThe slab was cut from a hand selected cedar\ntree. It's carefully oiled surface leaves a\nbreathtaking sheen to simply heighten the\nwarm hues of the wood itself. A simple flora\nborder adorns the edges.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Freyja.", "minecraft:wooden_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("White Chocolate", "A white chocolate bar about the size of a\nhuman hand. It smells strongly of vanillia,\nwith a hint of rose. It looks like a plain\nvanilla bar, speckled with rose petals. It\ncan be melted over anything, and when bit\ninto, it tastes very sweet.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fat arse reach hacks", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Sea Slayer", "The SeaSlayer is a weapon which brings\nstunning beauty to the battlefield, as well\nas ruthless fighting. The blade is crafted\nout of a fine slaysteel which brings\ndurability, and atching of waves, seashells,\nand fish which bring great beauty.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Ale", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragons Blood Wine", "Bitter but light, the Dragon’s Blood Wine is\na drink for those of refined taste. Stored in\na cool cellar for years, enjoy the labors of\nsomeone else’s dedication and hard work.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lanavia.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Fudge Brownie", "This double fudge brownie would be about an\ninch thick, and its top decorated with white\nchocolate flowers. This square of brownie\nwould contain quite a lot of fudge and\nchocolate chip- being a sweet treat to\nwhomever it was given to! Delicious!", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("∵Sea-Salt Rye∵", "A simple a bread as it comes, this soft rye\nloaf is baked with preserved salt-crystals\nwithin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sourdough", "This golden loaf of bread has a thick crust.\nA bite would reveal the obvious, sour taste\nof the bread. Great for sandwiches!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("﹌Rich Sourdough﹌", "This thick, squat loaf of sourdough is packed\nwith a strong, sour flavor to kick up any\nsandwhich or toast a notch. Pairs excellently\nwith any meat, or cheese!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("♧ Garlic-Bread ♧", "This flat-bread is quite thin, and very\ncrispy. While the bread itself lacks a strong\nflavor, the bold stench of strong garlic\neasily makes up for it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("▧ Dry-Rub Pork ▧", "The dry-rub spices on this pork keep the\nstrong flavor of the well cooked meat locked\nin. It tastes of smoke, and powerful spice,\nbut the pork itself is quite soft!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Double-Trouble Chocolate Snaps", "Doubling down on chocolate, this small cookie\nis a rich, dark cocoa color. A bite into the\ncookie reveals the name, it's a crunchy\ncookie with a great snap in each bite!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("๑ Molasses Sugar Cookie! ๑", "A sweet-treat! This pale brown cookie is\ncracked and crumbly, containing molasses and\nsugar to keep it soft and chewy. Mmm!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("♥ Strawberry Heartcake! ♥", "", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Esther's Acacian Honey", "This red mason jar is filled with sweet\nhoney! The taste is full and decadent, and\nthe sweetness is supported by hints of\ncinnamon and lemon. The jar is sealed with a\nwax stamp of a bumble-bee! ☤\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Delicious Honey!", "A dull-red glass jar, filled to the brim with\nsweet honey. A taste would reveal the divine\nflavor inside: sweetness bordering on\ndecadence, accented with low hints of\ncinnamon, and lemon. A wax stamp is on the\njar in dark blue wax, a bee!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Reward Cookie Delta", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Healing Potion", "A remedy--red in color--for moderate wounds\nsuch as stab injuries or 2nd degree burns.\nSimply apply the substance to the injury, and\nit will accelerate the healing process\nexponentially, provided it's not too grave.\nWhile the healing transpires, the area will\nbe rendered completely useless (1 irp hour).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Mana Potion", "A deep blue potion made with liquid essence\nand possessing mana restoration properties.\nIf one were to drink its contents, they would\nfind their mana producing at a rapid rate. It\nwill replenish 50% of their mana pool, but\nthey will also experience seven emotes of\nweakened magics (2 tiers weaker) and more\nexhaust from casting spells.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Soulheart Sorry Water", "A dark, murky liquid contained in a metallic\nflask. Smelling it would burn one's nasal\ncavity rather painfully, but getting it on\none's skin would cause an even worse effect.\nIt would irritate skin on contact and feel as\nif one was set on fire, lasting roughly\nthirty minutes. Unconsiousness isn't\nuncommon, especially if it gets in the eyes,\nnose or mouth. Blindness is a possibility\nunless washed quickly from the eyes. Water\ntends to spread the liquid across the skin,\nbut soothes the burning.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Solaria Soulheart.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Ink Well", "A small glass container of ink, the lid has a\nbear head etched carefully into it. The ink\nbeing made by Elizaveta vas Ruthern.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Theodosian Municipal Library.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Infinity Ticket", "A fine ticket woven of shimmering golden\nthread. Embossed upon it reads,\nRenatus-Marna Carnival : Admit One\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Locket Necklace", "A ferrum locket necklace with a coating of\nsilver, the outside has the sigil of a bear's\nhead roaring. The locket opens up, with two\nsections which allows the owner to insert\nsmall sketches of whatever they please.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Theodosian Municipal Library.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Hardened Ferrum Pilum", "The weapon would reach roughly six feet in\nits full length. The tip of the weapon would\nbe shaped akin to a bodkin arrow while a\nthinner ferrum rood would be below the weapon\nattaching to a sturdy wooden stave, this\nhardened ferrum section fully reaching for\ntwo feet while the Bodkin shaped tip itself\nis only a few inches by itself. the fully\nhardened nature of the weapon means it can be\nused in close Quarters combat or thrown.(two\nemotes if thrown also enemy might be able to\nuse if thrown)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tepah.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Living Lyre", "Long ago, a Gallic Clan seer unlocked the\nsecret of crafting beautiful instruments that\nnever fall out of tune. It was said that he\nlearned the craft from the fairy folk, as\nthey travelled between the realms. Now before\nyou sits a simple lyre, enchanted with such\nfae craft; A Living Lyre, which will always\nring faithfully true for a worthy musician.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by morrisaye.", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetian Goose Feather Quill", "A large feather delicately plucked from the\nmajestic Haense goose. The tip carefully\ncarved and lined with ferrum for the most\neloquent of penmanship.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Theodosian Municipal Library.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cookie", "The taste of this chocolate chip cookie is so\nheavenly, it's almost as if the gods\nthemselves had a hand in their creation. The\nchocolate is wonderfully rich and sweet and\nthe dough is remarkably soft and fluffy. It\nmay be the best cookie you've ever tasted!\n((Created with T5 Herblore-enhanced\ningredients.))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Soldier", "Painted with red, white, and green colors,\nthis wooden figure is often gifted to those\nthat were nice over the year.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Conspirator_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Shard", "The Ice Shard would be from the Frozen Plain,\nseeming to be quite cold and it would never\nmelt even within the hottest wether. It\ncrystals shimmering delicately shards pointed\nupon it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Vitality Tincture", "A light brown mixture in a glass vial -\nLabelled \"Lesser Vitality Tincture.\" Upon\ndrinking, the user's immune system and\ndisease-fighting properties would enhance,\nused as a medicine to fight the disease of\nill ones.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolfen Statuette", "The small statuette of a marble white wolf\nfits into your hand. The beast appears to be\nsitting with it's head craned back in a\nsilent howl.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dakirennis.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Ring", "This is a superiorly-crafted gold ring. It is\nadorned with ruby, encrusted with rose gold,\nand encircled with bands of native silver.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("lace choker with large moonstone and pearls", "Beautiful lace choker, with pearl chains\nhanging down from the sides before joining to\na large moonstone held in place with golden\ndetailing.Handcrafted, very delicate , and\nstunning , perfect gift for any woman.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Lightning Bolt", "A simple looking piece of white parchment. In\nthe center of it there would be a word\nwritten in blue lettering, a soft glow coming\nfrom it. When uttered the scroll would begin\nto burn up and a distortion would appear in\nthe air in it's place. over the period of six\nemotes a bolt of lightning would form before\nlaunching in a direction of the user's\npreference if no nearby iron detours it.\n((Contact Hoster102 for info))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Tipped Staff", "A plain, oaken staff with its main\ndistinguishing features being a fist sized\ndiamond placed at each end of the staff. One\nwould be enchanted to shoot upwards of three\nelectrical bolts, and the second of\nmagelight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Foraged Finests", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Flute of The Wilds", "A pan flute carefully crafted with reeds that\nstill hold a slight green tint to them. The\nwood binding the reeds has been carved to\nlook like brown vines and it produces a\ncalming melody even within novice hands.\nAnyone holding onto the flute for a few\nmoments would begin to see small green\nsprites appear and float around them, as if\nattracted by the music and dancing on the\nwind. Breaking contact with the reeds breaks\nthe illusion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelsioln.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye-Changing Potion", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Winter Apple Cider", "A stout corked clay bottle containing a\norangish tan liquid. The contained liquid\ntastes heavilly of ripe apples, spiced with\nnutmeg and cinnamon, with a slight bite due\nto the alchohol content. The contained liquid\nis lightly alchoholic. The contained liquid\nis notably better suited be to served hot,\nrather than chillded.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Quilted Silk Tunic", "A tunic made of silk layered into quilted\nsquares. The tunic is sleeveless, and\nsomewhat heavy. The tunic is well usable as\narmor, with the quilted layers of silk able\nto protect one from sword strikes, and even\narrows. The silk is made from that of large\nspiders, woven into a usable cloth. The silk\nis dyed a light blue. The tunic will descend\ndown to roughly the knees of the average\nsized elf or human.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Tomahawk Plushies", "A light blue tomahawk plushie. Extremely soft\nand not all that painful when hit. A great\ntoy for children!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Fay's Pan Flute", "A small hand crafted pan flute, fit for a\nchild. Its tubes are attached together using\nmany metal clasps. The tubes themselves were\ncreated from bamboo, and small carvings were\nimprinted onto the wood. The flute is also\ndecorated with a variety of colourful\nfeathers, beads and bands, each of them\nbearing their own special pattern, or print.\nThe name “Fay Aendryr” is printed on its\nside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BreadstickKazoo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Ring", "This beautiful silver ring, rests upon your\nfinger comfortably. The patters of flowing\nrivers running up and down the band, coming\nto meet and surround a beautifuly cut\nemerald. This Gem gives off a soft white\nglow, housing the enchantment for the mental\nward. T5 is reduced by 2.5 tiers, T4 is\nreduced by 3 teirs. T3 is reduced by 2.5\nteirs, T2 and T1 are practically useless. (Pm\nMrWhiteKnight19 for more infor)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Violet Mage] Serenity Al'Abass Avern.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Atheros", "A root, two feet in length, harvested from\nthe jungles of the Kha' lands. The root\nitself sports grey and brown spots, and\nserves as a pain reliever.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Stickball Trophy", "", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lavender Incense Sticks", "A collection of neutral coloured, sweet\nsmelling incense sticks that are to be burnt\ndirectly for use. Made with essential\nlavender oils, and it is said that it will\ndeliver calming, or soothing effects to the\nuser!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Trickin.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Khel'seth Stickball® Champions Ribbon!", "A ribbon given to the winners of the\nKhel'seth Stickball® Opening Tournament on\nthe 15th of grand harvest, 1645. Where the\nKhel'seth Dream Team beat the Khel'seth Blue\nfeathers in a victorious 2-1 lead! Wear this\nribbon with great pride!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kukiii.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Marriage Ring", "Gorgeous emerald ring, lined with gold and\nsilver symbols around the edge.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rabbit Rocket", "A rocket that when fired will burst with a\nradiant glow of bunnies.", "minecraft:fireworks", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Necklace", "This necklace, adorned with bright emeralds,\nis no cheap gift. The emerald stones that\nadorn the gold cord glisten brilliantly when\npresented in any light, and certainly lend\nthe wearer an air of grandeur.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Trophy", "A gold trophy depicting a man standing on a\nrock, flexing\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Bokolo Plushie", "This incredibly soft and squishy purple\nplushie would resemble the infamous\nWarhawkian native animal, a bokolo.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A Golden Qalasheen Ring", "This ring is made of pure gold, A red ruby in\nthe center with a Qalasheen gold design\nholding it beautifully, bright and amazing\nEmerald And Aquamarine jewels Are spread out\nwith each Qalasheen Curved Design. Upon the\ncenter of the Centre Jewel (ruby) small\nSilver Vines climb the Golden supports and\nMake a Beautiful and delicate Silver leaves\nand a majestic bright light blue flower, This\nmagnificent Qalasheen Ring must have Taken\nMany hours Or days to Craft with such Beauty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Stickball Trophy", "This stickball shaped golden trophy would\nhave 'stickball 1959' engraved in it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Bronze Spear", "A spear made out of bronze with an oakwood\nhaft. The spear head bears 2 bars of metal\nthat branch off of near the point where the\nspearhead meets the haft, though they\nimmediately curve back to, and join the\nmiddle of the spear, making a slight 'ϕ\nshape, with a sharp point. The entire length\nof the spear is about 8 feet long, spearhead\nincluded. The haft of the spear is made of\noakwood, well treated with linseed oil. [For\nOOC reference, the spearhead is that of a\nLunate Spear.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Key of the Wood Elves", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:green_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Chunk of Andesite", "A small grey chunk of rock that is about the\nsize of a walnut. If someone were to come\ninto contact with it, they would simply see\ntheir fists light up with flames. The embers\nwould of course do no damage to the holder,\ngiving them a sense of warmth instead.\nEverything the bearer touches would seem to\nerupt into a valley of fire, however this\nwould not be the true case; they are placed\nunder a tricky illusion! ((PM\nVoidal/FlamboyantVoid for more details\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantVoid.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Aesterwald Green", "A thin flask containing a thick green liquid,\nsecured by a metal cap which one would find a\npetal-less flower engraved in. Upon\nconsumption the drinker would find their\nspine, chest and throat unstable, causing\noverall, temporary paralyzation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ash.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Horse Statue", "A minuscule carved horse that easily fits in\nones palm. It seemed to be light in weight,\nbeing a few centimeters tall. Only when they\ncome into physical contact with it while also\nallowing their gaze to soak up its beauty,\nthey would find their vision becomes blurry\nand fuzzy. This slowly resides whenever they\nrelease the object. ((PM Voidal for more\ninformation))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Voidal.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Everyleaf", "This is a leaf of undefined species. It is a\nbrilliant green-red, and smells like fresh\nrainfall. It is the size of your palm, no\nmatter who holds it. It will never turn brown\nor wilt, and from its stem leaks a milky sap\nthat tastes like raspberries.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin4", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Royal Crown", "This royal crown is made of a silver metal,\nwith three beautiful sapphire gems at the\nfront- the middle being the largest. The\ncrown has a thin layer of felt around the\nband as to allow it to be comfortably worn.\nThe crown holds no magical properties, though\nit's clear this item holds a lot of value.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Button", "A small violet button that is used for\nclothing. If anyone were to physically touch\nthe object, they would seem to lose their\nsight, seeing nothing but black space around\nthem. This of course wears off immediatly if\nthe button is ditched. ((PM Voidal for more\ninfo", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Egg", "An egg, what more do you want?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Fury's Love", "A potato filled with the love and affection\nof ya BOI, Fury_Fire\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Upset_Ember.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Glow-stone' of Eathruz", "A smoothed over stone that gives off a very\nsmall glow, but if put into the sunlight at\ndusk or dawn, the stone begins to glow and\nwill continue to do such even after leaving\nthe light. Lasts 5 mins after leaving.\n[Message ZachsSlayer for any help!]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Rose Pollen", "A jar full of red rose pollen. It sparkles\nsomewhat when it's in direct sunlight, and\ngives off a sweet scent when the lid is\nremoved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Belladonna Graves.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Blue Bokolo Feather", "A large, perfectly conditioned Bokolo feather\npulled willingly from one of the giant\nflightless beasts. It seems to be well-kept!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Aldenburg Stout", "A dark brew made with roasted malts from the\nCounty of Aldenburg, the seat of House\nKavietsby. A strong and flavorful scent\nreminiscent to coffee enters your nostrils -\nit smells great (if you like coffee, that\nis).", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Jungle Juice", "A bottle filled with a thin green liquid, if\nthe tight cap was removed the pungent smell\nwas alike acid to those who smelled it. If\ndrank one would get beyond drunk with only a\nsingle shot, two or three may kill a person.\nIt tastes awful and a large sticker says [!]\nWARNING TOXIC, TAKE IN MODERATION [!].\nCrafted by Dael'ran, famously known as Jungle\njuice, but this of a less caliber for\nmortals. [Pm ZachsSlayer if you require any\nassistance.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("♨ Cup o' Java ♨", "A flavor packed bottle of still warm coffee,\nbrewed to keep you up and keep you going!\nPair with a splash of milk, or drink it\nblack!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("❂ Refreshing Lemonade ❂", "More sour than sweet, this cool lemonade\nharkens to memories of summer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Dog", "What appears to be a plushed canine with\nbeady ebon eyes, soft to the touch and\ndelicate in handiwork. Each stitch appears to\nbe precise and even: the button eyes angled\ncarefully above a bigger bead meant to\nresemble a large nose. There is a piece of\npink felt cut and sewn in a certain contour\nmeant to be a tongue that hung out from the\nthread smile of this adorable little doggy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by papikite.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Bear", "What appears to be a little tiny stuffed\nbear, being made of fake fur, it holds ebon\nbeady eyes and a sewn snout. It is a precious\nlittle toy!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by papikite.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Pig", "What appears to be a pig made of soft pink\nfabric with little beady eyes of black. The\nstitching is precise and even, with little\ncute snout poking out from its face!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by papikite.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Eve Pumpkin", "A sinister grin was etched across its\nterrifying features, with eyeless sockets\nthat burned into the center of your soul. The\npumpkin never succumbed to rot or disease.\nThough as it was held, you could sometimes\nsee piercing red eyes staring at you out of\nthe corner of your eye.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Party Invitation", "*A pristine parchment invitation with neat\npenmanship signed by Elyrus* \"You are invited\nto a masquerade and murder mystery party,\nhosted at the brand new tower built by The\nLiving Bridge on your way to the dominion.\nPlease bring a mask and prepare to have a fun\ntime!\" ((-621,-104 March 4th 6PM EST))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternity", "Eternity would be a beautiful wedding ring\nfashioned of quartz. There would be seven\nglimmering rubies inlaid around a large\nperfectly cut diamond at the head of the\nring. It would be of completely unique design\nsave for it's pair: Whisper.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon-Kissed Candle", "A pale wax candle that burned endlessly atop\na small golden candle plate. The flickering\nflame was a soft blue color though didn't\nseem to offer any warmth or heat. It didn't\nburn others and only itself for eternity. If\nyou put your ear to it, whispers would seduce\nyou into mindlessness until you pried\nyourself away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Eryn Serenes Arm", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Voidal Dust", "The result of an era of research, now\nwithered to fine dust. The dust lacks aura or\na trace of mana. It is interesting, however,\nthat a voidal material without a direct\nsource apparently does not dare to disappear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XXXXXXXX.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Clan Uuthlini’s Bilbemel", "A hearty, sweet blueberry mead made from the\ndarker honey of the blueberry blossom,\nseasoned with a generous dose of the\nplumpest, sweetest, most luscious blueberries\ngathered by the dark elves of Clan Uuthlini\nfor a fresh-tasting, healthy mead with an\nalcohol content of 13%\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Catarrh.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Catfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandwich", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ponderlot", "This is an eel scale bag, containing powdered\nponderlot petals. It smells sweet and\nclawing, and tastes like pomegranate. It may\nbe inhaled, smoked, or eaten, to produce\npsychotropic effects. These manifest as\nvisual and auditory hallucinations,\nhypersensitivity, and a sense of 'oneness' or\nego-death. It is commonly used in druidic\ncircles to bring one closer to nature. Its\neffects last for two Krug's hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Liquorice Cocktail", "An acquired taste,\nyet still Delicious upon\nconsumption.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cotton Candy Delight", "A sweet rum with a fairy top,\nsome come with a cherry kiss.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gummy Bear Margarita", "A drink of a thousand colours,\nwhat will you find?\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Clay Ocarina", "A blue clay flute-like instrument with 6\nholes along it, and one hole on the end of a\nspout like protrusion. In the right hands it\ncan play quite the pleasing tune.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pufferfish", "blubby blub blub.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("❂ Wolven Shroom Silk ❂", "Harvested and dried up by the Daluon-Family\nthis silk was created by using the Wolven\nShroom. The Wolven Shroom Silk seems to be a\nbit thicker, yet, seems to be as smooth as\nreal silk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Quartz Leg", "A large golems leg, it would be exceptionally\nwell made and dreadfully heavy. From the\nGolem that exploded in the Warhawkes\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather Amulet", "A small golden trinket, finely detailed and\nhand made.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cryptus Shroom", "A small container containing flakes of dried\nCryptus Shroom. If sprinkled on herbs or\nmeats, it will dry them at a very quick rate!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LaffenOutLoud.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Faerie Truffle", "Gnarled lumps that are a deep russet colour,\nthese faeries truffles are named after their\nsizes in comparison to the tiny fae\ncreatures, renowned for their earthiness in\nthe culinary world. Commonly believed to have\nafflicted stunted bodies.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon Brooch", "Small brooches wrought in the shape of a Blue\nMoon!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard Necklace", "A small shard with a hole in the top, a\nleather strap has been pulled through to\nsupport it being worn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Glass Bottle", "A cruel concoction that is encapsulated\nwithin an opaque dark blue and black crimp\ntop vial and is completely sealed by a jagged\nglass cork. If opened, the contents would\nsimply smell of stale wine and herb. Various\nsolid and liquid materials would be placed\nwithin the small container, giving the\nmixture a vicious bitter taste. ((PM Voidal\nfor effects.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("❂ Dried Bitter Reed ❂", "Harvested by the Daluon-Family this Bitter\nReed was already dried and prepared to be\ncooked and used as a medicine against nausea\nand other fever symptoms.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Night Sap", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink and Blue Cookie", "This frosted cookie is half pink and\nhalf-blue! It tastes like cotton candy!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("❂ Qalasheen Turmeric ❂", "Only grown and cultivated by the Qalasheen\nTurmeric is one of the most exotic spices\nwhich can be found on Atlas at the current\npoint. Often appearing like a peanut-like\nrhizome turmeric is always used to flavor\nfood, imparting a mustard-like, earthy aroma\nand pungent, slightly bitter flavor to it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Blissfoil", "A small collection of blue flowers perched\natop stalks of a flimsy nature. Easily\nremoved, it is a great pain reliever and\nnumbing agent. Using too much might\npermanently numb an area.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("R.F.E \\Rugged Emerald Necklace/", "Simple cut emerald that'd have small hole\nchipped through it to allow a silver chain be\nattached to allow it to be used like that of\na necklace. Said emerald be chipped and bit\nrugged yet have a bluish glow to it. On a\ncertain command word being uttered the item\nafter a few moments would begin glow. The\nemerald looking like a small heart was formed\nin it the color being a light pinkish color.\nThe light being bright like that of a small\ntorch. (Pm darkelfs for more info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Raccoon", "This is no Ordinary Raccoon but a, Romantic\nRaccoon only the Finest for anything\nRomantic, so that means a Romantic Raccoon!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Knuckles", "A weapon of 4 rings cast in one part, with a\nthick protrusion of metal on the underside.\nThe rings are all equal sized, seeming to be\nfitted for a human male's hand of average\nsize. It would be tight on someone with above\naveragely sized fingers, and loose on someone\nwith small fingers. The bronze rings are cast\ntogether in a way that it would fit someone's\nfingers put together into a fist. The top of\nthe 4 rings, what would be on the outside of\none's hand, are somewhat thickened, and flat.\nThe bronze the knuckles are made from is well\nshined and sanded, making it quite lustrous\nunder light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Pot", "haha, weed\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ozonbaby.", "minecraft:flower_pot", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_4(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Basket", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Hedgehog Plushie", "A cute little plushie of a hedgehog.\nEverything about it is soft and cuddly even\nthe spines on its back, as with all the\nplushies made by the certain creator the\nfabric is soft and warm to the touch making\nit a great nap buddy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DrususTheDumb.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Bokolo Plushie", "A blue bokolo plush, extremely soft and great\nfor children.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin5", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's Delicate Red c.1660", "The dryer red has hints of fruit and a\nlighter body. An enjoyable wine which could\nbe also paired with that of cooking. The\ncontent and tannin are quite light and will\nnot floor you upon consumption. A lighter\ndrink for the lighter person. The bottles are\nplastered with a makeshift label which states\nthe year and the sigil of purple grapes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Pants", "A merry reminder of our most\nfestive of holidays!\n*Moderator Approved*\nteegah approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Gorilla Tooth", "A large incisor tooth belonging to a giant\nape! The tooth is quite impressive, but also\nvery sharp! It would make a fine trophy or be\na material in a craft! Hey, watch where you\npoint that thing!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Foreign Maple Syrup", "Some maple syrup from a foreign, far away\nland. For some reason, those in possesion of\nit feel a heightened need to apologize. The\nmaple syrup seems to be frozen by some of the\nmost merciless winters on the planet.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lumiin.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ser Scaley Leonard Fishtimbers The Third", "A large, dead salmon that is an unhealthy hue\nof maroon and smells like.. well a rotting\nfish. It has two large bite marks present at\nits tail, and would seem to have cloudy, fish\neyes. Elinor's best friend, please treat him\nwith respect.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Voidal.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Shell Earrings", "A small pair of shell earrings, painted a\nlight blush.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Tippens root", "A horrible smelling yellow root with dark\nspots. A salve made from this plant would\nclutter up blood almost instantly, giving it\na good use in stopping bleeds.", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Carnation Pink Chalk", "This bright pink chalk easily stays on skin\nonce it makes contact!", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Pendant", "A Diamond Pendant found with the remains of a\nGoblin that was pulled from the guts of\nRazormouth\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Candles", "Small cylinders of wax, perfect for\nceremonies and tributes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rella101.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Peanut Butter Cookies", "It's a little peanut butter cookie in the\nshape of a pumpkin. A Jack-O-Lantern face is\nfrosted on top of it. Beware of allergies.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Dead Twizzlers", "A bundle of sticky red candy, fashioned to\nresemble small lengths of rope. The gooey\ncentre of this treat tastes of raspberry and\na coating of sugar dusts the outside. Tied to\nthe bundle is a small note, that reads:\n“Happy Fiesta de Fantasma.”", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Color Woller Jawbreakers", "A small, white, colorfully dotted, sphere.\nSwallow it, it's yummy, then it'll go to your\ntummy. Yummmm! (ATTENTION! IT'S GETTING DARK\nOUT! ATTENTION!)", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Assorted Candies", "A little pouch with a large variety of candy.\nSome may be sour, sweet, or even spicy. They\nmay leave a colorful residue on your\nfingertips.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Krumar Export Kompany Iron", "One Side enscribed with a Scorpion, the other\nwith the letters NAA this iron pays attention\nto detail\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LatePopeTrudeau.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose' Wine", "A bottle of lighter, blood looking liquid.\nSmells like rose' wine, with heavy fruit\nundertones. It as a low shelf life of around\na couple of months, and must be drinken soon\nafter purcase.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Castelo Reserve Port Wine v.1677", "A bright ruby-colored liquid sloshes\nenticingly about the glass. This special\nreserve wine, vintage 1677, is fortified with\nSantegian brandy to increase its sugar and\nalcohol content. This process leaves the wine\nwith a very sweet full-bodied fruity taste\nand an alcoholic kick to make any wild\nstallion envious. Pairs well with cheese,\nnuts, or chocolate.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [The Mighty] Aldonza Castelo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Autumn Acerglyn c.1683", "Well deserving of its name, this mead might\nremind one of a forest during The Grand\nHarvest. A pleasing aroma of honey and maple\nsyrup, that which it is made of, wafts from\nthe acerglyn. Often served warm on its own or\nwith a hearty meal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [The Mighty] CASTELO COMPANY.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cervantes Black c.1686", "The thicker, sweeter variant of most rums.\nBest left to sit in barrells to combine a\nwoody flavor with the almost overwhelming\ncaramel taste. Although it can be enjoyed\njust fine as a drink, the rum can be found in\nrecipes for candies and cakes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by CASTELO BREWING.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stettin Pumpkin Cider", "An orange liquid sloshes about the inside of\nthe glass. This cider, brewed in the hamlet\nof Stettin, is producd from the fermented\njuices of crushed apples and pumpkin.\nCinnamon and nutmeg are then added before\nfermentation to round out the the flavor.\nWhile drinking it, one could not escape the\nfeeling that the harvest season is upon them.\nServed best hot or cold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [The Mighty] CASTELO COMPANY.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Ale", "Golden colour with a thick, lasting foam that\ngives a full and creamy mouth feel. The\nsmooth, mild malt and gruit flavours is\nenhanced by the aromas of earth and floral\ngruit. Brewed by Aemich Grandaxe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Runic Smoke Grenade", "Soulbound II\nA handheld rock with runic inscriptions. Two\nDwinic runes can be seen and if you know the\nDwinic language it would say \"Create+Smoke\".\nA another inscription in common language can\nbe seen \"To use, speak Exi, and this runic\nitem with create a thick smoke.\" A smithing\nmark can be seen as well, DI. ((PM HIEBE for\nmore info. One time use))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:chiseled_stone_bricks", ""),
        StaticItem("Banana Juice", "Juicy Banana juice in a bottle\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Umar ibn salem.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly Vintage Red c.1652", "The sweet red has the faint taste of\nstrawberries and raspberries upon the palate,\nthough being contrasted by the sharper acidic\ntaste of the wine. With each sip, the tongue\nappears to be slightly dry though not in a\nway that attributes to discomfort. The\nfull-bodied wine would take customers unaware\nwith its strength, though sweet enough to\ncompliment even the most royal with the\nmixture of spices spread through the liquid.\nThe bottles have a makeshift label and a\nsigil of purple grapes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrum and Bronze Elven Brooch", "A simple brooch depicting two cherry leaves,\nmade of bronze with inlays of electrum. The\ntwo cherry leaves meet at the stem, and\nbranch out, making a slight V shape. Along\ntheir edges, a outline of electrum is inlaid,\nmaking the leaves pop upon sight. The pin of\nthe brooch is well sharpened, and it's clasp\nis well made. The brooch is well suitable for\nholding a garmet together, such as a cloak,\nor simply as decoration on one's person.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("throw a dog a bone!!!", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Free renames", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Card with an Hourglass", "A plain white card with a blue hourglass\nwithin. There's writing on the back in black\nink. \"Your target searches their deck for a\ncard and draws it.\" Underneath is written,\nQuen: Your target searches their deck for\ntwo cards and draws them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azureth.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Card with a Golden Ellipse", "A card with golden foil around its edges and\na shimmering ellipse within. There's writing\non the back in purple ink. \"You can play the\nEllipse after any other card is played,\nregardless of the current turn. That card\ndoes nothing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azureth.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Card with a Ellipse", "A plain white card with an aqua ellipse\nwithin. There's writing on the back in black\nink. \"You can play the Ellipse after any\nother card is played, regardless of the\ncurrent turn. That card does nothing.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose", "A simple rose encased within a resin\nsubstance, it bears a golden trim which\nclings to a little chain to be tucked into a\npocket for support; \"Forgive me\" Is etched\nonto its spine, alongside a scribed heart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hillith Athna.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Tea Chest", "This oblong wooden box contains six different\nblends of teas, each a delicate and delicious\nblend of fruits and herbs. These are sure to\nhelp you relax at the end of a long day.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Beauty", "A sweet-smelling purple potion rests here. If\nuncorked and applied to the skin, it would\nwork a wonderful solution of alchemical\nwhimsy. The skin softens and tones itself,\nremoving small blemishes such as acne! If\napplied to hair, the strands would grow\nfuller and more vibrant, leading to a natural\nflourish! If applied to the eyes, it would\nbrighten them and almost seem to glitter. A\nfavorite for beauty-conscious\nnoblewomen...and men.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Norlandic Wine", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by KefKong.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("White Wine", "A bottle of piss looking liquior. It smells\nof white wine, and is commonly used between\ndinner and dessert. It's refreshing and\nlighter, used in cooking.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("T", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Zawabate Potion", "A green slime. If drunken it would cause\nsevere hallucination effects but if rubbed\non/in a wound, it can heal almost all wounds\nno matter if its caused by slice,\nbludgeoning, piercing, aggresive magic, or\netc... Unlike other potions, it does not\ncause any tiring after-effects but CANNOT\nregrow limbs. It takes a few hours - a few\nweeks(IRP) to heal based on the severity of\nthe wound.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Q", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("U", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Ferret", "A masterfully carved ferret made from spruce.\nIt has lots of texture and details. It's\nabout the size of a puppy, perfect for\ndecoration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ChiakiTheNeko.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Potion of Celerity", "A light-red liquid inside a large bottle with\na label, writing \\\"Pozhyon of Zpeed T3\\\" Upon\ndrinking the potion, the user would become\nextremely agile & gain greatly heightened\nreflexes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Armoured] Mûrak'Ram 'Dah Purpul Zkull'.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Cider", "Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Cider, the adult alcoholic\nbeverage made from apple flavorings!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Present", "A present from winterwanderland\nI wonder what could be inside!\n(use /krugsmas unwrap to open)", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandit Skull", "An intimidating mask in the shape of a skull.\nIt conceals the identity of it's user.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crow Gryphon's Hide", "The tough flesh of a grand Crow Gryphon. Crow\nAdherents harvested the dense hide of their\nfallen bestial guardians so their signature\ncloaks may be sewn from their remains. It is\nthe belief of these lost cultists that the\nworst of winter's colds could not penetrate\ntheir hide shrouds, for nothing is colder\nthan the frigid high winds that Crow Gryphons\ntraverse.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sul'Vallel", "A short, black dagger, inscribed with a\nforeign text on the blade. When the hilt is\nrubbed, it will glow a faint, light blue.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by liam_barnett.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Water Blaster", "Arcane I\nThis appears to be some form of crossbow, but\nit has a small tank that can be filled with\nwater at the back. When you use the odd\nlittle contraption, it's water would appear\nto be some magenta color instead of the\nnormal color. When the water makes contact\nwith skin, it stains the skin for a day! Have\nFun! On the tank of water would be the words\nVeris Summer Festival, 1618\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Unlabelled Wine", "The murky bottle seems of crude quality,\nnevertheless its contents take upon a deep\nrouge as the wine floats within.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:dragon_breath", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Hide", "The Wyvern hide would be stronger than\nleather, though producing the same outcome.\nGiven comfortable padding on the inside and a\nstrong exterior on the outside.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Wendigo Skull", "A large skull of man shaped proportions.\nLarge antlers that shot backwards sprouted\nfrom its head, adorning it like a crown.\nSharp teeth lined the creatures maw, large\nand menacing in look.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Gul-San's Ornated Sword", "A somewhat simplistic looking longsword made\nof a strange particularly dark steel. The\ngrip would be made of a hard but soft black\nleather.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Bone", "A very sturdy, large and heavy bone, it\nclearly comes from a large beast and it's\nflame-resistance easily denotes it of a\ndragon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Padded Shoes", "(Common) A pair of shoes recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. They have heavily padded\non the soles, warming the feet against the\ncold stone floors.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Boxing Glove", "These gloves are made for fighting! thats\njust what they do. and one day these gloves,\nwill punch all the way over you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:fermented_spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Claw of the Watcher", "A large, three taloned claw made of ivory.\nBlack streaks would be seen across the\ndraconic statuette. Strange symbols would be\ncarved in the palm area of the claw, with\nthree pictures of stone, fire and death. It\ncould be investigated or researched if enough\ntime was put into its observation. [PM\nBedsAreBurning to Interact]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Cavity Stone", "This light green, cracked stone feels rather\nrugged and light. It could fit into one's\npalm. If rubbed, the gemstone flickers a\nyellowish, bright hue.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Claymore of the Ashtree", "Long and heavy sword made of a peculiar\nbluish steel, thought to be used with both\nhands. The hilt is made of pure aurum and the\ngrip has a red Ashtree carved into the black\nleather. The seal of the Aenguls Forge could\nbe seen at the pommel.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Meteorite Ore", "Precious ore that has been carefully\nextracted from a meteorite. It's a much\nmoredurable metal than iron, but weaker than\nboth Bluesteel and Diamond. It would take a\nwell-experienced blacksmith to forge this ore\ninto something useable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Solid gold coin", "A small shiny gold coin, seemingly years old,\nhowever not at all rusted, One might find a\ngood price for such a coin..or not\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by moosehunter123.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Data Collection Cube", "A sensory and data storage unit, used to\nstore any and all information possible. Be\nthey memories, traits, fingerprints or other\ntypes of data, the Data Cube is used solely\nto store any and all information forced into\nit. Similar to a Golem Core, the Cube may be\nimprinted with a personality. The cube pulls\nat the mind, soaking up any and all\ninformation it can find if nearby a person or\nbeing.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Bone", "A salvaged bone taken from a amber wolf. It\nseem to have a curved and slender physique\nsuggesting it was a rib. Although it seemed\nthin, it was quite sturdy\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("The World", "A card with a black back, and gold designs\nthat start at each corner, coming together in\nthe middle to form a flame. The front face of\nthe card shows a map of the Isles of Axios,\nelobrate and colorful in design. In gold\nlettering \"The Wolrd\" can be seen at the\nbottom, and a quote below it that reads \"Oh,\nto only see the world..\" ((Contact\nAssassinofawsome before use.))\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Jasper the Cat.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Earrings", "An array of diamonds dangled eloquently from\na chain of 23k white gold, into which they\nhad been pressed and set, glimmering in the\nsun and moon. If looked upon the earrings,\nthey would notice a floral design only\nemphasizing its elegance and perfected craft", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Bandit Sword", "A broken sword with no real use in combat\nother than making your defeat. ^Fortune +1^", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bord de la prospérité", "A well made Rapier, having the coat of arms\nof House Allard carved into it's protective\nspheric-hilt shield, along golden and silver\ndecorations and carves of Relourian artistics\nof expert human-made craftsmanship. Purposed\ndirectly for thrusting and piercing.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Baubas Head", "A roughly decapitated head once belonging to\na Baubas. Its black, dome-like head and razor\nsharp teeth glisten in the light.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aethermoorian Lion Figure", "This figurine is finely crafted, using iron as a\nbase, but has gold decorating the figure. The\nlion would be standing upon a slab of stone,\nroaring at the sky.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart of an Eyeless", "It appears that this is a dense crystal\nformed by blood, intricate patterns adorn\nthis particular Heart which depicts veins\nwith flowers enveloping the heart in a\nindiscriminate way. It bears a crack which\nsteadily leaks a faint red aura...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("ORDER OF BRAVERY", "For those who show themselves to be truly\nselfless and willing to charge headlong into\nthe fires, there is the Order of Bravery.\nOften heroic Knights and courageous soldiers\nwho have shown little regard for their safety\nwhen the Empire is on the line.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Carcoran Claws", "The horrific bloodied claws of a hulking\nCarcorans left hand to be in possesion of\nthese would mean that one would have had to\nhave fought the horrific beast, perhaps they\nhave a use?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by KBR.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Pathfinder's Trophy", "A small golden trophy awarded to an\nindividual that helped find a path to distant\nlands! (Atlas Transition Event)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of _Sug", "Killed on the 13th of The Amber Cold, 1621\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Starlight Lovers", "Soulbound II\nA Flawless Diamond polished to perfection\nsits within an inlay of aurum resting upon a\nsimple band of the stuff. A dusting of\nemerald is encrusted into the metal giving it\na rough and sparkly appearance. The dusting\nseen through the crystal clear diamond gives\nthe appearance of looking at starlight. An\naurum band around the diamond is shaped like\na half heart made to fit against a sister\nring. On the inside of the ring, a maker's\nmark lies: a music note with a flower inside.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystaline Blood Petal", "A beautiful petal of a red flower that shines\nwith the grotesque beauty of crystalline\nblood. It shimmers with a dark complexion on\nit's deep-red surface.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Pleskana Scales", "These scales are a hue of blue and purple,\nand seem to shine and sparkle in the light.\nThey would make for lovely jewlry pieces, or\nmake even a pair of boots!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent Scales", "The scales are quite strong, and are a great\ntrophy for those who aided in taking the\nserpent down!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Scale of a Wyvern", "Quite a beautiful item, when light hits the\nscale it reflects back a multitude of colours\nand creates an off-colour rainbow which\narches away from the light source. While\npretty, it is also quite sturdy, able to\ndeflect iron-tipped arrows with ease.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Spider Web", "These cobwebs are thick like veins and have a\nsilky shine. Their kind is macabre, but they\nare adorned by intricate patterns, only\npossible to craft by an greater Arachnoid.\nCan be braided ...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Slyzard's Hide", "Despite its owners immunity to flame, this\nhide doesn't provide its wearer the same\nbenefit. Very thick and vascular, with thin\nscales all over it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Fang", "A fang that is as large as the forearm of an\naverage human child, it's side is jagged and\nsharp which easily shreds through meat.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Tooth of a Giant Squid", "Large and menacing, this sharpened denture is\nquite dangerous. It would make quite a fine\ntrophy, but perhaps a creative craftsmen\ncould find a use for it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Scales", "A single scale, (or even a bunch), completely\nwhite. It woul be slightly flimsy like\nplastic, and had a rough texture to it. The\nedges were rather sharp, probably sharp\nenough to cut if one sliced hard enough.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Valtin Halberd", "A mastersmithed halberd would rest in your\nhands, 1.5 meters in length and with both a\ncrowbill back and a long piercing tip. The\nblade of the axe would be akin to a wide\ncleaver, in likeness of a Bardiche, albeit\nwith the general attachments of a Valtin\nHalberd. The weapon would seem to have a\nsolid oak pole fitted with an inner iron core\nto prevent it from being broken over a knee.\nTruly, a mastercrafted weapon suitable for\nthe defense of the innocents.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by IronLich.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Ruggine Potion", "A splash potion that spawns infectious and\ncontagious rashes on the victims skin. The\nskin would immediately turn red and spawn\nblisters and bumps that hold a very\nunpleasant burning sensation. This potion\nweakens a targets skin and makes it\nsusceptible to injury, as well as dazing them\nfor a slight minute immediately after use.\nRashes can prove fatal if untreated(Taking\n2irp months to kill someone)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("I", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Larihei's Fingers", "A pale, slender root.\nIt feels surprisingly smooth", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Container", "", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Tippen's Root", "A small, bitter herb\ncovered in dark yellow spots", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Zelak Chip", "A dark feather plucked from the body of the\nmaster of fabulous himself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eranikus.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Rapid Expanse Potion", "A thick black liquid sat in this bottle, if\nthe cap was opened or the bottle was broken\nsuddenly all of the liquid would turn into a\ngas, covering the area ((4x4x4)) is a mist\nthat put out flames quickly, leaving a cool\nbreeze behind it. If it was inhaled one would\nfind themselves sick within a few breaths of\nit, it also smelled like rot and the smell\nwould stick to anything it touched.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Halflings grass", "A supple chewy root. Smelling oddly pleasant,\nalmost calming.", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Boar", "The meat is marinated in salt and honey, as\nyou pick it up, the meat falls right off the\nbone.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Weakk.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Cherry", "The Fizzle-Pop Cola you love, but now with a\ncherry flavor! Made with real cherries grown\nin Dunshire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Classic", "The classic flavor of Fizzle-Pop cola. The\nworld's first carbonated soft drink, here for\nyou to enjoy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Zawabte Poison", "A green liquid. If drunken it would cause\nsevere to fatal hallucination effect. It's\nlong-lasting effect can be temporary or\npermanent based on the mental stability of a\nperson. The potion adjusts to the persons\nmindset and forces their mind to\nsee/hear/smell/ or even feel things that are\nrealistic to that persons specific situations\nand/or problems.(A King would hallucinate\nthat someone is rebelling, or become overall\nparanoid)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Luara's Light", "A tall glass of light berry cider with 2%\nalcohol content, it makes for pleasant\ndrinking. Notes of strawberry, raspberry, and\nmelon can be picked up under the gentle\ncarbonation.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Orange", "Fizzle-Pop color, but now with the addition\nof orange! Sweet, citrus, bubbly goodness!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fairfield Cider", "The fine drink in your hands is a bottle of\nFairfield Cider, freshly brewed by the finest\nof halflings.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Mead", "Made with only naturally obtained Dwarven\ningredients from carefully selected sources.\nThe pine shoots and the rich heather honey\nmixed lingonberries results in a mead with a\nrustic Dwarven feel. Brewed by Aemich\nGrandaxe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Esterian Whiskey", "This Tethese Islay has a lot of dark notes\nfrom the old oak wood barrels it has aged in.\nIt has sat for twelve years before bottled to\ndrink and is often said to taste of\nchocolate, nuts and a slight hint of\nsmokeyness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Robert I Bihar.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gin", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Godan's Vodka", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Purified Water", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kathaikaz Beoir", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mixed Berry Juice", "Mixed berry juice, served in a tall glass\nwith a pinch of vodka", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lady Bella’s Pirate Rum", "A golden rum spiced with cinnamon and has\nadded caramel. It’s been aged in a charred\nbirch tree barrels. A potent Spirit with a\nsweet taste, served usually with orange\njuice. The Drink is named after former ‘Lady\nBella’ who made the recipe.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Amelia Philippa.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fishstick", "Crunchy fishsticks with a sauce melted inside\nthe crispy shell.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Bombolone", "This doughnut-like pastry is filled to the\ncenter with a thick, rich, vanilla cream, and\nis dusted with white powder. The perfect\nIllatian treat!", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Tea", "A glass of warm green tea. It was brewed with\nMint, Lemongrass and Sage, and a keen tongue\ncould detect a hint of vanilla in there too.\nMilk and honey were mixed in to give the\ndrink a sweeter flavor, and a creamy texture.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Potion of Mending", "This concoction, only seconded in its healing\nproperties by a Potion of Regeneration, can\nheal most injuries or sicknesses. If one were\nto use this to cure an illness, the subject\nwould drink it to introduce it into their\nsystem. This would cause the drinker to fall\ninto a deep state of tiredness. If it were\nbeing used to heal a broken bone, wound, etc,\none would need to apply it to the injury.\nAfter such, the area it was applied to will\nbecome paralyzed for a long while.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Albreda's Brew", "Lovingly made by Albreda, this relatively\nsweet drink mainly tastes of cinnamon, with\nmenthol undertones. Quite alcoholic at 59%,\nthis drink is not only guaranteed to have a\nkick to it, but to warm you up also.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Water", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Judeburg Wine", "A delectable wine, tasting of sweetness and a\nhint of a vanilla blending perfectly\ntogether. This is truly a holy drink.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pipe-Weed", "It Is Grown And Enjoyed By Halflings,\nPrimarily Due To Being Sweet-Scented\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bahbou123456.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Rum", "A goatskin flask filled with the worst rum\nyou've ever drank, unfortunately.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldrich.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tequila", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Brewed Coffee", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bisteeya", "The flakey, buttery filo dough crust gives\nway to a unique filling of chicken and\nalmonds. Every bite is bursting with flavor\nof cinnamon, ginger, hints of saffron, and\nother spices.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sahar Tha'un.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Ribbontail", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusory Pendant", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sober Stone", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Charm", "A diamond, masterfully cut into the shape of\na spider. Hours of effort would have clearly\ngone into the intricate details of the charm.\nAn expensive item indeed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ahryn Skelt.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Paladic Shield of Old", "A beautifully crafted shield with designs of\nLapiz and Aurum, a crowned lion in the\ncenter.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Sea-Worn Trident", "A trident of grey metal. It appears worn from ages of being in the water\n-- but remarkably, it's still sharp and fit for combat.\n*Moderator Approved*\naerialkebab approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire-Pommeled Longsword", "A beautifully forged longsword, the pommel\nset with a shining sapphire, an inscription\nreads 'Forged by Caleb Crider'.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Cross of Horen", "This medium sized golden Cross of Horen was\nblessed by His Holiness, Jude I", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Plucked Rose", "A small red Rose which would be placed in the\nhair of a noble woman, it's pettles would\nshine in the sunlight with a bright pinkish\nred\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Isikhala.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Backsword", "A single edged blade made of unshined bronze,\nwith handle made of black locust wood. The\nblade of the sword is completely flat on one\nside, and sharp on the other. The edge of the\nblade has been honed to being shaving sharp.\nThe bronze the sword is made from has not\nbeen shined, making it a dull brown color.\nThe handle of the sword has no crossguard,\nand is made of black locust wood treated with\nolive oil, making it a bright yellow in\ncolor. The entire sword, hilt included, is 75\ncentimeters long. The end of the sword tapers\nup slightly, coming to an upward point.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling Smoke Pipe", "A Smoke-Pipe Made By The Halflings Using The\nFinest Woods , It Is Pure quality!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bahbou123456.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Cross", "A handcrafted golden cross, with five diamond\ninserted into it. Attatched to a small golden\nchain. Inscripted with god bless on the back.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("High-Grade Cocaine", "A baby-powder like substance that can be\nsnorted or implemented in a bong for an\nintense high. Extremely addictive.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _SuitAndTie_.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Ivae'Fenn Guardian cloth", "A clean, blue cloth that was usually worn\nabove the armor Ivae'Fenn Guardian. A neat\nand well-tailored cloth that would be able to\nwithstand the harsh weather conditions of the\nfar South.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Bravado.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("~Rose Chancedony Cross Pendant~", "A beautiful golden cross, handcrafted in the\nmountains of White Peak,1663. With a rose\nchalcedony gemstone set into the center, the\npink gemstone making this elegant pendant,\ncompleting any look for the fine ladies of\nAtlas\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Lamellar Tunic", "A tunic made out of bronze plates, or lamels,\nwoven together to make an effective armor.\nThe lamels are woven together vertically, and\nseem to overlap with eahother slightly. The\ntunic could be called shortsleeved, though\nits sleeves are closer to shoulderpads,\nwrapping around the top and sides of the arm,\nyet held onto the underside of the arm with a\nleatherstrap. The tunic itself extends down\njust below the groin of the wearer, if fitted\nproperly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Mug", "A somewhat simple cup with a handle, made out\nof bronze. The bronze has not been\nexcessively shined, giving it a dull\ntarnished appearance. The main cup part of\nthe drink seems to have been made in a mold,\nwith the handle attached thereafter. Whilst\nnot very pretty, the cup is excellent at\nholding liquids, and for all intents and\npurposes is great cup for those whom care not\nfor appearences.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Tea Kettle", "A simple Teapot made of bronze. The bronze\nhas been well shined, and is quite lustrous\nunder light. The teapot comes with a bronze\nlid. The teapot has a small handle and spout.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Golden Brooch of White Peak =~", "A small golden pin in the shape of a Rams\nhead of White Peak would sit comfortably in\nyour hand, being made out of solid gold from\nthe mountains of the great volcano in\nSouthern Atlas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Crab Shell", "A hard encasing, seeming to be quite sturdy\nand surprisingly light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Dab of Sticky Resin", "A small, airtight flask of a blue dyed sticky\nsap resin, useful for the sticking of two\nobjects together. A lable on the jar reads\napply heat to harden'.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gladiatorial Kopesh", "This is a well-crafted steel kopesh. It is\nstudded with black bronze, and banded with\ncopper. The object’s shaft is composed of\ndesert jukewood, and it is decorated with\nvulture feathers.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mining Pick", "(Common) A mining pick recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. While a capable weapon,\nthis pickaxe would normally be used to mine\nstone or ore.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Leery Ring", "A ring made out of purple colored steel, a\nlarge sapphire engraved into the ring. This\nring tracks the wearer's mana, measuring it\nout using color. At the peak of their\ncondition the ring should stay the same\ncolour, a slightly strange purple. As their\ncondition worsens the ring's color started to\nshift, progressively turning into a silver.\nOnce it has turned completely into a silver\nthe wearer would seem to not have any mana\nleft in them, leaving them completely without\nit until it is restored.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Lefthand Glove", "Arcane I\nA black glove of fire-retardant leather, set\nwith a multitude of rubies and lines of\nmagegold. A focus crystal sits in the palm.\nWhen the hand is squeezed, a fireball would\nform, which could then be thrown by jerking\nthe hand outward. Three emotes per fireball,\nfour charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Taelu [T1]", "A fairly standard looking dagger with a very\nsharp blade of iron make. The weapon appears\nquite standard, aside from a glimmering grey\nideogram comprised of diamond-like shapes.\nShould one touch this odd patterning, a\nmoment will pass before multiple silver\nspikes of Aerellian flame protrude from the\nblade of the weapon, causing minor discomfort\nto most spooks, though they can burn freshly\nspawned haunts and other weak corrupted\nbeings. [PM TheTri for more info][Needs\nrecharge every 2 weeks]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Apple Offering", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Blush", "A small disc holding onto packed particles of\nrosey hue meant for applying to ones cheeks\nfor a blushed impact.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Brigadier's Pendant", "A golden pendant awarded to those who donated\nto the Principality of Curon's treasury.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Righthand Glove", "Arcane I\nA black glove of fire-retardant leather, set\nwith a multitude of rubies and lines of\nmagegold. A focus crystal sits in the palm.\nWhen the hand is squeezed, a fireball would\nform, which could then be thrown by jerking\nthe hand outward. Three emotes per fireball,\nfour charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Snake Fang", "A large, curved snake fang, clearly having belonged\nto a large creature. The fang is dry and hollow, likely\nhaving once contained it's venom.\n*Moderator Approved*\nRoyim approved this item.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Blade", "A rusty blade only about three feet in\nlength. The tip of the blade has been chipped\noff, the edges unreasonably dull. Regardless,\nperhaps the missing chinks in the side could\nat least grant somebody the gift of tetanus.\nThe symbol of the order rests just on the\npommel of the blade.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Soaked Shaco", "", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Peacemaker", "A fearsome, extremely sharp slayer steel axe,\nfit for the best of undead-slayers!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Stinging Blade", "A crudely made dagger with an odd hue to it.\nIf this dagger were to cut a mortal, it would\ncause a strong burning sensation, making it\ndifficult to focus until the effects have\ncompletely worn off. [Effects last for 5\nminutes].\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Winners Dice Game Token", "This token indicates a win in a round of the\ngame.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 6xdestroyer.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Splitter", "This orcish styled axe doubles as a staff.\nIt's edge being serrated and the face of the\nblade having glyphics on it that would\nresemble an orc upon a mighty hunt. The pole\nattached would also be marked similarly and\nhave feathers tied off of the top\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gladiatorial Trident", "This is a well-crafted steel trident. It is\nstudded with black bronze, and banded with\ncopper. The object’s shaft is composed of\ndesert jukewood, and it is decorated with\nvulture feathers.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Pirate Ship", "Arr! The toy pirate ship would be carved\nboth intricately, yet with a study nature\nin mind; seemingly good for your odd\ncollector, or simply a playful child.\nLittle blunt cutlass equipped figurines\nwould be found on the set.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:acacia_boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Dagger", "This Oceanic Crystal has been sharpened to a\npoint, creating a strong yet effective\nweapon. The shard would be bound to a small\nmetal handle wrapped in leather, creating a\nvery unique dagger.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Ale", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonian Tax Slip", "Leave these in your tax box to avoid\nevictions and pay your dues to the city.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Curon.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Orb of Warmth", "A hollow bronze orb about the size of a\nbaseball that gives off an uncanny warmth at\nall times. The bronze the ball is made from\nis painstakingly sanded and shined, making it\nnearly refelctive enough for one to look at\ntheir own reflection as if looking into a\nmirror. The reflection is only marred by\ndesigns of filigrees indented into it's\nbronze surface. The ball gives off a constant\nwarmth, no matter the external stimuli, and\nin the cold would be quite useful for warming\none's hands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Mental Magic Ward", "A plain but well crafted necklace rests\nbefore you. The simple gem clutched by the\nnecklace glows dimly in its center. Enchanted\nto protect the wearer from Mental Magic\nintrusions, the gem brighten when Mental\nMagic is being cast upon the wearer. (Must\nrecharge regularly once a week, Contact\nHurferDurfer for more info.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Rubens Ring", "A ring made of gold and silver with a large\ngreen gem fixed in the center. Engraved in\nthe inner circle is the delicate design of\nthe Rubens lions chasing one another.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidically Enhanced Healing Kit", "A rustic leather satchel containing a\ncollection of various prepared salves and\npoultices. Each individual healing item was\nin it's own labelled pocket on the inside.\nThe satchel contains as followed, each in a\ndifferent pocket: A Blissfoil salve, which\nglowed softly and numbed any area which it\nwas applied to for awhile. Draugr Tongue\npaste, which stings but disinfects any wound\nit's applied to. Tippen's Root, smells\nterrible but clots wounds immediately. Along\nwith a roll of bandages.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Farcaller Badge", "", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Horn of the Farcaller", "", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Sickle Sword", "A single-edged bronze sword with a sickle\nlike design, and a oakwood hilt with a curved\nbottom. The oakwood the handle has been made\nfrom has been treated with linseed oil. The\nblade is initially straight, though bears a\nnotable curve a few a few inches up its\nlength, that than straightens out , making a\nnotable ' ᛋ ' shape. The blade tapers back\never so slightly, than ends in a blunt point.\nThe upper, outer curved part of the blade is\nthe only sharpened area of the sword, the\nrest is dull. the sword is weighted similarly\nto an axe, with a feeling of weight to the\nupper sharp area. The blade has been honed to\nbeing shaving sharp. The blade is not well\nshined, appearing brown and tarnished.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Acacia Honey", "Sweetness bordering on decadence, this fresh\njar of honey is sealed in a scarlet tinted\njar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Mask and Hemp Hood", "A cast bronze mask, alongside a quilted hemp\nhood. The bronze the mask is made from is\nwell shined, and is quite lustrous under\nlight. The hemp cloth the hood is made from\nis quite durable, and somewhat water\nresistant. The bronze mask depicts a\neffeminate face, with a smooth jaw, and a\nsmall nose. The mask, if worn properly, would\ncover the entire face. The mask comes with 3\nleather straps, that all meet together at\nwhat would be the back of one's head if worn\nproperly. the leather straps are adjustable,\nsimilar to a belt, with buckles and all. The\nquilted hemp hood is made of square sections\nof multiple plys of hemp cloth. The hood, if\nworn properly, would cover the entire head,\nand neck, leaving the face unobscured.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Peak Ale", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Cloud Candy", "This sugary confection is as soft as a cloud\nand slightly sticky. Biting into it feels\nlike biting into air, but the delicious taste\nbetrays that sensation. After eating the\nentirety of the cloud candy, only the stick\nit was on would remain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mapleveins.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Exquisite Truffel", "Extremely delicious if properly prepared.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Herblore Kit", "A rustic rawhide satchel containing a\ncollection of delicate instruments, sample\nvials and isolated pouches all crafted\nexplicitly for the study and foraging of most\ncommon varieties of herbs; An herbalist's\nbest friend. While it has no means of\ngathering harsher or exceptionally delicate\nplants such as Wisp Breath or Fire Flowers,\nit is an invaluable instrument in foraging\nfor alchemical reagents. The inside of the\nbag is signed by one \\\"Gwion B. Gallic\\\",\nimplying its creator.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Benny", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum-tipped Bolts", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield", "Within sight is the Gladewynn standard\nkite-shield, normalizing at 40 inches from\nshield top to kite bottom that protects the\nrespective arm, the wooden base of the shield\nwas topped off with a layer of resin to\nimprove durability while keeping the banner's\nsignature design intact. Iron border's the\ncorners and the middle of the kite, one might\nexpect it'd be good for bashing if all\noptions were out of order. Weighs around 7 kg\n(15 lbs) Heavier than normal, standard gear\nfor conscript recruits.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Juniper Wood Shortbow", "A shortbow made of juniper wood with a sinew\nstring. The bow is 40 inches tall, and bears\na tannish purple color. The bowstring is made\nof the chorded sinew of an animal, and is\nquite elastic. The bow bears a draw weight of\n50-60 pounds, and is not very effective\nagainst targets who're more than lightly\narmored. The shortbow bears shallow etchings\nof swirls and filigrees on the bowstave,\nthough they depict nothing. The bow seems\nto've been seasoned extensively with the ash\nof sassafrass wood. Though there is no ash on\nthe bow, it bears a exceptionally strong\nsweet and woody aroma. The bowstave bears a\nsmall, shallow notch a inch above its center\nas to help guide one when knocking an arrow.\nThe bow is a simple selfbow design.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Spriggancraft Living Longbow", "A heavy bow which appears to have been grown\ninto its current form, rather than shaped\nwith the use of tools. The wooden frame is\nentirely covered in bark whilst healthy green\nleaves sprout freely upon either limb, the\n‘bowstring’ apparently a sort of fibrous\nvine. https://goo.gl/b51pvn\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Tree Mother] Yew.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Bread", "A round, rustic, lightly spiced loaf. Toasted\nseeds and flour decorate the deep brown,\nalmost black crosscut crust. Should you cut a\nslice, the inside would be almost pitch black\nand dotted with seeds. It smells faintly of\nsweet carrot and warm spices.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Ale", "The drink doesnt look appetizing, but is\npacked with a punch, along with a bit sour\naftertaste. Quite delicious when warm, and is\nusually served along with meat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shanemcredmond_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Elven Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｔｒａｉｎｅｄ Ｍｅｓｓｅｎｇｅｒ Ｏｗｌ", "A large owl, trained to bring messages from\nplace to place. The owl weighs two kilograms.\nThe owl bears large claws on the end of it's\nfuzzy feet, and can aptly hold any letter or\nscroll it is given to deliver without\ndropping it. The owl is very fuzzy, and\nwhite, with black speckles along it's\nfeathers, and yellow eyes. The owl's feet are\nexceptionally fuzzy, making it seem as if it\nis wearing rather large slippers, or fuzzy\nshoes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by []ＡＶＩＡＲＹ[] \".", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Queen arachnid webbing", "This is a strong durable material thick like\na thin rope. The webbing is coated in a\nsubstance that makes it stick to ones hands\nand is hard to handle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Fireblood Mulled Wine", "This aged red wine carries a sweetness to it\nthat shows the care and time put into its\ncreation. Beautifully paired with savory\ncrackers or rich cheese, this is a favored\namong those looking for something light and\nclassic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lanavia.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fennic Hard Ale", "A Full-bodied drink with a Sweet, Fruity\nTaste is one enjoyed within the Southern\nLands. Its ability to Warm one's body, and\nSustain a Wonderful Flavor keeps its Drinkers\nwanting More. This Aged Ale is one used by\nMany for both a leisurely time at the Tavern,\nand for Drinking Contests amongst Friends.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fennic Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Ruggine Potion", "The Moderate Ruggine Potion is a splash\npotion that immediately turns into a mist\nwith the primary effect of knocking\nunconscious anyone who inhales/smells it, or\nis simply in its vicinty. Its secondary\neffects would be to provide an unpleasant\nburning sensation to whoever is in its mist\nand it also provides a pepper-spray effect to\nthe victim's eyes. The unconsciousness can\nlast from 10 minutes 3 hours depending on how\nmuch is breathed in although the mist\ndissolves after about 5 minutes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Orchid Hairpin", "A long pin that is decorated with vibrant\norchids; this was fashioned to hold back\nsomeone's hair or to accent the styling of\none's hair. The sweet smell of the flowers\nused to make it can still be caught wafting\nfrom it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lyadrian Des'Nox.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Last Light", "(Common) A peculiar torch recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The torch seems\nto appear like any other, except for its use.\nWhenever a non-Dwarf creature gets within\nseveral feet of the torch, it lights itself\nand sends out a blinding red light for\nseveral seconds. (1 Use)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of kizaura", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mead", "Smells of honey and heavy alcohol. A\nsweetness followed by a burn and kick. Brewed\nby the Darwegians that own a meadery outside\nof Haense.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rajnarok.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Warhammer", "The warhammer infront of you, bears a curved\nhead, leading into a series of sharp points\nof contact. This then leads to the handle,\nits features quite distinct, it bearing\nsymbols and letters, also adorning a small\ncrystal at its end.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Forgemaster] Dürar.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cast-Iron Anvil", "A small anvil made from wrought iron, which\nhad been reinforced. The shape of the anvil\nacross, measured at 5'5; whilst its depth\nrested at 4'3. The make of the anvil is of\nprecision and craftsmanship.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kilgar Starbreaker.", "minecraft:anvil", ""),
        StaticItem("Kalir-Zalar", "A steel dwarven warhammer, the head and shaft\nenscripting runes. It was carried by Dürar\nGrandaxe for centuries, becoming his\nsignature weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Craftsman] Dürar Grandaxe.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Smithing-Hammer", "The tool in-front of you, made from pure\nbronze enscripts runes on its side, which\ncurl around the body of the hammer. Its make\nis off precision, having little to no\nheating-stains on it, the head of the hammer\nwarn down, over many usages.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Forge-Master] Dürar.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Smithing Crucible", "A small crucible made from Re-inforced aurum,\nit is used to bear molten metals when\nsmithing. Heating-stains can be seen across\nthe crucible, infering an extensive amount of\nuse.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Forge-Master] Dürar.", "minecraft:flower_pot", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_5(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Dagger", "(Rare) A serrated golden dagger recovered\nfrom a cultist of Vilketa. The blade itself\nhas several runes running along the blade,\nwith the handle wrapped tightly in blood\nstained white cloth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Notification", "Your enderchest has been taken to be\nreviewed. Due to the issues that have cropped\nup, they will be returned after the map\ntransitions. Please read \\\"Flam's General\nAnnouncement\\\" on the forums for more\ninformation. Alternatively, another post will\ngo live once the map transitions which can be\nlooked at. If you have any questions, you can\nPM me over discord at Flamboyant#8856 or PM\nme over the forums.\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Bloodstone Ring", "A ring made of bronze, inlaid with a single\npolished bloodstone, made for the purpose of\nbeing worn on one's finger. The bronze the\nring is made from is well polished and is\nquite lustrous under light. The ring itself\nseems to've been cast in one part, and bears\na consistant edge, as if it was cut out from\nthe middle of a pipe, though it's inner\ncorner', or edge has been filed down\nslightly, ensuring it is not abbrassive to be\nput on. The ring is inlaid with a circular,\nflat, polished green stone, with large\nsplotches and swaths of bright red, known as\nbloodstone.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Fluffy Feathers", "Just a normal feather, but fluffier... i\nguess?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Southern Roke Pipe Weed", "This pipe weed seems to be tougher than any\nof its counterparts from the north as if\nbecause of it’s tougher growth conditions the\nweed itself has benefited. It would burn for\nlonger and seem to have a harsher tasting\nsmoke.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Windward Smoking Pipe", "A smoking pipe that looks to have been\nhandcrafted from oak wood. When you draw from\nit the air seems to pass through with ease,\nas if it has been crafted by someone who has\na deeper understanding of air flow. A small\nsymbol of an Owl is burnt onto the side along\nwith the date. -1650\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arhadir.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Carrot", "This 6 ft long sword was forged and crafted\nto look like a carrot! The black steel was\ndyed over and over to an orange color while\nthe entire shape of the blade looks like a\ncarrot! The hilt is turned green aswell to\nmake it look more like a carrot. The edges of\nthe blade are very sharp, but the point of\nthe blade out shines it all! It is sharper\nthan ever could be, Piercing through anything\na sword can pierce! ~Gnome slayer~ is nicely\ncarved into the blade of this Dwarven sized\ncarrot sword\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Figure", "A toy figure perfect for kids and adults\nalike. A small 'sword' made out of a Boars\nbone rests beside the figure, glued in place\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiked Cactus Green", "A lump of cactus green that has stranger\nlight green leaves amongst it.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Participation Medal", "A trashy looking participation medal... I'm\nsure despite its quality you did mediocre...\nMaybe.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:emerald_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Glory, Ardent Sword", "This magical artifact takes the shape of a\nfinely crafted sword, granting the wielder\nconfidence, banishing doubt and stress from\nthe swordsman's mind. The sword holds another\nqaulity, able to discharge a blinding light\nthat will leave minor burns on visible skin.\n((OOC: For more information, please look in\nthe Approved Artifact section for Glory,\nArdent Sword under the title [MArt] Radiance\nand Glory. PM knghtArtorias if you have any\nother questions.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bones of Chutagla", "The dull bones tell it's history, the marks\non them the proof of the battle between the\nnortherners and the dragon Chutagla.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by PorkNchopS.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Sealight", "This is a finely-crafted spotglass flask\ncontaining sealight. It is a gel consisting\nprimarily of water and collagen. The remnants\nof Turgon Algae within the gel produce a weak\nphosphorescence for a few minutes after\nexposure to the sun.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:sea_lantern", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragments of a Pot", "These are the fragments of an\nexceptionally-crafted fired cavemud pot. They\nare mottled and scratched, some have been\nworn down to nothing. They are tinged green\nand white from moisture and sun exposure.\nFaded herb-fungus dye can be found on the\nfragments. The remnants of indecipherable\nillustrations can be found on the fragments.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Pot", "This is an exceptionally-crafted fired\ncavemud pot. It is studded with acacia,\nredwood, and diorite, and is encrusted with\nhepatite. It is encircled with bands of woven\naqua hen grass, and woven sawgrass. It is\npainted with herb-fungus dye. On the item are\nillustrations of elves. The elves are\nperforming labors, including woodworking,\nfarming, and alchemy. On the item is an\nillustration of Malin and Iblees. Iblees\nappears terrified. Malin is posed\ntriumphantly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Lorraine Cross", "A holy Lorraine cross in the form of a\nnecklace lays before you, it'd be glistening\nwith pioustivity. All proceeds go to the\nChurch!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Varekan", "The metal sphere is rather cool to the touch\nbut warms upon activation. The curving shapes\nof the runes across the surface light up at\nthe touch of the user and emit a bright\nwhite-blue light from across the entire\nsurface of the sphere. As it is with all\nrunes, the runes would cease to work without\na timely renewal and would stop working all\ntogether after several uses.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:sea_lantern", ""),
        StaticItem("Infernal Rod", "A sturdy, 1'6 wand like object carved from\nwhat appears to be draconic bone A large\nfiery hued topaz would rest at one in within\na carved dragon's maw - Two smaller rubies\nresting in either eye socket which would take\non a fiery tint upon activation. The objects\nlength would be carved with a scale like\npattern, and its grip crafted from tough\nWyvern hide. Should one utter a certain\ncommand the rod would let loose a great fiery\ntorrent from the topaz at its end within a\nthree meter range!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Renascence Egg ★", "An easter egg so good-looking that some\nrenowed artists such as Horenardo da Vinci,\nMalilangelo and Krugatello have made great\npaintings about this egg. But it doesn't\nreally matters since all you want to do is to\neat it due to its innovative taste of grapes\nand chocolate. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Trophy", "A golden statue containing of etched details,\nappearing to be that of a giant man holding\nonto a kite shield and sword; Melee winner,\nof the Chambery tournament under Callan\nGromach; 8th of The First Seed, 1627.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("? Tasty Egg ?", "An easter egg found deep underground trapped\ninside the preserved bones of ancestral\ncreatures, and yet, the eggs seem to be\nintact. It probably did no good to these\nterryfing creatures, but it should be fine to\neat for you since it tastes of strawberries,\nnuts and chocolate. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart of Kezt", "This necklace contains a crude ruby gemstone\nor unusual shape, strung along with silver\nchain. http://tinyurl.com/z8l9o65\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantSoup.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Durendal", "A standared, 6' longsword with almost\nsinister looking etchings carved into its\nblade, and a misty, glowing saphire in its\ncrossguard. Should a certain command be\nuttered, these carvings would light up with a\nweak teal glow and in turn cause six razor\nsharp shards of ice to form about the blade\nin a reletively short ammount of time (2-3\nEmotes) and then fire on a second command (1\nemote). These shards are more then capable of\npiercing unarmored and leather clad\nindividuals. It has 2 charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("3rd Place Gauntlet Trophy", "The trophy for being the 3rd player to\ncomplete Zindrans gauntlet, awarded to\nMarijuanaology. Congradulations!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:iron_block", ""),
        StaticItem("߷ Philosophical Egg ߷", "An easter egg with scriptures of an unknown\nlanguage that does some nasty comments about\nboth dogs and cats and ten reasons why you\nshould replace one of them (in case you have\none) for a beautiful rabbit. But you can't\neven care about it since you get cravings to\nhave a bite and feel its taste of\nmarshmallows with chocolate. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aeldinic Wine", "Aeldinic Red imported from Aeldin, its\nweathered green bottled tied with thin linen\nrope into a hexagonal pattern. It is widely\nknown for its bold aroma and velvety taste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Robert I Bihar.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Doubloon", "A strange coin that seems to have rusted\nover..... Perhaps this currency could be used\nsomewhere.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiney Boots", "What seems to be a pair of fancy boots that\nshine with glitter. They appear to be\nabsolutely fancy! And could be suitable for\nanyone - even GOD!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Leaf Necklace", "This necklace seems to pulse a soft green\nalong the spine and veins of the leaf, giving\noff a light hue with each moving pulse. The\nrest of it is a refined steel, giving the\nwearer a bit of warmth when worn. It can be\ndetatched for a cape hook.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Chamomile Tea", "A warm glass of Chamomile tea. It was brewed\nwith dried German Chamomile petals. Milk and\nhoney were mixed in to give the drink a\nsweeter flavor, and a creamy texture.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rainey's Walking Stick", "It's quite literally just a long stick. It is\nused to feel surroundings... Allowing Rainey\nErischi to know where she is going.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Orange", "A very sweet and tangy orange, it's flavor\nenhanced to the best quality possible by a\nDruid who is a master in Herblore. These\nqualities would carry over to any drink made\nfrom it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Seed Druid] Kefi.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Morko Bear Bone Club", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Animal Skull", "The cleaned skull of a large adult grizzly\nbear. It appears to have undergone a\nbleaching processes which has left no damage\nwhatsoever. The teeth show wear and the bone\nstructure indicates it was a rather large\nspecimen, probably well into its prime.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fast Shadowfolk's Head", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Chip Cookies", "A bundle of chocolate chip cookies, baked\nhastily into uneven shapes. They’d be solid\nto touch, though harbouring a gooey center\nshould one break in half. A very faint smell\nof vodka can be sensed from the cookies, in\nenough attention was given.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hvcks.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cut Lemon", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrion Black", "A dark brew fashioned by unknown Raev\nmethodoly of Ostrelesy, favored by the\nCarrion hegemony. It tastes of the Sun's\nSmile itself.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Foxhide", "The thick, beautiful and undamaged hide of a\nrust-colored fox, one of the wilds' most\ncunning predators. Just as cunning as prey,\nquarry for a skilled hunter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Steel War-Scythe", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Arbor Tax Slip", "The stamp of House Silversteed, a Silver\nStallion rearing on two legs, is in the\nbottom corner.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Strength Potion", "A minor strength potion that would last for\nabout an hour, it would allow you to lift\nheavy things or get a small boost in battle.\nAfter the effects waer off you would feel\ntired and your muscles would be in pain\n((Contact LazyLordNick if you have any\nquestions))", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Prince Commodus' 'Krak du Shine' Moonshine", "Home brewed moonshine made in the Mos\nle'Harmless Cantina. Strong and taste and\ntakes the pain away. You can't help but feel\nyou want another for some reason...", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Krak du Shine", "Mos le'Harmless' customer favorite MOONSHINE.\nServed in a mason jar and with a strong\nalcoholic odor that burns the nostrils, it\nsurprisingly tastes pretty good and hits the\nconsumer quick. You can't just have one...", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Corvisange", "A thick resin, it would appear to be\ntransparent and holds a purple hue. A simple\nbit of consumption of this thick resin would\nprove to paralyze the applied area and would\nseem to have a heavy nulling effect on pain!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [LvL 79 Paladin] Ascanius.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bile Extract", "A pugnant substance extracted from\nbilespitter venom glands.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dunshire truffles", "A brown fungus regarded highly in the kitchen\nfor it's good taste", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Waldenian Lager", "A frothy ale originating from Vanderfell, the\ncapital of the Konigreich of Aesterwald in\nthe Atherian Era. Light and crisp, the lager\nis best served with a hardy meal but is great\nby itself still. I don't always drink beer,\nbut when I do - I prefer Waldenian lagers (at\nthe Mos le'Harmless Cantina).", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hansetian Prayer Candle", "A small candle made from white wax, with a\nsimple metal guard affixed to the bottom to\nserve as a handle and to catch dripping wax.\nCreated for the Hansetian Candlelight Vigil\nof 1683.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Wine", "A glass of light fruity red wine. Quite sweet\nfor a red, the flavour more resembles that of\na rosé; stronger flavours of strawberry and\nlime, while undertones of plum and cherry are\napparent in the smooth aftertaste.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stout Ale", "A tall bottle of thick ale, smelling of\nstrong alcohol and faintly of honey.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｃｈｏｃｏ Ｃｈｕｎｋ Ｃｏｏｋｉｅ", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Anbella’s Hearth Pale Ale", "This pale ale has a slight amber coloring, it\ntastes full and malty with a strong taste of\nhops as well, and is very refreshing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cpt_Noobman.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Linen Tunic", "A simple tunic made from finespun linen. The\ntunic bears grey lining on it's collar, hem,\nand sleeves. The tunic is made from 4 layers\nof linen, and is notably insulating. The\ntunic, if fitted properly, would end just\nbelow the groin of the wearer. [PM\nAuric_Saint for skin file.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Brocadesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Remant of a Giant's Tooth", "A rugged and half-broken shard of a giant's\ntooth.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:quartz_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Liquorice", "A small jar with small pieces of chewy black\nliquorice. The liquorice was either in long\nstraps, rolled up or it was in the shape of a\nleaf. It'd be quite sweet, though it still\nhad the destinctive liquorice taste to it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Sentinel] Gilondir Oronar.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Earl Gary Tea", "Earl Grey tea is a tea blend which has been\nflavoured with the addition of oil of\nbergamot. Bergamot is a variety of orange\nthat is often grown in Italy and France. The\nrind's fragrant oil is added to black tea to\ngive Earl Grey its unique taste\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HopeSky123.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mika's Blade", "A special blade that was doomforged by a\nmaster smith. Given to a small child whose\nfriend had passed.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Tunic Outfit", "A simple outfit consistant of a brown\nlongsleeved shirt, a pine green tunic, white\nleggings, and boots. The brown longsleeved\nshirt is made of linen, the green tunic is\nmade of spidersilk, and the leggings are made\nof wool. The outfit likewise comes with a\ndark leather belt, with a bronze belt buckle.\nThe tunic, if fitted properly, will extend to\nthe middle of the thighs of the wearer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Brocadesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lead Sling Bullets", "6 small cast lead sling bullets, weighing\nroughly 4 ounces each. The sling bullets are\neach roughly an inch long, and have been\nproperly smoothened, though not shined very\nmuch. The bullets bear a notable almond shape\nwith 2 pointed edges.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Metal Box", "It's a small metal box!", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Billy's Bread Flavored Soda", "The soda has waxy paper wrapped around its\nmid-section stating “Billy the Bread Vendors\nBread Flavored Soda”. The Soda makes a Fizzy\n*pop* noise when opened and tastes strongly\nof bread, leaving a tingling sensation on the\ntongue after every sip\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Grace's book O' names", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Silmaen Vodka", "An extraordinarily strong brew of Vodka,\ndistilled by a hobbyist brewer. It looked\nentirely like a clear bottle - the only hint\nof it being brimming with alcohol being a\nwavering line within. A shot or two would put\na grown elf on their bottom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Loriens.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("❖ Gauntlets of The Golden Light [T5] ❖", "A pair of gauntlets made of silver with\nornates on gold, each of them would have a\ngolden ideogram carved on the outer side with\nthe shape of a shield. If a dark being of\ncorrupted soul dares to enter in direct\ncontact with the gauntlets they would feel a\nstrange sensation as golden soulfire would be\ninvoked, wrapping around them and taking the\nshape of gloves around the gauntlets, causing\ngreat pain and burning their tissues if the\nexposition is prolonged. ((PM Suxals for more\ninfo))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Breadesses Merchant licence", "A piece of paper granting the Breadess\npermission to sell bread within the Earldom\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Peasants Wooden Gambling Dice", "", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Dagger", "Before you would be perfectly crafted dagger.\nOn close inspection you would see Roses\ncarved delicately into one side of it, on the\nother would be the name 'Kaia", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Jumper!", "A Krugsmas jumper in a brilliant shade of\nred, decorated with fur - much like Father\nKrugsmas' famous coat! On the front, several\nreinders have been carefully stitched into\nthe fabric. Each one wears its own Krugsmassy\nhat! Very Festive. Merry Krugsmas 2018!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Curved Short Sword", "A curved short sword that had a leather\nwrapping around it for better grip. On the\nedges of the blade was sparkles of Aurum that\nhelped for cutting through undead and the\nlikes. Along the hilt was a set of diamonds\nthat overlapped in each direction down the\nsides of the hilts. Across the main part of\nthe blade was etched in purple tattoo-like\nmarkings that gave off a soft glow when held.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kiki", "Lunetta Ragnarson's personal messenger Macow.\nThe bird looks perfectly normal, but seems to\nhave a blue bow tied around it's neck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shy_French_Fry.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Umar's Beating Stick", "This stick is used for primarily to beat Umar\nIbn Salem. (Lava1izard).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Frederick Bobbs.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｂｒｏｎｚｅ ａｎｄ Ｒｕｂｂｅｒ Ｇａｕｎｔｌｅｔｓ", "A somewhat complex bronze gauntlet, with a\nblack rubber lining. The black rupper lining\nis a glove in it's own right. Initially\nrather small, the glove can be pulled on, and\nwill stretch to accomadate a hand around the\nstandard descendant size. the cuff of the\nglove is capable of being pulled up the the\nelbow of someone of normal descendant height.\nThe gauntlet itself is sewn onto brown tanned\nleather, the metal part of the gauntlet\ncovers all of the fingers, the wrist, and the\nback of the hand, leaving the palm with only\nit's rubber covering. The rubber is sourced\nfrom the Winterleaf family.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:jungle_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Lamb", "A pretty, lambshaped stuffed toy. It'd be\nmade mostly of wool, being extremely soft to\nthe touch, and nicely stuffed, to give it\nthat soft, comforting feel. The head had eye\npaterns sewn into for eyes, aswell as a\nsmile. Overal, a pretty toy for a young\nchild.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Jute and Leather Sling", "A short sling made from braided jute rope,\nwith a leather 'pocket'. The leather pocket,\nthe place in which the sling ammunition is\nput before firing, is rough on one side, and\nsmooth on the other, and is able to be used\nwith the stone in either side. The tan jute\nrope the chord of the sling is made from is\nbraided twice, and is rather strong under\nduress. The sling is well useable as a\nweapon. If used properly, it is able to send\nammunition flying at quite a high velocity.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Oh fuck, I can't believe you've done this", "Seriously, what the fuck mate.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caesar and the Mile High Orchestra.", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Red Leather Satchel", "A simple satchel made of red leather. The\nsatchel is 14 inches tall, and 6 by 17 inches\nwide. The satchel bears a single leather\nstrap that is 4 feet long, and 3 inches wide.\nThe satchel is made of leather treated with\nbirch tar, and bears a somewhat rigid body.\nThe satchel bears a single flap, festooned\nwith bronze studs around its rim, with a\nsingle vertical slit in it's middle, with a\ncorresponding bronze button on the body of\nthe satchel as for one to be able to fasten\nit closed. The satchel bears 4 3 inch wide\npockets along the inner wall of the satchel.\nThe strap of the satchel bears a wide bronze\nbuckle, allowing it to be adjusted similarly\nto a belt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Lapis Lazuli Scarab Pendant", "A necklace made of bronze and lapis lazuli,\ndepicting a scarab. The chain of the\nnecklace, and the backing of the pendant are\nmade of bronze, whilst the scarab centerpiece\nis made of lapis lazuli. The bronze the\nnecklace and the backing are made from has\nbeen well shined, and is quite lustrous under\nlight. The lapis lazuli the scarab has been\nmade from is well smoothened, and bears a\nglossy finish. The lapis lazuli scarab is one\ninch tall, and 2/3rds of an inch wide. The\nscarab is comprised of 4 cut lapis lazuli\nsections, 2 for the wing-cases, one for the\nupper back, and one for the head. The bronze\nbacking is flat, and makes a small frame\naround the lapis lazuli scarab. The bronze\nchain is 14 inches long.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Druid-Bronze Ring", "A simple ring made out of an odd bronze. The\nbronze the ring is made from bears streaks\nand flecks of yellow and pale green along\nit's length. The bronze the ring is made from\nhas been shined extensively, giving it a near\nmirror finish. The ring appears completely\nconsistant on the outside, appearing as if it\nwas cut out of the middle section of a pipe.\nThe inner edge of the ring has been\nsmoothened, and filed down, as to assure ease\nand comfort of wear. Should a druid cast with\nthe ring in their grasp or on their hand, the\nring shall glow a pale green color. The ring\ncomes with a small dyed pine green canvas\npouch with a jute drawstring. The pouch is\nvery small, and only capable fo holding 4 or\n5 rings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:magma_cream", ""),
        StaticItem("⍆⊷⊶⊷ Ｋｉｎｇｗｏｏｄ Ｌｕｔｅ ⊶⊷⊶⍅", "A long stringed instrument used to play\nmusic. The lute bears a notable 'teardrop\nshape, with the bottom being the tailpiece\nand belly of the lute, and the top being the\nneck, and pegbox of the lute. The lute is\nmade of kingswood, treated with olive oil.\nThe head of the lute bends at a 90 degree\nangle from the neck of the lute backwards,\nmaking a notable 'L' shape. The lute bears 6\nstrings, fitted from the tailpiece to 6 pegs\nat the top of the lute. The lute bears a\nsingle '☗' shaped hole in the center of the\nbelly' of the lute, revealing it to be\nhollow. The 6 strings of the lute are catgut,\nand differ in size, being thicker on the\nright side of the lute, and thinner on the\nleft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Dirty Paper", "Apon this small peice of paper would be\nwriting, it read \"The darkness will fall", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Llama Plushie", "Soft and fluffy to the touch, this toy would\nmake a great gift to anyone. This particular\nplushie is a black variant, with a white loop\nfrom the point of the shoulder going all the\nway around to the withers. Only the front two\nlegs would be white. It is stuffed with\nauthentic llama wool.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by cowmoonist.", "minecraft:black_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Blowgun", "A 10 inch wooden narrow pipe/tube made for\nshooting darts, it holds space for one dart\nthat is activated with the persons\nexhalation; the stronger your lungs, the\nfarther a dart would go.(Similar to a bow, it\nrequires 2 emotes to be armed and shot.\nRequires Ammo in inventory.)\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｓｕｇａｒ Ｃｏｏｋｉｅ", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Summer Soap", "A soap that fits into the palm of a person's\nhand. The soap is made with basil,\nlemongrass, amyris, spearmint, shea butter,\ncoconut milk, and yellow clay. It's used in\nbathing, for immune support, calming nerves,\nlift moods, and help one focus.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Gilded Marzipan", "These pieces of perfectly-sculpted marzipan\nare lined in gold leaf and sealed with a wax.\nAlthough they're made of foodstuff, they're\nnot meant for eating, but as a piece of art.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:speckled_melon", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Cross", "An aurum cross with a pointy tip, its whole\nlength is about 8 inches", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Warhammer", "A bronze blunt hammer head on the end of a\nlong haft, as for use as a blundgeoning\nweapon. The warhammer is 90 centimeters long,\nfrom the bottom of the haft to the top of the\nhammer head. The bronze the hammer head is\nmade from is minimally shined, giving it a\nbrown, tarnished appearance. The oakwood haft\nof the warhammer has been treated with\nlinseed oil. The hammer head is of a claw\ndesign, with a straight 10 centimeter spike\non one end, and a flat, blunt end at the end\nof a 8 centimeter long neck. The face of the\nhammer is square in shape. The hammer head is\n22 centimeters long, 10 centimeters high, and\nweighs 1 kilogram. The haft is fortified with\n2 30 centimeter long langets nailed onto\neither side of the haft from the head.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll Tusk", "Thick tusk-bone removed from a troll.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrew Pelt Hood", "A hood made of the finest pelt of a gaint\nshew , its stitching perfect with a inner\nlayer of padding on the inside for extra\nwarmpth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Jondead.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Portrait of a Bronzesmith", "A printed portrait of a man with long hair,\nglasses, a goatee, and a large nose. The\nportrait has been printed on a flat sheet of\nbronze. The portrait consists of 2 layers of\npaint. One layer of white paint, and one\nlayer of black paint. The portrait has been\nset onto a base of blue canvas. The bronze\nsheet is rather thin, and light. [Art by\nMeb90/Supermeb90]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("♝ [The Mayor] ♝", "Obediah’s exclusive signature drink, the\nglass is filled half way up with aged scotch\nand the remainder poured with grain alcohol.\nClouds of scotch twirl within the clear glass\ngiving is a bronze color. Only those who have\nno hope in life should taste the bitter\nsadness concocted in the drink.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chillwind Boots", "A set of enchanted boots which allow the\nwearer to traverse water by freezing the\nsurface beneath the feet solid.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Chitinous Plate", "Made from spider-ant hybrid, the material\nwould be effective in creative durable\nshields and armor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DivineJustice.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Candy", "A see through candy with a red hue to it. It\nwould break easily much like a piece of glass\nand if you were to consume the odd candy it\nwould leave the taste of red apple in your\nmouth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Krummavisur Feather", "A small object , six inches in length. It is\njet black, and it's white at the root.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bread Sticks", "Good Ol' bread sticks, freshly made by Kevin!", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Hardened Bronze Sickle Sword", "A simple bronze sword with a sharp, hardened\nedge, a hilt with a curved bottom, and an\nancient design. The sword bears a handle made\nof oak wood, treated with linseed oil. The\nblade itself bears a slight curve a few\ninches down, yet than straightens out, making\na slight '⚡' shape. The sword's edge is\nshaving sharp, and can last under fair\nduress. The blade itself is a bit dull, and\nnot very shiny, seemingly due to its heavier\ntreatment to harden. [For OOC reference of\nwhat this looks like, its a canaanite sickle\nsword.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Sword", "A hand and a half sword with a braided\nleather handle and a sturdy iron pommel. The\nblade tapers to a fine point, and gleams in\nthe sunlight, showing that its owner keeps it\nwell.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheMineyMan99.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Anbella’s Hearth Mead", "Brewed with apple blossom honey and spiced,\nthis thick and sweet tasting mead is perfect\nfor warming up on a cold night.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cpt_Noobman.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Anbella’s Hearth Lager", "This golden pilsner smells and tastes almost\nfloral, with a zesty, citrus-like aftertaste\nthat might leave you wanting more.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cpt_Noobman.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Anbella’s Hearth Hard Cider", "This drink is strong and sturdy, but not too\nsweet. It tastes heavily of the apples used\nto brew it, with a slightly-sour aftertaste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cpt_Noobman.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Absinthe Verte", "An emerald green spirit which would turn a\nmilky, lime green when water was added. It\nsmells of anise and mint. The elegant bottle\nis labeled “Apotheke Verte”, a product of the\nAlchemists’ Guild.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Absinthe", "A lightly-green drink rests here, smelling\nfaintly of earthen tones. If drank, it would\nprove to be an exceptionally potent alcohol\nat 100%, along with being spiked with small\namounts of Halfling's Grass to cause a mellow\nfeeling in the drinker. Best for those who\nneed to calm down while still cracking a cold\none with their buddies.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Premium steel lighter", "A flint and steel style lighter using a\nflint-wheel to ignite a flame. It is cased in\na hard steel, clearly made of good quality.\nIt has etchings into the steel of various\npatterns.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Ground Shadeleaf", "It's been ground so finely it's now a powder\nthat's been dyed white and cut with various\nsubstances such as alcohol, Wisp Breath and\nCactus Green. It produces a feeling similar\nto Cactus Green yet more energetic. Best\nrubbed on gums or snorted.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Green Cigar", "A bundle of great quality dried and fermented\ncactus green wrapped in a dark brown hemp\npaper to form a far cigar. This has been made\nto be smoked.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Daelish Sarissa", "A 15 foot pole-arm spear. Forged by the\nDalstadt peoples.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rajnarok.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kaetheryn's Fighting Staff", "A staff specially made for Kaetheryn Ojorna.\nA redwood handle with ferrum caps.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kætheryn Ojørna.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Don't mine it...", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("I warned you....", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("☼Withfoot Hard Cider☼", "A sweet and lighthearted beverage made from\nfermented apple juice. The drink is clear and\nhas an amber hue. \"Withfoot Hard Cider -1624\nhas been labeled onto the bottle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Buttered Rum", "A creamy drink of mixed spices, perfect for\nthe Krugsmas season. Served hot to help warm\nup its drinker on cold and snowy days! A\nsmall slip of parchemtn would be attached to\nthe neck of the bottle with red ribbon: \"A\nMerry Krugsmas from the Castelo family to\nyou\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by CASTELO COMPANY.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("100% Organic Squid Steak!", "Steak from a flying squid? Odd, but tasty!", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiked Eggnog", "A simple mix of egg white and water made\nalcoholic,commonly drank by those without a\nstrong stomach", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Raiding-Ladders", "Raiding-ladders that can only be used in\nraids.\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:ladder", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternity Seed", "A gnarled, wooden walking stick. The tip is\nadorned with a golden ocelot head.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheBananasaurus.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Yellow Silk Band", "Soulbound II\nSoulbound II\nIt's a small silk band that may wrap around a\nfinger. The fabric seems worn and thin and\nwould be significant to whoever wore it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Allieice.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Thank You Card!", "A card meant to make the reciever feel\nbetter. \"Heard you might not be feeling the\nbest, it's ok though, I'm here to make you\nsmile! Thank you for being so protective an\nmotherly to me! -Love Romulus.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Waldenian-Style Beef and Sauerkraut", "A thin cut of the most tender beef has been\nseared in a pan with butter and seasonings.\nPoured on top is a hefty serving of gravy\nalong with a generous portion of salty\nsauerkraut.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetic Boar Meat and Hide", "A well cut piece of haensic boar that still\nretaiend the skin on it, appearign to be from\nthe leg of a boar.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Scented Candle", "A beautifully carved candle, made to resemble\nnothing other than the sun; a large circle\nwith some spikes protruding from it,\nobviously not at all sharp or dangerous. The\ntop 'spike' has a wick on it. When lit, the\ncandle exudes a lovely scent that would\nsurely remind anyone of the summer, the sweet\nsmell of watermelon, mangos and grapes. A\ncursive 'L' is stamped on the bottom, the\ncreator's signature.", "minecraft:concrete", ""),
        StaticItem("Choc-Ice", "A frozen bar of chocolate best enjoyed on hot\ndays. A Qalasheen treat created by Adil the\nEagle-Eyed of Al-Wakrah. Don’t hold it\ntightly or it will melt!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Dracones Ignis", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lamb Chops", "Finely cut lamb chops, seared for a long time\nover a slow flame. The outside would appear\nslightly charred, but the inside would be\ncooked to perfection.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legionnaire Baton", "A baton crafted of finely made Marnantine Oak\nabout two inches wide and twenty inches long.\nThe handle is wrapped in finely worked\nleather of purple and black, the bottom of\nthe baton is capped with an iron lion’s head.\nOn the side of the grip the stamp of the\nImperial Armory is present- as well the small\nmarkings of the Rhysten Smithy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Meat", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Pocket Knife", "The Pocket Knife consists of a slightly\ncurved wooden handle with gold caps and a\nfolding steel blade. The handle is a finely\nwhittled piece of tropical elmwood from the\nbarony of Caledonia. A small plated piece of\ngold is embedded in the side of the blade\nwith an inscribed message reading. “Thank you\nfor your continued service to the Empire,\nHappy Holidays! -House Horen”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by i_am_Ricky.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Flames of the Old Dark", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Faded Bluesteel Greaves", "", "minecraft:diamond_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Mithril Horse Sheeting (Heavy)", "Before you is a large custom fitted mass of\nmithril plated armor designed for horse use,\ndue to it's natural light nature the material\nhas extra layers of protection that'll ensure\nthe survival of most horses, assuming they\ncan swiftly move with the current armor. The\nprized material weighs no heavier than 30 kg,\neasily capable of absorbing blows from a\nmajority of attacks, be it arrow, sword, or\nyour locally health defective orc!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by jdesarno.", "minecraft:diamond_horse_armor", ""),
        StaticItem("Red-Iron Longsword", "A sword with a red-iron blade.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("11th Century Shield", "A shield of the 'Kite' variety. It would be\ncrafted from Dark Oak wood. An iron buffer\nwould adorn the upper center of the shield.\nIron trim would be fitted to the outline.\nPainted onto it would be a white cross.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Faded Bluesteel Sallet", "", "minecraft:diamond_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Leggings", "Forged by Black Company's blacksmiths.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Boots", "Forged by Black Company's blacksmiths.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Helmet", "Forged by Black Company's blacksmiths.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("≥ Carrion Black™ ≤", "A strong brew made from potato skins and\nbabalouche, in a process best left unknown. A\nfavored drink of the Carrion Hegemony, every\nbottle contains the Sun's Smile.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sul'aheral", "An amulet made to resemble the visage of\nTahariae with various tenets inscribed upon\nit. It bears an unnatural pearlescent finish\non the white gold that seems to waver and\nchange regardless of where it is in natural\nlight. A dull white haze also rings the\nfinely crafted piece of jewelry.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Heat Box", "A core carved of burnt oak and a diamond\nfitted in the middle, two cables made of mage\ngold wrapped in spider silk would be\nconnected to it with a snake bite clamp at\nits end. Once clamped to any metal that is\nrelative to Iron (Steel Etc) it will begin to\nheat up the metal to a temperature that can\ncook meat but not enough to compromise the\nmetals durability. A switch would be on the\ntop of the device to turn it on or off. ((2\nOOC Hours of charge, needs charge per use. PM\nToxzero Questions))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Creature of the Depths III", "A scale from the mighty lubba that had\nattacked at Sutica's bay. It was about the\nsize of a dinner plate, and perhaps could be\nused to make armor. It was strong, though not\nvery flexible. Perhaps someone can find a\ngreater use for this scale?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Iron Spear", "A stury spear with a head of black iron. The\nhaft is crafted from a polished length of\noak. Simple carvings of animals and olde\nrunes embellish the length of the wood.\nWithin the length of oak is a length of\nstrong ebony wood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bec de Corbim", "A one-handed Crowshead Warhammer made of\nFerrum and the shaft of Ironwood, an flat-rod\nof Ferrum runs along the Ironwooded shaft as\nit caps the bottom of the weapon in ferrum,\nleather stap hanging from the end in a ring,\nbig enough to hook it to something, a sparp\nFerrum spike would thrust into the sky from\nthe top of it sharply pointed whilst the back\nblade is shaped into another point lightly\ncurved like an pick, and the front formed\nlike an fourpoint hammer head from an\nwarhammer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jondead.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Chalice", "A large, royal chalice; It was crafted out of\na thin sheet of silver. A black and gold\ncloth hangs at the base of the chalice.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Luci'valmuel [Shiraz Wine]", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Perfume", "A delicate crystalline bottle filled to the\nbrim with quality perfume. On the top, under\na diamond-shaped cork, is a small contraption\nwhich allows one to simply squeeze onto- and\nout comes a cloud of mist. It has a lingering\nfragrance of rose petals and strawberries.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lilach Everupt.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of the Stag's Light", "This is a slayer steel amulet. All\ncraftselfship is of the highest quality. It\ntakes the shape of a stag's head, surrounded\nby a circle. It is suspended on a white gold\nchain. Platinum scriptures float lazily\naround it like an aura, recognizable to the\nlearned as the Utterings of Tahariae. Those\nof unnatural construction or tainted by vile\nmagics would find the very touch to be\nAnathema, causing them great pain. [PM\nAstartesTemplar for more info.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemist's Fire", "A disturbingly still potion rests here, bound\nin a tight Athin-fiber bag to keep it stable.\nKnown more commonly as 'Liquid Fire', this\npotion is more akin to boiling oil. Reacting\nwith the air when thrown, it is capable of a\nlarge scale fiery explosion in a 4x4 (16\nblock) radius. However, one must roll to\ncorrectly use this potion. If one rolls below\na 5 when throwing this potion, it explodes in\ntheir hand. Glass is sent out like shrapnel.\nA weapon of war, only to be used in the worst\nscenario.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Qalasheen Designed Bookmark", "A Wooden Thin Bookmark Carved Very Carefully,\nDesigned with beautiful curves and Qalasheen\ndesigns, It was carefully painted blue, Gold\nand Green Within the engraving, There is some\nWriting on the bookmark reading “ابتسم ودافئ\nقلوب الآخرين” and the other side translates\nto “Smile and warm the hearts of others”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("A Beautiful Qalasheen Ring", "This ring is made of Kadarsi Steel. The metal\nwhich looks like a beautiful water-pattern\nmakes the ring look majestically beautiful.\nThe ring's metal begins brahcning off making\na Qalasheen vector design of leaves and\nwonderful carves that seem like vines. Upon\nthese vines are an eye dazzling light blue\nParaiba Tourmaline Gems. The vines begin\nentwining delicately with each other in the\ncenter and make a flower. In the center of\nthis flower is a bright green Peridol gem\nthat shines wonderfully.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corpean.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A Beautiful Qalasheen Necklace", "This Necklace Is made Of Kadarsi Steel, The\nmetal holds a beautiful water-pattern which\nis Majestically Beautiful. The chain connects\nto a silver wave filled with beautiful light\nblue Aquamarine gems. The wave connects to a\ngolden outlined peacock which within the\noutline is made of emeralds each feather has\ntwo small Rubys within it, and a Gold\nQalasheen Vector design around them, Which\nThe feathers then climbs to the end of the\nchain, the eye of the beautiful bird is a\nMajestic Diamond!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Worker's Knife", "", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lumberjack Axe", "", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Brown Vase", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Harian Freshwater Pearl Earrings", "Crafted by the hands of the Daluon-Family\nthose two white pearl earrings are encircled\nby the subtle glimmer of white topaz gemstone\nhalos and a milgrain edge that adds some\nextra detail.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Opalescent Bracelet", "A beautiful bracelet made from onyx beads.\nThey seem to be almost too perfect, as if\nmanufactured in some way. But the heat\nrequired would be massive. Never the less\nthey are a rich black, reflecting rainbows in\ndirect light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown of Tuvya Carrion", "A dust-laden crown of gold, inlaid with\njewels of every ilk. Regality shone through\nits sheen of dust even despite its age.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by C18H10N2O4.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Cinder", "A black-iron dagger forged and enchanted by\nan adept alterationist. The ornate crossguard\nonly requires its center to be tapped to\nunleash devouring flames that shroud the\nblade of the dagger. [2 emote activation, 5\nuses until a recharge is needed. T5 Fire\nEvo].\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stafyrian Rum", "This darker rum has a fuller taste that\nretains a greater amount of the underlying\nmolasses flavor. Some amount of the original\nflavor of the sugar cane can be tasted.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ellenora.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Zweihander", "This blade sparsely runs flat - twisted and\ngnarled steel abounds the confines of the\nZweihander. Metal carvings engrave the\nmassive sword, though their meanings are\nentirely lost to time.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Valtin Halberd", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legionnaire Short Spear", "A sturdy spear 6ft long, the shaft is made of\na strong Caledonia Elm with the middle\nsection wrapped in a fine purple leather. The\nend of the spear is fitted with a strong\nsteel point polished to a high sheen and\ndeftly sharpened with care. the other end of\nthe spear features an iron cap for implanting\nit against the ground. The stamp of the\nImperial Armory is present upon the side\netched into the wooden shaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legionnaire Shortsword", "Standard issued to Imperial Legionnaires. The\nblade is forged from finely worked steel,\nsharpened and polished using a variety of\nwhetstones. A fine strip of purple leather is\nwrapped around the handle carved from\nRenatian Spruce. The Imperial Armory Stamp is\netched onto the bottom of the pommel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Spartan Officer Sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Riot Baton", "You hold a piece of wood, it has been dyed\nblack and has a purple dragon head as its\nhandle. At the handle there is a small rope\nto attach to your wrist.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Training Arrows", "To refined to be considered 'toys', but\nclearly not intended to injure nonetheless.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Legion Heavy Warbow", "A well strung longbow of the Imperial Legion,\nthe limbs are made from a finely smoothed and\ncarved Renation Spruce. The well oiled and\ntightened string would give the bow an\nimpressive firing strength. The longbow\nstands at almost 2 meters tall the grip\nalongside the nock a fine wrap of black\nleather. The stamp of the Imperial Armory is\npresent upon the side.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legion Short bow", "A well strung short bow, its limbs made from\nfinely carved and smoothed Highland Yew. The\nwell oiled and tightened string provides the\nbow a relatively impressive firing strength.\nThe bow is one and a quarter meters tall, its\ngrip wrapped with black leather. The stamp of\nthe Imperial Armory can be seen on the face\nof the bow’s upper limb.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legionnaire Heavy Crossbow", "Standard issued to Imperial Legionnaires.\nMasterfully carved and shaped Renatian Spruce\nis dyed black, fitted with steel parts to\nproduce this hefty crossbow. A cranequin sits\non top of the stock, able to draw the string\nback at high tensions. The Imperial Armory\nStamp is etched onto the metal piece that\nholds the catch in place.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Plum Wood Repeating Crossbow", "A odd light crossbow, with a box for holding\nbolts, or 'magazine' on it's top, an odd\nmechanism, and a large bronze crank. The plum\nwood the crossbow is made from has been\ntreated with linseed oil. The crank is\nattached to a simple magazine, that when\npushed forward grabs the bowstring and loads\na crossbow bolt, and when pulled back fires\nthe crossbow bolt. The crossbow is not very\naccurate, and difficult to aim, and it's\nlight draw weight makes unsuitable against\neven lightly armored targets, though it is\nable to fire quite a large amount of bolts\nrather quickly. The magazine is attached to\nthe crossbow, and can hold 10 bolts. [For OOC\nreference, this is a Chinese Repeating\nCrossbow.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Armory", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Roseglow Wine", "A bottle of Roseglow wine with the order of\nSaint Lucien’s Rhodesian Cross on the label.\nA popularized drink from the Anthosian Era,\nit was made in the Orenian Blackmarsh\noriginally. It has since become the signature\ndrink of of the Holy Order.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Jedih Palm Wine", "Created from the sap of the Jedih Palm, it\nwas historically considered a peasant drink\nbefore gaining popularity outside of the\nAlnorid Sultanate. Now looked at with more\nsophistication, it is typically served on\nhot, sunny days. The subtle sweetness of the\ndrink makes it a favorite among female\ncourtiers (and secretly men too).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Islamadon.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Emir's Palm Wine", "Also known as Jedih Palm Wine, it is made\nfrom the sap of the local palm trees located\nalong the Sophanem River that runs through\nthe city of Jedih. The palm wine is a milky\nwhite color with a fruity taste balanced with\nthe alcoholic taste from fermintation. It's a\nfavored drink among the ladies and secretly\nmany men too.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legionnaire Broadaxe", "A well honed broadaxe made of a strong steel\nalloy. The shaft of the axe is comprised of a\nwell smoothed strong Marnantine Oak with a\nfabric wrap in several places along the\nhandle. The axe features a large cutting face\nas well as a spike upon the rear. The pommel\nof the axe consists of a heavy ball of steel,\nperfect for caving helms in. The stamp of the\nImperial Armory is present on the bottom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian Blade", "Granted to the descendants who braved the\nbarricade formed of the Ebon Watch, and those\nwho answered the call to the Firelands by\nBalefas the Betrayer. This blade would have a\nhilt of bone-like material the sword as it\nshifted upward was made from an obsidian from\na volcano in the Firelands, it's point never\ndulling. Within the handle of the weapon lies\nan empty slot for an affixation of a\ngemstone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Triple Chocolate Brownies", "These brownies are made with three kinds of\nchocolate, dark, medium and light. Chunks of\nchocolate litter the inside of this pastry\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Isbara.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Creature of the Depths II", "A hard piece of the crab shell that had been\nbroken off. One could perhaps craft it into a\nsheild, or maybe even armor. It was quite\ndurable and tough, while also being somewhat\nheavy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Scepter of Electricity", "This scepter is made of carved wood and holds\na dark green emerald in its hilt. Once\ntapped, electricity begins to spark at the\ntop of the staff. Soon enough it will shoot a\nfairly large bolt of electricity wherever it\nis pointed. Enough to fry someone given the\nproper time to charge. The staff holds one\nuse in its gem and must be refilled for\nrepeated use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SoulStrung.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Arberrang gay", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Classic Aldin Red", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("(premium) Curonian Elderflower Reserve C. 1684", "A sweet, yet slightly tart wine; this\ndelicately crafted beverage would be colored\na luxurious golden hue when poured from its\nornately fashioned bottle. Having been made\nfrom both the flower and berry of the plant,\nsubtle hints of honeysuckle and citrus have\nbeen added to help offset the tart taste and\nhelp give the wine a more delicate and\nsweeter one\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("~<>Iblees-Demise<>~", "A sickly green liquid swirled about inside\nthe vial, purple whisps floating up from the\nsubstance their colors dimmed by the ashen\nglass. A skeletal figure would be embelished\non the bottle a thin finger pressed to his\nfleshless lips. The contents had been treated\nwith transfiguration to produce the strongest\nalcohol known to any race. Upon the underside\nthe words, \"Only the strongest of livers may\nsurvive..\" it would be stamped and coated in\na red paint.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Atticus Vesryn.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Bitter Ale", "A dark colored liquior which tastes very\nbitter, with a 3.6 content.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lamb Shawarma", "This wrap is filled with lamb meat, shaved\nfrom a rotating spit where it had been\ngrilled to juicy, flavorful perfection.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sahar Tha'un.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Vitaminerals", "A purple tinted liquid sits inside, it smells\nstrongly of roses. Once ingested, it boosts\nthe immune system against common diseases\nsuch as the cold or vomiting. Common side\naffects include fatigue and mild anger. Do\nNOT consume in large amounts as that may lead\nto heart failure. A label reads \\\"Now in grape\nflavor\\\". Despite it being medicine, it's\nsurprisingly good.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netherworld15.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Birch Tar", "A blurry glass bottle containing a thick,\nviscous liquid called tar. The tar is very\nsticky, and can be used as an effective\nadhesive, or for treatment of leather. The\ntar has a surprisingly pleasant, woody aroma\nto it, as it seems to've been made of birch\nwood. The tar under heat will become\nsignificantly less firm and thick, though\nwill still remain just as stucky. The bottle\nis made to contain 1 liter of liquid, and is\nfilled roughly 80% of the way with tar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("░ Ole Obediah's Dragon Jerky ░", "This dried meat comes from a mysterious\norigin. It has a sweet taste at first as if\nit was almost magical, but after a few\nmoments the taste changes to something\ncompletely twisted and spicy. The feeling in\nyour mouth only lasts a quick moment.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's Red Nectar c. 1697", "The red wine would have a strange,\ncontrasting quality to it. Made from refuse\ngrapes, the tartness of the drink is apparent\nupon first taste. Though this is combined\nwith honey and undertones of strawberries\nwhich make this tavern drink a strange,\ncomplex wine. The labels would be branded\nwith a simple tagline designating its origins\nand year.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Azaghul Sword", "this sword id made from the finest steel with\na sharp edge that can cleave a ors head from\nits body\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by welshnutter.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetian Whistle", "An ornate whistle carved out of bone\nenchanted by the Wizards John and Coltaine\nWick, when spoken through it would amplify\nthe users voice so they may cry out in there\ntime of need. (You may PM anyone in an 80\nblock Radius)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Autumn Tulip Tiva Wreath", "A wreath of beautiful sunset-coloured flowers\nthat drapes loosely around your neck. In the\nancient Tiva tongue of the Elves, the flowers\nspell out a symbolic end to things, and the\nrebirth to come in the Spring.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Billy's Pumpkin Pie", "A delicious pumpkin pie baken freshly by\nBilly. A flakey crust would hold in a moist\npumpkin filling, creating a feeling of joy\nand happiness when bitten into.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legion Commemorative Coin", "A small, silver coin that fits comfortably in\nthe palm of your hand. The Horen dragon\nstands proudly upon one side, and the Horen\ncross occupies the other. A neatly-carved\ninscription is engraved beneath the symbols:\nService and Sacrifice.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dagger of a the Renegade Knight", "A standard dagger bearing a strange insignia\nin an embossed gem on the crossguard!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blago's Shanties", "The best shanties about!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Blago.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Building", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gradic Grigio", "A slightly spicy but acidic wine with a\nlighter fruity aftertaste", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Dao", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_6(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("beanz", "high quality beanz", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum bolts", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Lady Bella's Pirate Rum", "A golden rum spiced with cinnamon and has\nadded caramel. It's been aged in charred\nbirch tree barrels. A potent spirit with a\nsweet taste, Commodus serves it usually with\norange juice. The drink is named after former\nbuccaneer 'Lady Bella' who made the recipe.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Yrodholm Requiem", "A pale, murky brew plundered from the\nstorerooms of Lasthope. It seems to be a mild\nalcohol infused with odd, unrecognisable\nherbs.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Secret Ingredient", "I'd write a description here but it's a\nsecret. Sorry.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Mixed Nuts", "This mix of nuts is a delicious snack. The\nfreshly roasted peanuts, pecans, almonds and\ncashews are packed with proteins, and have a\nfatty-sweet taste due to the oil in the nuts.\nA bit of salt is added to add an extra bit of\nflavour.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gilondir Oronar.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("๑ Molasses Sugar-Cookies! ๑", "A sweet treat! This pale brown cookie is\ncracked and crumbly, baked with brown sugar\nand extra molasses to keep it soft and chewy!\nMmm, delicious.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Atlas' #1 Baker] Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink n' Blue", "This pink and blue cookie tastes like cotton\ncandy!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mary Raspberry.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Mulled Wine", "A red wine fused with\ncardamon,nutmeg,cloves,sugar and some ginger.\nIt would seem to soothe and calm, while\ndrinking. Great for those wintery days.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evelyn Falkenrath.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Miniature Uroksvaal Figurines", "A dozen small figurines depicting Gorundyr\nwarriors, carved from a light brown wood.\nEach has been seen to in great detail and\nbears an assortment of clothing and weaponry.\nSome thrust forward their sturdy winged\nspears, mouths open in frozen shouts. Others\nhold forward steel-rimmed round shields,\nstanding tall and proud, their feet frozen in\nmotion as if they are advancing. The\nfigurines are painted and detailed with\ndelicate inlay, giving them a realistic\ndefinition.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MajesticOwyn.", "minecraft:cocoa_beans", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Tea Chest", "~An ornate tea chest, filled with a set of\nchina cups and some fresh tea leaves. Put\ntogether for the wedding of Thea and Thornn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evelyn Falkenrath.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Special", "A piping hot cup of white peony tea. Dried\nblueberries have been ground up into a powder\nand added into the drink, giving it a light\nblue hue. Typically served with a light dose\nof cream.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Silveress.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Torn Green Tabbard", "A Torn Green Tabbard , showing tearing,\nburns, and years of stains. The Tabbard would\nhave been taken off of Aische, A Strange\nKnight who terrorized Curonians.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｕｒｓａ Ｍａｊｏｒ", "The Six Foot Long Zweihander is a rare sight\nto the Descendants, Used only a few times\nthrough their History. The Zweihander's Blade\nwould be made out of Black Ferrum, having Two\nHooks Protruding off of the Lower Blade. The\nCrossguard would be an Elegant Craft, made\nfrom Aurum-Plated Steel, the name Ursa Major\nEngraved in the Center.The Handle, while\nWrapped in Leather, would be made from Spruce\nWood. The Pommel would be in the Shape of a\nBear's Head, Plated in Aurum.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Walking Stick", "A simple looking walking stick, made out of\npolished oak wood. Upon further inspection,\none may see that the cane's top can be\nuncorked, to reveal an otherwise hidden\nblade. This weapon, while not very useful, is\nvery easy to hide.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ducklingator.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Pickaxe", "Efficiency MMMMMMMMM\nFortune M", "minecraft:wooden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Santegian Sangria", "An alcoholic punch made with red wine and\nchopped fruit, served chilled. Brandy and\norange juice is also added to the concoction\nmaking it a refreshing, potent drink.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Revelry's Applejack: Circa 1683", "A dry, fully fermented cider made from a\nblend of acidic, aromatic, and tannic apples\nis put into a spruce barrel, then left\noutside to go through freeze distillation\nduring The Deep Cold. At the end of three\nsennights, the concentrated product is\ntransferred to a charred-oak barrel for\naging. The aged Applejack has rich and\ncomplex flavor, yet packs a hard kick; its\nexcess tartness is balanced by a hint of cane\nsugar. ~90-proof.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Revelry Corp.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Juniper Ale", "A sweet-smelling ale rests here, made of\nmalted oats and barley and spiced with\njuniper berries. Froth coated the edge of the\nmug, warming the belly and settling a\nproverbial BRICK in there, basically\nfulfilling the role of a meal if many were\ndrank. A heavy and frothy drink for a heavy\nand frothy people.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Radiance", "The blade within your grasp would be forged\nfrom the purest of Dralachite, the rare\nelement of the dragons. It’s curved blade\nwould be embellished with delicate details\nalong the blade, the language unknown to\nanyone but those with the blood ofdragons.\nOutstretched black obsidian wings serve as\nthe crossguard, while tanned drake leather is\nwrapped tightly around the shaft of the\nblade. Staring back at you with ruby eyes\nwould be a carvedobsidian likeness of\nAzdromoth, his mouth agape as the pommel of\nthe blade.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Venturi", "A Kriegsmesser made of pure Kodeh Steel\nhaving a pale-bronzeish tone to it. It is\nresistant to freezing, it’s curved tip shines\nbright in the sunlight. The blade would hum\nas it cuts through the air.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Autumn Tiva Tulip Wreath", "A wreath of beautiful sunset-coloured flowers\nthat drapes loosely around your neck. In the\nancient Tiva tongue of the Elves, the flowers\nspell out a symbolic end to things, and the\nrebirth to come in the Spring.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Shitter", "Well... don't miss?", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Hunting Knife", "A simple but keen blade of only a single\nedge, built with a sturdy handle crafted from\nsome kind of antler. When applied to flesh,\nit more easily slices than stabs, betraying\nits primary purpose; To skin and prepare\ngame, as a tool, not a weapon. It can be used\nas other tools for an under-prepared and\nclever hunter, but of all things it rends\nprey’s flesh the easiest.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceramic Pumpkin", "A ceramic pumpkin, about the size of a\nregular baking pumpkin. It is glazed with a\nrich orange color and would last much longer\nthan the real thing. On the bottom of the\nobject leays a small inscription in the fired\nclay. Written in loopy script, it reads;\nThank you for attending the Dominion Harvest\nFestival, 1686.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Melon Tree Sapling", "A sapling taken from the great Melon Tree\nthat makes it's home in the halfling village\nof Dunshire. The small leaves upon it would\nbe a bright green, the stem being a very dark\nshade of wood. Small buds would dangle from\ntiny branches, one day to from into great,\nhealthy watermelons.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Poison darts", "A tiny dart coated in a film of nightsap. A\nhit to the flesh will lead to the victim\nfeeling drowsy and eventually passing out in\ntwo to three emotes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Delicate Silver Bracelet", "A hand made, delicate silver bracelet, with\ndetails in the shape of leaves etched into\nthe chain.Designed to be worn by a women\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Echo Bay Sake", "This Sake is brewed in the way of how the\nEasterners of Echo Bay would brew it. The\nrice is left to ferment for 5 months in a\nCedar cask. The process enhances the flavour\nand gives it a kick when drunk. This is due\nto the alcohol being left to ferment for an\nextended period of time. The colouring of the\nSake is darkened brown due to the colouring\nof the wood seeping into the Sake which also\ngives off a slightly bitter taste. When\nheated up though the Sake gives off a more\nsweetened taste and more pleasant to drink.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by craigr341.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Droquar Scale", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Jewel of Malcontent", "A yellow-tinted crystalline orb of mysterious origins. Found\nwitin the heart of an unnaturally spawned beast of stone, the orb\ntingles with arcane energy to the touch, yet seems all but depleted.\nHolding it gies one a distinct sense of agitation and dissatisfaction.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Wristlet of Soul Retention", "Within your hand rests a bracelet of\nexceptionally foreign craft, made entirely of\npure quartz crystal and nearly translucent.\nOccasionally, when in complete darkness,\nfaint flickers of ethereal white light can be\nseen dancing within the crystalline\nstructure. Upon each quartz bead is an image\nof a progressing story. A lady in billowing\nwhite robes stands defiant of a man in black\nwielding a scythe. He attempts to steal her\nsoul with the wicked weapon, but fails.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Melgarth's Golden Spear", "A simple 2 meter spear with a snakewood haft,\nand an aurum spearhead. Iron langets run down\nits sides from the spearhead to about 1/4th\nof the way down clearly put in place as to\navoid the spear being broken via attacks to\nthe haft. The spear is clearly intended for\nthrusting, and it bears a small red ribbon\nright above the spearhead, giving a flowing\nmotion to any swings or thrusts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Drugao", "A large acacia branch that's been whittled\ndown into a staff. The staff was topped by a\ntranslucent gypsum crystal. It was so well\ncleaned that whatever light hit it would\nreflect from it's surface. The main region of\nthe staff had many strange images carved into\nit. One of the largest one's being a desert.\nA small string had been connected through a\nsmall hole in the staff. A small bright\norange feather hung from the basic string.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Blood", "The blood is very toxic, and posesses\nacid-like features. It has similar properties\nto alchemist fire, and can also be used in\nmany religious rituals.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:lava_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Barbu'leh Eth", "", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred Scales", "Scales, charred by an energy quite unlike\ntypical fire.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum WarAxe", "This blade is said to have caved in an\neyeless spook's helmet with force so great\nthe skies were torn asunder.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gravy", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Hush", "This well carved bow would have a good weight\nto it, making it perfect for combat. On the\nshaft in good handwriting would be carved\nHush", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Cross Necklace", "A handcrafted golden cross pendant with 6\nsmall diamonds inset into it, attached to a\ngolden chain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Titan Bones", "Bones taken from the carcass of a colossal\nTitan. They have slight red tinge to them and\nhave been poorly cleaned of the gristle and\nblood that once coated them.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Superior Frost Resistance", "A vial with a swirling orange liquid inside.\nShould the user take it, they will feel a\nprolonged warmth in their body, lasting for a\nday -- this provides greater resistance to\nthe cold, allowing one to traverse icy wastes\nwithout much hinderance. A symbol is on the\nvial: A cog with a man in an elixir inside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus of Heldenburg.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Claws", "A large, football sized blackened claw from a\nwyvern's backmost legs. Charred on the\noutward faces parts whilst a quite notably\nashier gray on the portion that likely once\nfaced flesh when connected to its respective\nbeing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Round Woodshield", "A large roundshield made from hickory wood.\nHorse hide covers the front face - giving it\na strong defense. A ferrum outter lining\nholds the two hickory halfs firmly together.\nIn the front face's center is a black ferrum\nbossing that provides additional defense in\ndeflecting attacks. The shield overall\nmeasures 38\" inches in diameter and 0.8\ninches thick.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Lacy Light Blue Lingerie Set", "The combination of feminine flowers and lace\noverlay decorates this lingerie set. The\nunderbust corset is crafted from panels of\nlight blue lace embroidered with orchids and\naccents of golden silk, with scalloped edges\nand orchids attached. Slender strips of light\nblue silk, topped with tiny crystals, sweep\nfrom the midriff to the hips creating a\nstreamlined shape. It comes with other\nmatching undergarments, such as panties and a\nbrassiere.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Droquar Skin", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Cutlass", "A sharp cutlass with many flowery designs\nupon the blade’s edge from top to bottom. It\nhas a band of leather fastened around its\nhilt, which was forged with black ferrum and\nadorns an elaborate cupped guard.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by June8th793.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Bones", "The thick and sturdy bones of a draconic\nbeing -- evidently thinner than normal to the\ntrained eye. Belonging to a wyvern!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lion's Roar", "A glistening steel longsword of brilliant craftsmanship,\nthe Paladin's trusted blade protrudes from the head\nof a silver lion's head, resting upon the guard with a\ngolden mane, the same metal of the rest of the guard\nand hilt. At its base, the blade also has an emerald inlaid.\n*Moderator Approved*\nski_king3 approved this item.\nThe blade exudes faint wisps of golden mist.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Relaxant Potion", "A mellow-smelling potion rests here. If\nimbibed, the potion would seem to numb the\nfeelings of anxiety and lead to a feeling of\nwell-being. A favorite of soldiers in the\nfield to deal with the trauma of combat, this\nwould allow one to escape the world for a bit\nin the proverbial sense. It is even capable\nof relieving muscle pain, leading to a very\nrelaxing experience if drank.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Brown Ale", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Festive Ring", "A thin golden band with red & greened\npatterned lines of jewels embedded onto it,\ncute!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("King's Ivy", "A regal herb, its brilliantly colored petals\nshining like a wealthy man's pocket. The\nplant is known by adventurers as the next\nbest thing to performance-enhancing potions,\nclearing one's head of troubles and\ninstilling great confidence in one's\nabilities in its place. Often this leads to\ngreater adventures and indeed, greater\nperformance, however beware; Overindulgence\ncan cause one to become irrational, violent\nand agitated, like a stag in rut.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:yellow_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pixie Dust", "A fine gray ash.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Tiara with Green Emeralds", "A golden ornate Tiara , with 3 large emeralds\ninserted at the front, many small diamonds\nsurround these. Very delicate and beautiful,\nfit for any royal or noble.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart Shaped Charm", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Trickster's Token", "A small disc made of aquamarine stone. One\nface bears the carving of a lamb's head\nlooking at you with mocking eyes. The other\nface simply has the word \"FOOL\" carved on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whimsycal.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Compass", "A small iron capsule containing a crude\nredstone crystal, which spins upon a delicate\npivot to face north as best it can. For many,\ntravelling without one at their side may have\nlethal consequences.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Cask of Strawberry Ale", "A somewhat opaque, thick drink with a low\nalchohol content, a light pink color and a\nstrawberry vanilla taste in an oakwood cask\nwith a silver spigot. the contained drink has\na low alchohol content, about that of a beer.\nThe thickness of the drink is about that of\nmilk. Its flavor is predominantly overly\nsweet strawberry and vanilla.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gotha Circlet", "A delicate, detailed circlet with flowers and\nleaves all around,In the center at the from\nlies one red ruby with a rose holding it in\nplace, quite large and stunning.The perfect\nitem to complete any look.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Ring", "A simple band of bronze made to be worn on\none's ring finger. The ring is set with a\nsingle circular stone of red marble. The red\nmarble stone has been polished quite\nextensively, and is somewhat shiny. The\nbronze the ring is made from has been\nthouroughly sanded, making it quite lustrous\nunder light. The ring is cast in one part,\nand bears a flat edge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Flawless Ruby", "The diligent work of an expert stonemason.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Golden Booch of White Peak =~", "A small golden pin in the shape of a Rams\nhead of White Peak would sit comfortably in\nyour hand, being made out of solid gold from\nthe mountains of the great volcano in\nSouthern Atlas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mast. Blacksmith] Bjorn Adigard.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Cream Beer, 1649", "A thick, smooth, bubbly drink with a low\nalchohol content, a tannish white color, and\na creamy vanilla taste in a blurry glass\nbottle with a cork. The contained drink has a\nlow alchohol content, less than a beer, with\na sweet vanilla cream taste, comparable to\nroot beer, or cream soda.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Shove-off shovel (greater)", "", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Heat Gel Wrappings", "Within the thin cloth is a gel that can\nprovide the wearer with warmth, enough to\nkeep themselves cozy during a long and\nunforgiving winter. These seem to last for\nquite some time; the wrappings having a\nsymbol with a potion surrounded by a cog,\nwith a little man inside the elixir.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus of Heldenburg.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Warming Gel", "A thin cloth -- thin enough to be slipped\nunder garments and armor -- that is warm to\nthe touch. There appears to be some sort of\ngel in it, one which when worn provides\nwarmth and some resistance to the cold for\nthe wearer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus of Heldenburg.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blowgun Dart(Poisoned)", "A small and sharp wooden dart with an iron\nending that is coated in a peculiar green\nnectar. This green nectar is a fatal poison\nthat acts like a virus when in contact with a\npersons blood, destroying the persons organ\nsystems until there is nothing left but\ndeath.(Takes an hour - 2 IRL days to kill)\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandages", "Can be used to treat minor to medium cuts and\ninjuries when tied securely around a wound,\nhowever, the wound will need time to heal\nitself even after the bandages are applied.\nIt's a little bit scratchy, but it's better\nthan bleeding to death.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netherworld15.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Acceptance Form to the Dominion", "A slip of paper that says that you passed\ngate inspection! This slip is dated. The Deep\nCold, 1666. (June 5th)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DiscoLiquid.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Powdered Desert Berry Bush", "A small pouch of red powder. It contains one\ndosage of desert berry bush poison, enhanced\nby a powerful (and unscrupulous) Druid,\nstrong enough to kill a man in minutes. It\ncan be dissolved in drinks, leaving a reddish\nhint and a sweet taste. Use with caution.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Archdruid] Ithuriel.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Gleddyf", "A kriegsmesser made of pure Kodeh Steel\nhaving a pale-bronzeish tone to it. It is\nresistant to freezing. Its curved tip shining\nin the sunlight. It gives a slight hum when\nswung.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Nabiel", "A large longsword made to be wielded by a\nbeing of great stature. The blade is made of\ndragon forged slayer steel, it’s edges sharp.\nThe blade bears a large curved\ncross-guard,reating ideal balance to allow\nfor smooth and accurate swings. The hilt of\nthe blade is wrapped in tanned stag\nhide,while the pommel bears a bright red ruby\nthat would appear as if it burned from\nwithin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("╁ Azure Emberknife ╁", "Arcane I\nWithin your hand is the fifth of seven\nEmberknife prototypes produced by Emberco, a\nholy weapons company formerly stationed in\nKal’Omith. It appears to be nothing more than\nan ornate silver hilt, though testing will\nreveal a twistable handle that causes an\nethereal blade of condensed holy fire to be\nproduced. The Emberblade phases through and\nis halted by any substance not corrupted,\nhowever, it burns through corrupted flesh\nsimilarly to an aurum blade.\nhttps://goo.gl/7QhjSQ\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghoul Skull Fragment", "it appears that this fragment of an ghoulish\ncreature had been rotting for a long time,\nthe decay on the bone is clearly visible as\nfoul marks run over the skull like veins.\nAltough dead and dry the fragment seems to\nact as an seperate organism.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Jasper Swan Pin", "A smaller pin, roughly two and a half\ncentimeters tall and wide. It's carved from\ngarnet, and the red stone forms a swan\ncraning its neck to preen its feathers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Boreal Treasures Jewelry Emporium.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Father Yurii's Trophy", "A menacing skull with two rubies placed in\nthe eye sockets.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cranburee.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("St. Julia’s Day Cross", "A cross blessed by High Pontiff Jude I.\nAcquired at the St. Julia's Day Festival!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugs axe", "", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fox Hide", "A very nice fox hide that Lyulen Daemyr got\nwhen killing a person's pet fox. He also got\nstew out of it.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Bucket with leather straps.", "The bucket would have two leather straps at\neither side, with a strong heavy duty belt\nbuckle on each.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Monkey Plushie", "A Monkey Plushie called Jangles, He has a\nGlass 'Space' Helmet on.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Beating Baton", "Used by the officials of Belvitz to beat\nunfaithful wives and radical elves.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Paper Boat", "A paper boat. Not a feat of origami genius,\nbut well-made enough to keep out water for a\nlittle while.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Wall Mirror", "A well made glass mirror with a wooden frame\naround it's edges, well suitable to be placed\non a wall for either utility or decoration.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Artyom's Pocket Watch", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by SpookyLean.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Dog", "A soft small toy perfect for any child.\nFilled with cotton, the realistic small dog\nheld a rather cute smile.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Tanned Leather", "Tanned and processed leather", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("St. Julia’s Day Ring", "The blood red ring in your possession is\nembellished with several rubies and other\ngemstones in the shape of flowers. This\nobject was acquired by a victor of the St.\nJulia’s Day maze! Blessed by High Pontiff\nJude I\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Skull", "A decapitated Goblin head, taken from a\ngoblin tribe in the Deeproads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Water", "A bottle of a golden liquid. Upon closer\ninspection, one might find that the sticky\nsubstance has golden flakes inside of it. To\ndrink this will prove to those hurt by gold.\nIn addition, it can be used to coat a tool,\nallowing one to treat their item to harm\nthose hurt by gold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus of Heldenburg.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("World Ender", "", "minecraft:fireworks", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff", "A staff with a crystal at its tip.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Brawm Pipe", "A finely crafted Brawm Pipe with various\ndesigns and depictions. The head of a Brawm\nHound would be carved on the pipe. The pipe\nwould be made out of spruce wood and would\nhave brown and gray dye smeared on it. The\npipe would be excellent for smoking cactus\ngreen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by McThornz.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Brawm Club", "A blunt club used by the poorest and worst\nequipped of the once Brawm bannerman.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by McThornz.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Claw", "A long, dagger-like claw, would be of about\n10 inches in length. The claw would appear to\nbe in perfection condition.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Katzbalger", "A type of arming sword often used as a\nsidearm to pikes and polearms by Landsknecht\ntroops", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Whitepeaks Heavy BastardSword", "The Hilt Of The Blades Being Wrapped In\nstrings of leather then another layer of the\nboar fur around the handles. The Greatsword\nWould be Double edged, being able to swing\neither way.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Halbert", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring of the People", "This ornate, small ring is encrusted with a\nbeautiful and expensive diamond. The shape is\ndetailed by a few more smaller jewels. A\nsilver band wraps around the gems and forms\nthe finger loop. This ring denotes a position\non the Court of Lords.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lady Amuril Des'Nox.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("SnowyOwl", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring of the Coin", "The ring is decorated lavishly with small\ngems and gold. The pattern shows off the\ndesign of two cuffed hands shaking before a\nlarge oak tree on a lovely, gradient\nbackground. This is the ring of the Caras\nEldar Merchant's Guild!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zilldude.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("King's Guard", "A large shield with black ferrum along the\nouter rim, Highland Yew wood creating the\nbase with a black ferrum plate over the wood\nand a golden boss embedded into the center.\nThere'd be intricate, swirling patterns\netched into the shield to give it a pleasant\nlook. A little bulky to hold but the enarmes\non the inside help with carrying the shield\naround.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Saveforthememory.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Greaves of the Dread Lord", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Chestpiece of the Dread Lord", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Ram Plushie", "A rather well crafted ram mask, the fairly\nsized spiralling horns of the headwear would\nbe made from the polished wood of a maple\ntree whilst the pelt of the ram would be a\nsoft white silk . The back of the mask has\ntwo pieces of twine stitched upon the oaken\nframe to keep it secured against ones face.\nQuite a fine piece to wear to masqurades and\nfestivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Helm of the Dread Lord", "A hefty dark iron helm covered in blood\nrunes. The emptiness inside seems to look\nback at you.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Royal Renatian Honey", "The sweetest honey you've ever tasted! Made,\npackaged and shipped from Aldenburg. It comes\nin a little jar, with a purple and gold bow\nwrapped around it's outside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Adette.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sprite-Away stick", "A stick that, when waved causes sprites to\nfling around in the air to avoid being\nbeaten.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("St. Julia's Arrows", "hese arrows are fabled to, after fatally\nwounding someone, make one feel a rush of\nlove and comfort before death...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Banded Herald", "A ox's horn fashioned into a blowing\ninstrument. The herald bears 2 bands of\nbronze wrapped around it. One band is wrapped\nnear the base, whilst the other is wrapped\naround the top of the horn. The ox horn the\nherald is made from has been well shined and\nsanded, making it notably smooth, and glossy.\nThe horn has been hollowed out, and bears a\nlarge opening, and a small opening, the\nlatter bearing a small bronze mouthpiece. The\nwarhorn, if used correctly, can be used to\nsound a blast loud enough to be heard over a\nsignificant distance.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Burlap Sack", "You can't see, you can hear and smell, but it\nprobably smells like shite.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by N0tt.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Leafblade Claymore", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sword of Justice", "The sword awarded to the Knight or Lord who\nwins the tourney.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin2", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Tool Knife", "A small bronze knife, with an oakwood handle.\nThe oakwood the handle is made from has been\ntreated with linseed oil. The bronze the\nblade is made from is well shined, making it\nquiet lustrous under light. The knife, handle\nincluded, is only 7 inches long. The knife's\nsingle edge has been honed to being shaving\nsharp. The handle of the knife bears no form\nof crossguard, though the handle itself fans\noutward near the base of the blade, as to\navoid one's hand slipping off the handle and\nonto the blade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("White Rose Cognac", "A brandy twice distilled in copper pot stills\nand aged for two years in Agathor Oak\nBarrels. The name comes from the drink’s dark\namber color reminiscent of the prominent hair\ncolor of latter day Chivays. A special trick\ncan be performed when the liquor is lit on\nfire, as it should be before serving. A white\nflame calmly burns on the liquor’s surface\nfor a few moments before burning out, ready\nto serve.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Islamadon.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Nûl Venom Gland", "The tiny, tiny organ capable\nof producing a potent neurotoxin", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Fallingwood Sword", "This is a finely-crafted fallingwood sword.\nIt is encrusted with amber opal and\naventurine, and menaces with spikes of\ntetrahedrite. It is decorated with cave\nlobster shell and crayfish shell. It is\nadorned with fungiwood fiber rings, which\nhave been dyed green using green slime dye.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand-Forged Warstaff", "A strong, light but sturdy warstaff. Crafted\nfrom a thick ebony, and the baubles on the\nend being made of a common but strong metal.\nThe shaft is delicately etched with vines,\nroses randomly dotted upon the vines. Upon\none of the metal baubles a name is etched, it\nreads \"Genevieve\", though it is somewhat\nscratched out, due to the weapon being used\nfairly often.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Swamp Shrooms", "The large toadstool would smell foul and\noffer hallucinogenic properties if consumed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Reindeer Hat", "A cozy hat, shaped in the form of a\nReindeer’s head. It smells like Reindeer...a\ncoincidence?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Disco's Cookie", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Spear of Malkaathe", "A long ferrum rod tipped with a sharp point\nthat crackles with electricity.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Norman", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Bread", "This bread is awfully fluffy! Almost as if it\nwas softer than cake, though- alas it's only\nfinely baked bread, for some reason the\nbottom had a secret message.. \"The Dominion\nwill soon fall!\" Was oddly burnt into the\nbottom, don't ask how this is even possible,\njust eat the bread.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by September's Malice.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Left Handed Sword of the Forbidden One", "One of the last creations of Lonan Daemyr,\nand is only used by a bad ass\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MinusOneMorale.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Right Handed Sword of the Forbidden One", "One of the last creations of Lonan Daemyr,\nand is only used by a bad ass\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MinusOneMorale.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Shortsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer Steel Longsword", "A bronze-hued longsword forged from slayer\nsteel. Its blade is far stronger than the\naverage aurum sword’s, all the while the\nweapon retains its capacity to damage magical\nbeings. The blade carries a set of Dwarven\nrunes, identifying its smith as Koralon, and\nthe forge as the Iron Honour.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Mother] Koralon Onyxheart.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("I love u", "I love u\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kaputski_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("drool", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Items Reclaimed for zGunter", "Hi Dewper, this is DiscoLiquid, you popped\nzGunter after he ran from combat, but you\nshould have picked him back to up to finish\nthe RP. I returned his items, but you're not\nin any trouble. PM me for questions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DiscoLiquid.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Quill", "This quill is made from a brilliant orange\nfalcon feather. The iron nib is engraved with\ntiny thorns. This quill is sure to last you a\nlong time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Reeve's Holy Slayer", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Companion", "A good, sharp arming sword.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Lance", "Long and adequately polished, this Haeseni\nJousting Lance is sturdy and ready to be\nused.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by julius55.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Backpack", "The Canvas bag would have a flap over its\ncenter hole as well as its 3 outer pockets.\nAttached via a clasp on the outside of the\nbag is a 28 meter coil of rope. The outer\npockets have a bird nest of tinder for fires\nas well as a dwarven fire starter. Inside the\ncenter of the bag is a steel ice axe, wooden\nhammer, and a metalic cup. there is still\nplenty of room inside the bag and in 2 of its\npockets for additional storage and\ncustomization. The bag is around 3kg when\nbase filled\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sign", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Story Manuscript", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Morghuul's war sickle", "", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Healing Potion", "A green-hued potion rests here, swirling\ncloudily and with a potent odor of sulphur.\nThe strongest common potion available, this\nlifesaver is composed of Frostvine, Athin,\nCrouching Feather, and Tippen's Root. If\napplied to a wound externally, the flesh\nwould begin to reknit before your very eyes,\nfinishing the healing process over the course\nof 5 emotes. It leaves the applicant weak for\nan elven hour, and if drank, it would\ndissolve poison spreading through the body\nand heal internal injury!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of GaiaLoTC", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Quartz Necklace", "Crafted and reshaped by the Daluon-Family\nthis crystal is engulfed in a silver\nnecklace, creating a mysterious , yet,\nelegant piece of jewelry.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Flowers", "An overly large bundle of chrysanthemums\nrests before you. Each one seems to be neatly\ncleaned, lacking dirt and still fresh. The\nbouquet would be wrapped together by a few\ngolden ribbons at the base, keeping the large\namount of flowers in place.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantPizza.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Idalian Benis", ":DDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDD\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Darksalvo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("you tied up boy", "", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Dian Syrah Splendor", "This is a 750mL coalglass bottle containing\nan exceptionally-crafted red wine. It is 13%\nalcohol by volume and produced from vellebeux\ngrapes. It has been aged ten years. It smells\nof alcohol and sweetness. It tastes smoothly\nbitter, with hints of sweetness, and a weak\nalcohol aftertaste.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fermented Cider", "This is a cedarwood cask containing\nwell-crafted fermented apple cider. It is 5%\nalcohol by volume and produced from Braeburn\napples. Raspberry juice, and a pinch of\nhoney, have been added, giving it a golden\ncolor. It smells of alcohol and sweetness,\nand froths on the pour. It tastes mildly\nbitter, with hints of sweetness, and has a\nweak cider aftertaste.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Filthy Dagger", "A small dagger, filthy at the handle yet\nclean at the blade, if one were to clean the\ndirt off the handle they would see 'Finn\nO'Rourke <3' carved messily into the dagger\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Karovic Dagger", "A long, sharp rondel dagger with the gryphon\nof Kovachev engraved on its edge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Henrik Kovachev.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Safeguard", "An exquisite bastard sword. Crafted from a\nstrong steel. Upon the pommel of the sword\nwould be a bird, with its wings spread wide.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Anthrax", "A suspicious white powder. Hmm, it doesn't\nseem to smell or taste like anything...", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrion Black™", "A bottle of Black, aged through the war of\nKal'Tarak by Rutledge. Its taste of the Sun\nSmiles is amplified thricefold\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chumpchump.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Spidersilk Rope", "This ten foot long braided cord is woven out\nof threads of silk from a spider. It's far\nstronger, and far lighter, than an average\nrope.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Pocket Box", "A small openable box made of beat bronze,\nmade to be held in one's pocket. The box is 6\ninches long, 3 inches wide, and one inch\ntall. The bronze the box is made from has\nbeen well shined, making it quite lustrous\nunder light. The box bears curved corners, as\nto ensure comfort when held in one's pocket.\nThe box bears a hinged lid on its top, with a\nsmall latch. The lid is flat, and is of equal\nwidth and length to the box. The interior of\nthe box is lined with red leather. The red\nleather lining has been treated with birch\ntar. The lid of the box bears indented\ndecorative filigrees along its perimeter. The\nfiligrees are symmetrical, both long, and\nshort sides being the same pattern, alongside\nall 4 corners bearing the same design.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Warbow", "A large warbow 75 inches in length is strung\ntaught with a black string, made of animal\nparts and silk. The bow takes the shape of a\nsort of recurve bow, except for the long\nrigid ears at the ends of it, where the\nstring is attached. When drawn back, the bow\narcs like a crescent, taking\none-hundred-and-eighty pounds of force to do\nso. The bow weighs roughly five pounds, and\nfits comfortably within a large person's\nhand. The limbs are engraved elegantly with\nthe name 'Cedlas' on each end of the ear. The\nmid-section of the bow is rather barren, with\na band of gold inbetween two bands of black\non either side of the grip, seperating the\ntwo sections.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Shuriken", "", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Azureth", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Killmatronix", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dominion Blowing Horn", "A hollowed out horn of a kudu antelope with a\nhole cut into it's narrow end, and with a\nsmall bronze band near the smaller opening.\nThough it requires 2 hands to hold properly,\nif blown into it will produce quite the loud\nand clear horn blast, that if done correctly\nis capable of being heard quite the long\ndistance. It has been smoothened and shined,\nmaking it quite pleasant to look at. [For ooc\nreference this is for all intents and\npurposes a Yemmenite Shofar]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Signal Horn", "A blowing horn made from the horn of an ox\nwith a notable curved shape. It bears two\nbands of leather tied near it's ends, with a\nlonger strand connecting the two giving a\nconvenient leather strap for ease of\ntransport. If one were to blow it correctly,\nit would make a loud blast, able to be heard\nquite the long distance, excellent for\nwarning or signalling others over notable\ndistances.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ladybug", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Triage Kit", "This kit contains gislocinovi petals, shears,\nbandages, needle and thread, blissfoil and\ntippens root, a small bottle of lesser\nvitality tincture, and a few other things.\nEverything someone would need to treat\ndisease and injury out in the field\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Head", "A Red Gem Stolen from a Shrine, might help\nwith building a golem?", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Norlandic Mark", "A circular gold coin, its face stamped with\nTorsten Rosik's face on either side. The\nnumber 1689 is printed along the edge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Friendship Bracelet", "A more adult version of the bracelets you\nonce made as children, this bracelet is\nadorned with beautiful gems and made from\nprecious metals. Quite an expensive gift for\na close companion, one that will surely\nremember you reach time they wear it\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkblue Bird", "A dark blue bird belonging to Carsandra\nIvydale. Her messager bird, very faithful.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Hound's Tooth", "Vibrant flame-like hues shone off this\nlongsword borne of tempered, refined steel\nalloy. Most notably however, the tapered\nedges are accented with some bronze-hued\nmaterial - Slayersteel - which carries the\nmonster-slaying properties of gold, but with\nthe durability of steel. The pommel bears\nsome unique design, resembling that of a\nbloodhound's head with beady eyes and\nflopping ears. The hilt is coiled in fine\nleather, a stamp pressed onto it reads:\nRhy\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Rapier", "A short sword weapon made of bronze and\noakwood. The bronze the blade is made from\nhas been minimally shined, giving it a\ntarnished, brown appearance. The oakwood the\nhandle is made from has been treated with\nlinseed oil. The rapier is 50 centimeters\nlong from the bottom of the handle to the tip\nof the blade. Initially, the blade of the\nrapier is as thick as the handle, though it\ntapers inward rather immediately, making the\nblade quite thin, remaining at the same\nthickness untill at the final 2 centimeters\nof the blade it tapers to a triangular point.\nThe rapier's two edges have been honed to\nbeing shaving sharp. The rapier comes with a\nred leather sheathe. The leather the sheathe\nis made from is treated with birch tar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Licorice Cocktail", "An acquired taste,\nyet still Delicious upon\nconsumption.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Khronhiem Citizenship Papers", "Soulbound I\nOfficial documents stating the person holding\nthese papers that they are citizens of the\nFree City State of Khronhiem.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Dirk", "A short dagger weapon made of bronze and\noakwood. The bronze the dirk is made from is\nminimally shined, giving it a tarnished,\nbrown appearance. The oakwood the handle is\nmade from has been treated with linseed oil.\nThe dirk is 22 centimeters long from the\nbottom of the handle to the tip of the blade.\nThe dirk bears a triangle shaped blade, with\n2 shallow ridges indented into it, creating\nthe outline of 2 small triangles, one within\nthe other, going up the blade. The dirk's 2\nedges have been honed to being shaving sharp.\nThe dirk comes with a red leather sheathe.\nThe leather the sheathe is made from has been\ntreated with birch tar. The blade of the dirk\nis only 12 centimeters long, making the\nhandle 10 centimeters.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Unrecognizable Fleshy Giblets", "This was once a small animal. Its tiny bones\nsuggest as much. What it was, however, is a\nmystery. It bears hints of a large insect or\nsmall bird munching on it at one point.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Faei.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("✧Medical Kit✧", "A small leather and cloth pack with a strap\nfor affixing to a belt for easy transport and\nquick access. The pack contains several\nneedles, a spool of thread, bandages treated\nwith gislocinovi petals, shears, a small\ncontainer of blissfoil salve , a sealed tub\nof tippens root paste, frost vine, a pestle\nand mortar and a pair of leather gloves.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Nurse] Evelyn Uialben.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Portrait of a Beautiful Elf Woman", "A rare, well done portrait of a female elf\nwith shoulder length white hair and a\nyouthful visage. It's in a complimenting\nmahogony frame with regal corner designs.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Inhaler's Bliss", "A pipe with crunched up herbs and regents\nwithin it. Taking of a hit of this would be\nsomething of a smoker's dream, and would\ninduce a heavily satisfying sensation.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Vanishing Powder", "A coarsely ground powder of indeterminate\nmaterials. In the faintest of light, this\nmetallic dust will shimmer in light. When\nthis powder is administered, the user will\nindeed find that the con artist has long\nsince vanished.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Salade d’Odo", "A light meal on its own, a combination of\nlettuce, fresh cherry tomatoes, boiled eggs,\ntuna, green beans, black olives and\nanchovies. Named after the Old Auvergne\nleader of Lotharingia - a supposed fan of\ntune and anchovies", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Prismarine Hake Fetish", "This prismarine fetish represents the hake\nfish; a mild fish found in shallow ocean\nwaters. It would be roughly the size of a\nhuman hand, with astounding attention to\ndetail and exquisite lapis lazuli inlays\ndecorating the fins and eyes. Engraved on its\nbelly would be the words 'From clay to\nsteel!' and the name 'Sylver'. If one were to\nlook even closer, they would find weathered\npictograms dashed about the surface; a rising\nsun, bottle of wine, and ocean tides chief\namong them. The surface of the fetish would\nseem treated with some kind of resin, which\ndoes a decent job of preserving it against\nthe elements.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Inflectus.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Soufflé", "An airy, egg-based dish, Soufflé is eaten\nsavoury or sweet in Auvergne and you’ve\nlikely found chocolate soufflé on dessert\nmenus all over the heartlands.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Sullen Fortified Wine", "A bottle of wine from a far off plane, the\nbottle has the design of a skeletal saint\nwith a beating heart in the ribcage, holding\na chalice in one hand, and a scale in the\nother. This aged wine has a very exquisite\ntaste, rivaling even the great wines of this\nplane. A curious little trinket.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A Planewalker's venture.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The ≎ Royal ≎ Sandwich", "The collection of meats and bread would cause\npious of men to drool and if it could talk\nmany would worship it as a false idol. A holy\nsecret sauce is spread on the bread for safe\nmeasure because they say it was crafted by a\nwitch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Mineral Solvent", "This muck colored solvent is one capable of\nbreaking down metal; this is corrosive to\nmetal, stone, and even organic material. Over\nthe course of minutes, it would dissolve the\nsubstance, causing rusting around the area\nfor metals; eating away organic material and\nslowly liquifying stone. If affected, get it\noff as soon as possible, or have something\nthat could cancel it out -- or hope that one\nonly got minor splashes on them. After being\nactivated, it lastes thirty minutes before\ngoing inert.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Frostbreath Potion", "This is a fire coral flask, decorated with\nbrown pearl, containing frostbreath potion.\nIt feels cold to the touch. It is viscous. A\ncube of ice floats in the liquid. It smells\nof nothing, and tastes of water and salt.\nWhoever drinks this potion will produce\nbreath as cool as a winter breeze, for one\nhour.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Anti-Poison", "A green elixir, that when drank, will remove\nthe effects of poisons from one’s systems.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Rokodra Greatsword", "Forged with the metal of the High Hells,\nwithin your grasp is a blade of most sinister\nmake. The design of the weapon is like that\nof a typical greatsword, the blade falling to\na T-shaped crossguard, with a handle ample in\nsize for use by most. The metal appears like\na deep blue, so dark that it could easily be\nconfused for black. If held for too long, the\ninnate cold exuded by the blade would cause\nyour skin to go numb, thus requiring a layer\nof protection between it and its wielder. The\nblade is immune to natural and voidally\nevoked fire.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rokodra Barbute Helm", "Forged of maleus through Rokodra, this helm\nboasts an all-together unusual design and\ncolour. The metal appears to be a very dark\nshade of blue, so dark that it could be\nmistaken for being black. The helm is styled\nin the barbut fashion, and is unusually cold\nto the touch, so much so that if held against\nbare flesh for too long will start to have a\nnumbing effect. One might take note that if\nthis helm is attempted to be reformed that\nconventional fire or evoked fire will have no\neffect on it whatsoever. When malflame is\ncast nearby the helm it will start to exude a\nneon green exhaust.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by vvmrr.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Cold Spiked Cider", "The Cold Spiked Cider, a Strong, yet Tasty\nblend, is a Favorite of those Within the\nSouth. The Brew would be a Mixture of Fennic\nApples, Rum, Cinnamon, Ginger, and Special\nIngredients which all contribute to its\nExtraordinary Taste. Those who Let the Drink\npass their Lips are Greeted by a Sweet, Tangy\nFlavor, its Auroma Captivating those within\nits smell of Cinnamon and Apples.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fennic Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax Slips (50)", "Tax slips fit for 50 mina each.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer-Accented Bolt", "While seemingly normal bolts of the bodkin\nvariety at a first glance these projectiles\nare accented or tipped in a bronze hued\nmaterial. Slayersteel carries the\nmonster-slaying traits of Gold while\nmaintaining the durability of tempered iron.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("★✫★ Ｗｉｓｐａｌ Ｃｏｍｐａｎｉｏｎ ★✫★", "A somewhat large, glowing, rotund rabbit like\ncreature, alongside a square bronze cage. The\ncreature's body bears a bright blue glow. The\ncreature is quite round, with a small, low to\nthe ground face. It bears 2 black eyes, a\nsmall button nose, and a split mouth, similar\nto a rabbit. It bears 4 small legs, each with\n4 small toes on each paw. The creature's back\nis 2 feet tall, whilst the creature itself is\nonly 3 feet tall, being as wide as it is\ntall. Due to the creature's short legs, it\ndoes not walk, or 'hop' far off the ground.\nIt is herbivorous, and eats plants. [Contact\nAuric_Saint for more info.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Arrow", "The bundle of arrows are heavier than usual\nat 560 grains per arrow, the arrowhead is\ncrafted to hold barbed ferrum, obviously not\nmade to cause fatal injuries but more\npainstakingly crippling ones that require\nmedicial expertise to remove. The shaft is\nmade of hickory wood, the flighted feathers\nare firmly attached to the base of the arrow\nholding standard design. Even looking at this\narrow can spell a painful extraction for any\nsoul unfortunate enough to be fired upon by\nthe munition.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Melted Gold Lance", "A disfigured item from a former comrade. The\nlance would be melted by some sort of flame,\nand twisted with rotted flesh. A trophy for\nthose who slain the Vodnik who wielded this.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Wonder Tonic", "A strong medicine that truly does wonders for\nthose who consume it. With ingredients like\nginseng, yarrow, chamomile and feverfew,\nWonder Tonic can fix many and most common\nailments. From fever, to diarrhea, from\nexhaustion to headaches, Wonder Tonic can\ncure it. The medicine itself is a misty white\nand sits in a medium-sized bottle. It smells\nstrongly of the various herbs it includes and\ntastes very bitter. IMPORTANT: Children\nshould not consume more than half a bottle\nper day. Consequences of taking in an\noverdosis can include but aren’t limited to:\nconstipation, lightheadedness and vomiting.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arthur Blaze.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Smoke Bombs", "A mastercrafted runic smoke bomb. This item\nwould create a large thick smoke screen when\nused. One time use only. (PM Hiebe for more\ninfo)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's Vintage Red c.1696", "The sweet red has undertones of strawberries\nand raspberries upon consumption. This\nsweetness is contrasted by the acidity\npresent within the wine, giving it a\ncontrasting flavor profile that develops\nitself pleasantly. This is a full-bodied wine\nthat will take the unaccustomed drinker\nunaware, enjoyable and decadent.The bottle is\nplastered with an finely crafted label, with\nthe sigil of purple grapes apparent. In the\ncorner, the Vintner “Kelly Winery and Co.”\nwould be written in cursive, with\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bow of Plenty (lesser)", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Lorraine Cross", "The beautiful blue-grey cross Lorraine.\nCarfully made by expert blacksmith's hands\nwith a singular blue gem of lapis shined by a\nwonderfully talented stone-mason. The cross\ncomes with minisculely-linked iron chain that\nwarm easily with your body heat. Blessed by\nhis eminence Arch-Bishop Braum S. Hardt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [ArchBishop] Braum S Hardt.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_7(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Meat Bread", "This fine piece of culinary artwork was\nperfected by Gordon the Baker himself. The\nloaf of bread would have strange chunks of\nmystery meat all over. The meat would have a\nstrange look to it but be no different than\nwhat one would find in the markets.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gordon.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Campfire kit.", "Excellent for the construction of campfires.", "minecraft:flint_and_steel", ""),
        StaticItem("Cousin Otis' Gumbo", "Patriotic gumbo over rice. Chunks of catfish,\nshrimp and spicy pork sausage make up healthy\nportions of the meal. A few legs of river mud\ncrab would stick out of the bowl.", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Flail", "", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Strength", "A cloudy concotion of red hue rests here,\nsmelling of acid when opened. If imbibed, the\nuser would find their strength (if human/elf)\nincreasing to that of an orc, allowing them\nto perform greater feats of strength and an\neasier time with strength-based tasks (like\nslamming a skull in with a mace). Just as all\ngood things, however, it is not for free. If\ndrank, the after effects would be an extreme\npain in the muscles for the rest of the elven\nday due to the overload of the muscle.\nCareful!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Family", "A delicate blue flower with a baby blue\nribbon tied in a bow around the stem.\nAttached would be a small tag reading \\\"With\nlove, to a member of my family.\\\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anabel.", "minecraft:blue_orchid", ""),
        StaticItem("Tulip of Thankfulness", "A pure white tulip with a white ribbon tied\nin a bow around the stem. Attached would be a\nsmall tag reading \"A flower gifted to you in\nthankfulness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anabel.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Judeberg Wine", "A delectable wine, tasting of sweetness and a\nhint of vanilla blending perfectly together.\nThis is truly a holy drink.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Order Banner", "The ancient black-and-white banner of the\nVaeyl Order, who were recently defeated in\nbattle by Haense.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legion Tomahawk", "The head of this single-handed axe is forged\nfrom steel, polished and sharpened using\nmultiple grits of whetstone; it would have\ntwo sides, one a cutting edge, the other a\nsharp point. Carved from Renatian Spruce, the\nslightly curved handle is hitched with a\nblack cord- providing a tight grip. Attached\nto the end of the handle is a piece of black\nand purple checkered cloth. The stamp of the\nImperial Armory is etched onto the side of\nthe handle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Basic Med-Kit Satchel", "Within this small, leather, satchel were\nsupplies definitely meant for healing and\nsuch. A tin with coagulant paste, pain\nnumbing paste, some disinfectant paste and a\nsmall bottle filled with a liquid version of\nthe disinfectant. Yet another tin filled with\na paste would also be in there, an expedited\nhealing paste, this time. A water skin, a\nbottle of pure alcohol, three rolls of\nbandages, a sewing kit, a whole Blood Lotus\nvine for nourishment, and a couple Eternal\nLeaves for anxiety relief would all be neatly\npacked away within the bag.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Saoirse ungur Ravja af Orvar.", "minecraft:trapped_chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Med-Kit", "Within the leather satchel, a large array of\nmedical supplies can be found. Various tubes\nof healing salves and medicinal liquids, An\nempty water pouch, 6 Rolls of Bandages and\nGauze, a large bottle of Alcohol, a Sewing\nKit, and dried healing herbs from across\nAtlas stored neatly and in labeled containers\nfor on-the-go situations.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Legion Logistics Brigade.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Windsor Wedding Band", "A Stunning Wedding Band made of Pure Aurum\nand at the Top holding a Large Diamond.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Steak of Friendship", "It was pretty special.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Bannana Bread", "Some warm soft bread for the cold given out\nby the kind gate keeper Braum. It tastes like\nbannana bread despite looking nothing like\nit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [swole] Braum S Hardt.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("~Golden Teardrop Earrings~", "This Alluring set of Teardrop-shaped\nearrings, are forged from pure gold,\ncarefully hand-crafted, with delicate, yet\nmesmerising engravings, giving the wearer a\nsense of class and confidence.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Red Leather Belt Quiver", "A bronze and red leather cylinder, alongside\na belt, made for the purpose of holding\narrows. The cylinder is 28 inches long, with\nthe diameter of the cylinder and it's opening\nbeing 5 inches wide. The leather the cylinder\nand belt are made from has been treated with\nbirch tar. The opening of the cylinder bears\na bronze band around it's rim. The bronze the\nband is made from is well shined, and is\nlustrous under light. The belt is 3 feet\nlong, with a bronze belt clasp. The quiver,\nwhen worn properly, would rest on the\nwearer's backside, the opening facing up and\nto the right at a 45 degree angle. The\nleather the quiver is made from is quite\nrigid. The quiver is fastened to the belt\nwith 4 bronze studs. The quiver can hold 20\narrows.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Bronze Dagger", "A short dagger weapon, with a oakwood handle,\nand a bronze blade and pommel. The bronze the\ndagger is made from is well shined, and is\nquite lustrous under light. The oakwood the\nhandle is made from has been treated with\nlinseed oil. The blade of the dagger is\ntriangular, and tapers to a point at a\nconsistent angle. The dagger, from top to\nbottom is 35 centimeters long. The dagger is\netched with the script 'ᚺᛖᚫᛚᛏᚺ' up the middle\nof the the blade. The pommel is 4 centimeters\nlong, and is of a dodecahedron design, (a 12\nsided shape, where each side is a equilateral\npentagon) made of cast bronze. The dagger\ncomes with a fitting sheathe, made of red\nleather. The dagger bears a straight, wooden\ncrossguard that measures 16 centimeters wide.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem of the Geode", "What seems to be half of a gem. Being green\nin color, this gem only gives off a faint\nglow, perhaps even serving as a dim light\nsource in the darkest of places. When the gem\nis matched with its counterpart, it gives off\na bright green glow in a 5 block radius,\nsimilar to an average torch. It has no other\nmagical properties, and cannot be used in\ncombat.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Brew of Dwarves", "This is a dwarf bone vial, studded with\nbismuth bronze, containing brew of dwarves. A\ncupric powder rests at the bottom of the\nvial. It smells earthy, and tastes bitter and\nrocky. Whoever drinks this brew becomes\ngreedier, for twenty-four hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Whisper's Edge", "", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Gladius", "A sharp double-edged steel gladius with a\ntapered point. The handle of the weapon is\nmade from Dark-ash wood, treated with boiled\nTung oil. The entire blade was only 30\ninches.The gladius' handle provided a solid\ngrip by a knobbed hilt with ridges for the\nfingers. Its crossguard was rhomboidal,\nconsisting of the steel tang and the Dark-ash\nwood handle. Branded upon the very pommel,\nwas the letter, Տ. This weapon weighs\napproximately 2 pounds.[[Ｔｈｉｓ ｗｅａｐｏｎ ｉｓ\nｐｕｒｐｏｓｅｄ ｆｏｒ ｈａｃｋｉｎｇ ａｎｄ ｓｌａｓｈｉｎｇ. Ａ ｇｌａｄｉｕｓ\nｃａｎ ｉｎｆｌｉｃｔ ｗｏｕｎｄｓ ｔｈａｔ ｍａｙ ｃａｕｓｅ ｌｉｍｂｓ ｔｏ ｂｅ\nｄｅｐａｒｔｅｄ ｆｒｏｍ ｔｈｅ ｂｏｄｙ.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mastersmith] Sali.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Alstreim Ventures Music Box, 1687", "A small, ornate music box the size of a man's\npalm, fashioned entirely out of Waldenian\nblack ferrum and lined with velvet,\ncontaining a pin-adorned cylinder and a tuned\nferrum comb inside. Opening the lid to spin\nthe miniature handle would activate a\nminiature clockwork mechanism that sets the\ncylinder in motion, plucking the ferrum comb\nto the melody of a glorious Waldenian tune,\nthe Victory March of Metz.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Rose", "A beautifully handcrafted wooden rose. The\nflower is an outstanding imitation of a real\nrose, indistinguishable to the common eye\nunless closely examined. The petals are made\nfrom that of a birch tree, colored with a\ncrimson dye, with the details having been\nmeticulously carved into each inch from the\npetal to the bud. The petals themselves curl\nbackwards twoards the stem, though very\nrigid, to add to the realism of the flower.\nIn the stem would be carved the initials A.D.\nvery carefully.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BlanchZombie.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Truffles", "A leather bag filled to the brim with\nchocolate truffles. One's never like the\nother; you never know what kind of chocolate\nyou're gonna get. This treat is sure to bring\na smile to anyone's face.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Figure of Aurelius I Horen, Emperor of Man", "A magnificent silver figurine the size of a\nman's palm, depicting a bearded man in\nglorious plate adorned by the Cross of\nPertinax, bearing a cape and a shiny,\npolished crown; the stand upon which it rests\nbears an engraved inscription reading\nIMPERATOR AURELIUS CANONIUS HOREN. Holding\nthe figurine, you cannot help but feel\nsuddenly overwhelmed by awe and respect for\nthe Divine Imperium of Man and the values it\nproudly defends.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Metal Figure Guild of Carolustadt.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's Tavern White c. 1697", "The white wine would be closer to mead if\nanything, the grapes giving it a comfortable\nwarmth to those that would consume it.\nUndertones of floral characters and more\nhoney are drowned within the excess grapes\nfrom harvest. A wine where women could\nembrace their decadence upon this drink and\nwhere a man who was not hearty enough to\nenjoy a strong cognac could follow suit. The\nlabel would be branded with the name of the\nwine and the year it was produced.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Battle Standard of Renatus-Marna", "Soulbound II", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Han's Hunting Knife", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("fuk u", "", "minecraft:ladder", ""),
        StaticItem("Babalouche", "A creamy concoction with a slight sweetness\nconsisting of cabbage and goat's milk. A hint\nof Carrion Black garnishes the dish.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Gladius", "A sharp, double edged shortsword made of\nbronze, with a blade that fans out near the\nend. The handle of the sword bears no\ncrossguard, and the wood the handle is made\nfrom is oakwood, treated with linseed oil.\nThe bronze the blade is made from is well\nshined, and is quite lustrous under light.\nThe blade has been honed to being shaving\nsharp. The entire sword is 22 inches long,\nand weighs 2 pounds. The blade fans outward\never so slightly, yet than tapers inward near\nthe tip, giving the sword a triangular point.\nThe sword is accompanied with a red leather\nsheathe. The leather the sheathe is made from\nhas been treated with birch tar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Prince Commodus' Krak du Shine Moonshine", "Home brewed moonshine from the Mos\nle'Harmless cantina. Easy to make and take\nthe pain away. Something about this drink\nmakes you feel so good you want to have\nanother!", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Moltenfish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Elven Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Stoneskin Potion", "A vile smelling gray potion rests here. If\nimbibed, they would find their skin and flesh\nhardening to that of stone-like qualities,\nprotecting them from most slashing injuries\nand providing resistance to the elements for\n15 emotes. However, this comes at a cost of\nslowing them to a walking pace and completely\nnulling dexterity-based actions, essentially\nmaking them a walking tank and little else.\nIf imbibed too often, can cause Akmen's\nSyndrome...is it worth it?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hierophant's Doll", "This is a palm-sized crow leather doll,\nstuffed with pig tail thread and brown\nrecluse spider silk. It is encrusted with\nresin opal. A small cherry hands from around\nits neck on cedar fibre string. When this\ncherry is fed to a living creature, the doll\nwill transform to take on the shape of the\ncreature, and act out the behaviors for the\nspecies.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Lost Soul Vodka", "A harsh, stout vodka that burns the mouth,\nthroat and belly. Only used to make oneself\nquite drunk, not for casual enjoyment.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MintyKnight.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of ItsMeAlex", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blowgun Darts (Poisoned)", "A small and sharp wooden dart with an iron\nending that is coated in a peculiar honey\nbrown nectar. This honey brown nectar ,when\nit comes in contact with the blood stream,\nthe afflicted person passed out for multiple\nhours, before awaking to splitting headache\nand grogginess.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Warden/Steward] Aymer Yalathir.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred chunk 'o' HighPrince Jacques Alphonse", "A chunk of a skinny high prince swiftly\ncaptured by the /better/ Proud Imperial\nprince Antonius and boiled alive in milk and\ncoca-powder by Maria Horen.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Waldenian Pretzel", "A glazed, hard-baked treat of thick, looped\ndough prepared in true Aesterwaldic Waldenian\nfashion, heavily salted and topped with\nsesame seeds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Legionnaire Halberd", "A well-crafted halberd which was comprised of\ntwo main parts and two main materials. The\nshaft was made from a sturdy Dark-elm wood,\ntreated from quality Tung-seed oil. Whilst\nthe spear and axe-head were made from high\ncarbon steel. The weapon was 6 feet 2 inches\nin height and weighed approximately 4 lbs.\nThe axe-head was quite large and well thinned\ntowards it's edges, making a well-defined\nhook towards the upper shaft. Most of the\nmiddle of the handle was wrapped with\nleather, woven in like intricately. Signed\nupon the leather with an etching tool was,\nＥｍｉｌ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Emil.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked The Harrison Fish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Sardine", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Cod", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Longfin", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Carp", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Keldrite", "A swirling, bubbling and unstable liquid\nSneak or use /walk before handling!\nThis item is best transported via Llama", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Field Medical Kit", "A large medical kit rests here, filled with\nvarious medical solutions. Contains a\nscalpel, tweezers, suturing kit, two rolls of\ngauze bandages, a Tippens-Blissfoil Salve, a\nFrostvine paste, Antiseptic paste, two\ntriangular eye dressings, and a minor Potion\nof Mending. The leather of the bag itself\ncould be taken apart to use as additional\nbandages, though they would not be nearly as\neffective as the actual gauze bandages. A\nlifesavers kit, prepared for any good doctor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daelyn Fae.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosnian Sweet Mead", "The Rosnian Sweet Mead would be a Flavorful\ncombination of Honey, Cherries, and\nStrawberry Leaves, giving it its Defining\nSweetness. The Drink would be made from\nLocally Sourced Ingredients from The Lands of\nRosenyr.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rosenyr Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("✮ Festival de Philip ✮", "A small piece of purple hued parchment\ndecorated with elaborate details, holding\netching on the backside; Thank you for\njoining us on this festival devoted for the\nbattled devoted to death of Philip Owyn on\nthe 10th of The First Seed, 1626. GOD guide\nyou!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ♛ The Imperial Administration ♛.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("1st Place Coin", "A coin won at the Adelburg Ball that has a\nbig \"1\" engraved into it along with red\nrubies inside for recieving 2nd place in the\ntalent show!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("TAX REDUCTION", "This signifies a reduced tax of 50% in the\ncity of Adelsburg.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("TAX PAID", "A receipt for a week's tax paid in the city\nof Adelsburg.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("TAX WARNING", "A warning incurred due to failure to pay\ntaxes. If you acquire three of these\nwarnings, you will be evicted!", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Catherine's Pearl Ring", "A flawless pearl polished to perfection sits\nwithin an inlay of aurum, resting upon a band\nalso crafted of aurum. Dust of emerald is\nencrusted into the metal to give it a\nshimmery appearance. These rings were made\nspecially for the Schuyler Sisters of Atlas!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Ring", "A finely made silver ring featuring an\nintricate geometric etching along the band.\nIn cursive elvish text, the name of the\nwearer's significant other is carved into the\ninside of the band in rose-gold lettering. No\ngemstone rests on the ring, but the band\nseems wider than one intended for a wife.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TwilightWolf9012.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Replica Sutican Guard and Ballista", "A small kit which includes a wooden\narticulated Sutican Guard painted to have\narmour detailing and blue and gold cloth and\ndetailing in the style of Axios Uniform. The\nBallista is also made of wood with high\ntension string installed as to allow a user\nto crank back the string and then launch a\nsmall wooden ballista bolt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Utaria.", "minecraft:repeater", ""),
        StaticItem("Writ of Safety and Compliance", "This writ, stamped with the Imperial seal and\nthe personal sigil of His Excellency, the\nArch-Seneschal, details its carrier as an\nImperial asset and commands Legion compliance\nwith their actions, provided they're dressed\nin Qalasheen garb.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aran Talraen de Rennes.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Krak du Shine' Moonshine", "Prince Commodus' home brewed moonshine made\nfrom corn mash. It's an incredibly potent\nliquor distilled in the Mos le'Harmless\nbasement and packs a molly wop to all but the\nalcoholics. Some warm feeling about this\ndrink makes you want to have another.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Commodus.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sangria", "A Santegian alcoholic beverage made with red\nwine and chopped fruit. A touch of brandy and\norange juice is added to the mixture to give\nit a more citrusy flavor. Better to drink\nthis with others than alone!", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Pig's Blood", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Fat Man's Blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Fish of Doom", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("lal lal nub kayr", "monetary proof of the fact that you do nub\nkayr lal lal", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Mending", "A peculiar pink potion rests here, swirling\nwith pretty clouds in the bottle. A common\nremedy for most medium-grade ailments, this\npotion is what you'd use in place of a\ngreater healing for the case of mild wounds.\nCapable of patching over cuts in a small\namount of emotes (3), this is it's most\ncommon usage, allowing for fast healing of an\ninjury that could impair you. It is even\ncapable of healing minor illnesses akin to\nthe cold. A useful potion for any\nself-proclaimed Doctor's arsenal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Baron Ribs", "Jesse's Red Baron Ribs named after Commodus\nbest friend. The pig ribs are smoked and the\nmeat falls off the bone when eaten. The ribs\nhave a hint of an applewood flavor and the\nmarrow is charred lightly on each side of the\nbone. Made from Pigzilla, the large Renatian\nBoar that roams the nearby forests.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Tubby Olog's Head", "It would appear to be the head of an obese\nOlog. It still reeks with a putrid scent.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Yemekarloss'Varekan", "In your hand you hold a fist sized stone\nsphere covered in runes. When the activation\nphrase \\\"Varekan\\\" is uttered, the sphere\nbegins to glow brightly and illuminates the\nnearby area with a white light equal in\nbrightness to a large torch. Upon uttering\nthe phrase once more, the runes would\ndeactivate and the light would diminish.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:sea_lantern", ""),
        StaticItem("Crouching Feather", "The flower gains it's name from how it\ncrouches' when approached by large fauna. A\nflower dedicated to alchemical use, it\nrepresents air in alchemy; speed, travel, and\ngrace. A strong gale will easily blow the\npetals off.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Brokenhelix.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Helm of Purity", "An ornate bronze helmet bearing circular\ninscriptions in flexio where the ears are\ncovered. The right side reads \"NULLUM MALUM\nAUDI\" while the left one reads \"NULLUM BONUM\nAUDI\". While worn, the helmet makes the user\nexperience absolute silence, regardless of\nexternal stimuli.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whamsickle.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Possessed Claymore", "A hefty sword of highlander craft. The blade\nhas a groove upon which strange runes are\ninscribed. Every time the weapon is swung it\nscreams in agony, audible only to the user.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whamsickle.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Anvil Cracker", "A hammer made from Mythael, found in the\ndeepest mines of the Dwarves. Extremely\ndense, this smithing hammer has been known to\nbreak Anvils it's used on.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fancy Tea Cup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Maga Hat", "A reward for all the Orenian patriots who\nfought in service of the Lord Saviour on\n11/8/16. It practically sparkles in the\nsunlight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Red_Rockkit.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Coq au Vin", "A dish of chicken braised with wine,\nmushrooms, bacon, mushrooms, onions, garlic\nand a drop of fine Adrian brandy!", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Cassoulet de Saucisse", "A comfort dish of white beans stewed slowly\nwith spicy pork sausages, wafting of parsley\nand innumerable other spices. Carrots,\npotatoes, water chestnuts, celery and leeks\nmake this dish a hearty one.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Leaflet for The Ratcatcher Tavern", "The leaflet reads, \"The Ratcatcher Tavern,\nrated 5 out of 5 Horens opens soon! Come\ndrink with friends and foes in this deep dark\ndank hole in a wall. Contact Obediah\n((Navin_)) for any inquires.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Navin_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose of Romance", "A small red rose, the thorns cut off. A red\nribbon would be tied in a bow around the\nstem, attached a small tag detailing “A rose\ngifted in love! Look to the giver, and\nperhaps you’ll find your romance”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Reindeer Pastry", "This delicious pastry smells like fresh\nherbs, minced meat and even like apple. It\nappears as if this pastry was made by using\nreindeer meat.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Norlandic Skull", "A collected head from the fall of Nordengrad.\nThe skull has been bleached white and is\nunrecognizable but a certificate is rolled up\npoking through its eyehole proving its\nauthentication.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pendant of The Imperial Legion", "A finely casted gold pendant bearing the\nsigil of the House of Horen on one side and\nthe Legion on the other. Around the edge of\nthe pendant are several words engraved in\nHigh Imperial \\\"Nobis conciliare Id rebus\\\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Treasury.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Kiteshield", "6ft tall large kiteshield made out of sturdy\ndark oak wood, several dents dot it, yet the\nshield can take plenty more punishment before\nbreaking.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Rapid Expanse", "A mist potion that immediately spawns a gas\nthat clears fire completely and immediately.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Spider Hide", "A hide retrieved from a Large Spider that\ninvaded San'Raakh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Space Helmet", "Rocket man burning out his fuse up here\nalone!~", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetic Boar Meat", "A tougher, gameyer, cut of pork. Cleaved from\nthe corpse of a giant Haensetic Boar this cut\nof meat is otherwise unremarkable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Drugs", "It's not that BAAAAAAD\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Cleansing Incense", "A potion that will emit a beautiful smell\nsimilar to that of a flower once it makes\ncontact with air.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Potion of Agility", "Upon drinking this green concoction, the user\nwill find a boost to their speed and\nreflexes, whether it be for a combative or\nany other application. It will allow the user\nto move x2.5 faster than their normal\ncapacity, but will cause fatigue, and\nafterward limit their speed to .4 of their\nnormal capacity (Effects last 5 minutes and\nafter effects last 10 minutes).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Elixir of Strength", "Upon drinking this yellow concoction, the\nuser will find a boost to their physique,\nwhether it be for a combative or any other\napplication. It will allow the muscles to\nfunction at x2.5 their normal capacity, but\nwill afterward drop the muscles to .4 of\ntheir capacity (Effects last 5 minutes and\nafter effects last 10 minutes).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Rapid Expanse", "A potion that disperses to gas when it is\nexposed to air in a 4 by 4 radius. It will\ndouse any weak or moderate flame, but a\nbreath of this will make a man vomit, more\nthan two will make a man sick, and whatever\nit touches will have an awful smell for a few\ndays afterward. If one were to touch the\npotion while it was still liquid, their skin\nwould turn black, and a pain would crawl up\ntheir limb for 2-3 hours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mastercrafted Wedding Ring", "A beautifully crafted wedding ring, featuring\na rosegold band, which was lined with tiny\ndiamond, but featured a big, indigo stained\ndiamond in the middle. If light fell upon it,\nit would sparkle in a beautiful fashion. The\ndiamond itself was masterfully cut, and while\nrelatively small, it would probably cost\nquite a lot, due to it's unique colouration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Smithing.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Fossilized Branch", "This is an ancient branch of an unknown\nspecies of tree. For some time before being\ndiscovered, it must have been buried under\nthe earth -- it has begun the process of\nmineralization, with its exterior rendered\nhard and flakey, like stone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Scale", "A small, plate-like scale, would be about 2\ninches in length. The scale would appear to\nbe in perfect condition.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("COCK PRESSURE", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pheasant Feather Arrows", "These arrows are rather pretty- Good for\nhanging up. Their arc is rather weak, though.\nWhoever made them clearly meant for them to\nbe a decoration.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bees that Listen", "This is a butterfly wing bottle containing\nsixteen yellowthorn bees. Their stings are\nmildly painful and cause minor swelling, but\nare not lethal and do not have systemic\neffects. When the bottle containing them is\nopened or shattered, they may be given a\nsingle command, which they will follow to the\nbest of their ability. They perish one\nSaint's half-hour after being released.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Notification", "You have been refunded golden carrots to\nrebreed your horse. Unfortunately this is all\nI can do, I'm not able to spawn in a specific\nspeed horse. -Deer", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreamcatcher of Drelthok", "A finenly crafted dreamcatcher of sticks and\nwool strings. Various small bones, colorful\nfeathers and beads decorate the craft\ndesigned to improve one's sleep. The hanger,\na bone, is engraved with shamanic runes in\nold blah praising the spirit Drelthok.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("The Roses' Locket", "A beautifully crafted silver necklace,\nfeaturing an elegant chain, and a locket\nwhich showed a sizeable ruby. The locket\nitself was nicely engraved, and could be\nopened to hold a small item. The ruby was\nexpertly carved and reflects whatever light\nthat falls upon it beautifully. Aside from\nthat main ruby, there were a few other,\nsmaller rubies, that were arranged around the\nmain ruby in such a pattern that it resembled\na rose.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Pilum", "A Javlin that is generally 2 metres with an\nIron shank at about 60 centimetres. The pilum\nis made of a fine wooden shaft, and is able\nto be used as a spear if needed.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Falkenrath Royal Mark c.1684", "Aged within charred oak barrels, this rye\nstyle whiskey would be both incredibly smooth\nand robust in its taste and flavor. Comprised\nof a strong fermented aroma, the drink would\nactually contain a subtle, sweet and delicate\nflavor profile consisting of brown sugar,\nvanilla, and caramel\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rolien Vulnear.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Autumn Spice Black Tea", "This fragrant and steaming cup of rich dark\nblack tea would emit a strong and flavorful\nscent of warm spices such as cinnamon, clove,\nnutmeg, and cardamom. The soul-warming\nbeverage would be the perfect drink for a\ncold Autumn's eve or night\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueberry Pie", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonsmilk Ale", "A classic that you simply can’t go wrong\nwith, Dragon’s Milk Ale is a hearty drink\nmade of wheat and honey. It’s rich flavor is\ncomplimented by the high levels of hops that\nwent into its brewing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lanavia.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Nufir's Head", "the Beheaded head of Nufir the Cyclops.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetian Emerald Necklace", "An excellently crafted necklace made of\n24Karat gold, in twines of Norse braids, when\ncoming to the center they entwine themselves\namongst golden chainlinks. Centered with a\nlarge Emerald gemstone set in an octogonal\npendant fixture with elongated sides. A\nrather large gem when compared to other, it\nis surrounded by a few smaller Emeralds\nentangled in golden vines off the chainlinks.\nIt comes with a certificate of authenticity,\nproving it to be made by The Wulf & The Bear\nTrading Company.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MaeceCetcher.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Waystone White", "A Specialty amongst the Waystone Inn, The\nWaystone White would be a Fine Wine, made at\nthe Hands of the Rosnian People. The Wine\nwould hold a Fruity Aroma, one Filled with\nScents of Citrus and Lemon. Upon Tasting, the\nWine would Burst with a Sweet, yet Fortified\nFlavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Waystone White.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Amazing Flint", "A huge beautiful brown stone 'o' flint that's\nso big it could easily weild 20 arrows. This\nis truley a rare treasure as it's all in one\npeice!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [swole] Braum S Hardt.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("✧ Pygmy Marmoset ✧", "A male pygmy marmoset ,with a light brown\ncolored coat. It would weigh around 100\ngrams, and would be small enough to fit in\nthe hand of a full grown human male. The\ncreature would have human like paws fit for\nclimbing and scavenging food , and sharp\nteeth , witch is their main fourm of defence.\nThe Pygmy marmoset would seem very protective\n, yet social twords its owner , and people\nthat are usually around them. It would be\nvery loud and in situations of known danger.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MayRndz.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lantern", "A lantern! Yes! This is a lantern! I am not\nsure if you've heard of one, but typically\nthey have a small fire inside that creates\nlight! Who would've thought that? Man if you\nknew that you must be a genius. Though\nseriously all it is is a lantern. You\ntypically light it to explore dark places or\nfor travelling in the night. It's also quite\noften used as not everyone is a cleric with\nmagic able to make light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HortonHeardAWho.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Grade S Fern", "A fern plant of unmatched quality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Crownland Ferns.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Residue", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Eye Orb", "A red orb with an eyeball in the centre.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Pauldron", "A bronze piece of armor meant to be worn on\none's shoulder. The bronze the pauldron is\nmade from is well shined, making it quite\nlustrous. The pauldron consists of one large\nsemihemispherical plate, and 3 smaller\noverlapping plates that go down the bicep, as\nwell as 3 leather straps as to fasten around\none's chest. The bronze plates are padded on\nthe inside, as for comfort of wear. The\nleather the straps are made from has been\ntreated with birch tar. The large\nsemihemispherical plate of the pauldron is 2\nand a half millimeters thick, whilst the\noverlapping plates are 1 millimeter. The\nlarge plate is 7 inches tall and wide, whilst\nthe smaller plates are each 3 inches long,\noverlapping like scale mail.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Azaghul made steel piece", "a piece of fine dwathen steel with a small\nnote on it \"azaghul", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Blade of The Fire Warden", "This short blade is made in a very percise\nmanner and ornate in its design with the\nsymbol of a dwarven longbeard on the guard.\nWhen activated by a dwarf the blade would be\nengulfed in a raging flame that would burn\nconstantly searing anything that was effected\nby fire. [2-3 uses] [overlord8000]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kanadensare.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("░░▒▓⇜ＡＬＲＡＳＩＡＮ ＧＯＬＤ⇝▓▒░░", "This here is an authentic gold coin from the\nRoyal Bank and Gambling House of Alras. Each\ncoin is worth 20 minas, no more, no less.\nThese coins are engraved with the head of\nHigh King Syrio Forel and the date 1615\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Horace Forel.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Band of Fire Control", "An intricately and finely crafted ironband.\nUpon the outerside of the band was an emerald\nembroidered upon it. Runes were etched under\nthe band. Once these runes were activated the\nrune creates fire, the wearer then will be\nable to move this fire and manipulate it with\nthe help of a few different motion rune\nmodifiers. These runes are being powered via\nthe gem upon it. [[ PM VioletPepsi for more\ninformation ]]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Dwarven Sword", "A blessed dwarven blade. This blade was\nblessed in the Temple of Belka in Holm. Runes\nof enforcement can be seen on the blade\nmaking it as strong as ferrum. The runes\nwould fade over time and would need to be\ntaken to a runesmith to re-inscribe . (This\nwould be 2 weeks ion real life. PM Hiebe for\nmore info.)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Runestone IV", "(Runestone) A peculier iron 'stone' that is\ncovered in runes. The sphere shaped object\nhas very little space that is not covered by\nthe runic language, only an Arch - Runelord\ncould hope to understand them.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Pine Druid's Special Herbs", "A herb grown by the Pine Druid to smoke,\nprovides calm and foggy sensations.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Mountain Ale", "This Drink would be as 'powerful' as rum, it\ntaest like how a fern tree smells in the\nwinter, a little earthy and many diffent\nvaring spices, over all a good drink to get\ndrunk on fast\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HopeSky123.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Revelry's Applejack c.1700", "A dry, fully fermented cider made from a\nblend of acidic, aromatic, and tannic apples\nis put into a spruce barrel, then left\noutside during Sigismund's End to go through\nfreeze distillation. At the end of three\nsennights, the concentrated product is\ntransferred to a charred-oak barrel for\naging. The aged Applejack has rich and\ncomplex flavor, yet packs a hard kick; its\nexcess tartness is balanced by a hint of cane\nsugar. ~100-proof\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Midnight Revelry.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Azaghul Dark Mead", "This robust yet semi-dry mead is made from a\ndarkened honey and the Azaghul secret\ningredient that produces rich tones and\nclearly defined layers of flavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bwelch Azaghul.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Qalasheen Steel Watch", "A Qalasheen Watch made of Qalasheen Steel,\nThe Steel Looked Like Majestic Water waves,\nWithin the Watch was a Brass outline Marking\nthe Times, The Small and Large Hand Would\nalso be made of brass shaped in a Qalasheen\nvector design, Within the Design of the\ncenterpiece of the watch, the qalasheen steel\nwould look like a mesmerizing electric shock\nwave...If we knew what that was.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Smoke Whispers", "Smoke Whispers A gray potion that will erupt\ninto a cloud of smoke when it contacts air,\ncausing irritation when breathed in and to\nthe eyes (5x5 block area). Good for a quick\nescape or a distraction!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Hot_Dip hey", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aex Book", "A surprisingly-new looking book found in the\nCommand Quarters of Lasthope. It seems to be\npost-Descendant arrival correspondence: the\npages inside bear the cursive scrawl of Aex,\nthe language of Old Atlas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Hazel Wood Flatbow", "A flatbow made of hazel wood, with a sinew\nstring. The bow is 70 inches tall, and bears\na yellowish tan color. The bowstring is made\nof the chorded sinew of an animal, and is\nquite elastic. The bow bears a draw weight of\n90 to 110 pounds, and is effective on targets\nwith little, or non-metal armor. The bow\nwidens ever so slightly near the lower half\nof the middle, indicating where it is to be\nheld. The handle area has been wrapped in a\nthin layer of red leather. The leather around\nthe handle has been treated with birch tar.\nThe thick handle area of the bow is unbending\nand stiff, whilst the arms of the bow flex\nand bend as needed. The bow bears a notably\nrectangular cross-section.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Poison Vial", "A green tinted whiskey colored liquid.\nSmelling of whiskey with a small tint of\nspices, once entered blood-stream or\ningested, it will cause a painful burning\nsensation and nausea. Two vials would result\nin death. When an area is cut with a weapon\nbearing this poison, that limb or area will\nconvulse and contract, which would be\npainful. These would occur around 2-3 minutes\nafter being applied to the bloodstream. ((3-4\nemotes with limbs, 2-3 with torso))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hyperthinking.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("<!>Klomper Jr.<!>", "Bricks blessed by the holy Brick Knight, they\nare a mighty force to be reckoned with.\nShould you posses this brick the All Father\nBrick guides you! It would be initialed\nA.V.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Atticus Vesryn.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Stake", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Plant", "A decently sized pot with a wooden trellis\nbacking, the slim oak panels tied together in\na criss-cross fashion with twine. Vines crept\nup the wood, clinging to it and growing upon\nit. The plants leaves were rounded, and young\nbuds grew in little bundles on certain spots,\nsmelling sweetly. A knowledgable gardener\nwould know this to be a honeysuckle plant!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Wrapped Rosiere Red, Circa, 1693", "A Wrapped Bottle of Rosiere Red, The\nSpecialty Wine of The Principality of\nRosenyr. The Drink would be Smooth and\nFlavorful, Giving off a Sweet, Fruity Smell\nOnce Opened. It is said that the Red's Flavor\nwould Improve the Longer it is Left Unopened.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rosenyr Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Nim's Babbling Concoction", "Upon consumption of this substance, the\ndrinker will find the oil causing their mouth\nto over salivate. Afterward, their tongue\nwill swell and shake. Finally, they will find\ntheir lips increasingly difficult to move.\nWith each stage, the user will have more and\nmore difficulty talking until the capability\neventually ceases. These effects will\napproximately last a day.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("✿❀Jar of Bees❀✿", "A large glass jar filled with at least twenty\nbees, the wooden stopper sealing the jar has\nhad small holes drilled through, the bees\nseem rather docile.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sourtail Whiskey", "A chunk of mummified tail from an\nunidentifiable reptilian creature floats\nabout the bottle, suspended in golden\n80-proof whiskey. The preserved piece of tail\nadds a slight sour flavor to the whiskey, but\nit itself is rock-hard and obviously not\nmeant for eating. When drinking this\nbeverage, there is but one rule: “You can\ndrink it fast, you can drink it slow—but the\nlips have gotta touch the tail.”\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("◿△◊ Bronze Conical Nasal Helmet ◊△◺", "A tall cast bronze helmet with a conical\nshape. The helmet is cast in two parts, a\nlarge cone, and a brow and nasal guard\nattached with rivets to the front. The helmet\nis quite tall, with a tall 'cone' shape that\nextends almost a foot above the wearer's\nhead. The helmet has notable suspension, and\nwill bounce slightly on the head if struck.\nThe nasal guard is flat and rectangular. The\nbronze the helmet has been made from has been\nwell shined, making it quite lustrous under\nlight. The helmet is quite light, weighing\nonly about a kilogram and a half. The helmet\non a standard sized human or elf will\nslightly cover the top of one's ears,\ngranting no protection to the side of the\nface or neck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Cotton Candy", "A leather bag filled to the brim with cotton\ncandy, sticky threads of crystalline goodness\nthat melts in your mouth. This treat is sure\nto bring a smile onto anyone's face.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Notice", "The locks you placed inside the keep located\nat 312, 1133 were removed due to them being\nillegally placed. In the future, please\nensure the locks that you are placing are not\non another person's property. If you have any\nquestions, please contact me on Discord -\nSakura#8726. Thank you.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Far Oxhorn", "This is a masterfully crafted ox bone horn.\nIt is decorated with native gold and black\nsilver, and encirlced with bands of ox\nleather and dolphin leather. Eagle bones\ndangle from it on ox leather string. On the\nitem is an illustration of an ox and a stag\ndoing battle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Hold-Wall", "A masterwork of dwarven craftsmanship, this\nsturdy arbalest earned its name during the\nBattle of White Mountain, where a dwarven\nranger held off a group of knights bearing\ndown on him and his few remaining comrades.\nIn the ranger's hands, the arbalest proved\nmore than capable of launching bolts through\nthick steel cuirasses, holding the invading\nforce at bay just long enough for\nreinforcements to arrive. While the victory\nagainst the Imperials proved short-lived, the\ntale is still one told with great pride\naround dwarven campfires.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Darksalvo.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Eternal Egg ★", "A hollow egg which has an egg inside it that\ncontains yet another egg, and, inside this\nthird egg, you have a fourth egg until it\ngets to the point that its so small and not\neven the deities can open it with their\nfingernails, yet, all of these easter eggs\ngot a charming taste of blue ice cream. Happy\neaster!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bjorn's Skull", "The blackened skull of the beserker Bjorn\nRayneck, who was turned into an undead\nmonstrosity at the behest of dark powers.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Wuglim", "The small stone is flat enough on one side to\ncarry a small rune. At the mention of the\nword of activation, Wuglim, the rune begins\nto glow softly and water would begin to flow\nsteadily from the surface of the rune until\nthe activation word is repeated. The rune\nitself, as all runes do, would wear out after\nan extended period without renewal and would\nlikely stop working after 4 or 5 uses.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("La Chaleur du Foyer", "A standard edition of ale, bottled and\nrefined using a small blend of hops. Although\nit’d suffer from a slightly bland taste, it’d\nstill leave a hearty and strong taste upon\nthe tongue. Its bottle is marked with the\nl’Vienne crest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Earrings", "Similar to coruscating diamonds, the exquisitve earrings\ncling to one's ear, glistening in the light. Jade, emerald\ngreen in colour, rimmed with rich gold: these\nwere intricate pieces of jewelry. Enchanted with\nthe ability to ward away Mental Magic.\n*Moderator Approved*\nVlKTORIOUS approved this item.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Fantastic Orchids", "*Moderator Approved*\nImCookiie approved this item.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Whispers of the Far Glade", "This is the skull of a high druid. When held\nup to your ear, secrets of the bramble and\nvine are whispered into your brain (1d4 where\n1 = insights into current situation, 2 = what\na druid would do in the current situation, 3\n= instructions on how to become one with\nbalance, 4 = whispers of the Aspects).\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Pocket Watches", "The clock of this watch is set in a solid\ngold case, inscripted with knotting designs\nthat circle its shining exterior. Most of the\nmaterial seems to be solid gold, therefore\nrendering it a little heavy, over than the\nunscathed glass face of the clock itself.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lotto-Stone", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Kovar the Quick's Elf Ears", "Food: 3\nSaturation: 2.0\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Hat", "A merry reminder of our most\nfestive of holidays!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Lion's Guard", "Armor crafted from wyvern scales. Inside is\ncoated with leather and two light blue\nsapphires are built into each shoulder,\nbearing a enchantment. Upon uttering the\nphrase \"Lion's Roar,\" they would find the\narmor engulfing in flames in the span of 3\nemotes (+1 for activation) equivalent to the\nheat of a fire pit. It is advised that the\nuser soaks the clothing under the Armor with\nfrost oil regularly, less they wish to suffer\nsearing pain. 3 uses before recharge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Bone", "The bone of a young and not yet matured\nCockatrice, there were burn and crisp marks\nscattered across it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Polar Bear Claw", "The Six Inch, Black Colored Claw of a Polar\nBear would rest within your Hand, Sharp\nenough to cut through Flesh. The Claw would\nbe Stained Red due to the Polar Bear's Diet,\nbut could be Turned into an Excellent Tool.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Copper Class Badge", "A badge of the Varendoz Adventurer's Guild\nsignifying the rank of a Copper Class\nAdventurer.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Meat", "A 16oz slice of meat from slain Cockatrice.\nIt would be sweet in favor.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Hero's Beer", "this is a strong tasting drink almost as if\nit has a dark smoke coming out of it as you\npluck it open, only the brave drink this!!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("50 Mina Chip", "A certified gambling chip that seems to have\nbeen lost from its game set. Worth 50 minas.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Pig Blood", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Short Spear", "A shorter weapon than the normal spear, it\nwould be long enough for 1 hand use and at\nthe same time can be thrown. The blade of\neach is roughly eight inches and cloven\nshaped. the shaft of the weapon is made from\nsome jungle wood and measures roughly two\nfoot. The center of the weapon has leather\nbound to it at the balancing spot for easy\ntelling when thrown.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the Kha'Tigrasi,\n- Teps", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Lion's Domain", "A hardy steel helm in the shape of a\nferocious lion. Its mouth is open in a manner\nin which the wearer's head would be within\nit, and the upper part of the mouth can be\nshut to provide the wearer more protection.\nUpon the middle of the helm is a sapphire\nthat when tapped, will evoke a tier five,\nblue fire blast where ever it's pointed.\nAlthough padding is lined inside, the metal\nwould become rather hot when activated,\ncausing the user some discomfort. 5 emotes to\nfire; 3 uses before recharge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Veridian Gift", "You are transformed into a bryophite. Contact\nan LT to receive a race-change. This item\nworks for the signed name, so long as\nSeptember wills it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Barnabas Brittlebranch.", "minecraft:lime_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("September's Bond", "The signed name is bound to the September\nPrince, for as long as he wills it. You\ncannot unattune others, help to unattune\nothers, or yourself be unattuned. You may\ntravel without issue due to range limitations\nfrom natural objects or structures, or due to\nthe unnatural quality of where you are\ntravelling to. You cannot act to harm the\nSeptember Prince, or his interests. This bond\ncan be broken, but only through secrets.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Marco Aurelio d'Montelliano.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Whiskey", "Your average Whiskey, the perfect drink if\nyou dont want to get completely drunk\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kavietsby Vineyard Wine", "A beautiful clear, spotless chalice adorned\nwith embellishments and filled close to the\nrim of a dark merlot wine straight from the\nKavietsby vineyard. A few raspberries soak in\nthe dark liquid, a quite tasty treat as well\nas a beverage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheesus_Crustt.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Queen", "The dagger of a high queen.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Hungry Owlet Cake ~", "Premium Mali'aheral Cakes courtesy of\nAllania La'Cai\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Opiate Powder", "A highly pure, strong opiate ground from the\npoppy fields of southern Asul. This powder\nwould mostly be used to resolve pain, but can\nbe easily abused if taken in higher dosages.\nThe powder would contain a light greyish\ncolour, almost white, showing its purity.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Cross of light", "An ornate silver cross with mage gold\ninscriptions etched within. The inscriptions\nread \"Dues Magnus\" in Felxo. When you tap the\njewled center of the cross, it emits a light\nequivalent to a torch, being deactivated the\nsame way.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lordish Greaves", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Falkenrath Fine Red Wine", "Brewed in the lands of Curon, 1666. The\nfertile lands of Curon produced the finest\ngrapes,when brewed into wine,its smooth and\nfruity tasty will leave you wanting more.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Long Sword", "(Common) A heavy long sword recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. A Dwarven-made sword\nthats only distinguishing feature is a tassel\nof gold and grey cloth that drips from the\npommel.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~= 9ct Pearl and Diamond brooch of White Peak =~", "~= A golden brooch shaped into a small\nmountain, diamonds and pearls covering its\nfront , the pearls forming the snow on top\nand the diamonds repesent the rich fetile\nlands of white peak.Crafted in white peak =~\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Bread Poster", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("The Holy Scrolls", "A copy of the Holy Scrolls in High Imperial.\nIt is neatly ornated and deodorated with\ncolorful imagery and sacred symbols of the\nCanonist faith. This illuminated manuscript\nappears to a single copy for personal use\nwith distinctive miniatures. Although crudely\nsewn together, it is clear much time and\neffort was put in this holy and beautiful\nbook.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Ensign] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Roseplate", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Medesculor Rifle", "The weapon held well together, made by a\nremarkable craftsmen. The strap held rather\nhuge, made to the correct length to uphold on\na torso.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by JakeFSF.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cranberry Pepsi", "A cranberry beverage of revolutionary origins", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cabbage", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mossy Skull", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceres Manufacturing Telescope", "A long telescope at a length of around 18\".\nThe barrel of it contains two lenses on the\ninside, capable of magnifying the target up\nto fifty meters away as if you were in person\nwith them. Along the end and front are small\nwood carvings etched into the 'scope, mainly\nfor aesthetic. Truly a revolutionary piece of\ntechnology.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caesar__Salad.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Reward Cookie", "A delicious cookie that seems to taste\nabsolutly euphoric. The chocolate is a rich\nvelvet texture that can only be described as\notherworldy. The breading of the cookie is\nsoft yet, has a bite to it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Knife", "A simple yet sturdy knife made from a\nrazor-sharp tooth, once belonging to a\nferocious cave leech. The blade has been\ncarefully sharpened, the handle being made of\noak wood and covered with bear leather. At\nthe bottom of the handle, a shiny emerald\nwould be attached. Along the length of the\nhandle, it would be engraved: 'Doomforged.\n[Contact UnStone for more information.]", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
