        StaticItem("Wood O", "O is for Osman was Nice and Built this for\nKadarsi", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood N", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Amethyst", "The Amythest, part of the Gem Set, it Calm's\nthe nerves, perfect for people Meditating or\nStudying.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Salvia Plant", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dance of the Insect-Queen", "This is a reedcloth sheet, containing an\nillustration of a dance. When performed, the\nsheet desiccates to dust. The dancer may\ncommunicate with insects, as normal speech,\nfor up to two saint's hours afterward.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Worm's Delight", "This is a stone leaf vial, containing potion\nof worm's delight. It smells of jungle soil\nand decomposing vegetables, and tastes\npowerfully bitter and earthy. Whoever drinks\nthis potion will attract worms to themselves\nwithin one-hundred meters, for one hour.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag of blood", "A leather sack filled with goats' blood,\nstuffed inside a Dreadknight's armor\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sundr.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fancy Spectacles", "A brand new pair of high quality, shiny\nglasses!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Herathus.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Meat", "This slab of meet was taken from the corpse\nof a red bokolo. If cooked properly it would\ntaste surprisingly similar to that of turkey,\nif not better.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Bokolo Feather", "This red bokolo feather has been plucked free\nfrom one of the fabled creatures themselves.\nIt lay at three inches long, and is\nsurprisingly soft.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Eye", "This is a beedy, dark red bokolo eye at\nroughly an inch in diameter. It still seemed\nwidened in the shock the beast felt in the\nmoments before death.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Claw", "This claw would be faintly tinted red, four\ninches in length and sharp enough to draw\nblood with just a tap. The beast this came\nfrom was clearly formidable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cornbread", "A hint of vanilla is in these fluffy square\ncuts of cornbread. It does not flake as much\nlike most do and are very warm when freshly\nserved. Butter is prepared alongside it to\nuse at your own discretion.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf Head", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Ring", "A lovely ring of gold, it looks to be hand\nmade by a master craftsman and a few very\nsmall carvings adorn the inner rim\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Bone Ring", "A small, poorly-carved ring of direwolf bone,\netched with a crude spiral on its top. It\ncould be used as a pendant, if one had\nhorrible taste in jewelry.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Raw Boar Meat", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 6xdestroyer.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Woolen Cloak", "An exceptionally thick hooded leather cloak,\ndyed a deep hue, tailored to a fit a woman.\nIt is made of multiple overlapping layers of\nwarm leather with stitching running patterns\nspanning multiple layers, giving it a\nmystifying appearance in the wind. It has one\nline of small, wooden buttons running up it,\nand a single, deep pocket located directly\nover the heart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("dirt with aids", "", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Highland Wool", "A thick rugged coat of raw wool. Recently\nshorn from a Highland sheep. The coat is\nthick and dense as a result of the long\nwinters endured by the breed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Loki's Casino VIP Pass", "A small card with the 'LC' logo on the top\nright corner, \"The bearer of this card is a\nVIP of Loki's casino\" (Msg Dragonayr for door\nperms)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dragonayr.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Silver Brooch of White Peak =~", "A small silver pin in the shape of a Rams\nhead of White Peak would sit comfortably in\nyour hand, being made out of solid gold from\nthe mountains of the great volcano in\nSouthern Atlas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mast. Blacksmith] Bjorn Adigard.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bogbeast Tongue", "Well that's just nasty.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("BAN", "This is a reciept for one ban. Consider\nyourself gonzo. 'Nothin' personal kid.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's White Blossom c.1660", "The sweet white wine has pairings of honey\nwhich flow through its entire pallette. The\naftertaste of the wine hits hard after\nconsumption, the tannin quite strong and felt\nas the warmth of the liquid flows through\nyou. The heavy tannin is followed by the\nhard-hitting full body of the wine, giving it\na composed but the ability to create a messy\nsituation to the light-tolerant.The bottles\nare plastered with a makeshift label which\nsates the year and the sigil of purple\ngrapes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Beer Barrel", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Samosa Scones", "These scones are golden crusted and moist on\nthe inside. They are dipped in choclate with\na caramel and chocolate drizzle on top.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Kary's Famous Beef Soup", "A hearty bowl of beef soup rests here,\nsmelling just as delicious as you'd imagine.\nThe broth was simmered with the bones,\nleading it to be even heartier than before!\nAlongside huge chunks of tasty and juicy\nbeef, a tantilizing selection of soft\npotatoes, wholesome carrots, and small chunks\nof celery. Seasoned with garlic, parsley, and\nyellow onion, this soup will keep you warm\nduring the coldest of blizzards!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Gingerbread Cookie", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Peanut budder...", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Contract", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Message thebulter '303262' when you have opened the chest", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Copper Cup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Horen Dragon", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bird Mask", "An expertly crafted mask, it looks remark\nremarkably in the visage of a bird.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hapi the Masksalesman.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Belvitz Original Cabernet Sauvignon", "A corked wine bottle, wrapped in a lettered\npaper with the name 'Belvitz Original' with a\nrather fancy design of the city in the\ndistance. It has a rather dry taste, and you\ncan taste the aged oak wood barrel. c. 1663.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Charles’ Whiskey", "A rye whiskey brewed originally in the\nCharles' Cantina of Carolustadt. Made in\nhonor of Charles Elliot Horen, the former\nArchchancellor of the Empire. This whiskey\nemits a smell of warmed spices, oak and rye\nbread; whilst taste is hot and spicy in the\nbeginning, delivering its potent punch.\nHowever, it becomes more mellow towards the\nend with a more herbal and savory taste for\nthe palate. Surely a drink of nobility.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Lockpick", "A small lockpick that appears to be very\nfragile and corroded. You'd be lucky to get\neven a single use out of this.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Longsword", "A well crafted blade from the forges of White\nPeak, made by none other than Eimar var\nBurgundar himself. Gifted to his son upon him\nreaching manhood. The length of the blade\nwould be bare, the handle wrapped in sweat\nstained leather, a simple crossguard and\npommel on the weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearty Beef Stew", "", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Teapot", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Hoof", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Void Bat Wing", "Has a strange texture to it, almost that of a\nwool textile. Could be used in crafting.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Gyazo'Lur's Armpit Hair", "", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Definitely A Flower", "", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Food Plate", "A simple disc shaped dining plate made of\nbronze. The bronze, whilst unadorned with any\ncarvings or designs, is well shined, and is\nrather lustrous under light. The rim of the\nplate is ever so slightly raised, ensuring\nany food set onto it shall not fall off of\nthe plate.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:heavy_weighted_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Cookies", "The cookies are quite far from perfect with a\nbland taste, but it was clearly made by\nsomeone who tried their hardest.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cauterizing Cream", "An ancient alchemic salve that would be used\nby Flame Priest's to heal the wounded. By\nsmearing a thin coat of this cream, a flesh\nwound would begin to sizzle and burn, as if\nbeing exposed to an open flame. Slowly, the\nflesh would begin to seal itself, as if being\ncauterized. The victim would feel as if there\nwound was exposed directly to a flame,\nleaving the flesh to be reddened and sore for\nseveral days after. Yet, with time, it would\nheal and be flesh anew. One time use.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:magma_cream", ""),
        StaticItem("Vote Frederick Baden", "", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Peter's Lute", "Carved from oak and smoothed with a shiny\nsealant, this wooden lute appears to be in\nperfect condition. The songs strummed from\nit's delicate chords sound akin to an\nenchanting wind chime. Should one look unto\nthe backside of the instrument, the initials\nP.B.\" would be inscribed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Scriptures", "A collection of holy scriptures from the\nCanonist Church, complied by High Pontiff\nJude I", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("ᛥᚭᛪᚮᛥᴮʳᵒᶰᶻᵉ ᶜʳᵃᵇ ᴾᵒᵗ ᛥᚭᛪᚮᛥ", "A odd, round lattice like basket made of\nbronze, used for the purpose of catching\ncrabs. The pot is one yard in diameter, and\none and a half feet tall, and is surprisingly\nlight. The top of the crab pot has a large,\nintentionally made hole as for the crabs to\nenter into. The bronze is not shined very\nmuch, making it somewhat dull under light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bouncy Ball!", "Boing!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Yeu Rthulu Charm", "A small wooden talisman, made in the design\nof the circular rune called 'The Eye of Yeu\nRthulu'. It bears no special properties aside\nfrom sentimentality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Bundle of Deerskin", "A bundle of leather skinned from a buck that\nhas been treated with grain oil and dried.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Four-Leaf Clover", "A pristine four-leaf clover, bearing an\nadditional leaf when compared to it's\ntraditional counter part, which holds only\nthree leaves. Giving off a polished, natural\natmosphere, this variety of clover is rather\nrare.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("1 ⚖ - Silver Coin", "A coin of fine make native to Ponce- known as\nthe \"pound.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FalkGhoulmeister.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Faroean Stag", "A necklace with a silver chain, pendant being\na finely shaped aurum stag. It shimmers in\nthe sunlight, the nobility of the creature\ntruly showing when held up to the sun's\nglare. It shows a deep friendship from those\nfrom the House Faroe, gifted upon only the\nclosest of allies.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Beer 'o Borgin", "Brown colour; toasty, nutty aromas; full,\nrich palate. Brewed by Aemich Grandaxe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Confetti Wand", "A simple, thinly carved, wooden wand,\ncomplete with a purple gem encrusted at the\nbutt end of the stick. Should one wave it\nwhilst shouting \"Dolus,\" a small array of\nmulti-colored confetti would emerge from the\nwand.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by papa_liam.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Papa Dust", "Dear Liam, thank you for saving my shit that\none time in hanese. Sincearly -Zach.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Lairinc Tea", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Taemoric Rose Bush", "Picked and planted in a pot, the Taemorins\ngive off a sweet yet enticing aroma.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EirikColborn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Officer Sword", "Has a thick tip.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Near Perfect Sandwich", "These sandwiches are near perfect creations\nfrom the Bread Saint, to hold one is an\nhonor. It is comprised of bread, with butter,\nand two more slices, making it a toasted\ntreat! They are cut with near perfection,\nwith a Lorraine Cross on the top\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FideiDefensor.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonian Chardonnay", "Voluptuous white wine hand pressed from the\ngrapes of Curon. A finer pallete would reveal\na hint of rich citrus.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Pomegranite Juice", "A bottle of a deep maroon pomegranite juice,\nwith a bittersweet taste. The blurry glass\nbottle seems to bear a lable with the words\nＰＯＭＥＧＲＡＮＩＴＥ ＪＵＩＣＥ' written on it in bold\nletters. The contained juice is bittersweet,\nthough is notably very healthy, and those\nwhom drink it regularly in place of other\ndrinks would feel significantly healthier.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toalak Extract", "A fine powder extracted from the mucous film\ncovering a toalak. Upon ingestion, one would\ndiscover its hallucinogenic properties.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Gilded Talon", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupt Mana Crystal", "A crystalized form of the magical essence\nthat runs through Atlas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Blemfort Mushroom", "This is a blemfort mushroom. It smells of\nspice, and tastes earthy and hot. It is\nusually fried or baked as a side, or an\nextract produced from it to add to meats or\nstews.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Flame Oil", "A cloudy red potion rests here, smelling\nheavily of sulphur and acrid stenches. If\napplied to flesh or a weapon, one would find\nthat wounds inflicted would bubble up with\npus and a terrible burning agony akin to\nburning. Strangely enough, the oil is\nactually flame retardant, and induces a\nslight resistance effect to heat if applied\nto armour. Items exposed to Flame Oil will\nslightly corrode over time however, so\ncaution must be given.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("High Flexio Tome", "A heavy, ancient tome written in an extremely\nold dialect of High Flexio. It's utterly\nunreadable; no one left alive could know this\nlanguage.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Library Key", "An eccentric stone tipped with three small\nprongs that resemble petals. It looks like it\nslots into some kind of door.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Jack's Personal Guard Harness.", "A complex device that will allow a person to\ncarry another person on their back, while\nstill being able to use both of their hands.\nIt seems to be made of the highest quality\nrope, and the \"Seat\" of the harness is padded\nwith thick leather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MintyKnight.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Comb", "While a normal looking comb made from\nhigh-guage steel, the handle can be twisted\nclockwise, and removed to reveal a steel\nspike that can be used for stabbing, or even\nperhaps piercing armor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MintyKnight.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("High-Backed Saddle", "A saddle made of finely crafted dark\nleather, flora designs are threaded into the\nleather, as golden tacks and buttons finish\nit off. The seat of the saddle has been\ncarved from oak, and padded with more\nleather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MintyKnight.", "minecraft:saddle", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Ancient Pearl", "This ancient pearl seems to be as big as a\nfresh coconut, being polished to the maximum.\nEach time the sun or strong light hits the\npearl the surface will reflect it, being\nsimilar to a small mirror.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Halberd", "A bronze halbered, tempered by the frost of\nthe Yatl Waste and the vigour of the warriors\nof the Vaeyl Order. Although fashioned from\nbronze and lacking a sharp edge, this polearm\nis heavy enough to buckle plate and break\nbones. The axe-head is decorated with\ninscriptions of men bearing spears running\nbeneath a dragon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Short-Faced Bear Fur Pelt", "The furry pelt of a Short-faced Bear. The\npelt is a metre long both in width and\nlength. A dark brown fur entwined with some\nlight hair, covers the pelt, warm enough to\nprovide protection in the coldness.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ragged Claw", "A ragged claw, belonging to a great white\nbear that haunts the night. A spatter of\ndried blood runs along its length, a silent\nreminder of the battle that tore it from its\nplace.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ForeverGinger.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Doll House", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Assistant Mayor's Badge", "", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiva Petal Wreath", "A seemingly random arrangement of flowers\ntied into a wreath. In the ancient wood elven\nlanguage of Tiva, it spells out 'Strong'.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Ticket", "With this simple piece of parchment, you can\ncollect and gather up to partake in a\nsplendid event within the Adelburg Festival!\nSee how much you can get, and gather in\nexchange for a splendid prize.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ♕ The Imperial Administration ♕.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ham", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Engraved Plate", "A finely made porcelain plate with artwork\netched into the surface. It depicts a\nfestival scene in Markev surrounded by a rose\nborder along the edge of the plate.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("War Knife", "A single edged long knife with swordbreaker\nindents on the backside. Forged in darkened\narmor in the forge of Vilacz.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornkin Salve", "A sickly-smelling potions rests here, green\nand frothy. If applied to skin, it would\nprove true to it's name, and would cause\nthorns to sprout up unevenly over the flesh\nthat it was applied to. Sharp and potent\nenough to tear clothes and cured leather,\nthere are a few drawbacks. Once the duration\nends, the thorns fall off and leave shallow\nwounds in the skin. Lots of holes. Along with\nthat, it does not harden your skin, and\ntherefore could cause damage if applied to\njoints. Careful, now!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwinic Steel Dagger", "A well made dagger forged from dwarven steel,\nin the halls of Kal'Tarak. The Dagger would\nbe small and easily concealable, perfect for\nquick jabs or shankings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray Dress", "A simple dress, dyed gray. It is tailored for\na good fit for pregnant women. On the inside,\nit has several thin silk-wrapped wool pads,\ndesigned for comfort and heat retention. Just\nin front of each shoulder rests a small\nsilver brooch, So that anything from a hood\nto a shoulder scabbard can be attached, if\nnecessary.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MinusOneMorale.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Finger Sandwiches", "Tea sandwiches small enough to finish in two\nor three bites. Each miniature sandwich has\nits crust cut off and has been prepared\ndelicately over wheat bread with cucumbers\nand cream cheese.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Pigman Dagger", "A small battered dagger made out of rough\ngold, the handle seems to be just a leather\nstrap wrapped around the low quality gold.\nThe dagger appears to be a nice trinket but\nlooks like it'd be fairly useless in combat!", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Jewlery Box", "A finely craft small box. Solid gold line the\nedges of the box. In the center would sit a\nlarge crimson ruby that sparkles when held in\nthe light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TarreBear.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sage", "", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar's Skin", "A sizeable portion of the skin of a Hansetian\nBoar, with the requisite leathery feel and\nhairs spread across. The skin would feel\nslightly thicker and sturdier than your\naverage bull's leather. The hide of the boar\nwould seem perfect for items such as your\naverage leather clothing, armor, or a cloak.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire of Varendoz", "One of the seven Varendozi sapphires,\ncaptured during the fall of the Varendoz\nDominion centuries ago. It is one of the holy\nrelics of their ancient god of war, Enlil the\nAspect of the Sun, slain by the human\ndemihero Morekan during the Fall of Varendoz.\nElven script covers all sides of the\nsquare-shaped gems, with the top carved with\nthe Seal of the Great Mala.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolfskin", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Pig Plushie", "A pink little stuffed plush of a pig,\nmuch smaller and cleaner than the\nreal kind. Oinkoink!", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Panda Plushie", "A Cute Panda, pffftt Whatever those are...", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Romantic Red Roses", "These roses are so beautiful that you would\nmost definitely swoon over whomever had given\nthem to you!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("High Heels", "These pair of Heels are of a well made\nquality!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sandey0000.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("✜ Union du Dragon et Corneille ✜", "This single bottle is made exclusive for the\nImperial Wedding of 1688. Made with pure\nChardonnay, this alluring pale-gold champagne\nsparkles gently under light. Subtle brioche\naccents paired with an elegant aroma creates\na path for the crisp and tight texture.\nThough the palate is rather dry, its\ncomplexity lingers, delivering a long, silky\nfinish. The translucent bottle is artisanally\ndecorated to fully bring forth the beauty of\nthe drink. The image of a dragon sits on one\nside of the bottle, while a crow on the\nopposite.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Revelry Vineyard.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Macarons", "A conglomerate of Auvergian confections in an\nassortment of colors and flavors such as\nalmond, vanilla and chocolate. The macarons\nhave been chilled prior to serving, making\neach bite into one refreshing.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Barbed Spear", "A 5'6\" pole of treated wood, firmly wrapped\nwith black leather and tipped with barbed\nsteel. The end is impressively forged, though\nnot terribly so. It weighs in at\napproximately 3 lbs and is well-balanced.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gaius Mournstone.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Whale", "A seven inch long whale, carved out of oak.\nThis wooden whale is painted aqua blue. Due\nto its age, the paint seems chipped, and the\nwooden body damaged. Under the belly of the\nwhale a small date, 1511.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonian Wine", "A fruity red wine.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The White Rose Cognac", "Named after the amber colored hair of latter\nday Chivays, this brandy is twice distilled\nin copper stills and aged for two years in\nAgathor Oak barrels. It's a very potent\nspirit (not to be confused with chivay brew)\nand not for inexperienced drinkers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Diamond necklace ~", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Unlit Torch", "A torch, recently with the handle soaked in\nwater to prevent burning. The top is in a\nslight bowl shape, filled with tiny flammable\nscraps, kindling, and twigs. Sadly, you'll\nhave to figure out your own way to light it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aron Hawksong.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Decorative Canonist Cross", "A large wooden crucifix, a symbol of the\nhuman Canonist religion. This large piece is\n3 feet long, and one foot wide, with darkened\nengraving an inch in, all the way around to\ngive this simple ornament an elegant touch.\nThis piece would make an ideal home\ndecoration... Or a pendant for a particularly\nsizeable canonist", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Freshly Baked Bread", "Freshly baked bread, baked with seeds and\nnuts on its outer crust, It'll be soft in the\nmiddle and be hard at the crust, making it a\ngood filling meal for two or three people\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Madilane.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Moss clumps", "", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspect's Token", "This is an exceptionally crafted fired-clay\ntoken. On the item is an image of Cerridwen,\nas an immaculate doe. Cerridwen is sleeping.\nWhen pressed into the forehead of a spriggan\nor ent, this item evaporates into a puff of\nsmoke. For the next saint's day, the spriggan\nor ent cannot attack the person who pressed\nthe token into their head, unless they are\nbodily harmed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Reed Pipe", "A small wind instrument made out of river\nreeds gather from Markev, the delicate pipe\nis tied together with brown ribbon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jacobcraft04.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("YOU'RE UGLY", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Pool Noodle Sword", "A medium sized pool noodle bastard sword.\nWhen you hit someone with it, the sword would\nsimply bounce off them. Great for play\nfightin! On the hilt of the sword would be\nthe words 'Veris Summer Festival, 1618\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Day Gifts", "What could be inside?", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore's Tooth", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lindor's Truffles", "A bag contains various small chocolate\nspheres with a slightly hard shell and softer\ninside. There are three distinct types;\nHazelnut (Hazelnut liqueur combined with a\ncreamy white center), Black Forest (A\nsemisweet chocolate mountain laden with veins\nof black cherry and capped with a cherry on\nits summit), and Imperial Dragon (Crystalized\nginger combined with liqueur in white\nchocolate). A sweet treat for all ages!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eagles2910.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Meadowsweet Beer", "A cylinder shaped corked glass bottle\ncontaining a tan, opaque liquid. The\ncontained liquid bears a sweet, flowery,\nfaintly breadish taste. The contained liquid\nis lightly alchoholic. The contained drink\nseems to ever so slightly act as a anodyne\nfor significant joint pains and headaches.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Mimic Goop", "A jar filled with a small amount of a thick,\npurple liquid. This came from the remains of\na Mimic! Could be experimented with\nalchemically.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by marimbamonk.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Mead", "", "minecraft:log2", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackberry Mead", "A stout clay jar with a wide circular cork,\ncontaining a blackish-blue alchoholic liquid.\nThe contained liquid tastes of blackberries\nand honey, and is notably very sweet. The\ncontained beverage bears a significant\nalchohol content, given it a notable bite.\nThe contained liquid is somewhat thin, and\nbears a ever so slightly sour after-taste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Crozier of Aesculus", "The Crozier has the owl of House Bracchus\nadorned on it, it is carried by reigning\nPrince-Bishop of Aesculus", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Golhils Fist (Heavy Mace)", "A sturdy and well balanced flanged mace made\nentirely out of Jorgundic Blacksteel. Clearly\nintended for one handed use, it holds a good\npunch in it, as it is devoted to Gorundyr\nmythical golem beast. With runes around\nbottom of its handle and norse serpent\nwrapping itself around the shaft all the way\nto its head, it holds more brutal feeling\nthan any other. Weapon designed clearly to\nbreak armors and shatter its joints. At one\nof the wings of it, there is Wulffs Den rune.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark-Spice Coffee", "A spiced coffee, well-brewed. It tastes like\nKrugsmas in a bottle, perfect for the\nwintertime.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Imperial Coins", "Stamped with the face of Godfrey I\n*Moderator Approved*\nAetosion approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ramming shot", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Magma Giant's Finger", "This was wrestled from the dead corpse of a\nMagma Giant, retrieved in the Firelands\nduring the Into the Firelands event.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Silk Handkerchief", "A soft handkerchief with lace edges, its\ncenter embroidered with cute teacups, spoons\nand saucers. This particular token smells\nreminiscently of Rose Tea.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobbes & Schmick Boutique.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Happy Helper Sound Track Vol. 1", "A selection from the holiday helper's top 5.", "minecraft:record_far", ""),
        StaticItem("Loira", "A brown teddy bear that reminds you more of a\ndog rather than a bear. Though it is soft to\nhold and perfect for a young child\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MissToni.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Cool Shit", "Only the sickest of cuntz can equip this\nmighty shit.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Smith Hammer", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Special Exemption Slip", "This person is exempted of taxation until the\nSecond Sunday of the Month of September.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("White Flower Crown", "The crown of flowers has been finely attached\ntogether by grass and smaller flowers of blue\nand yellow colours. Though in the middle you\nwill notice a big white flower adorning the\ncrown. A fine and well detailed flower crown.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bundle of Plushies", "Within the leather sack, there would be a\nbundle of plushies, from chickens, to cows,\nand recreations of Barbanov, to Horen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tsuyose.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Crutches", "Crutches made out of wood with wool on the\ntop where the arms would go to create a more\ncomfortable feeling of using them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MissToni.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Flower Crown", "The crown of flowers has been finely attached\ntogether by grass and smaller flowers of blue\nand yellow colours. Though in the middle you\nwill notice a big pink flower adorning the\ncrown. A fine and well detailed flower crown.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MissToni.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Simple Necklace", "A 24 K Gold necklace chain that has a wedding\nband attached to it. The band has a large\nSapphire in the center. Within the band is an\ninscription: YCS & JES", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugkorp Wooden Dildo", "A handcrafted wooden dildo measuring ten\ninches. It has \"Krugkorp\" engraved into the\nside.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Mini Pool-Noodle", "Arcane I\nA small blue pool noodle, perfect for the\nlittle ones to use. Oddly enough when the\nnoodle was placed into water it would change\nthe color, turning it a bright aqua color.\nThe words 'Veris Summer Festival, 1618' would\nbe engraved into the noodle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Tusk Necklace", "A piece of Tusk seemed to be be hanging on a\nlace, The Tusk was cut and refined around the\nedges yet in a form of a smaller tusk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sandey0000.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Sleeping", "Used by people of all kinds, this potion's\nobjective is placing someone to sleep. It\nwill act fast and will knock someone out.\nMaking the consumer feeling fully refreshed\nonce waking up.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dwarven Axe", "This dwarven axe is old in design and doesnt\nresemble anything of what the dwarves use\ntoday its unique in its look and use. The\nsymbol of the of the starbreakers can be seen\non these ancient axes possibly made of old\nmetal.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearthfire (Bastardsword)", "A truly awe-inspiring weapon that brings to\nmind a slew of regality, hope, and power. The\nblade itself was made of jorgundic black\nsteel to keep it capable of any battle\nwithout losing durability, capable of even\ntaking a zweihander to it and keep going\ndespite of it. The sword was made for the\nHaensetic Royal Family, the crest of the\nkingdom set in the middle of the blade near\nthe hilt. On the handguard are the words\nWhere is life, there is hope.\" the Wulf's\nDen Rune beneath it.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Malasada", "A Santegian dessert. Egg sized balls of deep\nfried yeast dough covered in congulated sugar\nand filled with either melted chocolate or\ncustard. After eating one, you feel like you\ncan't help but have another!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Krunch", "This delicious, dough pastry is drizzled with\nchocolate. Inside are crunchy nuts and\npeppermint chunks, complete with a toffee\nglaze on the underside.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanksgiving Turkey", "A grand feast awaits you with this delicious\nturkey on show, it'll showcase a true thanks\ngiving worth to remember. 𝓣𝓱𝓲𝓼 𝓲𝓼\n𝓹𝓻𝓮𝓽𝓽𝔂 𝓣𝓱𝓲𝓼 𝓲𝓼 𝓹𝓻𝓮𝓽𝓽𝔂 -\nCreated by The Evocress Produce Company", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Yak", "", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Cornbeard", "This bread is fresh and delicious", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("White Fur Blanket", "A large blanket, with a white soft pelt\nbelonging to a large Polar bear from the\nlands of Rivia. With silk sewn under the\npelt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Hansae' Masala Tea", "A cup of Butterboots classic blend of masala\ntea, made from a blend of foreign herbs and\nspices. Sweet to taste with spicy tones, the\nhot, milky drink is perfect beating back the\ncold! Tasties than Crann's muck-honey and\nmore wholesome than a hug from your mother!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tidwald Butterboots.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Duped Mina", "Worth a lot!\n★Developer Approved★\nSigned by Llir.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("H.R.A Certified Freedom Slingshot", "A sturdy and reliable slingshot rests before\nyou! Made from a combination of metal and\nwood it certainly has a premium quality a\nsmall gem could be seen embeded at the\nhandles base. When one draws the sling back,\nafter some time a small stone would appear in\nthe flinging portion so the user need never\ncarry their own stones! (2 emote build up,\none pull back, another for the stone to form.\nContact HurferDurfer for more info.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("White Carpet", "A Small White Cloth Sack Holding Soil\nContaining, Earth Worms, along with a\nAssortment of other Critters. Gathered by\nOsman Kharadeen\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Aldin's Apple Reserve (c. 1672)", "A notably smooth red stored inside a grey\nbottle. This drink is best identified by the\nscent of cinnamon and apple it emanates.\nBeing particularly low in tannin, the\nreddish-brown liquid pairs well with most\nfoods and serves as an easy alternative for\nthose seeking a delicious, spicy tang with\ntheir meal. Even the typical drinker will be\ncaught off guard by the impact of cinnamon\nand ginger, but the savory apple background\nmakes up for the initial surprise. “Aldin’s\nApple Reserve,” is labeled on the side of the\nbottle in bold script and the cork is branded\nwith a bottle wreathed in vines.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Desert in a Bottle", "This is a desert scorpion shell vial,\ncontaining desert in a bottle. It is ciscous.\nA sandy powder rests at the bottom of the\nvial. It smells of sand, and tastes of\nalcohol and stone. Whoever drinks this potion\nwill be dessicated for an equal volume of\nwater.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Karovic Iron Ring", "A band of refined iron, engraved around the\nentire outer face with the signature crows of\nthe Karovic bloodline. A product of the\nLudovar Luxuries Company.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Daelish Hound", "A large dog weighing in at about 70-110 lbs,\na mutt crossed between impressive highlander\nbreeds. It could easily chase down a hunter's\nquarry. [ This item is a mechanical\nrepresentation for the dog in question; If it\nis killed IRP, this should be discarded. ]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Drinking Flask", "A drinking flask made out of steel and coated\nlightly in gold. Light will reflect off of\nthe silver etching on the side, bearing the\nNordengrad crest. It has a small diamond in\nthe heart of the Ash Tree. It weighs a decent\namount, but is still able to be used as a\nregular drinking flask.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dog", "A larger dog weighing in around 110 pounds.\nIf killed in roleplay, the item is to be\ndestroyed and if PvP is done the skull is to\nreturn to jollyb123 as the dog would've ran\noff. [Message ZachsSlayer for any help].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Viking Sword", "A long slender sword. The metal would hold a\nblue tint to it and waves could be seen in\nthe metal from the countless times it has\nbeen folded. Both sides of the blade would be\nedged and the crossguard would be rather\nsimply, made to stop blows and nothing more.\nThe handguard would be wrapped in brown\nleather, stained with sweat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Agnar Reyurnt.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Box of Nordengrad Cigars", "Made from tobacco imported from outside the\nwalls but that are finished with flavors\nunique to Nordengrad, these cigars make for a\nrelaxing after-meal treat. One box has six\ncigars.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Fan", "A hand held fan, used to keep cool in the\nheat. A gift from Jerry Cali.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Apple Scones", "Sweet and flaky scones, a good treat to go\nwith some wine!", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Venison", "Tasty cooked venison lightly salted and\nsprinkled with fine seasonings. The meat is\ntender and delicious.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Sty'gvashs necklace", "A rather crude and weird piece of jewlery.\nClearly more tribal, and seemingly ancient.\nThere is an image engraved in emerald that is\nits center, showing what seems to be a drakes\nhead.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("<[-ADVERTISEMENT FLYER-]>", "The Theodosian Municipal Library of Haense,\nlocated within Markev, is currently open and\naccepting book donations. The sister library\nto the Remembrance Guild is also offering\nbook trades and have vacancies for\nlibrarians. Please feel free to make contact\nwith either Elizaveta vas Ruthern\n(Torkoal_Tom) or Swithun (NovumChase).", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Fierce Whirlwind", "A double edged war axe that was rumored to\nhave been wielded by an abnormally large\nOlog. It got the name because of the Olog's\nability to spin the axe so fast it could\ndeflect and chop arrows before they could hit\ntheir mark.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by neopsychedelia.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mournstone Hot Chocolate", "A delicious cup of hot chocolate. It has a\ndelicious undertone of mint and is topped\nwith a dollop of what appears to be cream\nthat's been whipped into a semi-solid form.\nDrinking it would make one incredibly happy\nsimply for how grand it tasted!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("The Judgement of Axis", "A five foot steel polearm with a darkened\nobsidian-iron alloyed pommel shaped like\nbull's horns on one end, and a foot and a\nhalf long curved blade made of a slayer-steel\nalloy on the other.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blago loves u", "if u have this sword, me, I, Blago, loves u.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kaputski_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Taurus - The Firm Protector.", "A rather worn and used broad sword, marked in\ndried blood however still well kept. It would\nbe made from a strong slayer steel, the\npommel of the blade smithed into the head of\na Bull. Standing proud and firm, the blade\nwas once wielded by Toren. The Bull Druid.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Detailed Engraving Voucher", "A voucher that allows for one item of\nyour choice to be engraved with finer\ndetail than a simple engraving.\n((Do not sell in auction houses))\n*Moderator Approved*\nLolitaDoll approved this item.", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Helena's Long Dagger", "Narrow steel dagger, very sharp. Perfect to\ncut soft materials or to stab someone. With a\nbeutiful patter on the middle of the blade\nand a small emerald decorating the handle.\nMade by the Black Company's smiths, for Lady\nHelena Ruthern.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MeLlamoPeter.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bull Mask", "A rather well crafted bull mask, the hide of\nthe bull would be made from fine tanned\nleather whilst the horns of the headwear\nwould be crafted from polished quartze. The\nback of the mask has two pieces of twine\nstitched upon the oaken frame to keep it\nsecured against ones face. Quite a fine piece\nto wear to masqurades and festivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Silver Dubloon", "This coin appears to be made out of silver\nand is having some deep scratches all over\nit. Legends say that it is part of a sunken\ntreasure.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lunarium Fiddle", "Before you is a beautiful instrument crafted\nof a golden and silver alloy, its luscious\nsurface glimmering beneath the light of the\nmoon. Six white strings crafted from the tail\nof a Pegasus glow with a faint ethereal hue.\nWhen played this fiddle produces sound\nexceptionally unpleasant to all soul-altered\nbeings; save ghostkind, who find the music\nexquisitely alluring. Non-sentient\nsoul-altered beings seem more intensely\naffected by the music.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Witching Arrow", "An arrow fletched with the dark feathers of a\ncrow, tipped with a vorpal head of knapped\nobsidian. The edge is sharper than any steel,\nbut becomes useless once fired due to the low\ndurability-- better not miss. Its\neffectiveness against flesh and lesser armour\nwould be nearly unmatched, but is fairly\nincapable of piercing thick or metallic\narmour. Additionally, each of the heads would\nhave been painstakingly blessed by Karyssmov\nFaroe, a Clerical Blessing [T5] upon them.\nCreated 1/27/18.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Plain M & Ms", "Some delicious, nut-free M & Ms.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Honey!", "Another jar of honey. This one is spicy. Oo!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Feywild.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Chicken Crate", "Purchased from the Cloud Temple Livery Stall\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Sheep Crate", "Purchased from the Cloud Temple Livery Stall\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Cow Crate", "Purchased from the Cloud Temple Livery Stall\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Hot Chocolate", "A warm mug filled to the brim with a steaming\ndark chocolate liquid, smelling of fresh\ncocoa beans. It would have a few small round\nmarshmallows in it, looking like a smiley\nface.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by houseofbigstars.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("///Blood///", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hero's Breath Potion", "This is a gazelle horn goblet, decorated with\ngiant fly wings, containing hero's breath\npotion. It smells of cherry, lilac, and\nsweat, and tastes of alcohol and fruit.\nWhoever drinks this potion will become\ncourageous, for twenty-four hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Present", "A cuboid-shaped present, wrapped in bright\nred paper and topped with a cloth ribbon of\nmetallic gold. Were one to shake it, the box\nthe contents would give a dull rattle within.\nA tag reads, \"Elenora, Merry Krugsmas. With\nlove from Haelun.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Kitty Plushie", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:player_head", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_11(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Posidon is mad", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Amberriddle", "A plant with jagged, soft leaves and pale\nblue flowers. if the sap is collected and\nstored within a airtight container, it can be\nused as a powerful glue for sealing wounds\nand preventing blood flow, though it does\nburn slightly once applied. If the sap is\nburnt, it releases a rather pleasant, spicy\nsmell! This type of flora can often be found\nbetween the branches of large trees.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ['Disguised'] Ascanius.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Hireling", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dwarven Diamond", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Monk", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Candy", "", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Cake", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Doryn's Flower", "A pretty pink tulip plucked right at the very\nbottom of the step, its aroma giving off a\nnature vibe.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Helm", "This is a set of superiorly-crafted bone\nboots. It is encrusted with sea-salt and\npowdered silicate, and studded with pearls\nand lobster shell. The object is decorated\nwith giant squid beak, giant crayfish shell,\nand raenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Oak Brandy", "A standard edition of brandy, carefully hand\ncrafted and aged within oak. Offering a\nsmooth and velvety taste, hinting the\ntastebuds with almond and walnut before\nleaving a combination of fruits and ginger\nupon the tongue. Its bottle is marked with\nthe House Arden crest. Upon taking your first\nfew sips the substance would leave you with\nan addiction to the drink.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gamecube", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Ribs", "The several foot long ribs from a wyvern.\nMaybe they'd make a good stave, who knows?", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Big ole' torch thing", "", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Layman's Beer", "A blurry glass bottle containing a rather\nunremarkable, yet pleasant lightly alchoholic\nbeer. The beer itself is a tannish yellow,\nand when poured has a tendency to froth. The\nbeer has a semi-sweet, mildly appley taste\nthat goes down easilly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Really Good Rope", "Sturdy as fuck, its basically made of steel", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Chest", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Friendship cookie", "A special cookie from Melkor__ as a token of\nfriendship\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melkor__.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Mug of Coffee", "A wihte, porcelain mug that has the words,\nThe Cozy Cafe', written upon it. Filling it,\nwith steam wafting out the top, is piping hot\ncoffee. Black, though creamers may be\npresent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Terrence.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Nugget", "A Rustic Dubloon, Made of Aurum, Supposed to\nbe used for Children to play with, Worth\nabout 10 mina to People who need Aurum.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Orchid Plant", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon-Designed Jian", "A double edged sword with various engravings\nof Dragons etched into the hilt. This exotic\nweapon has some foreign distorian words\ninscribed onto it.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon's Breath", "A swirling molten hued concoction. When\ningested, the user will feel a slight heat in\ntheir throat, denoted by smoke from the\nnostril or maw. should they take a deep\nbreath in, they will be able to exhale 3\nmeter torrent of flame. The fire can deal\nburns on opponents, likely charring and or\ndealing second degree if they at the edge of\nthe torrent, though close proximity is far\nmore devastating. Be wary, for consecutive\nuse without break, roughly 2-3 actions, will\ncause internal burning. This breath has 3\nuses, taking 2 actions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Power Word Tentacles", "A simplistically designed dark ferrum bastard\nsword, it's metal leaks with a vile blackened\nmiasma. Should this vile miasma make contact\nwith the living it will begin to spread a\ndeadly toxin through their mortal bodies.\nThis toxin will seek out and destroy the\nnervous system, especially in the spine in\norder to effectively place one in a state of\nunmoving parlaysis. These effects last half\nan elven day unless healed by a holy artist.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ventai.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Naromis Mocha", "A cup full of homemade Naromis Mocha, which\nis hot chocolate and coffee perfectly blended\ntogether to create the most delicious\ncaffinated drink. It smells divine to the\nnose, and utmost delicious to the tounge -\nthe perfect mix of bitter and sweet. It's a\nrecipe which only originates from it's maker,\nElvira Naromis, and cannot be easily\nreplicated.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Necklace", "A small charm with three symbols carved into\nit, an anvil, an open book and a helmet. The\ntrinket would rest at the end of a small\ngolden chain, just the right size to to fit\naround a chubby neck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Father] Hamnil Frostbeard.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Lockpick", "What a craft invention! These small tools can\nbe used to get through doors a lot easier\nthan bashing them down.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawke Blunt", "A warhawkian rolled blunt. Made with the\nfinest cactus green. No seeds or stems in\nthis one. It's as pure as it could get and\nmore personal than a hookah!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Shatchar", "A finely made gauntlet with a shimmering\ndiamond held within the back portion of it. A\ncircle of gold rests within the palm,\nenchanted to shoot out a bolt of arcane\nenergy after a three-emote build up. Pm\nFury_Fire for details.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Vex's Phylactery", "A crystal in the shape of a statuette,\ndepicting a small woman. Is the phylactery of\nVex (Azdromoth). It seems to course with\nlifeforce, seeming rather fragile to blunt\ndamage.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Ethel's Phylactery", "A glowing green gemstone with an ever\nflickering light radiating from it. The stone\nwould be held in a lantern like container,\nwith an open-mouthed skull like lock. The\nname 'Ethel' would be carved in the metal,\nbarred hatch of the lantern.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Deadbreath", "A simple scroll, with the word\nSerendipitous' written upon it. When that\nword was spoken, the text would begin to glow\nan icy-blue, before a cloud of opaque smog\nten blocks in radius would be produced. The\nsmog would last for roughly an RP hour, and\ncan be seen through by ectoplasm-affiliated\ncreatures. After use, the scroll\ndistintegrates. Three emotes total, PM\nToodles with questions.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Skull of Selrik Wick", "This Skull seems completely ordinary, though\nit once belonged to the famed Selrik Wick,\nlich of legend.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lefkos Amethil", "A twisted, red hued gem overwhelmed by\nblackness in its interior. Heinous ebon\nmiasma swirling about within like a vortex,\nwithin lie the soul of Lefkos Amethil. Should\nthe gem be destroyed the soul would return to\nthe earth, killing the boy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Horns", "This sword shines with a freshly made and\nfreshly sharpened luster, reflecting any\nlight that meets it. The blade appears to be\nof dwarven make, carvings of dwarven battles\nlitter the sword. The hilt, made out of\nsimilar metal, boasts a comfortable leather\ngrip. On the middle of the hilt rests a large\nemerald gem, shimmering with a wonderful and\nslightly magical glow.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Surging Mana Gems", "These gems, created by the ancient Fulmenancy\nSorcerer Abdiel Ipos, are unable to be\napplied for any effect beyond technical\nutilitarian purposes. When inserted into the\nappropriate device, they release controlled\nsurges of electrical energy, able to power\ntypes of machinery. These had been created to\nact as catalysts to the experimental\nThanhicore H.I.V.E Mana generator system.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Pendant", "A silver chain would be going through an\nemerald, making it look like a rather nice\npendant, the emerald would look as if it was\ngiving off a rather small glow. If worn the\nenchanted gem would change the appearance of\nthe wearers facial structure.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Isilioleth.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Drû Thlûn", "This large chest adorned a golden frame with\nstrange writings carved into the shining\nsurface. It's main body comprised of a dark\nwood and leather strips to form bands around\nthe chest, it's hinge was crude yet\nfunctional, and if you looked closely enough\nyou could see tiny; razor sharp; golden sets\nof teeth. They were shaped like a shark's and\nseemed to be made from the same metal as the\nframe, gold with blood-red streaks running\nthrough them.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Fucks", "A bottle of Fucks, alas there are none to be\nfound!\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand of The Ghoul Lord", "A wretched staff, 5'6 feet in length. Atop\nthe device the unliving, yet still twitching\nand festering hand of an unfortunate victim\ntaken by the staffs master. At the opposing\nend of the device, a sharpend aurum end would\nbe placed. Along its length, four symbols\nwould be carved on either side of its\ncylindrical length -- The Black Sun,\nshattered sword, dark flames, and a thorned,\ndecaying bush...\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Peyote Laced Cannolis", "Leave the sword... Take the cannoli.\" - The\nSpookfather\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Daendros' Phylactery", "This large, gem shaped lifeforce gem would\nglow slightly, the lifeforce within swiling\nlike a mad whirlpool, shifting as any life\nnearby it did. This holds the soul of a\nDarkstalker, Daendros. ((Dewlox.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Spider Fangs", "A mouth and fangs obtained from a Large\nSpider that invaded San'Raakh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:quartz_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Head", "This remarkable head seems to be from a\nCockatrice slain in battle. While it may only\nappear to be the head of a chicken at first\nglance, upon further inspection, a few teal\nand turquoise scales were seen at the back of\nthe creature's head. Beautiful feathers lined\nthe sides, and perhaps a pouch of skin still\nremained beneath the beak...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Chinese New Year Dragon Dust", "Dust from the serpent that guarded the year\nof the rooster festival!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AnotherDay.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Longbow", "This is an exceptionally crafted yew wood\nlongbow. It is encrusted with amber, in which\nbloodflies, black beetles, and monarch\nbutterflies are trapped. It is decorated with\nsnail shell and dried corpora fungus, and\nencircled with bands of tortoise leath\nleather. Tortoise bone bucklings are attached\nto its sides. It has a bowstring of wyvern\nleather. It smells faintly of cinnamon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Savage Claw", "This savage looking claw came from one of the\nslain plague beasts in Sutica. It is sure to\ncontain a bit of the curse still upon it,\nenough to plague someone once more...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("A small pile of Gems", "This small, shining palm-sized pile of gems\nconsist of rubies, emeralds, gold, and\ndiamonds! Oddly enough, they smelled like\npork. There was nothing special about them.\nJust smelly gems.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Spine of the Plagued Beast of Sutica", "A long, black and sharp spine. Oddly enough,\nit seemed rather light an even hollow on the\ninside. The base is empty, while the tip\nholds many very tiny holes. Perhaps one could\nfind greater use for this object...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of the Plague Beast of Sutica", "A large, glossy orb about the size of an\norange. It has a small, black pupil at its\ncenter, the surrounding area being a\ntransparent-blue color. This eye stares right\nup at its holder, almost in an eerie way, as\nif it were still alive and ready to attack...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:blue_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Hide", "This set of scaley, reptilian skin would be\nextremely dry and rugged, yet appeared\nbeautiful, should it glimmer against\nsunlight. It'd be a dark beige, seeming to\nmimic the color of sand. Should one test it's\ndurability, they'd find that it's amazingly\nresilliant to natural elements.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Fang of the Plagued Beast of Sutica", "A long, sharp fang, bearing both a sharp edge\nand pointed tip. Some parts of it are cracked\nand stained with blood. Maybe someone can\nfind a greater use for it...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:quartz_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Reinforced Thornbark Compound Bow", "A thornbark bow crafted in the shape and\nstyle of a compound bow; the strong sinew\nconnected by both hooks driven into the\nends of the reinforced limbs. Engraved\ninto the dried hide grip would be a black\nraven emblem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Black Blood", "A vial containing a black liquid. Upon closer\ninspection it'd be noticed that it was blood\nfrom a blighted creature! How strange.....\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll Hide", "Brown hide belonging to a troll. It is\ncallous and flaky, though it is quite\nresilent to slash-based attacks. It resembles\nleather in texture, though has yet to be\ntanned.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Hide of the Plagued Beast of Sutica", "This hide is rather thick and heavy. It\nseemed to be completely black, rough and\nleathery skin, even dark enough to allow one\nto be near impossible to see in the dead of\nnight. However, if worn for too long, one\nwould become dizzy and suffer from mild\nhallucinations...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent's Fang", "The fang of a giant serpent, it's near the\nsize of a short sword, with tip as sharp as\nthe point of a knife. It burns when cutting\nskin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arakrsptec.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolves' Cranium", "The skull of quite the large beast, a matted\nand straggly gray pelt kept around the thing.\nOne versed in creatures and the like could\neasily discern it was near twice the size of\nthe common wolves in Atlas. The upper left of\nit is pierced through.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Deceitful Heart of Darkness", "A twisted heart carved from the chest of the\nferal Quillian Serene, who betrayed her\nbrother in her lust for power and led to his\ndemise. A soft thumping seems to have\nreturned to its lifeless state--now\nblack--from its time fermenting by an Abyss\nSeed located in the depths of Outerhaven.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by vvmrr.", "minecraft:netherrack", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Abyss Seed", "Peering into its very core, one can see a\ndistorted, shadowy reflection that beckons\nits beholder closer—speaking to them with the\noldest voices of the earth. From this\notherworldly presence rose a constant\nsmoke-like smog that threatened to envelope\nall in its ebon cascade. Despite the warmth\nthat permeated the mind of those nearby, it\nwas cold to the touch. Its smooth surface\nrough, and wrinkled, though soft like flesh,\npulsating and throbbing as a heart beating\nwith majesty and power.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ixli.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem(">> Ancient Gem <<", "An ancient and well-polished gem. It sparkles and glitters under all light,\nand rainbow refractions of glimmering beauty are birthed by any light that\npours into it.\nThe value is incalcuable.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Remains from the Mask of Undru", "The Piece of Metal glows in a sick\ngreen light, on touch. The wearer would earn\na Vision of a dark world with Floating\ndoors inside as well as White eyes staring\nat him or her.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("ABCThe Book of SpiritsABC", "This tome is tick and heavy, its cover a\nhard, bone-like material. It is adorned in\ngemstones of a similar nature, the largest of\nwhich sits centrally upon its front cover,\nradiating with a green hue. To hold the tome,\nis to become awash with sensations of\nempowerment and a haunting melancholy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Heart of Darkness", "The heart of Alex Aureon, a cleric slain in\nbattle by a loyal thrall for the Wraithlord\nXaleskar. A soft humming of a heartbeat is\never so faintly present. The flesh itself has\nbecome unnaturally grey, as if it had been\nsmothered in ashes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by vvmrr.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Axe Plushie", "You hold a soft blue plushie in the shape of\nan axe. Great for children!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Jute Battle Net", "A 1 and a half meter wide, and long, square\nnet made of jute, with bronze weights tied\ninto it's corners. The net is made of rope\nmade from jute, knotted into a square. The\nweights on the corners of the net are made\nfrom cast bronze, adding roughly 10 extra\nkilograms of weight onto the net. The weights\nare bronze orbs, with slots for the rope to\nbe tied through. The net is made to be cast\nonto singular opponents as to hinder their\nmovement, whether in escape, or in the midst\nof battle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Winter Wolf Pelt", "The thick furs and leathers of the Winter\nWolves. Great beasts and Hunters of the snows\nwho succumbed to Orcish Hunters.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("G.M Hush Kush", "This is the kind of quality Hush Kush you\nexpect from a G.M stashe. The kind of power\nlike that of a Ban Hammer on steroids.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:bone_meal", ""),
        StaticItem("The Seer's Candle", "A smooth white candle with hints of\nopalescent tints that exudes an aroma like\nthat of an incense.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Kestrel Statuette", "Carved from emerald, this bird figurine has a\nmetal loop drilled into it, allowed it to be\nhung from a cord of leather or rope. While\ntiny, the detail is quite fine, the feathers\nmust have taken hours to carve. Sorey says\nit's a good luck charm.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Snail", "Legends tell of an age when giant armored\nbeasts would terrorize kingdoms and do battle\nwith the most fearsome of knights. These\ndays, they only terrorize gardens.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Moonbucks Candle", "A round pink candle that exudes the sweet and\nsimple aroma of pastries and delights baked\nin Moonbucks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower Crown", "A flower crown weaved together using the\nseeds and flowers, then grown into a full\ncrown by a master Druid! The flowers were\nmore vibrant than any seen in the wilds, and\nthey seemingly never wilted.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Muildir.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Rhum Tournant", "A standard edition of rum, bottled straight\nfrom a maturing oak barrel and distilled with\nnaturally grown sugarcane. Its taste would be\nslightly sharp but in turn allowing the\nnatural flavourings of the sugarcane to\nlinger upon the tongue, giving a sweet\naftertaste. Its bottle is marked with the\nl’Vienne crest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Turkey Plushie", "A medium-sized toy crafted with excellent\ncare and attention to detail. It had the\nscent of autumn across its soft surface. The\nperfect toy for any child. Or any adult too\nfor that matter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Genital Warts", "Uh oh!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by A Certified Doctor.", "minecraft:chorus_fruit_popped", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Water]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, clean water comes out of it. It appears\nit doesn’t have an end, where does it come\nfrom?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:water_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Ithrun", "The small runestone is flat on both sides and\nbears two different carvings on either side.\nAt the will of the holder, the rune glows\nbrightly and releases a bolt of raw lightning\nequal to the electrical power put out from a\ntazzer from one side. In a protective manner,\nthe rune on the opposite side protects the\nuser from any shock backlash. As it is with\nall runes, the runes would stop working\nwithout a timely renewal and would stop\nworking after several uses.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrum Ingot", "*Moderator Approved*\nFyaaheart approved this item.\nA refined whitish gold alloy with few imperfections\nin it's surface, dark creatures would find it painful to the touch", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Longsword", "Arcane I\nThe ancient aurum blade is well crafted and\ndecorated.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aelthir Tundrak Disguise", "A hefty Emerald cut to the size of a pint\nglass, on its surface the word \"Snow Elf\nwould appear carved. Should one apply\npressure to the carving, it'd activate to\nreveal the handiwork of a masterful\nIllusionist's enchantment - seemingly made\nfrom an in depth observation of Aelthir\nTundrak's face and hair put into practice.\nWhen wearing such it'd provide coverage from\nthe top of a Human or Elven sized head to the\ncollarbones of such an individual, however\nlacking the proficiency to display much\nexpression beyond the famed Snow Elven\nneutrality.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Raevir Crossbowman Figurine", "A crouching man, both hands pressed against\nhis wooden crossbow with eager aim. His head\nis tilted as he seeks to find a target on the\nfield of battle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Raevir Warrior Figurine", "A poised soldier, outfitted in scaled plate\nand topped with a helm. In his hand is a\nshashka and in the other a rounded shield, he\npoints towards the heavens with the iron\nblade.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Eagle Plushie", "A medium sized golden eagle plushie!\nBeautifully crafted, with soft fabrics, and\nexpert stitching. Under one of the wings\nwould be the words 'Veris Summer Festival,\n1618'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Bokolo", "A blue bokolo plushie with a little sea shell\nplush sewn onto it. The blue bokolo tend to\nlove the water and this little plushie is no\nexception! (Waterproof for children)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Lime", "A finely-grained powder that will brightly\ncoat anything it touches.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Blazing Powder", "An experimental drug ingredient, seemingly a\nmix of alchemist fuel and some.. other\nsubstance.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:blaze_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Stoneman Dust", "This is a cow leather pouch containing\nStoneman dust. It has been processed from the\nthumb of a Stoneman. It is sufficient for\nproduction of explosives.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:gunpowder", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Glass", "This is a cubic meter of volcanic glass. It\nis a delicate form of obsidian.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Emperor Siegmund Figurine", "The man stands, one of his eyes painted a\nbright blue. Siegmund Soothsayer, in one hand\nis a Hussariya Cross and in the other an\nEmperor's scepter.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of JakeFSF", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Flame Retardent Ore", "A shimmering red crystal-ore like substance\nthat resonates with heat, when tempered it\ncan withstand all kinds of flame.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AerialKaibab.", "minecraft:redstone_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("StickBall Ball", "A round, white ball that is generally larger\nthan one's palms and will likely hurt if hit\nby it. This Ball would be marked with the\nOffical Warhawke Ball Mark. Leyu'celia™\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Set of Wooden Dice", "Four wood dice, each with 6 sides. Oddly\nenough, instead of small indented cirlces,\nthe dice is indented with the number 1\nthrough 6. The dice are set within a small\nwooden cup with a tiny lid, kept on with a\nred string wrapped around it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Horse Skull", "The skull shows signs that the horse was from\nan adolescent stallion at the time of it's\ndeath, and that the skull was well looked\nafter with not a sign of meat left over.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of Records", "A hefty hardcover tome bound in fine leather\nwith a bronze frame and a beautiful emerald\nsocketed in the center of the front cover.\nThe enchantment can be activated by tapping\none of it’s pages twice with a quill and then\nsetting the quill in a source of ink. The\nbook will then use the quill to write down\nwhatever is spoken loud and clear within\ntwenty blocks as long as nothing disturbs the\nbook, quill or ink source.\n((PM Roxforbraynz for further details and\nlimits.))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elwen.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Firefly in a Jar", "A firefly contained inside a glass jar. It\nfaintly shines during the night with a\nyellowish color.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Osbert.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lapis Bracelet", "Thought to purify the soul, lapis lazuli is a\nmesmerizing gem; it flows around the wrist\nlike a deep blue river. Formed into a\nbracelet this item was crafted by the\nDaluon-Family.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Suede Leather Satchel", "A stitched bag made of brown dyed suede\nleather. It has 2 silver clasps on the end of\n2 leather strands to ensure it is closed when\nwished, and the inside is lined with sturdy\ntanned leather, to ensure its contents, no\nmatter the weight or size, shall not damage\nits soft suede outside nor allow the contents\nto be damaged from outside bumps or\ncollissions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Longsword of Embers", "A simple yet skillfully forged longsword\nrests before you. Supple black leather wraps\nthe hilt, the pommel would resemble a clawed\nhand clutching a ruby, while the crossguard\nis polished as to gleam and glitter. The ruby\ngem glows with an inner light, when tapped\nthree times embers and sparks would alight on\nthe blade, slowly sheathing the blade in\nflame (3 emote build up, Contact HurferDurfer\nfor more info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Phoenix Amulet", "An iron piece shaped like the firebird of\nmyth, the metal holding a slightly dark and\ndull tint to it from treatments done while it\nwas created. Should it be worn or held for a\nfew minutes the imbuement upon the iron will\nactivate: the phoenix abruptly looking to be\ncoated in purple flames and radiating a\ngentle warmth to the one having contact with\nit. The phoenix hangs upon a cord made of\nbraided leather strips that have a slight\npurple tint from dye.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheza.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Rthulan Pearl", "A odd baseball sized orb made up of what\nseems to be some form dense, milky stained\nglass. It seems to glow dimly, and with\nflecks and strands of color arcing around its\nglobular form that seem to shift as it is\nturned. It is completly smooth, and with\nsignificant weight. Though if dropped on a\nhard surface it would seem to bounce. Despite\nits unclear, or possible complete lack of\nnotable utility, it is a beautiful piece\nnonetheless, clearly a masterwork from\nwhatever craftsman has made it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Dirk", "A tribal dirk made of a sharpened stone tied\nto wooden handle. This dagger was retrieved\nfrom a tribal group of tentacle worshipping\nheathens. The bottom of the dagger has been\ncut off and replaced with a detatchable black\ngemstone.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cube of Contemplation", "A strange stone cube brimming with magic\npotential.. Those who wield it in their hand\nwould gain a strange sense of energy by its\nmere touch.. As magic was used by the caster\ngolden runes etched on its surface would\nperpetually become brighter until..?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by booklight12.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dusty Old Tome", "These ancient tomes were too damaged to be\ndecipherable. However, it seems as though\nsome pages contained drawings, vaguely\nshowing off various monstrous creatures and\nbeings.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Quotpede Chitin", "A chitin plate once belonging to a Quotpede.\nLeather straps have been added so that it may\nserve as a shield.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Auvergnian Longsword", "A well forged slayer steel longsword. It\nseems bigger than average, proportionally\nfitted for a big guy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Faithful Flora", "Renowned floral designers swear by the\nFaithful Flora, a brilliant and stunning\nspecimin, to be aware of their straning with\nfriends and family. It's believed that should\ntwo people grasp the stem of this flower, it\nwill either blossom or wilt dependent on the\nconnection between the two. However, many\nspeculate that such tales are a marketing\nscheme by said designers. But, there's always\na chance it's true!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:sunflower", ""),
        StaticItem("Lipstick", "A small ebon tube holding onto a substance of\nscarlet hue, meant to be placed upon the lips\nfor gained gloss - and attention of admirers!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:red_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll Skull", "The skull of a young troll named Jark. A well\nstudied beastiary would identify that this\nskull belonged to an adolescent troll, no\nolder than 10 years of age. There is a dent\nin the large thing from some foul concussive\nforce, and a hole from the sword wound that\nended the best\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Binds That Tie Us", "Legend has it that these ceremonial binds\nwere once used by an ancienty society during\nrituals of oath and word. They say that if\ntwo parties hold hands and then bind their\nforearms with these ropes, any promise, vow,\nor oath taken is unbreakable. Whether these\nanceint stories hold true is up to you to\nfind out.....\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dominon Blade", "An ancient elven blade, forged out of the\npurest aurum. The wings on its hilt indicate\nits origins from the first elven kingdome of\nMalinor.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Lubba Blood", "This small, glass vial contains an extremely\ndark, red liquid, swishing about in the\nminiature container. It is merely bound with\na small cork, tightly plugging the valued\nblood.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Meteorite Shard", "The fractured shard of a fallen piece of the\nsky. Though it is charred black, it still\nsparkles with a beautiful blue glow when held\nup to the light. It is about the size of a\njewel, and requires delicate hands to craft\nwith.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Paleknight Trophy", "A jar of ectoplasm, scooped up from that of a\npaleknight. Smelling rather dull and\nsulphiric, it'd drag about in the glass\ncontainment as it's goo-like base.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Clay Puppet", "A small clay figurine made to resemble a high\nelf's features, complete with pointed ears.\nIt has an uncanny craftsmanship belonging to\na former Soul Puppeteer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Remnants of a 'Stalker", "A partially destroyed Armet, numerous cracks\nand dents aligning the headpiece - it has a\nregal look about it, knightly even. A skull\nis within, somewhat destroyed from where the\nprotective piece faltered - some odd feelings\nof dread wash onto you as you hold it, as\nwell even a smidgen of bravery.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Giovanni's Meat Cleaver", "This rather large and sharp meat cleaver is\nmade of quite fine steel, inlain with a\npattern to have the blade appear as though it\nis the opened mouth of a hound, ready to bite\ninto its prey. One would have to have rather\nlarge hands to wield this otherwise normal\ninstrument one handed. It is stained with\nflecks of blood and meat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Jade Demigryph Statuette", "Carved from jade by a lowly soldier, the\nattention to detail is impressive from the\netched feathers on it's neck to the fact that\nit is anatomically correct, an exact replica\nof the average demigryph. Sorey says it's a\ngood luck charm.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Peridot Spider Figurine", "The figure is a small version of the Skull\nHermit Spider. Whoever carved this took the\ntime to make sure each individual joint got\nthe same attention, and the skull is\nstartlingly realistic. Sorey says it's a good\nluck charm.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon Ring", "A solid band made of pale gold decorated by a\ncrescent Moon, with an intricately textured\nsurface dotted by craters and canyons. A tiny\nkeyhole lies present beneath the Moon,\ninviting perhaps a tiny key.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Legion Donation Pendant", "The Shiny Gold Pendant shows the Insignia of\nthe 1st Legion, and an inscription below it\nsays: \"With this Pendant, You, A Valued\nCitizen of Oren, Show your support and\nwillingness to aid in the growth of the\nLegion. May this show all that you have done\nyour part in helping the Legion, its\nLegionnaires, and most importantly, The Holy\nOrenian Empire! Ave Orenia!!!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fnik.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Parasol", "A dainty parasol that sports a black stained\noakwood handle with small narwhal ivory\nrings. The canopy is made of fine black silk\nthat fades into lace near the outer perimeter\nof the item.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobbes & Schmick Boutique.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Naromis Ramen", "A bowl of steamy hot Naromis Ramen, made up\nof homemade noodles, delicious soup, and\ncooked chicken. The meal is well prepared and\nenough to make even an Aengudaemon's tounge\nwater, it tastes delicious with its neat\nblend of favours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Aventurine Pegasus Statuette", "Carved from a pretty, but common gemstone,\nthis pegasus is beautiful from its head to\nits hooves. The mane and tail are\npainstakingly etched, and look like their\nflowing in the wind. Sorey says it's a good\nluck charm.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Unlimited Ticket", "To bypass all ticket-included rides within\nthe festival!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ♛ The Imperial Administration ♛.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Monster Hunter License", "This license is granted to Holy Ser Richard\nSeregon, allowing for the tracking,\nhuntingand killing of Monsters. The monster\nhunter is expected to follow The Laws of\nMonsters and Unnatural Anomalies. Signed,\nImperial Huntsman, Philip de Capua.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gucko.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("❃ The Forge-Master's Garland ❃", "A Tiva line of innumerable blooms and fronds\nof an autumnal shade, painstakingly woven to\nbe worn as a crown or hung at the hip. A\nflaxen chrysanthemum and crimson azalea crown\nthe flora-braid, and along its length\number-touched ferns, golden oak leaves and\ncerise berries grapple to the remaining\nlength of twining carmine ivy. A trained eye\nwill decipher the calling and name of the\ngarland-bearer and his house, but to any it\nis clear that the line was woven with no\nsmall amount of devoted adoration to the\nwearer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TwilightWolf9012.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Scripture of Evoked Abyss", "Within this scrolling of ancient yellow\nparchment are the designs of a ritual\nintended to induce a state of imperfect\nresurrection within those deemed Half-Undead;\ndrawing about the madness of the beast within\nthem so that, in death, they rise as weapons\npoised against those who struck them down.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Abdiel Ipos.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rite of Subsumption", "This document of ancient beast's hide is in\nsuch ruinous condition from its age that only\na portion of its message can be deciphered;\nenough to allow one to conduct the Rite of\nSubsumption so that another Resonant Knight\nmay make rise. Only the worthy may learn such\ntwisted secrets such as these, and know them\nfor their true value.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The First Judge.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Kha'Tigrasi", "A cut of meat that has a distinctive feline\ntaste to it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantUsopp.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Suspicious Orcish Brownies", "A brownie made by the company of Eath'Lur.\nExactly. It appears to be a multi-layered\nbrownie. It's covered by a very small amount\nof some sort of dust, and, amidst the layers,\nthere's one of chocolate and another one that\nseems to be thin and and of a deep purple,\nand there's also a weak smell of mushrooms.\nIt makes the user both drowsy and awake,\ngiving off some sort of disturbing effect,\nwhile the same person in question\nhallucinates, which makes it highly\naddictive.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Gusmarzku.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Bokolo", "A red bokolo plushie that would look a lil\nbit angrier. The red bokolo tend to be rather\nfierce, and this plushie would have larger\ntalons than the others. (A fan favorite of\nEcaeris's)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Smokeless Tobacco", "A pouch of smokeless tobacco.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Big_Sexy_Beast.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Ash", "This is a crow leather pouch, containing ent\nash. There is enough here to cover six square\nmeters. It smells of ashes, and tastes of\nburning wood. When it is smeared upon a\nwooden surface, it turns to smoke, and\nsteadily converts the wood into charcoal.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Khardik", "A relic from the broken knot of Khardik, this\nAxolotyn artifact marks the user as Cheiftan.\nAdorned with sea rocks and deep ocean gems,\ntentacles of white stone snake around the\nstaff. Upon holding, the user would feel a\nheavy sense of dread, reminded of the sins of\nthe Knot.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Assault Rifle", "Assault Rifle from HALO Combat Evolved\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corpean.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Tears of Freema", "This collection of solidified tears were shed\nfrom the very sky god Freema, the\nManatee All Father of the Events.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of holding", "This ornate staff allows you to cause two\nobjects within 3 feet of the stave of up to\nfive pounds (2.2 KG) to float towards the\nstaff head once the head of the staff is\ntapped. The heads follow the staff, and\nceases to float once the head is tapped\nagain.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Forestlust", "This is a gypsum vial, containing imbued\ndruid blood. It smells and tastes of blood.\nWhen doused on the eyes, for the next saint's\nhour, causes blindness, except for a glowing\ngreen path which leads to the nearest forest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Misfortune Teller's Favourite", "This White glowing wonder of a Stone keeps calling the wearer 'Dave'.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Scarlet", "A finely-grained powder that will brightly\ncoat anything it touches.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gremlin Ward", "An orb-like bottle formed of vibrant glass,\nheld up by a mesh of twine. Meant to be hung\nas a charm, like something you'd see in a\nwitch's hut. When the sun is cast upon it,\nthe light scatters into colored rays, and at\ntimes may make strange shapes by chance. This\noffers a mystical vibe to the object, and\nindeed; It is said that these 'magic bottles\nare able to capture gremlins, thus protecting\nthe household from their mischief. Breaking\none supposedly releases the terrible luck it\ntrapped...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("The Chained Tyrant's Deceit", "A necklace made from casted magegold and\nencrusted with diamonds. Any that wears this\nwill find a glamor cast over them of an uruk\nin leather armor. Any direct touch causes\nripples on one's appearance that are hard to\nignore. Every few emotes, a small\nimperfection must be indicated that the\nillusion might not be real. This item\nrequires attunement to function and will\ngradually exhaust those that use it.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Chained Tyrant's Retaliation", "A smoky black kiteshield quenched in infernal\nblood during its forging process. It has\ncrimson diamonds bejewelled on the inside.\nTaking one emote to activate by tapping the\ngems, the metal will glow a dull green.\nAnyone that strikes the front will trigger a\nverdant magelight with an intense brightness\nfor a couple seconds, likely disorienting any\nattackers. It takes an additional emote of\ncooldown to reset for use again. There are\nonly 3 charges before it's drained.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodletter Mace", "A huge implement of WAR. In your gaze rests a\nmassive black steel mace with jagged flanges,\ntoo large to be wielded by most humans. All\nalong its metal are crimson runes of an\neldritch origin. If this mace manages to\nbreak skin on a hit, the wound will\nimmediately burst open with incredible pain,\ncausing blood to siphon into the runes.\nOtherwise, it takes 3 emotes of time being\nheld against skin to burst it open. A\nterrible weapon for a monstrous being.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Horned Lord.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Knight", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Medium Halberd", "A Black Ferrum halberd forged in Kal'Tarak.\nIt beards dwarven runes standing for the\ninitials K. and D.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Medvekoma.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dewper's Bunghole", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Dagger", "A well crafted by a master bronzesmith, a\nbronze dagger. The staby part is 6\", and the\nlength incuding the shaft and pommel is about\n10\". It's used as a close combat weapon,\ncapable with a well trained fighter of\nkilling in one blow. The blade is made of\nbronze, and the pommel is made with polished\noak wood with a small plain pommel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmar Bank", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Santegian Ale", "A beer of darkness and immensity; this\noatmeal stout is aged for a full year in\nbarrels, developing ﬂavors of chewy roasted\nmalts, charred oak and rich vanilla.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Oats", "A loose mixture of oats, barely and rye. Can\nbe boiled with milk to make a nutritious\nbreakfast.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Spear", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Basilisk Armor", "The armor would be molded perfectly to fit\nthe body of an elf, the outer layer being a\nstrong nearly unbreakable surface, while the\ninterior was a flexible and comfortably\npadded.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Fallingwood Helm", "This is a finely-crafted fallingwood helm. It\nis encrusted with amber opal and aventurine,\nand menaces with spikes of tetrahedrite. It\nis decorated with cave lobster shell and\ncrayfish shell. It is adorned with fungiwood\nfiber rings, which have been dyed green using\ngreen slime dye.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Screamer's Talon", "A razor-sharp talon, once the primary weapon\nof a Winged Screamer. Sharpened with a\nwhetstone, it cuts as well as any sword, and\nmakes for an impressive trophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Domaine de la Romanee-Conti", "A lovely wine, though it still tastes of\nbitter redness, delicious, too much can be\nthe devil. The bottle itself was a calm green\ncolour, with a label on it reading Domaine de\nla Romanee-Conti. Beneath the bottle engraved\non the bottom read the date: 1478\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkash Wood Spear", "A long Darkash pole which stood at an\nimpressive seven feet, polished with a glazed\nadhesive was wrapped delicately with a\nleather grip for better handling. The top of\nthe pole was a spear head which was made from\na hard bright pallid-bone, which was of some\nbeast. Upon the upper shaft, was a band tying\nbaubbles and trinkets of bone and teeth, for\ndecoration and intimidation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sali.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Katana", "The blade seems to be of elven design,\nvarious images scribed along it's spine. It\nappears to be ancient, old.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Royal Blood", "Within the glasswork would be the murky blood\nof the High prince of the Mali'ame. The\ncontents would seem rather chunky with\nseveral small chunks of flesh.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sil'Taynei", "A manablade with a simple, golden hilt\nbearing the insignia of the Order Absolute.\nFrom the hilt extends a light green blade,\nforever emitting a faint humming sound.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vitality Tincture", "A mysterious brew, a medicine distilled in\nalcohol. A single bottle contains 4 sips, and\na single sip aids the body in overcoming\nmaladies. A cure-all remedy, capable of\ntreating ails from dysentery to syphilis.\n[[View Potion Index for more information\nbefore use!]]\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Apple Juice", "A sweet smelling juice rests here, standard\nas they come. A favorite of a former\nArchcleric, this juice will replenish vital\nsugars and energy lost after a big fight or\nexpenditure of mana. (Not actually\nreplenishing mana, it's figurative.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Nectar of the Rex, c.1671", "A sweet, full bodied red wine that’s\nintoxicating with scent and taste. The bottle\nappears to be custom made, an ornate ribbon\nof bronze surrounding the glass bottle with\nsmall etchings running across its form.\nOtherwise, the bottle carries the distinct\nlogo of the Kelly Winery. Also with a small\nmessage across the label, handwritten.“For\nthe Strength of the Elven People against the\nUruk Menace”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Paralyzing Potion", "The transparent glass bottle would be filled\nwith a golden-brown liquid. Once in contact\nwith the bloodflow of any creature it'd\nslowly and gradually paralyze them. This\ndistilled water potion is made out of\nCrouching feather, Alabaster leaf, Night sap,\nSwamp's blossom, and Biteit. Brewed by:\nPereus Frostbeard and Rhova'dir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Infertility", "Soulbound II\nThis potion, made up of a dark aquamarine\nliquid, would increase the fertility of the\nuser to 50% probability for ten elven minutes\nafter consumption.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Tropical Fruit Juice", "Tropical juice, served in a tall glass.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Warm Apple Cinnamon Cookies", "These cookies are created by a nice elven\nwoman, who poured her heart and soul into the\nfair craft of this cookie. The beautiful\ncinnamon tastes as though it was plucked from\nthe great farms in Dominion, the dough seems\nto have been made by a master pastry chef in\nMarna, and all put perfectly together with a\nnice apple aftertaste via the love of\nSilveress Shadowfeather. Enjoy~\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mystery Uialben.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Staff", "A standard looking ferrum staff with hammers\nand armored figures infused into its shaft.\nThe top end of the staff is a steel circle\nabout the size of a baseball. Best to avoid\nbeing slapped by it!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheTri.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Slime", "A simple bottle of a slime. It doesnt do\nmuch, needs to feed om soemthing living once\na week, can only eat stuff rat sized or\nsmaller. It is otherwise non descript and non\naggressive which makes it all around a\nwonderful pet\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Summoning Misfortune", "A book with unwritten pages. On the front is a large cycle with a big eye in the\nCenter. Underneath this Symbol is written 'Close your Hands, Close the eyes, Misfortune\nhere it Comes.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem of the Eternal Conflict", "A glistening gem. It would have images of\nCerridwen, Cernunnos and Nemiisae all\nwatching over Nature as the Druids fight the\nEternal Conflict to protect it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [No Left Hand] Ascanius.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Binding Ropes", "Finely crafted rope with grains of mage-gold\nwithin them, plant them around the object and\nthey'll tie them up with a firm knot!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Great Eagle's Feather", "The brown plume of a giant bald eagle. It is\nabout 4 feet in length; this beast must've\nbeen massive. It would weigh about 3 pounds.\nOne heavy feather.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ketterfish", "This is a pufferfish species native to\nSoteria. It is larger than the common\npufferfish, and has a purple color pattern.\nIts poison glands are slightly larger than\nthe common pufferfish, and require delicacy\nto extract.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blackened Drum-Head", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Bard of Yar.", "minecraft:coal_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrical Vigil Stun Batton", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Rael Ithael.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Slaving Whip", "(Common) A long leather whip that was\nrecovered from a cultist of Vilketa. This\nlong whip was recovered from one of the many\nslave camps among the layers of Vilketa's\nfollowers, the grip being thicker than the\nrest of the whip.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Birchwood White-gold Warhammer", "A birchwood beam standing at seven feet in\nlength is decorated in ornate carvings\ndepicting small skirmishes of an Uruk\nwarband. It's upper shaft was given a band,\nand hanging from the band were bone trinkets\nand baubbles. The metal piece was made of\nWhite-gold; steel and gold alloy, which\nshined bright in the sun. It was\ndevastatingly cruel to those on the opposing\nside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sali.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Forest Ale", "a delicious tasting drink, with a hint of\nmaple leaving you with a sense of calmness", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart of Royalty c.1687", "A soft merlot with undertones of plum and\nberry intertwined on its palette. Made within\nthe Adrian climate, the wine is a deep purple\nhue. The lighter bodied wine is more suited\nfor drinking for pleasure than intoxication,\nas tones of caramel and oak lingering upon\nthe tastebuds. The usual mark of the Kelly\nWinery is sealed on the bottle, with a date\nand a signature on its label.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Adria's Harlot, c.1668", "A mid-ranged merlot has a decent content of\ntanin. It’s strong body and deep purple hues\nare the signal of its strength and stain upon\nthings that may be white. This full-bodied\nwine is used for royal settings or those that\nsimply wish to grow intoxicated. The plum\ntaste covers the palate, used to slightly\nmask the hard hitting alcohol. The bottle is\nplastered with a makeshift label which states\nthe year it was made and a small sigil\ncomprised of a set of grapes. The Kelly\nWinery sigil.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Luminosity", "Light in a bottle\" is a good way of\ndescribing this potion. Its standard color is\nblue, however it may be altered with dye.\nThis, however, will cause some of the light\nto escape from the bottle while the dye is\nbeing mixed. Over the course of one year\n((seven irl days)), the light will dim\ncompletely. A symbol burning is required to\nrekindle the illumination. A tag on the\nbottle reads \"Will recharge if brought back\nfor two pieces.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueberry Juice", "Blueberry juice, served in a tall glass. Made\nwith only the finest Uuthlini blueberries!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's Embrace c.1668", "A small vial of oil which appears to have a\nfew sprigs of herbs and foilage within it.\nThe liquid appears to be a clouded mixture of\npurple and white. The oil would be scented\nwith Lavender, with notes of citrus lying\nbeneath the scent. A perfume created by a\nformer Chamberlain, with the mark of the\nKelly Winery placed on the label near the top\nof the stopper of the vial.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's White Blossom c. 1661", "The sweet white wine has pairings of honey\nwhich flow through its entire pallette. The\naftertaste of the wine hits hard after\nconsumption, the tannin quite strong and felt\nas the warmth of the liquid flows through\nyou. followed by the hard-hitting full body\nof the wine, giving it a composed but the\nability to create a messy situation to the\nlight-tolerant. The bottles are plastered\nwith a makeshift label which states the year\nand the sigil of purple grapes. Distinctive\nof the Kelly Winery.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Clan Uuthlini’s Blueberry Lager", "This beverage, carbonated due to\nfermentation, flaunts a purplish hue and the\nrefreshing taste of blueberries. It is very\nsmooth, and possesses an alcohol content of\n5.5 percent. This lager is the Uuthlini\npride!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Catarrh.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackberry Juice", "Blackberry juice, served in a tall glass.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("One Free Gank Coupon", "This coupon allows you to force your jungler\nto gank your lane. Have a rengar who says 'no\ngank til 6 ;D', or a Yi who can't use his\nminimap? Then this is the coupon for you!\nExpires: Whenever eFungus stops trolling.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Birchwood Wand", "An elegantly carved wand by the hands of a\nmaster. The wand is 12 inches length boasting\na simplistic design with the handle carved\ninto the wood. This would make a magnificent\ncasting implement. One would need to attune\nto the implement first and imbue it to become\ntheir own personal instrument. Once bound it\nacts as a minor focus, allowing a mage a\nslightly easier time in casting. Using a\nfocus, a skilled mage would have the focus of\nsomeone in a calm and collected state.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The First Enchanter.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cú Echor", "A ring made up of a polished iron. The ring\nwould be made up entirely of iron except for\na rather large emerald that'd be attached at\nthe top of it. With that of a Crescent moon\netched in to it. On stating a command the\nCrescent etching begin glow bright as a\ntorch. While this happen on eac\\h side of the\nemerald there be heart etching that'd glow\nwhen Crescent moon does.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Jam", "This a jar of strawberry jam. All\ncraftselfship is of the highest quality. It\nis decorated with a plaid cloth. It is made\nfrom the finest glass. The cloth is red and\nwhite, with a shade of pink. The jam inside\nis sweet and delicious, lovingly made with\njust a dash of lemon juice! There is a note\non the front, written in a fine pink ink. It\nsays '17th of the Grand Harvest, 1658.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Powergaming", "These cookies make you feel awfully powerful,\ntoo bad it's just a cookie. Side effects\ninclude but are not limited to: Inflated ego,\ncommunities of people rejecting your\npresence, sky-gods becoming very upset with\nyour behavior, and banishment.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Rapier", "A silver Rapiers with a complex sweeping hilt\ndesigned to protect the hand wielding the\nsword. Rings extend forward from the\ncrosspiece. The blade is exactly 41 inches\nlong with a shimmer along the metal. A green\ndiamond is slotted on the bottom of the hilt.\nThe blade overall weights 2.2lbs (or 1kg)\nwhich allows any skilled hand to move quickly\nwith it.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Moz Stimozan Aurum Greatsword", "Before you lay the hulking four and a half\nlength aurum blade of wicked make. Its swipes\nleave behind a trail of embers and dark\nsmoke, their touch hot and faintly burning.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by vvmrr.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ten Thorns", "A rather ornate shortsword with cuboid engravings along\nthe blade. The edges of the blade seem to flare out\nwith thorny edges that make the blade look as if\nit were trying to keep something away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber-Glass Inkwell", "An amber-colored glass inkwell capped with a\nsilver top. Within the container was a thick,\ndeep red ink. If one were to catch a whiff,\nthey'd smell something skin to brimstone.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dralachite shard", "A slither of volcanic appearing ore, taking\nto an ebon hue as well glossy appearance.\nInfernal, sulfurous veins run amok on this\nigneous rock.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Ring", "The ring in your hand, one of a pair, is\nfairly simple save for a very intricate line\nof runes that follow along the outside of the\ncircle. They come to meet and circle about a\ndecently sized diamond in the middle of the\nring itself. Upon running one's finger along\nthe runes on the outside, they would begin to\nglow and emit a decent amount of light akin\nto that of a candle.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Rar Grish", "A White-Gold flanged mace which consisted of\nan alloy; silver, aurum and steel for it's\nmace head and an alloy of carbarum and steel\nfor it's handle. It was 14lbs and was a\nlength of 4 feet long. It donned a set of\ncockatrice scales which covered the middle\nshaft of the bludgeoning weapon, for easier\ngripping, and just below it's pommel was a\nsmall harpy eagle talon, sharp as a rondel\ndagger. The weapon was meant for devistating\nblows to armor, and could definitely take\ncare of creatures of the night, or those\ndeemed abbhorent; undead, apparitions and\nothers.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_12(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Bladed Wand", "This sturdy length of wood is coated with a\nblack lacquer. A sharp ornamental blade with\nelaborate etched designs protrudes from the\ntip. The handle is wrapped with a cherry\ncolored suede for comfort.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Phylactery of Shanka'Yar", "A black crystal that pulsates with necrotic\nenergies. You can feel the soul that is\ntrapped inside, yearning for freedom.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Breeze Through Malinor", "An airy, foresty lager that is light and\nfrothy like the Elves of the forest. Drinking\nit makes you feel light on your feet! But in\nreality it's just the alcohol. It's always\nthe alcohol.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Enchanted Emerald", "Those who come in contact with this gem would\nnotice its colorful properties, they'd also\nfeel a sense of calmness whenever the user\nholds it, something magical about the small\nstone\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lockezi.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Kadaine's Bloodwood Staff", "182 centimeters (72 inches) of exquisite\nBloodwood form the base of this spectacular\nstaff. The staff itself has been polished,\nsmoothened and strengthened with a metal\nhandle. The top would be shaped into an eye\nwith a diamond in its core.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kowaman.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Strange Necklace", "A necklace with a gold chain and eye shaped\npendant, pupil replaced with a spherical,\ndark purple gemstone. On the back of the eye,\na strange symbol would be engraved,\nresembling an hourglass. Once the gemstone is\ntapped, the wearer’s entire body shall be\nengulfed by an illusion that makes one appear\nto look like a female, blonde haired\nmali’aheral. Over time, the dark aura in the\ngem shall be consumed, needing to be\nrecharged a week of use.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Warders Delight", "The leather-bound shield has been heavily warded\nagainst the likes of Necromancy, Shade, and conjuration.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Stony axehead-arms", "This stony arm is obviously not like standard\nconstruct appendages, instead of ordinary\nhands lie a duo of axeheads, roughly akin to\na battleaxe, well suited for the likes of\nlumberjacking or combat!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:cobblestone_wall", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of Roots", "A ring that would seem to be made of\nroots, grasping around one another. A\nsmall aquamarine sitting in the centre.\n*Moderator Approved*\niMattyz approved this item.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Morning Star", "A spiked ball mounted on a shaft, resembling\na mace, with a long spike extending straight\nfrom the top and many smaller spikes around\nthe particle of the head. Its spikes being of\nprestine sharpness, the weight being somewhat\nheavy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Unmaker: Dreadknight's Greatsword", "A massive blade, fit for a Dreadknight's\ngrasp. While too heavy to be wielded\neffectively, this weapon of doomsday has and\nAengul Eye engraved in the pommel. Once\ntapped,, the eye will openass the blade feels\nlighter in your hands if you're the owner,\nalmost as if it's levitating. [PM\nInquisitioners for more detail]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Riot Stick", "A stick for beating elves", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Puppy", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Rose", "A small black rose that never wilted or\nsuccumbed to disease naturally. The rare\nplant was blessed by the forests. Small wisps\nof pale green mist jumping between each petal\nand leaf.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Glacial Embrace", "A ring that is held together by pure, crystal\nclear unmelting ice. The cursed ice holds the\nring together like a band and within the\ncenterpiece of the ring lays a rather\nalluring diamond which has been coated in an\narray of snowflakes that amplify it's beauty.\nAny light that shines upon the ring causes it\nto illuminate brightly, making light shine in\nvarious directions.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Aluminium Mixed Arrows", "Finely-crafted arrows forged from a light\naluminium and boomsteel alloy mix. The\naluminium oxide creates a wine red tint\nacross the textured arrowhead. These volatile\narrowheads would be capable of creating\nminiature shrapnel explosions if impacting\nagainst hard surfaces, experiencing tough\nfriction, or large amounts of heat. Painted\nacross the surface of these arrows are black\nscorpions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsteel Mixed Arrows", "These arrows are finely crafted. The heads of\nwhich are a medium-density boomsteel and\nbloodsteel alloy mix. They would be highly\nsusceptible to flame, though it would take a\ngreat deal of force to overheat the heavy\nalloy. Painted on the sides of the obsidian\nblack material are red scorpions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Tusk of Ectorius", "A boar tusk that's hot to the touch.\nCertainly holding it for far too long would\nleave severe burns on upon your flesh.\n(Obtained from a Flaming Boar.)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AwakenMyLove.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Self Rolling Dice", "Ancient dwedmar runic markings are enscribed\nacross all sides of this dice set. When\nrolled, the dice would roll longer than\nusual, glowing brightly from the blue runes.\nThe dice are still random and are harder to\ncheat with.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Torturer's Torch", "A torch held by an individual of ungodly\nnature. A torch that can only be wielded by a\nman as strong as ten thousand men! The man\nholding the torch would be dubbed \"The\nTorcher...er\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("peep", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Nantosuelta's Touch", "A lump of quasi-metal flesh that emits a\nsickening aura, anyone exposed to it for long\nperiods of time would experience vomiting,\nthen all the subsequent symptoms of radiation\nsickness. The exposed would start to grow\ntumors after 2 irl hours. Its effects can be\nnullified by clothing one's self with lead.\n(Radius 15 blocks, PM BathRugMan when\ncrafting with the material or interacting\nwith it).\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nantosuelta's Spawn.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana Warrior' Catfish", "Catfish caught from the magical waters of a\nlake affected by the mysterious Purple Trees.\nThe eyes of the fish are distinctly a dark\npurple, the same as people afflicted by the\nwater. Consuming it does not spread the\neffect.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Tree Mother] Yew.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiced Blood-Sausages", "Long thick sausages veined in marbling nearly\ncause the casing to burst at the seams, juice\njust beneath the surface give the meat a\nhefty feel. A dark bloody crimson colors the\nsausage from within and strained outwards, as\nif at any moment it would ooze it's bloody\nliquid. When cooked it would give a fragrant\nand pleasant aroma of spices and well\nprepared meat, juicy and almost sweet in\ntaste. One could not directly identify what\nkind of meat it was made out of, almost pork\nyet tasting of beef at the same\ntime....unidentifiable unless one had tasted\nmortal male before.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｂａｋｌａｖａ", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Jeweled Beetle", "A palm-sized scarab-like beetle, composed of\nview various colored gems bonded by a golden\ntrim around each gem and to form the rest of\nthe beetle. Two small translucent cuts of\nquartz form the beetle’s wings shell. It was\ncrafted into the position as if it was about\nto fly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jhaeros Flormai.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Winged Screamer Skull", "The colossal skull of a winged screamer, a\nmeter in diameter. It has been bleached white\nby the sun, and is marred with many small\nchips. It has signs of past trauma, which has\nhealed.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Morgan's SEED", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Mournstone Red", "A somewhat dry red within a grey bottle. It\nemits a strong strawberry fragrance, followed\nby a hint of cherry. Though a bit sweet in\nflavour, the spirit flows over the tongue in\na quick, pleasant rush. The tannin within is\nrather high, but certainly not enough to\noverpower the average drinker. The fruity\ntang is a pleasant departure from\nMournstone's other, often-spiced vocations.\n\\\"Classic Mournstone Red,\\\" is plastered to the\nside of the bottle in a bold, flowing script\nand the cork is branded with the Mournstone\ncrest; a dragon taking flight.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fallingwood Leggings", "These are finely-crafted fallingwood\nleggings. They are encrusted with amber opal\nand aventurine, and menace with spikes of\ntetrahedrite. They are decorated with cave\nlobster shell and crayfish shell. They are\nadorned with fungiwood fiber rings, which\nhave been dyed green using green slime dye.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Web", "(Common) A durable spider web gathered from a\nDeeproad's spider. If enough of it is\ngathered then it can be weaved into a strong\nthread.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("xdxd   Arcas Sea Chart   xdxd", "An old-marred sheaf of parchment. It looks\nlike a continental map, featuring Atlas on\none side, and another continent connecting it\nto from the south, beyond the frozen\nwastelands. It's divided into grids, and\ndetaisl careful nautical directions that lead\nfrom Atlas, to this entire new continent\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A Thank You Note", "It's a note saying thank you!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kairi.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("THE SLAB", "A tablet of basalt inscribed with a language\nthat clearly is not common. 1: AHK RA’ ODRA\n2: HONTKA ZA’NOTUM 3: RA’ ODRA HON 4: ZAAZH\nVHUT TAZ 5: RA’ ODRA MOKURZKA 6: KRAI RA’\nTRAMDALK 7: AHK RA’ ODRA 8: THUR’ HAAZK HVAN\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Copper Pole", "A seven foot long copper pole, cleared of any\nimpurities to make conducting electricity\neasier, and to make them less breakable.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Alabaster Feathers", "This large, six-inch long feather would be of\na navy-blue and gray mixture, seeming to\noriginate from the common Alabaster sea bird.\nIt'd be superb for decorative purposes, or as\na writing utensil!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackened Grimoire", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Bowl of Inferis Blood", "A bowl that would be filled with a red ichor,\na book and inkwell would be soaking in the\ncontents. Who knows what this could be for..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lockezi.", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Temptation", "A beautifully carved gem with a faint glow\ncoming from the middle. Uddering the correct\nwords would cause archaic purple spikes to\nappear and form and attempt to pierce the\nwearer from three different sides.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusionary Pendant", "A soft cut diamond, round on the surface and\nflat on its back. The pendant has an\nengraving of a rose sigal. A sheen of energy\npasses over its surface every so faintly.\nWhen one wears this and taps the gem twice, a\nglamor will be cast over the wearer's face.\nLasts a few hours until it is needing a\nrecharge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Blacksmithing Hammer", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blacksmithing Tongs", "", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Blacksmithing Chisel", "", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Warlock's Ring", "A grimy white bone carved ring. A skull would\nbe carved at the side of the ring, small\ngreen crystals sprouting from the cranium\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Nugget", "A shining silver ring inlaid with small,\nglimmering precious stones at regular\nintervals around its edge, shining when\ncaught by the sun rays. The precious stones\nwould be connected by grooves, depicting\nancient symbols of love, friendship and\ntrust.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shadowlord57.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sickening Poison Bottle", "A light green liquid rests inside the vessel.\nIf the venom touches bare skin it will\nproduce minor itching, but if ingested or\nentered blood-stream, the victim will suffer\nfrom high fever. If not healed in five days,\nthe target could die.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dmercads.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Talisman of Vilketa", "(Rare) A talisman recovered from a cultist of\nVilketa. It hangs from a thick string and is\nprimarily made of gold into a spherical\nshape, lined along the edges by silver.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Drilltongue", "This extremely hardy plant has a green hue\nand looks like a tangle of roots. Sometimes\nreferred to by its common name, vines, it's\ntypically found within that of mountainous or\ntundra related scene. It has the ability to\ningrain itself into rock and to take water\nand nutrients from the snow and sleet around\nit. It's ends give out purple flowers which\ngive out some sap.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus' Bite", "A glove of leather, reinforced by metal\nplates on the outside. At the knuckles of\nthese plates, almost a dozen 2'' long spines\nare cast in ferrum and set to be used in\ncombat.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:cactus", ""),
        StaticItem("A Participation Ribbon", "Congratulations! You've participated in one\nof the many contests that took place at the\nBlue Moon Festival. Give yourself a pat on\nthe back.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Hunson's Den", "", "minecraft:yellow_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Cannoli", "Scrumptious cannolis, baked to a golden brown\nshell. Inside they are filled with a sweet\ncreamy substance, which is topped with\nchocolate shavings, and a drizzling of\nchocolate syrup decorates the top of the\nshell! Delicious!", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Herring", "You should likely focus your time on other\nthings...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Georgelin, Troll of the Far Glade.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Lightless Golden Band", "No matter how much one struggles to hold this\nsimple aurum band to the brightest of flames,\nit seems absolutely incapable of producing\neven the slightest twinkle or gleam. It is as\nthough the dark of the Abyss itself had been\nripped from the depths of that gloaming\ncavern and shaped into this golden ring. Yet,\nupon adorning this unimpressing jewelry, one\nis filled with a comfortable warmth at all\ntimes. It is one's inner-flame that truly\nmatters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Geidleth.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Necklace", "A necklace made up of many small wooden beads\nstrung through a leather string, with each\nbead carefully carved into a unique piece\ndepicting the head of an animal. The necklace\nincludes a wide range of wildlife, each piece\nshowing accurate detail in depicting each\nspecies.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Melrethel's Greenhouse", "", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Harpoon", "A six foot long steel harpoon. The head was\nlarge, eight inches long and five inches wide\nat the largest part. It was shaped like an\narrow head. Solidly attached to the two inch\nwooden shaft, the weapon would be braced\nalong it's length with iron bands to make the\nwood stronger.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Old Book of Thule", "By the rivers of Thule, there we sat down;\nyea, we wept, when we remembered the Lord,\nGod-- the Land. Remember, O Lord, the\nChildren of Men in the day of Thule who said,\nraze the wood, even to the foundations'. O\ndaughter of Men, who ought to be destroyed;\nhappy shall he be, that rewardeth thee as\nthou hast served us. Happy shall he be ...\nthat taketh and dasheth thy little ones\nagainst the stones.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by murdercharls.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Apple", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Thyme", "", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Wild Garlic", "", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Giant Squid", "The fleshy meat smells of the sea. It writhes\nat times, even after being long dead. Perhaps\nyou could make a delicious feast from this!\nSushi!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather", "A painted, hard street dove feather that\ncould be used to write if the tip could\nproperly hold the ink together. Halfling\nsized. Can you even write with this...\nwithout having your hands slide off...?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Legitimate Trader Jihadi John.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Fortune", "Be as mighty as an Orc, durable as an Elf,\nstout as a Dwarf, agile as a Kharajyr\ndon't be like a human.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Luster", "This potion, a slightly shiny golden color,\nwould shimmer oddly. If consumed, the user\nwould feel an urge to grab and hold anything\nthat shines or lusters. Whether it be gold,\nor tinfoil, anything that is shiny is\nsuddenly infinitely valuable. The potion\nwould last about twenty elven minutes.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Anarchy", "The potion, glowing a slight red tint, seems\nslightly warm in your hand. The user of the\npotion would feel their anger and irrational\nside grow in strength, causing them to act\nmore violently and selfishly. The effect\nwould last about half an elven hour.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Studded Coinpurse", "A small leather pouch, covered in polished\nleather studs, causing it always to make soft\nclinks, no matter the contents, or lack\nthereof. It has a small red drawstring, along\nwith 2 extra in the pouch incase one is lost.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:blaze_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Sacrifical Chicken Feather", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Plush", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rainbow Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cod Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin3", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferret", "A small furry female Ferrit. It would be\nneatly groomed with a bushy tail , and two\nfont sharp teeth. It'd be long enough to wrap\naround someones neck .and would only weight\nabout 20LBS. It'd have a generally frienly\nand outgoing personality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MayRndz.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice With Lemon Syrup", "A bowl of ice and lukewarm melted lemon\nflavoring. The bowl is about the size of a\nhand, filled with ice that as bits of chilled\norange slices and grape peices. The lemon\nflavoring on top is fresh and crispy. A\nperfect fruity treat for summer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aegisian Rose", "A small batch of rare roses that sparkle in\nthe sunlight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("WolfPup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Flammability", "Soulbound I\nThe 'potion', made up of a dark red liquid,\nis simply oil. However, for some reason, the\nflammability and explosion radius has been\nincreased greatly when lit aflame.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("You Suck\" Sticky Notes", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Lythian Co. Cigarette", "Mid-grade tobacco, when lit it emits a strong\nmolasses scent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AGiantPie.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Eryn's Hunting Spear", "", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Oaked Vodka", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Insecurity", "This potion, made up of a yellow, lighter\ncolor, would cause the user to feel their\ninsecurities heightened, as well as vague\nfears, paranoia, and other uncomfortable\naspects in their mind. They would feel on\nedge and jittery for around twenty elven\nminutes after consumption.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Greenening", "the potion, a dark green in color, smells\nheavily of halfling's grass and cactus green.\nWhen consumed, the user would experience a\npowerful high, lasting for upwards of ten\nelven minutes. All the while, their eyes\nwould become slightly bloodshot.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Rotham, Lavender Lilac", "A rather nice bunch of lilac flowers bound at\nthe base with heavy paper and tied with a bit\nof twine.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Sunflower", "for sexi womin", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Orchid", "This plant shakes in your hands. A strange\npresence can be felt oozing off of it, like\nsomething is watching from it. Like its roots\nare hunting.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Ring", "A spider shaped ring that can be bent to fit\nany size finger! It seems to be made out of a\nblue black, but slightly iridacent material.\nInside is a makers mark, a small pumpkin and\nthe year it was made, 1686.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Blue Lingerie Set", "A high-waisted suspender belt set crafted\nfrom sheer light blue lace, with deep sides\nand playful frill trim decoration. Finished\nwith light blue satin-bound straps at the\nfront and back, with matching satin flashes.\nIncluded is a matching pair of lace blue\npanties, and an underwire satin and lace bra.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Blush Lingerie Set", "This set is crafted with a three-parts: a\npair of panties, a garter belt, and a sheer\nbra. Comprised of translucent fine net tulle\nembroidered with, contrasting pont d'esprit\nspots. It's decorated with black bows to\nmatch the dot embroidery, with nude rosebuds\nat their centre. It's finished with a black\nlace trim at the neckline and black seam\ndetails around the other edges.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Lavender Bundle", "A bundle of preserved lavender, tied together\nwith a black ribbon. A small note is attached\nit reads, 'Blessed Be.' on a fine slip of\nparchment attached with the ribbon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Bouquet of Flowers", "An arrangement of orchids accented by lily of\nthe valley, and hydrangeas.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Candy Apple", "An apple dipped in some kind of sugary\nsubstance, it gleams cherry red in the light.\nThe sugar on it seems to be sclupted ever so\nslighty to resemble a skull. Two divets\nformed for eyes, and and the drips of candy\nseem to form a toothy grin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Pie Slice", "A sweet and slightly spicy slice of pumpkin\npie. It's wrapped with a black cheesecloth,\nperfect for eating with your hands, or maybe\npacking for travel? Either way it's sure to\nbe delicious with whipped cream, or maybe a\nfrozen kind as well?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Bread", "A gently spiced bread, with pumpkin seeds a\ntop it! A single slice would be very rich and\na whole loaf like this would be very\nsatisfying. It's sweet and dense, a perfect\ntreat with hot apple cider or any other warm\ndrink.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Stick", "A flute, which is masterfully. Many circles\ndecorate the strong wooden body, with near\nperfect circle carving! The Flute plays\nabsolutely beautifully, a near perfect sound\ncomes out. Around the Mouthpiece is circle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Purifier Salts", "A bag of grayish salts that hold useful\nqaulities. When some of these salts are\napplied to a liquid, they can remove harmful\ncontaminants within, only to dissolve after.\nThis is very useful for purifying water, and\ngetting rid of dangerous substances from\ndrinks. This type is able to remove fairly\nstrong poisons, and even weaken powerful\nones. Do not ingest! Or else the body will\nreject it via vomiting or excretion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Stocks", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond and Gold Bracelet", "A small bracelet made of gold, set with 4\nbrilliant-cut diamonds around the\ncircumference. Appears to have some metal\nscrews in it, attaching it to the wearer's\nwrist until the proper tool is found.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Vladov Bear", "Never gets left behind!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of the Divine Flame", "A piece of charcoal that radiates with heat.\nIt is physical proof that you havebeen\npurified in the flames of the Far Glade.\nIt'll allow you safe passage into the\nundergrove.The heat it radiates is hot enough\nto set your clothes aflame and melt thin\narmor. It is highlyrecommended that you DO\nNOT hold this with your bear hands. On one\nside of the piece of charcoal is a simple\nphrase, \\\"You are Damned.\\\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ri'va T'sagari.", "minecraft:charcoal", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial", "For Smaw", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Glistening Pearl", "the pearl is quite holographic, changing\ncolors in the light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Devdog_.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Bracelet", "Interlocking loops of golden material,\nmanifesting a lovely bracelet for ones wrist!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Mint Syrup", "Cold ice with melted, luke-warm mint on top\nof it. The cold ice is in a small, hand sized\nbowl, with gummy carmels and chocolate peices\nmixed in. On top is melted mint, smelling\nlike Spring itself. A very sweet, cool treat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gus's Birthday Cake", "Happy birthday Gus!", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos' Hunt", "A combination of Cedarwood and Cinnamon\nBrandy, with a few other ingredients produces\nthe well renown Cernunnos’ Hunt. Contained\nwithin a rectangular bottle, with its nozzle\nplugged by a cork, the substance is a\nbronze-esque hue, with a fierce scent to it,\nindicating the sheer strength of the brandy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen__.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Saffvil", "A sickly green grass.\nThe smell of death wafts around it", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Flametongue Root", "A flower best held with gloves, the sharp\nbrambles have nearly all been removed in\npreparation for use.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Athin", "A blue algae that grows in freezing waters,\nit is difficult to collect due to its frigid\nenvironment and rarity. An excellent fire\nretardant, alchemists are known to carry a\nlarge mat made from its threads to put out\naccidental flames.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Vines", "It often is seen growing beneath shady trees\neasily notable due to its deep blue hue. Its\nuse in the medical field allows it to be\nrubbed into skin, numbing pain and loosening\nstiff muscle. Prolonged usage wil cause\ntemporary numbing", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent's Stalk", "A plant with elongtated stalks,\ntheir hue deep, almost emerald", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Pastry", "A freshly baked and tasty looking strawberry\npastry. It's essentially a little pie, with\nstrawberry filling and a cookie crumble\ncrust, it's still warm even!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gilondir Oronar.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Snowmaiden's Greetings", "A little card made of cotton paper, with a artistic smattering\nof snowflakes decorating the card.\nSeasons greetings for the Year 1538, Merry Krugmas!\nSigned, the city of Laureh'lin.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Teeth of the Verminae", "Teeth as long as daggers\nand as sharp as blades.\n*Moderator Approved*\nBrandNewKitten approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of Riddles", "A magical book - any words read from within\nwould be played out in your head.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Seed Token", "A glowing token, perhaps it is redeemable?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Thatpyrodude.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Ivory Tusk", "A tusk of a beast that's time to roam the earth has\npassed, an air of wisdom and power to it.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Kite-shield", "A rusted, yet still reliable, kite shield.\nIt's a little bit corroded and sticky...\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Beater, The Sword of Sorrows", "MART capable of doing a myriad of spells,\nnamely a glimmer, lesser earth elementalism,\nand the sword can demanifest and appear\nelsewhere. Resonates with spiritual energy,\nthough the pulse is weak.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Shard", "The scarlet crystal radiates with an eldritch\npower from an era long since passed,\nbequeathed onto those deemed worthy to\nadvance the lineage of blood.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tsuyose.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Virarim Medal", "A one inch long bronze pin, in the shape of a\nsimplified sword. The depicted 'sword' is a\ndouble edged sword with an exaggerated\ncrossguard. Despite it's appearance it is\ncompletely blunt, aside from the pin on it's\nbackside. The medal has been well shined and\nsanded, making it smooth to the touch and\nshiny under light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Pipe", "the pipe is seemingly grown from ironwood. It\nshines as if someone had just used the best\nmaterials to shine it and to a druid this\npipe feels alive, as if it was originally\nfrom an awoken staff and ingrained in the\nwood is Halfling's Grass, so even if you\nsmoked all of the grass it would still grow\nback over time, but this can be sped up using\ntheir druidic gifts, the one who obtains this\nmay never need another pipe ever again!\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Kairn's Ring", "A simple engraved solid gold band. The\nexterior is reflective and engraved with a\nhowling wolf. The interior of the ring is\npolished as well, and engraved with the name\nKairn Calithil.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ShadowedOblivion.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("De-FAN-der", "This shield's kite design consists of several\nmetal rods fanning out to the variousedges of\nthe shield. The space between the rods is\nfilled with a thin, lightweight material. The\nbottom of the shield has a handle, for some\nreason.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by grimmothy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring of Promise", "A plain ring of silver, set with a single\nresplendent emerald-stone which was mined in\nthe far Dwarven Kingdom of Kaz'Ulrah. Upon\nthe inside circle is graved, in flowing\nElvish script, \"And love will come, and joy\nand blessed peace also, for no devotion is\npurer than that of the Elves for their\npeople.\" This phrase is followed by a maker's\nmark in the shape of an \"A\".", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Kairn's Sword", "A Black Ferrum blade of apparent wood elven\norigin. Engraved into the cross-guard are\nblossoming roses and at the center a howling\nwolf. A large red ruby sits securely in the\npommel. The leather on the sword grip is\nstamped with vines of roses. The reverse of\nthe cross-guard is inscribed with the words\n“Eth'hiyem Thrur'sae.”\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by sidmmvv.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Beta Swing Timer-Less Warhammer", "A trial swing timer-less weapon.\n★Developer Approved★\nSigned by Kowaman.\nWhen in main hand:\n-3 Attack Speed\n+9 Attack Damage\n+18% Attack Damage", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Wineskin", "A simple wineskin, made of black leather. It\nis well suitable for holding most liquids,\nwithout causing any change of taste with the\ncontained liquid.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem Necklace", "A necklace adorned with little blue gems!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Blight Charm", "A primal pendant, like roots entangling a\ncrude cut of naturally formed amber. Keeping\nit around seems to make the ills of unnatural\nblights feel just a little easier, and aid in\none's recovery from them... But, it won't\nsave you from more lethal cases. Either way,\nit's a pretty bauble.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Quartz Pendant", "A praying man, dangling low from shining\nchains\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Brokenhelix.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Coverlet", "A warm bed covering made of padding, its\njoint lines of stiching appear well-formed\nand it's silky to the touch. Oddly enough,\nit's not too hot and its clement at almost\nall times.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Windswept Branch", "A decorative ornament perfect for beating\nrebellious children. Found by Carellith\nCalithil, circa 2016.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Benign Tulip", "This plant's native range happens to be the\nwoods adjacent to Linandria, it is a fine\nspecimen of the naturalist approach towards\nthe surrounding lands and would have a scent\nreminiscent to spring bloom. Picked by Kairn\nduring one of his many journeys, it's a\nshapely perrenial conveying a deep and\nprofound love for his wife, Arianna Calithil.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Brew of the Harridan", "This potion, when broken, emits a loud shriek\nthat emits for a mile!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ape Predator C3000", "A well forged sword made to kill apes", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Shovel", "a shogging shovel blesssed by sandk1ng\nhimself hes prone to give you free wins and\nmake you be good champion\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Cerridwen", "An oval-shaped amulet wrought of ivory and\ngold, it's suspendended by loose chainlinks\nand its surface is embellished by the\nengravings of a field of grass and the\nluminescent moon. Ascribed to this artifact\nis the ability to sence whether it's day or\nnight time by touching it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("The Goddess' Chain", "An ornate, golden silhouette of a woman\ndangles upon a chain of wrought iron that\nfeels of faint warmth. The figure appears to\nbe indistinguishable apart from the two jade\nemeralds that pierce through the eyes of the\nwoman. Small but distinct and beautiful in\nappearance. The necklace itself would be soft\nto the touch and feel like fabrics and flesh.\nEven though made of metal, strange? [PM\nScreamingDingo to Interact]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Lined Gloves", "A pair of simple brown gloves, lined with\nrabbit fur. They both have an incredibly\ncold, small dark blue crystal embedded in the\ncuffs that seems to lack any shine. Delicate\nembroidery lines the cuff in the form of\nsnowflakes, blending in with the brown. When\nthe embroidery has a finger run over it, the\nthread changes to a pale blue. (Message\nThatWeirdGirl/TwigTheTwig#4321 for more info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vulnikru.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Elven Necklace", "An ornate wire wrapped elven necklace that\nhoops around one's neck. Golden Leaves hang\ndelicately upon the centerpiece, while\nemerald gems sparkle in the sunlight\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Western Warden Waffles(TM)", "These are perfectly W shapes waffles, the\ntaste in your mouth leaves you more satisfied\nthan your partner in the bed. You will\nremember who made them, as they are easy to\nget right, due to the name. The famous\nWarden's true identity and age is largely\nunknown. Guaranteed to be (Mostly) bone free.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ajax_Manslayer.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Blade, Consistant of Eleven Percent Tin, and Eighty-Nine Percent Copper, Double Sharpened Edge in Make and Shaving Sharp in Refinement, Accompanied in Make With Oaken Wood Hilt with Fine Varnish of Linseed Oil", "A simple bronze double edged shortsword with\nan oakwood hilt. The blade of the sword has\nbeen well shined, making it quite lustrous\nunder light. The edge of the blade has been\nsharpened to shaving sharp, and makes a\nnotable triangular shape to the tip. The hilt\nof the blade, which has been nailed onto the\ntang of the blade, has been treated with\nlinseed oil.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rainbow Staff", "The staff held would be made of two different\nkinds of wood interwoven together along the\nshaft of the staff. The length would be\ncovered in lavender with various flowers\nalong with a pearl placed ontop. The word\nRainbow' would be carved on wooden frame.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Spriggancraft Living Staff", "A tall, gnarled wooden staff adorned with\nmany violet flowers and rustling leaves. The\nstaff still echoes with the druidic energies\nthat awoke it's creator, and is fashioned\nfrom the spriggan's very body. These staves\nare often given to those who have perfomed a\nservice for nature, and aided a Spriggan in\ntheir duties.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cielosoro.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiva Wreath of Learning", "A tiva wreath constructed with a strong root\nbase, shaped to fit above the head to\nsymbolize the brain, or intelligence even\nfurther. Fresh flowers were strung all along\nthe circle, in the following order, following\nthe pattern of: Cornflower, Toadflax, Clary,\nCornflower, Toadflax and Iris.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Taliame'onn.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiva Wreath of Identification.", "A flower wreath crafted from a root base in a\nsize to fit perfectly above the head. It had\nbeen strung by a master of Tiva, delicately\nplaced flowers in the following pattern:\nAzalea, Angrec, Gladiolus, Chrysanthemum,\nCarnation, Bellflower, one Gardenia,\nRanunculus, Peony. To the untrained eye, it\nis but a flower crown, however those who\nunderstand the lost flower language would\nfind that it tells much about a person and\ntheir life, it's meaning personal to the\nwearer it was designed for.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Taliame'onn.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Potion of Sleeping", "A red-brown tinted liquid inside a large\nglass bottle, labeled \"Lesser Potion of\nSleeping.\" If one drank the liquid - They\nwould be put to sleep in the matter of\nmoments, causing them to fall into a deep\nsleep for around 3 hours. Upon awaking, The\ndrinker would suffer from severe migrains for\nthe same amount of time they had been asleep.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｈａｌｆｌｉｎｇ＇ｓ Ｇｒａｓｓ Ｃｕｌｔｕｒｅｄ Ｂｕｔｔｅｒ", "Ａ ｊａｒ ｓｅａｌｅｄ ｗｉｔｈ ｃｈｅｅｓｅｃｌｏｔｈ ａｎｄ ａ ｍｅｔａｌ\nｌｉｄ， ｓｅａｌｉｎｇ ｉｔｓ ｃｏｎｔｅｎｔｓ． Ｉｎｓｉｄｅ ｔｈｅ ｊａｒ，\nｏｎｅ ｗｏｕｌｄ ｆｉｎｄ ｔｈｉｃｋ ａｎｄ ｓｍｏｏｔｈ ｃｕｌｔｕｒｅｄ\nｂｕｔｔｅｒ． Ｔｈｅ ｂｕｔｔｅｒ ｗａｓ ｆｅｒｍｅｎｔｅｄ ｏｖｅｒｎｉｇｈｔ\nｆｒｏｍ ｆｒｅｓｈ ａｎｄ ｆｌａｖｏｒｆｕｌ ｃｒｅａｍ ａｌｏｎｇ ｗｉｔｈ ｔｈｅ\nｅｘｔｒａｃｔ ｏｆ Ｈａｌｆｌｉｎｇｓ Ｇｒａｓｓ． Ｓｍａｌｌ， ｄｉｃｅｄ ｕｐ\nｐｉｅｃｅｓ ｏｆ Ｈａｌｆｌｉｎｇｓ Ｇｒａｓｓ ｗｅｒｅ ｅｖｅｎ ｍｉｘｅｄ ｉｎ\nｗｉｔｈ ｔｈｅ ｃｒｅａｍｙ， ｓｍｏｏｔｈ ｂｕｔｔｅｒ． Ｕｐｏｎ\nｃｏｎｓｕｍｐｔｉｏｎ， ｂｙ ｕｓｉｎｇ ｔｈｅ ｂｕｔｔｅｒ ｉｎ ｂａｋｉｎｇ ｏｒ\nｃｏｏｋｉｎｇ， ｏｎｅ ｗｏｕｌｄ ｅｘｐｅｒｉｅｎｃｅ Ｅｕｐｈｏｒｉａ ａｎｄ\nｍｉｌｄ Ｈａｌｌｕｃｉｎａｔｉｏｎｓ， ａｌｉｋｅ Ｃａｃｔｕｓ Ｇｒｅｅｎ ｙｅｔ\nＳｔｒｏｎｇｅｒ．\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sharpened Antler Armor", "A Steel Cover for Taletheus' Antlers, It's\ntips are sharpened - Making his Antlers a\nmuch more formidable weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Boruto.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Adelard", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Wine", "Strawberry wine made with what else,\nstrawberries! It as an liquior content of\n11%, and in the bottle is red-ish liquid.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Healer's Kit", "A polished wooden box branded with the\ncaduceus of Akezo, patron of healers. Within\nit are no healing potions or spells, but\nrather tools; Irons, a saw, a set of needles,\nclamps, hooks, bandages, and more... And\noddly enough, scissors and razors seemingly\nmeant to cut hair. The surgical knife packed\nwithin is crafted from obsidian, granting it\nan edge far sharper than steel, but making it\nvery delicate regarding keeping its edge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Leather Sketchbook", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Oaken Stardust", "A whiteish coloured liquid, encased in a\nclear bottle. Once opened, the holder would\nrecieve a whiff of a perfume-like fragrance,\nsweet but strong. If you drank it, it'd taste\nstrong like a blend of a few different\nalcohols, most prominent being vodka & rum.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Raelynn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("dumb ass blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceramic Mug", "An orange-pink juice; flavoured with\nwatermelon and carrot! Yum!", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("White Painted Egg", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("White Marble", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Wedding Band", "A wedding band, forged from gold. Three\nstrands have been welded together to create\nthe body. Small leaves and flowers,\nspecifically daisies and roses, are carved\ninto the gold. The petals of the daisies are\nset with diamonds, the roses rubies. When put\nin direct sunlight the ring sparkles\nbrilliantly, creating rainbows galore. The\ninside of this piece of jewelry is smooth,\nsave for an inscription inside, reading; “Ad\nignum”.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspectist Incense Stick", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Slapping Stick", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Morkan Fondl'jukrin's Blood", "The blood of the Sea Titan Morkan\nFondl'jukrin. It would be the same as an\naverage shrimp's blood. It would glisten a\nslime green and if you put your ear up to it\nyou could hear the sounds of the ocean waves.\nObtained from the final September Prince\nevent.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Broodmother Whiskey", "Has life gotten to you? Are you exhausted,\ntense, tired? Need a break from life, from\nparenting, from everything that makes you…\nwell, you? Take a shot of Broodmother Whiskey\nto forget it all! Fiery hot with a punch that\nwill knock you off your seat, this is one\nyou’ll come back for.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lanavia.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Firebrand Brandy", "For those who like to take their time and sip\ntheir drink, this brandy is savory and is\nbest served on the rocks. Sit back, relax,\nand have a conversation or two, and enjoy\nthis rich, aged brandy like the gentleman you\nare.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Heloise.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Honey Coffee", "A dark fresh coffee , with a touch honey\nmixed in. This sweet coffee would make those\nwho drink feel warm and cosy inside.Leaving a\nsweet taste in the drinkers mouth afterwards\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evelyn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Arali [T5 Emberhearth Infusion]", "A forty-inch longsword, born of the finest\nsteel known to Atlas. Upon its leather hilt\nlies an emerald gemstone. If one were to\npress on it whilst wielding the sword, it\nwould activate the infusion, igniting the\nblade with holy green fire. If it were to\nmake contact with a tainted/twisted being, it\nwould very severely burn their flesh, but not\nignite them. [Must be recharged after 10\nuses. Twisted/tainted souls are not able to\nactivate the infusion.]", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A bottle of red wine, with a fancy label marking it as a product of Stafyr winemakers.", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Age Dominion Shield", "An old-looking but still functional shield -\nnow used as a memento of better times. It\nappears to be an Virarim-style shield with\nAspect Elven lettering on a green background.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by iMattyz.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Meat", "A nice chunky piece of meat from a slain\nwyvern. If cooked it would taste like the\nmost delightful chicken your tastebuds ever\ntouched.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Thairic Sword", "A beautifully ornate sword can be seen, with\na flowing and intricate series of engravings,\ntransitioning from Elven writing to makeshift\nphoenixes. It is quite a thin blade, and is\nquite lengthy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Krugsmas Express", "A little wooden cart, pulled by a plush\nreindeer. It is big enough for a full grown\nperson to sit in.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Ooze Chunk", "(Common) A chunk of Ooze gathered from a cave\nof Ooze slime. It smells revolting.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("8000 ping", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Crow", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Smile Dip", "Its worse than Drugs , the whole world around\nyou dances to a strange beat you never heard\nof before. Flowers have faces and say how do\nyou do and the trees shake thier booty at you\n.... wait trees have booties?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("White Chocolate Bunny", "A chocolate bunny, this bunny would be filled\nwith several small eggs inside all containing\na delicious mixture.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Nebulium", "A swirling, bubbling and unstable liquid\nSneak or use /walk before handling!\nThis item is best transported via Llama", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Essense of Cerrwiden", "A beautiful, ornately decorated wooden vial\nfilled with fresh spring water- a sign of\nrebirth in the Aspectist faith.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Venus Fly Trap", "Venus Fly Trap in a pot", "minecraft:waterlily", ""),
        StaticItem("Crann's Muck-honey", "A small ceramic pot filled with raw honey,\nsweet to taste and thick as muck. Its secret\ningredient helps ward off illness and pain\nand calms the user. Made in Belvitz, on the\nshores of the Baltas River.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tidgemo.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Fine Pay-Slip", "This pay-slip serves to prove the owner has\npaid 150 minas towards the Dominion's\ntreasury for any of the following crimes:\ntheft, public slander of allies, vandalism /\nunlawful destruction, identity obfuscation,\nor public disruption / harassment.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dominion of Malin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Fine Pay-Slip", "This pay-slip serves to prove the owner has\npaid 250 minas towards the Dominion's\ntreasury for any of the following crimes:\nkidnapping, or illegal usage of magic within\nthe Forest District.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dominion of Malin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Substantial Fine Pay-Slip", "This pay-slip serves to prove the owner has\npaid 350 minas towards the Dominion's\ntreasury for any of the following crimes:\nmalicious sadistic or sociopathic behaviour,\nunderaged sex, practice of magic with\nmalicious intent, or unpermitted use of\nmental magic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dominion of Malin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Major Fine Pay-Slip", "This pay-slip serves to prove the owner has\npaid 500 minas towards the Dominion's\ntreasury for any of the following crimes:\nownership or sale of slaves of any race (bar\nconstructs).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dominion of Malin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Military Fine Pay-Slip", "This pay-slip serves to prove the owner has\npaid 200 minas towards the Dominion's\ntreasury for any of the following military\ncrimes: repeated offence in intentional /\nmalicious abuse of visitors or citizens.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dominion of Malin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Major Military Fine Pay-Slip", "This pay-slip serves to prove the owner has\npaid 300 minas towards the Dominion's\ntreasury for any of the following military\ncrimes: provoking fights with malicious\nintent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dominion of Malin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Hard-Boiled Egg", "An egg, boiled within its shell. When cracked\nopen, one would find a delicious and fresh\nboiled egg.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Terrence.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Bread", "A fresh, warm, loaf of bread. Ready to be\neaten or sliced up for other purposes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Terrence.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bagel", "A (relatively) fresh, plain bagel, served on\na small piece of serving paper. If you like\nplain bagels, you might find yourself\nenjoying the warmth and texture.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Terrence.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Cream Cheese Bagel", "A fresh bagel, split into two halves with a\nlayer of cream cheese in the center, and put\nback together. It's fresh and warm, served on\na piece of serving paper. Yum.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Terrence.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Childrens Wooden Sword", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dandelion Tea", "Freshly brewed, and ready to consumption.\nThis Dandelion 'Tea' acts as a coffee\nsubstitute, somewhat similar in appearance\nand flavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Terrence.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby", "This baby has been bundled up warmly, well\nfed before its trip to its new parent. ((I\ngot too many kids! I adopt too many! I have a\nproblem. Heres a Baby of any race you\nchoose.))", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Snow Elf Body Pillow", "What you would see really isn't much,\nconsidering it's made of 97% snow shaped to\nbe an actual woman, though from the looks of\nit, the design was already crudely deformed.\nHow unfortunate.", "minecraft:snow", ""),
        StaticItem("Roasted Boar", "Boar meat roasted over an open fire. The\nexterior has a slightly charred appearance,\nwhich the juciness of the meat within.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("❇ Essence of Cernunnos ❇", "A bottle full of thick, red, warm boar blood.\nIt's sealed tight with a cork, horns painted\nonto the front of the bottle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelin Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Plays Manuscript", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragons Blood Rum", "The big boy's drink. Dragon's blood is a\ndrink made for the tavern's stronger\ndrinkers. Not for the weak of heart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roy D'Avre.", "minecraft:potion", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_13(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Pickled Herring", "A small glass jar, containing various sliced\nportions of herring. The glass jar is\nsomewhat blurry, and bears a wide cork\nkeeping it sealed. The herring contained in\nthe jar has been sliced into edible portions\nof meat, bearing its head and tail cut off\nand gutted. The jar contains roughly 9\nherring. The jar weighs 4 pounds, and can\ncontain one litre. The herring are kept in a\nmixture of brine and onions. The contained\nherring bears a somewhat sour, fishy taste.\nThe herring still bear their scales, and give\noff a silvery white sheen. The bottle bears a\nwhite lable glued onto it, displaying the\ntext 'ＰＩＣＫＬＥＤ ＨＥＲＲＩＮＧ' on it, alongside a\npooly drawn picture of a herring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Angler] Alken.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Fish", "A fish, salted and dried to be preserved for\na long time. The meat of the fish is from\nthat of a tilapia fish. The fish has been\ngutted, though not unscaled. The fish is 9\ninches long, and 6 inches tall. The fish’s\neyes look a blackened grey, and its scales\nare a dull grey, and it’s fins now appear\ngreyed and shriveled. Its body is encrusted\nwith salt, and feels somewhat like sand. The\nfish bears a salty-savory taste, though it is\nrather fishy. The fish tastes vaguely sandy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Angler] Alken.", "minecraft:cooked_cod", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Bastardsword", "A mastersmithed hand-and-a-half sword would\nrest in your hands, 40 inches in length and\nsharpened on both ends. The tip of the weapon\nwould have been narrowed, serving as well in\nthrusts as it would in slashing. The\ncross-section of the blade would be of Broad\nFuller design, serving it's duty well and\nallowing it to also be used in a Mordhau\neffectively. A sigil of a Silver Stag would\nbe upon the hilt, implying the nation that\nthis tool of war originates from. Truly, a\nmastercrafted weapon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by IronLich.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Beautiful Sapphire Ring", "A beautiful ring lies in your hand. It would\nfeature a gold band, with small, yet\nintricate engravings, featuring a dwarven\nmotive. On the inside, it would read: \\\"For\nthe prettiest Halfling around.\\\" Te ring also\nfeatured a sapphire on top. It was nicely\npolished and shined beautifully in the light!\nTruly, a beautiful gift to give!", "minecraft:lapis_lazuli", ""),
        StaticItem("An Appreciative Gift", "A token of appreciation from a rabbit tossed\ninto the water. She leaves it with her\nrescuer as a sign of thankfulness and\nappreciation for his help.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Stew", "Beef stew.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by draja.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("parker: *EEEEEEEEEE* *slaps head with leg* nEEEE buh wee wee *siren noises with mouth* wONKY peepee! toast muffin MMMMM *slams head on desk* AAAAAAAAAAAAAA uO gee jeep jeep *makes drum noises on belly* MEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE toot toot! baaaa", "", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("First Note", "Hello and welcome to the 'Storytellers Cart'.\nIt's run, walked, and occasionally pushed, by\nKaiden Ne-Olivier Xandel, a man of a million\nstories.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Second Note", "Kaiden writes, sells, buys and tells stories.\nFiction and otherwise, only a mere call away.\nAll from the mind of a man who has seen more\nthan most in the various worlds we have\ninhabited.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Third Note", "To make contact, please simply find the suave\neldery man wearing the pristine maroon suit,\nor bird him. (Minecraft Name: RideTheSky)", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Cut Out Puzzle #1", "This was a thicker sheet of a cardboard-like\nmaterial, it had small dotted outlines as to\nwhere to cut out certain shapes, it also came\nwith a small set of instructions attached. If\nthe instructions were used correctly and the\nshape were cut out fairly well the wood\nmaterial came together to create a phoenix\nshaped puzzle about the size of ones palm.\nThe total piece count of this one was 60 and\nwas marked as an ‘Easy’ level puzzle!\n[ZachsSlayer].\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("String of Silent Screams", "A bone necklace bearing thick, braided\nstrands of soft crimson rope that twines\naround a variety of misshaped and snapped\nbones. Once the wearer comes into physical\ncontact with the object, they'd begin to hear\nsubtle inaudible whispers. ((PM Voidal for\nmore info\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Whispering Secrets.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Dice Set", "A find brown bag of dice that carried 7\nsix-sided die inside the bag, each one was a\ndifferent color and all were made of wood and\npainted afterwards. On the inside came\ndirections to a game labeled ‘DIce’. First it\nstated that everyone bet a certain amount of\nmina and give it to the money keeper of the\nround, from there each person roll a die and\nwhoever gets the highest wins. If two or more\npeople roll the same number which is also the\nhighest number, then those people re-roll\nuntil won.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Present Lighter Necklace", "A simple necklace that had a present shaped\ncharm at the bottom of it. If the lid of the\npresent was removed, a small grey fire would\nappear inside the necklace and was capable of\nlighting up the very immediate area around\nthe person. It didn’t burn any untainted\nbeings but if touched would make undead feel\nuncomfortable in it. The fire was incapable\nof being put out via liquids but also very\nsmall. [Message ZachsSlayer for any required\nhelp or questions!]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("0.01520104151291335 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sword", "This blade is made from refined Aurum and\nblessed to deal with all sorts of undead\nabominations, versus Ferrum it'd not be a\nsurprise if the blade suffers material damage\ndue to the normally soft metal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Slightly Corroded Breastplate", "A breastplate that seems to be useless at\nthis point, some spots of the armor having\nholes in it, even chunks of meat and flesh\nstill stuck to the inside... Because of this,\nthe piece smelled horrid.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Contorted Metal", "(Rare) A piece of contorted metal found in a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. It was found\nlying near a container of Thanhium dust, and\nif pieced together may form a spherical\nshape.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("[R.F.E.] Emerald Necklace", "A beautifully made silver necklace would rest\nbefore you, a beautifully cut ruby would rest\nin the pendant, giving off a slight glow\neither from the sun, or something else. The\ngem end up housing a Fire Evocation Ward. T5\nwould be reduced by 2.5 T4 reduces by 3 T3\nreduces by 2.5 Teirs and T2 and T1 being\npractically useless. (Pm bolon_ for more\ndetails)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bolon_.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("a Enigma Candya", "f434!\", is the general response of many who\nconsume this out of this world sweet treat.\nThe shape, texture, flavor, everything, is\nconstantly changing. The ultimate enigma for\nthe adventurous sweet tooth. Don't try to\ncomprehend it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Flamboyant Sage", "A fine whiskey that has a spicy kick to it\nbut the aftertaste leaves you with a calm,\nmellow buzz. Perfect for the carnival-goer\nfinishing up their night.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bejewelled Skull", "A bleached skull inlaid with saphires, once\nbelonging to Hulphon Lapidoth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Falk Geldmeister of Juria.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of the Beholder", "A bejewelled eye which seems oddly realistic.\nIt is a family heirloom of the Geldmeister\nstock. Some say it belonged to Hulphon\nLapidoth himself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Falk Rattle-my-Bones.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Savoy Soldiers Orders", "An Old, Torn page taken from the Darkstalker\nknown as The Smith. The Orders, while\nsomewhat scratched off, say \"Capture Hein...\nrron\" Before being ripped off.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Cosmic Egg ★", "An easter egg that was launched into space\nfrom another planet with a catapult, and,\nduring its course, it crossed a\nspace-rainbow, acquiring all of its tastes.\nYou can't define the flavour, but it tastes a\nbit like... sugar. Did it even come from\nsomewhere else? Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ash Insignia", "A drawing of an ash tree, made in charcoal.\nIn the corner of your eye, the branches seem\nto writhe.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Drink of Hard Knox", "A powerful drink that will surely knock you\noff your feet, or existance itself if you\ndrink it the wrong way. Best drunken with\nfriends and enemies.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandworm Flesh", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Mail", "Armour designed to fit goblins.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Gorgemel.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Drengr'je Stolt (heavy halbert)", "This is a gorundyr styled Halberd. The head\nof the Halberd is made of black steel with\nmany odd runes carved into it,\"Langur\" is\ngently carved into the side of the metal\naswell. The long shaft of the handle is made\nfrom ash wood while the grip is wrapped in\nbeige stainned leather. A bone necklace and a\nfew black, brown and gray feathers hang from\nthe butt of the halberd, This weapon was made\nby the hands of a masterful crafter. A\ngorundyr scent emits from this item.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Forrest'je claw'ja (bearded battleaxe)", "This is a gorundyr styled Bearded battle axe.\nVarious runes are carved into the head of the\naxe while a small bone necklace hangs from\nthe back of it giving a more gorundyr feel to\nit. \"Beztr fahdon\" is carved onto both sides\nof the axe head. The long handle is made from\noak wood while the grip of the handle is\nwrapped in a beige stainned leather. A bear\nand a wolf have been nicely carved into the\nlong handle. This is very well made, clearly\nby the hands of a masterful crafter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fine Steel Censer", "A censer, typically used for burning incense,\nwrought of fine steel and polished to a\nshine.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Argentum Jian", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray shield", "A well rounded shield void of any insignia or\ncrests. A simple film of gray colors the bulk\nof the bulwark. Significant dents scattered\nthe surface. Each one more ominous then the\nlast. The overall integrity of the shield\nappears to still be in good health.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Stone", "Stone that once bore vivid red runes. Its now\ncold and dormant; and merely a pretty trophy\nto show guests.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone finger", "this stone is from an old ancient golem that\nonce rested in the forest. Its in the shape\nof a large finger.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:mossy_cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Drowner's Head", "The severed head of some blue-skinned beast,\nan quite unsightly at that. Glassy white eyes\nglared onwards, the skin near scale-like - it\nsmelt of spoiled fish.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AdeptusMechanic.", "minecraft:prismarine", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Gem", "A strange gem with arcane etchings on the\nsurface.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Calamari", "Delicious looking giant slabs of Octopus\nmeat. Just one hunk could likely fill an\nOlog!", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Covered Watermelon Slice", "This slice of watermelon is coated with\nhardened chocolate and crushed nuts. If one\nbit into this watermelon slice, they would\nfind that it tasted more sweet than watery.\nHowever, one who tastes this would find that\ntheir legs become incredibly heavy, as if\nthere was something within weighing them\ndown. Even the strongest of soldiers might\nhave a hard time moving around, although this\nis only an illusion, for there is no /real/\nweight holding them down. This lasts for 15\n(irl) minutes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:melon", ""),
        StaticItem("Moleman Whiskers", "The Whiskers of a Moleman, tied up like a\nlock of hair, symbolizing a trophy from the\nslained Moleman.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Head", "A decapitated Dwarven Head, slain by Goblins\nwhile guarding the Deeproads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Reindeer Skull", "What can I say? Father Krugmas\ngets hungry too.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Voodoo doll", "a little doll, clearly used for some dark\nthings.", "minecraft:totem_of_undying", ""),
        StaticItem("Killshot", "A slayer steel two-handed warhammer. The\nweapon would take a lot of strength to use\nbut when in the right warrior's hands it can\nbe effective on all sorts of eldritch\nhorrors. The pommel of the shaft is carved\ninto the head of an eagle. This weapon has\nalso been strengthened to be incredibly\ndurable, perhaps unbreakable!", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of legitlight", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Denial Slip for the Dominion", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Acceptance Slip for the Dominion", "This slip of paper says you passed the gate\ninspection. It is dated, 16th of the Deep\nCold, 1666. (June 6) Name - Robert, Purpose -\nVisiting.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DiscoLiquid.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Knox Pie", "", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Whip", "The perfect tool to get an unruly person to\nbehave.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze colored Flail", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by IclapYOURcheeks.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Narora's Pearl Earrings", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by PeachLova.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Magic Swamp Water", "Its actually a burn salve enhanced by druidic\nherblore. Made of aloe vera extract and\ndissolved aqua nymph, and smells like rotten\neggs.", "minecraft:hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Eastpeak Obsidian", "A heavy, jagged chunk of viciously sharp,\nglass-like stone. It is said that tools\nsharper than carbarum could be crafted from\nthis material, gathered only from dangerous\nplaces where the earth bleeds often enough\nfor it to form. This sample was taken from\nthe Firelands of Eastpeak, a place where\ngreat trees cast their roots into lakes of\nroiling fire, and strange creatures etch out\nsurvival against the odds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Chip Muffin", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("50.34364773670421 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand-crafted Drum", "It's made of delicately carved and decorated\nwood, and the skin of a stag. It actually\nsounds quite lovely when used! A little 'A\nis carved into the side.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by wryssa.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Mother", "A wooden figurine depicting Cerridwen. The\ncraftsmanship is not perfect, though it is\nobvious the creator put a lot of time and\nlove into the piece!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Father", "A wooden figurine depicting Cernunnos. The\ncraftsmanship is not perfect, though it is\nobvious the creator put a lot of time and\nlove into the piece!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Disinfectant Wipes", "A stack of cotton wipes glued together at the\ntop corner, allowing the user to easily tear\noff a sheet. The wipes have been soaked in a\nconcentrated solution of Gislocinovi, and\nwhen applied to an open wound it will have\npowerful antibacterial properties.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LaffenOutLoud.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("DrillTongue Powder", "A brown powder that has a sweet taste and can\nbe dissolved into liquids, if this is placed\ninto a liquid it will make it sweeter and\nvisions will come onto the drinker. Along\nwith that their mind is distorted for about\nan elven hour, but it can also be inhaled.\n[Message Muyakelgism/ZachsSlayer for any\nhelp.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Muyakelgism.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Beeswax", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The pot of luck", "", "minecraft:poisonous_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Family Wine", "The contents of the bottle are blue and taste\nof Blueberries and vanilla! It is wine...", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Homecooked Broth", "", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Drink Ideas", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Creature of the Depth I", "A large chunk of the colossus octopus that\nattacked Sutica. Oddly enough, this flesh\nseemed quite withered away. It didn't look to\ntasty, or even taste good if one were to cook\nit. Maybe it was enough to make one throw\nup... Eugh...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("A Mushroom: Bite Not Included", "", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Cask of Jakubian Ale", "A heavy cask filled with a dark and pungent\nale, tasting of hops and earth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chumpchump.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Lips of Autumn", "An interesting concoction of nightglow,\nserpents stalk, saffvil, miner's helmet and\ncorvisange, along with some hard rum! It\nwould seem quite thick, along with a pungent\nsmell of sweetness topped with a bitter\naftersmell. The drink would take a purple hue\ndue to its contents. Drinking this would be\nfatal, however its best use is probably on a\nblade. [[Contact VengefulLucifer OOC for more\ninfo]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Armoured Elf.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("RRu LUu", "A fairly sizeable glass bottle with life\ngrowing in it! There would appear to be grass\ngrowing ontop of rocks, along with water\ndripping down onto a sprouting seed.\nMiniature clouds span the ecosystem and worms\nwould appear fond of the oncoming drizzle. If\nyou look hard enough, a small grotto filled\nwith a tiny pond lays tucked away in the\nlandscape.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ascanius.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Medical Salve Bandage", "It would appear to be a moderately size\nbandage with a hound sewn into it. It would\nseem that the bottom side of the bandage is\ncovered in vertical strips of Blissfoil\nsalve, Corvisange and Atheros salve for the\nbest pain relief and healing properties in\nthe land. One would begin to feel numb in the\napplied area and would feel a strong sense of\ntheir pain being nulled.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Hound Druid] Ascanius.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Forever Flowers", "A trio of red tulips made from felt. They\nfeel very soft and at a glance look like the\nreal thing.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Evergreen Kuila", "A translucent green shard, one which glows\npassively almost like a heartbeat. Some may\nbe able to bond with this crystal and produce\nsome interesting results.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Bryophyte's Blood", "A jar of bryophyte blood, it appears well\npreserved. This freshly spilled blood may be\napplied to metal to cause a volume one third\nthat of the applied blood to rust.\nAdditionally, plants watered with this blood\nwill grow at twice the speed of normal. All\nof this, so long as the September Prince\nwills it.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of The Deathknight Vex", "The Skull still hums with a dark aura. Let it\nnot whisper influence to the owner\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ascanius Dunlain.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Maylu", "This is a velvet puppy plushie. All\ncraftselfship is of the highest quality. The\ncloth is masterfully dyed a striking pink.\nThis object is adorned with lilac hearts. On\nthe plushie is an inscription. The\ninscription reads \"Love is forever.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist's Hand", "(Common) A hand recovered from a display case\nin a cultist of Vilketa's layer. This hand's\nfingers are all the same length, the hand\nclearly once belonging to a Dwarf.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("Harpy's Claw", "A Harpy Claw recoverd from a servant of\nVilketa. The claw was severed from a\nbeastmaster's harpy after it had been shot\ndown.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("Onyxheart Direbrew (1672 vintage)", "A sizzling, orange-ish bottle of ale that has\na sulphuric, metallic scent. The direbrew is\nas strong as the magma it looks like and has\na distinct taste from the steel barrels in\nwhich it was fermented.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Luminous Shard", "(Common) A sharp of glass obtained from a\npool of water in the Deeproads. It is blue\nand emits a faint light.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Deeproads Key", "(Key) A strange misshapen golden key that is\nlined with several scratched out letters. Its\npeculiar shape would not appear to fit any\nstandard Dwarven lock.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Stone", "A slab of volcanic stone harvested from the\nDeeproads. While still warm, it has cooled\nenough to touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:magma", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Weed", "One large marijuana, sir!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by mindrot.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Salve Bandages", "A small bag filled with a white bandage that\nhas been neatly wrapped and stored inside the\nclosed back to keep sterile. The bag was\neasily ripped through and the bandage inside\nwas made of a tough cloth material that had a\ngreenish tint on the inside of it, if the\ninside was to meet small and medium wounds it\nwould halt bleeding and cause small cuts to\nform back together and heal up, although it\nleaves the area stiff and hard to move.\n[Message ZachsSlayer for any help needed.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:white_carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Staff", "A six foot long ironwood quarterstaff,\nperfect for delivering blunt damage from a\ndecent range. Odd tribal markings are carved\ninto the staff's shaft, turning it's basic\nlook into something fascinating!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blunt Wraps", "Oddly glossy paper designed for the wrapping\nof suspiciously rancid plant life.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by mindrot.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pristine Parchment", "A sheet of pure parchment, it's color a\ngentle white. It serves as a reminder for the\nfuture, crisp and blank, waiting to be\nwritten.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Poison Ivy", "An infamous, easily identifiable weed known\nfor miles around as a camper's worst\nnightmare. Contact with the herb causes a\npainful, itchy reaction which lasts about a\nweek. Worst of all, it's a fairly common\nsight around temperate forests!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Faei.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Wagon Chair", "The device would have a chair made out of a\nsingle carved chunk of spruce. On either side\nof the chair would rest two three foot wheels\nakin to wagon wheels, the outerband of them\ncovered in iron for durability. From the\nbottom of the chair would jut out four\nlegs', two forward and two backwards. The\nlegs are short enough to avoid impeding the\nwheels however long enough to avoid the user\nbeign able to fall forward or backwards", "minecraft:spruce_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Dove Pin", "An ivory pin carved into the shape of a dove.\nA tiny pale blue sapphire creates a\nglittering eye. It carries a silver olive\nleaf in it's beak.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Altered_Ruler", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gul-san's baked tater", "A baked potato, made by Gul-san with a strong\ndrug that makes one fall asleep after even a\nfew bites, but the drug was hidden and\ntasteless!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemists shears", "A simple tool used by most Alchemists for\ntheir Herb gathering needs. The clippers\nblades are made of gold and are quite sharp\non the cutting edges.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Torn Paper", "(Common) Torn pieces of paper recovered from\na cultist of Vilketa's layer. The words on\nthe pages seem to be in another language, and\nentirely indecipherable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Green Doink", "A moderate amount of Cactus Green rolled into\na tube, with a smoking paper coiled around\nit. The paper has a sticky consistency, and\nseems to have been saturated in the\npowder-like 'kief' of the cacti's flower-bud.\nAt the tip, a glob of distilled oil from the\nplant is present, and is extremely pungent.\nThe cacti cigarolli offers a pleasant,\nstrong, and soothing smoke.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bolon Stormtaker.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("BOI", "", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Tharrax's Claw", "This claw would feel cold to the touch, the\ntalons of razor-sharp bone still just as\nbloodied as when they first assaulted the\nLands of Atlas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Designer Swamp Shoes", "Pure luxury. The leather of many rats would\nbe stitched together beautifully. While\nwearing these, you go from about a 3.5-5 to a\nsolid 7.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Yekekar Figurine", "The figure would stand at a height of 20cm,\nsturdy in nature as the general shape be of a\ndwarf. The figurine would be battered in a\nroyal tunic unlike those seen previously\nit'll give off a humble look yet a stern\nstricture of authority. Near the bottom it'll\nbe marked with a series of dwarven runes, if\none could read them spelling the name\nYemekar.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Collectable Armakak Figurine", "An expertly crafted figurine of Armakak\nholding a large sack of coins in one hand and\na scale in another. Part of the Brathmordakin\ncollectable set. First Edition.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by High Prelate Nerak Frostbeard.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Collectable Dungrimm Figurine", "An expertly crafted figurine of Dungrimm\nwielding a large battlehammer, and a\nKaz’Ulrah shield. Part of the Brathmordakin\ncollectable set. First Edition.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by High Prelate Nerak Frostbeard.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Non-Agression Pact", "This treaty is a non-aggression pact, formed\nbetween The Trade Federation Of Sutica and\nThe Kadarsi Sultanate. It details in\nbeautiful calligraphy the specifications of\nthe agreement between the two nations. Signed\nby both parties, it is part of a two item\nset.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoked Lamb", "A fresh piece of smoked lamb. A hint of\ngarlic and pepper is evident to those with a\nkeen scent of smell. Although the majority of\nit is cooked well-done, it seems to be\ncharred at the edges from overcooking.\nHopefully you like your meat crispy!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Quen Flyer", "Quen is a deckbuilding strategy card game.\nYou can finds cards and a place to play here!\n[!] A map is drawn. ((x1157 z-1711))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azureth.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("~+= Homemade Hot Cocoa =+~", "A warm bowl of hot cocoa lays infront of you,\nfilled to the brim with a steaming hot\nchocolate brown liquid. It smells of natural\ncocoa and a tiny bit of mint, making it\nrefreshing and warming.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Antoinette de Hartcold.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("look at my name, then ur hair", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by hrasion.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A White Cane", "A white cane is used by many people who are\nblind or visually impaired. Primarily it aids\nits user to scan their surroundings for\nobstacles or orientation marks, but is also\nhelpful for other traffic participants in\nidentifying the user as blind or visually\nimpaired and taking appropriate care.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A Blind Man.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cypress and Bronze Harpoon", "A 2 meter long spear like weapon made of\ncypress wood, with a bronze head. The head of\nthe harpoon bears a notable 'arrow' shape to\nit, with it's edges sharpened. The haft of\nthe harpoon is made of cypress wood, treated\nwith olive, and boiled linseed oil, giving it\na somewhat glossy finish. The harpoon bears a\nsmall hole on the base of the haft, as to tie\nrope through. The bronze the head of the\nharpoon is made from has been well shined,\nmaking it quite lustrous under light. The\nharpoon is somewhat light, weighing roughly a\nkilogram and a half. The harpoon is shorter\nthan a standard spear, and seems better\nsuited to be thrown.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharajyr Pelt", "The miniscule pelt of a youthful Kha'Cheetra,\nit was speckled in small brown dots, the rest\nof the fur holding a tan hue. The pelt looked\nto be the perfect size to be made into\napparell, a scarf maybe. ((Kha Skinned:\nItadia)).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by YouLoveMe.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blade of Protection", "This blade was made to protect Danika", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Practice Sword", "A small wooden sword. Great care went into\nit's carving. Minute details are present,\nshowing great effort was involved in making\nthe tool looke like a real steel blade.\nSmooth, and with a honey-gold hue, it was the\nperfect fit for a child.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiny Blade", "A standard looking shortsword with a soft\nsnakeskin grip. Its pommel is comprised of\npure steel, while its sharp blade is made up\nof an aurum and steel alloy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheTri.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Clay Hammer", "This hammer seems to be covered in hardened\nclay. The form suggest that it was forged in\nancient times. Maybe a skilled archeologist\ncan uncover the ancient tool from the clay...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Roasted Elk", "Cooked slowly over a flame, the meat is a\nlittle charred on the outside but soft and\njuicy on the inside. Herbs and spices give it\na lovely, earthy taste.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Mulled Wine", "A flask of a deep red liquid, scented with\nspices. Good either hot, or cold.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Potion of Healing", "A remedy--red in color--for moderate wounds\nsuch as stab injuries or 2nd degree burns.\nSimply apply the substance to the injury, and\nit will accelerate the healing process\nexponentially, provided it's not too grave.\nWhile the healing transpires, the area will\nbe rendered completely useless (1 irp hour).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of Babble", "A seemingly ordinary ferrum ring possessed by\na muddlegeist. When worn the user is rendered\nincapable of comprehensive speech: spewing\ngibberish with no meaning nor translation to\nthose around them, though within their own\nmind speaking perfect sense. It seems to have\nno effect on undead users, however.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheKingOfTheMoon.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cast Bronze Hook", "A somewhat heavy hook made of cast bronze.\nThe bronze the hook is made from is well\nshined, and is somewhat lustrous under light.\nThe hook is somewhat heavy, weighing roughly\n2 kilograms. The hook is roughly a foot long,\nwith a large circular ring on it's base,\nwhether for hanging on something, or for a\nrope or chain. The point of the hook is dull,\nthough it does come to a mild point. The hook\nis surprisingly smooth, seemingly having been\nsanded thouroughly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Snakefish", "A normal looking, rotting fish that releases\na repungent scent. If anyone were to make\ncontact with the fish, it would seem to\nwiggle and come to life! ((PM Voidal for full\ninfo", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactusfish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandfish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Tounguefish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Stonefish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Ribbontail", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghoulfish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cowfish", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Warstaff", "When he took the field himself, the General\nbore a demon-visaged staff shaped with a\nnumber of protrusions and barbs designed for\ntripping, disarming, and dismounting his\nopponents. Witnesses described the General\nmoving through armies like a b\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HeliosDeWeird.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Birthday Card", "The exterior of the card seems to be a\ndepiction of a forest with a rabbit and a\nhedgehog infront of a tree. The two animals\nand their surroundings are drawn with thick\nblack lines, yet are uncolored. Upon opening\nthe card, a few mina would fall out,\nalongside a few wax crayons. In bold bright\ntext the interior of the card reads \"ＨＡＰＰＹ\nＢＩＲＴＨＤＡＹ ＣＡＤＥＲＹＮ!", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Raffle Ticket", "The raffle ticket is marked with the number 3\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Irawyn.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Note", "The People of Fenn have pushed out our kind\nwith their heretic laws. Unless the Council\nof Fenn kneels to Our Kind, they shall\nSuffer\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Card", "Have a safe and merry Krugsmas ~ The Sky\nLords Above\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth", "The cloth has an embroidered 'Merry Krugsmas\non it. It appears someone missed the memo of\nKrugsmas' date.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sim's Baby", "A small fluffy cat with beady eyes filled\nwith joy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Orb", "You feel slightly uncomfortable as you gaze\nupon the orb...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StoIas.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cigar", "Premium tobacco, if lit up it's smoke fills\nup your nostrils with a hint of chocolate", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Essense of Cerridwen", "A beautiful, ornately decorated wooden vial\ncontaining fresh spring water- a sign of\nrebirth in the Aspectist faith.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Chi-Chi's Cat Herb Bag", "A cat shaped bag stuffed full of various\nhealing herbs. It having cute paws that\ndangle and it opens from the back.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclops' Fingers", "The thick, meaty fingers of Clugor the\nCyclops. They're filthy and smell of rotten\nflesh. Why did you take these anyways..?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Clugor the Cyclops.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspectist Incense Sticks", "Colourful incense sticks, when burned they\ngive off a lavender scent. Meant to be placed\nin front of shrines, or homes, for the Animal\nspirit's favour.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Quartz", "A sizable chunk,\nof raw nether quartz", "minecraft:quartz_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("Lightfre", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("You've been struck by a Smooth Criminal", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Vodka Milk", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of Manaflow", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Romance Novel", "The cover reads \"Forbidden Magic: The\nWarrior's Embrace\". Be prepared to be swept\noff your feet and into the romance between\nArmolas the elven warrior, and the young mage\nMandalf. Definitely not for children. The\nstory isn't very good.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Tome of Construction", "This ancient tome contains schematics and\northographic drawings of many buildings,\nstructures, and monuments, all of Elven\ndesign. At the end of the book would be a\nisometric drawing of a beautiful city, filled\nwith trees, houses, and great government\nbureaus. Upon this last page in the bottom\nright corner would be the written name and\nsignature 'Elrith Searith'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PlusOneMorale.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Maehr'sae Hiylun'ehya!", "You are Mali'aheral; blessed at birth --\nblood reverent. Your ancestors built and\ncarried forth what was to become Haelun'or:\nthe grand Silver State. It requires you to do\nyour duty and seek out Haelun'or again; for\nMaehr'sae Hiylun'ehya!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aythyinae.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bugpuff Red", "This is an eel scale bag, containing powdered\nbugpuff hyphae. It smells pungent, and tastes\nbitter and meaty. It may be smoked or\nvaporized to produce psychotropic effects.\nThese manifest as laziness, increased\nappetite, relaxation, and sleepiness. It can\nbe used to aid in Farseer spirit-walking, and\nis often used as an offering to the spirits.\nIts effects last for two Krug's hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Reinforced Rope", "The rope would be layered using a finely\nwoven spider silk, much stronger than the\naverage rope.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Mammoth Tusk", "The ivory tusks of a large mammoth, yellowed\nand brittle, chips and scratches upon them\nfrom various points in the creature's life.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("^RED^ Cool sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kutuhith Paste", "A canister of thick white paste, made from\ncrushed Kutuhith herbs. It is often smeared\non clothes to fireproof them- you can never\nbe to safe!", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Reminder", "Please ensure that you are replanting the CT\nfields after every harvest you do. Thank you\n-TarreBear\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TarreBear.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sheet Music", "An orginially composed, but untitled piece\nwith a slow melody. It would be rather simple\nfor new musicians to play, as it does not\nhave a complex range of notes. It seems to\nspecifically written for the lyre, although\ncould be on any instrument . The initials OT\nwould be on the bottom right corner of the\npage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Olivia Thorn.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarf Piss", "This bottle is filled with a Dwarf's urine", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Uruk Hide ☼Ireheart Quality☼", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Nerve Damage Remedy Cake", "", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Adoption Papers Colette", "These papers certify that Valor Vanvilith is\nthe legal guardian of Colette [!] The paper\nis stamped by Awaiti Aureon", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Leather Pouch", "A small red pouch with a somewhat heart shape\nto it. It is well tanned leather, with a\nslight sheen to it. It bears 2 brown buttons\nas to keep it closed when wanted, and a\nsingle leather strap well sewn into the top\ntwo corners of the pouch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:beetroot", ""),
        StaticItem("Mud Ruith", "An enhanced, and highly potent\nhallucinogenic. Even sniffing the clipped\nherb causes one to reel back in shock if\ncaught unaware. However, when ingested as its\nherb form or through smoke, it will cause\nintense visions, whispers, and some say even\ncalls from the Aspects themselves.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:green_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield of the Swampgoth", "A shield gained from the corpse of Fort\nStronk's swampgoth. In the battle of the Nice\nRoads, 9th of the Sun's Smile, 1667.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Frozen Fire", "A potion with a faint green glow that emits a\nmild chill. If brought near a heat source,\nsuch as a torch or direct exposure from the\nsun, it will combust--thus it is best to keep\ncovered when it's being carried. If\nshattered, the substance will burn with near\nthe intensity of the legendary alchemists\nfire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A gift.", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Maheral's Reserve 1641", "A sweet white wine of a deep yellow color,\nthe richness of its taste lingers in the\nmouth for some time after consumption\noffering a pleasant well rounded finish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kuila Dust", "A standard jam jar filled with a pale,\nfaintly-red crystalline dust. The dust itself\nis quite fine, though the granules twinkle\nunder light. Should a Druid utilize their\nGifts while touching the dust, it would glow\nwith a light akin to the pale red of the dust\nitself. The jar is sealed with a cork bung.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelin Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Kuila Crystal Chunk", "It’s said that when a Druid utilizes their\nability the crystal begins to hum with life\nand emit a glow at the intensity of its user.\nThis one came from the corpse of a Imp, some\nof its flesh still within the piece...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Heavy Warhammer", "Within your hands lays a veritable behemoth\nof a weapon. This dire bonebreaker seems\nfitting for destroying armour and skeletal\ntargets. The pole-end of the weapon would\nhave a armour-piercing tip upon it, perfect\nfor being slammed through armour of an\nunsuspecting fool who was deserving of such a\nfate. An exquisite carving of the Silver Stag\nwould be upon the pole of the warhammer,\nreferencing where the masterwork weapon had\ncome from. A true warlord's weapon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by IronLich.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eiderdown", "Eiderdown is a rare and sought-after\nsubstance renowned for its unrivaled softness\nand warmth. It is known to be found as far\ninto the arctic south as the Yatl Wasteland,\nin coastal areas where thousands of birds\nflock in the summer to feast upon the\nbountiful marine life exposed by the melted\nice. The Eider birds spend all their nesting\nperiod plucking warm down from their chests,\nand filling their nests with it to keep their\nclutch warm. A very difficult material to\nobtain...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Thin Paintbrush", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Grey Present", "A long, slim object wrapped in silvery-white\nmuslin cloth. The parcel is nearly six feet\nin length and an initial guess might suggest\nit was a polearm or the like. The cloth is\nheld tightly together by a cloth ribbon,\nmetallic gold in colour. It's finished by a\nnice bow. A Druid would sense a whisper of\nlife from within.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("⚝ Mordring's Oblivion [T5] ⚝", "Large shield of the forces of Mordring, once\nit was corrupted but now the corruption has\nbeen burned away by the ethereal flame of the\nArchaengul and infused with white soulfire,\nwhich causes that if a corrupted being dares\nto touch it, the shield would ignite in holy\nflames that would burn the corrupted tissues\nand cause an unbearable pain. ((PM Suxals for\nmore infornation))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Raven Feathers", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiva Wreath of Winter and Regality", "This masterly-crafted flower wreath is fit to\nbe worn on the head, symbolizing the location\nof Amaethons horns. It is strung with\nMyosotis', Gladiolus', Peonies and Daisies.\nTraditionally, it has been woven to celebrate\nthe Winter Solstice, however the flowers\nsymbolizes the stag Mani Amaethon, his\nqualities, and traditional offerings towards\nhim.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Taliame'onn.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Stone", "Gem akin to amber that grows in places where\ndivine energy is present, it would absorb\nsuch energy and turn it into light, storing\nit within itself. Light Stones can be used to\nenergize and recharge items created with holy\nalteration.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("《 Chain of Redemption [T5] 》", "Long chain of almost 4 meters, it has a sharp\nblade in one of the ends and a heavy sphere\nin the other, the sphere would have carved an\ninfused ideogram with the shape of a shield\nmade of aurum. If a dark being dares to touch\nthe chain they chain they would start to feel\ntired as vermillion soulfire is invoked along\nthe chain, draining their energy and probably\neven making them fall in come if the contact\nis extended. ((PM Suxals for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Cast Bronze Collar Necklace", "A necklace made of various cast bronze\nsegments held together with 2 leather chords,\nmade to be tied around one's neck as\njewelery. The segments of the necklace are\nrectangular, roughly two inches tall, and one\ninch wide. The bronze segments seem to be\ncurved inward slightly, as to fit the\ncurvature of the neck. There is 11 bronze\nsegments in total, with the center segment\nbearing a single circular stone of heliotrope\nin the center. The bronze the necklace is\nmade from has been well shined, making it\nquite lustrous under light. The necklace is\nmade in a choker design, as to be held\ntightly against the middle or base of one's\nneck. The necklace's 2 chords are quite long\nenough as to allow it to be tied on most any\nneck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:hopper", ""),
        StaticItem("Kite Shield of Embers", "Kite shield with ornaments made of aurum, it\nwould have a sharp edge on the upper side and\nan ideogram with the shape of a shield on the\ninner side, which would cause the shield to\nignite in golden soulfire if a being of\ncorrupted nature enters in direct contact\nwith the shield. Burning their tissues and\ncausing an unbearable pain ((PM Suxals for\nmore information.))", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell Bracelet", "A bracelet made from a simple leather cord\nand a collection of shells. Laid out the\nbracelet is half a foot in length, each shell\npierced and braided into the main cord. The\nshells vary in color from speckled white and\nbrown to ones with arcs of blue and gray,\neach shell has been polished to a shine. For\nevery fifth shell there is a ovular cobalt\nglass bead, and near the center is a teardrop\nbead of the same make, hanging as a\ncenterpiece framed by two white shells.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Angler] Alken.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("The Bane of Abominations [T5]", "Morningstar that consists of a sphere of dark\nferrum with several spikes around it,\nattached to a handle of dark wood decorated\nwith lines of silver through a very resistant\nchain. On one of the sides of the sphere a\ngolden ideogram infused with ruinous soulfire\nwould be seen. If the sphere or its spikes\nenter in direct contact with corrupted matter\nit would light in golden soulfire, which\nwould burn anything considered corrupted by\nAeriel. (PM Suxals for more info.)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Bracelet", "A bracelet carved from the bones of a\nSeptember-Bonded human. It is decorated with\ncarvings of short elven prayers, and carvings\nthat were just there for good looks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelin.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("¡THE ENEMA!", "An all purpose machete that is 17 inches in\nlength and a tenth of an inch thick. It’s\naccompanied by a dullish blue eel skinned\nscabbard. The hilt of the weapon is made out\nof Orcish ivory and dark oak. It is wrapped\nand bound by dark leather. The dark oak\npommel of the hilt would be in the shape of a\nwolf’s head snarling. On the heavy spine area\nof the blade by the hilt is the engraving\n‘Cali’.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caliban.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Krummavisur Feather", "A hefty, yet slender black feather plucked\nfrom an enormous winged screamer. It seems to\nbe well kept with very smooth follicles.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:black_carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Elven Blade", "The blade is etched with an intricate elvish pattern.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMeguzara approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Dagger of Aurelion", "A short, lightweight aurum dagger with\ndelicate intricate swirls etched into the\nsharp blade. The blade has the word \"Hope\netched into it's edge, While the handle of\nthe dagger is wrapped in a fine, tanned\nleather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Large open Oysters", "Succulent Oysters with a slight salty taste,\ncleaned to remove grit and slides smoothly\ndown the throat. A slight creamyness is\npresent, almost like they were dipped in\nmilk.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Baron's Hook", "", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Brokenblend", "This is an eel scale bag, containing powdered\nbugpuff hyphae, powdered ponderlot petals,\nbog decoction, and cave lobster blood. It\nsmells sweet and savory, and tastes like\nrotten meat. It may be smoked to produce\npsychotropic effects. These manifest as\nhallucinations, relaxation, hypersensitivity,\nand reduced libido. It is commonly used to\nspirit-walk, and as an offering to nature\nspirits. Its effects last for four Krug's\nhours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Lapis Dust", "A bottle of pure lapis lazuli grinded down\ninto a fine, deep blue powder. Great for dye\nmaking!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bardic Kush", "Ruu's Magical Kush!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DiscoLiquid.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawke Violin", "A small violin along with a bow with a small\nhair for making music on it.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Sunflower Circlet", "Bright and charming, this headband crafted\npainstakingly of sunflowers and daffodils\nwill brighten anyone's appearance. The\ndelightful smell of the flowers it was\ncreated from wafts from the wearer as they\nmove.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lyadrian Des'Nox.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Bow", "A finely crafted bow made from well tempered\nIronwood. The bow was created to work only\nfor Tayna and would be awkward for anyone\nelse to weild. Along the wood, jasmine vines\nwere carved into it as well as several\nbeautifully carved sparrows.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Sturdy Dried Grass Rope", "The rope itself seems to be made out of dried\ngrass which is able to withstand a lot of\nforce without breaking. The thickness of the\nthe rope is around 2'7 inches.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aewion Silma.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Goodie Box of the Ancestors", "All the essentials necessary to feel more in\ntune with a world beyond our own! Inside this\nsmall spruce box would accompany an array of\ntraditional dark elven goodies, such as:\nDes'Nox Dank, Xayarath Dreamsnare, a small\nback of Khel'igne crystal mushrooms, and a\nflask of Uuthlini Blueberry Lager.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Readicti.", "minecraft:crafting_table", ""),
        StaticItem("Engagement Ring", "An Expertly made Engagement Ring, Sculpted\nfrom Fine Quartz. The Body of the Ring would\nbe Polished with a smooth Varnish, leaving it\nboth Physically and Visually Appealing.\nTopping the Ring would be a Beautiful\nDiamond, leaving the piece both Simple, yet\nStunning.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Golden Stag Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("DOWN WITH THE CARRION H E G E M O N Y", "Storm King Propaganda!", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bamboo Panflute", "A well-made panflute, composed of\nthick bamboo segments held together\nby wool string. If treated well, it will\nlast for a long time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roxforbraynz.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Salvian Wisteria Sapling", "A specially preserved sapling that was bred\nfrom the wisteria trees from Anthos. When\nplanted, the tree takes 4 to 5 years to\nbloom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:acacia_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar Kush", "The dried bud of dark green plantlife sticks\nto your fingers like sap fresh from a tree.\nHair thin tendrils of a light blue color\nweave through the plant. A strong aroma\nassails your nose as you hold it. When\nsmoked, a sickly sweet aroma burns in the\nback of your throat and the faint taste of\nsugar clings to your mouth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:dye", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_14(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Humtouch", "The dried bud of dark green plantlife sticks\nto your fingers like sap fresh from a tree.\nHair thin tendrils of a dark green weave\nthrough the plant. A strong aroma assails\nyour nose as you hold it. When smoked, an\nearthy aroma burns in the back of your throat\nand the faint taste of blueberries clings to\nyour mouth. This green would calm and relax\nthe user.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Droquar Bone Fragment", "This bit of bone came from something long\ndeceased, quite the ancient creature. The\nfragment was broken off of a much larger\npiece of the deceased monster.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer Steel Ingot", "This ingot is a yellow-bronze hue, and is an\nalloy of gold and steel, known as Slayer\nSteel. The metal itself is damaging to\nSpooks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Vegetable & Chicken Curry", "A spicy and delicious curry made for a dinner\ndate, yum!", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Sewing Needle", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Storm's edge", "This blade was forged in Kaz'ad Barakir by\nthe runelord's the blade when activated by\ntouch would encase itself in lighting and\nwhen coming into contact with another object\nat the blade's edge it would hit that object\nwith the power of raw lighting [uses 2-3\nbefore refuling at the city] [pm for use\noverlord8000]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Crystal", "Seems to be a unremarkable, low quality\ncrystal, dug up from the ground somewhere.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by neopsychedelia.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("»Chisa Katana«", "The short blade would be made of carbon\nsteel, with an iron fuller. The bade would\nhave sharp edges slightly curving inward to\nthe central ridge of the blade. The point of\nthe blade would be fairly sharp following the\nblade curve with a flat sharp edge. The\npommel of the katana would be made of oak\nwood, with fox hide wrapped around it. The\npommel would have the head of a lion carved\ninto it with the initials Leo.A. carved into\nthe side of the hilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Leona Amori.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Doll", "A small doll, with bright red yawn for hair.\nIt's painted on eyes are violet, and an\napproximation of a devious grin is it's\nexpression. In green leggings and shirt.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Pod'yem [T4 Emberthorn]", "You hold in your hand a divine weapon. On the\nhilt are an arrangement of crystal embers\nthat form an ideogram. If one of pure soul\nactivates it, the edges of this blade will\nignite with serrated ethereal flames of\nindigo colour. These flames are excellent at\ncarving through corrupted flesh and may\nignite it with prolonged contact. Killing a\ndark creature will incinerate the corpse and\ncharge the ideogram. ((Contact White_Wolf))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("✠ Marked Sword [T5] ✠", "Arcane I\nSteel sword with ornates in silver, the hilt\nwould be made of aurum and an ideogram would\nbe carved on middle of it, if it is tapped it\nwould invoke a dense layer of soulfire along\nit's blade with small thorns of the same\nethereal energy. ((PM Suxals for more\ninformation))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Bolt", "A crossbow bolt rests here, set with deep\ngrooves in the tip and with a strange blue\nmixture flowing from it, exuding a sense of\ncold. Within the channels of the expertly\ncrafted bolthead, rests the potion known as\nFrost Oil. If one were to be shot by this\nbolt, they would find the afflicted area\naround the entry wound beginning to freeze\nover, and if the bolt were not removed,\nfrostbite would soon set into the tissue and\nflesh of the area.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Fire Bolt", "A crossbow bolt rests here, set with deep\nchannel grooves in the tip. From within the\ngrooves eeks out a peculiar red liquid. If\nthis bolt were to be fired and impact flesh,\na feeling of bubbling flesh and singed skin\nwould begin to arise from the location of the\ninjury, debilitating the individual around\nthe area shot. Most effective against magii\ndue to the large amount of pain that would be\ninflicted. This could be counteracted with\nfrostvine or other such reagents.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Winterleaf Hurdy-Gurdy", "This instrument resembles a violin with the\nneck folded back over the body through a\nkeybox, with 24 keys protruding from the\nside. There is a crank on the bottom and a\nwheel protruding from the body, which when\nturned causes the three drone strings to play\na constant, deep, rich tone. The keys change\nthe tone of the three melody strings, and\nprovide a deeper, violin-like sound. The body\nhas faint engravings of trees and fields, the\nWinterleaf craftsman's symbol on the\nunderside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Austere Whetstone", "A simple, blocky whetstone of basic quality,\nused for sharpening various blades and\nknives. An intrinsic item, useful for any\nwhose profession revolves around a blade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Painted Clay Jar", "A odd, tall-fishbowl shaped jar made of clay,\npainted with an odd, bronze paintjob.\nSomething about it seems old, as if the\ndesign was from the days when aenguls and\ndaemons walked the earth. Its lid seems to\nsit atop it loosely, though it is held atop\nit with a yellow ribbon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Poppy Wreath", "A wreath of red poppies large enough to wear\non one's head, shoulders or hip", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Gabbro Ring", "A ring made of bronze, inlaid with a single\npolished gabbro stone, made for the purpose\nof being worn on one's finger. The bronze the\nring is made from is well polished and is\nquite lustrous under light. The ring itself\nseems to've been cast in one part, and bears\na consistant edge, as if it was cut out from\nthe middle of a pipe, though it's inner\ncorner', or edge has been filed down\nslightly, ensuring it is not abbrassive to be\nput on. The ring is inlaid with a circular,\nflat, polished grey and black stone of black\ngranite, or gabbro.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Plant", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Betharuz Charm", "A small, hand-forged charm in the shape of a\nsmall lump of cactus with small, blunt spikes\nprotruding, the basis for the drug Cactus\nGreen. Made by Serevik Isilioleth in fond\nmemory of the construction of the Betharuz\nshrine in Velunor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serevik Isilioleth.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Charm", "A plain aurum charm with a hydra insignia\nembedded within.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yung_N_Hung.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Star", "At least you tried.\" is carved into the side\nof this mini-golden star.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantSoup.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Hartshorn", "While not an herb, hartshorn commonly finds\nits place in the company of medicus and\nalchemists for its ammonic nature, capable of\nresuscitating fallen individuals from\nfainting and jump-starting respiratory\nfunction. In alchemy, it represents a weak\nsymbol of life for its ability to revive\nfallen men. The ground form of a proud hart's\nantlers, with many uses if in trained hands,\nfrom chefs to healers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Flormai Purple Plush Pillow™", "A plush, velvet pillow. Adorned with the\ninsignia of the Flormai, the pillow is one of\nthe few Flormai keepsakes remaining from the\ntime of Asulon.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Empty Creature Jars", "A Jar that once held a Creature within its\nbody through an Unknown Magic. The Jar would\nbe made out of a Hardened Glass, with a\npurple tint.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Potion of Sleeping", "A strong concoction that could knock\nindividuals out with just the smell if their\nbodies weren't prepared for the scent. This\npotion, unless consumed by something as big\nas a hardy orc, will likely make someone fall\nstraight asleep upon drinking it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Spear", "A six foot staff of hardwood, tipped with a\nthick, foot long leaf blade of aurum. The\nmetal has an odd sheen to it perhaps dulling\nit to resemble yellow iron. Its head is very\nconductive of lightning and possesses a\nstrong magnetic property with other aurum\nobjects.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Clockwork Crossbow MK II", "A seemingly mundane compact crossbow were it\nnot for the cogs and chains latched beside\nit. A keyhole appears beneath the breast of\nthe weapon, a winding key in place beside it.\nWhen fully wound the mechanism can support\ntwo semi-automated 'cocks' of the weapon by\nflick of a lever buried in the stock. Upon\nthe side of the stock sits a rune of silence;\nas a result the weapon is incapable of\nproducing sound.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mordu.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Dyed Frog Piss", "The urine of the common frog, mixed with red\ndye.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mordu.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharajyr Prayer Rock", "A simple looking carved rock. The smoothed\nstone would have a simply phrase scrawled\ninto one side of it in Va'kha. The letters\nwould be painted with a very light blue dye\nto give them a sky blue color meshing with\nthe marbled gray river rock.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Potion Bag", "A large bag with a flap to open it. There's a\nfew small pockets at its side and one would\ncarry this on their shoulder.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cleansing Incense", "A potion that produces a very pleasant smell\nwhen it's exposed to air. This potion is not\nto be consumed, however. if one were to drink\nit, they'd likely fall ill.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Freezing Salve", "A concoction that can keep someone hydrated\ngoing through deserts or other hot\nenvironments.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fast Acting Tippen's Root", "A faster-acting and more potent version of\nthe common Tippen's Root potion. This brew is\nthe favored among soldiers on the\nbattlefield, capable of quickly stopping\nbleeding and closing medium-sized cuts and\nstab wounds with little repercussions except\na brief moment of tiredness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Glue Oil", "A white oil that's very sticky after applied\nto something. it is often used among builders\nand can be used to patch a hole or bind two\nobjects together.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chillblain", "A blue potion that will cause the user to\ntransform blue and a rough, scaley texture.\nWhen its effects are active, one will be\nresistant to fire, although will be slowed to\nsome extent during its duration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Blood", "A blue potion that's cold to the touch. Also\nknown as \"Liquid Bandage,\" this concoction\nwill react to blood, freezing it into a\nfoam-like substance instantly as it makes\ncontact with it, acting like a bandage to\nwhatever bleeding wound it's applied to.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Potion of Acuity", "A green concoction that significantly\nimproves all senses and even reflexes to some\nextent. Afterward, the senses will\npractically diminish, and will take a small\nwhile to recover.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Toxicity", "The potion, seemingly darker and more twisted\nthan the others, is a pretty dark purple\ncolor. If poured upon any organic matter,\nplant, animal, or descendant, anything\nconsidered 'alive', it would almost instantly\nsour' it. As in, expire it like milk, making\nit inedible and almost intolerable to be\naround, filling the room with it's putrid\nsmell. If poured on something still alive,\nlike a person, they would recover their usual\nform in around half an elven hour.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Salad", "This potion seems much more mundane than the\nother. It seems a very light, happy green\ncolor. When consumed, for an entire elven\nhour straight, the user would crave salad\nwith every fiber of their being. It would be\nhorrifying. They would do anything (rule\nallowed) to acquire salad. Use with caution.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Deafening", "This potion, a light grey color in tone,\nwould slosh around quietly in it's bottle.\nWhen consumed, the user would hear a loud\npop', and then, would lose their hearing\nentirely! For the next ten elven minutes, the\nuser of the potion would be effectively deaf.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Chestplate", "A Chestplate made of Steel, Pretty Hard, and\nDecently Heavy. a Gauntlet attached to it,\nthe Gauntlet is a Outer Shell of a Golem\nHand, kept together by a Mending Potion.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("An Elk, Carved of Marble", "", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("❤ Cherry Folly ❤", "A decadent, indulgent cherry mead. Fermented\nwith honey, cherries, and raspberries, the\npotent alcohol of the drink is masked well\nunder the delicious, sweet flavors. The\nbottle is signed with a single red bee. ☤\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Atlas' #1 Baker] Esther Lester.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Majestic", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｃｈｅｒｒｙｗｏｏｄ Ｂｅａｒ Ｆｉｇｕｒｉｎｅ", "A carved figurine of a bear made of weathered\ncherry wood. The bear from tail to snout is 5\ninches long, and from foot to shoulder is 2\ninches tall. The bear is carved with a\nnotable brow ridge, yet no eyes. Each of the\nbear's feet bares 4 dull claws. The wood the\nbear is carved from is a dark greyish brown,\nseeming to have been treated with multiple\noils over long periods of time. The bear's\nbody is rather smooth, not seeming to have\nbeen carved with just a single carving knife.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Irawyn.", "minecraft:oak_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Frog Mask", "A rather well crafted frog mask, the lime\ngreen skin of the amphibian would be formed\nwith a fine silk fabric, whilst the exotic\npatterns of the headwear would be made from\nred dyes of poppy flowers. The back of the\nmask has two pieces of twine stitched upon\nthe oaken frame to keep it secured against\nones face. Quite a fine piece to wear to\nmasqurades and festivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mandragora Cocktail", "A druidic potion made through herblore that\nregenerates flesh and bone slowly. It is\nalcoholic.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon Tart", "A small sugar cookie in the shape of a cup,\nand filled with sweet lemon curd! The dessert\nwould be about the size of a golf ball.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Mushroom", "An edible variety, this is a tall reaching\nmushroom that resembles a trumpet. The top is\nconcave and a dull brown, while the stem is a\npale orange and covered with gills. It has a\nhusky, smoky flavour and a delicate texture.\nGood for stews!", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Flawless Diamond", "A flawless diamond mined from the Mixed\nKnolls about the size of the average human's\nindex finger width. As big as it is, it would\nnot be suitable to embed into a ring but\nwould be worth quite a lot as a treasure\nregardless. C-3 is written on the\naccompanying papers authenticating this\ndiamond.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Aewion's Seed", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald-Encrusted Khazadmar Ring", "An intricately crafted golden ring with a\nhexagonal-cut emerald seated within. The\nmetal carries a set of dwarven rules showing\nits origins from the Kaz’Ulrah forge. The\nring is suitable both for a piece of fine\njewellery and for possible enchanting.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Medvekoma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Flask", "This blueberry lager has a purplish hue and\ncarbonation from the fermentation. It has a\nrefreshing taste of blueberries, and is very\nsmooth. It contains 5.5 percent alcohol. This\nlager is the Uuthlini pride.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Catarrh.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Nuts", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Blade of Rom'Gash", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Jhaeros' Beatin Stick", "A much weathered cane, belonging to Jhaeros,\nPatriarch of Clan Flormai. A silver raven\nsits upon the handle, with carvings of vines\nwrapping around the body. Although detailed,\nthe finer intricacies have been dulled due to\nits age.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JtPvLSD.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcanic Blade", "A simmering, blue blade, awash with wisps and\nthe buzzing of a mosquito. At it's hilt lay a\nmanagem and culturally Wood Elven design.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Glineth.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Oak Walking Stick", "A simple curved walking stick, the bottom of\nthe stick has a metal device that creates a\nclapping noise when it hits something hard.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Yari", "A long narrow spear with a double-edged blade\nextending about two feet from the saft. The\nshaft itself seems to be made of dark oak and\nbears iron banding. The base of it is capped\nin iron to add balance to the Yari.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Geborgenheit.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Leather Boots", "Average leather boots that seemed to fit\nanyone. When one put these boots on, they\nwould be frozen in place and unable to walk\nanywhere, as if the boots were weighing them\ndown. However, when one held them, they were\nnot affected at all.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Iluusion stone", "A pendant with three stones, attached around\none's neck with a sturdy chain. Each stone\nchanges one aspect of someone, whether it be\nphysical, or verbal.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Cross", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Moose Antlers", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Clothing", "A Change of Clothes of which include: A Blue\nRobe, Some Pants, A Shirt with Straps, and\nOne other Clothes item. ((You can choose the\nItem it cant be military clothing, or from\nout of Kadarsi! Thanks!))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cherry Bomb", "A spherical exploding firework sized at one\nin a half inches in diameter (3.8 cm). Use\nwith caution and keep out of reach of\nchildren. VERY loud when it explodes. Safety\nfuse is unpredictable and can explode within\n10-15 seconds after igniting.", "minecraft:fireworks", ""),
        StaticItem("Grief Carrot", "They'll make you not sad!", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrub", "The planted shrub appears to dance a\nfunky jig in place.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashton's Staff", "An ash wood staff, shorter than the\naverage stave. However, it's length is\nperfect for the tiny woman who carries\nit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by morrisaye.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Raccoon Mask", "A rather well crafted raccoon mask, the\nlittle black patches of the critter would be\nmade from soft black wool hwhilst the pelt of\nthe ram would be a soft white silk . The back\nof the mask has two pieces of twine stitched\nupon the oaken frame to keep it secured\nagainst ones face. Quite a fine piece to wear\nto masqurades and festivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspect ☼ Bars", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Clump of roots and vines", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sky Blue Lily", "An effortless lily flower, adorned with sky\nblue petals. Although it may seem that its\nprepossessing features were ones most flora\nhad, it was simply sentimental to one whom\nheld it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aiden T. 'Taveira.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Hansae' Chai Tea Mix.", "A small painted pot containing a mix of\nforeign herbs and spices. Sweet to smell with\na light sting and when brewed in milk, makes\na chai that'd beat back any cold! Sweeter\nthan Crann's Muck-Honey and more wholesome\nthan a hug from your mother!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tidwald Butterboots.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Soul Resin", "", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Trophy Antlers", "A rack of imposing scale, cut from an elk\nhailing from the fells to the south. Often\ndisplayed in great number upon the mantles of\nhunters, to demonstrate their prowess in\ntheir craft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorched Dwarven Bones", "These are the remains of a human victim to a\nmutation slaughtered by the dwarves.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bruce", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Bow of the Sky Gods", "Yes\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FalconByte.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Double-edged Black Ferrum Dagger", "This small dagger resides at a length of 8\ninches. (Hilt + Blade) It seems to have been\nmade for someone of a small size, the blade\nseeming to be made of Black Ferrum. The\ninitials R.C. would be stamped into the base\nof the blade, barely visible. The blade has a\ndarkened hue while the grip seems to be\nwrapped in a fine leather. On the other side\nof the name, a small name was carved into the\ntop of the hilt: \"Sylvia\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ruben.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sharpened Rune-laden Root", "A root that has been compressed and sharpened\nby the Pine Druid. It is covered in runes,\nand sharp to the touch, never getting blunt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gigarun.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("&lDirewolf Tooth Neclace", "", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Basket of Assorted Soaps", "A small basket, containing various soaps. The\nsoaps dont appear all too scented, all\nbearing a faint, yet identifiable fruity\nsmell. Whilst they are the same in size, they\nvary in cleaning ability, and hardness, along\nwith color. They seem to be made of different\nashes and lye from various sources.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Stickball Bat", "A normal looking bat used for Stickball! If\nanyone were to come into physical contact\nwith the object, a lightness would consume\ntheir body. Soon after, their vision would\nbegin to become distorted and blurry, making\nmost far ranged things difficult to see! ((PM\nVoidal/FlamboyantVoid for more info!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Slice of Slug", "A chunk of a Giant Slug that once lived on\nCeru. The flesh is still slimey, and it even\ntwitches time to time. I hear Grilled Slug\ntastes like Chicken, wanna come over for\ndinner?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreamcatcher", "An intricate and handwoven dreamcatcher - a\nsimple means of decor. The thin ring of a\nwillow branch would neither be twister nor\nbroken, almost grown in the manner that it\nresided. Interwoven and artistically crafted,\nthe threads of finely spun cotton lace\ntogether, replicating the natural pattern of\na spider’s web. Dangling from the lower rim\nof the piece, three feathers hang in\nsuccession, that of a bluejay, sparrow, and\nmockingjay. Various colorful clay beads\nlitter the weaving found within the circle,\nillustrating a very similar pattern to that\nof a snowflake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arahaelth.", "minecraft:cobweb", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Goo", "This goo seems to cling to whatever it's\nplaced on, requiring two hands and some elbow\ngrease to remove it. No matter how badly you\ntry to seperate it from itself, it always\nreforms. If split into different containers,\nit will press itself against the wall,\nattempting to reach its other half. Talk\nabout clingy!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fool's Gold", "Shiny! But that's about it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whimsycal.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem(".-Tahariaen Healing [T5]-.", "A parchment rests in your hands, bearing\nglowing letters declaring some ancient\nprayer. \\\"Through Your Light we gain Guidance,\nO Lord, grant us Your Vision on the Path of\nPurity.\\\" If the words were read aloud, an\nashen-like substance would poof up from the\nparchment, finding the nearest injury,\nhealing it. This is at T5 Strength, capable\nof healing everything except for organs and\nreattachment of limbs. Msg FlamboyantKollu\nfor details. Disappears after use.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Squirming Tiny Tentacle", "A small piece of a black tentacle. It seems\nto squirm and flail around, as if trying to\nget your attention. It shrivels in the\nsunlight but grows to about five inches long\nin the shadows of night. When poked, it\nhisses!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("☾ Lunarium Lute ☽", "Before you is a beautiful instrument crafted\nof a golden and silver alloy, its luscious\nsurface glimmering beneath the light of the\nmoon. Six white strings crafted from the tail\nof a Pegasus glow with a faint ethereal hue.\nWhen played this lute produces sound\nexceptionally unpleasant to all soul-altered\nbeings; save ghostkind, who find the music\nexquisitely alluring. Non-sentient\nsoul-altered beings seem more intensely\naffected by the music.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Valentine Quill", "A golden feathered quill with traces of a\ndeep crimson along the spine and a sharp,\nbrass writing tip. This quill instils\nfeelings of warmth and companionship, and\nserves as a fitting momento for any writer.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Necklace", "A necklace made from a simple silver chain,\nwith small Emeralds and White diamonds set\nagainst the links.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imibee.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Tooth", "An artificial tooth crafted from a piece of\nKaz'Adar Gold. Its intricate design, in the\ndwedmar fashion, features small inscriptions\non the coronna, as well as the signature of\nthe craftsman.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bergukli] Kordenn Goldhand.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Surgical Needle", "A clean surgical needle with a line of thread\nattached to it. It is quite small, seemingly\nmade for very small hands.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Basilisk Fang", "A sizeable fange from a basilisk. The bone is\nsurprisingly light for its size, yet still it\nis quite a load to carry. Without the\nvenemous glands, the fang is thought to be\nharmless, besides its sharp and pointy\nnature. But...do you really want to try your\nluck to find out?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Sand!", "Magical sand, awarded to one who is best at\nsand. This sand would sand like no other sand\nas it stands sandly. It acts similar to\nputty, and makes for an excellent children's\ntoy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:sand", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemist's Shears", "An obviously used pair of alchemy shears\nmeant for clipping herbs.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Dragon Scale", "A bronze dragon scale shimmers in the light.\nThis is rumored to be an ancient\ncurrency....I wonder if you could spend it\nsomewhere.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:orange_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Miners Pocket Watch", "The watch has a stem-winding movement which\nis working nicely. The movement is protected\nby an inner hinged cover. The cover has a\nKaz'Ulrah Emblem on the surface. The watch\nitself measures 52mm diameter excluding the\nwinding stem and the loop.The case is 10ct\ngold plated with Dark Purple enamel Dwarven\nnumerals. The winding crown pushes in to open\nthe front cover. Inside there is an acrylic\nlens that has a yellowed tint.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StripezPurple.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Emberhard", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sacrificial Dagger", "Intricate runes surround the blade of the\ndagger. It seems to let out a dull hum as you\nhold it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Stolas.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cocktail", "A fruity twist on regular drinks, these\naverage 20% alcohol content depending on the\ntype of drink is mixed with the fruit juice.\nServed with a piece of fruit wedged onto the\nrim of the glass.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Elora's Sugar Cookies", "These sugar cookies may be the most delicious\nof thier kind. Baked with much love.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Ink Black Wyvern Scale", "The ink black scale of a slain wyvern. This\nscale would contain the durability of steel\nand would be sharp to the touch. The would be\nabout a foot in diameter.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Cupcake", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bread Flavored Cigar", "A finely wrapped cigar with a thick, full\nbarrel. The label Reads \"Billy's Bread\nFlavored Cigar\". Its long size burns long and\neven and produces a lot of smoke and flavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze colored short-bow", "A medium sized bow that was tightly strung\nwith a tightly woven string, it was colored\nwith a deep bronze hue, carried by the\nVirarim Fenar Dathon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IclapYOURcheeks.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bow", "A Strong Sturdy, Fallenwood Cross-Bow, Quite\nDurable, the Cross-Bow can shoot a good\nDistance, and Hold Heavy Bolts, The string is\nThin, But need's to be Replaced at Times; A\nSantagian Archer's Crossbow\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Metal Shield", "A shield made from glimmering metal, likely\nsteel colored a deep, rich bronze. It matches\nthe armor of the Virarim - a noble order of\nthe Dominion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IclapYOURcheeks.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Galokin", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Maukta Macuahuitl", "A larger Macuahuitl designed with precision.\nThe edges are laced with evenly cut pieces of\nvolcanic glass. The obsidian is sharper than\nsurgical steel, but quite brittle--this\nweapon was surely not made for use against\narmored foes in mind. The wooden base has\nbeen painted an array of tribal blues and\ngolds depicting a Masked Uruk sacrificing a\nslave to the spirits. Its shaft is about five\nfeet long and is much lighter than a sword.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Candle of Cerridwen’s Light", "This is an exceptionally crafted beeswax\ncandle. When lit, it will burn a green flame\nfor up to one saint’s hour. Blight cannot\nspread into the region the candle shines\nlight upon, though it is not repulsed from\nthis region if already there.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("where the fuck the beacon at", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Charboiled Porkchop", "Cuts of breaded pork that have been seasoned\nwith salt, pepper, and garlic seasoning. The\nporks are somewhat hot,a nd will require a\nbit of time to cool. The porkchops are very\njuicy, and somewhat greasy. The porkchop is\nsurprisingly tender, it's white meat\nseparating at the lightest of pulls or prods.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Kairi's Pelt (fake)", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Kairi", "", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Shining Bronze Blade", "A slightly curved blade, it was colored with\na deep bronze hue, carried by the Virarim\nFenar Dathon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IclapYOURcheeks.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Saber", "A short single edged blade made of bronze,\nwith a slight curve to it. The blade is well\nshined, and is quite lustrous under light.\nThe blade's one edge has been sharpened to\nbeing shaving sharp. The sword overall is\nroughly 30 inches long. The handle of the\nsword is made of oakwood, treated with\nlinseed oil, making it shiny with a deep dark\nbrown color.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("METH", "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Drunken Lords Secret", "You hold in your hand a small glass bottle\nfilled with an aqua blue liquid, it glows\nwith an ethereal blue hue. A warm sensation\nis felt throughout your body as you hold it\nand if one were to drink the liquid contained\nwithin, they would become intoxicated rather\nquickly\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll of Firebolt", "A tightly bound scroll with a glossy red,\nthickly lettered calligraphy glyph indicating\nBurz-nha\". When spoken aloud, fire would\nspur forth from the space in front of the\nwielder's torso to form a crossbow bolt of\norange flame. ((3 emotes, single use, created\nby goosey / mindrot))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bullwhip", "A braided bullwhip with several leather\nending straps, designed for lashing and to\nwrap around objects. Usually kept coiled at\none's hip.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Mandragora", "Somewhat shaped like a parsnip,\nyou can barely make out the plant's spores\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:poisonous_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Godans' Vodka", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Brownies?", "A brownie with a nice smell, once a bite is\ntaken. YOu will have the time of your life.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Grizzly Cloak", "This heavy cloak was made from the pelt of a\nGrizzly bear. With how thick it is, it could\nprovide restistance to the elements and\narrows alike!", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Si vis pacem para bellum", "An inscription on the blade reads, 'Forged\nfor the House of Begovic, by Caleb Crider,\nMaster Smith, a silver-inlaid eagle visible\nas the pommel.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Magic Scroll [T5]", "A scroll with an odd dark blue picture\nenscribed into it. the picture depicts a\nstick figure man with a smiley face pointing\nhis hand at another figure. From the hand of\nthe initial stick figure, a jagged line\nstretches forth. Furthermore, the phrase \"Zap\nthat Bitch,\" is etched into the scroll.\nShould one state the phrase, a formidable arc\nof electricity will form, surging toward the\nopposition after a few moments. [4 emotes to\ncast. PM TheTri for more and possibly\nimportant information]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Evernight Wine", "Grown deep underground, Evernight grapes have\nadapted to utilize the natural geothermal\nheat of the world to grow without sunlight.\nDue to their unique climate, the grapes have\nthick, saturated skins, making the wine\ndevelop as a deep black with occasional hues\nof dark blue. Big, bold Evernight is\nunquestionably fruit forward, with flavors\nreminiscent of tart blackberries, black\ncherries, and plum. To finish are notes of\nvanilla bean and spice. Our current stock is\na 1662 medium full body, aged in dark oak\nbarrels for a softer, caramel feel.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Appendages", "A four foot long taxidermied spider leg that\ngives off a interesting yet spooky fealing to\nwhoever sets their eyes upon it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vladimir Irongut.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Jade Statuette", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Juithy Ass Cheek", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yung_N_Hung.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Betharuz's Best", "A fresh and flavourful mug of bright cask\nale, refreshing enough to quench your thirst\nbut full of flavour. It sits at 6% alcohol\ncontent, and is served at room temperature as\nall ales should be.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Asul's Bounty", "A double shot of white rum, made with\ncoconuts and bananas. A summery drink when\nmixed in a cocktail, but perfectly sweet and\nspicy on its own, it hits hard at 38% alcohol\ncontent.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Velunor Crystal Gin", "A thin tall glass of 20% alcohol content gin\nand carbonated tonic water. Flavoured with\njuniper berries and served with some mint\nleaves and a lemon pinwheel.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kathadun oz Korraaz", "A grand axe of large proportions, its length\nat 5'4 make it quite the weapon for many to\nwield, of strong slayer steel it holds runes\nmarking the steel and the handle, powering\nthe axe with vast amounts of electricity\nwhile keeping the user safe from it's wrath.\nLining the shaft of the blade was an\nintricately carved snake of unknown origin,\nas it rounded from tail to head runic\ncarvings lined it's form. Reaching the head\nyou see small beads of darkness meet your\neyes with sharp fangs to match. [Four uses\nbefore recharge needed - T4 Lightning Runes]\n[Being struck with this axe while active\nwould cause painful bolts of electricity to\ncourse through the body, tensing up and\nburning likely.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [God] Kalgrimmor.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana Banna'!", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Alabaster Purgant Potion", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugium", "A unit of opium that has originated,\naccording to the dealer, straight from the\nold orcish jungles, grown by great rains and\nspiritual blessings. Krugium is just the cute\nname for the opium that you find upon your\nhand. The recreative drug can be chewed and\nit has a bitter taste. Leads to a high state\nof oneiric dreams. The drug is so strong that\nit has to be consumed while sitting upon the\nground. Highly addictive.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Eath'Lur.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Intricate Fisherman's Cameo", "A small, sand-dollar sized cedar wood cameo\nof two fish. The cameo depicts two catfish\nencircled around each other, their whiskers\ntrailing along their bodies and intertwining\nin the center of the carving. Their tails\nboth barely eluding the other's open mouth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Readicti.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Creepy Bird Mask", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Adherent IronWood Shield", "A tall tower shield. It has been made out of\nIronWood. The large shield is tall enough to\ncover someone who stands five feet, and wide\nenough to provide ample protection for the\nbody. The shield is thick, and the ironwood\nmakes it heavy, it would not be easy to run\ncarrying this thing. The ironwood makes it\nresistant to fire, as well as strong as iron.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Ritus Light", "A blessed book that only works in the hands\nof a Cleric of Tahariae. Giving off a pulsing\ngolden glow. Whenever one writes in it the\nwriting is immediately erased. Though when\nused by a priest healer it can cast spells\nwithin a radius ((Search Ritus Light for more\ndetails))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice With Coffee Syrup", "A bowl of ice, covered with luke-warm melted\ncoffee. The bowl is about the size of a hand,\nand in the ice is bits of chocolate and\nvanillia. The coffee melted on has a smooth,\nnutty taste. A perfect cool, sweet treat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Scarf", "A scarf made of some form of tan animal fur,\nit serves to help prevent over exposure in\nwinter weather. The length of fur seems\nexpertly crafted into its current form by\ndeft hands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Leyne.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Job Token III", "(Token) A tier II job token that was obtained\nfor completing a quest for Larwin. It can be\nexchanged for a reward at Larwin's stand in\nKaz'Ulrah.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Job Token II", "(Token) A tier II job token that was obtained\nfor completing a quest for Larwin. It can be\nexchanged for a reward at Larwin's stand in\nKaz'Ulrah.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Job Token I", "(Token) A tier I job token that was obtained\nfor completing a quest for Larwin. It can be\nexchanged for a reward at Larwin's stand in\nKaz'Ulrah.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("The Steadfast Charge", "This necklace is a work of art. It's chain is\nmade of links, half of them made of silver,\nhalf of them made of red-gold. In the middle\nrests a rare, red diamond, encased in silver.\nOver the top of the diamond, two silver\nbull's horns come out. On the back of the\nsilver that encases the diamond, there'd be a\nshort text. \"For a steadfast, beautifull\nwoman, that rare, strong godess.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by sidmmvv.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Emerald Encrusted Ring", "A ring of legendary make. A light, forest\ngreen, emerald is perfectly sculpted into the\nFerrum ring. The metal shines brightly as\ndoes the jewel. A ring that only the most\nmasterful of smiths could dream of making.\nThe name Cecila is written on the interior of\nthe ring.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Amethyst Encrusted Ring", "A masterfully crafted Ferrum ring! With a\ndark colored amethyst adorning it. The fine\nmetal would be polished and free of any\nscratches or marks. Truly, a ring made by the\nfinest of high elven smiths. The name Elrith\nis written on the interior of the ring.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Vase", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueberry Bush", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Blue Vase", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fern Vase", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Vase", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Longsword", "A rather hefty ferrum longsword with a blade\nof about 4 feet in length and a hilt only\nhalf a foot. Bear leather is used for the\ngrip and the guard has decorative copper\nvines twisting around it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Knuckles", "A pair of polished ferrum knuckles that have\nsome weight to them. On each knuckle would be\na dull spike made of slayer-steel, fine\ncraftsmanship; constructed by only the finest\nof Mali'thill smiths.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Fiery Whetstone", "An 8 inch long, 2 inch wide crimson hued\nwhetstone. This stone is made of a rock that\ncontains granite and boomsteel, giving it a\ndark red color, and will ignite when friction\nfro metal is applied. It has a rough texture,\nundoubtly good for sharpening carbarum\nblades, steel ones would suffer because of\nthe heat the whetstone give off. One should\nlikely wear gloves while using it!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ellenora.", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bobby's Bread Burgers!", "It's a hamburger without the ham!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Shamshir", "A 15 degree curved blade is held by a grip\nwrapped in red leather. The grip is protected\nby a jagged, curled guard of gold leaf eagle\nwings. The blade itself measures 30\" carries\nan intricate almost flowing water like\ndesign. The sword's tang is concealed by\nleather and polished bone fixed by bronze\nrivets. ((OOC this is a damascus steel\nshamshir))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Xalid.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ardenin Wine", "This elegant bottle coontains a deep dark red\nliquid within its depths. The contents would\ntaste mildly sweet and heady, harkening from\nless arid climes than more common southern\nvarieties.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Malasadas", "Yeast-leavened doughnuts made from eggs,\nbutter, and condensated milk that are fried\nand then rolled in sugar. Santegian malasadas\ncome with all manner of filling including\nvanilla custard, chocolate and\ncoconut-flavored pudding.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("FAG BRICKS", "if you own these guess what you are\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chumpchump.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Honey Berry Backwoods", "Backwoods Honey Berry features Cuban seed\nshort filler, a top-quality, dark Connecticut\nbroadleaf wrapper, and a unique blend of\njuicy berries and warm sweet honey. This\nlittle western- styled stick will wallop your\npalate. Rolltide.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TrendE.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Albondigas with Spicy Tomato Sauce", "Hearty beef and chorizo meatballs that are\nfried and topped with a boldly delicious\ntomato sauce. They are accented with garlic,\nchili and olive oil then garnished parsley\nand blue cheese.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("H", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bacon-On-A-Stick", "This gumbled mess of bacon is pierced onto a\nlong wooden stick. The fat from the bacon\nwould drip, causing a great hunger to beset\nupon you. The bacon would fill up anyone as a\nsmall meal.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Invitation", "You are hearby invited to attend a wedding\nand festival celebrating Edgar Sarkozic &\nMaya Vladov. There will be food, drinks,\ncompetitons, and prizes to be won. It will be\na joyful and beautiful occassion! ((6/6/2018\nin Belvitz))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TarreBear.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Old dwarven gold", "This has the seal of ancient banks long lost\nto the dwarves. Its a heafty piece of gold\nand seems to have a goldhand stamp on it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Honey", "A sweet gooey substance, with vibrant colours\nlike a flame. The rather viscous liquid sat\ninside a small mason jar, with a cyan ribbon\nwrapped around the middle of the jar. Upon\nconsumption, one would be filled with a warm\nfeeling, and their tastebuds overwhelmed with\nflavour!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor Al'Abass.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Hide", "(Common) A Minotaur hide that was skinned\nfrom a Minotaur of the Deeproads. Its tough\nhide would be stronger than its cow brethren.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Vodnik Parasite", "This large Vodnik seems to have lived in the\noceans for a long while. It is full of life\nenergy, which suggests that the host has\nbecome an empty shell, kept alive by the\nsupply of nutrients. It lives, and is\nextremely dangerous even on land!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Heart", "The heart of a minotaur. It would be rather\nlarge, about the size of a house cat, and\nwould have a seemingly unnatural amount of\narterial tubes attached to it. Over time, it\nwould begin to decay and putrefy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by The Trapped Minotaur.", "minecraft:red_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Funeral Shroud", "A black funeral shroud.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar O' Holy Water", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bi-Polar Head", "The heard ofa sad bear, if you look into the\neyes you see a broken soul. Thank you for\ntaking it out of its misery.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Spirit Blood", "A bottle of booze extracted from a Spirit of\nParty. It is extremely tasteful and potent,\nand drinking it will stir the desire to\ndance.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SuitAndTie_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tofu's Cookies", "They don't seem that special.\n★Developer Approved★\nSigned by Tofuus.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("[!] Symptons of Disease", "You feel a cold running down your spine, as\nyou felt sick to your stomach as you took a\nmoment to see how you feel. (Do not drop\nduring Event!)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Iridescent Steel Bone", "A long, metallic bone with an iridescent,\ncolorful sheen to it. When one changes their\nperspective of the bone, they could see a\ndifferent colors. The bone was smooth, shiny,\nand felt warm to the touch for a reason\nunknown. The dense part seemed to serve well\nas a trophy from a once-living steel\nskeleton.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Feudalism, a Failure.", "Questioning Private Property\nSignature: Bernard Oakstool", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("You've been refunded!", "Gear has been palced in you're inventory to\ncompensate for lost items during that\nterrible warclaim on 11/25", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A Horned Skull", "Fragile, soft, and black as charcoal, a skull\nadorning one fully formed ram horn and\nanother ripped in twain sits before you. Even\nthe smallest flick can send raptures\nthroughout it's soft exterior, as if it\nyearns to be made into dust.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Birthday Cake", "A simple vanilla cake with vanilla butter\ncream. \"Happy birthday\" would be written on\nthe cake in purple icing in cursive.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Bola", "The Bola would be of a three ball design.\nEach ferrum ball being about three inches in\ndiameter and polished to shine in the light.\nThe cords tied around each ball would be\nwoven out of tight treated plant fiber and\nleather to allow for a very durable and\nweather resistant rope. Etched into each of\nthethe shining ferrum balls would be detailed\ncarvings of swirling trees and plants as well\nas a trident with a line through the shaft of\nthe weapon to form a t.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloody Arrow", "A Bloodied arrow, Partially dry\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheAnorak.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Ash Wood Crossbow", "A simple light crossbow made of bronze and\nash wood. The firing mechanism is made of 4\ncast bronze parts, and is a simple vertical\nlock design. The butt plate of the crossbow\nis also made of bronze. The body, and bow are\nmade of ash wood, treated with boiled linseed\noil. The body of the crossbow bears 3 runes\ncarved on it's sides, ᛏ ᛗ ᛉ. The crossbow is\n3 feet long, with the bow of the crossbow\nbeing 3 feet and 2 inches wide. The body of\nthe crossbow is straight, with two bronze bow\nirons holding the bow properly in place onto\nthe crossbow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Communism, and Class Struggle", "A discussion of collective work, state as an\ninstrument, and ending exploitation\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bernard Oakstool.\nSignature: Bernard Oakstool", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Sushi Plush", "A small sushi plush perfectly stitched with\nsmall decorations on top, adding a pop of\ncolor!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by nikabell.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Framed Stamp of His Holiness JUDE I", "A mimiked stamp of a symbol commonly used by\nthe Pontifex, it would be slightly of a\nrugged shape and holds a darker color;\nnoticeable by those who have seen the stamp\nnumerous times.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jacobcraft04.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Thanium", "Whoa! You found the legendary Fizzle-Pop Cola\nflavor -- Thanium! [!] Made with real\nThanium, drink at your own risk [!]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("~Curonic Pumpkin Pie~", "~A delious deep filled pumpkin pie , with a\nhint of cinnamon and sweetened with a little\nsugar. The curst would be baked to\nperfection.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evelyn Falkenrath.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Spooky Tea Cup", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Henri's Blend", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pembroke Dark", "Much like red, but with a bigger kick and a\nswellfull taste.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Claw", "A large intact wolf claw. It seemed to be\nsharp to the touch with dirt pressed deeply\nbeneath the deep curve of its underside.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Naked Apple Juice", "This drink was made from the most naked of\npure apples, pounded and pressed into\nbeautiful naked juice\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Ensign] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Naked Orange Juice", "This drink was made from the most naked and\npressed oranges, a very vibrant orangish\ncolor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Ensign] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:potion", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_15(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Naked Strawberry Juice", "This drink was made from the best naked\nstrawberries, hand picked naked strawberries.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Ensign] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Honey Whiskey", "A strong, sweet alcohol flavoured with honey.\nReminds you of sunny days spent outside.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Engraved Aurum Bayonet", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Sproutling Axe", "The hatchet is made of ironwood, a terribly\ndurable type of wood, and sharpened on both\nsides of the axe head.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cave_Creature.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray Fish", "A Rubberish Fish Head, A good Dog toy, Seems\nto be ripped off the body... Well Then...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Moist Snuff", "A pouch of finely ground and moistened\nsmokeless tobacco; used by taking a pinch and\nstuffing it under your lower lip. Most\ncommonly used by soldiers as stress or\nmigraine relief. Sold exclusively at the 1\nSwitzer Corps kitshop!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by 1 Switzer Corps Kitshop.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Twisted Mixture", "A cruel concoction that is encapsulated\nwithin an opaque dark blue and black crimp\ntop vial and is completely sealed by a jagged\nglass cork. If opened, the contents would\nsimply smell of stale wine and herb. Various\nsolid and liquid materials would be placed\nwithin the small container, giving the\nmixture a vicious bitter taste. ((PM Voidal\nfor effects.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoke Pipe", "", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("O'Scott Scotch", "This drink is both strong in smell and taste.\nIt is slightly sweet and has a strong bite.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fossilised Skull", "A good Mask If your Hiding Up in the Tree and\nyour Small.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Creme de Champagne", "A soft, bubbling champagne with hints of\norange and pineapple. There are underlying\nnotes of vanilla which give it a soft\nsweetness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~ Sarsaparilla", "Fizzle-Pop Cola in a special, part-time\nflavor -- Sarsaparilla!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wines Blossom", "A standard edition of red wine, aged only\nshortly and thus its full flavourings not\ncoming through upon taste. Nevertheless its\ntaste would be a graceful combination of\nvanilla, smoke and hints of sweet spices such\nas clove and cinnamon. A distant buttery\naroma would linger upon this wine. Its bottle\nis marked with the House Arden crest. Upon\ndrinking it you would feel an addiction for\nmore.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fireheart_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ardenin Pale Ale", "This strong alcoholic beverage would gleam as\nit is poured into your cup, foaming to the\ntop and often over it too. The pale ale would\nbe aged to the utmost perfection, and the keg\nbeing made from Ashwood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Scarf", "", "", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Charm", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Pig Crate", "Purchased from the Cloud Temple Livery Stall\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Bleach", "A cleaning fluid, probably tastes nice. Mixes\nwell with Ammonia!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GloriaPreussens.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Ale Cake", "A large cake full of sweets and ale. This\ncake was baked by Borin Grandaxe to serve in\nto Kal'Tarak Tavern.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Spring Roll", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron\"ic Sword", "It's a sword! I swear! One of the deadliest\nweapons in the known realm of the chicken\ngod.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corpean.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Slime Vial", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Lamb", "A docile and extremely fluffy creature which\ndespite its magnificent horns seems to be a\nyoung specimen of its kind. It horns\noccasionally produce a faint light in a\ngolden hue.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Monkbread", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Playing Cards", "A set of old playing cards with the original\nfour brothers and their related races acting\nas the suits: Krug, Urguan, Horen, and Malin\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by balluffip.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Tangerine Dreams", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Bread Rolls", "A roll that usually came in pairs. It was\nslightly charred on the end, however this was\nintentional, the inside being nice and warm.\nIt's alright on its own, but amazing with\nbutter!", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Killer's Head", "A large whale's head that was cut off from,\nof course, a whale. This is likely the\nlargest taxidermy someone has done. Unless\nsome man decided to stuff a full dragon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HortonHeardAWho.", "minecraft:concrete", ""),
        StaticItem("A Swan's Feather Quill", "A beautiful, delicately shaped swan feather.\nIt is perfect for a quill, the tip shaped\nperfectly into a sharp tip. It is snow white,\nwith no imperfections.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Chained Golden Pocket Watch", "A golden watch, simple by design, created for\na particular Elf. A chain attached to it to\nprevent it just falling out of one's pocket.\nWritten on the back of it \"Time is a terrible\nthing to waste my friend. -T", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Ilvenmore", "A finely crafted bow. The weapon would be\nold, but well taken care of. This clearly\nheld some significance at one point.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [The Mighty] Aldonza Castelo.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Vladovic Taco", "Vladovic trade secret recipe!", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sunspear", "An exquisite spear with a lantern dangling\nfrom it, the Sunspear is a weapon of the\nfaith used by a follower of the All-Father to\nslay the unworthy. The tip of the spear is\nlaced in Aurum making it effective against\nundead.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Telos' Staff", "A staff made for the most daring of\nbattlemages, this staff's handle is wrapped\nwith oiled and rinsed black leather. Each end\nof the staff boasts a sharp blade, made for\nboth cutting and stabbing making this not\nonly a staff for magical focus, but also a\nweapon for both magic casters and the mere\nsoldier whom would pick this up. The blades\nconsist of a strong Ferrum and Iron alloy and\nhave been sharpened by an exceptional smith.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackbird", "A simple walking stick with a black cloth\nwrapped around the middle. The bottom of the\nstaff is worn down from years of being used\non different terrain, while the top twists\nand turns a bit with multiple sharp edges and\ncorners. The wood is nearly completely black.\nHow strange...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Scriptures", "A thick tome providing infomation about\nYeuism, including info about the Goddess, the\nmagic, and the 30 Strictures. ((Pm\nfiregirl7892467 for more info on the books\ncontents))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Juvenile Toalak", "The young toalak would have recently emerged\nfrom its larval tadpole stage.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Thahnium Lump", "A fistful sized lump of unprocessed Thahnium.\n[PM IRINEJ TO PROCESS]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield of Protection", "This shield is capable of withstanding fire\nfor a short period of time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Unmelting Ice", "Ice exposed to unsullied Thahnium for many\nyears, thusly imbued with the quality of\nbeing unmelted.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Lubba-Scaled Armor", "Arcane I\nChest armor crafter from the scales of a\npowerful sea monster, possessing a\ngreenish-blue hue. Its slightly lighter than\nchainmail yes as strong as iron. It covered\nthe full lenght of the torso and arms.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Coat of Kulin'oem", "A simple coat hand made by Kulin'oem, an\nunnotable high elf. It's shoddily made but\nthe inside is lined with green.\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Kulin'oem.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Water", "It has a deep red hue and when opened it\ngives off little red particles and a feeling\nof darkness.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Present", "A strange box that gives off an odd aura to\nthose who hold it. It is incapable of being\nsmashed or pried open, regardless of the\nstrength or magical prowess of the person\nattempting. What rests inside of this box is\na mystery. Perhaps one day it will open?\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNoodle.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gryphon Feather", "A golden brown feather, once belonging to a\nmighty beast. It seems to shimmer when held\nup against the sunlight. The shaft of the\nglittering feather would likely make an\nexcellent quill, but to waste such a unique\nthing on an arrow would be foolish.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Rorel.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring of the Bald", "A small slayer-steel circlet. It would have a\ndiamond set in Aurum. On the outside, vines\nwould be etched in silver, and inside the\nband 'Torto' would be engraved in silver as\nwell.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by neopsychedelia.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sigil of the Kingdom", "This is a finely-crafted woodwax sigil. It is\ncomposed of rendered wood oil and kidzu bird\ntallow. It has been colored with powdered\nflower dye. On the item is an exceptional\nimage of an oak tree. The oak tree is blowing\nin the wind. The item smells powerfully of\nroses.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Donyae's Hunting Knife", "The knife is curved at the tip, designed to\ntry to penetrate armor. The knife was passed\ndown from halfling to halfling in the\nSugarfoot family. The hilt of the blade has\nSF\" carved into it: a symbol of the family\nname.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Burmese Ruby Tiara", "An intricate design of beautiful detail and\nprecision, the tiara a relatively average\nheight. The Theme is of Floral design, with\nopal gems rising in the centre to give an\norange illusion of nature. Next to the opals\nwhere an extremely large arr", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Rapier : Dyrnwyn =~", "A Masterfully Crafted Rapier. The Blade would\nbe made of Steel, shining as if freshly\npolished. The Hilt would be thin, but\ncomplex, as it would be plated with gold. The\nhandle would be wrapped in gold painted bear\nleather, creating a tough, yet strong grip.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Bjorn Adigard.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Healingberry", "a tasty and rejuvenating berry. (heals minor\nwounds and infections, also restores stamina)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sacred Sapling Remains", "The fine dust of a sapling that wilted.\nAlthough devoid of any live, it does seem to\nbe rich with nutrients. Maybe a herbalist\ncould use it for something?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Chest Of Protection", "This item protects against most magical\nabilities and fire. Once the gem on its front\nis tapped thrice, of course. (PM\nFlyingHalfMast for more info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Manifested Sorrow", "A small round orb with a perfectly smooth\nsurface. It's outer layer holding a milky transparent casing\nwhile the inside slowly manifests with a lingering\npurple fog. If one holds this, they'd slowly start\nto feel sad over time.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Grandma's Necklace", "A golden necklace with the center piece\nshaped like a heart. It would have black and\nred diamonds placed into the center piece. If\nyou wore it for a long time, your skin would\nbegin to turn a grey unnatural tone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Chestplate", "A chestplate of solid bronze, painted black\nand trimmed with white. Along its front, it\ndepicts an odd design of spearmen standing\nbefore a towering wall, and a winged creature\nflying above that wall. Oddly, the inside is\nsmeared with a dried red substance. It\nresembles a crossed circle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("๑ Nexus Shard ๑", "A shard of an irridescent substance. It glows\nbrightly when in contact with voidal magic.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Sylvan Dropping", "Forged from ferrum, this nearly circular,\nalmost perfectly rounded ferrum ball is about\nthe size of one's eyeball. It'd have a rough\ntexture when touched, and smelled rather\nfoul. They were also extraordinarily hard\nwhen thrown!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gigantic Visceral Eye", "You are looking at a gigantic eyeball, with a\nlight green retina, staring direct at you.\nThis eye looks like it is in harsh shape, and\nlooks like it was rotting before it finally\nwas preserved. This eye is roughly Five Feet\nin diameter, and will often drip with\ndisgusting eye juices whenever held. It is\nadvised to not get too close to this thing or\nelse the gunk of it might make one gag.. ((\nAs this is 5 feet in diameter, it would\nrequire someone two arms to carry to prevent\ndamage to it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bloodsoaked] Mystery Uialben.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Quahog Clam", "A beautifuly brown and gray Quahog Clam. It\nhas a hard shell and is served alive with the\nrest of it's bed. The clam has a chance to\nhave a black or white pearl inside! (roll 20/\n15 and under is no pearl, 16-17 is a black\npearl, 18-20 is a white pearl, size is\ndetermined by a /roll 3,\n1=small,2=medium=,3=large) The clams if\ncooked properly are delicious! The Bed of\nclams is served in a large bucket with 'CCC\nwritten on it.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Mirror of Beauty", "A handheld mirror fit only for the most\nbeautiful! When the beholder looks upon the\nmirror, they are placed under a spell of\nattraction to one’s self. If they\ncontinuously look into the mirror, they’ll\ngrow addicted to their own image. The effect\nis temporary.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Wedding Tiva Wreath", "This traditional Tiva Wreath is strung on a\nroot base, adorned with beautiful, freshly\npicked Carnations, Daisies, Magnolias and\nLinaria Bipartitas. The symbolism in the\nwreath represents promise, faithfulness, love\nand marriage. Using the ancient tounge of\nFlowers, the wreath is akin to a wedding ring\nin showing that the two wearers are vowed to\neachother in marriage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Animated Paper Horse", "A well kempt thin piece of paper. It looks\nnormal to the usual keen eye, however once\nsomeone comes into contact with the\nparchment, they'd see it fold and spring to\nlife. The holder would see the page crinkle\ntogether and form by itself, taking a jagged\nshape of a small horse. Given it has the\nroom, it would begin prancing around and\nemitting a few squealy neighs. It would\nimmediately return to normal once the bearer\nreleases its hold. ((PM Izkuthii for more\ninfo.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Karake Paste", "A thick paste farmed from the bones of\nskeletons and opiate powder. Has its own\nunique kick.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Burning Toy Sword", "A small wooden sword fit for a child. Its\nblade is very dull, making it a weapon no\nbetter than a stick. The hilt seemed to be\nwrapped tightly with a dark maroon coloured\ncloth. If one were to wield this sword by the\nhilt, they would simply see its blade come to\nlife with flame. The embers do not deal any\ndamage to the sword, nor to oppenents or\nother matters as it is simply an illusion.\n((PM Voidal for more info\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantVoid.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skult Tubes", "Long narrow bone tubes that wer attached to the creature's shell, hollow at the end and\nstart, you can assume it used this to suck blood.\n*Moderator Approved*\nNalatac_Aicneta approved this item.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye Glow Potion", "A peculiar potion rests here, almost seeming\ndevoid of color. How strange. If imbibed,\nthis potion would seem to flush through the\nuser's body for a moment before rushing to\nthe eyes, filling their eye with the colour\nof their Aura. (Refer to void lore.) The\nintensity of this glow depends on how much of\nthe potion is consumed. More potion = more\nglow, vice versa. This wears off after 2 irl\nweeks, and can damage eyesight if overusing\n(max dose constantly, for example.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ellomi", "A beautiful crafted blue steel rapier rests\nbefore you, nearly opaque in design. The\nblade would come to a fine point and weigh\npractically nothing due to the technique used\nto forge the blade. Along the hilt and the\nguard would be the images of flowing vines\nand leaves blowing through the air, the hilt\nitself being made of silver entirely. On the\npomel would rest a single briliant shapire\nglowing when the sun or moonlight passed\nthrough it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlight Druid] Eryn Nailo Serene.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Mace", "A mace with a steel handle, the head is an\nincredbly solid, spiked crystal orb.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("King John's Legendary War-Axe", "This axe was once used by the legendary King\nJohn, on those foolish enough not to pay\ntheir taxes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shuggie_.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Strawberry Soap", "A small brick shaped block of soap, with\nrounded edges. It smells lightly of\nstrawberries, and when wet can be used to\nlather quite well, cleaning as intended.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:red_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Dion Diraar Pelt", "The tattered pelt of a slain Dion Diraar\nrests before you, clear signs of the damage\nthe beast had taken before it died remain,\nthough the fur is still silky smooth and may\ndeflect small slashes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Ice Cream", "A lovely, creamy frozen dessert that tastes\nstrongly of rich, decadent chocolate.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Minority Bribe", "Food: 3\nSaturation: 2.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Greymane Boar Tusk", "This six-inch long tusk is rather sharp on\nthe tip, capable of piercing human flesh. It\nappeared to have been sawed off from a\ncreature of some kind.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("A Fold of Shade", "This is a square meter of shadow. It is\ntranslucent and utterly weightless, but\notherwise possesses all the physical\nqualities of black fabric.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:black_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Tickling Feather of Justice", "It appears to be an alchemically-altered\nfeather that causes people to be\nultra-ticklish for a while. Useless in\ncombat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by chaoticConjurer.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of frog", "Froggy do the ded ded", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of The Mighty Minotim", "The head of the Mighty Minotaur Cheiftan\nMinotim. Minotim's last words were \"I Like\nMale Minotaurs\".\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Aesopian", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Whale's Blubber", "A chunk of blubber cut from that of a whale,\nthat's what this was. It could be used for a\nfew things, mainly revolving around the fact\nthat it can be used to create lamp oil. With\nlamp oil you can make a variety of flammable\nweaponry but... That's more of a goblin thing\nreally.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HortonHeardAWho.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Mace", "Soulbound II\nA mace is a blunt weapon, a type of club or\nvirge that uses a heavy head on the end of a\nhandle to deliver powerful blows. It would\ncontain a the name of its Smith on the wooden\nshaft\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Julia.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Bitter Reed", "The Bitter Reed is known as a strong medicine\nagainst nausea and other symptoms of\ndiseases. Growing near swamps and rivers this\nreed is also known for covering most of the\nmuddy land, turning swamps and the riversides\ninto little jungles.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:hay_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Ligma", "Ligma Balls", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bowl of Ramen", "A hot steaming bowl of ramen would be in your\nhands. The spices on the noodles would be hot\nand only the trained man or woman can handle\nsuch spice. This particular recipe comes\ndirectly from Echoes Bay of Eden", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Spoon", "A small trinket the goblins held in very high\nregard. The spoon has been oddly polished and\nis in mint condition.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Firelands Egg", "This sac was dropped from an unknown beast in\nthe Firelands.. Hatches on 8/14/2018\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbarum Earrings", "A pair of well crafted earrings, the detail\non them is painstakingly done. It comes\ntogether to form the depiction of an aengul,\nits feathered wings folded infront of it in\nan almost hug like manner.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Man-Smasher", "The weapon in your hands is a large\ntwo-handed mace. A product of its original\ntwo components, the club of the Cyclops Nufir\nand a Muyakelg segment, the main shaft and\nhead of the weapon is of solid wooden make\nand the head bears a number of sharp\nfragments from the stone of the Muyakelg\nsegment. Orkish runes decorate each of these,\nbringing a cruel and powerful look to the\nmighty weapon.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Ocean Worn Gladius", "A dull, bent and near useless gladius. A\ndecorative piece just before the hilt bears a\nhawk's talons. The tool stinks of decayed\nfish and salt water.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Maternity Parcel", "Inside the simple wooden box is a myriad of\nbottles, jars, and loose leaf tea containers.\nEach is labeled in an elegantly spidery font-\nRed Raspberry Leaf, Peppermint, Ginger Root,\nand Calendula, to name a few. There is a\npamphlet included, explaining uses and\ndosages.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Jagged Cleaver", "A large Cleaver that once belonged to the\nDancing Olog before his defeat.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Scroll [T5]", "A 3x1ft scroll with the word 'Magic Missle\non the bottom of it. Should the word be said\na wave of air is spewed out only to be pulled\nback in and formed into a ball of rapidly\nspinning air. After awhile of charging this\nwill be powerful enough to shoot a person\nback a few feet and knock them on thier bum,\na fully armored person could be knocked over\neasily and moved back as well. [Msg\nZachsSlayer for more info][4 emotes. Connect,\nsummon, summon, shoot]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Egg Cluster", "A cluster of eggs found just off the coast of\nColonia Aequium. From time to time it seems\nto pulsate and the creatures within seem to\ntwitch and jolt when prodded.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Beast Meat", "Meat cut from some completely foreign beast.\nIt smells like a blend of fish and pork.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonhead Staff", "Soulbound I\nA helix designed stave with ornate carvings\nand a carved dragons' head as the tip.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ninja Helmet", "A black ninja helmet covered in slime. Such\nan item was taken from the slimey body of the\nslime spirit Yerkath after he was frozen and\nlocked away by the dwarves of Kaz'Ulrah.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("❆ Cranus Painus ✺", "One of the six cursed demon katanas forged by\nthe great wizard Denis. Cranus Painus is said\nto give its wielder an enhanced power belly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck'Lak Action Figure", "The plastic figurine would be complete with\narticulated joints and all the fun you can\nhandle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of a Shadow Orb", "it is what remained of the tool used by a\ncertain user of the dark arts of 'Shadow\nIllusionry'. There is not much energy or aura\nleft, but it doesn't seem to reflect any\nsunlight, making it pitch black glass.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Akanthros.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Paleknight Rubble", "A soup bowl full of the blue-green nastiness\nof a slain paleknight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Daine.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Music Box", "A delicate little music box, small details carved into\naged wood. When opened, soft music would fill the air,\nmaking its listeners feel safe and at home.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:noteblock", ""),
        StaticItem("Eldrad", "A self sufficient and artificial mind,\nenchanted within an Intelligent Matrix. With\nglowing ridges and a crystal 'eye' within the\ncenter, this Artificial Mind may be activated\nby verbal command, and will communicate and\ncomply with it's Master's wishes. The voice\nwould be deep and metallic, though possesses\na very sarcastic personality. This cube\nliterally sucks information into it like a\nsponge. ((Check the MArts for more Info))\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ivy", "This sword is forged with hard steel,\na pattern of thorns engraved onto it.\n*Moderator Approved*\nImCookiie approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Pocketwatch", "The little watch would be hung by a detachable chain.\nIt is of a gold metal, with the clock face's hands\nmade of copper. An image of a beast would be detailed\ninto the back, its barbed tail filling its viewer\nwith an odd sense of power and security.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Maiden's Reprieve", "The lute is highly elegant, it curving to fit the figure\nof a woman just right. Its wood is of a dark stain, a\nbeautiful deep and dark mahogany. If strung by those\nskilled of hand, it will produce a sound that strikes\nlonging into the hearts of even the manliest of men.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:oak_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Naval Blade", "A shortsword of a long forgotten\npirateer, rope knotted around its handle\nbeautifully,a copper charm of an anchor\nbeing strung to it carefully. The scent\nof sea salt would cling to the blade, and\nto anyone whom the sea is important to,\nit would bring memories rushing back to\nthem.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by iLovePumpkins.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Edraith", "Edraith meaning Salvation, this ceremonial\ndagger gleams in light and is sharp at the\ncurved edges and tip, indicating its\nwell-kept nature. The dark oak grip appears\nsmooth and delicate to grasp, and a golden\nrim of elvish curvature adorns the hilt.\nRunning along the flat of the blade itself\nare a series of faint, silver elvish knots\nwhich can appear at the right angles. When\nnot wielded, it is tucked into a tough, black\nsheath.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of the Four", "The amulet depicts six hooded figures, one at\neach corner of the smooth metal. It glows a\nsoft blue hue, and from time to time seems to\nvibrate in the holder's grasp.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Aethermoore Coin", "The coin is of a coppery gold,\nAethermoore's lion imprinted into the metal.\nIt is said to bring good luck!", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Washcloth", "A simple white washcloth with tattered\nedges, perfect for cleaning up spills or\ndirt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Melody & Andrea", "A calendar, strikingly similar to the\nscum of the earth ones made before. This\none, however, would portray two oh-so hot\nlesbian brides, each month bringing some\nnew doofy pose. It begins in 1961 but\nends in 1962.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Heirophant's Doll", "This is a palm-sized crow leather doll,\nstuffed with pig tail thread and brown\nrecluse spider silk. It is encrusted with\nresin opal. A small cherry hangs from around\nits neck on cedar fibre string. When this\ncherry is fed to a living creature, the doll\nwill transform to take on the shape of the\ncreature, and act out the behaviors for the\nspecies.\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Vaynth.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Denis Signal", "This firework could be used at anytime to\nsummon the hero, Denis the Quick-Blade to\nvanquish anything EVIL. (If he's online)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shoogie.", "minecraft:fireworks", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of crushed Flametounge root.", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Fallingwood Chestplate", "This is a finely-crafted fallingwood\nchestplate. It is encrusted with amber opal\nand aventurine, and menaces with spikes of\ntetrahedrite. It is decorated with cave\nlobster shell and crayfish shell. It is\nadorned with fungiwood fiber rings, which\nhave been dyed green using green slime dye.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Hammer", "Just a big rock on a big stick. Nothing\nspecial.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pinnteine", "A blade passed down by Thünadrikuk family, It\nis so heavy only a member of the Thünadrikuk\nwould be able to lift it with their powerful\nmuscles.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shuggie_.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Orange Slime", "A hardened shard of orange slime. If consumed\nwould be extremely spicy causing heartburn\nand extreme sweating\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:magma_cream", ""),
        StaticItem("Torch", "A Magificent Candle, Gold supporting the wax\nof which burns to give flame.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Raw Ruibrium", "(Legendary) A raw from of the reddish\nmineral, Ruibrium. It is extremely lethal to\nbreath in and touch, the taint very active.\n[If you have taken this item, contact\nthebulter]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:quartz_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("Processed Ruibrium", "(Rare) The redish mineral Ruibrium has been\nprocessed out of its raw form, its taint\ncontained thoroughly. While still dangerous\nto ingest, the processed form is safe to\ntouch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Flesh", "", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Talon", "A slayersteel dagger rests here, seeming to\nresonate with practicality. A flared tip at\nthe edge of the blade would lead to serrated\nwounds which would heal incorrectly, scarring\nand maiming the victim if not properly\ntreated. The hilt was made of well-hewn black\nleather, and rests comfortingly within one's\ngrip. Upon the crossguard rests an\ninscription of a lion with flared wings, as\nif it were about to rend someone in twain.\nThe initials of 'WD' rest below the lion,\nindicating who created it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dog Toy", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Ghoulfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Spine of Tharrax", "A dark bone fragment, sharpened to a razor's\nedge and fastened upon the hilt of birchwood\nfound outside the Crossroads, this blade was\nmade from the remains of the Frost Wyrm that\nassaulted the Realm of Atlas for a year\nstraight, until falling to the Heroes of the\nWinter Frontier on 8/22/2018.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarnished Bronze Maul", "A bludgeoning weapon made of bronze, with an\noakwood haft. The bronze the head of the maul\nis made from is shined minimally, giving it a\ntarnished, brown appearance. The oakwood the\nhaft is made from has been treated with\nlinseed oil. The head of the maul is 9 inches\nlong, 3 inches tall, and 3 inches wide. The\nmaul's face is square shaped, whilst the\nother side of the maul tapers down to a\npyramid shaped spike. The wooden handle of\nthe maul is 27 inches long. The head of the\nmaul has been fastened onto the its haft via\na socket in the head, with the haft fitting\ninto the socket, and being fastened with\npitch and two rivets. The maul is 30 inches\nfrom top to bottom, and weighs 5 pounds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mod Warning", "This is an official warning from the\nModeration Team in response to your OOC\ntoxicity leading up to a PVP encounter.\nRepeat offenses of Toxicity may result in a\nban. - DonutsTasteMmm Discord:Donuts#0966\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DonutsTasteMmm.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Flail", "A bludgeoning weapon, consisting of a wood\nhandle, with a bronze chain attached, with a\nteardrop shaped head of bronze. The handle of\nthe flail is made of oakwood, treated with\nlinseed oil. The chain of the flail is 14\ninches long. The chain of the flail bears 15\nlinks, not including the hoop on the haft, or\nthe head on the end. The flail head is\nteardrop shaped, and is cast in a single\npart. The bronze of the chain and head has\nbeen sanded and shined, making it quite\nlustrous under light. The head of the flail\nweighs roughly a kilogram, whilst the rest of\nthe flail, chain included, weighs 2, making\nthe entire flail weigh 3 kilograms.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("gray", "", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbal Burn Cream", "Stored in a sealed metal canister, this\ncarefully concocted burn remedy is composed\nof Athin, Atheros, Aqua Nympth and Aquate\nRoot. When applied to a burn, it brings a\ncooling sensation to the skin, relieving most\npain and leaving the skin healthy and\nhydrated.", "minecraft:light_blue_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fashionable Bag", "A fancy leather bag. Those holding this bag\nwill find that whenever an item is put in, a\nnom nom nom' will be heard. Whenever an item\nis pulled out, they will hear 'put it back!\nscreeched at them. Whenever around cows, it\nwill seem as if they are glaring at the\nbagholder. Those who hold this bag will feel\ntheir emotions ever so slightly lessen.\n((Contact FlamboyantRage for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Veist Longarms", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Brown Bear's Head", "The head of a formidable bear, with a great\nbrow and wide mouth. It is an impressive\ntrophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bear.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Regular Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Frayhayt, lebn aun Kapital!", "A banner that shows ones support to the\nSaulist agenda in achieving a capitalist\nutopia, away from the prying tendrils of\nSanoism. Lang Lebn Ancapistan!", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Listing Paper", "(Rare) A piece of paper recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. While the words\non this piece of paper would be ineligible,\nthe numbers streaming down it would indicate\nthat it is a listing of supplies of some\nsort.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Smith & Wesson Model 500", "The Smith & Wesson Model 500 is a five-shot,\ndouble/single action large-caliber revolver\nproduced by Smith & Wesson, firing the .500\nS&W Magnum cartridge, a .50 caliber bullet.\nThe S&W 500 is built on S&W's largest frame,\nthe X-Frame, which was developed because none\nof S&W's existing double-action frame designs\ncould handle the muzzle energy and pressures\ngenerated by the .500 S&W cartridge. It is\none of the most powerful production revolvers\nin the world today, and it is being marketed\nas being \"the world's most powerful handgun\nby the manufacturer.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Bear Helm of Kaz'Ulrah", "A helmet, made out of a bear’s head. The\nhelmet seems to be rather valuable to the\nFrostbeard clan, and has significant value.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kaz'Ulrah Frostbeard.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Azwyraz", "The blade of Verthaik II Frostbeard which he\nused during the great War in which he\nconquered Urguan.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Raomir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Meticulous Made Ship in a Bottle.", "This ship is made to resemble the ship\nIthrun'Drakna, the massive steamship made by\nClan Stormbreaker for a prestigious occasion.\nA master feat of engineering, the ship bottle\nwould have a small funnel for water and coal,\nallowing the ships wheels to turn. This ship\nis no small gift at all.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SoulStrung.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Endrinkuli Drekmaraz", "A Dwarven mechanical crossbow, created by a\nDwarf veteran engineer. The top of the barrel\nhas a rectangular slot for holding bolt\ncartridges, which feed ammunition down into\nthe flight grove. The string is pulled back\nmanually via a crank mechanism, which can be\nremoved and attached to either side for both\nleft- and right-handed Dwarfs. The crank is\nsmall and extremely tight, designed for Dwarf\nhands, and only the strongest Human or Elf\ncould hope to use it properly. Orcs' and\nOlogs' hands are too big to use this weapon.\nThe body and gears are crafted of\nhigh-quality Dwarf puresteel. The engineer\nreluctantly resorted to these materials after\nrunning out of carbarum. Bolts fired by this\nweapon have enough force to pierce solid\nsteel.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("[H] Precious Painting", "This work of art is unlike anything you've ever seen.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Dwarven Shortsword", "A Dwarven shortsword with a halt shaped to a\nY'. It's blade starts thin yet the longer it\ngoes it becomes thicker. It also has various\ndwarven carvings on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Karimir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Urn", "An urn packed to the brim with skeletal ash,\nthe ash seems to contain small particles of\nalmost metallic appearance, shining dimly\nunder light opposed to the rest of the stark\ngray powdered bone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Kings Bling", "A large shiney blue gem attached to an\nironchain necklace. When light hits the gem\nit would shoot beams of blue light in every\ndirection. This item belongs only to the High\nKing of Kaz'Ulrah.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Father] Hamnil Frostbeard.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown Of Kaz'Ulrah", "", "minecraft:diamond_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Claw", "The claw is curved to form a loose 'C' shape\nthat is roughly 3 inches in full length. The\nclaw is black and would be on par with\nstrength just below that of a stone weapon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Ykk'arrs Shield", "A large iron kite shield, twice as big as a\nnormal one. It was wielded by Ykk'arr Da\nTroll, meant to fit his large size. The\nshield is heavy and can be operated only by\nsomeone large enough to wield it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyrmsbane", "This weapon has a bronze-ish hue with an\nelaborate glint to it. The axe-head bears\nflame-like decorations in its metal and a set\nof dwarven runes identifying the weapon by\nits name. The weapon’s handle is made from\ndecorated wrought iron, twisted to give the\nbearer a fair grip. The experienced\nblacksmith may see that the axe was forged\nfrom aengul aurum, refined slayer steel\ncapable of vanquishing most monsters.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Mother] Koralon Onyxheart.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Battle Axe", "The axe would have a normal cresent-shaped\nhead with a spike behind it and on the top\nall of them forged from Black Ferrum. The\nshaft of the axe would be 3.5 ft and made of\nsolid dark oak. Engraved, on the left side,\nof the axe head would be the Words \"Narvak Oz\nGarrond\". On the right side of the axe head a\nstar would be carved in with a C cutting it\ndown the middle showing it was made by Crevin\nStarbreaker.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HotBurritos.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Redwoodrose Wine Bottle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Redwoodrose Wine", "A red spirit that smells very fruity,\nalthough it seems to be a wine, the drink has\na faint smell of alcohol, yet it tastes very\nsweet and reminds of a bygone time, pleasant\nand rather nostalgic is the taste.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lucian Curaçao.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ladies' Rum", "A pink colored spice rum consisting of\nsorrel, cherries, and Curonian pepper.\nTypically enjoyed by the fashionable ladies\nat the Curonian court.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Halin (Dwarven Greatsword)", "A Dwarven Greatsword reaching the height of\n4ft. The Handle is golden and the blade a\nshiny steel sharp to the touch.The blade\nwould have engravings on it of unknown\norigins it would seem be the handle is\nwrapped in moss.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by J33xt101.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Definitely not Pork, probably Beef", "The juices still crackles from the expert\nhandling by the godlike chef, the seasonings\nperfect in every way. Kamal is not\nresponsible for any poisoning.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PorkNchopS.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Dire Wolf Claw", "(Common) A claw recovered from a wolf in a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The claw is\nnothing out of the ordinary, once belonging\nto a dire wolf whose master served the Maiden\nof Fertility.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Colossus Staff", "Soulbound II\nthe one i use on ur mom", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ball O' Wool", "A twisted ball of yellow yarn. Catnip has\nbeen stuffed into the center for its calming\naffects on felines. It was a gift from Tay to\nDamien.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("The Great Levathianus Axe", "large men only", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Relouria (Heavy Greatsword)", "A masterly crafted Longsword of Black Steel,\na massive 3'6\" long blade with the pommel to\nhandguard adding 11 inches. On either side\nthe blade is inscribed twice, one on each\noutside of the fuller. \"Princeps in Omnibvs.\nThe crossguard is plain on the top half, with\nNorse knots on bottom, each side a triad of\ndots. The guard/pommel are steel, and the\npommel is octagonal with a point for bashing.\nThe pommel has engravings, centered by a\nlarge oak tree, wrapped in diagonal black\nleather descending.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MaeceCetcher.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Vial of Wyvern Blood", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Paralyzing Hex", "Brewed through powerful witchdoctory, the\naffects of this hex would overcome its\nassailant in a wave of numbness and\nsluggeshness, and as time went on, brought\nthe victim into paralysis.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Divinejustice.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Feral Elf Ear", "(Rare) An ear recovered from a slain Feral\nElf. Not having been seen in centuries, the\nfew remaining feral elves were imprisoned in\ncages by the Ironborn and used for\nentertainment after the fall of Ondnarch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ratiki Head", "This small head of a Ratman is the trophy of\nthe execution that was the first strike\nagainst the plague. The Head was adorned with\na crushed Helmet made from Blacksteel.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Adria Pale Ale", "This brew has a very bitter nature due to its\nhoppy flavor. It has a light yellow color.\nDistilled and bottled by the Olde Adria\nBrewery, Inc.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RedfaceKilla.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Boiled Hive Tonic", "This is a carambola jar, containing boiled\nhive tonic. It smells waxy and sweet. Whoever\napplies this tonic topically to their skin\nwill exude beeswax from the applied surface,\nat a rate of three centimeters per hour, for\nsix hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred Paper", "(Common) Charred pieces of paper recovered\nfrom a cultist of Vilketa's layer. The words\non the pages seem to be in another language,\nand entirely indecipherable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana Wood", "This wood was taken from one of the Purple\nTrees scattered around Atlas. It does not,\nhowever, seem to bear any magical properties.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Smawton.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood of Khurmt", "This is a frog hide waterskin, containing the\nblood of Khurmt. It tastes watery, bitter,\nand of iron, and smells of rot and death.\nWhen a dark magic user drinks this entirely,\nthey may progress to the next tier of their\nmagic three days faster.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Medical Kit", "A container that shuts with a latch. When\nopened, one would discover that there were\nseveral pouches inside, containing medical\ntools. Tweezers, needle and thread,\nbandaging, alcohol and several other tools\nare found inside. Perfect for surgeries or to\nbring as a first aid kit!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LaffenOutLoud.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Lord Beesechurger's EPIC Axe", "Greasy finger prints were about the shaft of\nthe weapon as though it had been tenderly\ncared for by a greasy midget ape. Should a\nstraight male of any race pick this weapon up\nthey'd instantly be transformed into a\nhomosexual midget cuck!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shuggie_.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Potion of Celerity", "A potion that when drank, gives the consumer\nincreased reflex and agility. However, as the\neffects wear off, he or she may experience\nimmense pain in their muscles for a short\namount of time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _SuitAndTie_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Plate Leggings", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Extremely Warm Halfling Wool Suits", "An Extreme Halfling McGuffin, Keeps The\nHalfling Warm, Even In The Coldest Area.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrLollytime.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("blogus's delight", "a very prestigious epic bread wrapped over\nsausage...made by Blogus'Raguk and sponsored\nby CLAN RAGUK™", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Egg", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("his Aryan balls", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("PROJECTILE CUM LOAD", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Firewood", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackbear Skull", "The skull from a Blackbear that was recently\nslain, you can see a crack from an arrow head\nat the side of the skull. The Skull being the\nsize of someones upper torso, and weighing\naround 60 pounds.\n?Event Actor Approved?\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood of Yrodholm", "A very vintage pungent alcohol that the Vaeyl\nOrder used to brew in their stronghold city\nof Yrodholm. One sip is enough to knock a\nhardy Orc off his feet, and bestow upon them\nlucid dreams.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cold Bear Trophy", "The head of a Cold Bear; the mythical mounts\nof the Vaeyl Order that reside in the deepest\nsnowfalls of the Yatl Wasteland. This head is\neasily thrice the size of a normal bear, and\na single antler remains attached as testament\nto its former strength. There is a haunting,\nyet cold, sadness to its eyes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bird", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Horse Plushie", "This soft plushy has 'NMS' embroidered on the\nright ear, an authentic souvenir from the\nHorse Olympics Festival.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ShadowedOblivion.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Witch's Ring", "A simple golden ring, with the small shape of\nan upside-down triangle clumsily carved into\nits side. Possessed by an aurageist, this\nring changes the colour of one’s magic to a\ntwisted, dark, glowing, half-opaque purple,\nspare holy magic. The wielder of the ring\nfeels soft tingles on the worn area of flesh.\nThe tingling would slowly grow in magnitude,\nreaching heavy levels of pain if not taken\noff for a few hours. This ring was surely\nmeant for a finger that didn’t feel pain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AlFalah.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Turning Rum", "A standard edition of rum, bottled straight\nfrom a maturing oak barrel and distilled with\nnaturally grown sugarcane. Its taste would be\nslightly sharp but in turn allowing the\nnatural flavourings of the sugarcane to\nlinger upon the tongue, giving a sweet\naftertaste. Its bottle is marked with the\nHouse Arden crest. Upon drinking from the\nbottle an odd addiction would take hold of\noneself, leading to a quest for more of the\nsubstance.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tea of the Garden", "The tea leaves would form a light and elegant\nbrew, however with a sweet suggestion of\nsummer fruits it’d give its taste a\ncharacteristic twist with the hint of rose\nallowing it to glimmer a deep shade of rouge.\nIts bottle is marked with the House Arden\ncrest. Upon drinking from the bottle you\nwould have a strong addiction to have more,\nleading you to find more of the drink.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lovely Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyan Marble", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Marble", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cow Plushie", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Yucky Meat", "Gained from an insect monster fought by\norcish hunters. Tastes like cockroach.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Necklace", "A simpel solid gold necklace, it has a charm\nhanging from it made of a large amythist with\nthe words \"kourk\" enlayed with silver on the\nback of the charm\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Barazeq", "This scrumptious, light cookie has a unique\ntartness, hint of vanilla, and has chopped\npistachios on the top. The rounded bottoms\nappear to have been dipped in roasted sesame\nseeds before baking, helping give it a nice\ncrunch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Chunk O' Chocolate Cookies ⌘", "A small, decorated bag full of savory, round\ncookies. The cookies contain chunks of\nmilk-chocolate. The bag is clear, tied off at\nthe top by a blue ribbon. There’s a stamp on\nthe bottoms, reading: “Contains chocolate,\nmilk, wheat, and egg products.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Notepad", "One wonders how the pages are still dry", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("it's a chair from the aspects", "", "minecraft:jungle_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Great Staff of BLOGUS", "A long, sturdy and dense staff about five\nfeet in length. Upon the bottom of the staff\nis a ferrum covering, likely to be used for\nbattering people with. Atop the staff is a\nfigure head of Blogus' BEAUTIFUL, HANDSOME,\nface. Merry Christmas, MinionMan! -\nCaesar/Dabromino\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Blogus' Sweatshop.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_16(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Dragon's Spit", "The brew is sweet and spicy, like honey and\nhot peppers. It's been sitting in a barrel\nlikely for several years, a light red froth\nat the top of the glass. It bubbles\ndangerously, and the mere scent of it gets\none's eyes watering.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eranikus.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tidal Moon", "A two-handed crescent war-axe,\npractically designed with acid etchings\ndecorating the blade. An image of the\nmoon suspended over a torrent\nof crashing waves. Also bearing the\nsmith mark, P.Y.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pungent Jerky", "A few thick cut pieces of Dex-Mex Jerky, very\npungent, and potentially fatal to the lesser\nman", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Santa Hat", "★Developer Approved★\nSigned by Awe.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("St. Julia's Day Medallion", "This medallion is gifted to the winner of the\nSt. Julia's Day festival foot-race winner.\nIt's meant to be worn around the neck for the\nduration of the celebration! Blessed by High\nPontiff Jude I", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Human Dung", "You stand before some Grade A Elven fecies it\nbears a repulsize stench able to repel even\nthe dullest of noses", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Roll of Roughspun Burlap", "A roll of about 5 yards of roughspuin burlap.\nProperly sacklcloth, the burlap is hardy, yet\nis very uncomfortable to wear. Suitable for\nmost non-clothing cloth needs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:white_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Timeberry Wine ~circa ????", "It tastes of nostalgia, and has a dreamy\naroma to it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Throwing Dust", "A pouch of dust that seems to contain crushed\naurum. With one simple flick of the wrist,\none could throw a fistful of aurum in one's\nface. If you have multiple of this item, the\namount of aurum you throw increases (4 aurum\nitems may be a rather hefty bag, the size of\nroughly a baseball filled to the bring with\naurum). It seems like however had this had\nthe skill and tools to crush this golden\nalloy down to a size where one could breath\nit in.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mystery Uialben.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Toy Solider", "A wooden figurine made of smooth spruce wood,\nmade to resemble a knight in full plate,\nholding a shield and a greataxe. Neither his\nplate nor his shield hold any symbols that\nmay imply he serves any specific (existing)\nnation; there is, however, a raven carved\ninto his shield, wings spread out. The\nknight's head, limbs and wrists are slightly\ndetached to allow free movement.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Glass of Wine", "A wine glass filled with Avern Red Wine. Aged\nperfectly, holding a fruity hint - though a\nsoft nutty after-taste. It was blood-red and\nsmelt amazing. One whom took to Wine Mastery\ncould easily tell such perfection. To others?\nIt's just wine.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Missing L Pinkie] Ravena Avern.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Hair Rejuvenation Potion", "An olive-colored oil that can either grow\nhair where it's applied or rejuvenate hair.\nOne must be careful to not contaminate it\nhowever, or the hair growth substance could\nmove farther than its intended target, and\ngrow hair on the entire body! For this\nreason, the user should have clean hands\nbefore applying.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kathaikaz Lager", "Kathaikaz Lager is a full flavoured higher\nalcohol beer that has been brewed to 6.5%\nalc./vol. leaving this lager with a slighter\nsweeter palate that retains a dominant hop\nflavour and aroma along with a pleasantly\nsmooth finish. Brewed by Aemich Grandaxe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Frosty Skull", "This head is what's left after the icy\nfuneral ... bones. Fortunately, this was an\nundead looking for traces of magic, but it\ncould soon be a descendant in its place.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrunken Head", "A very grim and horribly distorted head\ndangling at you with blackened eyes. Upon its\nscalp were small cords braided over its head.\nThis braid is decorated with different\npearls, the arrangement of the ornaments is\nreminiscent of a tribal folk..\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Hempen Rope", "A thick braided rope spanning 20 feet.\nPerfect for all of your rope-related needs!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mystery_Uialben.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("An Intricate Qalasheen Bracelet", "An intricately made Kadarsi-Steel bracelet,\nseemingly made as part of a set. The metal is\nembossed with a beautiful water-pattern,\nsmall blue seashells dotted here and there. A\npeacock rests in the center, each of its four\nfeathers tipped with gems, two rubies, a\nsapphire, and an emerald. A four carat\ndiamond represents the birds eyes, glittering\nwhen in the sunlight. A silver inscription on\nthe inside reads, 'Forged by Caleb Crider,\nfor Safwa'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Abeam1.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Daemonsteel Wedding Ring", "A round ring made from deamonsteel with a\nscale-like pattern. Small pearls are embedded\ninto each scale and a flawlessly sharpened\ndiamond as the showpiece. Two names have been\nengraved into the ring: \"Mika\" and \"Evelyn\nto show they are symbolically bound to each\nother with this strong yet elegant ring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by mika1278.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Jameson Whiskey", "A sweet whiskey, brewed within curon by the\nfinest brewer,1665. A rather strong drink ,\nto warm and make merry with\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tea-buchet", "A glass cup of hot steaming water with a tiny\ntrebuchet on the side. The counter weight is\nthe tea bag and the loaded mini artillery is\nloaded with 3 cubes of sugar and some brown\npower that adds a winter mint flavour. The\ntrebuchet is made of cleanly cut dark oak\nwood. The sling is made out of some tiny high\nquality smooth thin hide from a pig, dyed\ncrimson ofcourse! Once activated correctly\nthe hot sweet tea has a clean vegetal\nflavour, it's dark red or brown in apperance.\n(It's Tea-riffic!)", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("❀Alabaster Leaf❀", "A small plant with alabaster hued leaves, the\nplant has been dug up from the roots. It's\nleaves can be crushed and used as a dye,\npaint or a poison that causes vomiting,\nnausea and dizziness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Nurse] Evelyn Uialben.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("•Krugsmas Card•", "A Krugsmas card decorated with hand drawn\nsnowflakes and a deep blue caligraphy. The\nfront of the card simply states \\\"Merry\nKrugsmas!\\\" with a simplistic doodle of the\naddressee on the inside and a signature that\nreads \\\"Love, Silver ❤\\\" Inside of the card\nwould be a pressed, bright red poppy.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sappling of the Peasant", "A sappling for peasants who can't afford real\nrp items. How's it feel living like a\nmedieval lower class piece of property to the\nnobility?", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Axe", "my guy, it's just an axe\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the axe.", "minecraft:wooden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("░Coarse Gold Dust░", "This gold dust has been filed from a gold bar\nto a coarse dust, the dust is held inside a\nsmallcloth pouch with a string around the\nopening for easy opening and closing as well\nas for fixing it to a belt. The coarse and\nsharp fragments of gold would likely hurt if\nthey were grabbed with a bare hand, it is\nrecommendedthat you use a glove or gauntlet\nwhen handling the gold dust.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evelyn Uialben.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Conjured Vine", "", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Doll", "A 11\"Inch tall doll of Krug! It's filled with\nsmall balls of cotton sprayed with alchemy\nmade Peppermint spray! Making the whole doll\nsmell like Krugsmas Spirit!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by a Krugsmas Elf.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Kutuhith", "A soft, white weed with thin green leaves\nsprouting from all over its length. It can be\nground into a dust and made into a paste to\nbe smeared on one's clothes, making them\nfire-proof.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Conjuration Scroll: Wiggly Cactus", "A magic tool which conjures a Wiggly Cactus.\nThe cactus is described in detail and is\nshown in a very neat sketch. The incantation\nof the cactus requires minimal knowlegde of\nthe void and a firm concentration upon using\nit (3 emote cast 1 use!)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hermit.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Daemonsteel Maul", "", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Gjota", "These flat-like fungi offer a sweet\nstench, unkile their taste, and are very\npale in colour, little specks of a very\nlight brown dotting it's crown. When\neaten, these mushrooms will make someone\nvery high, half of one makes the user\nvery aware of their surroundings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by VenymNyx.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Special Friendship Apple", "This apple can only be given from one friend\nto another!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Calendar: Horn in The Morn", "A small calendar, its cover full of\nshirtless men posed together with smiles\nfrozen upon their faces. Throughout the\nseven months shown, the models within the\nillustrations would wear little, showing\noff them bodies o' steel. It is for the\nyear 1961.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Calendar: Pretty in Pink", "A small calendar, its pages of a thick\nglossy paper. The cover would portray a\nman in a frilly white dress, holding his\nskirt down as wind would blow at it!\n((Marilyn Monroe my bros.)) The rest of\nthe months would show images of a similar\ncalibre, all for the year 1562.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DJSneeze.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Tobacco Bundle", "An immense collection of dried tobacco\nleaves. It seems to be held together with a\nsolid band of rope. The smell is unbearable\nfor most; unless stored in an enclosed space,\nany building will start to reek of pure\ntobacco. A tag juts out from the band of rope\n-- the back shows a small, brazen,\norange-on-black clover. The front has a\nsingle word; \"Luck.", "minecraft:hay_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Elixir of Intellect", "Also known as Wizard's Wisdom, this potion is\npurple in color and increases brainpower. If\none were to drink the potion, they would feel\nmore focused and their critical thinking\nskills would sharpen. It can aid a mage in\ncasting stronger spells quicker, but will\nrender their focus weaker after the effect\n(Can cast t4 and t5 spells 1 emote quicker\nfor 5 minutes, but will cast t4 and t5 spells\n4 emotes slower for 10 minutes after the\neffects wear off. Will also render them\nmentally exhausted).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("☼ Refreshing Lemonade ☼", "A sweet and sour mix of delicious lemonade,\nwith real, lemon taste. The color is a rich\nyellow, just the color lemonade should be.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Atlas' #1 Baker] Esther Lester.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystery's Bootsies", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Bolts", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Dingle Juice", "Fine wine created by the local Dingleberry\nFarms\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corpean.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carving of Mother and Father", "A carving of a mother and father holding\nhands. Encircling the father is dead\nvegetation, and the mother is too much growth\nto be supported. In the center is a harmonius\ngarden with people inside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Beaver", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson 'Peace' Stick", "A two foot long metal rod on a crimson dyed\nhickorywooden handle with a rounded ball at\nthe end of the rod, the ball can be exchanged\nfor an aurum one. The Peace stick is the go\nto weapon of the CCC when taking a non-lethal\napproach to dealing with a situation. The\nPeace stick also has a lanyard to prevent it\nfrom being removed from the wearers hand with\na short spike at the end for non-lethal\nstabs. The ball at the end can be unscrewed\nto reveal tassles with notches in them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Braum the Third.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhium Crystal", "A cold, bitter chunk of thanhium about the\nsize of a fist. The mineral seeps heat from\nthe environment, leaving anything in its\nradius covered by ice and frost, in the\nprocess turning the gathered heat into mana\nwithin the crystal. ((Note: this IS a legit\nsource. It's just been broken off from an LT\nsigned piece. PM Dabromino#2064 if you're\nunsure)).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thomas Browne.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar O' Blood", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cauldron With Soup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Message thebulter 'clock' if you have found this", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Zawabate Nectar", "A bottle fair bottle of nectar derived from\nthe Zawabate which gives great\nhallucionogenic properties. It has been told\nthat taking on this nectar can throw even the\nstrongest of Elves into what some call 'an\nout of body experience'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azraelon.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mental Vault Necklace", "This necklace would be lined with gold, thin\nchain. It's center piece would be an emerald\ngem that shines in the sunlight. It's simple\nelegance would attempt to conceal it's\nmagical properties. It'd ward, and shield\nyour mind from all mental magics that attempt\nto penetrate your mind. (( Recharge after\nabout two to three attempts that try and\nbreach your mind. Contact DevBug for more\ninfo.))", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("The Queen's Soap", "The soap is about the size of a person’s\npalm, is purple in color, and smells strongly\nof lavender. It’s made from goat’s milk,\nashes, lavender, and grape oil. It’s used in\nbathing or ladies perfumes. On the bottom is\nstamped with a crow.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar-Cookies!", "A sweet, simple cookie, baked with sugar and\nmolasses to be chewy and scrumptious.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystical Door Of Dimensions", "A door that when opened, leads to a far off\ndimension. It is not known what lies on the\nother side, as no one has returned from its\ndepths.", "minecraft:dark_oak_door", ""),
        StaticItem("Safety hat", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Cake of GM Love", "A GM loves you\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xalid.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Melkor's Shortsword", "An intricate blade made by Melkor, its size\nwould be between that of a dagger and a\nshortsword. It has beautiful, detailed\nengravings of what appears to be writhing\ntentacles and other strange but unique\ndesigns. It also has fine leather on the hilt\nfor a better grip.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Raglin's Totem", "", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Intimidating Marauder's Mask", "An intimidating mask that strikes fear into\nthe hearts of all. Tremble mortal, and\ndespair. Doom has come to this world!\nConceals the identity of it's wearer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sushi", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Melkor's Longsword", "A longsword forged by Melkor in his younger\ndays. The intricacy alone would show that he\nis truly a master of his craft. The steel is\nfinely polished and the hilt is wrapped in a\nblack tanned leather that had been dipped in\noil, giving the wielder a more comfortable\ngrip on the weapon. The pommel has a saying\nwritten in ancient elvish engraved into it,\nthough any who still live to understand it\nwould read: \"Symbolic acts so vivid, yet at\nthe same time, were invisible", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eggbert the Fourth", "A hardboiled chicken egg with a smiley face\npainted unto it with black paint. The back\nsays, in hardly readable handwriting,\nEggbert'. Handle with care.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Adrius.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ear Tips", "Ear tips that have been crudely flayed from\nthe head of an impure Mali' that took a Valah\nas her lover. Let this be a message to any\nother elf who may decide to do the same.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vyrthur Drennan.", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot", "A carrot that was handed down by the Carrot\nKnight, Ser Alexander. May this be a charm of\ngood luck to anyone that holds it.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Maple Samara", "The seed of a proud, vibrant maple tree, now\nproudly cast to the wind. To those connected\nto nature and the spectral forces, this seed\nfaintly whispers echoes of supernatural\ninfluence... Not evil, but an ominous sort. [\nPM Gallic to interact! ]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Solace.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("The Everlasting Azure", "One would see a relatively mundane clay pot,\nfilled to the brim with rich soil. However,\nshould the holder investigate further, or\nshould they be capable of sensing faint\nmagical auras, the item is revealed to be\nmore than what it seems. DO NOT PLACE DOWN.\nPM Gladuos for details.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dancer Doll", "A few straps of wood and chains were put\ntogether to craft this item- A small wooden\ndoll, limbs and head moveable at will, Even\nthe most tiny details drawn to make the\nimpression of a real elfess within the toy. A\nsmall dress is stuck to it, Appearing to\nglitter.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Pile of Gems", "A small pile of gems. They sparkle in the\nlight.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystic Fungi Spores", "It appears that there are spores trapped in\nthis bottle. They have a mellow blue glow and\nwould idly float inside of the bottle. One\ncould say it's what remains of the malicous\nFungi Magus'... [?]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tranquil Feather", "A feather of pure white, plucked from the\nskies above. It was soothing to touch,\nperhaps even to an addicting level. When held\nclose, the user would feel at utter peace;\ntheir mind at ease. When bound to a specific\nitem, it will provide immunity against mild\ntaints and diseases. [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nature.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Staff", "A large wooden staff with a stone firmly\nwrapped around the top to create a\nsemi-functional holding point, it would have\na bit of paint marked down the side reading\nMALN\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rickson.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Blue Card", "This small blue card is scribbled upon, in\nmessy scriptures. It would read; \"We luv you,\nmaln! Happi Red Rose Dey! From Velanna, and\nRyul.\" Ink is sploched across some corners of\nthe parchment, and a stickman drawing of four\nfigures, two parents and twins.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Shortspear", "This spear stands at a total 3 foot length.\nIt possesses a 2 foot haft, made of linseed\noil stained elm wood, carefully carved. The\nblade of the spear stands at a total foot\nlength, making up the remainder of the length\nand constructed of ferrum. Tied off between\nthe blade and haft is a clutch of assorted\nfeathers, tied with a leather cord.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Leyne.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Reiter Slayer", "This bloody beserker axe has the head of\nCedric Estermont attached on to its hilt.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Legoandra", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Th3_11th", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lumiin", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("ⱺ Swift Judgement ⱺ", "A 6ft spear with a 1ft blade made of feather\npatterned damascus steel. The blade is leaf\nshape and attached to a shaft of ash for a\nlight yet strong wood. The leather wrapping\nfor the handle is at the weapons balance\nspot, it is black to contrast with the creamy\ncolored wood. The symbol of a mountain\nmerging into a tree is branded in as well as\nthe words \"may someone give mercy, for I will\nnot\" stamped down the length of the weapons\nshaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Count Durlak.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Wakizashi", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Easterner War Scythe", "Formerly a farming tool probably, an\nEasterner human has put together a long pole\narm with a curved steel blade at the end.\nGood at clearing away masses of unarmored\ncivilians and decapitations.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Master Bobo.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Thot Blocker", "To block the thots.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Cherry Pie", "A frech delicious cherry pie make for the\nyoung' birthday boy! It's served with pretty\nsteel forks that easily cut through the fresh\npie. It has many hints of cinnamon. The pie\nis very 'apple-aling!' ;)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Braum the Third.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cobalt Blue Headcloth", "Made from flax. This soft piece of cloth can\nbe worn as a hood or scarf to protect the\nhead from the desert elements.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by cowmoonist.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Effigy of Nin", "An effigy of humanoid shape fashioned from\nblonde hair. It's adorned with silver clothes\nand gold string.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by 0w0_WhatsThis.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Pipe-reed Flute", "A crudely made pipe-reed flute. It sounds\ndecent, though.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Join the Aleksandrian Army!", "Join today! Talk to a Seargent, Captain or\nHigher to join the Aleksandrian Army! Free\nhouse, Armour and Weapons! Ave Staunton!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax Slip", "A tax slip worth exactly twenty-five Mina.\nWhile pretty in decorations, its only use is\nto pay taxes. It has some text on it,\ndetermining that it is an official city\ndocument. Additionally the Senntisten sigil\nhas been stamped at the bottom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Salier.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sigmar's Pimp Cane", "A cane only fit for the pimpest of Kings,\nbehold ye' \"The King of Pimps\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Zombie Blood Decoction", "This is an onyx wafer flask, containing a\nzombie blood decoction. It smells of iron,\nblood, and salt, and tastes like salty blood\npudding. Whoever drinks this decoction will\ndevelop a powerful hunger for the flesh of\nsapient creatures, for one hour.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("dank kush", "some real dank grass 420 blaze it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GloriaPreussens.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengul Eye Lense", "A clear shining lense of delicately carved\nand shaped Aengul eye. It reflects\nbeautifully in the light, and would be about\nthe size of a large man’s palm.These delicate\nlenses would be used within a magic engine to\nstrengthen and enhance magic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:glass_pane", ""),
        StaticItem("Stormstrike", "A durable and well crafted shortsword and\npebble sized charm. This item is able to\nconjure electricity to swarm the blade if the\ncrossguard is tapped. When discorded sixty\nfeet, and should the person mutter the\ncommand with the charm on them, the blade\nwill return to their person.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Paper Crown", "This golden paper crown is incredibly durable\nthrough the power of non specific magic. It's\nincredibly intricate designs are painted on,\nand feature diamonds, saphires, and other\ngems. On the inside it says, \"For Jan\nSigmund.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Preserved Black Truffle Slices", "A medium sized cylindrical bottle holding a\nfew small slices of black truffle suspended\nin a tannish yellow olive oil. A culinary\nremedy to make up for the scarcity of the\npungent delicacy that is the truffle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Brooch of Haunts", "At first glance this is a simple and ordinary\nbrooch. Upon being worn, however, the wearer\nwill occasionally hear whispers. As time goes\non the whispers will become more frequent and\neventually an implacable feeling of paranoia\nwill take over.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by 0w0_WhatsThis.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Clownfish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Turkey", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Squid Ink", "A jar full of ink. The ink was farmed from\nsome giant squids, which can be found all\nover the Atlasian Oceans.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Thahnium Bomb", "A bright, white, frothy brewski that is cold\nto touch like its namesake. Flecks of blue\nfloat within it and you really aren't sure if\nit's actual Thahnium or not. Tastes like\nfrostbite!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Boris's Babushka's Burly Beer", "A fine brew made with secret strelt\ngrandmother techniques! Boris approved and\nmuch better than normal strelt vodka. Is good\nthrowback to old days, Carry on Carrion!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleur du Cantal - Vintage 1576", "A powerful aromatic red wine born from grapes\nof the Barony of Cantal. It's an Auvergnian\nstyle wine fermented in the traditional manor\nof the House Valois; world famous in Oren\nthroughout the ages. It sponsors full-bodied\nwine with a faintly earthy taste. It sports\nvintage of the year, 1576.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Iheiuh'len", "This is a fine white champagne. All\ncraftselfship is of the highest quality. The\nliquid is a bubbling gold, masterfully\nbrewed, spazzed, and stirred by Aila Avern.\nIt is stored in an ornate glass bottle. On\nthe bottle is a label bearing it's name in\nancient elvish. There is a calligraphic A on\nthe label in green ink.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Adrian Brandy, Circa 1679", "A fine Adrian Brandy distilled from the many\nriverside vineyards of Belvitz, produced\naround the year 1679. Very intoxicating, and\nnot for those lacking constitution.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carnival Brew", "A multicolor ale that smells like sweet\nflowers. The color is a clear mix of red,\nblue, and green. It doesn't seem very\nalcoholic, but it does seem very tasty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Senntisten Gold Medal - Detective's Award", "A shiny gold medal on a purple ribbon, the\nRenatian coat of arms proudly displayed on\nit, along with a fluffy cat beneath! The\ninscription reads: \"Senntisten Gold Medal -\nTo Detective Adelheid Frau von Alstreim for\nher services to the Capital, 1671.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart-Shaped Locket", "A silver locket, small in size, finely\nengraved and shaped like a heart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sigmund Alstreim.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Dragon Figurine", "A cast bronze figurine of a scaly dragon\nready to take flight, its beady eyes gleaming\ngold. Terrifying!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Figurine", "A cast bronze figurine of a recognizable\nelfess of pleasant contours, roughly the size\nof a human palm. Several details would stand\nout: her curly hair, adorned by a\nrose-patterned hairpin, and a heart-shaped\nlocket held in her hands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Raven and Stoat Medallion", "One half of a peculiar silver medallion,\nmasterfully engraved with a delicate flower\npattern around the outer edge. Depending on\nwhich part is held, either a raven or a stoat\nis displayed near the middle, forming a duo\nif both halves are joined.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Plantern", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Foxglove", "Growing from a small terracotta pot, a young\nfoxglove plant spreads its leaves out\nskyward. It's slim branches seem to have been\nshaped however, into intricate swirling\npatterns. Small flower buds line some\nbranches, the plant seeming to thrive under\ncareful care.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth Bundle", "Unfurling the neatly wrapped cloth from this\nsmall parcel reveals two figures crafted from\ncloth, their clothing adorned with tiny\nembroidered flowers. Orange wool makes up the\ncurly hair of the left figure, who appeared\nto be holding the hand the right, a coat clad\ndoll with a warm smile. An even tinier cloth\nchicken sits between them, a sprig of\nlavender in it's beak.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("A Scarf!", "A skillfully crafted red scarf! The fabric is\nsoft and rich, the edges trimmed with a neat\nsilver lining. Flowers and ravens have been\nembroidered into the cloth, creating a scene\nof birds in a meadow all up and down the\ngarment!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Captured Courlandic Standard", "A poorly and hastily sewn banner of Courland,\ntattered and bloodied, seized by Renatian\nknights during the Siege of Red Peak, 1668.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:green_banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Iris", "A singular iris flower, preserved eternally\nby means unknown!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("The Stewards Umbrella", "A beautifully crafted umbrella of elven\ndesign, the wooden handle varnished to be a\nwarm and shining dark brown. Its gleam\nbrought out the intricate carvings that ran\nup and down the wooden areas, each one a\ndifferent plant or animal, often interacting\nwith one another. The cloth spread over the\nmetal frame of the umbrella held its own\npattern, the green fabric carefully decorated\nwith little frogs of various sizes!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Laethesia.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("❖ Shield of Embers [T5] ❖", "Kite shield with ornaments made of aurum, it\nwould have a sharp edge on the upper side and\nan ideogram with the shape of a shield on the\ninner side, which would cause the shield to\nignite in golden soulfire if a being of\ncorrupted nature enters in direct contact\nwith the shield. Burning their tissues and\ncausing an unbearable pain ((PM Suxals for\nmore information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Necklace", "A glistenting collection of crystals,\nthreaded upon a string. They would glitter as\nyou moved them in the sunlight, seeming to\nchange colors in different shades of light!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kinslayer.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Miniature Piano", "This is a very finely made miniature piano.\nAll the keys would function and make the\ncorrect sounds. It seems that someone did\nvery detailed and complex work on this. On\nthe side of the piano it would say, “~Jaya\nJayamen Classic Grand Piano”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:noteblock", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｆｅｎｎｉｃ Ｔｅａ", "The Specialty Tea od the South, known as\nFennic Tea, is one that is both Balanced, and\nCOld enough to let off Smoke. The Fennic Tea\nis infused with Peppermint, Lemon Balm,\nLicorice Root, and Blue Pea Flowers to give\nit the Signature Taste, Look , and Feel those\nhave come to Love. The Tea is both Sweet and\nMinty, leaving anyone Drinking it Refreshed.\nCovering the top of the Tea would be a layer\nof Shredded Ice, adding to its Signature\nCold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fennic Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Chisel", "A cheaply made tool consisting of a metal rod\nflattened at the tip with a wooden grip. Used\nto carve into stuff.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whimsycal.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Demon", "A tall cup of rich espresso with hints of\ncranberry. Taking on a dark hue, a close eye\nwould show a slight red tint to the drink.\nThe finely ground blend's amount of caffeine\nwould certainly give a boost of energy!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Silveress.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Refreshing Spring Water", "Slightly better than regular water! Maybe.\nTastes surprisingly similar to plain bottled\nwater.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Silveress.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chorizo and Egg", "Chorizo sausage served with a melted sweet\ncheese and egg. A good morning/brunch meal\nfor the average human looking for 'homey\ncooking'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Talapia Salad", "Grilled Talapia fish chopped and served over\na salad with a slice of limon on the side.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Love and Peace Potato", "This potato has a heart carved into its skin,\nand a letter seemingly carved below that in\nsuprisingly legible charecters. \"I do hope\nthis potato bridges the gap in our friendship\nand love, and that we can move on as time has\nallowed us. May we once again be the allies\nwe once were. - Lily Anarion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Paradise Coconut Cookies", "Buttery sugar cookie with a nutty aroma.\nThese coconut cookies are loaded with toasted\ncoconut and crispy on the outside and soft\nand chewy in the middle. They are made with\nParadise Coconuts' and much Cottonwood love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [High Chief] Bjor 'Sugartits' Cottonwood.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Atlasian Seagrass", "This plant grows in the oceans of Atlas. It\nappears to be used by sailors and merchants\nas a stable food supply for their long\ntravels.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearth-Heat Coffee", "Warm and bitter coffee, brewed to great\nstrength with a light amount of grinds left\nin the mix. A hint of cardamom spices the\ndrink with a hearty, smoked aftertaste.\nDelicious!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tiva.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rat droppings", "A trail? Maybe a clue! ... But actually it's\nkinda gross that you picked it up.", "minecraft:soul_sand", ""),
        StaticItem("Acorn", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Fenton Thermos", "A normal-looking thermos, aside from the\nemerald fused into its bottom. A button\npressed on the side activates a Translocation\nenchantment, in which stone-sized objects can\nbe placed in and pulled out of the thermos.\nThe holder can pick and choose what to pull\nfrom it via a Mentalism enchantment, as long\nas they understand what it is they are\nlooking for. ((PM SpodoKaiba for more\ninformation))", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("A Month of Crow", "This is a copper leaf vial, containing a\nmonth of a life of a crow. It smells and\ntastes of nothing. When consumed, for the\nnext saint's day, causes its drinker to\nbehave as a crow would.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mali'ker beating stick of the Kool Kids Klub", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Miners Ale", "A brew thought up while sweating in the mines\nof Mynebor, a nice fresh brewed ale, straight\nout of an oak cask.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by J33xt101.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Austrasian Citizenship Papers", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("I.O.U. Porkchop", "Exchange this at the gates of the PK Gates\nfor one free porkchop. Redeemable until\n01/01/2019\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Silverbrew Mead", "A sweet honey mead with a perfect mixture of\nsweet but strong. It's very smooth and goes\ndown easily but can knock out a lesser being.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ulfrikr (Bearded Battleaxe)", "Thy who faces what harsh frost brings shall\nfear none but death itself. Drom'kosfadir.\nThy who quenched blade in blood of another\nhuman shall forever bare his soul. Ylo wita\nfe vaskr brodir. Thy who looked in wolf eye\nwill know forever what it means to be part of\nnature. Tra'viik'jar sitja. Thy who gave your\nlife to protect family will know true pride\nof passing. Vaskr hlaeja ull faer konungur.\nSkarpefanger clan shall last as this blade\npasses through it. Till last day till last\nbreath.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Rum", "Served on ice. A pretty flat but practical\ndrink. The taste is reminiscent of a wicked\nevening and awakens a strange nostalgia. It\nleaves a creamy feeling on the tongue and\nseems to be one of the high-percentage\nvarieties.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lucian Curaçao.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood-Fermented Leather Wrapping", "This thick strand of leather has sat at the\nbottom of vat filled with the blood of an\nunknown creature. It smells of iron and raw\nhide.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rajnarok.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Losenge", "A sweet yellow losenge made of hardened\nsyrups.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Flame Ejecter", "In your hand lies a blue gem, a sapphire,\nwith a silver band around it. It would be\nenchanted with fire magic. When saying\n\\\"Scorch\\\". It would slowly start building up a\nflame coating, which, after a while bursts\noutwards. ((1 activation emote, 3 buildup\nemotes, 4th emote it fires. No concussive\nforce, just a burst of very hot fire. Saying\nthe phrase will activate all those that you\nhave on you, so beware. One use, then it can\nbe recharged. 2 blocks of range in every\ndirection. Contact FlemishSupremacy for\ninfo.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:lapis_lazuli", ""),
        StaticItem("Starbreaker Sword", "A dwarven sword of black ferrum alloy with a\nunique design. The blackened blade stretched\nto a length of 28inches, with aurum lines\nalong the center of the blade, the hilt was\nmade of bronze, with a forge with three stars\nabove it carved into it, the sigil of the\nStarbreaker Clan. It weighed roughly 6lbs,\ndue to the alloy used.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Stromnikar Starbreaker.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Starbreaker War Axe", "A double-bladed axe of dwarven design and of\na black ferrum alloy, the two axe-heads split\ndown the middle with a strong, dark oaken\nbase, the hilt wrapped in a dark leather. It\nsat at a meager 12inches, and weight 3lbs,\nmade for one-handed use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Stromnikar Starbreaker.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Heat Resistance Potion", "A red-gray potion rests here, smelling like\ncinnamon. Yum. If imbibed, the user's body\nwould seem to cool down, leading to a slower\nheart rate and a faint chill to the touch. If\ntraveling in a warm area, one would be better\nable to resist the effects. (50% Reduction.)\nThis would be effective for traveling in\nvolcanic areas, underground caves of magma,\nor better enabling one to handle standard\nnon-magical fire. Lasts 2 irl hours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Zeugl Skin", "The dark, rubbery hide of a Zeugl that was\ncrudely stripped from its corpse. This\nmonster-flesh once belonged to a creature\nthat had made its home in a shipwreck, before\nit was slain by the Haensetian Royal Army.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("✮ Wooden Lyre ✮", "Arcane I\nA curved line of wood, with a long U\nprotruding from its ends. A long vine is\nengraved into the polished oak, flowers\ncluttering its length with gem and metal\nfillings. Small holes are drilled into it,\nfor strings of various diameters to go\nacross. When strummed, they produce a light\nthump; when using this lyre the user's mind\nis calmed, and they feel as though they are\ndoing their best - allowing for a better\nperformance.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:fence", ""),
        StaticItem("White Chocolate Egg", "A chocolate egg that resembles a chicken egg,\nhowever made of chocolate, these eggs can\nsometimes be filled with smaller chocolates.\n(/roll 2, if you roll a 2, you get extra\nchocolate).\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Silk Blankets", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Painted Wooden Abacus", "A finely polished painted wooden abacus. A\ncounting apparatus with many different rungs\nwith 10 beads on each . It is well finished,\nand slightly glossy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:ladder", ""),
        StaticItem("Erin Doll", "A crude figure made of bent and tied together\nbits and pieces of sugar cane, tied together\nwith bits of twine and tree sap holding the\narms and legs in place. The head would have\nfrayed twine for hair, made to crudely\nresemble Erin. It would be clothed in a blue\nand white dress, much like a smaller version\nof Erin's, and done very simply, by someone\nwith little skill.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Faroean Mocha", "A wonderful-smelling piping-hot mocha rests\nhere. Based on the design of someone dear to\nthe brewer, this mocha-flavoured coffee is\nmore than capable of raising the spirits\nafter a low day. A faint note is on the side\nof each bottle. 'Thanks, E!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Short Dagger", "A Short Dagger made by Dwarves", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Revenge of the Kha", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("You have pissed me off", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Pick", "This Ice pick has a thick-toothed bottom edge\nto grip onto the ice", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Elemental Blade", "This item needs repair before it can have any\nuse. Contact Malgonious when a forging\ntechnique is acquired.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Voidsteel Blade", "", "", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Mana Potion", "A teal potion rests here, seeming to swirl\nwithin the bottle. If swirled, it would\nalmost seem to glimmer and shimmer like a\ngalaxy contained within a bottle. If uncorked\nand drank, one would find their mana pool\nrecharging a signifigant amount , recharging\na T5's mana reserves by half. However at the\ncost, they would find to physically tire\nfaster and their magic would be lowered by 2\nTiers for 7 emotes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vanilla Rum", "A nose-burning rum rests here, brewed in the\nwoods of Arberrang with homemade equipment.\nCapable of getting even the largest of men\nsloshed in a few shots, this vanilla-spiced\nrum is more than capable of satiating even\nthe most ravenous alcoholic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Absolution", "I AFK'ed too long and Died (Rough Itme Copy)", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Currenta", "A silver shimmering cocktail, with soda. The\ndrink is ice-cold and seems particularly\nappealing. The little bubbles in the drink\nseem to rise more slowly than usual, leaving\nthe impression that the time in this cocktail\nis slowing down.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lucian Curaçao.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Crucible steel", "An alloy of cast Iron, iron, steel, ashes and\nother fluxes. It can be used to create the\nstrongest of weapons, although in it's early\nstages of bending to one's will, it is\nbrittle and must be worked with care.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Boomsteel", "The ore would have explosive characteristics,\nheavy and notable by it's ebony-looking hue.\nA sour stench would reek from the raw form\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by JustJennaaa.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Rope", "Dry strands of wild fibers, woven sturdy into\nthe form of a reliable, indespensible form of\nequipment. Its uses are limitless.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Rings", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Croissant", "A freshly baked croissant, with a flaky outer\ncrust, and soft, tender bread on the inside.\nThe delicious pastry smelled savoury with a\nhint of sweetness, any good man's weakness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ailsa Gromach.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bapir Bread", "A circular wafer of semi-sweet barley bread.\nThe bread has been baked into a circle with a\n6 inch diameter, and sits at one inch tall.\nThe wafer bears a flat top, and is browned\nall over. The bread bears a somewhat bland,\nporridge like taste, with a mild honey-like\nsweetness. The browned crust of the bread is\nrather thin, whilst the inside of the bread\nbears a yellowish tan color.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Breadsmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Soft Red Scarf", "This scarf is composed of soft wool,\nextending 5 feet in length, It can wrap\naround a neck serveral times. Along the\nentire length of the scarf, runs a single\ngold thread, untill the end. The ends are\nfrayed and tied in small knots on the end!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Frosthander.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Fitermon's Cake", "Thicc and juicy fluffy cake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeing Eye Cane", "This cane allows those without sight to\nnavigate without running into things! It has\na loop to stay on the wrist and not fall.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Feather", "An abundance of multi-coloured feathers\ncollected from the nests of Bokolos found\nnear the Warhawkes. The feathers are soft to\nthe touch, and are rather large, bigger than\nthe palm of an average sized being. Typically\nin Warhawkian culture, these feathers are\ngifted from one person to another, as to ask\nfor their hand in marriage. If the other\nperson accepts, they are seen as officially\nmarried by Warhawkes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Whispering Secrets.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Deer skull", "The skull of a now hunted deer, it has been\ncleaned and treated to a point of \"not\ndisgusting\". It would make for a fine\ndecoration!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sword Pendant", "A pendant, clearly meant to be pinned upon a\nman's lapel or vestment, shaped like a great\nlongsword. It would be of pure gold, though a\nsmall pebble-sized onyx gemstone would rest\nat where the blade met the hilt. A fine, yet\nsimple bade of prowess for any warrior or\nsoldier.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Jeweled Bracelet", "A beautiful bracelet with green gemstones\nthat will look graceful on any woman. The\ngems align perfectly around the wrist, being\nset upon a silvery ring. In the sunlight, the\nstones sparkle and gleam showing off the\nsuperior craftsmanship.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Beiras Promise", "An extravagant 24 Karat gold ring, it has\nthree bands entwining like roots of a tree in\na reef. Vined prongs slither up, close at the\nbase of the centerpiece gem and enveloping it\nenough to cover the gem. The gem itself is a\nlustrous green emerald, flawlessy cut with\nextraordinary clarity. As if carved inside of\nthe gem itself is a strange rune that\npresents itself majesticly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MaeceCetcher.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Statuette of a Boat", "An intricate statuette of a boat, 5 inches\nlong and 2 inches wide can be seen attached\nto a gold base. The base would be ridged,\ngiving off the impression of waves. It is\nclear to see that the length of time\nconstructing such an oddity would have been\nno small number.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Afturkvald Popato", "A grand popato grown to be found! I wonder\nwho will collect the most....\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PosidonX7.", "minecraft:potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Lotus Elixir", "A peculiar smelling potion rests here. Made\nof potent Blood Lotus, this potion here is\nthe perfect meal solution for the soldier on\nthe go. Composed of the aforementioned herb\nand mixed with a beef-broth to create a\npleasing meal, this would grant the\nindividual a dietary supplement and can even\nhelp one lose weight if rumours are true.\nGreat for camping on a long hunt. Extended\nuse can redden the skin, however...so caution\nmust be given.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Poison Bolt", "A crossbow bolt rests here, deep channel\ngrooves carved into the bolt's tip. From\nthere, an insidious green mixture leaks.\nShould an individual be shot by this bolt,\ndepending on the area (closer to heart =\nfaster effect) they would begin to undergo\nvarious hallucinations, causing them to\nwonder what is real and what is not. While\nnot 'poison' by the traditional method,\nenough of the Saffvil getting into the blood\ncould destroy one's mind. It also numbs the\narea shot.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Holy Mace", "Forged of Slayersteel. This Mace is meant for\ndealing damage, its head alone weighs in at\nabout 150lbs and consist of a plethora of\nspikes to deal maximum damage to undead or\nother. It gives off a slight glow, almost as\nif it's Holy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by VengefulLucifer.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Snowboots", "Heavy hobnailed boots of rusted bronze plates\nlayered over thick leather and white fur. In\nthe depths of the Yatl Waste, these boots\nhelped the Vaeyl Order traverse the heavy\nsnows.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Greathelm", "A visored bascinet forged entirely from\nbronze that has been long since layered in\nthick rust. The sides are adorned with\ngrandeur wings, and beneath the rust the\nhelmet bears eroded designs of men holding\nspears beneath a wall.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Bastardsword: Bellum =~", "A Bastardsword sits in your hand, the blade\nbeing 120 centimeters in length, weighing\n1,2kg. The hilt is made for both hands, two\npieces of red leather separated by a\ncheckered black and silver steel piece that\nsat in the middle of the oval hilt, the blade\nsharpened into a fine point, allowing for\nquick thrusts and slashes from the sword, the\nguard of the sword was that of plated silver,\na canonist cross etched into the pommel with\na ruby sitting comfortably on each end of the\ncross\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Fancy Shortsword: I Dixerunt Non =~", "A Shortsword sits in your hands, 40\ncentimeters in length weighing barely a\nkilogram. The hilt would be made out of a\nfine Rosewood with Red Leather adorning it\nfor a firmer grip, the guard of the\nshortsword being plated with gold, etched to\ndepict a young woman fending off numerous men\nin what appeared to be a tavern, keeping them\nat bay with arm outstretched, tables and\nstools overturned. The pommel was made out of\ngoldplated steel, with a ruby in the bottom\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gwai Apples", "A naturally occurring fruit, growing in the\nfrozen wastelands to the south. Pale gold,\nthe fruit is delicious, having a crispy sweet\nflavour with a hint of tartness that cloys to\nthe tongue, lingering long after the fruit\nhas been eaten.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Shroudbloom", "A very rare herb, found in the remote parts\nof swamps, often uncovered surrounded by a\nthick underground, making it a cumbersome\ntask to reach and harvest. It is small and\ndelicate, with gentle, light blue petals\nshaped like small, curving teardrops.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Snail Shell", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Young Zekhrum-Alloy Snake", "A small creature, no more than half a meter\nwhich seems more like a metal snake than a\nliving being most of the time. Organic\nfeatures such as mouths and eyes manifest\nalong the creature on occasion, only becoming\nactive from its otherwise sedentary state\nwhen bothered or hungry. Passively, the\ncreature will exude a thin green liquid when\nfeeding, occasionally making distorted\nchirps.", "minecraft:end_stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Ring", "A finely made silver ring with scribbles of\nancient elven written on the outside and\ninside of the ring, an small emerald would\nsit ontop of the ring, It’s bright color\nreflecting off things around it, If the gem\nwas tapped, the emerald would begin to give\noff a green glow as it seems as the finger it\nis on will be able to be used like a\npaintbrush of sorts, being able to draw in\nthe air, sadly, after a few minutes the\narcane drawings would disappear\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lockezi.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Thin Banded Gold Ring", "A thin band of pure gold, decorately\ndelicately with intricate sets of carvings.\nUpon the top face of the ring sits a small,\nred gem. The gem would noticeably sparkle in\nthe light, causing it to flicker like a\nrainbow. On the inner side of the ring were\nwords scribed in ancient elven.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nephanee.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Glimmering Aquamarine Ring", "A silver ring, elegantly hand crafted. The\nring itself is simple, but placed delicately\nin the center is a small aquamarin gemstone,\ncut in an octagonal shape. Sterling silver\nencases it, keeping it held against the ring,\nwhile giving it a small amount of detail.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Belladonna Graves.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Corrupted Mana Crystal", "", "", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart of the Frost Wyrm", "", "", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Focus Chamber", "A two by half foot chamber of arcanium\nmage-gold, the concealed inner ribs\ncontaining a grand total of twenty mana-gems,\neach of which are transmuted to have their\nenergy drawn towards a set of center rings. A\nspace in the center of the chamber is left\nwith three rings for placement of a very\nspecifically sized crystal, accessible via a\nremovable bottom attached to a connective\nshaft. The top of the apparatus is lain with\na sheet of focus-crystals, serving to channel\nany energy dispersed by the center crystal\ninto a singular, well focused beam - capable\nof traveling far further by magnification of\nthe force in question.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arzota.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Woodland Creature Cupcake", "A vanilla cupcake of moderate size. It is\niced with black and gray icing, decorated to\nresemble a raccoon's face.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell of Cernunnos", "A seashell used by numerous crabs for their\nhomes, or to protect from the wilds. Now,\nabandoned and left to the will of nature.\nThis unique, mystical item can be held to\none's ear as they would hear the marches of\nthe wilds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Witches' Curse", "The medeusculor is fairly worn, the letters\nP, L and A etched into the side of the\nweapon, yet the L seems to be crossed out.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Caladblog II (T5 Ascended Hearth Infusion)", "A set of five arrows, more akin to lances in\ntheir design, but thin enough to be fired\nfrom a bow. The tips are coiled into spirals\nto rend flesh with ease, made of a dense\ncarbarum alloy. Upon being tapped twice, they\nwould ignite with a holy flame, vaguely green\nin color. This flame, upon contacting an\naltered soul, would severely burn the being\nin question. The fire would only burn what it\ncomes in contact with and not spread. (The\ninfusion will be active for 4 emotes. 8 uses\nbefore recharge)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Pristine Compass", "A comapss which appears to be in absolutely\nmint condition. Within the compass are many\ndifferent and almost unnecessary looking\nmechanics. Regardless of the former, the\nneedle doesn't appear to work right, either\nshifting in a seemingly random direction or\nnot moving at all. On the underside of the\ncompass is the symbol of a hollowed out\ntriangle, a tilted scythe passing through it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by NailmasterSpiffy.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Revision", "A simplistically designed wooden staff.\nCrimsion paint decorates the base of the wood\nand traverses up along it in a circling\npattern, as well etched into the staff rests\nvarious carvings with their appearance akin\nto fire while in the center lays the image of\na pheonix neatly carved into the wood.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_17(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("The All Seeing", "This helmet constructed of a strange alloy of\nunique gems crafted all around the solid\nhead, however purely where the eyesockets\nremain being the most dense. These gems are\nalso mixed with reflective crystals of pure\nwhite. When worn the helmet will synch up to\nyour mind and give access to vision of every\ndirection around onesself.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Vials of Spirit Blood", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Manifestation of Consumption", "A very old human fingerbone riddled with\ncountless tiny inscriptions carved into its\nmarrow. These odd messages are not able to be\nread, but rather are whispered to the holder\nthe means to grow powerful through undead\ncannibalism. It is as though the bone still\nlives, acting as the messenger of the one who\ndiscerned this ascension - the Redhood.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("A Small Wooden Flower", "A Small carved flower with crude detail\nclearly the word of a child\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SeventhCircle.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of the Jökulthrall", "An amulet that when worn by someone effected\nwith harsh cold, their skin would feel warm\nas a normal decendant upon physical touch.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Devourer Ash", "This is the sapling of an ash tree. It is\npotted in the depression of a rotting oak\nlog. It is fifty centimeters in height, and\nemits a harsh odor like burning wood. So long\nas there is dead or decaying plant life\nwithin one-hundred meters, it will continue\nto grow as normal, otherwise it will wilt.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf's Fang", "A bluesteel bastard sword webbed with thin,\ndark cracks. They seem to seep a subtle ebon\nmist, and will absorb the lifeforce of those\nwounded by it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of the Far Glade", "A rock, or is it a gem? Regardless, it is a\ncrystalline object that has been carved into\nthe shape of a leaf. The rough edges indicate\nthat it took the creator quite some time, and\nthe tools they used were blunt, and likely\nmade out of stone. [Imagine a leaf stone from\nPokemon.]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Living Longevity] The Far Glade Spirit.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ivory Drinking Horn", "An expertly carved drinking horn of ivory,\ninlaid with brass motifs of grapes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("= Banner of the Almenodrim =", "A resplendent bolt of sanguine crimson silk,\nwell-suited for purposes of display and\ngarment-sash both. It is embroidered with\nfine silver thread, rendering upon its broad\nsurface the device of the Almenodrim House\nSylvaeri; a series of seven eight-pointed\nstars above an intricate silver crown.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana Node", "A gem about the size of a smell pebble. It's\nsurface is smooth and absent of any flaws,\nwith edges that are quite sharp, enough to\ncut flesh with enough force. The crystal is\ntransparent with a dim green light within its\ncenter that had rhythmic increases and\ndecreases in intensity. If one held this\nitem, they would be able to access the Rift\nLands of Haelun'or, or leave if you are\ncreature of the Rift Lands. ((PM Thanhium for\nmore information.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by niceguynorman.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Hrunting", "An intricately designed lance-esque arrow\nthat is entirely pitch-black with a few small\nedges coiling around it's thin core,\nspiraling around it and somewhat curving\noutward. These small edges allow the arrow\nit's serrated qualities which allows the\npiercing and rending of flesh with ease.\nAlong with this a diamond gem rests just\nbelow the center of it's spine, that when\ntapped twice will begin to conjure a small\nflame- about it's tip over the course of 2-3\nemotes. After the next emote the flame will\nburst and cause substantial kinetic force to\nthose around the exploasion, enough to break\nbone and push people to the ground.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Alluring Stone", "An alluring stone which appears to hold a\nsmall blue orb in its centre, shoning out\nlightly with a vague buzz sounding from its\ncore.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Liquid Essence", "A bottle of churning, magical fluid. It has\nmultiple uses, be it for sustaining some\nmagical creatures, or for other applications.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wrist-mounted Spike-launcher", "A ferrum gauntlet, with lines of magegold\nrunning through it. Upon it is mounted an\naurum spike, connected to a canister. Upon\nactivation, the spike shoots forth with the\nspeed of a crossbow bolt. Three emotes total.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Lovebirds", "If you've received this flower, you've been\nblessed", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueapple-Pine Brew", "A blue spirit that is very reminiscent of a\npunch, the fruity taste has an exceptional\ndepth and has a rustic finish, the drink is\nalso bubbly, and therefore at the same time\ncaptivating! Recommendation of the manager!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lucian Curaçao.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Assorted Nuts", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("A Beef", "It's a beef.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Chiggen", "Happy birthday Fitermon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Distress Switch", "A basic household enchantment using a long\ndistance focusing crystal. When activated, a\nspecific and attached gem would adorn a soft\nglow, as would the gem at the apex of his\nswitch. As the two gems get closer, the light\nwill get brighter and brighter.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Chêne Cognac", "A standard edition of brandy, carefully hand\ncrafted and aged within oak. Offering a\nsmooth and velvety taste, hinting the\ntastebuds with almond and walnut before\nleaving a combination of fruits and ginger\nupon the tongue. Its bottle is marked with\nthe Vienne crest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Token", "A Chalice is imprinted on the golden coin.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by InfamousCanadian.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Yellow Blanket", "", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Pile O' Rope", "The rope is five centimeters in diameter and\nforty meters in length.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ovari Pine Soap", "This lovely, green, soap would smell\nbeautifully of pine, mint, and shea butter.\nIf used, it offered a calming sensation, as\nEternal Leaves were crushed into it along\nwith other herbs. The lye and lard made bar\nwas expertly made, and could last for months\nof wear and used. For maxium effectiveness,\nkeep in a soap container. The shea butter\nwithin the green bar would also offer a\nsoftness to the body or hands it was used on.\nIn the Middle is an Orvari Eagle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:concrete", ""),
        StaticItem("Promise", "A beautifully crafted silver bracelet with\nthe inlay of several different gems. The\nbracelet would have a running stream etched\ninto the metal several willow trees could be\nseen along the banks of the stream. The\nbracelet would have an interesting clasp on\nit, it would be fashioned in the way of a\npuzzle lock not showing any visible way of\nunlocking it. Along the edge of the bracelet\nthe initials E.N.S and E.J.T.W.S could be\nseen etched along the metal.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Whisper", "Whisper would be a beautiful wedding ring\nfashioned of quartz. There would be seven\nglimmering emeralds inlaid around a large\nperfectly cut diamond at the head of the\nring. It would be of completely unique design\nsave for it's pair: Eternity.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Hairclip of the Forest", "A hairclip, made of dark green emerald. It's\ncarved with the scene of a forest lake\ncentered in the stone, a herd of deer\ndrinking at the left and a few rabbits on the\nright. If one looks closely a wolf can be\nvisible between the trees on the left side,\nstalking the deer.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather of a Cockatrice", "The ornate feathers of a cockatrice. Often\nused for ancient ceremonies, these things are\nnow a rarity amongst certain collectors.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by french_king3.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloom", "Bloom would be an engagement ring fashioned\nof gold. At its crown would sit a pristine\nheat treated diamond. The diamond would\nreflect a beautiful rose onto the wearers arm\nwhen shone through from above by light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Leg", "An arcane leg forged of a fine, lightweight\nsteel. Severa hatches run along it,\ncontaining the gems that fuel the telekinesis\nand mental magic enchantments that allow it\nto function. It would act much the same as a\nnormal leg, though durable and in eed of\nrefueling once every five weeks. ((PM\nFury_Fire for more information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Swiss Cheese Steel Leg", "A hastily made steel leg, It looks exactly\nlike a leggin to a suit of armor however the\ninside is filled with a hex work of metal\nsupports. The knee would be rounded as it was\nmelted to the wearer's leg.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Perpetuity", "Perpetuity would be a gold wedding ring\ninlaid with a sapphire, emerald, ruby, and\ndiamond flowing circularly. They would appear\ncounterclockwise, ending with the central\ndiamond, symbolizing that love will return\nthese two to each other always.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Faded Golem Core", "Once held the soul of a brave hero.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Last Bite", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystery Meat Sandwhich", "A sour-dough breaded sandwhich, the inside\nhas an Herbal Butter Spread, with a thick\nslab of what could be pork! Maybe...\nProbably.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Owlbear Claw", "This claw is quite large in size, being about\nfour inches long and hooked at the end,\nmaking it great for slashing and clamping\nonto flesh or clothes. It's quite sharp,\nenough to pierce leather at the very most.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Light", "A bar of soap that fits in the palm of one's\nhand. It's grey soap, but it smells strongly\nof cream. Smooth sand was added, making it\nperfect for scrubbing away dirt or encrushed\nfilth. A small tag on it would read 'in honor\nof Dael'ran husband, Ascended'. A small crow\nwas stamped on the soap.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Roasted Beef Tenderloin", "One of the Irongut Clan's culinary secrets,\nthis slow-roasted slice of tenderloin has\nbeen marinated in herbs rarely found outside\nof the Silver Hills of Holm. Expensive, sure.\nBut well worth the mouth-watering experience.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("10.83452487033744 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Aefr", "An ancient, time-worn bronze coin, marked\nwith an ope-eye symbol. It seems like old\ncurrency, from a time when the Vaeyl Order\nruled Atlas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Knight Helmet", "The helmet of a Knight of the Vaeyl Order,\ndefenders of Ancient Atlas. Plundered from\nthe storerooms of Lasthope after the castle's\nfall, it appears to be a spare helmet,\nslashed with the mark of Red Vaeyl.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Arrow", "Arrows of refined, frost-tempered bronze,\nused by the archers of the Vaeyl Order.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Tower Shield", "A tower shield of banded bronze, painted\nblack with a white eye, the iris slashed with\nred, used by the Knights of the Red Vaeyl\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Halberd", "A long, five-foot polearm mounted with a\nviscous crescent-moon axe head, capable of\nsplitting shields and heads with a strong\nblow. The Knights of the Vaeyl Order used\nthese weapons in their shield-walls.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Oathstone", "A mesmiring, golden gem that seems to suck in\nall the light and reflect it like the desert\nsun. This gem has an undeniable aura of\npower, and tiny words appeared to be engraved\nin it: 'I pledge my body and soul to Vaeyl,\nto the defence of Lasthope, Yatl, and all\nAtlas, in life and death. Hear my Oath of\nOrder, and bind my soul.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Third Banner of the Dragon", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown of Thorns", "A black metal crown that when placed on the\nhead digs into your flesh, and is extremely\npainful to remove. This item offers the\nequivalent of T3 (Maybe only T2) mental\nwards, and causes the user to see shadows\nreaching out towards them, as if to embrace\nthem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkways Focus Rod", "A rod of enchanted, gleaming carbarum,\ninfused with otherworldy magic. It is used to\nconnect portals in the twisted Darkways\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Hansetian Wayfinder", "A semi clear gem seemingly humming with\nmagical energy enchanted by the Wizards John\nand Coltaine Wick, when tapped thrice the gem\nwould flood the immediate area with a bright\nlight, to guide the user in times of\ndarkness.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Resistance Potion", "A blue-gray potion rests here, frothing\nlightly if opened. Smells like mint, ew. If\nimbibed, the user's body would seem to heat\nup due to the reagents used, causing a flush\nto the skin and a faster heartrate. The cold\nseems to not bother you as much as it had\nbefore (50% reduction) and it leads to one\nbetter able to travel in the colder climates\nor icy caverns without as much hassle. A\nuseful tool for any spelunker's arsenal!\nLasts 2 irl hours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandey's seed", "This seed seems have something special about\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sandey0000.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Chicken", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Soilder's Gift", "The soap is about the size of a person’s\npalm, and dark black in color. It smells like\nchocolate. It’s made from plantain leaves,\ncoaco pods, palm tree leaves, ashes, and\nanimal fat. It’s used to treat acne and\nstretch marks. On the bottom is stamped with\na crow.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Shekel", "The official currency of the Noose Necked\nWillies, which can be exchanged with them for\ngoods you wouldn't otherwise find in a normal\nstall.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ingot Mold", "", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Selrik's Phylactery", "The fragments of the strange material\nemenated a black, hissing haze. As one made\ncontact with the fragments, a frantic\nscreaming in an eldritch language would\nresonate throughout your body.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Malineer's First Notebook", "A relic of ages past this palm-sized notebook\nonce served as a canvas of thought for a\nyoung alchemist with all the potential in the\nworld. Now the book is worn, cracked and\nfaded, Its amateur alchemical scribblings\nbarely legible.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shelyn.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Ring", "One Absolutely Beautiful Ladies Diamond &\nSapphire Ring! This Stunning Love-Knot style\nRing contains two interlocking rows of\nchannel-set Diamonds and Gorgeous Sapphires.\nThe Sapphires have Strong Intense Shades of\nBright Blue, that exhibit Great Brilliance\nand Wonderful Sparkle. The 14kt White Gold\nMounting is Solid, Heavy and extremely Well\nMade.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheDarkIsEternal.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("&6&l Speedy", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Spelunker's Rare Sabatons", "Something rather uncommon but often sought\nfor by all walks of life. These pants grant\nmajor protection at the risk of speed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Tankard", "The sides of the mug are ornately decorated\nwith etchings of glorious battles and vibrant\nfeasts. What draws your eye is the thin ring\nof runic symbols that ring the edge of the\nmug itself. Try as you might, you cannot seem\nto spill the contents but you have no problem\ndrinking. The piece is truly of Arcadian\nmake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Golden Shogger", "The Golden Shogger is a shovel once found\nbeneath the Urguanian desert, its true shape\nmakes it remarkable, it is a true beauty.\n?Game Moderator Approved?\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Skeleton Mask", "Lo and behold the skeleton mask, forged\nbetwixt the desolate digits of a long lost\nwoodworker who aspired to produce the most\nrealistic All Spirit Eve's costume for the\nyearly ball held within his hometown. In his\naspiration, he gutted his wife to wear her\nbody akin to a flesh suit, and fashioned his\nskeletal masks atop the very skull of his\ndeceased lover.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Heater Shield", "A small, specially-made shield crafted with\nsturdy oak wood. It's size and weight would\nfit a young boy perfectly. It's painted with\na yellow flower sigil on a black field. The\ncolours of House Barbanov.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Sphere Of Corruption", "This green sphere contains a black oil\nwithin, the thick green glass protects the\ncontents until the insides are extruded. The\nsphere when broken would instantly corrupt\nthe nearest object or land with a large\namount of corruption. If drank, the oil would\ncorrupt the body, turning them into a walking\nhusk, deranged and cannabalistic. They would\nonly live for a few minutes before dying and\ncausing the land to corrupt where they fell.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aldros The Mage.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Warped Egg ★", "An egg so awesome that you can see straight\nthrough it alongside the fact that its cold.\nThe most questionable mages say that these\neggs came from the warping of the soul of the\ngreatest of the voidal terrors, but this\ndoesn't changes the fact that it tastes like\ncoconut and milk. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Polished Stone", "The carefully polished stone has simplistic\ncarvings etched into it. You wonder what they\nare for.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Order of Saint Lucien Kite Shield", "Standard Issued Kite Shield from the Order of\nSaint Lucien. The shield has seen better days\nand although it remains intact, a crack is\nseen on top left of the shield's front. Its\ncolors are somewhat faded but the red\nLorraine Cross, the trademark of the Order,\nremains clear enough. Its previous owner is\nunknown.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Grandmaster Rakim Yar.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Coin of Strength", "A coin gifted by a traveler of whom visited\nCanahedo and requested they protect an item\nfrom the undead hordes. A token of grattitude\nfor obtaining victory. A token gifted to a\nwarrior who proved their strength.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusted Blade", "Gods, these things have been sitting around for ages!\" - A wandering scholar.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Beltran's Brick", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by BathRugMan.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Iced Coffee", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Coin of the Trickster", "At first glance one might assume this was a\nnormal golden coin easily mistaken for a\ncommon Mina. After looking it over for a\nmoment the coin could be noted at being a\nfake. On one side would be the words \"Better\nluck next time\" and on the other would be the\nimpression of a jester laughing at whom ever\nheld the coin\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Trickster.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Iced Tea", "A tall glass of iced tea.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Amethyst Ring", "An ornate aurum ring sized for an average\nhuman or elven finger holding a rectangularly\ncarved gem of amethyst. The band has\nintricate engravings all around it and the\ngem itself seems to give off a gentle glow of\npurple, though it's very subtle. [PM UnBaed\nfor questions.]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Refined Thanhium Crystal", "A blue sized thanhium crystal, cold to the\ntouch, roughly the size of one's finger and\nif overheated runs the risk of exploding.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Cross", "The Iron Cross of the Teutonic Order. In\nremembrance of Hanseti. Beliae doe Orden!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Hochmeister.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Adrian GlowSticks", "", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleugal Tentacle", "A long, stringy tentacle. It's almost like\nthat of an octopus, but significantly longer.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MaxGemini.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Wine Skin", "A leather sac with an uncorked opening made for holding water or wine.\nIt seems like an effective means for carrying liquid to and fro places.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironborn Band", "(Rare) A ring recovered from a shaman of the\nFeral Elves. It is a well forged iron band\nthat has no noticable insignias on it. On the\ninside of the band the Dwarven word \\\"Clod\\\" is\nwritten\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Goblin War Pick", "A stone and wood war pick once used by a\ngoblin of the Naragoshuk Clan. A carving on\nthe handle of the war pick depicts what\nappears to be a hill with a setting sun.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Sturdy Iron Ring", "A noble ring rimed for only the sturdiest,\nstoutest workers. Its shine is everlasting,\npolish seeming almost holy. It serves as a\nreminder of the obligation and ethics of the\nhard-working working class.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodied Large Spider Eye", "The remains of a Large Spider who invaded\nSan'Raakh\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Esme's Dagger", "A small and sharp blade, with a leather grip.\nDesigns of dainty flowers would run up the\ncenter of the blade, and along the strips of\nleather.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ballista Bolt", "a heavy duty ballista bolt forged in Holm.\nIntricate runes near the base of its metal\nhead identify its creator as being from Holm", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Urag's Klub", "A massive bloody club made of only steel.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pita", "This unleavened, freshly baked bread is\nstuffed with juicy tomatoes, white onions,\ngrilled mutton - all chopped to bite-sized\npieces, and are mixed with melted mozzarella\ncheese and a special yogurt sauce. Drops of\nlemon juice would be added to heighten the\nflavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by cowmoonist.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengul Eye", "A mythic gemstone believed to be made from\nthe tears of a falling aengul. Those whom\nimbibe their mana into the enchanted item\nwould notice the artifact to eminate a\nshining light brighter than the very sun.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by booklight12.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Parasol", "A metal rod with a button on it. When the\nbutton is pressed arcane energy flowers out\nof the top of it, forming an umbrella. It\nseems rather effective at stopping rain!\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragments of Orcish Horns", "These partially intact fragments of what\nseems to be horns gave off an odd feeling.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Akello's Horn", "A large Alpha Venator's horn, quite a trophy!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("☤ ḈṳṙḭṏṳṠ ḶṳṮḕ ☤", "Ａ ｌｕｔｅ ｏｆ ｌｉｇｈｔ-ｙｅｌｌｏｗ ｂｉｒｃｈ , ｈｏｗｅｖｅｒ ｗｉｔｈ\nｇｏｌｄ ｉｎｌａｙｓ. Ｔｈｅ ｅｌｏｑｕｅｎｔ ｄｅｓｉｇｎ ｗｏｕｌｄ ｆｏｏｌ\nｏｎｅ, ｆｏｒ ｔｈｉｓ ｌｕｔｅ ｉｓ ｍａｄｅ ｏｆ ａｍｐｌｅ ｍａｔｅｒｉａｌｓ\nａｎｄ ｐｒｏｎｅ ｔｏ ｗｅａｋ ｑｕａｌｉｔｙ, ｔｈｏｕｇｈ ｉｔ ｍａｙ\nｐｒｏｄｕｃｅ ａｄｅｑｕａｔｅ ｍｕｓｉｃ ｗｉｔｈ ａ ｄｅｃｅｎｔ\nｌｕｔａｎｉｓｔ. Ｏｎ ｔｈｅ ｂａｓｅ ｅｎｄ ｉｓ ａ ｂｅｌｌ ｗｉｔｈ ｎｏ\nｒｉｎｇ, ａｎｄ ｍｏｃｋ ｓｔｉｎｋｈｏｒｎｓ ｔｈｅ ｏｔｈｅｒ ｅｎｄ.\nＤｅｓｉｇｎ: ｈｔｔｐｓ://ｔｉｎｙｕｒｌ.ｃｏｍ/ＬｏｒａｓＬｕｔａｎｉｓｔ\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Woven Flower Crown", "A tightly woven flower crown, made of white\nand pink flowers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mute] Cohan.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Lifeforce Gem", "The gem hisses in an unearthly voice,\nwhispering in an unintelligible language.\nBlack mist emenated from the item, seeping\nonto the floor and fading out of sight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Zombie Mask", "A sickly green mask, depicting the face\nof a monster only seen in nightmares.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Creator's Fury", "A great sword with a blade of fine steel. The\nhilt is wrapped with uncracked, pristine\nred-colored leather and the crossguard is\nmade of the golden material known as aurum. A\nsigil, carved at where the blade met the\nhilt, was in the shape of two lit braziers.\nIf touched and held for a few moments, this\ngreat sword's blade would erupt into\npearlescent holy fire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Moribundity's Soul", "It's empty? NANI?!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Moribundity.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Elderly Decoction", "This is a capybara leather gourd, studded\nwith capybara teeth, containing elderly\ndecoction. It smells of parsley and\nsweetness, and tastes of chocolate and\nbitterness. Whoever drinks this decoction\nwill have a random body part (1d6, 1 = brain,\n2 = eyes, 3 = lungs, 4 = liver, 5 = spleen, 6\n= intestines) age twenty years, over twenty\nminutes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("THAT'S A NICE HEAD ON YOUR SHOULDERS", "SKALL, SKALL, SKALL, SKALL, SKALL!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Bear Pelt", "The fur of the Iron Bear would be as tough as\nsteel, able to defend against most attacks it\nrecieves similar to armor. Although slightly\ndamaged perhaps it could be used by an\nexperienced craftsman?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B3ast_Mod.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Twohander", "Within your hands is a great sword made\nspecially for ♾ORCS♾. The handle of this\nmenacing weapon is bound with black leather\nand the blade of this weaponry is serrated\nmaking it good for hunting tough creatures\nthat lurks Atlast.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bucket o' Hair", "(Rare) A bucket o' hair recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The hair inside\nseems to be primarily long scruffy beard hair\nof differing colors, black being the most\ncommon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Belenus Svass (Crowbeak Glaive)", "Born from despair, thy who faced loss will\nknow only hope from now on. Drom'kos Aife.\nFaced with natures wrath, born from it's\nlove, thy shall be always loved. Unae elska\nfaer Ara. Your actions and deeds forever\nchieseld into runic stone, thy shall always\nbe one with us. Fleyja sevlla, fleyja fjarri\nOlwen. Entwined fate with clan of gone kin,\nthy shall always be protected by it. Ylo wita\nfe vaskr Cernu. Covered by runes, this long\nbranch entwines with itself, at the top of it\nholding a gemslot.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Conall's Spiked Bludgeon", "A two and a half foot long metal club with\nspiked formed upon it's sides and top on the\nticker end. A crude handwrap encompasses the\nwielding side of it.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Violet Crystal", "Within the fragile, violet crystal, the soul\nof Charpot ((Zindran)) is held. ((PM _Drak3_,\nParkins, or Zindran for info.))", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar-spear", "An old forged spear with an oaken shaft. Its\nend is sharpened to a tapering point, and two\niron lugs protrude from either side of the\nwood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by char_oodler.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Legionnaire's Long Sword", "A worn and chipped sword from an era bygone.\nIt appears that the blade itself would break\nand give way under any bit of pressure, the\npommel is missing, as well a small bit of the\nhilt. '1590' is inscribed along the spine of\nthe weapon itself.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Chain of Ogrol (Ilzgûl Udalgum)", "This silver jewellery shimmers in the light,\nyet a darkness is latent within the gem in\nthe centre. After prolonged exposure, the\nwearer would find themselves sapped of\nstrength.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Dohvi.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzle-Pop Cola ~Vanilla~", "Fizzle-Pop Cola™ now mixed with sweet,\nrefreshing vanilla!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Dragon's Blood", "The vial swirls with a scarlet substance,\nwrithe with iron and thick to the touch.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tsuyose.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Justicar", "A sword cut from the finest piece of Black\nFerrum anywhere in the Imperium. The\ncrossguard and the rainguard would be made of\ngold with elaborate designs whilst the handle\nis made of steel and covered in gray rabbit's\nhide. The pommel would be a circle of gems.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of TM", "A gold token of Toriel Maddison, his name\nwould be engraved on the token itself and it\ncould be exchanged for a varity of items at\nthe unknown man's shop.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonscales", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Wine]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, wine comes out of it. It appears it\ndoesn’t have an end, where does it come from?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Albino Forktail Scales", "★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by iLovePumpkins.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Contorted, Purple Branch", "This branch appears to twist and contort in\nan odd fashion. The bark and the leaves offer\na faint, purple glow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Smawton.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Dewper Is A Wanna Be Flay", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Fortune Cookie", "Written in fine penmanship inside of the\ncookie, it holds the lettering of: \"You will\nbe given the gift of love.\" on the golden\nparchment.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Violino.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("➳ Myrtle Hearthstrike ➳", "One of many weapons made popular by Emberco,\na holy weapons company. The Hearthstrike\narrow is designed to hit ‘em where it hurts,\npiercing corrupted flesh and setting the\nimmediate area on fire with beautiful holy\nflame. Touch the arrowhead to prime the\narrow, setting it ablaze, and then fire it\ninto your soul-afflicted foe. Each quiver\ncomes with a complete manual of operation.\nhttps://goo.gl/5REHzg\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Romantic Bouquet of Flowers", "This beautiful bouquet of flowers would be\nneatly arranged as well as perfectly fanning\noutwards. Blue Iris', pink, orange and,\npurple Camellias, Stargazer Lilys, pink\nOrchids, Lilacs, and Tulips, would be\ncircling around some white oxeye dasies while\na few sprigs of blue Baby's Breath would line\nthe outside. The floral arrangement would be\nfor someone special, a loved one --\nromantically. A gesture of fondness and care,\nas well as a loyal air about it. The flowers\nwould be surrounded by pink cloth and tied\ntogether with a red bow to kep it all from\nfalling apart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:rose_bush", ""),
        StaticItem("i like traps", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Jewled Brooch", "A brooch made of silver shaped to look like a\nwolf's head facing forward. Its jaw hangs\nlow, baring its teeth clutching a gloriously\ncarved diamond of a cool color. Fury burns in\nthe wolf's eyes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Fancy Cane", "A fancy cane made of oak. Those who use this\ncane will find that they hear an insult\nshouted at them every few steps.\nOccasionally, a light shines down from the\nheavens that only the wielder can see,\naccompanied by laughter as if the gods\nthemselves were laughing at the cane user.\nThose who use this staff will also feel their\nemotions dulled ever so slightly. ((Contact\nFlamboyantRage for more information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("╁ Thulian Neothorn [T5] ╁", "Within your hand rests an arming sword\nmeasuring four feet in length, its silvery\nblade displaying a brilliant sheen. Twisting\nthe pommel of this weapon would cause the\nsharpened blade to become surrounded in a\nthin veil of condensed Soulflame, giving it\nthe properties of aurum when used offensively\nagainst a creature of the Dark. The Emberco\ninsignia is present on the hilt, offering\ninsight to this weapon’s origin.\nhttps://goo.gl/iWqvYC\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruric Warbow", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dranoth.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Fossilized uruk feces", "One could say this rock looks very 'unique\none could say it's unatural. Its purpose, let\nalone origin is plainly unknown, all that the\nperson recieving it could really be aware of\nis the fact it might've been a projectile at\none point.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caveman Orc.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("~Gyllene Ring~", "A simple golden ring, hand crafted in the\nfires of white peak, 1663. Set with a single\nDiamond in the center.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Banded Ring", "A silver banded ring with specially made\ngrooves to fit a warmly color topaz. It\nshines beautifully in the light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Dragon Tea", "Favored by the lady of the house, Rose Dragon\nTea is a sweet blend of rose petals and fine\ntea leaves. Steeped to perfection and often\nserved with honey, this tea is a delectable\ntreat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tsarra.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Stout", "A long lost Orenien Stout recipe saved by the\nBrew Master, Dankmar Montagne. A rather heavy\nstout, it's dark taste is paired nicely with\na hearty steak", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Frost Witch Ichor (Blood)", "This vial contains essence of the blood of a\nFrost Witch! Used for Alchemy and Rituals.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ThatWeirdGirl.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottled Liquid Essence", "In this pristine glass bottle cotains a small\namount of liquid essence gathered from the\nwasteland of Haelun’or, deep into the\nCelestial Orders cave, the light blue liquid\ninside looking like it was moving, this can\nbe used in several alchemical potions or for\nenchanting purposes.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Auric Oil", "A peculiar golden potion rests here, tinkling\nsoftly if shook. Appled to a weapon, it would\nbegin to take on a slightly translucent\ngolden glow. For 30 ooc minutes, the blade\nwould affect creatures similarly to gold does\nwithout the loss of durability. Typically\nuseful against most abberant creatures, this\nis a favorite of hexers and witchers across\nthe land. Refer to Liquid Essence lore for\nmore information.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Un-Burn", "A light blue, oily substance sits inside the\nbottle. A label reads: \\\"Apply to burns to\nheal instantly!\\\" Once applied, this oily\nsubstance will remove 1st degree burns within\nseconds and lessen the severity of 2nd degree\nburns, though not healing them completely. Do\nNOT expose to open air for too long as that\nmay cause the oil to crust and may render the\nremedy useless.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netherworld15.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Sutican Horseman's Pick", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Spinner", "The object would consist of a peculiar\nbearing in the center of three extensions,\neach at 120 degrees out from the center. At\nthe end of each of these, a lighly pulsing\nred gem would rest that when spun, would\nrelease a trail of arcane wisps!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Frost Oil Mixture", "This mixture, which can only be applied to\none item, is a thick oil that can be used to\nvery carefully coat an item in a thick oil.\nThe oil dries, and makes an item fireproof,\nunless the dried oil was removed with liquids\nsuch as acid. It's been enhanced by a Druid\nwho is a master in Herblore. It is fatal, if\ningested. Frostbite will occur on skin.\n(Contact Corvoo for all questions and info).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhium Dust", "(Rare) A smattering of dust recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The Thanhium\nwould appear no different from its standard\nstrain, but one can only question why it was\nfound in the depths of a cultist layer.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:lapis_lazuli", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Bodkin Point Arrow", "A footed bodkin point arrow, with a bronze\narrowhead. The two parts of the footed arrow\nare made of cedar and teak wood. The\narrowhead is made to a bodkin point, with 2\nsharpened edges. The arrow bears 4\ngoose-feather vanes as to stabilize it when\nshot. The bronze the arrowhead has been made\nfrom has been well shined, making it quite\nlustrous under light. The cedar and teak wood\nthe arrow is made from has been treated with\nboiled linseed oil.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Vega Ring", "The soft shape of this gorgeous gemstone ring\nis effortless to wear, The moonstone gemstone\nmeasures 7.8mm x 15mm and is rose cut to\nbring out its unique tones and natural\nvariation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A REAL CAKE", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Severed Golem Arm", "A battered and worn runic prosthetic lined\nwith deep channels that emits a blue,\nsupernatural glow. Further inspection of the\nrunic limb may allude to the telltale of an\nIrongut's craftsmanship. Blood and dried gore\nstain the edge of the limb with the remains\nof a bone protruding", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("snelven rebellion did nothing wrong", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Defender of Ard Krallackh's Sword", "A slayer-steel blade with a ruby embedded\ninto the hilt of the blade. The sword is\nengraved with the smith's signature - the\nGrand Master Rakim Yar. This sword is one in\nfive given out to the winning team of the\nOrder of Saint Lucien's Tournament of the\nBicentennial 5 on 5 melee.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The middle section of the broken Greatsword", "The middle section, crafted from pure carbarum. The middle section also contains thick\nstreaks of crimson crystals, spiraling upwards towards towards a few, sharp sections of\ncarbarum points out from where the tip broke from the middle section of the carbarum\nblade. It also excretes a faint miasma of corruption.\n*Moderator Approved*\n__Xan__ approved this item.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Zephonim Spidersilk", "A sizeable coil of spidersilk.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Necklace of one Million Moons", "This shiny crystal looks like an upside down tear\nwith a silver chain turning it into an unbreakable\nnecklace.\nIf somebody is wearing the necklace, it will start to\nrelease a weak, light coming out of the center of\nthe crystal.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Smaragdus Circlus", "A silver ring with a single large polished\nemerald set on top, held in place by silver\nshaped to hawks claws.Inscripted inside with\nDeus sit apud vos\" meaning god be with you\ncrafted in White Peak by Aldyth var Burgundar\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Spliced Quartz Dust", "Quartz dust, a powerfully addictive stimulant\nthat makes one feel untouchable, and godlike.\nSpliced almost half and half with\naggressively hallucinogenic magic mushrooms.\nThe effects of the mushrooms kick in far\nlater than that of the dust, by about twenty\nelven minutes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Peculiar Necklace Shard", "One of three bits of a peculiar necklace,\nwhen touched a vision of fire and blood\ncrosses your eyesight, audible screams\nechoing from the jewel. These last until you\nrelease this artefact.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Sadist's Fiery Shackles", "Dark aurum shackles forged by a sadistic\nNecromancer. Hot to the touch, they burn the\nwearer and tighten the more they resist.\nVicious spikes are strewn along the edges\nmaking any attempts at prying them off\npainful. There is no key..", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Weathered Firebrand", "A rather ornate length of oiled ashwood.\nNumerous figures of religious significance\nare carved into the resilient wood; they wind\nup the sides in a strange, nonsensical\npattern, but are topped by a somewhat large\ndepiction of a bear. A rather large cage of\nblack steel is tightly mounted to the tip of\nthe branch, wherein a bright orange flame can\nbe seen burning. The rim of the cage is lined\nwith Aurum, which coils downward to provide a\nsmoother transition between the cage and the\nashwood. Towards the bottom, one would find\nan immensely weathered leather grip and a\nlarge knob of hefty blackened steel fitted to\nthe base of the branch. A small set of\ninitials can be found just above the knob:\n“SA”.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Warning", "This warning is for PuddleMancerPro. Please\ndo not leave floating leaves! Leaves do not\ndecay in freebuild! -GM Team.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Horold.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Broach", "A stunning broach forged by a ancient dwarven\nblacksmith. It displays a silver pineapple\nwith spessartite inlaid into its' frame. If\nstroked it gives off a peasant warmth that\nwould warm one to the core.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aengoth.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("ERP Dildo Warning", "Do not ERP. Have a dildo for your genital\nneeds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corpean.", "minecraft:cactus", ""),
        StaticItem("Ape Skull", "The skull of a large ape. When held/worn, the\nwielder will see the world as if everything\nwas a banana of varying size. A constant\nAAAAAAA' can be heard as well, drowning\neverything else out. The emotions of the user\nwill be lessened ever so slightly while this\nis used. ((Contact FlamboyantRage for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred Papers", "(Common) Charred pieces of paper recovered\nfrom a cultist of Vilketa's layer. The words\non the pages seem to be in another language,\nand entirely indecipherable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Pendant", "This silver pendant is marquise-shaped. It is\ndesigned in in a frilly style. It is accented\nwith a small transparent dark red emerald-cut\ngem.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("An Ordinary Stone", "The stone held within your palm would be an\nordinary looking stone with a blue, greenish\nmixed coloration throughout the object. There\ndoesn't appear to be anything unique about it\nsay for the carving of an owl taking flight\nwithin its center.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Pearl", "Deep within the core of this mana crystal\nlies a soft flame, brimming in the dark.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Thick Athin Gloves", "Fashioned from leather, these gauntlets have\nbeen delicately coated in a thick, rubbery,\nathin-based compound. As a result, these\ngloves are best used when dealing with\npoisonous, explosive, or otherwise volatile\nsubstances.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("~!4k Gold Emerald Ring~", "A beautiful handcrafted golden ring with\nlarge emerald set in claws at the front. Six\nsmall diamonds surround the emerald, three\neither side, Forged in White Peak\nmountains,1663.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Shot", "A huge, weighty boulder that would serve as\nan ideal projectile for siege engines such as\nTrebuchets and Rune Cannons.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Toalak Slime", "The fine powder would offer hallucinogenic\nproperties if consumed. It smells terrible,\nand would burn the nose.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Withered Twig", "A withered twig that seems to have died from\nbeing ripped from a tree. It would also be\nblackened, covered in volcanic soot.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNoodle.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Serenity's Grimoire", "A beautiful made Tome would sit before you.\nIntricate silver patterns would be seen all\nalong the front and back of the covers both\ncoalescing in the front to form a rose in the\ndesign. Along the spine two silver bindings\ncould be seen to give the book extra support.\nThe inside would contain beautiful writing\nsome in common some in elven, more blank\npages would also be in the book. If you\nstudied the book long enough you would almost\nswear that you could see a white glow emit\nfrom the cover.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Cathedral Snowglobe", "The majestic Santegian Cathedral - a lovely\nstructure for canonists around the realm -\nwould be visible in fine detail.. In a small,\npocket sized, snowglobe! It would look just\nlike the real building, it being hard to find\na mistake of difference. Once someone shakes\nthe snowglobe, snowflakes start dwindling\nthrough it and in the belltower a small bell\nwould sound through the glass.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Cantwell Moonshine", "On this galleon jug would be engraved, \"XXX\".\nSniffing the drink would almost burn your\nnostrils from the strength of the drink.\nBrewed in a shack in the woods outside Curon,\nthis 'moonshine' would be around 200 proof.\nSo strong, an alcoholic will fall to it's\npowers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Th3_11th.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Random item", "Druids are ok i guess", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bed Linen", "Roughspun bed linen. Perfect for peasantry.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Candy Bin", "You hold a rather festive and spooky looking\ncandy bin. Decorate it how you wish and carry\nit around with you to store your candy! It is\nnot advised to fill the entirety of your bin\nand consume all the candy.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Hardtack", "A biscuit made from flour, water, and salt.\nIt is long-lasting, and tastes stale. The\nchoice food of those looking to deny\nthemselves worldly pleasures.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Monk] Barthal of Touron.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Tonic of the Lizard", "This is a stormstone jar, containing tonic of\nthe lizard. It smells pungent and earthy. It\nis viscous. Whoever applies this tonic\ntopically to their skin loses their ability\nto regulate their own body temperature and\nwill automatically hibernate in cold\nenvironments, for twenty-four hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude war axe", "This battleaxe has three spikes of hardened\nsteel protruding from the back of the blade.\nIt is large but can be used with one hand by\nan orc. There are etchings of skulls on the\nblade\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Ocean", "A set of perfectly crafted amethyst earrings,\nset and pressed into a platinum base and\nsurrounded by an array of clustered diamonds.\nPerhaps giving the illusion of a flower.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Icy Sapphire Ring", "An excellently crafted ring set with a\nflawless Sapphire. The band is made of a\nwhite gold gold–palladium–silver alloy, and\nthe inside has the The Wulf & The Bear makers\nmark. The shades of silver blend, as the\nsmithing process created a wave pattern in\nthe band.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Sloth Plushie", "A smaller sloth plushie, it even comes with a\nlil perch for it to hand from! Its made from\nthe finest fabrics, and has expert stitching\nthroughout it. On the palm of the sloths hand\nwould be the words 'Veris Summer Festival,\n1618'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Deer Hide", "From a doe felled near Santegia. It seems the\nhunter was handy with a knife - high quality\nleather could be made from this.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll's Foot", "A foot cut from a troll, the blood around the\nwound has dried.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Gorgemel.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("P0tat0 l00p", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Gilded Trophy!", "A trophy that displays you as a champion of\nCaptain Blackjacks Shogging tournament! Your\nmust have displayed incredible skill with a\nwooden shovel and pumpkin or.. you were just\nlucky to win.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("1Error Gem1", "You get the strange feeling that you don't\nwant to touch this for very long.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Medesculor", "A snub-nosed medesculor with rabbit hide\nencompassing the grip. The one-handed firearm\nhas the capacity of six medium-sized arcane\nbolts for each clip. The stock bears the seal\nof the Knight Enchanter Ser Avenel.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Accursed Lance", "The bearer of this ragegeist-haunted\nspearwould find their temper shorten to such\nan extremeextent that the smallest of bothers\nwould aggitate them with ease to the point of\nviolence. Those not mortal go unaffected.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zarsies.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("glorious nippon flag", "my ancestors are smiling down at me imperial,\ncan you say the same ??\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("╁ Thulian Emberknife ╁", "Within your hand appears to be nothing more\nthan an ornate silver hilt, though testing\nwill reveal a twistable handle that causes an\nethereal blade of condensed holy fire to be\nproduced. The Emberblade phases through and\nis halted by any substance not corrupted,\nhowever, it burns through corrupted flesh\nsimilarly to an aurum blade.\nhttps://goo.gl/7QhjSQ\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Blade", "A finely made blade, it is adorned with\netchings of roses along the blade and adorned\nwith light red gems in the hilt and pommel.\nThe hilt is wrapped in a fine red leather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Silverstatik.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Godrik's Brigandine", "A sheet of iron chainmail designed to cover\none's torso, with a few dents and small\nholes, evidently also facing the wear caused\nby age. The chainmail is enhanced in order to\nserve as an insulating barrier. It means that\nonly physical damage can pass through the\nchainmail, such as blades or blunt trauma.\nHowever heat, cold, and other \"non-physical\nforces cannot harm one through the chainmail.", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer Steel tipped ballista bolt", "A masterfully crafted ballista bolt. It would\nfeature an oakwood shaft and feathers to\nensure it's aim stayed true. The tip was most\nimpressive, being made out of Slayersteel,\nclearly done by a master smith. They'd be\nsharp, and if fired from a ballista, could\neasily penetrate even the thickest armor, or\neven thin wooden defenses! The tip would also\nfeature a barb, making it more difficult to\npull out once embedded into something!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Smithing.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("The hilt of the Prophet's Greatsword", "The hilt of the broken greatsword has been crafted from a compressed, dark oak wood.\nThe guard and a few spikes of carbarum still remain upon the hilt of the blade. Engraved\ninto the hilt and the guard would be thick streaks of a crimson crystal. The hilt of the\nbroken greatsword faintly excretes a miasma of corruption.\n*Moderator Approved*\n__Xan__ approved this item.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Watchful Eye", "A metallic orb with a very odd eye in the\ncentre of it. It appears to follow you\nwherever you move. It's rather\nuncomfortable...\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("The tip of the broken Greatsword", "Finally, the tip of the Prophet's corrupted Greatsword. It too, has blood crystals\nspiralling around it and to the very tip. Excreting a faint miasma of corruption.\n*Moderator Approved*\n__Xan__ approved this item.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Treasure Map", "The map is not exactly very clear. It simply\nshows a path leading through a pine forest\nwith a rock next to the path and a bush right\nnext to it. An arrow would point at the bush.\nFurther from the path is drawn something that\nlooks kind of like a little hut with a\nwoodpile and a chimney. The arrow clearly\npointed at the bush next to the path though.\nOn the back of the map were three words:\n\\\"Sleetfells\\\" \\\"Riviän Road\\\" \\\"Night's Light\\\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SanderWarrior14.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Potato of Epicness", "A potato that imbues the wielder with great\npower. It releases adrenaline and basically\nturns you into a chad, able to defeat any foe\nand flex on any virgin. (This is one of a\nkind and YES this is an official lore item.\nPM Melkor__ to interact)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melkor__.", "minecraft:poisonous_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Kal'Riad Coin", "Fat, golden coins minted in Kal'Riad, seat of\nthe Kal'Riad Consortium and monument of\nDwarven power on Atlas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Golden Egg of Mickmeist", "A golden egg gifted to Melkor by Mickmeist\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Urguanic Coins", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Scene21.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_18(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("~*Friendship Cookie*~", "A cookie that keeps friendships together.\nFrom MrsWhiteKnight to Melkor__ <3 :)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrsWhiteKnight.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("~-= Heureux Amoureux=-~", "A fairly decent painting of an elven couple,\nboth with snow white hair and pale skin. They\nwould be sitting by the fountain in Caras\nEldar, faint smiles splaying across their\nfaces. The woman would have her head laying\nover on the man's shoulder, her beautiful\ndress sweeping the stone beneath them. The\nman would have his head leaning against hers,\nboth of their eyes would be closed as they\nheld the biggest smiles. They'd be holding\nhands, the bottom of the painting signed with\nLove, Val\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Valerica Leyu'ilueth.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Rod of Echoes", "A rod made of an ivory hued stone, bearing a\nemerald head, with gold laden bands off metal\nholding it in pace. With his rune inscribed\nhandle, it would seem the rod bears the\nproperty of anyone who holds it to be able to\nproject their voice upon another entity.\nEchoing around their ears, the illusory\nechoes project an intended emotion infused\ninto ones words.. (For more info pm\nBooklight12)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by booklight12.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Jon's friendship leaf", "This leaf seems to have healing properties.\nJust the touch of it gives a person a\ncalming feeling.", "minecraft:waterlily", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Stew", "A thick brown stew of tender boar and chunked\ncarrots. Thin slices of delightful truffle\nwould have been added to the brew, giving it\na strong and earthy taste. Plenty of salt and\nherbs added to the already mouth watering\nmixture of basic ingredients and Cottonwood\nlove.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Commander] Chef Sugartits.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashes of Julia Adelheid", "The ashes of a former Empress and\nmother-figure, these remains are concealed\nwithin a silken pouch of a tan shade, tied\ntightly and kept close.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel-Nobbed Walking Cane", "A long stick of polished spruce wood, carved\nvines tracing up and down the length of it.\nAt it's top would sit a steel knob, molded\nand carved into the shape of a dragon's head\nby master craftsmen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fossilized Wyvern's Egg", "A fossilized wyvern's egg, turned to\npractically-stone by time and age. The scales\nencasing the unborn dragonkin shone in a dull\ngreen hue, a beautiful item to possess by\nany.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("love you wrynn", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ducklingator.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Shard Rings", "This set of three rings are made of a\ntempered glass, shaped and cut to appear like\nclear ice carved from a block. The three\nrings have grooves cut into the bands, making\nthem fit together if stacked one upon the\nother seamlessly.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Love Cake", "The batter has been perfectly baked to a\nfluffy, moist texture, rich with almonds,\ncardamom, and hints of lemon zest. The creamy\nicing is sweetened with honey and rose-water\nwith notes of saffron, and is topped with\ncandied rose petals and chopped pistachios.\nLegend has it this dessert can bring feelings\nof love and affection from those gifted it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sahar Tha'un.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Metzli's Tangle", "A coiling, sturdy root", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Tusk", "A bloodied goblin tusk.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Gusuminister.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("The Hand of a Necromancer", "A hand severed at the wrist relatively\ncleanly.", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Demented Femur", "A twisted femur spotted with blood and\neternally scorched by whatever creature it\nbelonged to.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Toy", "A small, red-stained metal figure of a dragon\non all fours! It's mouth was hinged so that\nit may open and close.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by aerialkebab.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Celerity", "A silver-gray potion sloshes dully in the\nbottle, smelling of salt when opened. Known\nmore commonly as a potion of agility, this\npotion raises the imbiber's speed and\nreflexes. Useful both for the violent fires\nof combat, or for a speedy escape . A\ndownside, however, is that an intense muscle\nsoreness is felt after the effects wear off\ndue to the exertion forced upon them. A handy\npotion for chasing someone down, or escaping\nyourself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Adventurer's Rucksack (Light)", "A burlap sack rests here, measuring in at\nhalf the average man's back and weighing in\nat around 12 pounds. Within was 2 meals worth\nof pemmican, a canteen of water, a 20 foot\nlong coil of rope, wheat chaff for starting a\nfire, a flint and steel for lighting said\nfire, a serrated knife, and fitted with extra\nrungs to add more items. (Such as a rung for\nbows and arrows!) Fit and proper for\nadventuring in the woods, this could save\nyour life in a pinch!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Great leader!", "A depiction of a great and powerful leader!\nAlthough he is slightly orange...\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Tyrant!", "A depection of an incompetent tyrant with\nglued on hair and orange painted skin. What a\nmean, mean, man...\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Lilac Necklace", "Charming, but simple, this lilac necklace\nwith an open-front design carries the sweet\nand rich aroma of the flowers it was made\nfrom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lyadrian Des'Nox.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Cookie!", "Delicious!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of bmanrules", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Arnold's Animals Voucher", "A voucher that let's you\nredeem for one item at\nArnold's Animals.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMorsmordre approved this item.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Tongs", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Music Box", "As you open the lid to this small wooden box\nit releases a soothing melody - soft to ones\near. It doesn't halt until it is shut once\nmore; a dancing ballerina spins about on a\nsmall sparkling platform with an everlasting\nsmile painted upon her visage.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of the Prince's Sap", "A bottle of a thick, yellow resinous\nsubstance and some water.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A Syringe", "A simple metal syringe.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Longsword", "A bronze longsword once utilised by a Vaeyl\nOrderman in the defence of the Atlas against\nthe Descendant invaders. This blade lacks a\nsharp edge, but its size and weight carry the\npromise of broken bones upon a strike. It was\nfound amongst the dead at the Battle of the\nWastes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Horn", "A sharp, curved horn once belonging to a\nfearsome Wyvern.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Kalina's Halberd", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Note", "Dear Elenora, thank you for everything you've\ndone for me. You're the best mother a child\ncould ever ask for. I know I don't do much\nfor you, but I really do love you with all my\nheart. I know you're not one for poetry so I\nwon't make this any cheesier than it already\nis. I hope you enjoy the gift. ♡ - Liri\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Artisan's Expression", "This cello was carefully grown as one solid\npiece of maple, no seams to be found. The\npegs, endpin, and tailpiece are made of\nfinely polished ferrum, the saddle a soft\ntanned sheepskin. It has a brilliant natural\nwoodgrain with knot spirals accenting it,\nfinished to a rich mahogany color. It's tones\nare deep and resonant, expertly tuned with a\ndiscerning ear. On the back of the neck the\nWinterleaf craftsman symbol is etched in\nsilver filigree as a craftsman's mark.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Majestic Red Feathers", "You hold in your hand Majestic Red Feathers,\nthey once belonged to the mighty Crackers the\nRavenous! Devourer of Food. Perhaps you can\nuse it as decoration, or fashion from it a\nquill?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaznakoh-Vorzhnak", "★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by vvmrr.\nSignature: Aurna", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Strong Ale", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Molotov", "A bizzare bottle with a thin oily rag hanging\nout of the top, a cork loosely holding the\ntwo together. When lit and thrown, the glass\nwould shatter and release the flammable\nliquid inside.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stack Of Papers", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling Grass Bracelet", "Created of the herb Halfling's Grass after\nallowing it to near fully dry out, this\nhumble bracelet was carefully weaved into a\nlooping design to mock the shape of petals.\nThe dull aroma of the plant can be caught if\none holds it close enough to them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lyadrian Des'Nox.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Carved Leaf", "In your hands would rest an old and worn\nwooden carving. This carving would take that\nof a leaf caught blowing in the wind\nperputally never stopping. Upon the back of\nthe leaf three names would be carved into the\nwood carefully perserved over time. Eryn,\nEzira, Amara. In the middle Nailo would also\nbe carved along with what looked like thre\ntally marks. The wood appears to be old, but\nwell kept and cherished.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlight Druid] Eryn N Aureon.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Scythe", "While it takes a similar name to the common\nfarming tool, this Scythe is forged for war.\nIts point is finely sharpened for monumental\nblows and its edge is tuned for slashing.\nClose inspection would reveal the crest of\nHouse Dunlain upon the start of the blade.\nIts hilt is a finely grown branch, it seems\nto have grown around the blade to become one\nwith it. As your enemies watch you slaughter\ntheir kinsman with this scythe, the only\nthing in their minds is that the Reaper is\ncoming.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ascanius Dunlain.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Palmier Cookie", "A puff pastry made with alternating layers of\ndough and butter, rolled and folded over to\ncreate hundreds of flaky layers. The puff\npastry is rolled out, coated with sugar and\ndrizzled with honey.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Elora's Holiday Rum Cake", "The majority of each cake is of a dark\naromatic batter, littered with signs of\nvarious delicious spices to compliment the\nhint of fine rum one would experience with\neach bite of the moist yet fluffy and light\ninterior. Upon the top lays a frosting of\nvanilla and just the slightest touch of\norange zest, a simple topping sure to let the\ncake's warm flavours shine through. Each bite\nof this divine treat leaves the taster\nyearning for another.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elora Silma.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Magi-Locked Truechest", "This is a masterfully crafted ashwood chest.\nIt is studded with gypsum, pig iron, and rose\ngold. It menaces with spikes of hepatite and\ntricalcite. On the item is an illustration of\na war between orcs and elves. It is sealed\nwith a powerful lock. It may be only opened\nby two shamans and two druids, working in\nuncoerced union.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lunar Rings", "Set in two strips of white gold in the shape\nof half moons are an array of 30k Diamonds,\nstudded pressed to an extremely perfected\nquality. At the pinpoint of the earrings are\ntwo ovals, fitted with 6 diamonds each.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Copper Lager", "A strong, hoppy brew with a dark copper\ncolor. Distilled and bottled by the Olde\nAdria Brewery, Inc.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RedfaceKilla.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Royal Aster", "The last plant to bloom in a year, it is\nquite the special flower and to trick it into\nan early bloom is quite difficult. It seemed\nto have been tended with a large amount of\ncare, various dainty whiskers pointing out of\nits petals. From it spread a fragrant smell\nthat was appealing to the nose.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EirikColborn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lady's Timepiece", "Always ticking away, 'till some final fate...", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Mixed Herbs", "A mix of several alchemical herbs consisting\nof ginger, parsley, cinnamon, thyme and many\nmore.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Wintercress Sapling", "The Wintercress sapling is an extremely rare,\ntall plant which was found near the ice wall\nat the south of Atlas. It blooms in the late\nwinter. It has small, lobed leaves, which are\nusually a light blue. It also grows decent\nsized flowers, which can be light yellow at\nthe peak of their bloom. ((Contact Capace\nonce planted in order to interact with the\nsapling any further)).\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Whisperking Tears", "This is a zinc flask, encrusted with\naventurine, and studded with magnesium\nthanide metal, containing whisperking tears.\nIt smells of salt and smoke, tastes of\nnothing, and glows a soft amber light.\nWhoever drinks these tears will be able to\nmore clearly remember memories of loved ones\nwho have died, for twenty-four hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Rapier", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Withered Great-Maul", "A considerably old maul on a long oaken\nshaft. The oaken shaft had a firm, withered\nleathered handle and faded red silk draping\nfrom said handle. The maul had a few cracks,\nand tribalistic engravings. On the handle, in\nDwarvish, 'Shaundakul' is written.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Decapitadora", "A small dagger, with the sharpest blade. Do\nnot use it to hit, it might break. Seems\nideal to behead humans.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MeLlamoPeter.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("BIG MEME PVP", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Renee Silma's left arm", "Renee Silma got her arm cut down when she was\ncaptured by the orcs. The Dominion did not\nwant to pay a rescue for her, but orcs do not\nkill childer, so they cut her arm instead.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Slaughter trophy", "A bone from the very first innocent Umhra\nmurdered. A young dwarf that couldnt defend\nhimself. He was in the wrong spot during a\ntown invasion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MeLlamoPeter.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusted Hand Pendant", "A long, partially rusted chain pendant with a\nsmall copper hand hanging from it. The hand\nhas tribal carvings on it, which are crude at\nbest.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("IOU", "For Mori to use for one GM favor\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xalid.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ordinary Can", "Haha, you thought! As soon as you open this\ncan a spring-loaded false snake springs out\nwith great speed!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Esther Lester.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant's Toe", "A large hallux toe, which is five inches in\nlength. From what it appears, the toe is\nsevered with dry blood and tissue clotting\nthe blood inside the toe. The bone is\nvisible.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("◆ Well-Carved Emerald ◆", "This emerald is carved to display the lovely\ngreen color, and strong fractal patterns\nwithin. Shaped like a rectangle with many\nsloped cuts, the stone is smooth and\nbeautiful.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Preserved Golden Eagle Feather", "A small, delicate feather once belonging to a\ngolden eagle, with a waxy feeling to the\ntouch, seemingly kept together after being\ndipped in some sort of preservative. It'd\nsmell like chemicals, yet the feather would\nlook beautiful and wholesome.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("✮ Star-Topaz ✮", "This topaz gem is carved into a small star.\nThe color is a dull orange, but is still\nreflective!", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bluweil's Bone Claymore", "Claymore of 6 feet of lenght made with the\ntail of the huge cobra, which makes it rather\nlight for its size. The blade would be white,\nbright and sharp, while the grip and the\nsheathe would be made with the bluish scaled\nskin of the same creature. Finally the symbol\nof a toalak would be carved on the hilt with\nthe word \"Lak\" under it\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Toalak Youngling", "A toalak fresh from its stage as a tadpole. A\nfierce fucker, it'd likely bite your finger\nor something equally menacing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Worn Rag", "The rag is worn and torn from years of use,\nbut still proudly held by barkeeps around\nAtlas", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Vienne", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("~Yaisa Makla~", "~This Broadsword , crafted of Steel. stout\nand fearsome blade, great for delievering\ndeadly slashing cuts and hacking blows as\nwell as thrusts. Criciform hilt with 7\" cross\nguard and disc Pommel.Crafted 1668.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Dark Crimson Blood", "The near blackened blood sloshes about inside\nof the vial\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclops Eye", "An eye said by some to posess magical powers,\noriginally squishy it has now hardened the\noutsde to a rock like, transparent layer, you\ncan also see eyeball floating inside the\njelly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mama Xen II's Pendant of Motherhood", "A magegold amulet forged meticulously and\nencrusted with a diamond central managem. It\nglows with voidal potential, imbued with\nspecific magics. Designed so that when a\ncertain green arcane atronach wears it, a\nglamor is cast over their form to make them\npink instead. Need only tap thrice when worn\nto turn on and off. Fails after some use (1\nOOC hour) but recharges after a week's time\n(7 OOC hours). [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Cap", "(Rare) A priest's cap recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. The cap itself is modeled\non a Siberian fur hat, with each ear flap\nhaving a thunder cloud stitched onto it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Friendship Stick", "A stick given by the Porcupine Druid to\ncommemorate eternal friendship. Treasure it\nforever, for it is very important and sacred.\nYou are loved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AlternateKy.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cusped Falchion", "A short, steel falchion. It has the coat of\narms of the House Staunton-Baden engraved\ninto the pommel. Gifted to Thomas Baden by\nhis sister, Philippa. Later given to\nFrederick Baden.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eldritch Plate", "Plates belonging to the armor of an eldritch\nbeing, with about the same strength as steel.\nIt would hold a deep, bronze-ish sheen, and\nwould feel lighter than the steel it feels\nlike.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Eldritch Flesh", "The flesh of what was a mysterious,\nunidentifiable being of the southern wastes.\nThe flesh would be tender, patchy with hair,\nand awfully splotched. The flesh would smell\nlike cooked meat, for an unknown reason.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of WanderingFriend", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Limited edition ‘Cloud Temple Monk’ action figure", "This very small toy is a part of the current Cloud Temple Monk toy series.\nThere is only a limited number in existence!\n*Moderator Approved*\nFyaa approved this item.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Green", "A lovely herb, for lovely times!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruined Potion", "This potion tastes burnt, as if it may've\nbeen left over the fire too long. But perhaps\nthat's purposeful, as, according to the\nlabel, it's: \"Bekarr's Stupendous Cure-All!\nThe burning means its working!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Gobo Apothecary] Bekarr.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Emergency Ungrown Elderwood Trees", "", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Windstalker, Eclipse of Blessings", "In your hands sits Windstalker, a superior\nrecurve bow that has been skillfully crafted\nfrom the wood of a great red elm tree. The\nbowstring is crafted from the braided strands\nof the strongest spider silk.The limbs of the\nbow have been decorated with crafted eyes,\nand end in rounded curves ornamented with the\npoints of animal antler, While the handle of\nthe bow is wrapped in light leather, and\ndecorated with the tribal painting style of\nthe Mali’Ame.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Cider", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dor's Sapphire", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax paper, 150 per stone week", "Contact Jak Irongut via bird for payment", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax paper, 200 per stone week", "Contact Jak Irongut via bird for payment", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax paper, 100 per stone week", "Contact Jak Irongut via bird for payment", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax paper, 300 per stone week", "Contact Jak Irongut via bird for payment", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aqua Vitae", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarf Beer", "The best beer in Kaz'Ulrah!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Whisky", "The best whisky from the south!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Azghari Blanket", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by dogwolf.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Fluffy Mittens", "Stuffed with warm reindeer fur those mittens\nare perfect to keep your hands warm in the\nmiddle of winter.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:light_gray_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Roast", "This delicious meal contains a piece of\nroasted meat, a few side dishes and even a\nglass of eggnog! The amount of food is enough\nto keep you stuffed for a whole day.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:oak_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Cinnamon Cotton Candy", "A pinkish cotton candy, yet, upon eating it\nthe taste of cinnamon and Krugsmas Cookies is\nfilling your mouth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Peppermint Mocha", "A creamy drink, tasting like coffee,\npeppermint and a little bit of chocolate. The\ndrinks is topped with whipped cream and is\nstill steaming hot.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Hot Wine Punch", "A mixture of wine, cinnamon and other spices,\nheated up and served with another roll of\ncinnamon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("B-A-R", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Wolfsbane27", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Urn Of Ashes", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosa's Whacking Stick", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Kylmu'je bita (Heavy warhammer)", "This is a gorundyr styled warhammer. The\nJormungdic Black Steel hammer is decorated\nwith many massive fanged teeth attached to\nboth sides of the hammer with various\ngorundyr runes carved into them that lead\ndown into the hammer head it self.The shaft\nis made of oak wood with a handle wrapped in\nwhite stained leather decorated with various\nfeathers. This is a well made and crafted\nweapon with \"~Arberrang~\" Nicely carved into\nthe shaft of the mighty warhammer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("To Dwarger Silvervein", "Dear Dwarger, I have some urgent business\naway from Atlas and will be gone for a few\nyears, My father will around to help you out\nwith anything you want but he unsure in\njoining ulrah he wants a clear view of all\ndwarven parts in Atlas beforedeciding, i\nguess you'll see what he will do, that is all\nfor now... Stay Strong and be good for the\nSilvervein's! Your Friend Zokhamli.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand Rum of Santegia", "An alcoholic drink made from fermented and\ndistilled sugarcane juice, a favorite among\nmerchants and seafolk around Santegia. It\ntastes sweet with a hint of oak from the\nbarrel it was aged in.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Bass", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Soaked Paper", "(Common) Soaked pieces of paper recovered\nfrom a cultist of Vilketa's layer. The words\non the pages seem to be in another language,\nand entirely indecipherable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbarum Chestplate Recipe", "", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Deeproads Map", "(Rare) A hastily drawn map that would allow\nnavigation of the Dwarven Deeproads. The map\nwhile incomplete, would indicate that an\nentrance would be close to the capitol of\nKaz'Ulrah.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Kaz'Ulrah Officer Citation", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Crate", "Purchased from the Cloud Temple Livery Stall\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("You are ugly", "~ Toni", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Trolls leathery hide", "The thick hide of a troll can be used for\ngreat insulation during the cold and provides\ntough resistance to slashing strikes on it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("driftwood", "This pieces of driftwood would twist and\ncurve, going ever which way nature has\nintented them to go, spiraling down to make a\nmarvelous work of nature and art. The wood\nwould resonate with flecks of red shining\ndown it!", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Viscid Oil", "A dark brown liquid that sat inside a flask,\nonce uncorked it'd begin to turn into a\nsludge in the space of two emotes, by the\nsecond emote as air had gotten to it, it'd\nbecome extremely sticky and gooey making it\nhard to move if one has become entrapped in\nit.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Truncheon", "(Common) A heavy wooden truncheon retrieved\nfrom a cultist of Vilketa. It is covered in\ndried blood, with the handle wrapped in old\npieces of cloth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Adumbrate Vessel", "A dark oak bowl with a beautiful, glossy\nsheen. Any individual to hold this object\nwould experience a faint aura of discomfort\nand paranoia. Any food served within would\nseem to loose its appealing qualities and, if\neaten, nauseate an individual", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Brown Bear Fat Decoction", "This is a copper flask, containing brown bear\nfat decoction. A tuft of brown bear fur\nfloats on the liquid. It is viscous. It\nsmells oily and of flesh, and tastes greasy\nand like gelatin. Whoever drinks this\ndecoction attracts hungry animals within\none-hundred meters, for twenty-four hours.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNewEra.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("4", "", "minecraft:cactus", ""),
        StaticItem("3", "", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("2", "", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("White Chip", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Casino Staff.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Jaws of Life", "A large, mechanical set of shears, used in\nemergency situations. The runes on the grip\ncan be activated, forcing the blades toward\none another, allowing it to cut through\nnearly anything.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Elk Bun", "A carefully-formed bun of soft bread dough\nformed around smoked elk meat, well-seasoned.\nThere's an X drawn on the top to allow the\nsteam to escape, and the top is a glossy\ngolden brown thanks to a buttery brushing\nbefore it was fired. It smells amazing.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Withfoot cider", "A clear and amber hued liquid with a sweet\nand lighthearted taste. \"Withfoot cider\" Has\nbeen labelled onto the bottle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Milk Chocolate Egg", "A chocolate egg that resembles a chicken egg,\nhowever made of chocolate, these eggs can\nsometimes be filled with smaller chocolates.\n(/roll 2, if you roll a 2, you get extra\nchocolate).\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Mushroom Spore", "A mushroom spore harvest from a cultist of\nVilketa's layer. It would grow particularly\nwell in a dark space.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Chieftess's Tabard", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Uruk Skull Fetish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwifar's bane", "In the hands of Nakhimir this ordinary blade\nfelled Dwifar 'The Fat' Goldhand.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Thaneala's mistake", "This blade, while in the hands of Sudo\nFrostbeard, brought down Thanela \"The\nMistake\" with the infinite skill of a holy\nwarrior blessed by Dungrimm.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wife Beater", "Keeps thots in line.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemist Shears", "", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Club", "When wielding this club you're tempted to hit\nthe nearest persona.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwennessy VSOP", "A blend of over 60 eaux-de-vie resulting in a\nharmonious experience - a testament to the\nenduring expertise of the master blenders. A\nnatural balance of strength and smoothness\nwith hallmarks of vanilla, clove, cinnamon,\nand candied fruit melding together for a\nmind-bending experience. Brewed by Aemich\nGrandaxe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana Crystal", "The crystal you hold brims with captured\nmagical essence, an experienced magic-user\nmay use this as a single-use to regain lost\nmana reserves.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:blue_stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of Thalrim", "The head of a dwarf of the silvervein clan.\nHis life sadly ended and his soul was used as\na host for the undeath.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of Shan Wu Chen", "The severed head of a wisdom filled monkey\nwho refused to spill his knowledge to the\ndwed of Kaz'Ulrah. This head is what remainds\nof him.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of Grand Queen Avilia", "The severed head of the once great queen of\nthe Grand Kingdom of Urguan. Wife to Grand\nKing Bastion Ireheart and the last true Queen\nof Urguan. Her death remains unsolved.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Agh Draagh", "A wooden and stained shaft bares the\ninscription \"Kulûk kulagh gozad aghu draagh.\nUpon the shaft lays a six pound hammer head\nthat has a curved tail coming off the back\nand a straight point off the top.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent's Coil Staff", "A tall, oak wood staff. It's plain apart from\nthe snake coiled around the shaft, each scale\nimmaculately carved from the tail to the tip\nof it's nose. It's eyes are replaced with\ngleaming emeralds, and sharp fangs protrude\nfrom it's open mouth, poised to strike. A\nluxuriously soft green leather wraps around\nthe grip.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Boreal Treasures Jewelry Emporium.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Bracelet", "Experience Boost I\nAn expertly crafted iron bracelet with a\nlarge diamond embedded in the center.\nEncircling the diamond are two dragons etched\ninto the metal which are illuminated under\nthe faint teal glow of the diamond. The gem\nis filled with mana to fuel the spell weaved\ninto the bracelet; a powerful ward against\nMental Magic and Sensory Illusion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Garrond the Great", "A masterful painting, displaying a nude High\nKing Garrond Frostbeard atop his throne.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("memeblock", "", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Kharajyr Doll", "A doll intricately made of dark oak depicting\na kharajyr - the limbs and head all rotatable\nin any direction. Finite details are painted\non delicately with grey ochre.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Starfelt.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Cartographer's Amulet", "A small talisman favoured by dwedmar\nmapmaker. Its casing, made from Kaz'Ulrah\niron, is engraved with the words: \"Lare Vroth\nOthok Sirk\". It features a needle made from\nredstone, enchanted to always point at the\nCloud temple.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bergukli] Kordenn Goldhand.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Cauldron", "A simple cooking area,\ncapable of making\na multitude of foods.", "minecraft:cauldron", ""),
        StaticItem("Ungrown Drilltongue", "A single seed in a padded pouch. This ungrown\ndrilltongue would spring into a snarl of\nroots if thrown at the ground-- perfect for\ntripping someone up. Enhanced for durability\nvia Druidic Herblore, a Druid could then\ncontrol the drilltongue to ensnare their\nenemies. \"Roots for when no roots are\naround!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Archdruid] Ithuriel.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Goldhand Coin", "A small coin with the emblem of Clan Goldhand\nstamped on. Used for Goldhand blood oath\nceremonies.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Kuban 'Black cactus' Cigar", "Tobaco leaves wrap around this very potent,\nalmost char-like cactus green cigar", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeds of Discord", "I holding these seeds close to ones ear, the\nsilent whispers of chaos could be heard , it\ntempting the listener down a path of madness\nand discord.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Graven Knucklebone", "A rare corporeal trophy of a bound being.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Salt", "A mineral composed primarily of sodium\nchloride. Salt is one of the oldest and most\nubiquitous food seasonings, and salting is an\nimportant method of food preservation.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Spittail", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Canister of Oil", "", "minecraft:magma_cream", ""),
        StaticItem("Mahogany Spoon", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aron Hawksong.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Mahogany Fork", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aron Hawksong.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Made with only naturally obtained Dwarven ingredients from carefully selected sources. The pine shoots and the rich heather honey mixed lingonberries results in a mead with a rustic Dwarven feel. Brewed by Aemich Grandaxe.", "Made with only naturally obtained Dwarven\ningredients from carefully selected sources.\nThe pine shoots and the rich heather honey\nmixed lingonberries results in a mead with a\nrustic Dwarven feel. The mead fits perfectly\nwith rich and tasty food", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("fake runic axe", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Pancreas pills", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Stafyric Vodka", "A glass filled to the brim with vodka,\ndistilled at the estate of the Stafyrs. It\nmay not be Carrion Black, but it'd take a\nRaevir to know the difference.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Cat", "The toy would be filled with fluffy stuffing\n, itd be shaped to look like a cute kitten,\nthe toy would be perfect for small children\nto play with. Lovable ,and cuddly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Blacksmith Hammer", "This is a decent sized hammer it has seen its\nwear and tear. The hammer also features a\nstrong yet slender shaft and the head has a\nheafty weight to it, surely good enough to\nget the job done!", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Velia Gladii", "A sharp double-edged steel gladius with a\ntapered point. The handle of the weapon is\nmade from Dark-ash wood, treated with boiled\nTung oil. The entire blade was only 30\ninches.The gladius' handle provided a solid\ngrip by a knobbed hilt with ridges for the\nfingers. Its crossguard was rhomboidal,\nconsisting of the steel tang and the Dark-ash\nwood handle. This weapon weighs approximately\n2 pounds. [[Ｔｈｉｓ ｗｅａｐｏｎ ｉｓ ｐｕｒｐｏｓｅｄ ｆｏｒ\nｈａｃｋｉｎｇ ａｎｄ ｓｌａｓｈｉｎｇ. Ａ ｇｌａｄｉｕｓ ｃａｎ ｉｎｆｌｉｃｔ\nｗｏｕｎｄｓ ｔｈａｔ ｍａｙ ｃａｕｓｅ ｌｉｍｂｓ ｔｏ ｂｅ ｄｅｐａｒｔｅｄ\nｆｒｏｍ ｔｈｅ ｂｏｄｙ.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Marcus Aurelius.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vinum Claudii Reservo", "This elegantly expressive wine was\nhandcrafted by the Claudii Familia Wine\nEstate in the Velian Colonia Aequium. It's a\nthoughtfully blended press of Canus\n(Grenache) and Cornelia (Syrah). Vinified and\nbottled by Velians. Fermented in amphora.\nAged for 36 months in barrel. Notes of juicy\nblack cherries and black berries. With hints\nof rose and vanilla. Goes well with a feast\nor party, or a pizza!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Claudii Familia, 1692.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("locking_Stick", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Chartreuse Lantern", "A teardrop shaped lantern made of\nyellow-green dyed glass. Made to burn lamp\noil slowly, rather than brightly. A lighting\nimplement less suited for lighting up a dim\ncave for exploration, but moreso as a soft\nbedside anodyne for the shadows of night.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Velian Denarius", "A coin made of silver, near 6 grams in\nweight. On one side is an image of the senate\nbuilding of the Velian people, with the\ninscription 'Velia Invicta'. On the opposite\nside is the head of Luccula Victora, a famous\nVelian Consul of recent history.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Velian Silver Bar", "A pure bar of silver, near 100-oz. It would\nbe plain and without detail, minus a small\nimprinting underneath which read 'Velia\nInvicta'.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Velian Aureus", "A golden coin from Velia, equal to 25\nDenarius. Printed on the face is an Eagle in\nflight, and on the other side the iconic\nhelmet of the Velian legions, writing along\nthe edge would read 'Senatus Semper'.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Velian Viaticum", "A special Velian Aureus. Gold coins given as\nan enlistment bonus for legionaries.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sp00k-Slayer 3000", "Are spooks haunting your family? Your place\nof work? Well no more! With Sp00k-Slayer 3000\nwe can guarantee a spook free life for you\nand you loved ones. (Terms and conditions\napply)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Whotin the Owl", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Luz Del Dia", "Luz Del Dia is an elegant and complex sipping\nrum, carefully crafted from the purest of\nsugar cane honeys. It is delicately distilled\nin ancient copper pot stills and aged in\nsmall oak casks for up to twelve years\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by houseofbigstars.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottled Mana", "The liquid inside the vial would glow an\neldritch blue, obtained from the unnatural\nflowing rivers of Haelun'or the liquid mana\nwould seemingly radiate a sense of the\narcane. However drinking it would have little\neffect upon the user, unless of arcane\norigin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Elvira's Frost Oil", "A metallic vial full of a bright blue oil\nsubstance. When touched by bare skin, one\nwould feel their skin freezing by the\ntemperture of the liquid. This oil can be\napplied onto weapons, allowing for wounds to\npotientally gain minor frostbite if the oil\nis not washed out.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lock Component #1", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anonymous.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Lock Component #2", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anonymous.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Lock Component #3", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anonymous.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Lock Component #4", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anonymous.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Silver Coin", "This silver coin, about the size of one's\nhand, features a prominent golden eagle on\nits head. On its tail, a crest is featured\ndepicting a long-necked spherical flask\nbetween two swords that could be interpreted\nas two-handed swords.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anonymous.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Arminius' Baton", "A large, lengthy wooden stick that has been\nsanded to be extremely smooth. The handle is\nfixed with a leather grip for added ability.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Paper Ballot", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Vinum Claudii", "The sophisticated wine was handcrafted by the\nClaudii Familia Wine Estate in the Colony of\nAequium. It's a gentle single varietal press\nof the Laenas (Bacchus) grape. Vinified and\nbottle by the Velians. Notes of elderflower,\npears, flint, and cut grass. Light and crisp\nbody. Goes will with garum-bread and roasted\npork.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fire-Pot Explosive", "When the fuse on this ceramic, oval vessel is\nlit, the deadly mixture contained within this\nthrowable device that is mainly compiled from\noil and sulphur catches ablaze in mere\nseconds, making the structurally unsound\ncontainer explode and spill its flammable\ncontents on the surrounding area, lighting it\non fire.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Chillblain", "An aqua blue potion that is cold to the touch\nand wrapped with thin leather. If one were to\ndrink this concoction, the user would find\ntheir skin warped blue and into a rough scaly\ntexture. A chill would radiate from them,\nrepelling any heat for a short\nwhile--however, in consequence to the hard\ntexture of the skin near the joints, mobility\nwould be limited and their standard movement\nspeed would be reduced by half (Lasts 10\nemotes).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Potion of Acuity", "A green concoction that will, to some extent,\nimprove all sense. Whether it be to heighten\na chef's taste or refine a hunter's hearing,\nthis potion will increase senses to 2.5 their\nnormal capacity. However, after the effects\nwear off, the user will find those senses\nreduced to .4 of their original capacity\n(Effects last 5 minutes and after effects\nlast 10 minutes).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Richard Baruch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Dagger of Ark'Azhuul", "In your grasp would be a delicately carved\nObsidian dagger. The blade itself is sharp to\nthe touch, and it’s color would be black as\nnight with glistening hues of violet. The\nblade of the dagger is set into the hilt with\nstrong sinew fibers,wrapped around it. The\nmost peculiar aspect of this blade seems to\nbe the hilt itself, an aged piece of animal\nbone, in which is carved with dark skulls,\nmouths agape in horror.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Songbird Amulet", "The amulet is a soft, thicker emerald backing\non a light blue song-bird embossment. When\nlight catches the materials, it doesn't\nshine. The amulet is rather matte in its\ngreen and blue finishes. It has a removeable\nsilver necklace.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Magnar Ale", "Tastes like shit, really strong. probabaly\nmakes your throw up.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Vodnik Glaive", "In your hand lies a well crafted glaive of\nelvish design. It featured a wooden shaft and\na well maintained blade. Above the blade a\ngem would rest, which, upon saying \\\"Feld\\\nwould slowly build up an arcanism missile,\nwhich upon firing would try to embed itself\ninto the target, before expanding outwards.\n((1 activation emote, 2 charge emote, 4th\nemote fire. Slightly sharp projectile expands\nto headsize. 5 charges. PM FlemishSupremacy\nfor info))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrosive Poison Flask", "Inside the bottle an orange liquid flows.\nWhen ingested or entered in contact with\nblood-stream will cause an extreme scorching\nsensation to the drinker. If bare skin is\ntouched, can leave severe burns and wounds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dmercads.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Therese's Wedding Ring", "The beautiful ring had a large, blood red\ndiamond emblazoned in its center! The diamond\nwas the center of spiraling bits of gold that\ngave it the appearance of a rose, intricate\ncarvings within the band of the ring itself\nwere very small, undiscernable to the human\neye. ((PM FlyingHalfMast for more info))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("KC1 Heavy Arbalest", "This beast of an arbalest is a staggering\n120cm long, it is comprised of a crank\nmechanism for loading thick bolts, it has a\nbronze and copper frame for flexibility and a\ntripod mounted along the bottom of the\nluxurious shaft that is made from a tropical\ncocobolo rosewood and engraved with multiple\ndwarven runes.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Soulstone", "Type /ss for more information\nWhen equipped:\n-25% Soulstone Cooldown\n+1.0 Soulstone Slots", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Fly Agaric Poison", "A liquid made from distilled water and fly\nagaric; it is a simple poison that isn't\nconcentrated enough to kill, but it will\ncause extreme nausea, sweating, and vertigo.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kardel Corp.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Heat Potion", "A potion made from a simple mixture of Aqua\nVitae, Crimson Vase, and pepper. Once\ningested, you would start to feel your body\nheating up at a rather fast rate; perfect for\nmaking sure you don't die of hypothermia.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kardel Corp.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("V.M.H.I Voucher", "The voucher below entitles the person who\npresents it to recieve five, Velian Standard\nsteeds. (18 speed). For redemption, go to the\ncolony of Aquiliam and show these to the\nguards, then your horses will be negotiated\nto you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("VMHI Overstock Voucher", "A voucher from the VMHI good for one\noverstock breed. This can be redeemed at\nColonia Aequium.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Sabre", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_19(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Orion's Chain Netting", "Chains that have been linked in such a manner\nthat imitates the style of a net. These\ndevices are heavy, requiring peak strength\nand likely assistance to use. At the bottom\nof each series of nets, there is an apparatus\nfor attaching weights, as well as a hook for\nmultiple uses on such devices like a\nballista.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Infused Golden Warhammer", "Warhammer of 3 feet of length and 5 pounds of\nweight, the handle is made of oak wood and is\ncovered by light blue dyed leather. The head\nis composed by an alloy of aurum and Damascus\nSteel and consists of a plain side and a\ncrowbeak. A golden ideogram is placed in the\nmiddle of the handle, which would invoke\ngolden soulfire around the entire weapon once\nactivated. [Requires 3 emotes to activate it,\nbeing able to be used on the 3rd one. PM\nSuxals for more info.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bead of Oersus", "A strange stone. It's said to do something in\ndesignated sites.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Garum", "A condiment consisting of fermented fish,\nsalt and a minor hint of spiced wine. The\nscent itself is absolutely vile and stomach\nturning, nevermind the taste.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Chain Weights", "A solid, cast iron weight that has a hooking\napparatus capable of attaching to Orion's\nchain nets. These devices weigh 50 pounds\neach.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrapnell Ejecter", "In your hand lies a blue gem with a silver\nband around it. It would be enchanted, that\nwhen saying \\\"Purity.\\\" a lot of small arcane\nballs would form around the gem, before\nshooting outwards at high speed! ((1\nactivation emote, 3 buildup, 5th emote it\nfires. 3 blocks of range in every direction.\nOne use, has to be recharged afterwards. If\nyou utter the phrase, all similar items on\nyou are activated. PM FlemishSupremacy for\ninfo))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:lapis_lazuli", ""),
        StaticItem("Barrel of Pitch", "Similar to oil, pitch is a sort of tar,\nviscous in its make and black in color. It's\noftentimes boiled and tossed from\nbattlements, allowing it to bubble and melt\nthe flesh of soliders. It retains heat for\nlong periods of time.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Holiday Honey Bread", "This bread was crafted with honest hands in a\nfestively-decorated bronze oven, resulting in\nthe best of holiday flavours. Glazed in honey\nand sprinkled with red and green colored\nsugars, this bread will definitely have you\nin the Krugsmas Spirit\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Darkroots", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Dried Petals", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Vile Liquid", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Hobbit's Moonshine", "A bottle of moonshine crafted by the infamous\nGrimsly Copperpot. One whiff of the contents\ncould curl the hair on an Olog. Actually\ndrinking this stuff does not seem like a wise\nidea.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Barrel Mead", "An artisanal brewed bottle of mead, bright\norange in color. It has a strong pumpkin\naroma when opened. When drank, there is a\nsmooth, buttery taste followed by a pumpkin\naftertaste. Its proof is rather low, but it\nsurely tastes well.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rolled Vanilla Ice Cream", "This dish contains five rolled up strips of\nice cream, each holding a small frozen\nstrawberry in the middle. Whipped cream\nswirls up at the top between the five ice\ncream rolls, drizzled in chocolate and sugar.\nDespite the environment it was in, it never\nseemed to melt. One who tasted this yummy\ntreat would find that they see things that\nare not there, even sometimes being put into\na dream-like trance. A humiliating prank, or\nan unexpected accident?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Vigor Cookie", "This cookie has melted chocolate inside and\nout, also tasting amazing! One who bit into\nthis cookie would feel like a million minas,\nas if they were completely refereshed. Any\nsore muscles and headaches would leave. Does\nnot heal wounds.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Ghostfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Flann's acoustic violin", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by mika1278.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Bitchwhippa", "An axe of brutish form crafted entirely from\nthe illustrious and rare metal: Bloodsteel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rex Leydluk'Raguk.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Freshly brewed tea", "This drink would be filled with herbs, giving\noff a earthy scent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Carrying Nico] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cream Filled Doughnut", "This doughnut is still nice and warm , inside\nis a thick whipped cream.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Rock of Love", "The rock glows in some strange magical power,\nits bearer feeling a strong sense of passion\nand virility.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yopplwasupxxx.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bowl of Hunter's Stew", "A small clay bowl, containing roughly 2/3rds\nof a litre of stew. The broth is very\nflavorful, and bears a yellowish tan color.\nThe stew seems to be a perpetual stew, in\nwhich the stew is always cooked, and various\ningredients and liquids are added as needed.\n[Do '/roll 10' twice for the prevantlent\nflavor. First roll for the prevalent meat,\nsecond for the most prevalent 'grain'. For\nmeats: 1=Beef, 2=Pork, 3=chicken, 4=lamb,\n5=spiced sausage, 6=fish 7=rat-meat,\n8=venison, 9=clams and shrimp, 10=horse-meat.\nFor grains: 1=barley, 2=rice,\n3=wheat-noodles, 4=potatos and carrots,\n5=lentils, 6=celery and cabbage, 7=stewbread,\n8=matzo crackers, 9=oat grains, 10=rice\nnoodles.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Livingwood Flute", "A simple flute grown by the crude hands of a\nsavage, but with the great care of a\nmusician. Its bark still breathes and it\nleaves still sprout from its stems, yet the\nbreath that carries through it is like the\nwind itself singing to the world; Beautiful.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unknown Druid.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Hide", "The Hide of an Amber Wolf. The hide would be\ncovered in a glowing secretion, burning\nanyone brave enough to touch it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Meat", "The Flesh of an Amber Wolf.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("60 Carat Sapphire and Silver Necklace", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Smoke Bomb", "This object is a small stone cylinder with a\nvent at the top of it in the closed postion.\nTo activate the user must hold the object\nclose whisper the words Oronduk this will\ncuase the object to fill with smoke. open the\nvent and throw.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fluffy Blanket", "A White Clean Fluffly Blanket with a Floral\nScent", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Blankets", "The blanket would be soft and gentle to the\ntouch while being able to withstand the cold\nfrom the outside.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusion stone", "A stone that needs to be rejuiced regularly\nthat would allow the user to appear to have\nstrinking crimson hair and blue eyes", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Speeshul Maeesk foowr JokeearLaww", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling meat", "A large, bloody chunk of meat that appears to\nbe halfling.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Sleeping Medicine", "A gold/green tinted thin liquid in a thin\nvial - Filled to the brim and sealed tightly\nwith a cork. It is made from Nightsap\ndilluted with water and Javens - And when\nused properly, it can send one to sleep\ninstantly for three hours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Healing Potion", "A soft red elixir that when drank will\nprovide some healing properties. The potion,\nat the cost of minor stamina drain, will\naccelerate healing small cuts and gashes. It\nalso aids in clotting blood, if applied to\nthe wound.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Ivae'Fenn Blade", "A Standard Fennic Blade, dyed black. The\nblade would seem to be shining, even though\nbeing covered in chips and scratches.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of dwain", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mug O' Cider", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Black-Ferrum Warhammer", "Infront of you lies a warhammer, crafted from\nreinforce black-ferrum. Its head molded into\na stirdy anvil-like shape, whilst its hilt;\nStraightened to a point. Aging marks could be\nseen across the weapon, indicating an\nextensive amount of usage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kizaura.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Beer", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gucci Clockwork", "", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Regeneration Potion", "The dark drink, is to be revealed as a\nregeneration potion, a less one.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bacon", "Fresh grilled bacon! It's smoked honeyed\nbacon. Tastes wonderful.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Josh \"Hawkeye\" 3738 Repellant", "I know you're regularly checking my\ninventory. But now I caught you red-handed.\nHi!", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Juststan147", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Warning!", "Hey! You took all four of ChumpChump's\nllamas. : ( You have to leave 2! Consider\nthis an informal reminder.\n-DiscoLiquid/Feywild\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Feywild.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Dwarven Wristband", "“An iron band, polished to a large degree.\nThe band would highlight the balance symbol\nin the center. The wrist band would fit the\narm of only a dwarf.”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Elven Coin", "A old and aged coin, covered in rust but\nappears to be an ancient piece of Axios.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Arrow", "A long, black-tipped arrow coated with slime.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Orange Marmalade", "A jar of orange cake pops. Each peice is\nheld by a carved, short stick, on the one end\nis a little mini-cake ball, coated in orange\nchocolate. It seems to have a cute bunny\ndesign on it!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Pipe", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fish Plushie", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Raw Amber Pendant", "A pendant of raw amber, simple and beautiful\nin its plainness. If one looks hard enough,\nfeeling of solace warmly eminates from within\nit, when one focuses on it. Some animals seem\nto respond to this as well, mostly around the\nwilds of Ceru.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Snow Elf Head", "The head of a filthy snow elf! The owner\nshould be proud.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Luv.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Owl's Head Coin", "A solid Iron pin. Its shape, though slightly\nworn, is that of an owl's head.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Protest Sign", "A large wooden sign, slightly worn from use!\nWords have been carved on either side: \"I am\nan all-purpose protest sign! I am against\nwhatever the occasion calls for!\" Too lazy to\ncarry around multiple signs to protest\nmultiple things? This is the sign for you!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Halfling Lives Matter.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Hair Piece", "A golden ornate hair piece embellished with\ncrimson poinsettia flowers and small white\ndiamonds that sparkle in the light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Imperial Family.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Wedding Ring", "A Silver Ring, crafted by Gray Ravencloak and\nKjartan Arden in the smithy of Nordengrad.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Oak Necklace", "A necklace with a finely made iron chain. At\nthe end of the chain is a amulet in the shape\nof a tree, wooden inlay adorns the trunk of\nthe tree and bits of emerald are used for the\nleaves.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Snowball", "It appears as if this snowball was covered\nwith water and then frozen to create a\nprotective, yet, hard layer!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by PurpleCola.", "minecraft:snow", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Band", "A small, uniquely crafted wedding band.\nEngraved on the inside is: \"Yours forever -\nSamson\" The ring is of high quality aurum and\na decent fit for most any man's finger—if\nthey are heartless enough to wear a dead\nman's wedding ring.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Collar", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Swirled Bronze Khopesh", "A bronze shortsword with a curved design, and\na single sharpened edge. The Bronze short\nsword is initially completely straight for\n2/3rds of the length of the blade, yet at the\nfinal curve a portion of the blade juts out\nand extends upward into a curve, that swirls\nto the back of the blade, being roughly at\nlevel with the straight 2/3rds of the blade.\nThe edge of the blade has been sharpened to\nbeing shaving sharp. The bronze the sword is\nmade from has been well shined , making it\nquite lustrous under light. The blade's\nhandle is made of oakwood, treated with\nlinseed oil. [For OOC reference visible, this\nis a El Daba Khopesh]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart shaped Necklace", "A heartshaped jewel that hangs on a delicate\nsilver chain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot rolls", "Braised juicy carrots which have been rolled\nin delicious strips of bacon, with a sprinkle\nof different spices and love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Ch(i)ef] Bjor 'Sugartits' Cottonwood.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana-Infused Giant Raven Head", "This darkened head of a now-deceased giant\nraven has a certain oddity to it. Lingering\nvoidal energies coursed through the lifeless\nsockets and orifices. A large, bloodied gash\nappears on the left side of its skull.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of the Herald", "These white shards of frost leave\na cold aura around them, faint cracks\necho from them now and again.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Primordial Surge", "Arcane I\nMagegold forged expertly into a lightweight\nwand of excellent quality. Over its body is a\nnumber of diamond gems infused with large\namounts of voidal energies. Through wavering\ngestures this wand builds up power to release\na great arcane beam over the course of five\nemotes. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Imbibed Fountain Statuette", "A statuette small enough to be held in the\npalm of one's hand. Its weight is still\nconsiderable however as it is seemingly\ncomposed entirely of granite. Small glimmers\nof red and orange magic sometimes pass over\nthe surface, barely visible to the naked eye.\nFor any wizard capable of such, this may be\nutilized for the sake of a water entrapment\nin the creation of enchantments. [PM Gladuos\nfor details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Stalwart Statuette", "Arcane I\nA white stone statuette depicting an elderly\nman hunched and carrying a massive boulder on\nhis back. It gives off a minor sheen over its\nsurface as to hint at its magical presence.\nThis can be tapped into for the purpose of\nbeing an earth evocation entrapment. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Arcanic Whispering", "Arcane I\nA massive torso-sized leatherbound tome which\nbears no title on its face, though on its\nfirst page the words 'Arcanic Whispering' are\nnoticed. Flipping through the grimoire one\nwould come to find it encompasses a large\namount of information regarding Arcanism. The\nbook is covered in many aurum bindings while\nruby gemstones encrust its entire spine, both\ngiving off a faint orange-tinted aura and\nsheening with potential energy. [Not enough\ninformation to self-teach] [PM Gladuos for\ndetails]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Gusted Crag", "A small sculpture of the tip of a great\nmountain. Swirls are carved into it as to\nindicate winds brushing all around it. A\npurple gemstone is encased underneath it,\nglowing with an intense energy. For purpose\nof enchanting, this can be used as an air\nevocation entrapment - if one knows how to.\n[PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sephra's Bracer", "Arcane I\nMagic Resistance I\nA pitch metal bracer padded by a dark leather\nover what would be a lithe forearm whether\nelven or human in nature. Several\norange-amber gems are embedded on the\narmguard's surface, swirling with intense\narcane power. The origin of these gems are a\nmystery, with an appearance alien to the\nconventional crystal. Though one could say\nthey are vaguely similar to aengul eyes on\nobservation. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Glove of Holding", "A brown glove enchanted with translocation\nand mental magics. A gemstone is stitched on\nthe back of the hand. This is capable of\nstoring anything in the Void which can fit in\nyour hand and merely thinking for it to\ndisappear. If you wish to regain it, just\nthink of bringing the object back again. It\nwill return. May only be used 3 times during\ncombat. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Disruptors", "A shard of Arcanium, suspended midair within\na cylindrical, reinforced glass case. On one\nof the ends of the glass case is a small\nbutton that, when pressed, will crush the\nArcanium in on itself, shattering it into\nmana pieces. Unfortunately, for any Mage\nresent, this will release the mana stored\nwithin the Arcanium out into the glass case.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Transdimensional Mirror", "Arcane I\nA grand ovular mirror shining with brilliance\ndue to its precious silver nature. It's\nencrusted with numerous fine diamonds all\nalong its borders, allowing the item to\nproduce a luminous effect. An aura of mystery\nsurrounds this object, but its reflection\nseems normal enough. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("⊙ Gilded Visage ⊙", "Ornate and etched with innumerable carvings,\nyou see a golden emotionless mask with red\ngemstones for eyes. A sheen of potential\nwashes over its surface as it has no purpose\nwhile being worn. Given the know-how an\nenchanter could tap into this object for the\nuse of illusion-based enchantments. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Distress Orb", "Arcane I\nA metallic, spherical object seems to be dull\nand monotone in colour and design. Imbued\nwith a nifty trick, however, and bound to a\nspecific gem, when an enchantment is\nactivated the spherical object will begin to\nglow with a furious white. It's brightness\nmerely growing the closer and closer it gets\nto the assigned gem, the orb will be almost\nblinding when in direct contact.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Enigmatic Slab", "A black slab of metallic origin formed into a\nrectangular shape, small enough to fit in\none's hand. Grooves and etchings are engraved\nalong the artifact. On it is a beautiful\nazure crystal, glimmering in the light. PM\nGladuos for details.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian Forest", "A tome of unknown origins possessing\nqualities both voidal and strange. The book’s\ncover is as puzzling as it’s content; It is\nwrought not of leather but of some sort of\ndark stone material, hard to the touch. It\nhas been engraved on it’s front with a forest\nof pine, and upon it’s back the same forest,\na single tower within atop a hill. [For full\ndescription PM Tehlulu or use the following\nlink: http://tinyurl.com/ameonn3]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Cosmic Tome", "Arcane I\nA great leather tome within which are\ninnumerable indescript arcanic runes written\nonto each of its many pages. An orange gem is\nset into its cover which sparkles brilliantly\ndue to its precious nature and the immense\nmagical presence stored inside. If you manage\nto somehow figure out its activation, the\nbearer is capable of evoking a massive\nflaming boulder and cast it down where they\npoint. Needs 6 emotes to charge and typically\nhas 2 uses before needing refuelment. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Green Chalk", "This dark green chalk easily stays on skin\nonce it makes contact! for green", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fuchsia Chalk", "This bright fuchsia colored chalk easily on\nskin once it makes contact!", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("A Light Steel Crossbow", "A gorgeous crossbow made from steel and\nspider silk. This lightweight silver crossbow\nis easy to maneuver and use, but can be taken\ndown in a few hits. ((Two emotes to load, one\nto shoot. Breaking requires three emotes of\nbattering.))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Red-elm Limbed Crossbow", "A complex crossbow made of Red-elm wood and\nsteel. The mechanisms consist of a crannequin\nwhich was located on the top of the crossbows\ntiller, for cranking the bowstring back. The\nback of the tiller has an iron-wrought\nbutt-cap which has the brand, Տ. Upon the\nfront of the crossbow was a steel stirrup.\nTung oil was treated to the bow and body of\nthe crossbow. The entire item was 3 feet\nlong, the bow being 4 feet, and 2 inches\nwide. The bow itself was fixed upon the body\nusing steel bow irons. To crank the crossbow,\nit required strength and a good arm.（（Ｔｈｉｓ\nｃｒｏｓｓｂｏｗ ｒｅｑｕｉｒｅｓ ｆｏｕｒ ｅｍｏｔｅｓ ｔｏ ｐｒｏｐｅｒｌｙ\nｒｏｌｅ－ｐｌａｙ.））\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mastersmith] Sali.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Skygod Hammer", "Countessem's Skygod Hammer", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Sturdy Leather Rope", "A sturdy leather rope, heavy enough to hold a\nfully grown man's weight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Dead Man's Ashes", "Ashes are all that is left of the a wandering\ncorpse. They still carry with them the faint\nstench of the grave...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ForeverGinger.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Final Solution", "A large leather tome containing many\northographic and isometric pictures of\nvarious tools, structures, and materials. If\none analyzes the entire document, the realize\nthat the final result is large meagstructure,\na fort of monolithic scale. The last page of\nthe book contains two signatures, one in\nformal, and one in cursive.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PlusOneMorale.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Book of protection", "The iron clad tome rests in your hand with utmost beauty.\nEach page produces a sense of amazing power...\nbut as you try to open the book, it keeps itself shut,\nprotecting itself from your prying hands.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("What Binds Us Together", "A reminder that Haelun'or and the Mali'thill\nis more than just a nation. It is a people, a\nculture, a love of knowledge. It is learning\nand making up for the mistakes of the past.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("A Heavy Noose", "A heavy rope, designed as a noose for\nhanging. It is new, and has been properly\nstretched.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Glitterbomb", "", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrum Wand", "A long cylinder of Electrum cast into a\nslight 'screw' shape, with a leather grip.\nThe wand is roughly 2 feet long, with a small\nsphere on the end. On the bottom of the wand\nis a blue-dyed leather grip for comfort,\ngoing from the base of the wand, to 1/4 of\nit's length, about 6 inches. It would seem to\nbe a focus tool, for one to cast magic from.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Armor Stand", "The puppet, made of wood, has silver hair\nwith small beads dotting it. Tall for a high\nelf, the depiction has dark purple eyes and\nis adorned with white robes. The facial\nstructure would appear to resemble Elrith\n(Mordu), and be quite physically fit. (Bound:\nMar 14, 2018)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("The puppet of pride (PM: Aviers for more info)", "A wooden puppet, with a strand of curling\nsilver hair and painted on golden eyes. The\npale complexion had a likeness to the elf\nCenwall (DustyDune). The puppet is dressed in\nopulent armor, crafted using wood, cloth, and\niron. (Bound: Mar 9th, 2018)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("The stern puppet (PM: Aviers for more info)", "A wooden puppet, with short gray hair of\naverage body-size. It has painted on\ngreen-blue eyes, with slight but visible bags\nunder them. The pale complexion resembles the\nelf Areion Visaj (Braz_), and dressed in red\nand gray clothing. (Bound: Mar 14th, 2018)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Dagger", "A slayer steel dagger, curved slightly and\nhaving an edge on both sides. A simple loop\nof metal would be at the end of the hilt,\nmaking it easy for a person to pull it free\nwith a single finger. The dagger itself would\nbe light weight in make, and have leaves\nblowing in the wind engraved into the metal,\nswirling around and up to the leather bound\nhilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlight Druid] Eryn Nailo Serene.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Worlds Best Sworsd", "It's the worlds best sword\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haintrain.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Silver Amulet", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Earth Blast [T5]", "A scroll only about as long and wide as\nsomeones hand, inscribed on it was much odd\nwriting in a dark blue ink, atop it was the\nword 'Sandicus'. If the word was spoke a\ntorrent of sand would fly out from the scroll\nfrom its back, likely enough to temporarily\nblind a person with sand in the eyes. this\nwould take very little time for the cast to\nfully cast. Once casted the ink would burn\naway off the paper, rending it a one use\nscroll.(two emotes summon. First emote\nsummons sand. Second launches)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Glaive", "A powerful weapon forged in exotic lands.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gingerbread Man (PM: Aviers for more info)", "The puppet is made in the shape of\ngingerbread man, coated with frosting,\nchocolate for hair, and gumdrops for buttons.\nWhen connected toward an individual, the\ntarget would begin to turn into cake,\nspecifically their top layer of skin.\nEventually, one would die as their whole\nbodily exterior turned into gingerbread. The\neffect lasts until the connection is broken.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Stricture Tablet", "Stricture 26: It is in due right, and in way\nof nature that those bound in marriage should\nenjoy the privileges of sexual intercourse\nand relations. Yet, it is to be kept between\nthe 2 lifemates, not extending to others and\ncreating such things as orgies or brothels,\nfor they are detestable and disgusting.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Fire", "A pale green liquid that emits a faint glow\nalong with being slightly cooler compared to\nits surroundings. Much like Alchemist's Fire,\nthis substance is highly volatile and should\nbe handled with great care and caution.\nExposure to even the heat from a candle,\ntorch, or bright sunlight can lead to the\nsubstance combusting violently - burning as\nhot as Alchemist's fire. This would be stored\nwithin an oddly shaped glass flask, with a\nglass cork on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Doriftu.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Smoke Whispers", "A dark blue liquid speckled with white\nparticles swirls in the flask. Once opened,\nthe contents of the bottle would be swiftly\nbe released into the air, quickly clouding\nthe area in a 6 block radius. The smoke is\ndense, obstructing ones sight as well as\ncausing irritation when breathing and in the\neye. It would last roughly 2 rounds of emotes\nin an open space before dissipating. ((PM\nAviers for more info))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aviers.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Caras Eldar Merchant Permit", "This permit hereby grants the holder the\nability to sell goods in the Dominion of\nMalin. A tax of 50 minas has been paid to do\nthis. Any questions should be directed to the\nLord Merchant, Azoth Hawksong.\" - Merchant's\nGuild\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zilldude.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Seax", "A Nordengradic Seax made of iron. Runes line\nthe cross guard. A piece of rough leather is\nwrapped about the hilt of the blade and a\nsimple oval of iron inlaid with a smooth\nriver stone forms the pommel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elkarinah'thilln' - The Silver Sunrise", "A flag of thick cloth coloured clear light\nblue with a detailed rising sun in the\nmiddle. [[PM Aythyinae for a photo.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aythyinae.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Air Blast", "A large scroll neatly wrapped up, if opened\nthe enside entailed a long list of unreadable\ncharacters, some small, some large. The\ncharacters were written in mana ink, then\ninfused with a powerful spell, at the bottom\none could read the word 'Airevectros'. When\nthis word was said the ink on the page would\nburn up off the paper, though a powerful ball\nof air would begin to form ((four emotes)).\nThis was capable of knocking over people in\narmor at max. One use scroll. ((Made by\nZachsSlayer))[T5]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Muggled Boots", "These boots seem to have a purple shimmer\nradiating from them. The stitching upon the\nboots is of a high and vast quality, almost\nunable to be measured. The leather itself\nwould seem to be rough and coarse. If you\nwere to punch these boots, a sharp pain would\nshoot up your arm!\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Snowglobe", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Deleted Email", "Legend has it this was recovered by the\nDwarven whistleblower, \\\"Assangegoth.\\\" With\nhis efforts, Ski_Kings corruptions was\nbrought to light on 11/9/16.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Red_Rockkit.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Porkiest Meaticle", "The mightiest and porkiest of meats. Able to\nsmite all.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashen Yelen-Wynne White", "A wine of yellow tint, aged in ashen bark, in\nlands far away. It tastes sweet, but has a\nsour aftertaste. Quite addictive.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Teddy Bear", "A pink fluffy teddybear, about a foot tall.\nIt sits in typical teddy bear fashion with\nits arms outstretched. It looks quite happy\nwith itself, is very fluffy, and is probably\nthe perfect gift for a young girl!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear's blood", "A bowl filled with a direbear's blood.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("The Mighty Smitten Bread", "This bread is powerful and smitten.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Tide's apology", "I am really sorry for what i did with Areln.\nIm sorry, her frostwitch powers allured me.\nFriends again?", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Wyvern Tongues", "This is a lemonwood gourd, containing potion\nof wyvern tongues. It smells loamy and with\nwisps of pears, and tastes greasy and fruity.\nWhoever drinks this potion will be able to\nunderstand the roars of wyverns, for one\nhour.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll's blood", "This blood is from a troll its vile and\nsmells like filth. Its thick consistancy\nmakes one cringe at the thought of its\norigin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fake Cheque", "This cheque can be renewed for 9000 minas at\nyour local bank!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by a Kha'Cheetrah.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Hoplite Sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cold Cutter", "A well made dwarven long sword with a large\nblue gem at the hilt. The weapon would belong\nto Hamnil Frostbeard and would take great\nstrength to weild.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag of Ash", "A small amount of ash left behind\nby the slain Lich, Elwen Evaglno.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elwen.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Staff", "A very broken staff. At the hilt would be\nunfurled leather bindings and the staff\nitself seemed to be a very ornate staff made\nwith craftsmanship beyond the skilled\ncraftsman. ((For reference picture of the\nstaff, contact TheDragonsRoost)).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheDragonsRoost.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dire Wolf Corpse", "(Common) A Dire Wolf Corpse recovered in a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The corpse has\ncarvings all over it, once belonging to a\ndire wolf whose master served the Maiden of\nFertility.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Carrier", "A harness worn by a parent to carry their\nchild in while still being able to use both\nof their hands!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Daddy Turned Dad] Ahryn Skelt.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Swan Feather Quill", "A swan's feather, beautifully plumed and pure\nwhite. The tip is sharpened to a light point,\nperfect for writing letters. The feather\nmeasures about a foot long from tip to end,\nand can serve as a writing utensil or a hair\ndecoration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Chest", "An elegant ring box with a fancy lock and\nfine padding on the inside. In the center\nsits a silver ring with an emerald fitted on\nthe top. If the ring is rubbed it would begin\nto play music akin to a music box to the\nwearer and the ring would take a soft glow.\n\\\"Thank you.\\\" is inscribed inside the ring.\n[[PM Toxzero for Questions regarding the\nenchantment. Needs to be recharged after 20\nuses. If warded directly for Illusion by a T5\nAbjuration the enchant will break.]]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kanadensare.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Starlight Helm", "Made from iron plates and silver\nbolts, draped in a black, silky coif.\nA blue silk sash is attached to\nthe end, indicating a cosmetic appeal\nrather than practical application to combat.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Infertility Potion", "This potion, when drunk, will cause the\ndrinker to become fully infertile temporarily\n((A few IRL hours)).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Luger", "A standard issue Dwarven shortsword", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Glowy Stick", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Titanic Beast Blood", "The blood of a titanic beast. Taint can be\ndetected in it. On consumption, induces\nnausea, vomitting, weakness, headaches, and\nexhaustion, increasing in intensity over five\nKrug's hours. At this point, it fades. The\ncondition can be cleansed by shamanistic\nblessing, or druidic or clerical healing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Chubby the Cat.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("x Inscribed Meteorite Fragment x", "And so the tomes of power fell to the realm behest the\nAenguls and Daemons, a boon of their immense and\nunfathomable power.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Muffin", "", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Kalenz Toast", "A slice of toast that, by utter chance, bears\na likeness to Kalenz Uradir.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by One Toast To Rule Them All.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Le Baguette", "It's a baguette\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haintrain.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Boar Meat", "The fresh raw meat carved from a Giant Boar,\nvery similar to pork but rougher to chew. A\nhardy meal for a big boy/girl!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Egg Sac", "You can see a larvae-type creature swirling\naround inside the yolky sac, this was\nretrieved from the Far Southern Wall.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Sauted Mutton", "A fine cut of mutton sauted in a light oil,\nonions, and peppers. The meat has been cooked\nto medium-rare perfection.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Purified Gelatin", "Gelatin dust.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Evocress Produce Company.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Donation Voucher", "This voucher shows that you have proudly\nsupported the Enchantry - Thank you for your\ndonation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toxcat.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashen Skull", "A mask made from hardened clay and painted gray.\nSomething to surprise friends or startle enemies.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Adult Direbear's ribs", "A cut of meat from a massive adult direbear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Scrying Eye", "A glass sphere that fits in your palm. It is\nsmokey on the inside. When held, a blood\ncrimson eye appears, only visible to the\nholder. It always seems to stare towards the\nsouth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whamsickle.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Striga Blood", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by ___Jacko_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("GET WELL SOON SAKURA!!!!!", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by GandalfDahWhite.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Knight's Luxurious Heater", "A well made and extravagant heater shield with a quality red paintjob.\nIt's leather strap appears to have small glowstone studs in it, making the handle glow\nin the dark, probably incase someone drops it in a dark place.\n*Moderator Approved*\nIrishPerson approved this item.", "minecraft:blaze_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Silk", "One of the most durable\nmaterials in existence.\nPerhaps it has other uses?", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Book", "Within the book contains the Dominion's codex\nof law.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Not Enough Sticks", "", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Naughty Girl", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("white silk", "This is white silk. All craftselfship is of\nthe highest quality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Translock Rings", "These rings do nothing on it's own.\n((Contact: Candylandman, for more info))", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornwood Arrow", "This is an expertly crafted thornwood arrow.\nIt is banded with gryphon leather and snail\nshell, and has a barbed bare wood tip. The\nobject has eaglefeather vanes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Green Boots", "On the side of the boots, there would be\nthe words, 'For your withered behind. May\nyou always be thwacking men upon the head\nwith cooking utensils' would be engraved.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Sakura's ERP Logs", "Congrats. You have wood now.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Catroot", "A strange, crudely feline-shaped root,\ngrown into an intricate braided motif in\nsome places. It lays, a bizarre sorrow to\nit, as if crafted by an artist in\nmourning. Its solemn gaze stares\never-watchful over those who hold it...\nPeering into their soul.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashwood Branches", "These small items could perhaps be turned\ninto crafts, looks about the right size for a\nshort sword, or a bow.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Woolen Vest", "A thick, deep red vest. Because it is made of\npatternless linothorax and dense wool, it can\nbe easily reformed to fit any size or shape.\nThis also gives it a waxxed, smooth feel. It\nhas three iron buttons with patterns engraven\ninto each one.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Hunting Spear", "A typical spear, perfect for hunting bears.\nIt is a large wooden pool, with a sharpe\nsteel tip covering the top.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("abs Magical Cotton Candy Stick abc", "If you shake this stick a few times,\nCotton candy will appear. Fluffy and sweet.\nUnltimited Cotton Candy.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("White Cotton", "This is white cotton. All craftselfship is of\nthe highest quality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("White Suede", "This is white suede. All craftselfship is of\nthe highest quality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Hedgehog", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Peach", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pet Food", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood L", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of bunemma", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cut Lilikoi", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Laurel Wreath", "A meticulously woven crown of leaves. Each\nbranch was curled tightly about the other,\nyet a brilliant mixture of fall and summer\nleaves shone from the item. Within the\ncenter, presumedly to be placed upon the\nforehead, was a wooden carving of clasped\nhands. This carving was curled around and\nheld in place by the flora.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Loriens.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Replinishing Potion", "A potion that is to be taken twice an elven\nday, its capable of helping with the healing\nof internal wounds, broken bones, and\nassisting in fighting away infection or\ndisease. The brew only speeds up the recovery\ntime slightly and in turn makes the user\nsleepy along with the possibility of pain in\nthe healing locations and minor paralysis. If\nmis-used it can become quickly addictive. [Pm\nZachsSlayer for any help!]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Harolds' Homemade Tattie Scones", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("OwlBear Hide", "The Hide of an OwlBear. The Skin itself would\nbe Tough and Brown, covered by a mess of Wool\nand Feathers, a very odd combination.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Valein's Silver Ring", "A small silver band that is encrusted with\nLapis Lazuli and engraved with decorative\nlines and swirls. If anyone were to come into\nphysical contact with the ring, a small\ntransparent bubble 'shield' would span out\naround them. Anything may pass through the\nshield' as it is just an illusion! Finally,\nif the wearer comes across a mirror or any\nreflective surface and gazes upon their own\nform, they'd see an uglier, withered verion\nof themselves. ((PM Voidal for more info\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantVoid.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Adult Direbear's thigh", "A cut of meat from a massive adult direbear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Adult Direbear's breast", "A cut of meat from a massive adult direbear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Forge Master's Hammer", "A small Carbarum hammer made for use in the\nforge, it would be exactly what one would\nneed if they were crafting weapons or armor.\nThe words, \"Maehr'sae Hilyun'ehya\" are\nwritten upon the hammer's head.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GotXanned.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Sprite Dust", "The dust seems to shimmer, seeming\nto give off a gentle glow.\n*Moderator Approved*\ndagothagahnim approved this item.", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Warped Stone", "A stone, rendered twisted and black by\nforbidden practices.\nIt feels otherworldly and strange to touch.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Worn Handkerchief", "A soft, but used handkerchief embroidered\nwith patterns of swords and bows. The\nedges are frayed, and there's small\nspatters of blood on it. It smells very\nfaintly of lavender behind the strong\nreek of war.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Mop", "An elegant mop of black stained wood and\nstrips of fabric, pearl-coloured rings\ncircling the handle; bound by a silver\nring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bundle Smoke Pipe", "The Bundle Smoke Pipe Passed Down Through\nGeneration Is a Masterpiece. Its Stem Would\nBe Made Out Of Gold and Its Bowl From The\nRarest Sandalwood\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bahbou123456.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Hoe", "A Scythe. A long staff of black ferrum\nwrapped in dark leather. Carvings of Adunian\nrunes and engravings honoring the Paragon\nAelfwynn are seen all along the shaft. At the\ntop of the staff lies a black ferrum cage\ncontaining the fire and coals", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("State of the Art Whacking Stick", "The whacking sticks seem good for most\nuses! Getting those darn children off\nyour law, even hitting your nephew!\nPerhaps punishing those pesky thieves? Or\neven for use behind locked doors ;).\nEngraved into the grip would be a black\nraven emblem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Self-threading needle", "This arcanic needle, wen sit on torn clothing,\nappears to fix it on its own, requiring not a\nperson to thread it through.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusionary High Elf Mask", "A cowl of silk imbued with an illusionary\nenchament that'd cause it to resemble a High\nElven male's face if pulled taut over a\nfeatureless ovular head. An amulet bearing a\nhefty mana gem is looped to this guise,\nproperly worn hung from the wearer's neck. PM\nLhindir_ for details.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Fang Of The Stone Wolf", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Storm-Weaver", "A silver longsword that was simple, but\nfinely crafted. Its grip would be wrapped in\nleather, and the pommel would have a\ndecorative carving in the center of two\ncrossing lightning bolts.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("War Blade", "An Old War Blade of Arbor, it has seen use,\nand is damaged. It is good for protection, if\nused at all.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon Tea", "A cup of freshly brewed lemon tea. Despite\nthe lemony flavour, the aftertaste is more\nsweet than anything.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caesar's Sweatshop.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyrilsburg Honey Mead", "Fermented with savory honey from the Curonian\nApiary, this honey mead goes down extremely\nsmoothly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Yikes", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fighting Staff", "A oak quarterstaff made for someone about six\nfeet in height. The weapon would be wel\nbalanced and have iron caps at each end\nadding to their utility. The quarterstaff\nwould otherwise be bare and unremarkable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Devran Vanir-Iyliar.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("1  SECRET DRINK [009] 1", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Krysto-\"FKLA\"-ray pocket watch", "This luxury pocket watch, designed in the\nKaz'Ulrah fashion, function by generating a\nray of light through an array of \"FKLA\ncrystals. The ray is then projected, through\na system of mirrors, on the glass screen,\ncreating the image.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("A Letter to Ithilion Drakon", "A letter is delivered to the Drakon manor,\naddressed to Ithilion. The parchment is\nstained with tear marks, and slightly curled\nat the ends. The handwriting is shaky and\nhastily written.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Archmonk of Moon's Prayers", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Lock Removal Stick", "Whack things to remove their locks!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:stick", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_20(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Old Ford Bundle Cheese", "A Family Recipe Of The Bundle's , The Cheese\nWould Have a Pillowy texture With a Crumbly\nOuter Layer And It Would Have Grassy and\nSmoky Flavour.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bahbou123456.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bearded Battleaxe", "An excellently crafted polearm, standing at\n4’11” tall. The pole is crafted of a fine\nFarfolk Ebony, and the blade of Jorgundic\nBlack Steel. The blade is 1’5” long from the\ntop to bottom of the beard. It is adorned\nwith engravings of Norse Knots, centered by a\nhowling Wolf. Dubbed, “Skammdegi,” it is a\nthicc and terrifying weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sandey0000.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Phoenix", "Phoenix\" is long, with a gold-coloured\nhandle and hilt, and a distinctive blade. The\nhilt of the sword if adorned with precious\njewels and the blade is mirror polished.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aehab.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Polelance", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cracked Hermit Crab Shell", "A cracked piece of shell once belonging to a\ngiant hermit crab. It can be used for\nmultiple types of crafting in order to\nreinforce weapons or armor.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Mother's Touch", "These small grains of seeds are told to be\nthe very seeds in which was the first flora\nto to bloom upon the surface of the earth,\nthe sunflower. The oddly shaped seeds are\nblack in colour and have small white stripes\nrunning over the surface of them- the\nsunflower represents the light that our\nmother breathes and the towering height in\nwhich the mali'ame represent. A truly sacred\nthing is the gift of life, so nurture these\nseedlings into full bloom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:cocoa_beans", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of the Fallen Metal Spirit", "A heavy skull made of pure steel, in its eye\nsockets lightning often bounced to and fro,\nbut could never seem to be touched. Fallen\nSpirit of Metal and Electricity\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Muyakelgism.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Firey Skull", "An ashen colored skull, smoothed over and\nmissing a jaw. Inside the eye sockets of the\nbeing were two small burning flames, they\nseemingly burned forever and were put out if\nanything touched them, unable to light things\non fire. They would light back on once\nwhatever had left them. Skull of minor Fire\nSpirit\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The liver of a 'ker", "A liver taken from a dark elven mother. What\nhorrifying luck.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Brooch of promotion", "A badge that signifies prowess and skills\nagainst a superior beast, one not to be\nreckoned with in small numbers\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A Fella Fisk-man", "purple tinted skull with thousands of teeth\nthat were all sharp. A dead Fisk-man that was\nsimply looking for a meal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Shredded Ticket #1", "This piece of paper appears to be part of a\nbigger ticket, it's the upper left corner\npiece.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Conspirator_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sea Snail", "It is a somewhat large sea snail, very slow\nhowever. It would make a priceless companion\nto those of old age.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("simple runeblade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Polar Bear Hide", "The Rough Fur of a Polar Bear, skinned from\nHead to Toe. The Hide would be bloodied from\nmultiple injuries, adding to it's slayers\nreputation to kill such a beast.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:bone_meal", ""),
        StaticItem("Faerie Truffles", "A small handsel of a rare herb said to be the\nfavorite food of the fairy folk, attributed\nto the reason they stay so small. The herb is\nimpossible to grow in captivity and grows up\nto three feet below the greatest roots,\ncontributing to its rarity beyond simple\nscarcity. Amongst mortals, the truffle is a\nremarkable delicacy, renowned by chefs and\nalchemists alike, for it is both tasty and a\nstrange, mystical reagent.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Betrothal blade", "A 13 degree curved blade is held by a grip\nwrapped in red leather. The grip is protected\nby a jagged, curled guard of gold leaf eagle\nwings. The blade itself measures 12” and\ncarries an intricate almost flowing water\nlike design. The dagger’s tang is concealed\nby leather and polished bone fixed by bronze\nrivets.((OOC this is a damascus steel\ndagger))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Xalid Mournstone.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pirate Cutlass", "A cutlass scavenged from that of a pirate,\nthough who knows what history it bore before\nthat? The blade itself seemed worn and showed\nmany signs of wear. It most definitely needed\nto be sharpened, too be honest it's a mystery\nwhy the pirates didn't sharpen it. Guess they\nwere lazy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HortonHeardAWho.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghostfish", "You can't eat it, if you can't see it", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Stonefish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Silvervein Whiskey", "Easy tasting whiskey thats elegant but\nstrong.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Longmanes Lovin", "An old brew from an old, now dead clan. It is\na strong mead thats aged well.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Silvervein Vodka", "The vodka rolls down the tongue with a sharp\naftertaste and smells like disenfectant.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Anvilaxe Special", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Guthrie Family Longsword", "A well crafted double edged longsword, forged\nby a master smith. A daelish phrase is\ninscribed along the length of the blade,\nreading: \"Treun anns a' chath.\" The\ncrossguard extends out to give as much\nprotection to the hands as possible. /edit\ndesc A well crafted double edged longsword,\nforged by a master smith. A daelish phrase is\ninscribed along the length of the blade,\nreading: \"Treun anns a' chath.\" The\ncrossguard extends out to give as much\nprotection to the hands as possible. A\ngemstone has been fastened to the center of\nthe crossguard, it gleams brilliantly with\ngreen and blue hues, like a submerged forest.\nThe pommel has been shaped in the form of a\nraven, its design intricately made.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vorgraven.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hartraft Family Longsword", "A well crafted double edged longsword, forged\nby a master smith. A phrase is inscribed\nalong the length of the blade, reading:\nTreun anns a' chath.' The crossguard extends\nout to give as much protection to the\nwearer's hands. A gemstone is fastened to the\ncenter of the crossguard, it gleams\nbrilliantly with green and blue hues, like a\nsubmerged forest. The pommel has been shaped\nin the form of a raven, its design\nintricately made.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vorgraven.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Crossbow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Battleaxe", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Medium Crossbow", "A crossbow fitted for siege defense and\nmoderately ranged conflicts.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Cutlass", "The Blade Before You Was Forged In Honor Of A\nFallen Mage Who Bore Red Hair And several\nNon-Organic Limbs. As You look Closer At the\nBlade You Will See That It Also Bare A Red\nTinge To it, Some Would Also Be Able To Malic\nOriginating From It\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Primordian_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("You smell idiot, haha", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Axe of The Flame Warden's", "This is a wonderous axe made by the dwarves\nof kaz'ulrah ornately decorated and standing\nout from other weapons. When a user of\ndwarven blood grabs hold of this weapon it\nwould ignite into a large flame encompassing\nthe entire axe head in a crackling burning\nheat that would sear the skin. [2-3 uses]\n[contact overlord8000]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kanadensare.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Owl", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Worn Shield", "A shield wielded by a Strange Knight, causing\nmayhem in his path. The shield would be\npainted in faded green and black stripes,\nafter many years of use. The Shield would be\nchipped and dented in many places, and have a\nstrange symbol of a Burning Tree carved onto\nthe backside.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("5kg dumbell", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Sting", "★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Cruel War Axe", "A deadly axe made of dark steel that beckons\nfor the thrill of combat. It strikes harder\nthan any normal blade, yet seems to sap the\nuser's fortitude. (+7 damage, -3.0 armor)", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Robe", "(Common) A set of robes recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. The robes are made of a\nsoft linen, primarily made of grey and yellow\nthreads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Inactive Runestone", "(Common) A stone recovered from a cultist of\nVilketa's layer. The small stone would fit in\nthe palm of one's hand while having an\nimpossibly smooth surface. While it was clear\nat one point this stone was covered in\ndifferent runes, they have now been partially\nscuffed out or removed.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider eggs", "These pulsating eggs are black in color and\nseem to be ready to burst forth a new spider.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Spider Carapace", "This is a hard carapace of a Giant spider of\nanarak. Hard like steel and black as coal its\ntruely a great prize.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Tear-Drop Emerald Earrings", "A pair of dangling earrings, with tear cut\nemeralds hanging from delicate silver\nthreads. The earrings would be finely made,\npieces of wealth and prosperity.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imibee.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather Duster", "An elegant feather duster of white\nfeathers and a black stained wooden\nhandle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Soul Amber", "This gem shimmers in the wild inspiration of\ndesperate souls. When they experienced a\nbloodthirsty exploit, they crystallized into\nthis amber and left their essence as a\ntrophy. A macabre but intriguing gem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golem head", "this item is a large head of a golem missing\nan eye. Its old and covered in moss it has a\ncrazied look about it with writings along its\nskull that suggest it was damaged.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruthern Style Sweet Meat Sub", "A variety of smoked and sweetened meats, all\nfreshly hunted within the forests of Haense,\ncooked and seasoned to perfection using an\nancient Ruthern family recipe passed down\nthrough the generations, a tradition since\nthe era of the Raevir Prince.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("I hate you <3", "Please dont take my modreqs, i havent done a\nsingle one this month.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TideVermin.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Lyuer", "The slayersteel bastard sword would be\nroughly 48 inches in length. The blade of\nthis weapon would be thinner than its sister\nAnnil and have two fullers down the full\nlength. The steel crossguard would point\ntowards the tip of the weapon to form a V.\nFor the pommel a full tang design would be\nused with desert jukewood wrapped in black\nleather for a strong yet comfortable grip. To\ncap off the weapon the tang would actually\nappear to be split apart and sculted to look\nlike twin wolf heads", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Yew Short Bow", "A simply made shortbow of light colored yew\nwood, which is strung with the strongest of\nsilks. May your arrow fly true.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Yew-wood Warbow", "A large Warbow with an ashen design to it's\nbirch-colored make, it stood at a massive six\nfeet in height. Requiring quite a large\namount of strength and patience to pull back,\nif fired it would carry the arrow towards\nit's target which rivels simple crossbows. A\nfull one-hundred and seventy pounds of\ndraw-weight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Omar.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Willbreaker", "A greataxe forged in pure diamond with a very\nsharp-edge blade. The Silvervein emblem and\nthe Kaz'ulrah melted on the shoulder of the\nsteel handle of each side to show it's Glory.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZoriTheFluffyFox.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Marriage ribbon", "a legnth of red ribbon\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Greymane Boar Skull", "The skull of a large Greymane Boar.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Cursed Treant Remains", "It appears that these are the remains of a\ncreature made of wood, the consistency of it\nclosely resembles wood scrapings. It has the\ndistinct fragnance of soul resin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Clay Slug", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Throqual Tail", "This large, spined tail was cut from the\nbeast of the Throqual, an infamous monster of\norcish folklore. Sunken into its flesh, a\nmouth would still writhe and twist as if it\nwas still alive.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Divinejustice.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Falum'Lur Action Figure", "An action figure created by a small cub\nconstructed together by slime and bones. This\nfigure is a green adult Orc covered in scars,\nhorns, and large tusks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lutauman.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Merk'Lur Action Figure", "An action figure created by a small cub\nconstructed together by slime and bones. This\nfigure is a green cub Orc that is covered in\ndust and bruises from the trouble he gets in.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lutauman.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Tobacco", "A bundle of cured and dried tobacco. it has a\nrich, earthy scent like dried hay, with just\na little sweetness, perfect for the casual\nsmoker that doesn't fancy drugs but just\nwants to smoke a pipe, cigar or cigarette now\nand then... Or maybe quite often.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gilondir Oronar.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Gjota Mushroom", "A peculiar looking mushroom with a wide\nconvex cap, bearing a caramel colour which\nfades abruptly to a straw-like shade around\nits rim. The crown is pitted with dark blue\nzones that become more prominent with age.\nIts stalk is skinny and five to six inches\nlong in length with a light gray to white\ncolouring. This mushroom has a faint\nfarinaceous stench and if consumed would have\nan extreme bitter and earthy taste, making it\nvery unpleasant to consume. Upon consumption\none would experience a potent psychedelic\nhigh, becoming very alert and aware of their\nsurroundings, as well as inducing auditory\nand visual hallucinations. ((Google Psilocybe\nAzurescens for more detail on what you would\nexperience.))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MajesticOwyn.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Glitter Bomb", "You know what it do\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("~[Wavy Greatsword: Anam na Cloiche Brón]~", "It appears the entirety of this zwëihander\nhas been wrought from pure, refined\nDaemonsteel. The blade, reaching an\nimpressive 6 feet (182.8cm), undulates to and\nfro to allow each slash to have a lascerating\neffect on the lightest of armors and and\nthickest of flesh. Towards the base of the\nblade is a set of unique parierhaken; offset\nfrom the 4\" (10.16cm) ricasso, the pair of\ndaemonsteel hooks curve off into a shape\nreminiscent of a wyvern's scaled wings. Below\nthe wings, the ricasso is adorned in a thick\nlayer of crosshatched leather. Even further\nbelow is an impressively thick crossguard\nstyled to resemble slightly-curved spikes\nthat jut out out horizontally before curving\nskyward.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fireheart's Beautiful Heart", "", "minecraft:beetroot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Potion of Mending", "A dirty-yellow colored liquid inside a large\nbottle, labeled \"Lesser Potion of Mending.\nWhen opened, you'd be greeted with a foul\nsmell, much resembling a rotted corpse. Upon\ndrinking, the potion will get rid of\nheadaches, bad stomachaches, and cure mild\nillnesses. The liquid heals surfaces with\nmuch more speed when spread upon bruises,\ncuts, and other minor abrasions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious metal slab", "Arcane I\nA blank of msterious metal, it seems to be\nglowing with purple carvings. A single button\nrests in the middle of the slab.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:daylight_detector", ""),
        StaticItem("Peridot Bracelet", "A simple little bracelet, embezzled with a\nstriking array of peridots, waving and each\nof different sheen, like the aurora borealis.\nEngraved on the inner portion, which is\nchiefly silver, is a little heart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ahryn Skelt.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("A Lightweight Walking Cane", "A lightweight walking cane that can be\nextended or shortened by twisting the head.\nThe head is steel, shaped into a tree, where\na diamond lay at the heart. Perfect for\nshowing others that you're just too good for\nthem.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cargo Stick", "A beautifully crafted stick forged by Cargo's\nLackies. It's great for beating snow elves!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [PurpleScarf] Cargo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("In-Bread", "For those who mix weird stuff in their dough.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Loksu \\\"Fluffy\\\" Silvervein.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Lapis Lazuli Ring", "A small ring intended for engagement. The\nring itself would be composed of gold and\nwith iron engravements along it. Atop the\nring would be a small lapis crystal intended\nto look like Thanhium. Finally, engraved into\nthe gem is Garoll's emblem.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thanhium.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pile of Turd <3 Bubba", "Bubba give gift", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Cut Out Puzzle #2 [Collectors Edition]", "The second of two puzzles. This one was a\ncollectors edition meaning it had been\npainted a faint color of gold around the\nedges to form an intricate design when the\nentire puzzle was complete. This puzzle was\naround 140 pieces and was considered a\n‘Medium’ difficulty puzzle. On the back was a\nsheet of paper that instructed the\nconstruction of the thick material to create\nwhat could come to be a mongoose if correctly\nmade. [ZachsSlayer]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Venomous Spider Sac", "Small sacks containing the venom that were\ncollected from fairly large spiders. It's\npotency is also supported by the offspring of\nthe Axios Broodmother.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lutauman.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Numbing Poultice", "A gray poultice contained within a glass jar.\nIt would smell earthly, made from river clay\nand a variety of herbs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Crayola Box", "The Ultimate Crayola Box, 200 crayons.\nSomeone must really like you. :>", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wisp Head", "It would appear to be the head of a dead\nwispal rabbit. These beings are forged of Yeu\nRthulu's magic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Disguised] Ascanius.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar", "OH, HONEY HONEY", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Rum o' Bogrin", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarf Strong Ale", "The strongest dwarven ale in Kaz'Ulrah!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Mending Potion", "Half a cup of blue, thick liquid, with a hint\nof yellow. Smells of water, and dirt. Its\ncapable of healing minor wounds, and\nillnesses.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Warm Milk", "A large mug of milk which had been heated\ncarefully to the point of steaming. A creamy\naroma comes from the mug, with a slight kick\nfrom the nytmeg added. If one were to drink\nsuch a beverage, they'd be left with a\nmustache of froth!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chef891.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("~~[**Ice Blade:A Dhìon**]~~", "In your hand is a runed hilt of intricate\ndesign, inlaid with various blue gems, though\nthey are mere accents. If one knew how to\nactivate it, within two emotes a blade of\ndark blue energy would form, equal to the\nlength of a longsword. It’s impact would be\nequivalent to that of an iron blade, though\nthe hilt is still marginally lighter. While\none could tell it was enchanted, the source\nof power is unclear. ((PM Aviers for more\ninfo))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aviers.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Training Longsword", "A 4 Foot long Long sword with a wide\nhilt-guard. Obviously meant for someone less\nused to the normal Longsword shape.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nafari.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear's Bane", "An ironic name for this blade, for it's\nowner, the tracker was slain by a Bear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kayen's Sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Barbed Hunting Dagger", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by jdesarno.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Staff of the Addled", "An intricate stave rests in your hand. Atop\nthe ornate head is a molten green cystal.\nAslong as you hold it you feel your grip on\nreality slipping, your senses numbing, as you\ndrift into a drinkless stupour. It's almost\nlike you're getting stupider!\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Wyvern Egg", "A small head sized wyvern egg frozen solid.\nThis egg is unlikely to hold any living\norganism within but who knows? The egg would\nbe a blue green color and covered with sharp\nscales.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:prismarine", ""),
        StaticItem("Woolen Children's Clothes", "A light brown, linen set of clothes, small\nenough to be comfortable for a child. It\nlooks to have been hand-stitched, and is\nlined on the inside with a little wool. The\nskirt is long, and bears a carefully crafted\ndark green weave depicting vines trailing to\nthe floor. On each side of it is a pocket.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Sillumiran Action Figure", "A regal high elven figure in fine armor. They\nhold a mace in their molded hand, as well as\na shield.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Woolen Coat", "A simple, black coat. Fastened with a row of\ncarved buttons, and with a row of pockets,\noutside and in. It is woven of linens, and as\nsuch is light enough to be worn in the heat,\nand to billow in the wind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("DPM's Table", "", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pair Of Crutches", "A solid pair of crutches made out of oak.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Hiya Sakura", "You may notice that your item is no longer in\nthe Auction house. I got a complaint form\nsomeone whom said the item was lorebreaking,\nand after some research it was. The head\nwould have dissapeared, but i would feel too\nbad if i simply took it and trash it, so i\ngave it back. Your dear friend, Tide, (pls\ndont hate me <3)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TideVermin.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurora's Drawing", "A child's drawing, done in crayon and chiefly\nin the colors Yellow, Blue, and Purple. The\nscene is quite detailed actually, it seems\nAurora is becoming quite the artist! It\ndepicts herself, Ahryn, and Eurielle all sat\non the edge of a lake, Aurora has a little\nfishing pole with a tiny fishy on the end,\nAhryn is soaked, and there's a note saying he\nfell in, and Eurielle is laughing. It's not\nclear if she's laughing with Aurora's success\nor Ahryn's falling. Aurora signed her name!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aurora Skelt.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Embroidered Damask Patch", "A one foot long square of embroidered blue\nlinen, this patch of cloth has had a great\ndeal of effort put into it, embroidered with\nthe designs of gold filigrees.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A crate of Sweetberry Ale", "has a nice berry taste that would seem to get\nye buzzed almost with each sip\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Salty Ale", "A large flask of salted ale. The taste of\nhoney and sugar flows over the tongue in a\npleasant rush, though the aftertaste is quite\nsalty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Concoction", "(Rare) A bottle of liquid recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The liquid inside\nshifts between a red and yellowish hue, and\nif smelled would fill the senses with the\nsmell of sweet strawberries.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fennic Tea", "The Specialty Tea of the South, known as\nFennic Tea, is one that is both Balanced, and\nCold enough to let off Smoke. The Fennic Tea\nis infused with Peppermint, Lemon Balm,\nLicorice Root, and Blue Pea Flowers to give\nit the Signature Taste, Look, and Feel those\nhave come to Love. The Tea is both Sweet and\nMinty, leaving anyone Drinking it Refreshed.\nCovering the top of the Tea would be a layer\nof Shredded Ice, adding to its Signature\nCold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fennic Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Broom", "An elegant broom of black stained wood\nand straw, pearl-coloured rings circling\nthe handle; bound by a golden ring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Splint", "A length of smooth oak plank with a length of\ncloth padding attached, a series of ropes\nwould be tied about it clearly ment to secure\nthe damaged limb.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Deluxe Schreck'Lak Action Figure", "This figure, unlike its peers, seems to have\nbeen crafted with utter care. Its glory has\nno rival.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Readicti.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Simochii's Soul", "Here lays Simochii's soul, it swirls with a\ndarkness. If one looks deep into it one can\nsee inner loathing and suffering.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Sling", "(Common) A simple sling recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. There does not appear to\nbe anything special about the sling, acting\nonly to fling rocks or missles at enemies.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Valencia's Blessing", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Power Armor Helmet", "A prototype helmet for a set of Power-Armor,\nbut it actually just looks like a bucket with\nfireworks tied to the sides\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Majestic Armor", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Thick Woolen Overcoat", "A thick coat woven from highland wool.\nTailored to the measurements of a large man.\nThe Coat would be dyed a dark gray, clearly\npainstaking crafted by hand. Large pockets\nwould be available at the waist and upon the\nbreast. The buttons would be carved of wood\nand attached with hardy thread.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire and Diamond halo ring", "An elegant halo-style ring featuring a large\nsapphire surrounded by smaller diamonds. The\nband would be silver, with gems encrusted\nalong the outer side, tapering from the\nstunning marquise-cut sapphire gleaming in\nthe middle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Mounted Direwolf Head on Plaque", "The mounted remains of a slain direwolf from\nthe Mixed Knolls. While intact, a shallow\ngash from what one would probably assume to\nbe a hunting knife is along the left side of\nthe beast's snout. Even in death, the hellish\nvisage of the Direwolf would make even the\nbravest of men tense up.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Commodus de Jedih.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Marriage bread", "This bread is the symbol of the holy\nmatrimony of the Bread Vendor and the Bread\nvendor-ess\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Holmiote Kush", "An especially 'dank' strain of cactus green\nknown for its sedative effects. Purple\ntrichomes line these potent, luscious nugs,\nwhich smell wonderfully DANK\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PizzeriaDjango.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Hoe", "", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand-Made Snaga Collar", "The collar would be fashioned crudle from\nwhat seemed to be the pelt of a white-fured\nwolf. The skin was cured loosely but not very\nwell while a clasp would be forged on either\nend of the strap out of iron while being very\ncrude.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Smoking Pipe", "A simple pipe carved from oak wood. An item\nowned by most every man, noble or simple,\nuseful for long evenings relaxing by the\nfireside, or breaks in the day taking in the\ncountry air. It shows very little sign of\nwear or damage, and has a year burned onto\nthe side of its bowl - 1646.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Engraved Birth Stones", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Rapier of Roke", "A finely polished rapier, it looks as if it\nis very well looked after. The pommel of the\nblade is shaped like an Owl.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Stolt Standard Vol. I", "The finest newspaper in all of Atlas, and the\nofficial press of Fenn! In this issue, we\nwill bring you your Stolt favorites such as a\nLymeric for the Children, The Daily Dundric,\nBlatant bamboozles, and Cactus Corner. This\nvolume also includes news of the growing\ntensions between the almighty Fenn and the\n“nation” they call the Dominion.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or refined iron ingot", "Unearthed from the mine of Okarn’thilln. The\nhigh quality iron in the mountain under\nOkarn’thilln may have its origin in the\nnatural rivers of pure mana running through\nit. Tools made of this ingot would have a\nsoft glimmer coming off from it.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Ebony Flute", "A masterfully crafted ebony flute, the\nembodiment of a perfect wooden instrument.\nThe body has carvings of flower vines and\nsome ornate naturesque details. When played,\nit releases a beautiful sound, pleasing the\nsurrounding audience.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Belladonna Graves.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Zekul Claw", "The right claw of a slain Zekul, its seems to\nresemble that of a polar bears claw. The claw\nis much darker than that of a normal polar\nbear and seems to almost be smoking.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashrock", "A small palm-sized chunk of condensed\nvolcanic ash. Unlike wood ash it seems to\nhave pieces of jagged rock, glass, and other\nminute mineral littering the sides of the\ndark grey sample.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Hans Adrian Bell", "Hans Adrian Bell lays in white blankets and a\nfur pelt. He has dark auburn hair and olive\nskin and his bright emerald eyes are staring\nat you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Marshmallow", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Brown Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Smelly Turd", "A stinky, meldable piece of shit! Little bits\nof green and orange stick out, presumably\npart of a once-delicious salad! Use it as you\nwill, but beware of the smell..", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("~Purple Tree Seeds~", "~Seeds collected from the fruits , of the\npurple trees (Contact Hazeorbs and Wrynn if\nplanting ,collected by madyead and\nPunisher8817)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Lark Appreciation Ring", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by GandalfDahWhite.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Derrick's Crossbow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Sketch", "A finely drawn sketch of the\nCaerme'onn-Lorenthus wedding in the Vizmak\nKeep. Everyone is drawn gazing joyously at\nthe couple by the fire, great detail afforded\nthat one could pick out each person within\nthe sketch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aphrodisiac", "A dark silver liquid that sits in a cold\nchalice. The liquid is said to have been\nprocured from the unicorn phallas and encites\narousal in both male and female humans.\nDoesn't work on Orcs or Dwarves, varying\nresults on Elves.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Trapper's Kit", "A heavy rawhide satchel, inside contained an\narray of specific tools and scraps that'd be\na mystery to a layman. To one versed in\ntrapping, however, it holds everything needed\nto arm and disarm an array of traps meant for\ncatching fur, or perhaps men. With everything\nfrom stakes to spades, it easily covers\nsimple and mundane traps- However it begins\nto fall short when faced with complex\nengineering, or magic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Cup", "A flaks made complete out of steel, the whole\nthing seeming be plan except there be etching\ngoing around it showing an image of a\nmushroom and something like that of some kind\nof liquid pooring inside the mushroom. On top\nthis etching of the letters B.S. If one would\nopen and sniff it they'd be hit with hell of\na strong smell of pure alcohol one that'd\nknock most off there rear on drinking [Pm\ndark_elf01 if one would drink from this]", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Josef's Arrow", "An arrow used for hunting, it's a bit smaller\nthan most as if it were fletched by a\nteenager's hands.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Ash", "A small pouch of volcanic ash from the\nBurztorgo Firelands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Winged Screamer Beak", "This is the beak of a large winged screamer.\nThe material is tough and has the ability to\nslice into steel. Truly a make of a\naccomplished hunting party.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 4, column 9)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 4, column 8)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 4, column 7)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 4, column 6)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Delicious, Tasty Cheese", "The best cheese, made from the best dairy. It\nis soft and has a distinct taste of cheesy\ngoodness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:sponge", ""),
        StaticItem("Offical Document of House Willow", "*This Document states that Lily of House\nMournstone is Regent of House Willow intill\ndeath. This entitles' that Lily of House\nMournstone is a Lady of House Willow and will\nadminister House willow if the current leader\nis a minor or is absent\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jualia Willow.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sizeable Coin Purse", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Andil's Cut", "A Simple human made iron sword retreived by\nAndil Frostbeard for his Frostbeard trials.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Arrow", "An arrow engraved with a runic text all the\nway down its shaft, its head was a serrated\nmetal.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Legion Donation Pendant", "A golden pendant given in reward for donating\nto Legio I Ioannes.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Writ of Permission", "A writ of permission penned by Adrian\nSarkozy, granting Ser Berengar Helvets all\nthe resources and men required to fulfill the\ntask of routing the spiders from the home of\nthe Frostbeards in the name of the King.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrumallium family sword", "A well maintained broadsword with a Wolf head\npummel\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by shade1121.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Holy Lorraine Cross", "A golden holy Lorraine cross, blessed by the\nVicar of GOD in the virtues of the Saints.\nThe cross is magnificently detailed and\nshines bright in the light of the sun. The\nbeholder's faith becomes the center of\nattention when worn.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Halflin' Moonshine", "A bottle of cheeky \"halflin' moonshine\",\nlaced with something unnoticeable to the\nnormal eye! ((PM DoctorGoosey for effects))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana-blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Trapdoor", "A wooden sieve... made purely of wood... does\nit even works? According to a specific\nfarfolk trader, it has elven origens, hence\nwhy it's wooden.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Legitimate Trader Jihadi John.", "minecraft:trapdoor", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Fang Blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blade of Berserk", "A Well made blade forged in Marna retrieved\nby Hieracon Frostbeard, Second Berserker of\nthe clan Frostbeard during atlas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hot_Dip.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer of Gods", "", "minecraft:wooden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("♀♂The Blade of the Lady-Boy♀♂", "This blade can only be wielded a powerful\ntransgender", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred Seeds", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Dire Wolf's Claw", "(Common) A claw recovered from a wolf in a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The claw is\nnothing out of the ordinary, once belonging\nto a dire wolf whose master served the Maiden\nof Fertility.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Average Dwarven nail", "An average dwarven nail forged by Dwifar\nGoldhand in the Forges of Kaz'Ulrah, it is\nslightly crooked though expected from rookie\ncraftmanship\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Father] Dwifar Goldhand.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Pal-Cola", "A tasty treat, and the world's first sodapop!\nHQ located on Melon St., Dunshire.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwedmar Iron Ring", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Split Skull of the Goliath", "A massive skull made of stone that has been\nsplit in half with a massive crack, if put\nback together the cracks line up perfectly\ninto a heavy stone skull.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dungrimm's Mark", "A metal rod forged from Dwarven steel,\noutlined with high quality dwarven gold. The\nend of the rod would be a metal block with\nletters ingraved at the end, reading\nVanguard in Dwarf\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Father] Grand Marshal Hamnil Frostbeard.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Embedded Necklace", "A simple, golden pendant with various glowing\nemeralds embedded into such. Mental magic\nusers would however, find a very hard time in\npenetrating the wearers mind however! (T5\nMental ward). The initials A.E are carved in\nthe central bits back side.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anordal Elverhilin.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Severed Head of King Verthaik", "The gored head of the rebel Dwarven king,\ngrime and filth from battle still upon the\nflesh and hair.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Talisman", "(Common) A talisman retrieved from a cultist\nof Vilketa, it seems to be broken beyond\nrepair. Its sphere like shape is primarily\nmade of gold, with the edges lined with\nsilver. There are no peculier designs on it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf Skin", "A folded skin of a direwolf.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Earings", "(Rare) A pair of earings recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. The stud earings have a\nred ruby implanted into them, an intricate\ndesign of two wolves decorating the rim. The\nrubies would emit a faint light if engulfed\nin complete darkness.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A Diamond Shaped Crystal", "The Crystal would appear cracked at the top,\nhowever other then that it has perfect\nsymetry from all sides. When one would look\nat the crystal it'll act like you're viewing\na gallery of a thousand mirrors, light\nreflecting from each side in all directions.\nIt would appear to shine while within the\nsunlight.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Old dwarven coins", "These are some old dwarven coins with the\nstamp of the gold hands on one side and the\nscale of the goldhands on the other. Its\ndated but you can't make out what year.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Misty's painting of the Grove", "Apon this rather perfectly printed paper,\nwould be the grove and all of its wonderous\nfeatures. In the middle of the page would be\na huge tree with vines and flowers flowing\ndown from the brantches. To the lefts and\nscattered into the right would be more\nflowers of various diffrent colours. And\npainted rather well would be a duck in a\npond.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Gryphon's Talon", "The severed talon of a Gryphon - The tip of\nthe talon is razor sharp. A Gryhpon is a huge\ncat-like creature combined with an eagle.\nTruly it is a majestic creature\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Salier.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Spade Of Dundar!", "An enchanted shovel from the very old\nHalfling named Dundar. A massive Halfling,\nalmost as tall as a Bigg'un, Dundar was a\nbounder who protected the bounds of his\nvillage. Everytime you swing this shovel, it\nyells our 'Dundar!'.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Bone", "A large and thick bone, procured from a\nmountain giant.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Sword of gears", "The sword of gears this intricate blade is\nmade up of hundreds of gears with sharp edges\nit can fold in half and be stored away for\neasy use it seems to have been a weapon for\nsome unkown mechancial guard.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mace of the Iron Grasp", "A large spiked mace whose camelthorn shaft\nhas many tough thorns protruding from it. At\nthe bottom of the shaft, the thorns are sawed\noff and replaced with a comfortable leather\ngrip. the head of this masterfully crafted\ndwarvern weapon bears a spiked black ferrum\nmace-head coated with aurum. The weapon of a\nfierce warrior.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheTri.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Staff", "(Common) A staff recovered from a cultist of\nVilketa. The ebony colored staff is made of a\ndark wood, with one end hooked at a 90 degree\nangle. There does not appear to be anything\ninately magical about it, perhaps it was just\na walking stick?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blissfoil & Tippens salve", "A cyan hued salve made from Tippens root,\nBlissfoil and distilled water as a base. When\napplied to an open wound the salve would\nclutter up blood, effectively stopping most\nbleeding whilst the affected area numbs down,\nrelieving the receiver of pain for one to two\nhours. [PM dkink14 for more info.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Commander's Boots", "(Rare) A pair of Iron boots recovered from a\nCultist Commander. The boots themself are\nmodeled on standard steel toed hiking boots,\nbut these have small spikes lining both the\nheel and sole.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Scuffed Map", "(Common) A map recovered from a cultist of\nVilketa. While at one point this map may have\nlead somewhere, its picture is thoroughly\nmarked up and torn at.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Dishevelled Reichwald Zweihander", "A dishevelled zweihander seemingly stolen by\nthe wielder from the Reichwald Landsknechts -\ndenoted by the insignia that the handle bore\n- to do It's evil bidding. The blade is\nplagued by many chips and is beginning to\nrust in areas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by PoliceStateLoTC.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of new Beginnings", "A worn staff, it carries the words 'Arrr harr\nmattey!' on it, it has been through obvious\nabuse but was a very sturdy piece of wood to\nbegin. A staff that was used by Exavier in\nthe start of his adventure, one that holds\ngreat signifigance.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bongo Drum", "A small wooden drum with some sort of skin or\nhide over the top to hit and make music with.\nThe drum would have carvings all over the\nside that arn't from any specific language or\nreligion, just simply decoration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheTri.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("White Wash Tusk", "A Tusk from a white washed orc.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Johannesburg 25 Mina Tax Papers", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Thepyrodude.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Dire Wolf Tail", "(Rare) A Dire Wolf's tail recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa's layer. The tail was\nsevered from a dire wolf's rear and has been\ntied up with gauze and rope to cover the end.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Beard Ring of Kerwyr II", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sheriff's Badge", "The badge of the sheriff in Dunshire, the\nhighest law authority known to Halflings.\nCrafted 3rd, The Grand Harvest, 1666.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Misty's Drawing of Rosa", "Apon this samll tattered piece of paper would\nbe a small poorly drawn, what looked to be a\nlittle girl. She'd have black hair with small\ncircle for eyes, and she'd wear a small pink\ntriangle dress. Around the girl would be\nsmall folwers dotted in random places, this\nto would be poorly drawn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("xdxd   Avendal's Heart   xdxd", "A large, disembodied heart with dark,\npulsating veins. It looks as if it was\nsurgically removed from a corpse and cleaned.\nThere's just the small matter that it still\nseems to be beating.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:fire_charge", ""),
        StaticItem("Oathstone Fragment", "A bloodied, jagged shard of some kind of\ngolden gem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:stained_glass_pane", ""),
        StaticItem("Oathstone", "A golden, dodecahedron-shaped item that\nglimmers in the light. Tiny, intricate words\nare carved onto its surface in a cursive\nlanguage\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blood Blade", "A thousand folded blade forged by the Orcs of\nold. Its sheer size makes up for its quite\ndull blade, easily able to break the bones of\nany mortal enemy that the weilder comes\nacross.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LordOfTheCraft.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Soul Blade", "A thousand folded blade forged by the great\nelven smiths of old. This untarnishing blade\nholds a razor sharp edge that can easily\nslice through any mortal flesh.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LordOfTheCraft.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Invasion map", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("24.0625 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Branch", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeds of Gayness", "Seeds used by Sir Hemroid of Harryness to sow\nwhat are called....gays", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("White Fluffy Towel", "This towel is clean, without stain, and soft\nto the touch. Its ability to absorb moisture\nis amazing!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:wool", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_21(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("A Clean Change Of Clothes", "This is a clean set of soft cotton clothes.\nThere is a shirt, underwear, socks, and soft\ncotton pajama bottoms. They are pristine,\npressed, and folded expertly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A Wooden Pipe", "A long, delicate pipe carved from the wood of\nthe Blue Mahoe tree. It it carved inexpertly,\nbut well enough to resemble an actual pipe,\nand is fully functioning. It comes with a\nscraper made from the same wood, both with\nthe initials \"A.M.\" engraved on them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Target Shield", "A small, round shield forged entirely from\nsteel. Intended to be strapped to the forearm\nand used for parrying, not blocking.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dabrander.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Mahogany Kallimba", "Otherwise known as a Thumb Piano, This 17-Key\nKallimba would be Crafted out of Mohagany\nWood and Iron. Tuned to the Note of C, The\nKallimba would Soothe its listeners if played\ncorrectly. The Kallimba would be crafted into\nthe Shape of an Oval, its body Hollow to Emit\na Greater Sound.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Dedicant] The Kallimba Company.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Hoe", "A staff made from the wood of the september\nprince, this staff hoilds many powers. Eric\nwould be carved into the handle and aslong as\nsomoine holds it, the staff will glow a\nblueish tint.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("1.1515972552049631 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("2.3031945104099263 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Chalk Silver", "The silver of the Chalk Alps; A metal pale\nand cold, like the light of the moon. A soft,\nheavy material, silver is difficult to temper\nfor means of war, but is none-the-less used\nworld-wide in the craft of smiths and\njewelers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MaeceCetcher.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Frog", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Hankie", "", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Elemental Discharge", "The husk of a felled storm elemental.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Tinkerer Kalen's Crank", "What, did you expect\nFood or something? Do\nI look like a chef or something?", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Fruit Cake", "It is hard, decorative and most-likely unedible. Good paperweight though.\n*Moderator Approved*\nBrandNewKitten approved this item.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Rib", "A chipped brittle bone from the ribcage of a large draconic beast.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Siren's Skin", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll Bones", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Whale Bone", "Once part of a big, proud beast, this\nbleached bone has since been removed from its\noriginal position.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Darksalvo.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart Fragment", "The heart is still a little bit bloody, but\nit looks valuable enough for research!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Armor", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Axe", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ooze Flake", "A flake of pollution left behind by an Ooze\nwho has travelled over ground. It will\neventually grow into pollution itself.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Inner Ooze", "A solid form of ooze, gathered from the core\nof a large pollution slime.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:slime", ""),
        StaticItem("Yemekar", "", "minecraft:anvil", ""),
        StaticItem("Dungrimm", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Anbella", "", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Armakak", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Belka", "", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Ogradhad", "A set of books and quills for the avid writers!", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Grimdugan", "", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("meat?", "", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Quarter Portion", "", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Ooze", "A slimy substance obtained from a pollution\nslime. It's gooey substance is not a complete\nliquid, but smells something like sewage.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Atandt's Cigar", "A big old dwarven cigar. Hand crafted by\ncommunity service workers from Az'adar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Lord Protector] Atandt Irongrinder.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Grey Wool Scarf", "This dark grey scarf would be knitted with\nsome skill, using the pattern of star\nstitching. The colors would seem to alternate\nbetween hues of grey, making the scarf look\nalmost shimmering in almost every light. The\nwool itself used, would be soft and stretchy,\nwith a medium length so the wearer could wrap\nit around their neck. Overall, a well made\nand time consuming product.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DaHazelWazel.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwak", "Dwak is a legendary sword created by Clan\nIrongrinder in the greatest of dwarven\nforges. The sword has been blessed by the\nlate Hero of the Brathmordakin, High Prophet\nDarid Irongrinder. The sword has been passed\ndown through the late High Prophet's lineage.\nDwak has ended up with Atandt Irongrinder,\nson of Darid II Irongrinder, son of Darid\nIrongrinder, son of Samsung Irongrinder.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Atandt Irongrinder.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("arrest warrant", "You are under arrest for kitten killing", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Healing Water", "This bottle contains dark blue liquid. Will\nwork for little wounds, and will attenuate\nmost pains, but it isn't very useful to heal\nsevere injuries or restore broken parts.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth Scraps", "Bloodied scraps of cloth, belonging once to\nHeide - Ghost of Troutstadt. [PM IRINEJ TO\nINTERACT]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Airship Model", "A little model of a flying ship. A elipsoidic\nballoon attached to a wooden ship made for\nsailing. It has two turbines attached at the\nback of the ship that would make the airship\nfly forward. The balloon has an attachment to\nthe boat at some spot at some fire that will\nfulfill the balloon with hot air that will\nmake it float. The gravity would pull it back\ndown and the hot air will raise it up, and\nthat will controll its altitude by the amount\nof warm air provided in the balloon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vorgraven.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark-wood Steel Gladius", "A sharp double-edged steel gladius with a\ntapered point. The handle of the weapon is\nmade from Dark-ash wood, treated with boiled\nTung oil. The entire blade was only 30\ninches.The gladius' handle provided a solid\ngrip by a knobbed hilt with ridges for the\nfingers. Its crossguard was rhomboidal,\nconsisting of the steel tang and the Dark-ash\nwood handle. Branded upon the very pommel,\nwas the letter, Տ. This weapon weighs\napproximately 2 pounds.[[Ｔｈｉｓ ｗｅａｐｏｎ ｉｓ\nｐｕｒｐｏｓｅｄ ｆｏｒ ｈａｃｋｉｎｇ ａｎｄ ｓｌａｓｈｉｎｇ. Ａ ｇｌａｄｉｕｓ\nｃａｎ ｉｎｆｌｉｃｔ ｗｏｕｎｄｓ ｔｈａｔ ｍａｙ ｃａｕｓｅ ｌｉｍｂｓ ｔｏ ｂｅ\nｄｅｐａｒｔｅｄ ｆｒｏｍ ｔｈｅ ｂｏｄｙ.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mastersmith] Sali.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Axe of the Lighting Warden", "This is a wonderous axe made by the dwarves\nof kaz'ulrah embued with the rare power of\ndwarven runes when used by a dwarf it would\nstart to emite a chain of lighting around the\naxe blade and head and when used in combat\nwould send out a bolt of raw lighting [2-3\nuses] [Contact overlord8000]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kanadensare.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Sailor's Broad Cutlass", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("♛ Golden Sage's Kite Shied [T5] ♛", "Kite shield with the colours of the house de\nAlba, it would have a sharp edge on the upper\nside and an ideogram with the shape of a\nshield on the inner side, which would cause\nthe shield to ignite in golden soulfire if a\nbeing of corrupted nature enters in direct\ncontact with the shield. ((PM Suxals for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Nightfall", "An artfully crafted bastard sword rests\nbefire you, hilt wrapped in supple black\nleather, the pommel of the blade would be a\ndetailed rendering of a crow's head, eyes\ngleaming with inset rubies. Etched down the\nlength on either side of the blade would be a\ndetailed depiction of wings, as though the\nblade itself was in flight. Enchanted with\npowerful sorceries, when swung the blade\nwould seem to belt out a litany of curses as\nthough to harass its opponent. When a certain\nphrase is uttered the ruby eyes of the crow\nwould glow, crackling electricity building\nalong the blade. (3 emote build up Contact\nHurferDurfer for info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Razthrimmek", "A weapon invented by Balin Anvilaxe that\nwould be both ranged and melee, it is made\nout of a Sword and a Crossbow, one attached\nto each other, crossbow standing at the\nhandle of the sword. The crossbow would open\nand close its wooden extensions that are tied\nwith a string. Another string to the\nextensions through the main plank, a button\nwould be put near the trigger that opens and\ncloses the extentions of the crossbow. The\nsword has 2 buttons, an oppening one and a\nshooting one. While you hold the oppening\nbutton the crossbow would open its wooden\nextensions until the button is no longer\npressed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Balin Anvilaxe.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Beef Stroganoff", "This beef dish is made with cow heart and\nmade tender with the aid of the sauce. The\negg noodles cooked to perfection , chunks of\nmushroom and onion could be seen.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Taeyna's Homebrew Cider", "A golden in colour liquid rests inside a\nlilac tankard. With a single sniff one would\nbe able to pick out a confectionary scent,\nand upon taking a sip, you'd be overwhelmed\nwith both a sweet and sour taste! The drink\nitself is non-alcoholic, a perfect drink for\nany child (or adult) with a sweet tooth!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fennic Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Clue #1", "The spot where horses sleep but don’t run, is\nwhere you should start your fun.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Kinilerindi Device", "This device would be very confusing, probably\nbecause it wasn't a device at all and just a\nnormal diamond.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by premiumroleplay.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Croissant", "Crispy pastry heaven. This goodie was\nlovingly baked by a snelven cook with the\nutmost care taken to ensure the taste is\nnothing short of divine.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Long Dagger", "A simple 6\" dagger wrought from steel.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Guan Dao", "Weapon of Rhaegar Highstrider. He stumbled\nupon a mysterious cave one day, and found it\nlaying there. He has felt strangely attached\nsince", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("English Longbow", "A skillfully crafted long bow, measuring in\nat 6ft (1.8m) in length with a draw force of\nbetween 90 and 110 pounds. The bowstave\nitself was made of elm wood, surprisingly\nstrong and durable. Upon the limbs of the bow\nwere depictions of a house sigil, along with\nthe names of family members, some seemed to\nhave been scratched out over time though. The\ngrip was a coloured leather, green and\norange, possibly to represent a certain noble\nhouse. The string was made of hemp, attached\nto the limbs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ailsa Gromach.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiked Gauntlets", "A set of masterfully crafted steel gauntlets\nof dwarvern make bearing a lion with a parted\nmaw engraved on their underside. On the\nback-side their are multiple spikes comprised\nof an aurum and steel alloy. Inside the\ngauntlets are a layer of boiled leather to\nkeep one's hand comfortable!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheTri.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Dagor's Rock", "This rock seems to be LIT with something\ncalled \"meams\"! Several words are imprinted\non the artifact, including \"support him for\nskygod\" and \"incest\". Should you come into\ncontact with it, the \"meams\" overpower you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Undescript Meat", "Is it cow? Is it horse? Nobody knows, just\neat it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by premiumroleplay.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Softening Skin Lotion", "This beautiful iron urn is decorated with\ncarvings of rivers from the top - Streaming\ndownwards as they blossom with flowers. When\nopen - One would be greeted by a\nLavender-Scented salve - Light yellow in\ncolor. It is composed of a base of beeswax\nand Almond Oil, with Aloe Vera Gel, Comfrey\nand Witch Hazel extract - Along with Neem oil\nand fresh Lavender. It smoothly applies onto\nskin and when applied - It would soften the\nskin and bring the skin radiance and a glow\nwith prolonged use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Oakson.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Diadem of the Debutante", "Given to the best dressed female at the\nWinter’s Ball, this tiara displays fine\nFennic craftsmanship. The piece is made from\ngold, with swirling designs forming a\nsnowflake in the centre. Within the\nsnowflake, a brilliant cut emerald sits,\nwhich catches the light with ease. This piece\nis sure to compliment the elegance of any\nwoman.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aeldrin.", "minecraft:emerald_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Nor'sair", "", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bilokonn'sair", "", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Narn'sair'magara", "", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Lom'sair'ame", "", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Shackles", "Strong aurum shackles mean't to constrict\nliving beings and impair their movement.\nBlack ferrum is banded into some parts of the\nshackles, expertly woven by a master\nNorlandic blacksmith.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleshy Blade", "A blade made of flesh, the flesh of\nKarvos'sol Drakon. It would look as if the\nsword was made from that man. His exact eyes\nwould lay on the center-crossguard, blinking\nand gazing around mindless. His lips would\nlay on the crossguard itself. It would be as\nif Karvos'sol was made into a sword.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fennic Sandwich", "Crafted by the chefs of Fenn, the Fennic\nSandwich would be one popular in their\ntaverns and homes. The sandwich would consist\nof mutton, cheese, lettuce, and a secret\nsauce, giving the simple dish a nice taste.\nThe sandwich would be made with ingredients\nabundant in their snowy lands, capitalizing\non not putting their resources to waste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Fennic Bakery.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Seasoned Pork Chops", "Seasoned in thyme, oregano, rosemary, and\ngarlic, these Pork Chops would be cooked to\nperfection. Topping off the fine meat would\nbe a dollop of of garlic butter, adding to\nits wonderful taste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Fennic Bakery.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Clue #6", "If a prize you seek, \"Velulaei\" is the code\nword to declare - thus ends this hunt, return\nto the square!", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Suggestion: Do more Stolt Standards!!!!!!!!", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Clue #5", "Where Snow Elves bold are laid to rest, is\nwhere you shall finish this jubilous quest.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Blue Knitted Blanket!", "A rather large blue woollen blanket\n(6ftx6ft). Whilst not perfect, the maker had\nput in plenty of effort to ensure it looked\ndecent. A basic snowflake design was set in\nthe centre with white wool. This soft piece\nwas ideal for anyone who needed some extra\nwarmth in their life. At the bottom was a\nsmall cloth tag, with a written message:\nBaby Tundrak, may you be raised to be\nstrong, kind, and most importantly loved.\nLove Kat\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Jaded] Katrina Atmorice.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist's Robes", "The Robes in which the Undead Cult of Fenn\nhave been known to wear During Their Attacks.\nThe Robes would be of a Rough Black Material,\nCovered in Gold Plating.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Flesh of The Living Cave", "A Chunk of Flesh, Removed from a Once Lively\nUndead Cave. The Flesh would seem to be\nOtherwordly, Being made of a Rather Hard Red\nSubstance.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Freezing Embrace", "A finely made shortsword, imbued with magical\nproperties. Upon the pommel, there was a\nsizeable sapphire, which, if tapped, would\ncause the blade to summon a ball of water,\nwhich soon would be shot out. Once it hit\nsomething, the water would freeze up\nentirely. (PM FlemishSupremacy for details.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Smithing.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Merialeth's Beauty", "A finely made engagement ring. It has a\nbeautifully engraved golden band, showing\nelven designs. In the center, a finely\npolished diamond would rest. If light would\nfall upon this diamond, it would reflect the\nlight in a beautifully sparkling manner. On\nthe inside, a small text was engraved,\nreading. \"For my one and only love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Smithing.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Undead Tentacle", "A Chunk of A Giant Undead Tentacle, Covered\nin that of Burnt Flesh, and A Strange Red\nOoze.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fennic Cinnamon-Chocolate Fudge", "A chocolate fuge with a white sugar topping\nto look like the mountainy landscape around\nFenn. The chocolate would start out with a\nwarm note before tailing off to a salty yet\nrich sweetness\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the Kha'Tigrasi,\n- Tepah", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Wyvern", "A sturdy chest piece made of high carbon\nsteel, fashioned with intricate inlays which\nall direct towards the central figure: A\nmighty wyvern with ruby inlayed eyes, the\nchest piece would have slight corregation to\ngive it even strong durability than normal\nplate armour, and a light padding in certain\nareas on the underneath to allow for an even\ncomfier placement while not being\nover-encumbering.", "minecraft:diamond_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Hot Cocoa", "Made within the Southern lands of Fenn, Hot\nCocoa is a Staple for any visitors to the\nRegion. The Sweet Taste of Cocoa combined\nwith a hint of Salt would be a Taste both\nSimplistic, but Enjoyable. Topping the\nClassic Drink would be a Sweet Whipped Cream,\nand 2 Cinnamon Sticks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fennic Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Burning Beverage Slayer", "A normal looking blade with an unusual\nhandle. The hilt would have a trigger and a\nbutton. The button would open a small slide\non the hilt letting alchohol cover the blade\nwhen held upside down. The trigger would\nignite a spark. You get the idea\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A pretty Amazing Gold Block!", "It's not amazing amazing, but, it's pretty\namazing.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Dimaethor Visagj Beating stick", "A stick useful for beating those intended.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Frederick Bobbs.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Runed Fragment", "The second of the Runed fragments found, the\nwielder of this would find a more complete\nfeeling as they bore two of the fragments of\nwhatever strange device they belong to. It\nseems as though a single fragment remains to\nbe found.. What will these items create when\nput together...?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nate1540.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyan Ocarina", "A cyan ocarina made from clay. It is well\nmade, and the clay has a glossy finish,\nmaking it a tad shiny. It has 8 holes along\nthe body, and one more at the end of a\nprotrusion, clearly for the mouth. Initially\nforeign, with a little practice this ocarina\nwould become a breeze to play.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Cosmic's Pokeball!", "You have been caught by CosmicWhaleShark!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ash Ketchum.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Seed", "The seeds of death that will be sowed upon\nCountessem should she not go to bed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Antler Necklace", "A well made ornate necklace, made by Nyx\nAtmorice. While simply a child while making\nthis, the design proves it took a while to\ncreate.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Nyx Atmorice.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Trained Messenger Raven", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elaborate Walking Stick", "The walking stick appears to be simple\nenough. It’s body is made of some sort of\nblack wood, with its tip covered in a white\nmetal. The head takes the shape of a\nwell-polished, metal crow, sparkling blue\ngems inlaid in its eyes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aviers.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Polar Bear Flesh", "A Delicacy of the South, Polar Bear Flesh\nwould be a Fatty Meat with plenty of Flavor.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Jarin Caen", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of PrinceH_626", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Helenya Caen", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mutton Chops", "Finely cooked Mutton Chops, fresh off of the\nfurnace. The Mutton would be seasoned with\nthyme, pepper, ginger, garlic, and salt,\nbalanced enough to bring out each individual\ntaste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Fennic Bakery.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Hamburger [1.8]", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Toy Dwedish Soldier", "A wooden soldier with articulated joints, the\nwork of a famed company of Dwarven toymakers.\nHis stern emerald eyes gaze out above a\npainted auburn beard, armour carved to\nresemble that of a Grand Legionnaire. The\nbottoms of his his sturdily-booted feet are\ncarved with inert Dwarven runes, set in a\nsemicircle about the heel. \"Narvak Urguan,\nthey read, \"Narvak Tumunzahar.\" Below these\nphrases, a maker's mark of the Emberhorn Clan\nis evinced.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Fid_.", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Flawless Emerald", "A flawless emerald cut by dwed jewelsmiths in\nthe forges of Kal'Tarak. It dazzles you with\nits beautiful allure.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Deployable Lightning Rod", "A tall metal bar with a collapsible set of\nlegs on the bottom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Portrait of Elluin Drakon", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Bell", "", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Commendation of the High Chancellor", "This highly polished gemstone would be\nengraved with the markings of the the Tundrak\nFamily, beside that of the Mali'fenn. Beneath\nthe two engravings would be the mark of the\nOffice of the High Chancellor. The item, if\nflipped would read as follows. \"To whom it\nmay concern, the bearer of this mark is\nhereby accredited a commendation of service\nto the Mali'Fenn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by premiumroleplay.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Doctorate of Law", "The document bears the seal of the City of\nBelvitz\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RedfaceKilla.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Roasted Coffee Beans", "A small cloth bag full of oven-roasted coffee\nbeans from the Sutican Café. Now you can make\nyour own coffee at home!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Silveress.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Space cake", "A chocolate cake infused with halfling grass\nbutter. It would make the eater relaxed,\nhappy. Eat too much and experience a fun\ntrip.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Fried Pork Strip", "Strips of pork neatly sliced and battered in\na light coating of bread crumbs before being\nsizzled in egg yolk on an iron pan over a\ncharcoal fire. The strip would be decently\ngreasy, but extremely delicious. Azza's\nSpecialty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Azza.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Amara Tathvir", "An ancient skull, bits of decrepid flesh\nstill hanging off of the bone.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("OoO Reckoning Ooo", "A finely made double edged sabre made from\nancient Doomforge clan metal, making the\nblade black while the hilt is silver and the\nhandle is crimson. Upon the blade are\nflame-like etchings that are tribalistic and\nbear a gleaming silver-crimson clerical light\nwithin. The light, you notice, radiates a\npowerful aura and the very blade itself seems\nto deeply hum a soft melody. Upon one side of\nthe blade is a long line of words that read:\nlux, veritas, virtus'.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Icebreaker", "Icebreaker is an uncommonly well-designed\nelven broadsword. Encouraging words are\ninscribed into the fuller in ancient elvish\ntongue. Upon equipping the weapon one might\nfeel more courageous both in battle and\nspeech.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Bravado.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dual Dark Fennic Blades", "Two Dark Blades held by a Dark Stalker in\nFennic Armor. The Blades would be Basic\nFerrum, but would be Dyed Black in unknown\nways.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Chipped Nameplate", "A Chipped Nameplate from something that seems\nlike a Tombstone, or Crypt.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Widower's Amulet", "A silver, heart-shaped locket held aloft by a\nshort interwoven chain. Moonlight seems to\ncatch and shiver upon its soft visage, which\nneeds never be polished and always maintains\na perfect sheen.Within can be seen an image\nof one most familiar, though whom is now no\nlonger amongst the living.An etching can be\nseen along the rim. It reads, “Death leaves a\nheartache no one can heal, love leaves a\nmemory no one can steal.”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("Chilled Bone", "These bones, appearing to have come from a\nrib cage, or perhaps a femur, are tinted a\nlight, chilly blue. Should one touch them\nwith their bare hands, the bone would be ice\ncold to the touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Mounted Polar Bear Head", "The Trophy head of a Polar Bear. The Head\nwould be attached to a Spruce Frame, a\nPerfect Piece for any Wall.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Black Mist", "Black mist swirls around this translucent\nbottle. If opened or smashed, a cloud of\nstinky black gas would linger for a period of\nten minutes, its stench utterly terrible for\nthe nostrils to bear. Vomiting may ensue.\n[[PM Aeldrin for details.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aeldrin.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("The Head of Katrina's Otter, Zip", "It's the head. Of a dead otter. What did you\nexpect? Why did you buy this?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aeldrin.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Waist Lantern", "A small ferrum lantern with glass panels that\nis made specifically for being worn around\nthe waist. The lantern can be lit, allowing\nlight to surround the area around the wearer.\nIt uses oil to keep the fire burning.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Rainbow Pearl", "One of Hestal's prized treasures. Though now the Grove\nis only home to smaller clams, it seems there used to be a\nlarger, ancient one to watch over them. Sadly he fell victim\nto Hestal, who took the clam's pearl as his prize. Glittering\nand reflective, in the right light the pearl reveals\nall the colors of the rainbow\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.\n[[Do Not Place]]", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Morph Shard", "The shards are cold to the touch, seeming\ndormant, yet they still give off a blue glow.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Blago.", "minecraft:ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Elf Hat!", "It's quite small...\nBut magical for sure!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Butter Shoes!", "Slip 'n' Slide...\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Nightsap Syringe", "A glass syringe full of Nightsap, an\nincrediblu addictive and powerful sedative.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Red Echidna", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by _SteelMemes_.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Thruma'je mattur (heavy warhammer)", "This is a gorundyr styled warhammer. This\nmassive head is made of Jorgundic Black\nmetal, Many runes are carved into the metal\nand a thunder bolt is carved into the side\nwhile a turtle is carved into the other.\nHattadr\" is carved into the top of the\nhammer head aswell. The long handle is made\nof ash wood while the grip is wrapped with a\ndark brown stainned leather, Various feathers\nhang from the butt of the handle giving a\ngorundyr feel. This massive two handed war\nhammer was masterfully made.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Butter", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidsgiving Cornucopia", "The horn-shaped cornucopia was quite light\ndespite the many delights resting within.\nCarefully woven from dried plant fibers, the\ntraditional container was decorated in an\nassortment of autumn leaves with a treated\nleather strap allowing it to be carried. It\nexuded the scent of a druid. Laying within\nwas an ever-refilling variety of delicious\nnuts, fruits, and vegetables to appease even\nthe fattest dwarf in the realm.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven herbs", "A set of herbs, enhanced by a druid's magic.\nThese leaves are SAID to be able to heal\nblight, and bring forth nature, should it be\ndone correctly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Katrina's Pumpkin Pie", "A still steaming pie. It had been simply yet\nsweetly decorated, with fork marks pressed\nalong the circular edge. A sweet aroma with\njust a hint of spice would make it hard for\none's mouth not to water. Upon eating this\ndelicious treat, the pastr\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by premiumroleplay.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Indigo Ocarina", "An ancient wind musical instrument, a type of\nvessle flute. it would have 6 finger holes\nwitch would each produce a unique sound. The\ninstrument would be made of the horn of a\nBoar, with an Unique shape. (Pm MayRndz for\nmore info!)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MayRndz.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Stefjan Figurine", "A carved wooden figurine that would appear to\nbe hand-painted, illustrating a young\nKovachev boy. He would be holding sword at\nthe ready.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Undead's Ooze", "The Dripping Ooze of an Undead Cave. The\nOoze, while not Having an Effect on\nDescendants, would give off a Faint Glow,\nSomewhat worrying to those carrying it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rare Silk", "This Silk is particularly unruly and\nresistant. Surprisingly, it is also soft and\nshiny. A really special fabric could be made\nfrom this. The result is a rare sight for\ntailors and fabric merchants of Atlas.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Fi'halen Mulled Wine", "\\\"To fend off the cold season, the High Elves\nof the Silver Enclave heat and serve a\nmixture of wine, a few swigs of rum and a\ncareful selection of spices. Cinnamon, nutmeg\nand star anise give the drink a truly unique\ntaste. To be heated up before serving, but\navoid boiling. [1694]\\\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aythyinae.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Paralysis Potion", "A peculiar blue substance would swirl about\nwithin the small vial. Upon drinking it, one\nwould slowly lose control of their voluntary\nbodily functions. Over a period of five\nminutes the drinker would eventually become\nparalyzed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ShameJax.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Intricate Candle Stands", "The Candle stand would have lacing underneath\nthe gold stem, the shaft reaching 3ft before\nreaching the plate attached upon the top,\ngold encasing the shaft, and silver encasing\nthe plate. Signs of the cross would be on all\nsides of the plate.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Gorundyr Steak Pudding", "This delicious, boiled, meat pie would be\ncovered in a golden wheat crust with suet\npellets mixed in. Inside would be thinly\nsliced, stacked, lean cuts of steak that was\nrubbed and seasoned with pepper, salt, thyme,\nseason-all, a pinch of mace, a sprinkle of\nnutmeg, a small spoon-full of brown sugar and\nhoney, and a dash of lemon juice. The round\npudding pie would've been boiled, in a cheese\ncloth, for about three or so hours, as the\nmeats within would have caused the excessive\ntime. The delectable blends of seasonings\nwould taste absolutely divine that\ncomplimented the wheaty flavour. What a meal!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Purity", "This bundle of flowers, all perfectly\narranged, would show for purity, loyalty,\ngood nature, and a welcoming air. Arum, white\ncarnations, dasies, white lilies, white\nlotus', mulleins, sweetbriers, and blue\nviolets would all be fanned out in a\nbeautiful bouquet while delicate baby's\nbreath were situated on the outside. The\nentirety of flowers were held together by a\ngorgeous, white, silk, cloth embroidered with\na golden inlay on the edges of it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:white_tulip", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Strength and Power", "This bundle of flowers, all perfectly\narranged, would show for strength, unity,\nroyalty, wealth, and all that would be\nperfect as a gift for someone emotionally\nhurt. Within the fanned out bouquet,\nAmeranths, Amaryllis', Bird's-foot trefoils,\nbuttercups, Daffodils, Fennels, Gladiolus',\nPeonys, yellow Poppys, and purple Tulips\nwould tangle with each other to create a\ngorgeous sight. On the outside, framing the\nplants, would be a few sprigs of wheat;\nalthough an odd sight, it it seemed to\nentertwin perfectly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:peony", ""),
        StaticItem("Hog Roast Meal", "Finely pulled pork lay on a plate accompanied\non a plate with a wide variety of vegetables\nbefore you. Drizzled in a scrumptous gravy,\nit is hard for one's mouth not to water at\nthe scent of such a fine creation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chef891.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Ancient Orcish Sword", "This item needs repair before it can have any\nuse. Contant Lionbileti when a proper forging\ntechnique is aquired.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Sword", "A glittering ornate sword made of gold and\njewels. Clearly not fit for any type of\ncombat, but it appears to be worth quite a\nbit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Spr0nk.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Medal of Long Service", "A medal handed out by Prince Sigirath\nTundrak, High Chancellor of Fenn, for long\nservice within Fenn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by premiumroleplay.", "minecraft:diamond_block", ""),
        StaticItem("A burnt fish", "", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Erika's Shin Bone", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Skull of Vesryn Annungilben", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Spruce Branch Bow", "A small branch bend and twined on it's two\nends with string. Un-refined in every sense,\nthe only part cleanly carved is the handle\nand where the arrow is placed\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Nyx Atmorice.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Tin Soldier", "A small toy of a Fennic soldier holding a\nspear and shield.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Victory Potatos", "Potatos to celebrate Fenn's victory over a\nmighty dragon\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Nyx Atmorice.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Rabbit", "A stuffed toy rabbit, extremely fluffy and\nsoft.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("A bone from the skeleton king", "A bone from the skeleton king himself, taken\nfrom the dismantled corpse once defeated. The\nbones themselves would hold a remembrance of\nthe lives lost this day and a piece to show\nthat the skeleton king cannot reform fully\nwithout them.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by IronLich.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Pendant", "A Strange Pendant worn by a Darkstalker in a\nFennic Uniform. The Pendant would seem to\nresemble the Fennic Banner, but with a large\nX through it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar Canes", "Sticks of Sugar, a tasty snack to chew on!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Warden/Steward] Aymer Yalathir.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Sailing Trophy", "A gold plated trophy awarded for prowess at\nsailing small boats on ice in a competition.", "minecraft:brewing_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Steak", "A sizzling grilled steak, cut from the flesh\nof a mighty minotaur.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Sexy Jazz Harmonica", "This Sexy Jazz Harmonica is the only of its\nkind, being able to seduce anyone that hears\nits tunes, while simultaneousely exposing\ntheir deepest thoughts through the smooth\njazz tunes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Arborist Tree Plushie", "An expertly sewn plushie, shaped in the form\nof an Oak Sapling. Who doesnt love Arborism?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Warden/Steward] Aymer Yalathir.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lusty Hou-zi Maid", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AwakenMyLove.\nSignature: Door", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Journal of Aesilnoth Annungilben", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Baltic Raspberry Mead", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Symbol", "A symbol dropped by the Ivae'fenn Dark\nStalker. The symbol would seem to be that of\nthe Fennic Banner, but with a large red X\ngoing through it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Knight's Letter", "A letter pulled off the body of a Strange\nKnight. The Letter would read, \"Scope out the\nfolks within Fenn. They believe themselves to\nbe soldiers, but show them what a real\nsoldier is made of\", The Note would be signed\nP.O.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart of the Soulless", "The Heart of The Living Cave, A Creature\nknown to have fought the People of Fenn. The\nHeart, dug out of its Remains, is a Glowing\nOrb, both a Combination of Flesh, and an\nUnknown Material. Would be Strangely Hot to\nthe Touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:magma", ""),
        StaticItem("Polar Bear Meat", "The Meat of a Polar Bear. It would be\nBloodied and Roughly Cut, done by someone\nvery quickly with a large blade.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrical Vigil Stun Baton", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Unknown.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("External Vodnik Parasite", "This Parasite seems to have bitten itself\nonto you, and is quite hard to remove... it\nacts similiar to a tick, with numerous\nspikes.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("penis", "", "minecraft:wooden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Widow's Scythe", "This an old farmer's 'Trusty wheat Scythe'.\nit seems to have been fixed up over and over\nand over again. The feel of the scythe would\nseem to be that of combat nowadays. As if the\ndays of chopping wheat have passed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Tha Man] Mystery Uialben.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Clue #4", "In splendid halls of elegance and grandeur, a\ngreat chair you will find should you endure.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ikurn Ring", "A simple iron ring ready to have a gem set in\nit and enchanted.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Foreign Obisdian", "This odd obsidian was pulled from the body of\nthe stone structure that arrived in Sutica.\nIt feels heavy and smooth with its matt like\ntexture, And it seems awfully sharp, More\nthan obsidian usually is.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Fist of GOD", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Katana", "The Engraving of Dragons are etched onto the\nhilt of the Katana, similarily its blade also\nhas extravagant designs of Dragons and\ninelligible words inscribed upon it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by neopsychedelia.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mood-Altering Magegold Ring", "A precious arcaurum band encrusted by many\nazure gemstones sparkling over its whole\nbeing. It shimmers now and then in a barely\nnoticable fashion, indicating its magical\nnature. To those that wear this, they would\nfind an overwhelming sense of calm wash over\nthem to quell a great many wraths. This\nillusory phantasm may last for up to an elven\nhour before being drained. It will then take\nan additional three elven hours before it\nrestores its power. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ward's Wondrous Wizardry.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Silver Lightstone Ring", "The ring was simple in make, a silver band\nwith an inlaid lightstone. On the inner\nportion of the band was a maker's mark, an\nS'V. The lightstone gleamed with a brilliant\nsilver glow while the band was covered in a\ncertain, unnatural sheen. Should one begin to\nrub at the stone in the center, it would\nbegin to gently calm the wearer down and\nbring with it a sense of warmth. Good for 1\nhour of continual use. (PM Soviet_Reindeer\nfor more info)", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gorkilgoth Moonshine", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Rose Staff of Arcanism", "A staff with a rose petal head, the metal\nfolded into fine petals at the end. Spiky,\nmetal vines descend down the shaft of the\nstaff, creating a spot for the user to hold\nit by. In the middle of the rose rests a\ndazzling ruby, and upon issuing a command to\nthe weapon, it will begin to form arcanist's\nwisps, to eventually create a laser beam.\n((PM __Elk__ for more information)).", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mae's Fancy Boots", "", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Test Bone", "This item is a test done on a bone.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of LeoWarrior14", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("[ Gilded Scimitar ]", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Rum", "This drink is dark brown, and has a\nvanilla-molasses taste to it, finishing with\na hint of smokeyness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Broken R arm/leg] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Raiding-Ladder", "A well crafted raiding-ladder.\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:ladder", ""),
        StaticItem("Orkish Staff", "The knarled oak is of orkish craft. Into its\nsides are many details: orks in battle, Old\nBlah, death; a fat toad rests upon the top\nwith beady eyes. It smells bad.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Bastard Sword", "This blade is blessed by a cleric in the\nAdherent Order, shown by some of the\nengravings on the pommel which seems to be of\nan eye? It's blessing would fall dormant if\nnot redone by another cleric.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Warhammer", "A massive warhammer fit for an orc. The two\nheads of the warhammer resemble massive\nfists, the metal stained a deep black. The\nshaft would be made of dark oak with iron\nbandings periodically spread out to add\nsupport to it. Faint demonic carvings could\nbe seen in the wood if closely inspected.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Var'ziel.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("simple polearm", "A sturdy polearm, the shaft is of hearty oak\nand the blade is crafted from finely smithed\nsteel, purple leather wraps around the shaft.\nThe superior infantry weapon.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Nodachi", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Jasmine-Tea", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Poppy Serum", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Amethyst Earrings", "A pair of golden earrings. In each earring\nrest a dark purple amethyst, covered and\nsurrounded by thin, yet, decorative lines of\ngold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Everlight Lantern", "A iron lantern with glass panes fitted into\nit's sides. It contains a small white flame\nthat gives off a bright white light, it gives\noff very little heat. The flame shall burn\nindefinitely, never burning out unless\nintentionally snuffed out with water, or if\nthe creator of the flame were to will it out.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quavinir Tinuvial.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tainted Earth", "Tainted Earth dug from the tainted lands\noverrun with dark beings undead and taint.\n(Map cords -737x 164y 270z)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arashiha.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("A slayer steel saber", "This slayer steel saber would have lost its\nshine a long while ago. It is now covered in\na sickly green substance, clearly some sort\nof blood from a foul creature. The saber\nwould be like most others, a short hilt with\na long blade perpetuating from the guard.\nNear the end of the blade would be a slight\ncurve with the tip lifting up.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gryphon Leather", "This is gryphon leather. It is thick,\ncotton-like, but as tough as any traditional\ncombat leather. It is stained a deep brown,\nwith speckles of white.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Diamond Bracelet", "A bracelet consisting of a large dark red\ndiamond and two smaller yellow diamonds and\ndelicate silver wire coiled about the gems\nwith plentiful spiraling patterns.About an\ninch wide at the widest, the bracelet is\nquite small and is put on with a clasp formed\nfrom the wire it's made of. It's evident he\nstones have been polished to perfection by a\nmaster stonemason, and countless hours have\nbeen spent in manipulating the wire to the\ncorrect shapes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Whalebone Coronet", "A coronet crafted of the bones of a great\nwhale, made for the Count of Ayr. It would\nhave multiple bones interlocked to form a\nringlet to be worn around the head, adorn\nwith gems and stones representing the colours\nof House Baruch.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Tyrone's Helmet", "Before you is a battered helmet with a dent\non the top right, clearly put there by some\nitem of brute force. The iron itself would\nappear polished though it would not hide the\ndamage which the helmet has endured.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serge4nt_Forge99.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Tyrone's Chestplate", "This chetsplate would be covered in scratches\nand some slight cracks which would lay on its\nlower left and upperback. A carved in cross\ncan be seens on the upper left of the chest.\nWhile the initials \"T. T. O'S.\" would be\nspelt at the collar. This chestplate would\nlook to be polished though the scratches and\nother damages would be plainly visible.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serge4nt_Forge99.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Tyrone's Leggings", "These leggins would be the least damaged of\nthe set, though a large dent would be evident\nabove where the right knee would be. The\nleggings with some scratches on the back\nwould have little more to it. It would look\nto be polished though the scratches remain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serge4nt_Forge99.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Tyrone's Boots", "These boot would clearly have been worn to\nmuch extent. Though in relatively good\ncondition, scratches can be seen etched into\ntheir features. They would look to be\npolished.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serge4nt_Forge99.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("cigars", "", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Pelt", "A shiny orange pelt scavenged from an amber\nwolf. It seemed to be crusty from a dried up\nsubstance, though it kept its vibrant colour.\nThe fur itself would be thick, stained with\nblood and grime.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:leather", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_22(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Authentic Mongo Foxburr Action Figure", "The strong look of a brave halfling many\nrecognize as the famous \"Mongo Foxburr\nWearing his Yellow WHMIS Issued Safety Vest\nand Hard Hat, standing with his arms giving\nthe double thumbs up, his large belt with an\nS' for SUTICAN HERO, shines brightly in the\nsummer sun, with a genuine Mongo Tear\ninside,aswell as a drop of the very same oil\nhe was burned alive in.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Vytharion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Mongo Foxburr's Spirit.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Mongo Foxburr's Spirit.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Shredded Ticket #2", "This piece of paper appears to be part of a\nbigger ticket, it's the lower left corner\npiece.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Shredded Ticket #3", "This piece of paper appears to be part of a\nbigger ticket, it's the upper right corner\npiece.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Shredded Ticket #4", "This piece of paper appears to be part of a\nbigger ticket, it's the lower right corner\npiece.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Shredded Ticket #5", "This piece of paper appears to be part of a\nbigger ticket, it's the middle piece.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray's Scepter Of Life", "This scepter has a tendency to be a bit\nflamboyant.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by IronLich.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray's Sarissa", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("High Elven Womans Liver", "A high elven womans liver. Great.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Bread", "Sweet Krug shaped Ginger bread decorated with\nmouth watering sweet Green, red, and white\nfrosting!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Krugsmas Elf.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Athame", "An ancient blade chipped from crude chert\nmany worlds ago, stolen from the earth and\nstill tied to its essence. The stone is sharp\nand stained, blackened by the many rituals it\nhas faced.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of an Ancient Ritual Stone", "This shard hums with a slight energy still. A\nfragment of a once great stone used for\npowerful magics. Perhaps it can be utilized\nin some sort of craft. Ouch! It's sharp!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SeventhCircle.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("-=Thunderkrug=-", "A minty tasting powder that is very cold\nand chilling to the touch. Just the auroma\nprovides the holder with a chilling sensation\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Magma's Molten Joy", "A crude Dwarven rum, amber in color. As you\ndrink it, a warm burning sensation fills your\nthroat followed by a sweet cooling effect.\nMany herbs and spices were added to this aged\nrum.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bonecharm", "Seemingly crafted from deceased beasts of\nimpressive stature, the pendant gives off\na fearsome aura to animals around you.\nNot even the greatest of bears would dare\nto near.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Bone Flute", "An old, preserved flute constructed of the\nbone of a great Ceru Owl; It bears little\nembellishment, but the primal spirit of the\nbeast gives the instrument all the beauty it\nrequires. Somebody took great care in\ncrafting this piece; It is tuned to a low,\npeaceful D and is played through a transverse\nhole. The nomadic, stoic personality of the\nnow-extinct species of Owl lives on through\nthis blessed flute.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Raven's Bone", "Half of a massive bone. The break was\nobviously horrendous, and the creature's\ndeath was nothing short of painful.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Autumn Crown", "A well crafted golden crown. It is comprised\nof a ring of gold encircling the head and 8\ngolden stag antlers branching out from the\nring, covering the side of the head. Three\nmeteorite shards would be placed on the\ncentre of the crown, they would shine blue in\nthe light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Reed Guthrie.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Gallic Spear", "A spear with a bronze spearhead and ferrule,\nand a haft made of Highland Yew. The spear is\n8 feet long from speartip to foot of the\nhaft. The bronze ferrule extends roughly one\nfoot down the yew haft. The spear head is\ndouble edged, and has been well shined, and\nis quite lustrous under light. The\nspearhead's two edges are shaving sharp. The\nyew haft has been treated both with olive\noil, and beeswax as to keep it in good\ncondition over a long period of time. The\nhighland yew the haft is made from is quite\nstrong, and can last quite well under duress.\nThe bronze of the spearhead has been\ncoldforged, making it notably more rigid and\nstrong than average bronze.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hyperthinking.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Drelthoks Seedling", "A tiny seedling that will grow into a\nbeautiful red rose. To shamans it feels odd\nand even moreso to druids. (( PM Hedgehug for\ndetails.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:melon_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Leaf", "A single giant leaf that had fallen from an\novergrown plant. It's charred and damaged a\nbit, but the rough outline of the shape can\nbe seen. The top and bottom are both rather\nsmooth compared to the sharp edge running\nalong it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:oak_leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Endless Feast", "A rather festive box of goodies. It never\nseems to run out of delicious Krugmas food,\nwhich magically reappears each time it is\nopened. From ham to candied yams and grilled\ncactus, the spirit of Krugmas lives on\nforever in this mysterious, decorative box.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Pendant", "A small glass pendant, it's a cylinder of\ncolored glass that fades delicately from deep\nred to bright orage, and around it's top\nthere is a black dragon. The dragon is\nwrapped around the cylinder of glass, it's\ntail gripping it at the bottom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sybbyl.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottled ale", "Some Good ol'Norlandic Ale", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Coca Leaf", "", "minecraft:waterlily", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Wine", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff Of The Salamander", "This staff is long and curved in a spiral\nshape, as if half of a whole. Carved from\nrich dark oak, the entire length has been\nsanded down to the smoothest of finishes. It\nis carved to be the lengthened body of a\nsalamander, with legs held close to its body\nand its head as what is clearly half of the\nintended handle. Carved into the underbelly\nis \\\"Midnus Anarion\\\".", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fiyem", "A slender, curved staff of Oak Origin. A\nfaint blue shimmer travels up and down it's\nform, though isn't all too obvious. It\nappears to be a Focal Point Staff, bearing a\nblue-white crystal encased in the\nacorn-shaped tip, engravings upon its\nsurface.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by a Elf.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("CrossGauntlet", "The weapon you stand before is a full arm\nGauntlet possessing a remarkably built\ncrossbow on its forearm,It has retractable\narches and though it is smaller than usual it\npacks the same amount of punch ((Message\nmika1278 or _Valyrian for info))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Catacomb Keeper] Mika Uialben.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Commemorative Centennial Coin ⌘", "This rare coin was given out to the attendees\nof Adria's Commemorative Centennial Feast,\ncelebrating the beginning of 1700. Only one\nset was made, there are no others. The coin\nis polished, and cannot be used as tender. On\none side, a valiant crow is depicted; on the\nother, a phrase is engraved: \"In GODANI, we\ntrust.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Commemorative Centennial Feast.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Legion Bonus Slip", "If you get a slip from an officer. You can\nturn it in to Ser Brand. For 200 Minas.\nNotice: Must be a Legionnaire to use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [The Indomitable] Ser Brand von Denhardt.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Triple sec", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Wedding Band", "A silver wedding band with a sharp glimmer\nand a amber gem placed in the center of it.\nThe band would have \"Denhardt\" engraved into", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Hermit Crab", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of ExplorerEze", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Alioth", "A wooden statue depicting a man with a hammer\nin one hand, a book in the other, and a doofy\nsmile on his face. A rune carved into the\nbottom extinguishes flames on or next to the\nstatue when the words \"Nazka'Karaad\" are\nspoken.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Powder Puff", "A small pearl disc, holding onto pale dust as\nto rid of all flaws to ones complexion,\nconcealing them perfection.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Huntmaster's Boots", "These leather boots are dyed red. Made with\nthe pelt of an Iron Skin bear the boots are\nlight but durable, comparable to the steel\nboots often made by the local blacksmith\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by B3ast_Mod.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("go fuck yourself <3 whiplash", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Lambs Ear Plant!", "A small potted lambs ear plant! It thrives in\nfull sun and warm temperatures, and its\nleaves are soft to the touch!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Areln.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Malkaathe's Resistance", "A helmet belonging to Orwell, battle-worn and\nnicked wherever blades have struck, with an\nodd, dark mist swirling within. Whenever worn\nand activated with a small Xionic prayer, the\nmist would surge out and cover the wearer's\nbody in denaturated lifeforce, serving as a\nbody shield against holy manifestations.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Mister Melty: Pocket Furnace Companion", "The little furnace that could.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by walkingheart.", "minecraft:furnace", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll of Deadbreath", "A scroll that casts deadbreath from the point\nit is unrolled, inlaid upon it were the\ncharacters for invisibility and stealth in\nthe dark language- illustrated in a deep blue\ncoloured glowing ink of ectoplasmic\nappearance. The cloud would stretch out ten\nblocks from where it was activated over a\nthree emote duration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bboosey.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pinned Flyer", "Thou law shall be populate Aegis There Monks\nto guide your forth the future control Home\nin world Aegis Protect a lifetime is ahead", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Important Things", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Makeshift blindfold", "A green piece of cloth put together by Utak\nIreheart. It is supposed to protect the eyes\nof a blind dark elf. \"An eye for an eye only\nends up making the whole world blind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Warden] Utak Ireheart.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Venenum equum domitor", "A dark, slightly rough liquid with a sour\nsmell. When drunk cures regular mild poison\nand delays normal poison for Twenty Elven\nMinutes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Honey Bread", "A classic for any party or festival, Honey\nBread is a staple for all descendants. Even\nwith the simple ingredients of honey, bread,\nand a dash of butter, the Honey Bread never\nfails to be a common ask amongst party goers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Fennic Bakery.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("V-Bucks", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corpean.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Limited Edition Golden Rubber Duck", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Rounders Bat", "A bat used to play a game named Rounders,\ndesigned for hitting a baseball.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlugalMC.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
