        StaticItem("Cactus Flower", "A Green, Small, Cactus Plant with a Flower on\ntop! If set outside, when it rains it turns\ninto Cactus Juice! Good for eating!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Orange Candle", "A Orange, and Yellow Wax Candle, It smells\nlike the good part Kadarsi. DO NOT let\nChildren Eat any part of the Candle!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bolas", "a bundle of interconnected cords, with round\nweights attached to their ends. It makes for\nan excellent throwing weapon, it seems.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PapaVesemir.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Medalla de Triumpho", "A medal of servitude. Given to those\nSantegians who have honoured their country\nand fought bravely alongside fellow\nSantegians. Bestowed to the most bravest of\nmen! On the face of the medal would be a\nDragon accompanied by a steed. The symbol of\nthe Royal Santegian Household. The ribbon\nbelow would be purple and yellow with a gold\nplating with the date '1662' imprinted onto\nit!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kukiii.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghoul Eye", "The eye of a ghoul plucked from its socket\nafter its owner was decapitated", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Sack of Flour", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rice Sack", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Stack of Plates", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice With Sugar Syrup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar Bowl", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Candlestick", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bodin's Spider Mask", "A thick, carved sheet of Spruce wood and\nbark. Visorlike, it covers the upper half of\nthe face, along with sections surrounding it.\nIt has Bodin written inside. Several discs of\nred glass are set in approximately where the\neyes of a bilespitter would rest, with the\nfront two adjusted to lay over a human pair\nof eyes. It stays on by a leather strap\naround the back of the head. Strangely, there\nappears to be a large nose-socket sticking\nout, disrupting the otherwise decent image of\na spider.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("[Replica] Rod of Arcane Bolt", "A two foot rod formed of intricate wood and\nmetal. This item is able to -- when activated\n-- unleash a small arcane bolt, carrying\nenough force as a standard crossbow bolt (75\npounds). When it makes impact, the item\nexplodes with concentrated kinetic energies.\nThis item can only shoot three bolts per\nsaint (IRL) hour. ((1-2 emotes for a bolt.\nContact Niv_Mizzet for more information. This\nis only a replica, not the original item, and\nthus has no powers.))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Relennium", "A swirling, bubbling and unstable liquid\nSneak or use /walk before handling!\nThis item is best transported via Llama", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Effigy Stone", "Pulled from the husk of something long\nforgotten, the stone glows faintly wherever\nit is touched.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Haybale", "The finest grass and legumes were used to\ncreate this haybale. Bred in the Mother Grove\nunder supervision of the Greatest Botanists\nin the Druidic Order, this haybale is packed\nwith delicious protein that is sure to make\nyour animals strong!", "minecraft:hay_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Birdy's Feathers", "The remains of a best bud", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Dilmah Green Tea", "Do try it!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Haintrain.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lich Skull", "The head of the Lich Lord Nicholas Thorbecke.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Brokenhelix.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Suspenders Outfit", "This is an outfit consisting of leather\npants, boots, and gloves, and linen\nsuspenders. All craftselfship is of the\nhighest quality. The thread is red,\nmasterfully dyed, cut, and tailored by Haila\nAvern. The leather is dyed and tanned to a\nlasting finish. An \"M\" emblem is stitched\ninto the gloves. The boots are steel-toed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dolinare.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cabinet", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Creole Seared Potato Halves", "Halved potatoes that are charred around the\nedge of the skin, covered in seasoning to the\npoint it could be breading, leaving a spicy\nkick after every bite.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Welcome back", "Welcome back to LotC buddy,\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:yellow_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("A small, jagged rock", "The rock is about the size of a fist, it'd be\nsomewhat heavy too, but not extremely for its\nsize.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Tomahawk", "A rather large Tomahawk. It seems to be of\nWarhawkian forge. The handle would be made of\nMeteorite, aswell as the tip of the axe. It\nwould be hard to break and would be rather\ntough. Toward the tip of the Tomahawk would\nbe a few bokolo feathers being held together\nby a small piece of rope. Toward the bottom\none would find \"Rhae\" engraved onto it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mortar and Pestle", "", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Black potion bottle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Sugar Cookies", "Palm sized Dragon shaped sugar cookies with\nridged detailing around the tail and body.\nThey would all be identical sizes.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Participation Ribbons", "Red satin participation ribbons!", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of a Deadman", "The head of a basic human, crazy in his ways\nhe believed himself undead, quickly righted\nby the blade of an axe, his head left crudely\ncarved from the body it once enhabited. Guts\nand the remains of a spinal chord hang from\nthe head.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Jagged Gem", "This green gem would seem to be broken apart\nfrom another half, its edges sharp and and\neasily breakable.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Fishing Rod", "A light, small fishing rod toy made perfect\nfor young children. It could potentially\ncatch a small fish!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("A Stubby Figure (PM: IronLich for more info)", "A figure that'll resemble the height of a\ndwarf however deformed in some way, the face\nin itself is scared and would look like the\nappearance of William (Atles). This wonderful\ncrafted figure would seemly be dressed in\nspider weave silk cloth and be comprised of\nmostly flesh and bone with a small raw\nRuibrium core. (Created: 23/12/2017)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Saplings", "A six foot long quarterstaff made of sturdy\ndark oak, both ends of it reinforced with\nthornbark. While it looks like a basic,\nlenghty walking stick, yet in the right hands\nit becomes a powerful weapon. Mostly used for\nstunning hostilities from a range.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Shit Stinks' - The Musical", "A musical tone to get into the festive spirit!", "minecraft:record_mellohi", ""),
        StaticItem("Norlandic Baguette", "A fine norlandic baguette, a sharp blade is\nsecretly baked into the baguette", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("KISS MY RING", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Glock", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial Of Thick Cockatrice Blood", "The glass vial was filled with a dark red\nliquid, that appeared similar to normal\ndescendant blood, despite it originating from\na Cockatrice.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Cockatrice Scale", "The scales of the draconic beast were as\ntough as iron, though the weighed a bit less\nthan it. Marks of battle coated their fronts.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Curt the Turtle", "Just an ordinary tortoise. [!] A note is\nattached to him \"Curt the Turt, You have\neaten the garden's berries for the last time,\nyou mongrel!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower Bag", "A simple cloth bag. Inside would be hundreds\nof small fake flowers, each with a different\nswirling pattern on it's petals, the fabric\nsoft and pleasant. The colors would be\nvibrant yellows, pinks, and every other color\nof the rainbow, each one made with care!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Urn of the Fire-Imp", "A resilient urn; the lid welded completely\nshut. A continuous source of heat pulsated\nfrom the urn's surface, with the energy of a\nfurnace. Occasionally, it would almost feel\nas if something was trying to escape its\nconfinements from within; though it was safe\nto assume the object had gone inactive over\nthe centuries it laid dormant.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:cauldron", ""),
        StaticItem("Clutcher's Straw", "Grass which is of a darker color than normal\ngrass, almost the color of tar. Upon a quick\nglance, one might think it was dead grass.\nUpon uprooting it, the roots would be\ndiscovered to be a pitch-black color with\nextremely sharp ends.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Box of Chocolates", "Assorted chocolates to give to a loved one.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Lotus", "The rusty-red stalks of this plant\nremind you of blood vessels", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin's Ivy", "A brownish-green vine", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarf's Pumpkin", "A sprig of the herb, the leaves dried to\npreserve them on their journey. Upon removing\nthem from the cloth its wrapped in, the plant\nemits a pungent scent.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Beauclair Booksellers: Pot of Black Ink", "Collected from docile squids in the Lobster\nIsles of Atlas, this ink is the finest\nwriting material you'll find in all the\nrealm. Perfect for any sort of literary\nventure.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pebble", "", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Peacock Feather", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Tangerine Chalk", "This bright tangerine colored chalk easily\nstays on skin once it makescontact!", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Masonry Block", "Stone workstation, chiseling\nand modifying stone", "minecraft:piston", ""),
        StaticItem("A Looted Meal", "A piece of meat, looted from a chest in\nHaelun'or. It smells amazing, due to the\nbrilliant cooking abilities of the\nMali'aheral.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Large White Acorns", "These white acorns were picked at their\nhighest growth before they fell to the earth\nand split against the ground, whole and ripe\nfor large and small animals. The acorns are\nfirm and have a slight spice taste to them\nalmost like Nutmeg.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Champion Fishing Rod", "A strange fishing rod, that when cast into\nthe water would instantly attract all nearby\nmarine life. The rod itself is made from a\nstrange blue tinged wood.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Catnip Tea", "This simple glass jar is filled with a dried\nmixture of Catnip, Lemongrass and Basil, it\nsmells and tastes very earthy. The catnip\nitself is very pungent, standing out as the\nstrongest scent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dwyn Tinuvial.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Water Ball", "A large squishy ball. When it connects with\nsomeone it would explode into a large watery\nsplash! Afterwards it would slowly reform and\nreturn to its ball shape.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:slime", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Cactusfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Tounguefish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Juicy Grasshopper", "This grasshopper is abot an inch big and very\njuicy looking , quite fun to snack on", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Gazpacho Camaron", "A local favorite; this spicy soup is made\nfrom buttery sauteed shrimp, sun-ripened\ntomato, sweet onion, roasted red and orange\nbell pepper, cucumber, cilantro and a blend\nof locally-grown spices. So good, you won't\neven care that it's served cold!", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("SlingShot", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Scalloped Cheesy Potatoes", "Thinly sliced baked potatoes with melted\ncheese on top.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Salisbury Steak", "A steak made of ground beef and other\ningredients. The meal is served on a fine\nplate and can be served with gravy or brown\nsauce.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Tangy Lamb Kebabs", "Tropical lamb kebabs with pineapple, mangoes,\ngrilled onions and balls of bacon. There\nwould be lemon juice lightly squeezed over\neach kebab to give it a slight tang. One\nwould taste a hint of honey as well.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Testbone", "The word \"Test.\" is engraved into the side.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Zawabate and Quartz dust Tea", "This liquid seems to change colors when light\npasses it, having streams of yellow, red and\neven blue on the green background. Bits of a\ndust seem to be floating through the mix,\ngiving it sparks as well when in the light.\nDrinking it would make the person have strong\nhallucinations and lose sense of time and\nplace. Those that drink this very rarely\nremember how they got to drink it.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoked Ham", "A big fat lef of aged smoked ham. It's salty\nbut super delicious.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("ᴰʳᵉᵃᵐᵉʳ'ˢ ᴴᵉʳᵃᶫᵈ", "A warhorn made from the horn of a bull. It\nhas a metal mouthpiece, yet the horn itself\nhas been adorned with malachine, and green\nstained glass. The stained glass seems to\nwrap around the horn, a few large rings with\nfiligrees waving off the sides and insides of\nthe rings. Though it's sound would seem to be\nthe exact same of any other warhorn, it's\naesthetic is remarkable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｓａｉｌｏｒ'ｓ Ｓｕｎｓｔｏｎｅ", "A prized possession to any sailor or navyman\nalike. A small, clear piece of polarized\nquartz cut into a square of roughly the size\nof your palm. On an overcast day, a sailor\nwould be able to hold this to the sky, the\nlocation of the sun is revealed when one of\ntwo marked dots have vanished. The length of\nthe cut crystal is wrapped in a fine braided\nleather for a more comfortable grip, and to\nfocus the light within the sunstone itself.\nAt the end is a loop to allow a necklace to\nbe laced inside for safe keeping.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jhaeros Flormai.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("crushed up weed", "This that stank shit, even more potent than\nthe Grade A Kush. This is the shit of\nlegends. This that shit Jesus touched.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Stickball bats", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Moso'chino's Soul Shard", "This soul shard would make whomever is\nholding it be overcome with grief and\ndespair. If held for a long period of time\n(more than 3 hours) it can even cause deathly\nthoughts to fill one's mind.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystical Watering Can", "This watering can emits a faint purple glow\nand seems to never need to be refilled. The\nwater it produces is almost like an enhancer\nthat speeds the growth of whatever plant is\nreceiving said magical water.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Duality Stone", "Pulled from the crown of something both dead\nand alive, the stone glows faintly when in\nthe presence of the supernatural.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mystical Seeds", "These seeds seem to glow a purple hue and\ncause a chill to run down the spine of anyone\nholding them. Once in the hands of someone a\nfaint whispering would invade said persons\nhead, but they would not be able to decipher\nthe words being whispered.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Fuck Me Boots", "These boots when worn, make someone that\nbitch and they just feel themselves.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Partridge Mask", "A rather well crafted partridge mask, the\nsoft feathers of the bird would be made from\nsmall dove feathers which are a devine snow\nwhite in colour and the beak of the headwear\nwould be crafted from polished oak. The back\nof the mask has two pieces of twine stitched\nupon the oaken frame to keep it secured\nagainst ones face. Quite a fine piece to wear\nto masqurades and festivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Feral Armour", "odd patchwork of iron, leather, and chainmail\nto the average onlooker. But for one knowing\nwhat they were looking at they would see an\nexpertly crafted set of half plate fit for a\nferal. The main body of the suit would be\nleather, covering each limb. Iron plates\nwould be placed to cover the torso along with\nthighs and upper arms to provide protection\nto these spots. At the joints and weaknesses\nthat weren't covered by plate, chain mail\nwould be sewn into the leather to provide\nextra padding.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bolon Stormtaker.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Marco The Delivery Bee", "This is a larger than average bee\nEquipped with goggles,\nThis bee will tirelessly deliver mail\nAt high speeds!\n*Moderator Approved*\nMittoTheSavage approved this item.", "minecraft:sponge", ""),
        StaticItem("Lightblue Bird", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lunas Longsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Rock", "Its a rock.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Contact Request", "Hell friend. My name is FalconByte and I am a\nGame Moderator on this server. Could you\nplease contact me VIA discord:\nFalconByte#5080 Thank you.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FalconByte.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Potion of the Arctic Mists", "This vial holds a liquid that holds an aqua\nblue and emits an icey-cold aura.When used, a\nmist would spawn slowly. The mist itself,\nwill disperse viraly, without any control, in\nevery direction around the initial reaction,\nextending all around i\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yannirog.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Stone", "For one with keen eyes. This stone, when\nshook, will whisper a certain answer when\nasked a question. It can say numerous\naffirmations to a question, or uncertainty.\nOr even just simply 'no'.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Coconut Drink", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Garoll's Gift", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Reptile Meat", "Reptile meat, speically lizard meat. It's\nabout 1,500 calories, salted heavily and it\ntastes like chicken! It's cooked, de-scaled,\nand looks very appitizing.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Left Aurum Gauntlet of Moso'chino", "An aurum forged gauntlet of ancient make. The\nmetal was thick and heavy upon the hand,\ndensely forged to provide the most protection\nit could. A gem adorns the palm of the\ngauntlet, a light red shimmer coming from it.\nIf the correct word is spoken, a torrent of\nflames is propelled from the palm. ((3\nemotes, 4 charges.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Signet Ring of The Stag", "A signet ring that when spoken a prayer, the\nring will glow with a light of the power of a\nMaster clerics, giving off a comfortable\nwarmth and slight numbess as the basic\neffects of Priest Healing. If one would be\nbleeding it'd stop faster than most herbal\nremedies an average docter could come up\nwith. Internal Wounds including\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Candle", "A medium-sized candle scented to remind you\nof the fresh air of the open and starry skies\nof Leyu'celia", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Absynthe", "A rich and powerful substance, it glides down\nyour throat fairly easily. Be careful, it\npacks quite the punch!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Earth", "This is a cow leather satchel containing a\ncubic foot of dirt. It is dark-colored, with\nstriations of blight. It exudes an\nuncomfortable feeling of hate and darkness.\nIt is impossible to purify this using any\nmortal means, mundane or magical. Legend\nholds that this is part of the earth that was\nscarred forever when Iblees was dragged,\nscreaming and tearing, into his prison below\nthe world.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Stein", "A golden trophy shaped like a stein. On the\nbottom would be engraved ‘Festival of\nVividity Drinking Competition Champion!’", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Vanilla ice cream", "A creamy, frozen dessert that tastes strongly\nof vanilla bean. It's clear that this is\nhomemade!", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Doll", "A doll with brown locks and green eyes, her\ncomplexion is fair and looks quite lovely!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Azdrazi Breath", "A strong and potent alcohol, reminding you of\ncinnamon and anything spicy you've ever\neaten.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Orc Lockpick", "It's just a big stick.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Spectral Tome", "A spectral tome containing Druidic Records I.\nYou will need time, in order to decipher its\ncontents.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Coat Hanger", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Three Teir Cookie Cake", "The first tier to the cake would be a large,\nthick chocolate chip cookie with whip cream\non top. The Second tier would be a thick\ndouble chocolate cookie with whip cream on\ntop. The second tier would once more be a\nthick chocolate cookie with with whip cream\non top. The second tier would once more be a\nthick chocolate cookie with whip cream pipped\nall around the outer edges. Cookie dough\nwould be sprinkled on top.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("kukiii eats ass", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Kazoo", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Shed Basilisk Skin", "A semi transparent section of shed basalisks\nskin, capable of being used for certain\narmors and holding many useful properties.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber", "A fragment of amber encasing a strange insect\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Ring of Power", "A pure aurum ring stands on your palm, it has\nthe following words engraved on the sides\nTous est a Toi\" The ring is said to bring\nluck and fortune to worthy rulers.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Orb", "A fine orb, made of strong steel forged by a\ncapable blacksmith. It's almost flawlessly\nround, and polished to the point one can see\ntheir reflection in the massive iron orb.\nIt's about 2 kg's in weight, so it wouldn't\nbe a problem to carry it around in a\nbackpack, or your pocket. What purpose this\norb serves, is known only to the user!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Space_Matrix.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Gauntlet of Moso'chino", "An aurum gauntlet of ancient design. The\nmetal was thick and heavy upon the hand,\ndensly made to provide the most protection\npossible. Runes were engraved upon the palm\nand bracer of the gauntlet, letting the use\ncast flames. It requires 3 emotes to use, 2\ncharging, 1 casting. After 4 uses the\ngauntlet must be recharged.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("~ ^ _ Dreamwalker _ ^ ~", "A subtle and thin craft that's smal at the\nbottom and gradually thickens the longer it\ngets. It rises at about 5ft tall. Any attuned\ndruid can sense the staff is a living being-\nthe bark containing little leaves that pop\nout every now and again.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pygmy Dragon Feathers", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar Of Magma Dust", "A spice which comes from the deep mines of\nthe Dwarves in Kal'Omith\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("wheat Grade A Kush", "Grade A Marijuana here, this is the stuff of\nlegends. Only grown in the shadyest of\nneighborhoods. This that sheet they use to\nget bears high\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Aqua Bokolo Feather", "A very elegant feather with a soft aqua hue,\nit gleams in the light with a reflective\nproperty like silk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netphreak.", "minecraft:feather", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_32(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Blessed Scimitar [T5]", "A blessed curved blade, a silver light would\nglow if a cleric would take uphold of the\nblade as it harms anyone who would be harmed\nby aurum and or clerical magic. A chaotic\nholy energy coats this weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Thot Crusher", "Elves are a waste", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Leowarrior's Delicious Tears", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A Sign From The Aspects!", "Oh my! The Aspects have given you a sign!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Grobsnopper", "A reddish-orange plant with small pot sitting\nin the middle of its petals, this plant is\nknown by apothecaries as a strong\ndisinfectant on wounds. It is usually hanged\nabove a bed post to ward off disease.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Raw Porkchop", "The raw flesh of a young boar. Hardy and with\na good amount of fat, when cooked will\nprovide much energy for a weary traveler.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Steak", "Thick cuts of meat, taken from a giant ice\nbear.", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Riddle Potato", "The best kind of potatoes are the ones you\nhave to think about.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gwion Gallic.", "minecraft:potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Walking Staff", "A stout walking staff carved from sturdy oak.\nThe entire thing would be nearly six feet in\nheight, and about an inch and a half in\ndiameter. Leather was wrapped around it's\nhandle, to create a grip.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Bourbon", "This drink has a taste of apples and pumkins\nfrom the ingredients it was brewed with.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Man at Arms] Umar ibn salem.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("You are Wife", "You are wife, fuck you!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gimli Metalfist.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Skywhale Droppings", "Large droppings produced by frightened\nskywhales.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bokermon.", "minecraft:bone_meal", ""),
        StaticItem("The Keeper of Order", "In your hands is a longsword made of\nbluesteel with a hilt of polished steel. Upon\nthe pommel is an engraving of a lion, the\neyes imbedded with amber. The blade itself is\ncarved with images of Paladins through the\ncenturies battling corrupt Dragon-kin and\nUndead alike. Upon the leather grip, the\nwords “For the Brotherhood, for Order, for\nXan we fight without fear or hesitation.”\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Drake Claw", "A sharp, curved, arched claw that is very\nlong and curves downwards. The tip of the\nclaw appears to be chipped and slightly\nscorched, a clear sign of a raging battle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Gorum.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Golden Lion Signet Ring", "Within your hand would be a majestically\ncrafted ring, carved from an emerald. A steel\nplate would be inlaid in the polished\nsurface, bearing the symbol of the Golden\nLion of Xan, the words 'Order' and\nGuardianship' accenting the lion. It would\nbe clear you are holding one of the two\nsignet rings of the Brotherhood of the Golden\nLion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreadknight Skull", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Thatpyrodude.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lion Amulet", "A shiny, golden amulet, forged into the shape\nof a lion's head. It's eyes almost appear to\nstare back at you, as you look into them.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Decrepit Blade", "This blade has been warped by the unforgiving\npassages of time, now decrepit and\nreminiscent of an era yonder, a time of war\nand Gods alike; the golden onslaught.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of The_Shrouded_One", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sterling Carafe", "A fine, moderately sized carafe made of blue\ndyed glass. Its handleless body makes it seem\nmore of a vase than an effective cup, though\nit is suitable to be drank out of\nnonetheless.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Oathkeeper; Promise to Our Sister", "A crossspear forged from raw aurum and\nenforced with carbarum alloy, making the\nweapon of average physical strength akin to a\nlongsword. Its head is a two foot long blade\nwhilst its shaft is just over five feet in\nlength. The guard itself has a Lance, whose\nmagick peaked in an era long gone. Because of\nit, it'd be littered in an array of runes,\nnotably, the words 'Xan', 'Athna', and\nSarah' would be inscribed betwixt the\nincomprehensible runes. https://goo.gl/Tse3An\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fireheart_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Badge of Persistence", "This amulet would take the shape of a lion,\nrampant and guardant, made of pure gold, eyes\nmade of small emeralds. Etched in silver upon\nthe spine would be but a single word,\nPersistence. The craftmanship would be of the\nhighest quality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Shattered Phylactery", "The shattered remains of an emerald, which\nonce acted as a phylactery and housed the\nsoul of the Lost Knight, a lonely soul who\nwas cursed to wander the forests in solitude,\nmourning the life he sought to prolong.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Forktail Whip Tail", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Porcelain Doll", "A male doll, delicately made. Clearly of good\nquality.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheDarkIsEternal.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Xannic Water", "In your hands was a bottle of water warm to\nthe touch, which shimmered gold in the light.\nThose attuned to Xan would feel the Lord of\nSunlight's power coursing through the water.\nIt had been taken from the Atlasian Warhawke\nChancery.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Helmet", "An aged helmet, battered and bruised, charred\nby fire.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvernscale", "A highly durable scale of the infamous\nForktail-wyvern /Dûn/. Shimmering espacilly\ncolorfull in moonshine, it breaks the\nlightwaves into almost an anti-rainbow. Maybe\nan expierenced craftsman can create something\ngreat out of it?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bellamoor Apple Juice", "A concentrated and beautiful apple juice,\nmade to perfection. The drink is bottled in\nwhat could easily be mistaken as an ornate\nwine bottle, fortunately, it's labeled with\nBellamoor Apple Juice'. Best served cold.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lighter", "A ring made of ferrum holding a rather large\nemerald. A crescent moon has been carefully\nput into the gems center and on stating a\ncommand, the crescent will light up with the\nglow equivalent to that of a torch. When\nactive, heart halves will glow on either\nfront of the crescent, making up a full one\nif you were to look straight through the\ngemstone. It'd fit somebody with rather\nskinny fingers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by aerialkebab.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("T.I.M Decryption Chip", "This chip is used to decrypt T.I.M's\nmainframe code. 8 in total.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Lairnic Tea", "A Famous Tea on the Realm of Adreo, Lairnic\nTea would be a Flavorful Mix, Consisting of a\nSweet Mint, Blue Mountain Flowers, Lemon, and\na Drop of Honey. The Combination, while\nsimple, is Beloved by those who Drink it,\nused for a Simple Drink with Friends, or for\nHelping Soothe the Throat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rosenyr Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bunny Beer", "A strong booze that tastes slightly of carrot\nwith a tingle of melon. It assaults your\ntaste buds with its dark rich flavour", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("❀Forest ale❀", "A Dunshire original drink brewed from the\nlocal vegetation, it has a earhtern taste", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Applebrook porter", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Brandybuck brandy", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosiere Red", "The Rosiere Red, a Staple for the People of\nRosenyr, would Entice its Drinkers with a\nFruity Aroma and Soft Flavor. A Recipe tested\nthrough Time, Each bottle would Sit for 6\nMonths before Serving.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rosenyr Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Ale", "It tastes like carrots, wheat, and more\ncarrots. A simple booze for a simple folk", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Bed", "", "minecraft:green_bed", ""),
