        StaticItem("Dalek's Cooki", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Honorary Shogger's Badge", "", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Grass hat", "", "minecraft:short_grass", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Pipe", "A hickory wood pipe, seemingly 'carved\nflawlessly. However, to druids, the wood has\nbeen awakened. The pipe eminates druidic\nenergy, and while in the hands of a druid,\npassively grows pipeweed within it, growing\nfast enough to grow back fully between\nsmokes. If not held by a druid, it simply\ngrows at pipeweed's normal growing pace.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fine Oak Smoking Pipe", "A smoking pipe made of oak wood. It has a\ndefinitive 'J' shape and a glossy finish. It\nbears small carvings along its side that are\ndetailed depictions of hedgehogs bumbling and\nplaying about in rows of dandelions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dwyn Tinuvial.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Hedge bindweed", "A vine with white flowers. No alchemical\npurposes, It's just pretty.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Harold Applefoot's Potato", "A most ravishing potato filled with the taste\nof love, hard work and a little bit of salt", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Knox Charm", "A wooden pendant hanging off of a silver\nnecklace. The pendant itself is painted\norange, and carved into the likeness of a\nlaughing pumpkin. On the back, one word is\ncarved into it, with large, jerky carving:\nKnox\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:carved_pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Apple sapling", "A little sapling gathered from an apple tree.\nIt has been carefully planted inside of a\nlittle flower pot.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:oak_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("You're a birch girl", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Trout Druid] Kasfer.", "minecraft:birch_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot flute", "A carrot is carved into the form of a flute.\nIts is carved with designs of a dwaf dancing\nover the bodies of fallen gnomes under a\nnight sky\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Elf Beer", "The drink has a nice dark colour and smells\nlike grapes yet still has the bite of a fresh\nbeer!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling Grenade", "It looks like a firework, but it has the word\nGrenade' written onto a paper attached to\nthe side.", "minecraft:firework_rocket", ""),
        StaticItem("The Royal Pumpkin", "A Frondor shovel lost in the ages. Pumpkin\nand halfling insignia are carved throughout\nthe staff of the shovel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Pumpkin.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Official Better Burrow Bureau Burrowing Shovel", "The official BBB Member shovel. 'Make Burrows\nBetter Again' is carved on the staff.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Elder] Petrus Frondor.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Shovel of Life", "The Frondor family shovel since Aegis. Traces\nof regenerative magic can be felt coming from\nit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Petrus Frondor.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Frondor Shogging Shovel", "The shovel used by the shogging champion\nGaeleg in the shogging competition of Asulon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by White_Moose.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Fuego Vainilla de Luna", "Santegia's most beloved delicacy- this dish\nfeatures luxuriously rich, fresh-churned\ncinnamon-vanilla ice cream which is coated in\nhoney, rolled in toasted coconut flakes, and\nthen set aflame in a dish of decadent Golden\nStallion Rum.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Shovel", "I mean... it's kind of like a shovel?", "minecraft:oak_sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Oak Leaves", "A bunch of dried oak leaves, Perhaps they\ncould be smoked up.", "minecraft:oak_leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag O' bonemeal", "", "minecraft:bone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("TIM Audio Recording", "This audio recording, when played, would show\nRollo singing while in the shower. He is\nsinging rather badly.", "minecraft:music_disc_mellohi", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosemary Tea", "", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy House", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Kestrel Feather", "This feather would have been pulled from the\ntail of an Atheran Kestrel. It's color, brown\nwith a black tip, resembles those found on\nthe woodland variant of the creature. This\nmight do for a nice quill or fletching.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rosyra Belladonna.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Daisy's Cake", "A competently-made cake, with proper frosting\nand a well-done interior, with only a few\nburn marks on the side. It'd smell like an\nautumn-esque scent of apple and pumpkin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Bomb-kin", "A small pumpkin that has been carved out and\nfilled with gunpowder\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Pumpkin.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Handcuffs", "A pair of dense handcuffs made to secure an\nindividuals wrists. However, it's evident\nthat Caesar uses these for a different kind\nof prisoners, considering they're in his\nbedside drawer!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thanhium.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Maly Green", "A small, round cactus that has been dried and\nhad its spines plucked out. When eaten, the\nconsumer has livid psychoactive day dreams\nand is used by some for ritualistic or\nmedical usage. It is named after Malythil\nGreensun. While relaxing, it causes paranoia\nafter long term use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caliban the Cindered.", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson Cleaver", "A hefty blade of a study construction. The\nblade itself mimics a elongated plate of\nthoroughly sharpened metal housed within a\nhilt painted bright red. Peculiar etchings\ndepicting fire and icons of the Canon faith\nline the blade's surface in a runic script.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Geomancers Slingshot", "Seemingly a childs toy but this object is not\nto be played with, a small gem is embed in\nthe sling pouch, when ever its pulled back a\nsmall stone is evoked into the sling,\nallowing the user to use it without carrying\nstones of their own.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Spoon", "This spoon is the epitone of fine silversmith\ncraftsmanship. The piece of silverware\nfeatures an intricate, ornate cluster of\nfruit, leaves, and flowers lavishly engraved\ninto its handle, adding unforgetting elegance\nwhen in view.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Antique Emerald Pendant", "This stunning antique cluster pendant is fine\nquality set with an emerald and very well\ncolour matched, very high colour graded old\ncut diamonds. The pendant is a very good\ngauge of gold and is in excellent condition.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Satyr's Horn", "A hollowed horn of a Satyr, fashioned into a\ndrinking horn.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Concerning the South-Blackwald Winery", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Cloak Pin", "A cloak pin hand crafted from gold, depicting\nvarious vines and leaves interwoven with one\nanother, adorned with small jewels.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imibee.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashes of Raenor Tahorran", "Within this black urn are the ashes of\nRaenor, martyred for his service to Xan.\nThough his soul has passed, he now rests in\ntotality with Xan for eternity.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AstartesTemplar.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Valtin Halbert", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Scimitar", "A large, long, curved scimitar with a hilt\nsimilar to a katana, but the pommel is curved\nslightly forward. The hilt is wrapped with a\nblack and purple cord.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Vodnik", "A water-creature, it seems to have some\nantennas that palpate between sharp spikes.\nIt moves on like a mollusk but seems to have\nan exoskeleton like an insect.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Vodnik.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Direbear Ribs", "A cut of adolescent direbear, slain by\nNordengrad's hunters.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eveline.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("The Epic Fertile Honker Seeds Of The Honk Plant", "A very big and /FAT/ set of seeds, it glowing\na simply epic™ green of prosperity and\nfertility, only being provided by the renown\nCoppuhPeasant™ and Honker Corps™, it seems\nlike a one in the kind, this premium item\nbeaming with glory!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by jhon_boat.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Sunlight Spear\" [T3]", "Beautiful boar spear, the pole is made of\nsilver with golden ornaments, the head is\nmade of slayer steel. At the middle of the\npole there is an infused ideogram with the\nshape of a big rhombus with spikes, if it is\ntapped twice it would invoke a thin layer of\ngolden soulfire and spikes made of the same\nenergy along the entire polearm, if a being\nof corrupted soul enters into direct contact\nwith the fire it would burn its tissues and\ncause an unbearable pain. ((Pm Suxals for\nmore info ))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Saturn Illume", "A meteorite longsword forged in a traditional\ndamascus fashion and sharpened to perfection.\nThe steel hilt is wrapped in firm full-grain\nleather tooled with designs of the three,\nRellenia, Keldrith and Tariel. The sword's\nquilions are forged to appear as robed humans\nsimilar to those of the Monks of yore. And a\nname is engraved into the metal of the blade\nitself, the sword's moniker -- 'Saturn\nIllume'. Additionally runes coat the blade\nfrom tip to base, allowing fire to consume\nthe metal.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Geomancers Glove", "A supple brown leather glove with brass\nfittings embedded at the knuckles, each\nholding a small opal, it would have a strap\nat the wrist so the wearer may adjust the fit\nof the glove with ease. When the activating\nphrase is spoken, the opal would shine\nbrightly, a small stone appearing in the\nwearers hand, slowly growing and taking the\nshape of a small shield (3 emotes).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Ouija Board", "A board covered in letters and numbers. It\ncomes with a lens that slides.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Carving Pumpkins", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Half Moon Pendant", "The pendant has a sharp cut diamond in it's\ncenter. A sheen of energy passes over its\nsurface every so faintly. When one wears this\nand taps the gem twice, a glamor will be cast\nover the wearer's face. Lasts for a few hours\nuntil drained and needing a recharge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Recurve Bow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Blunt Training Sword", "Used for training among recruits- Packs a\npunch, if swung with enough power.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Tablet", "Roughly the size of a large book, this stone\ntablet is etched with unknown runes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Spear", "The shaft is of a light brown, dense,\ntropical wood measuring six feet tall. There\nare some odd, deeply-etched carvings which\nmeander along the length like rivers down to\nthe bottom. The spearhead is carrot-shaped\nand composed of bone that has been whittled\ndown to a lethal level of sharpness. The head\nis stuck onto the top of the shaft with\nhardened sap. For further stability, multiple\nthinner lengths of rope have been wrapped\naround the shaft and lower, blunt end of the\nspearhead firmly.", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Cookies!", "Delicious!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus green blunt", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Shortsword", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Gloves", "A pair of white doe-skin gloves, with Eleanor\nAlexandra's initials embroidered with real\ngold thread on the corner of both. They are\nscented with lilac, rose, bergamot and orange\nblossom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by marinaemily.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Peasant Action Figure", "Bought at the Valachic Peasant Festival. The\nFigure is shown wiping his forehead with his\nhat, an axe stuck in a tree next to him.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BudderBacca247.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Poop", "As you watch this, you gotta remember my love\ntowards you Patu. Poop.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiked Warhammer", "A 50 pound spiked warhammer", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Simple Pearl Necklace", "A strand of glowing, silver-white pearls.\nHanging in a neat formation, each one\ntouching the other, creating an illuminating\nreflection.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cavalry Falchion", "A intricately made falchion, forged in black\nferrum, a good bit heavier than a normal\nweapon of its size, no doubt due to the\ndensity and purity of the ferrum. Longer than\nnormal, a good height for chopping orc necks\nfrom on horseback , a silver inscription\nreads 'Forged by Caleb Crider, Master Smith.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gooey Ball", "A sticky foul substance which is great with\nplay with when lacking of entertainment.\nThough, if not moved for even a mere second\nit will form to a hard solid unable to go\nback to its state beforehand without\nmovement.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Whalebone Staff", "An approximately five foot long, slightly\ncurved whales rib-bone. Its wide end has been\nsanded down into a nice, holdable semi-sphere\nand the opposite side ends in a dull point\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by HollowGoosey.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bison Horn", "The Horn is Hollow, with some adjustments it\ncould be used as a War Horn\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Beast720.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Gnomish Cocaine", "This strand of quartz is some of the most\npotent stuff in Axios. It'll make you see\nsome real s***!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Harolds' Bread of Pity", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar-Zilla's Tusk", "One of two tusks belonging to the fabled\nBoar-Zilla, slayed by the Sirame. They're\nincredibly big compared to most boar, a true\nsign of the beast's greatness in life.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Liquorice", "Sweet Liquorice from the town of Belvitz.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Tobacco Cigarette", "Grand Tobacco cigarettes, made in Calais.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Boggen Head", "The decapitated head of a large Boggen. It\nwould begin to rot unless preserved in a cold\nspace.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sol Charm", "A beautifully carved gem that glows faintly\non the inside. When the correct phrase is\nsaid a burst of fire would blast all around\nthe wearer. The wearer unharmed. Two charges,\nThree Emotes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Reign", "*Moderator Approved*\nman5791 approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cursed Dirk of The Betrayor", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Fur", "The great, thick fur of a giant ice bear. It\nwould be cured by the sun. Supple and soft,\nthe fur well taken care of, it would be good\nfor clothing.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Julius, the Elder", "There is no partcular aura or presence surrounding this staff. Situated at its top is a\nfocus crystal, blue in color. Right below lies what can only be described as the head of\na flanged mace of dark ferrum, likely used for some form of combat. The shaft of this\nstaff is of spintered and withered dark oak wood. It appears as if this staff has been\naround for many, many years. At the very bottom, it is capped with the same dark ferrum.\n*Moderator Approved*\nIrishPerson approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandit Falchion", "A falchion forged of hardy black steel.\n*Moderator Approved*\nZerachial approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Waterlogged Telescope", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Daisy", "The blade is perfect in every feasible way. Unnaturally so.\n*Moderator Approved*\nman5791 approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Direbear Fur", "A skin of white, clean fur.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Blade", "An ancient set of blades probably issued\nto the military of a forgotten empire.\n*Moderator Approved*\nman5791 approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Messer of Thesseues", "This knife like sword is hued a gray-blue color along the blade, carrying with it\nembroideries of a snarling wolf and open eyes. Even now, the single edged blade carries\na sharpened edge and a good point.\n*Moderator Approved*\nCosmicWhaleShark approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tulip", "The sword is perfect.\nImpossibly so.\nIt shimmers unnaturally.\n*Moderator Approved*\nman5791 approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsoaked Lantern", "Some lights for your Krugsmas Tree", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Greatsword", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Real dragon egg", "ebin egg :-ddd\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SaintPaint.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Azgharian Herd Whip", "grak grak x---D", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Dewper is a Wanna be flay?", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Brandy", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Common Ale", "The common man's drink, brewed from malt and\ndried with coke. A thin layer of froth sits\nat the top of the mug. Est the 10th of the\nGrand Harvest, 1693\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Fizzy Banana Juice", "A bright yellow fizzy drink made from fresh\nspring water and freshly squeezed bananas, a\nreal treat to any Hou Zhi, but gorillas\nespecially.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Juicemaker.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiced Wine", "A strong, red wine, enriched with spices.\nSuitable for parties, festivals and events.\nEst the 10th of The Grand Harvest, 1693.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Herding Horn", "The hollowed horn of a Podolian longhorn cow,\nadorned with a mouthpiece at the tip for a\nherdsman to blow into. When air passes\nthrough it, it creates a deep, resonant noise\nthat can carry quite far on the wind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Combat_Roleplay.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Composite Targe", "A shield, halfway between a buckler and a\nkiteshield, made of wooden planks wrapped in\nhard boiled leather. The upper edge of the\nshield sweeps upward, protecting the neck of\na fighter when worn on the arm.\n((tinyurl.com/y7x2f54w))", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Tea", "A mug sits infront of you, filled with a\nhoney coloured translucent liquid. Smelling\nof an amalgamation of ingredients such as\npeach, raspberry, lemon & mint.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by houseofbigstars.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Ojornasen Mead", "It smells strongly of candy and honey. The\ntaste would be of freshly harvested sunflower\nbee honey, but would kick like a mule and\nburn the throat like an inferno. It'd leave a\nsweet aftertaste of vanilla but also leave a\nlingering bitterness like piss.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Cannoli", "A chocolate covered shell filled with creamy\nricotta, it is an old illatian pastry favored\nby many.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Enlightenment_.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Edge of the Stone Wolf", "A large 4'6 blade made of black ferrum and\nbloodstone. The hilt is made from steel and\nplated with dragonscales. The name \"Vasquez\nis engraved on the foot of the blade.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rochir's Claw", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Yanyuedao", "This spear would stand at 5 feet in length,\nwith the pole made of many meteorite\nfragments wrapped in green leather straps.\nThe blade end would be made from a hardened\nBasilisk tooth lathered in poison, bringing a\nburning sensation when stabbed or cut into\nsomeone. A jade gem would sit towards the\ntop, causing the end of the blade to sizzle\nand coat itself in electricity after 3 emotes\nof being tapped. PM Fury_Fire for details.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Whispering Secrets.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Harpoon Gun", "A mechanised harpoon gun; dishevelled yet\nfunctional.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by PoliceStateLoTC.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Chewing Tobacco", "A tin of Switzer Select chewing tobacco.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mullraugh.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Puzzle Box", "A puzzle box chiselled from a rich-blue\nlapis, with moving parts whittled from dark\noak. Each face of this box is divided into\ntwelve sections that can be moved around in\nall directions. Some thought and patience can\nsolve this beautifully-made puzzle to reveal\na different expression on each side; a smile,\na frown, a scream, a scowl, laughter, and\nneutrality.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ruslan Amador.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Branch of Orison", "A hefty branch, worn down by the years. Its\nhandle is wrapped in elk's hide, and thread\nis wrapped around the hide. The bark had been\ncompletely stripped bare, leaving behind the\nexposed surface, etched with countless\nprayers and various names.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Zawabate Treatment", "Healing Zawabate nectar that heals wounds\nfrom the outside(5 seconds), and heals wounds\nfrom the inside more slower(2 in-game days).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Alitruist.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Necrosis Verdict", "A token of death: Be it that you have\nreceived this omen, then your future bears a\ngrave bottom-line", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Lapis Tomahawk", "A lapis tomahawk forged out of lapis by\nEreinion Taloha, and Prince Erolas Ba'ikana.\nThe end of the axe would be very sharp with a\ndeep blue glimmer to it. At the pommel of the\ntomahawk there would sit a lapis sculpture of\nIgne'acaela. The handle would have carvings\nof stars and bokolo's surrounding it. The axe\nwould contain the initials 'R&R' of the twin\nchieftains Ereinion & Eraynion Taloha. This\nTomahawk is given to a mighty 'Ker worthy of\nbeing called 'Champion of the Stars'!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nate1540.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Whitestone Pendant", "The shiny Whitestone Gem hangs from a silver necklace.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Jungle Frog", "A psychedelic jungle frog when licked would\ngive long lasting effect of a psychedelic\ntrip. entering the cosmos. long lasting\neffects of absolute THC would run through\nyour body.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Cervitaur] Psychedelic Trippy frog.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("F*ck-Me Boots", "These tall boots spanning up the wearer's leg\nwould make anyone want to f*ck them. Some\nwould call the wearer a slut, but what's\nwrong with a little company?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nate1540.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Multicolored Feather", "A rather large bird feather. The pattern is\ncolorful and tropical. It's size and\ncoloration would match that of the birds that\nlive on Ceru.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Greystone of Ker'nor", "A unique gem, appearing like that of a sea of\ndarkness. Appearing to both shine be devoid\nof light at the same time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by WarsongFarseer.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby 'Arthur", "Wrapped carefully in a wool blanket is an\ninfant boy of human descent.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Participation Coin", "A coin won at the Adelburg Ball that has a\nbig \"P\" engraved into it, for participation!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll Paste", "A paste fed to Trolls to keep them subdued.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Gorgemel.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Teal", "A finely-grained powder that will brightly\ncoat anything it touches.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fuchsia", "A finely-grained powder that will brightly\ncoat anything it touches.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Head", "The head of a once powerful female Wyvern.\nslain by the hands of Prince Erolas Ba'ikana\nand the Warhawkian Warband.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nate1540.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Meteorite Chunk", "A large chunk from a meteor, a mix of igneous\nstone and peculiar metal. Perhaps this could\nbe used for something, or perhaps not. That\nis up for the holder to find out.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Laethis.", "minecraft:coal_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Meteorite Chunk", "A small chunk from a meteor, a mix of igneous\nstone and peculiar metal. Perhaps this could\nbe used for something, or perhaps not. That\nis up for the holder to find out.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Laethis.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield of Bogrin Grandaxe", "The large steel shield would look to be Dwarven in origin,\na large axe is carved into the metal face of the shield.\nThe symbol of Yemekar decorates the face, a circular\npattern around the outer edges of the object. It would\ncontain the four words: Honour, Glory, Valour and Respect\non the inside of the shield, the words crudely carved into\nthe shining metal. The handle if gripped would feel\nand look like cut ivory.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDizzy771 approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_door", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent's Head", "The chopped off head of a serpent, its yellow\neyes seem to follow those around it as if it\nwere a painting. Its fangs are sharp as\nknives, and its tongue has been pinned\nbackward to sit between its teeth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arakrsptec.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of the Meme Hoarder", "The ring would be a band of the bloodforged\nmetal of a katana. As one looked into the\nengraved symbols of it they would see various\nmemes floating around. Each time they see a\nnew meme or cringy picture / premium roleplay\nit is sucked into the ring of Hoarding,\ntrapped inside for the holder to see as much\nas they wish.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nate1540.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Rat King's Nail", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Pincers", "Giant pincers belonging to an equally giant\nbeetle. Made of hard shell.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Abyssus.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Snake Fangs", "Hollow cartilage, these huge constructs are\nas hard as rock.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Abyssus.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("2nd Place Trophy", "A beautifully crafted gold trophy. Given to\nthe second place winner of the Veris Summer\nTournament.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tentacle Keys", "A golden key, it seems to resemble a\ntentacle, what does it open?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Abyssus.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sohaer's Finest Dirt", "A delicate pile of coarse soil; once gifted\nto the Warhawkes, now gifted to you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by parion_.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Jurumbi Paste", "A very pink, fragile powder designed by\ndwarven alchemists using an unknown compound\nof ingredients.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Green", "Made by Leilatha Devione, this green will\nleave you seeing stars for hours. There would\nbe a small tink of blue in the green, once\nsmoked you would begin to see the stars more\nclearly. WARNING: Do not give to children\nunder the age of 20\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Cherry", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lavender Plant", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pontifical Santegian Crown", "This blessed Crown was forged by the\ngoldsmiths of High Pontiff Jude I for the\nCoronation of Achilius Horen in the Deep Cold\nof 1657. The Crown is encrusted with yellow,\npurple and black gemstones. A large purple\ngemstone would sit toward the front of the\nCrown. Engraved beside the gemstone would sit\na Dragon, with a Steed sitting on the\nopposite side, signifying the House Horen &\nHouse de Savin. It would also bear the seal\nof the Pontificate along with the Cross of\nHoren.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TitanOfTheDepths.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Oathmaker", "An extremely fancy weapon, made out of pure\ngold. It would be polished and shined untill\none could see their own reflection in the\nblade, and sharpened untill one could shave\nwith it. The crossguard would take the shape\nof 2 golden eagle wings. Incrusted into the\npommel, one would find a flawlessly cut and\nbeautifully polished diamond.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("De Castro's Bite", "A fine blade, made out of a long tooth lies\nhere. Upon closer inspection, it would be\nclear that the tooth came from the maw of a\nfearsome dragon. The toothblade is about as\nlong as that of a longsword, and razorsharp\non one end. It ends in a fearsomely sharp\ntip, capable of impaling men with ease. The\ncrossguard would be made out of silver,\nfollowed by a fine leather handle, before it\nended in a silver pommel, shaped in the form\nof a knight's greathelmet.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Training Blade", "An item embroided with the Staunton hilt,\nclearly a training sword used by only the\nhighest, most noble of princes and to-be\nwarriors.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kadarsi Steel Sword Of Santegia", "A Kadarsi Steal Sword, its hilt made of pure\ngold, aligned with Yellow Citrine, Blue\nDiamonds, Green Peridot And other Exotic\nGems, The end of the hilt is shaped Horse its\neyes have wonderfully polished dark Red\nGarnets that shine brightly, the steel blade\nlooks like a magnificent metal waves of pure\nBeauty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mortal Greatcleaver", "A massive hunk of slayer steel, carrying with\nit a singular, thicker than average jagged\nedge. Just shy of seven feet long, a mortal\nman of normal proportions would find the\nweapon particularly unwieldly, its width fore\nthe blade even more daunting, it easily\nweighed twenty pounds. Cleaving through flesh\nwith the sword would rend whatever organic\nlife it passed through, coating the blade in\na corrosive taint that would seep into the\nvictim of further assault. ((PM Goosey for\nmore information))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Harsh Tendril of Blackened Goo", "A darkened tendril, designed to be held.\nThose stabbed with it grow sick, and paranoia clings to\nthem for at least a day.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kowaman.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cantwell Leafblade Claymore", "A sturdy iron claymore, hand forged by a\nmaster smith. The hilt is covered in two\ntoned yellow and red leather, sewn\nexcellently together. The blade is etched\nwith intricate linework, with the family's\ncrest sitting proudly at the very top. The\nwhole sword is a staggering 140cm long, with\nit weighing in at 2.7kg.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cantwell Family Forge.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell Dagger", "A beautiful steel dagger, a phrase; written\nin silver inlets on the blade reads 'Semper\nFidelis'. The pommel is centered by a blue\nseashell. A signature on the crossguard reads\nForged by Caleb Crider of Adria'.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Truth Stone", "Before you rests a water smoothed stonemade\nup of vague opaque blue swirls, there appears\nto be glittering gem at its center. Shaped to\nbe held comfortably in a mans hand, when the\nactivating phrase is uttered it would gleam\nand glow gently when it detects someone\ntelling the truth, the gem itself having a\nsmall connection to the minds of those around\nit to determine so.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Hoss' head", "The huge skull of the Crocolisk 'Big Hoss'.\nOne eye is covered by a scar. That sure was\none big 'gator...\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kodokunaa.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent Poison", "A bottle of faintly green liquid. Drinking it\nwould surely mean death, while leaving it in\nan open wound invites infection.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arakrsptec.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("✦ Praymore “The Bane of the Damned” [T5] ✦", "Big claymore of 45 inches made of a blue-ish\nmaterial, it would have ornates of gold\ncarved along the entire blade, while the\ncrossguard would me made of aurum. On the\nmiddle of the grip there would be an\nideogram, which if it is tapped twice it\nwould invoke wild flames of golden soulfire\nalong the entire blade, which would burn\ntissues and cause great pain to dark beings.\n((PM Suxals for more info.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Missi's Bone Knife", "A knife made with a bone hilt! Intricate\ncarvings are engraved into the bone.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wilmot's Trusty Pipe", "The dark oak pipe would be well-worned with\nthe initials 'W.C' on the shaft of the pipe.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Babadooks.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("AAAXannic GemAAA", "A dazzling emerald gem refined and cut into\nthe shape of a trillion. Within it's\nscintillating exterior an almost unnoticeable\nflame flickered within. A flicker of golden\nlife burning with deific ardor, constantly\nswaying to and fro yet n ever extinguishing\nunless influenced by the darkest of magicks.\nWhen wielding this gem upon your person you\nfeel constantly enveloped in a mental warmth,\nas if never truly alone.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Harpy Head", "The severed head of a harpy!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Severed Head", "The severed head of an exotic beast. The\nblackened skin reeks of fermentation, its\nlifeless eyes seem to almost stare back at\nyou.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elain's Locket", "A locket containing a mini portrait of\na beautifully petite blonde woman.\nFlakes of dirt cling to the locket's\nglass, kept there by time.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Good Lad Star", "", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian Container", "A small box of sorts, seemingly formed from\nan obsidian-like stone. The black container\nwould be smooth upon all of its faces, yet\nalmost seem natural in its formation. Though\nit was clear there was a lid shut by a clasp,\nit was entirely unclear how the clasp would\nbe opened. Any attempt to break it open would\nbe met with utter failure.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Laethis.", "minecraft:chest", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_33(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Etched Pottery Vase", "Crafted by the expert hands of a warhawke,\nthis terracotta vase is slim on it's neck and\nthick on the bottom. Intricately designed by\nthe artists' fingers, the design used mimics\nthat of a bird's feather pattern, repeating\nall through out.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Mosaic Terracotta Bowls", "Crafted by the expert hands of a warhawke,\nthis mosaic terracotta bowls are made by\nbreaking glass, and expertly placing them on\nthe base bowl with tak glue to provide an\nantique design! http://bit.ly/2l1DnLT", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Lubba-Scaled Leggings", "Leggings armor crafter from the scales of a\npowerful sea monster, possessing a\ngreenish-blue hue. Its slightly lighter than\nchainmail yes as strong as iron. It covered\nthe full lenght of the legs and waist.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Egg", "The sizeable Draconian egg took to a Crimson\nhue, arguably the size of a male Halfling. If\nproper conditions are met for the egg, it\nshould hatch, if not so, surely resulting in\na dud. Contact Skylez1 sometime after the\n23rd of May.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Egg Sac", "A collection of spider-eggs cobbled together\nwith a thin net of silk. [PM C18H10N2O4 to\nInteract]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by C18H10N2O4.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorpian's Egg", "About the size of an Orc's palm, the egg\ntakes to a somewhat reddish hue - unhatched.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Myrzym Armor", "A heavy, steel set of plate and chain armor\nfashioned for a large War Myrzym. Black runes\nand patterns adorn the armor.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:iron_horse_armor", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Plate Chestplate", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("The Acri Spear", "This elongated, 6ft long spear is molded from\nthe sturdiest of wood, complete with a black\nferrum tip. Amazingly, this spear would seem\nto be unbelievably sharp, and would, as if\nmagically, never require sharpening.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Blade", "An ornate silver and gold gilded white steel\nlongsword, held within an equally immaculate\nsheathe. It is clearly of decorative\nMali'aheral design, should one have knowledge\nabout these things.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Turkey Leg", "A large hunk of meat with a smoky hickory\nflavor. A large peice would be bitten out of\nit. After all the meat was eaten off the\nbone, it could be used as a club.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Count] Ser Marek Kastrovat.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Seed", "The seeds of a Cactus, some of them are\nalready growing smaller stems.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Nul Exoskeleton", "The exoskeleton of a dead Nul. It appears as\nif the flesh of the insect is long gone.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Silk Handkerchief", "A soft silk handkerchief patterned with\nfloral embroidery. If you look closely, you\ncan read a small \"LL\" sewn in fine\nhandwriting on one of the corners\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobbes & Schmick Tailors.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeds -=Of The Thunderkrug Cactus=-", "This seed is the offspring of the large\nThunderkrug Cactus. Three of these seeds need\nto be planted in the same location for the\ngrowth of another Thunderkrug plant to bloom.\nWithout the help of farseers, this seed will\nnever be as large as the original mothering\nplant. The seeds are large spherical green\nobjects, their texture rough, but if the\njuices are extracted, they can produce a\ngreat high.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Razormouth Hide", "Tanned and processed leather\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Trap Spirit Of Yerkath", "This purple crystal would have ancient blah\nwritten across and around itself. A pounding\nnoise would emit from it to anyone close\nenough to listen. If broken open the Spirit\nof Yerkath would be unleashed seeping into\nthe floor to wait to be called forth again.\nBind who, Bind thee, Bind Yerkath The\nConsuming Slime\" To those who could read it.\n(Contact dtrik about it for questions)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Yerkath, The Spirit of Slime.", "minecraft:shulker_shell", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Musket", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Warhammer of the White Dragon", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Revelry's Applejack: Circa 1687", "A dry, fully fermented cider made from a\nblend of acidic, aromatic, and tannic apples\nis put into a spruce barrel, then left\noutside to go through freeze distillation\nduring The Deep Cold. At the end of three\nsennights, the concentrated product is\ntransferred to a charred-oak barrel for\naging. The aged Applejack has rich and\ncomplex flavor, yet packs a hard kick; its\nexcess tartness is balanced by a hint of cane\nsugar. ~80-proof.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Revelry Corp.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Jägermeister", "A Waldenian digestif Kräuterlikör (herbal\nliqueur). Foul tasting but potent. Sometimes\ngiven to misbehaving children in small\nquantities.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("(premium) Curonian Cherry Wine", "Nestled within this bottle would be the\nextremely dark, if not almost black, cherry\nwine. once opened, this pungent smell of\nfermented cherries would escape from the\ncrystal bottle and fill the air with its\narmoa. The drink itself would be rather tart,\nas it's flavors would consist of mostly wild\ncherry. Though whispers of vanilla could be\nconsist of mostly wild cherry. Though the\nwhispers of vanilla could be noted as well\nwithin the drink\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("let's rp <3 woo!", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Tongue", "*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Skin", "*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Ruibrium Crystal", "A small, pure ruibrium crystal that can grow.\nContains taint.", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Raven's Beak", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tirenas.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Gold", "★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by iLovePumpkins.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Pained Dilemna", "Those whom carry the blade on their person\nwould find that a black tattoo covers their\nentire left arm. If one tried to conceal the\ntattoo it would effortlessly burn through\nit's coverings.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Champion of The Glade,\n- THE FALLEN, IRRI'AYE", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dire Wolf Pelt", "The dire wolf hide would be puffy and hair\nfilled on the outside though the inside would\nbe able to keep in heat, giving a nice warm\nand soft texture on the inside wearable for\nthe user.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Trophy", "Reward for the sacrifice of the animals paid\ntoward Laklul, Spirit of The Swamps. This\nblood crystal the condence form of cows blood\nand spirit energy. Can be used in prayer\ntoward Laklul.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of the Ex-King Kairn", "", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Entbark Bow", "A wooden bow crafted from the thick bark of\nan ent. It was once deadly, but now it is\nvery old.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Watch", "A lovely made watch!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arakrsptec.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Kawaii Fluffy Bunny Boots ^-^", "Each boot would seem to have two\nrabbit ears, and a rabbit snout. They would\nalso seem extremely fluffy to the touch.\nThe bunny shoes would seem to be blushing!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.\n*The boots would be signed by a man named 'John Cena", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("massive black dildo", "despacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacitodespacito", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandit's Mask", "A mask which covers the face\nnicely. Perfect for banditry!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("September's Greaves", "These thick greaves have been carefully\ncarved out of Elderwood. While Druidic in\nappearance they're stained with the blood of\nyour ancestors..\nThe forests have eyes..\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Champion of The Glade,\n- The September Prince", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of the Watcher", "An ancient skull that was still in one piece.\nResting within the sockets would be two\nglass' eyes. You swear they were watching\nyou, and you couldn't rid the feeling of\ndread, or power, while around it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandk1ng meme trophy", "A trophy given out to only the dankest of memers.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Nature's Fury", "The curved dagger made of blackened wood is as strong\nas steel. The rusted, though firm hilt, holds a\nred gem in the center where the palm is\nclasped to.\n<-<>->\nSmall shards of wood splinter out from the\nbackside, the thorns upon the blade strengthened\nby the corruption seething through it.\nVV^^VV\nThe blade itself would be sentient and would\ndrive the wielder to feed its unresting hunger\nfor blood.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDiscoLiquid approved this item.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf-hide", "The hide of a direwolf skinned from a pack\nliving in the dwarven mountains\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Worldiswar28.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Mutated Raven Egg", "A large egg, found by the catapult in the\ndwarven courtyard.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Clump of Raven's Fur", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tirenas.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Stave of Fae’ron", "This is a Uteahwood stave, the craftsmanship\nof which is of the highest quality. It is\nencrusted with tourmaline, pure amber, and\ndiorite. It is decorated with clam shell,\nboar bone, and jungle flower dye, and\nencircled with bands of tortoise leather. On\nthe item is a carving of Fae’ron the\nArchdruid rising from a corpse, relating to\nthe reincarnation of the archdruid in the\nlate winter of 1302. A druid who bears this\nstaff gains two ranks in Nature’s Communion,\nbut not other druidic magics.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupted Scales", "", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Fury's Crown", "A crown that has been tainted with the\nimpurities of humanity. Within it's frame it\nholds the soul of one of the Glade's\nChampions. As you continue to wear it you\nfeel compelled to return to the glade.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Champion of The Glade,\n- The Fury", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("II Gauntlet of Shurr'Dom II", "A bloodied and finely made gauntlet. The scars of war are imbedded into the\niron shape of it, leaving proof of many fights and victories.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDiscoLiquid approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Colossal Bone Shard", "Remnants of a great beast. The bones didn't\nappear the normal kind, however. Seemingly\nshaped like razer talons. The outside of the\nbone shard is actually quite durable.\nProbably making it difficult to modify the\nheavy object.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("The Devlish Gem", "A black gem that has a black mist around it, it giving\nthe image of a sand storm rolling over the orcish\ngoi, with a hooded orc in the distance, glowing eyes\ncoming from under the hood.\n*Moderator Approved*\nVladovAlt approved this item.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupted Olog Horn", "", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("The Great Journal", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Bryophitian Blood", "The Blood of a Bryophite, full of nutrients\nthat benefits skeletal strength,\ntissue/growth repair, digestion, and provides\nyou with more Energy. It tastes dull and\ndisgusting to other races, but delicious to\norcs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Jhazeem the Flowerboy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Açaí Juice", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Gatherer Stone", "An obsidian rock with four spindly legs and a\ntail sticking out of its rear. Three fingers\nwere present on the tip of its tail. ((PM\nSpodoKaiba to interact/use))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("☾!☽ Club of Laklul ☾!☽", "⊙ Ceremonial weapon of Shrek'lak, King of Swamps. ⊙\n*Moderator Approved*\nDiscoLiquid approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("* Delicious Pie *", "A lovely, warm, and freshly baked strawberry\npie! The warm smells of this baked good fills\nyour nose as you draw your breath, enough to\nmake any man or woman's mouth water with the\nmemories of mother's cooking. The sharp taste\nof strawberry mixes well with the dough, and\neven ice cream should you have that with.\nHowever as you swallow you're left with a\nweird aftertaste of sorts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Veronica Aep Willferd.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cup Of Milk", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Globe", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pile Of Books", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Demigryph Feather", "Small three inch objecct, dried blood at the\ntip.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Potato Bag", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Princess' Rose", "This rose would mark you the friend of a\nprincess, it's deep velvet color masking the\nsun's glow within it's binds.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Dirty Washcloth", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Pure Crystal Meth 99.99%", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("love", "If I kill u with dis, I luv u <3\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Blago.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Shattered Veil", "A decrepit tome with an assortment of\notherworldly runes that rapidly change in its\npages. A sense of concern is felt as flesh\nrests upon the leather, a soft warmth exuded\nfrom it. [Contact ScreamingDingo to Interact]\nSignature: ፕዘቿ ዕዪቿልጠቿዪ", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked The Sleeping Monk Meal", "Broiled monkfish fillet doused with lemon,\nparsley and white wine and served with fried\npotatoes. The monkfish liver is round and\nserved seperately with roe on top of it. Hard\nto believe this came from the ugly fish\nconsidered a delicacy.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Esther’s Acacian Honey", "This red mason jar is filled with sweet\nhoney! The taste is full and decadent, and\nthe sweetness is supported by hints cinnamon\nand lemon. The jar is sealed with a wax stamp\nof a bumble-bee! ☤\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bee-Keeper] Esther Lester.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Riot Batton", "You hold a piece of wood, it has been dyed\nblack and has a purple dragon head as its\nhandle. At the handle there is a small rope\nto attach to your wrist.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Don Quixote", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Ogradhad Styled Staff", "This twisted branch staff is made from\nWaxwood and is 5'6\" long. The wood is stained\na dark brown color and has a tiny figure made\nfrom bronze at the very tip of the staff and\nIt looks like an Open book as if it was the\nsymbol of Ogradhad. Once the user grabs onto\nthe staff they feel a a small connection\nmaking them feel calm and collected,\nmoderatly more focused then they already are\naiding them in their casting of magic.\n~Wulf's Den~ Is nicely engraved into the wood\nof the staff.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Javelin", "A Masterfully Crafted Weapon from the Silver\nRaven Smithy. This Javelin would be topped\nwith a Long Aurum Tip, capable of breaking\nthrough the tough skin of most monsters. The\nbody would be made out of Spruce Wood, with\nsections wrapped in leather for a good grip.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mast. Blacksmith] Bjorn Adigard-Mauntel.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Beautiful Rose Bouquet", "A beautiful bouquet of roses would lay in\nyour hands. Attached to it would be a note:\nFor a truly brave and remarkable woman,\nthose beautiful, rare flowers.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Castelo Roses", "Freshly cut roses, bound in a blue and red\nstriped ribbon rest in your hand. A small\nnote is attatched to the knot in the ribbon.\nIt reads: \"My darling Aldonza, I wouldn't\nhave made it this far without you by my side.\nThank you, for everything.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Bouquet", "A bundle of fresh roses bound in a red\nribbon. The thorns have been clipped off.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Chunk of Obsidian", "A hand sized chunk of smooth obsidian that\nhas concentric curves along where it broke\noff.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Renatian Red Apple", "An apple which one would have fished up in\nthe apple-bobbing competition during the St.\nJulia's Day festival! It's got a perfect\ncrunch and is amazingly sweet!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bblackish.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Engagement Ring", "The small ring looks to be bands of silver\nstems twined and artfully fused together, the\nstems gathering at the top form a small\nflower. An engraving on the inside says: \"Uma\nrosa para o meu amor - A rose for my love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cranky_Varangian.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aldonza's Wedding Band", "A well-polished yet simple and unassuming\nring. Obviously the work of an ameteur smith,\nRoland's too prideful to admit the numerous\nminor burns that he sustained while forging\nthe ring himself. The word \"Together\" is\nengraved into the inside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cranky_Varangian.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Band", "A delicate band, forged from aurum. Engraved\non the inside would be the initials A.S.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Courlandic Banner", "A banner bearing the hearldry of House\nStaunton, claimed during the Rape of\nWhitepeak.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("➳ Infused Bolt ➳ [T5]", "Bolts made of dark wood, its head would have\nan infused ideogram that would invoke golden\nsoulfire around the bolt, which would damage\ndark beings of altered soul akin to undead,\nexpanding the area of effect of the head and\nalso invoke thorns of the same ethereal\nenergy along the shaft, making critical\ndamage if it penetrates their corrupted\ntissues, it would need to be activated before\nused, which would only require touch the\nideogram. (PM Suxals for more information)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Croquetas de Jamon", "Very tasty, small, lightly breaded and fried\nsort of fritter that is both crunchy on the\noutside and creamy-smooth on the side. These\ntapas are made of bechamel and ham mixture\nwhich is rolled into logs, coated with egg\nand breadcrumbs then fried to golden brown.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of healerdealer", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of xLerenzo_", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Apiary", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Herais' Owl Plushie", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("lag", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fluffy Robes", "A lovely sewn robe, soft to the touch, and\ncandy to the eyes. It has a sewn 'S.P' on it;\nshort for Sally Products.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Drinkable Klomp", "The finest brew in brewing technology to get\nyou so drunk in such a short amount of time\nyou thought you fought an orc and lost. When\ndrunken by orcs or dwarves, they are\ncompelled to find the nearest orc or dwarf\nand try to outdrink them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Festival of Recollection.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("IMPERIAL CREED II: FAITH", "The original copy, found within the\nkinslaughter of a cave. He who holds this\nbook is beholden to the murder taken to\nacquire it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Leathery Skin", "A thick hide of some animal. It seems burned\nin a lot of spots, and is quite rough and\nbumpy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiver", "This sword is made out of a steel-gold-nickel\nalloy, making it a very light sword which can\nbe of great use in offensive combat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SanderWarrior14.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("_Capitalx's Griefing Warning", "This is a warning, if you continue to grief\ninto places, you will receive a ban. - GM\nTeam", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Broadaxe", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Calabreeni Cleaning Rags TM.", "", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashtree Amulet", "The Amulet hangs in a ferrum dangle, made of\nfine Haenseni craftsmenship and each ring\ndecorated finely with flowery designs. Its\ndecorated engravings filled with a golden\naurum, pon its center pieces back it stands\nin bold letters. \"Forever, Protected\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EirikColborn.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Carina Fiscere's Writ of Commerce", "This document grants one Carina of Clan\nFiscere the right to conduct the business of\nTailoring within our Domain\" It would be\nstamped with the Ruric Seal and signed by\nThoromir Edvardsson Ruric II.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Large emerald and diamond chained necklace", "Two silver diamond-encrusted chains meet in\nthe centre of this necklace, incorporating a\nlong string of emeralds in between the\ndiamond chains. They meet with a large silver\nbase, holding a dangling rounded-cut emerald\npendant.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Vykk Volaren's War Cleaver", "Vykk was gifted a warcleaver during his time\nas a mercenary fighting for the Iron Uzg, it\nis a short one handed chopping weapon.\nIncluding the handle, the blade is\napproximately one foot long. vykk has been\nknown to not only kill men with this weapon\nbut to also cook delicious meals when the\nneed arises.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver-Carbarum Ring", "A ring forged from a carbarum and silver\nalloy that holds an emerald upon its face.\nThe magnificient piece of work gleams a teal\ncolor with a hint of platnium, shining in the\nlight. The forest green emerald, is a bit\ndull, but fits quite well with the ring!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Ring", "A sleek, thin black ferrum ring with an\nencrusted diamond upon it. This marvelous gem\nshines a briliant sea blue, though still\nquite transparent, clueing in on its purity!\nThe gem and metal, blue and black, contrast\nwith one another quite well.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Hou-Zi Fighting Staff", "Within your grib would a well crafted Hou-Zi\nFighting Staff be placed, the handle made of\nwood and upon the edges would a be a bit of\niron covering the staff itself. Within the\nwood would be engraved 'Shenjiao' and a few\nsymbols would be formed around the word. This\nweapon usually used by gongfu martial\nartists, giving a great arc of possibilities\nin battle.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem Infused Cane", "This staff has five emerald gems down its\nhilt. When tapped, it creates a loud hum and\nbuzz before shooting a constant stream of\nelectricity for multiple emotes. It takes\ndays to recharge with mana.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Undead: An Overview", "A freshly made book with its title scrawled\nin an elegant, golden handwriting across the\nfront cover and spine. The book itself would\nbe of leather make, with the design of a\nskull stitched into the front cover below the\ntitle. On the first page would be the words\n\\\"The Whispering Secrets\\\". Any who held this\nbook would find a lifelike image of what they\nwere studying rising forth from the page,\ngiving a visual example that only the holder\ncould see. PM Fury_Fire for info.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.\nSignature: Friedrich", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Deities: Worship", "This book is freshly made, with elegant\ngolden text on the front cover as well as\nspine, stating the name of such. A picture of\na fire would be etched into the leather cover\nin golden thread. Those who hold this book\nwould find it giving a faint, though\ncomforting warmth around it, along with\noccasional wisps of golden energy rising up\nas you turn the pages - only percievable to\nthe one holding it. PM Fury_Fire for\ninformation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.\nSignature: Friedrich", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Mental Magic: Barriers", "A finely printed book with a leather cover,\nthe name of such stitched into the front and\nspine of such. The contents would be a fair\namount of knowledge of Mental Magic and\nBarriers - an explanation on how to defend\nyourself against Mental Assaults. On the\nfirst page is a picture of an eye, with the\nname of the company who made it written below\n- \\\"The Whispering Secrets.\\\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.\nSignature: Friedrich", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Boar Hide", "A hide from a Giant Boar, it can be used to\nfashion together protection, as a Giant\nBoar's hide is thick and resistant. It\nmeasure 4ftx2ft.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("⸎Standarized Spear⸎", "The full weapon length is nearly 6ft in\nlength with a 1ft blade attached to the\nshaft. The blade itself would swell in the\nflat part before tappering down to a shaving\nedge, the final result making a good stabbing\nand slashing weapon but at the cost of some\nadditional weight. The shaft of the weapon is\na rusty brown colored black locust, the\nresult a heavier shaft that is almost\nunbreakable. Lastly a leather wrap handle at\ntha balance point has a mountain that merges\ninto a tree branded on it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Count Durlak.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Necklace", "A rather well-crafted golden necklace. The\nchain is entirely gold, while the main part\nof the necklace is also gold. However, there\nare also different gems embedded in the main\nnecklace: Diamond, Ruby, Sapphire, Emerald.\nIf one were to look on the otherside of the\nnecklace, the word 'Aeriel' is seen.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheDarkIsEternal.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Clover", "There is nothing unusual about the clovers,\njust their large size.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toren.", "minecraft:lily_pad", ""),
        StaticItem("Duma dice", "", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Morning-star", "", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Redwood Sapling", "Man! This redwood tree is growing quite well!\nIt is now a solid 12' in the air, with many\nbranches around its upper portion, all\nbedecked with dark green foliage. Its bark is\ngrowing well, giving the tree a nice rusty\ntextured look, and the diameter of the trunk\nis now about 8''.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Leather", "The thick hide of a slain Minotaur! Although\nthe leather may have a few sword cuts and\nsome burns on it, it would still be quite\ngood as a piece of leather.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by niceguynorman.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
