        StaticItem("Ruskan Cross", "An ornately made cross, set in a Ruskan\nstyle, an inscription on the back reads,\nMade for The Blue Cap Cossacks, may God\nbless their sabers.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ilatian Cigar", "A cigar crafted by an Ilatian Artisan in\nBelvitz. Provides quite the sensation when\nsmoked, and a pleasure for all men to enjoy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Hunter", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Ratiki (dead)", "This is pretty dead, and nasty... but mostly\ndead!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("⋳ Hollows Scream ⋻", "An ashwood based crossbow with bronze\ndecorations down the body of the weapon\nleading to its trigger. The top of the weapon\nhas a notch that can be used to slide a\nwooden covering over the bolt gully to hold\nit in place in movement during combat. The\nweapons bow would have metal reinforcements\nhowever not fully made of it. Just behind the\nstring catch is the word 'Durlak' carved into\nthe wood\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Count Durlak.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghoul Fever Medication", "A medication used to prevent Ghoul Fever.\nGhoul fever is a disease that comes about\nwhen impaled by a ghoul and retaining some of\nit's ectoplasm inside of your body. This\nmedication must be taken once a saint's day.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Paris_Valentine.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Grizzly Bear Claws", "Grizzly Bear Claws that are sharp, and large,\nthis could tear the best of Leather armor\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Earplugs", "Wool cloth torn apart in a very precise\nmatter, to a size of 1 inch long and 1/2 inch\nwide strips. These strips would be held\ntogether by adhesive slime that keeps them\ntogether whilst still being flexible. If one\nwere to put them in their ears, they'd not be\nable to hear a thing due to the precise\nmeasurements and flexibility of the plugs to\nfit snugly. They may cause deafness if stuck\ntoo far into the ear or if the slime melts to\nthe inside of the ear itself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Paris_Valentine.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Lur Spear", "A large spear with a extremely sharp flint\ntip. It's shaft is made of hard redwood cut\nfrom the rampards of the Elven City after a\nsuccessful raid and it has the words 'Elves\nbi gayh' engraved on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LordOfTheCraft.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax Paper", "A single ST1 tax slip. Applicable in the\nHamlet of Stettin and coinciding real estate\nonly.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Witchunter Chestplate", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("[R.F.E.] Raven Lights The Way", "A pendant shaped like that of a ravens head\nand being close to the size of ones hand. A\nblack gem be attached to it's eye socket\nthat'd have a faint blue glow about it. If\none state the command word 'light my way\nlittle one' the gem's glow begin to brighten\nthe glow slowly brightening to that of a\ntorch from the gem'd eye. The glow being that\nof a bluish tint. (1-2 emotes. Pm darkelfs\nfor info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkElfs.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of acid", "A vial of a moderately acidic liquid. If left\non the skin for too long, it would burn\nharshly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Pay Slip x6", "A pay slip worth that of six 25 minas slips.\nRedeemable for a total of 150 minas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nonival.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackbear Hide", "The hide from a Blackbear that was recently\nslain. The black fur is rough and a bit of\nblood is stained on the hide. It measures out\nto be 2ft by 1 ft, perhaps it can be used to\ncraft a hide of armor.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("6.987091944665735E-4 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aloe Leaf", "It's an aloe leaf. How exciting.", "minecraft:sugar_cane", ""),
        StaticItem("+=Elegant Pocket Watch=+", "This stainless steel hand-wound pocket watch\nthat showcases the skeleton mechanical\nmovement makes a wonderful gift for anyone!\nOn the front of the watch, it would say \"May\nthe Aspects Guide You.\", engraved into the\nsteele. Vines and leaves would wrap and swirl\naround the phrase. A chain would dangle from\nthe top of it with a little clasp to attach\nto a belt loop!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Marten Druid.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("~Curonic Ale ~", "~A smooth ale , that has just the right kick\nof flavours to make you feel giddy with only\na bottle or two !!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [3months] Evelyn Devereux.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lightly scaled pelt", "A lightly burned pelt lined with thin scales.\nStrangely soft to the touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Ring", "An elegant blue sapphire and diamond three\nstone ring symbolizes the past, present and\nfuture of your life. The claw set cushion\nsapphire is flanked by glimmering half moon\ndiamonds, exuding a mesmerizing harmony of\nblue and white dazzle. Crafte\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider's Web", "(Common) A spider web carefully removed from\nthe nest of a Deeproad's spider. It is a\ntough material that could be weaved into a\ntough material.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Beast Hide", "A hide from the Sea Beasts of Colonia\nAequium. Soft, lightly scaled and effectively\nuseless for anything other than a proof of\nkill.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Longs Pasts Rocks", "Simple stones that had a smooth face, but no\nmagical value. [ZachsSlayer made, pm for any\nquestions]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Mothers Head", "The head of a frost witch, it seems to\nresemble one of some infamy\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Krummavisur Beak", "A large object that belonged to a Winged\nScreamer. When you examine the beak you\nnotice dried blood at near the nostrils.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Jelani's Ring", "The ring was a vibrant blend of ferrum and\naurum, it's band laced in a twisted fashion\nbetween the two rocks. The centerpiece was an\nemerald that glowed in the light of the high\nsun, radiating just as the beauty of Jelani\ndid.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("❂❃❂ Ｇｌｉｍｍｅｒｉｎｇ Ｂｒｏｎｚｅ Ｐｅｎｄａｎｔ ❂❃❂", "A glowing amethyst pendant on the end of a\nbronze chain. The amethyst seems to've been\ntaken from a geode, uncut, and backed with a\ncircle of bronze. The amethyst seems to glow\ndimly, seemingly refracting some lightsource\ncontained between the amethyst crystals, and\nthe bronze backing. The amethyst crystal is\nsomewhat sharp, with various obelisk shaped\ncrystal protrustions. The chain the pendant\nis attached to is made of bronze. The bronze\nthe chain and backing is made from is\nextensively shined, making is very lustrous\nunder light. The pendant at all times gives\noff a dim, purple shaded light, and exudes a\nfaint warmth. The chain the pendant is\nattached to bears a small clasp on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:end_crystal", ""),
        StaticItem("John Sarkozic's Shield", "John Sarkozic's shield which served him\nthrough the Purge of Norland.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("❂⊱ Daemonsteel Glaive ⊰❂", "Mounted to a thick spruce shaft wrapped in\nthick black leather, the head of this 6’3”\n(6.3m) glaive is a mass of intricately\nengraved Daemonsteel. Upon it, wispal\npatterns curl in upon themselves and form a\nshort passage of ceremonial prayars to the\nMani. The head itself follows the make of a\nType-C glaive, complete with a twisted,\nbarbed spike of Daemonsteel that juts out\ntowards the wielder in the shape of a hook.\nThe weapon itself weighs in at approximately\n16lbs (7.2kg) and appears relatively new; the\nhead is almost completely unscathed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelin Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sealed Corvisange Jar", "A purple and thick resin lays inside this\njar, fortunately it would be covered off by a\nlayer of wax. If one was to apply this resin\nto an area, they would discover that it would\nparalyze the local area to where it was\ninjected. Very tiny doses of this resin could\nbe used a strong painkiller, however it can\nalso be dangerous and have negative effects\non the user after long term usage. Perhaps\nthis could be applied to a blade. This also\nacts a strong Earth Symbol for Alchemical\nworks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Azraelon.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("varim's shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Improvised Molotov", "An acquired taste,\nyet still Delicious upon\nconsumption.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Pando_.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("McCow", "McCow - Hand-pressed cow beef patties,\nseasoned generously and cooked to your\nliking.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Reiver Sword", "A sword wielded by a legendary elven reiver\nwho was feared throughout the lands of Axios\nbefore going missing within the forest of the\nWood elves. Gone, but not forgotten.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MinusOneMorale.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Caesar's Telescope", "A long telescope about 1.5 feet long. It\nholds two lenses, one in the viewing hole and\nthe other in the magnifying hole, capable of\nzooming in up to fifty meters in close\ndetail. Along the ends of the telescope are\nsmall engravings and markings, mainly for\naesthetic. A very quality piece of work that\nwould last a long time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caesar \"Epsilon\" Curseus.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Volaren Rum", "This brew contains 50% ash tree sap", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vlaamsche Leeuw Trippel", "A blond, clear beer of high fermentation,\nwith an aroma of Saaz-hop. The soft\nmaltcharacter and the perfumed fruitiness of\napples and pears show themselves in the\naftertaste. This would make for a truly\ndelicious beer, to be enjoyed with a hearty\nmeal. (8,5%)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Brewery.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wacky Baton", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Salty Seaman", "A very salty blob of seaman seeds, tasting of\nseawater with an odd, milky-clear color and\nviscous texture.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Castelo Port Wine", "A deep red port of Castello make.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Glooming Gauntlet", "The seemingly simple gauntlet would gently\ngive off a deep red glow to it upon close\ninspection. For a specific mage\n(zlipperyznake) the gauntlet would allow them\nto focus their spells easier.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Shadowy papers", "A piece of paper with the words \"The Gates\nare closing, get there soon.\" Written on them\nin a dark ink\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Muyakelgism.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Knecklace", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of MrsWhiteKnight", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Staff", "A rather large bone, possibly from a rhino or\nmammoth. The bone's shaft would have a\nprominent emblem of the Yar clan carved into\nit.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("➳ Thulian Hearthstrike ➳", "One of many weapons made popular by Emberco,\na holy weapons company. The Hearthstrike\narrow is designed to hit ‘em where it hurts,\npiercing corrupted flesh and setting the\nimmediate area on fire with beautiful holy\nflame. Touch the arrowhead to prime the\narrow, setting it ablaze, and then fire it\ninto your soul-afflicted foe. Each quiver\ncomes with a complete manual of operation.\nhttps://goo.gl/5REHzg\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Axii's Spark", "A finely crafted and carved wooden rod with a\ndiamond embedded within the handle. If the\ncorrect phrase is muttered the diamond will\nglow and begin to emit sparks for the tip.\nThe wand has the capability to shoot out\nthree evocated electrical bolts before\nneeding to be recharged. [PM Applewick for\nmore info.] 3 charges, 3 Emotes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Tozen Uchigatana", "A long exotic blade from far away. It's\nconstruction is impressive. Wooden hilt with\na small circular guard, the sword is slightly\ncurved.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eath's Legacy", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Laser Blaster", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Holmite Aleberry", "A rectangular glass bottle with a small cork,\ncontaining a somewhat clear, reddish brown\nfrothy liquid. The contained liquid tastes of\nnutmeg and sugar, and is lightly alchoholic.\nThe contained liquid seems better suited for\nbeing served warm, and bears a breadish\naftertaste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon's Milk", "A cup of milk filled to the brim with a\ncreamy orange liquid, if sipped it would\ntaste as if your mouth was on fire.", "minecraft:lava_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Trinity's Cake", "A heavenly light, yet dense cake, alleviating\na perfect scent of a well-crafted baked good.\nThe frosting would be articulately-done, as\nthe cake had a perfect, sweet taste to it,\nshowing true baking talent from the creator.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Salty Popcorn", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of KBR_Jr", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Slice of Mori's Birthday Cake", "Thank you for helping to complete Mori's big\nfat birthday challenge!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xalid.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Slayer Steel Sword", "An elven made Sword of Slayer Steel. It is a\nsingle edged straight bladed weapon. It has a\nmark of a Phoenix at the bottom of the blade.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Pendant", "Soulbound II\nThe maker took extra care in bending the\nsmooth silver and fixing it in place with\ndainty Iron wires. Inside sits a rather small\nblue and grey stone, found in the wilds of\nthe dwarven mountains. At the top, where the\npendant meets the woven leather strap, is a\nsmall coil, tightly curled to make sure the\nstrap didn't come loose. On the back of the\nstone is an 'A' Scratched into it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ElevenJellyBeans.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Venator Talons", "The talons of a bestial reptile known as a\nvenator. It sports discoloration, and\nmeasures six inches in length. Sharp.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Bastardsword", "An oiled and maintained simple\nHand-and-a-half' blade made of steel.\n3.6\n135 cm(53.1 in) Tip-to-pommel.\nBalanced in moderate favor to the hilt. ---\nThe weapon lacks any decorative features.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A-K Arms and Armor.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Skinning Knife", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandit's Sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Acquisitioner Slip", "These slips are redeemable for 300 mina,\nafter an Acquisitioner recruits an\nindividual, and that individual is active for\na minimum of one week.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Meth", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Strips", "Leather strips are made by cutting leather at\na tanning rack into strips. Leather strips\nare always a required component when smithing\narmor, but not always weapons or jewelry.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Reverse Twisted String", "A reverse-twisted string is made of separate\nbundles, each bundle individually twisted in\none direction; the entire group of bundles is\nthen twisted in the other direction. The\nresult tends to be stronger for its weight\nthan a simple string.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Simple Bow String", "Made from any fiber, twisted into a single\ncord. Such strings are effective and fairly\nquick to make. However, they tend to be\nweaker for their weight than the reverse\ntwisted string. They may also come apart if\nnot kept constantly under tension\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Lucky Gambling Dice", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Engraved Wedding Ring", "A large and beautiful wedding ring. It is a\nvery large perfectly cut gem, likely\nincredibly valuable, crafted by both elven\nand dwarven smiths. It sits in a band of\niron, engraved with stallions\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bloodnight.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
