        StaticItem("Orc Urine", "A very thick and slimy and gooey concoction\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("✶---- Lucero del Alba ----✶", "Morningstar of 3 feet and half of lenght. The\nshaft is made of steel and a third part of it\nis covered in blue dyed leather, while the\nspherical head is 5 inches of diameter, made\nof bluesteel and is covered in spikes of the\nsame material. The coat of arms of house de\nAlba would be embroidered with gold in the\nmiddle of the grip.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Leaf Ape Pelt", "This would be a small furred pelt of a\ncreature akin in build to that of a frail and\nsickly monkey. It is covered in a thick gray\nand black fur though, akin to a wolf.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBigThonk.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("~Bear Brooch~", "~A delicate silver brooch shaped into a bear\nwith a single diamond for its eyes,its fur\ndetails carefully etched into the silver.Made\nin celebration of the Wedding of Count\nWilhelm and Lady Evelyn. 1688.~\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Curonic Jeweller.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("~Memory Ring~", "A Silver Ring, decorated with intricate\ncarvings (silver teardrops, rubies to\nrepresent blood, and imprints to imply a\nbroken window) designs to signify a sorrowful\nmoment.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("White Calla-Lily", "An old fragile flower, that has begun\nwithering, though it's beautiful white petals\nwere doused with blood, only those who were\npresent would understand why.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Bo the Puxie ~", "A petite Puxie pup, with a round cute face\nand large expressive eyes. The pup bears a\nthick, fluffy double coat that appears to be\nrecently groomed, that smells similar too\ncinnamon. It'd have a blue color, made by\npieces of braided leather.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Raw Parrot Meat", "", "minecraft:chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("easy easy easy easy easy easy get rekt noob lmaooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Redbull", "An energy drink said to give you wings. It's\ngot a special ingredient that comes from a\nbull's testi-, OI cut that out Jimmy , you're\nruining the commercial!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonite Ale", "A dark ale , brewed in the mill of curon, a\nsmooth dark ale, with a slightly bitter\ntaste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Tax Slip", "Official tax slip of Curon that works to pay\ntaxes for property in the County of\nCyrilsburg, it contains a seal of the Privy\nCouncil and the sign of the Head Steward.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MCPancakes.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A Qalasheen Diamond Ring", "A black tungsten Diamond Qalasheen ring that\nDazzles the eye, Upon Sight of it, it would\nhave a Delicately carved Qalasheen Vector\nDesign Which Exposes a Bright Mirror made of\nsilver that Increases The Beauty in whatever\nit reflects. The Centerpiece is a Soft cut\nTriangle Diamond That Glistens in the darkest\nof areas, The inside of the Diamond is\nMemorising to the soul.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Hansetian Armbands", "A slim band of refined gold, with just enough\nspace for a woman's arm to be held within. At\none end, the golden band is shaped in the\nlikeness of a crow's head, with small rubies\nplaced for eyes. A feather-liked texturing is\nadded to the rest of the band, a fine piece\nfor any collecter. A piece by the Ludovar\nLuxuries Company.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Tippensroot", "A thick wad of the live-saving herb,\ntippensroot. Application of this root will\nslow or even halt bleeding in a matter of\nseconds. However, upon the root being broken\nopen, a vile smell would permeate the air\naround it, a scent akin to rotting flesh. As\nsuch, it makes it difficult for patient and\ndoctor alike not to vomit at this revolting\naroma.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Titian Wood Leg] Eric.", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Roasted Ham", "A ham baked to delicious perfection covered\nin pineapples and cherries. Having been baked\nin the pineapple and cherry juice, the ham is\nmoist and succulent, perfect for cutting\ninto. It's easy to cut and easy to chew,\nmaking it perfect for all ages to enjoy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Blanket", "A plush blanket. Great for keeping warm\nduring the coldest of seasons!", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusionist Robes", "Worn by servants of the Dark One, this robe\nemits an aura of energy that which protects\nit from the harsh effects of natural wear and\ntear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Porkour.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Frostvine Mixture", "This is a large jar, filled with a herbal\nmixture of some sort. When taken internally,\nit would make one feel a deep cold all the\nway to their core. This was not a dangerous\nmixture, nor did it have any negative\nside-effects, as it has been enhanced by a\nDruid who is a master in Herblore. Just a\nlittle sip, is enough to make you cold for at\nleast 2 ooc hours. (Contact Corvoo for more\ninfo).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of Sevus", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ink Bottle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of Dominus", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Dice", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("AdrianPoonSlayer", "I'm compensating for something.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Golem Core", "An old deactivated core of a golem. Perhaps\nsomething can be done with it but one thing\nis for sure. Life would never again come from\nthe core as it appears unusable for another\ngolem. (PM haunter3 for any further inquiry)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Dagger", "This dagger is bigger than most, as if it\ncould be used as a shortsword. It was obvious\nthis belonged to a large creature.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skeletal", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Cane", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Angelic Fork", "A PitchFork Bearing Only Two Prongs With A\nFull Metal Grip And A Spiral Design Covering\nThe Tip", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sergeants Pace Stick", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Torch of Owyn", "A torch awarded by the Lectorship, to\nindividuals exhibiting uncommon piety and\ncourage in the face of hardship.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chaqery.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of mayrndz", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Greatsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Ferrum Blade", "It appears that this sword was crafted\nexpertly, it dark metal has a red color to\nit... which is the result of fossilization.\nAltough this blade seems rusty, when\nsharpened it bears a keen edge.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Wolf Figurine", "This polished wood sculpture depicts a wolf,\npreparing to pounce. It's mouth is contorted\nto a menacing sneer. Every detail is\nexquisitely carved, and the wood is\nchild-proof, devoid of splinters or jagged\nends.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Durrendal", "House de Hartcold's family sword. The sword\nis a bastard sword, being able to be used in\none hand or two hands with ease. The swords\ngrip is made of dark ash wood, with black\nleather wrapped around it for a more\ncomfortable grip.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Inscribed Aurum Chalice", "What appears to be a well-made chalice of an\naurum alloyed metal is inscribed with various\nlines of both old blah and common. The runic\nscripture reads \"By Betharuz be blessed!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Hunter's Charm", "A few small chunks of bone, bound together by\nsinew to form the crude symbol of Votar,\nmaster of the hunt. To bear the object is\nsaid to pay homage to him, to bring about\ngreater challenges and greater hunts. That is\nits origin, however in secular society the\nsymbol merely serves as a good luck charm,\nand its spiritual connotations are often\nlost.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Medal of the Silver Dragon", "A silver medallion, engraved in the symbol of\na dragon. Below the dragon is carved \"Gott\nMit Uns - Vincent Valkin 1648\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yopplwasupxxx.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Brexit man", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharmandal Heavy Glaive", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Deep Emerald", "A peculiar gemstone fished from the riverbed\nof the Sleetfell waters. This jewel appears\nto have been forged by high, underground\npressures and tinted green by underwater\nvegetation. It gleams brilliantly with green\nand blue hues, like a submerged forest.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Angie's Bow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Thick Wolf Pelt Shoulder Drape", "A finly crafted and cut direwolf pelt,\ndesigned to fall over the shoulders to keep\none warm in the winter. It is a beautiful\nbrown and gold coloring, with white tuffs\nmixed in. It doesn't look expensive, but it\ndoes look like it was made to last", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Angie's Dagger", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pouch of Herbs", "", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("The Breastplate of Siol Atmorice", "A Masterfully Crafted Breastplate, made from\nBlue Steel. While seeming to be made Long\nAgo, the Breastplate has been Very Well cared\nfor. Engraved in the Center of the Elaborate\nBreastplate would be the Symbol of a Snake,\nEmbedded with Purple Crystals. This\nBreastplate is said to have been Worn by Siol\nAtmorice, The First Matriarch of the Atmorice\nBloodline.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Siol Atmorice.", "minecraft:diamond_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("The Leggings of Siol Atmorice", "A Masterfully Crafted Set of Bluesteel\nLeggings, seeming to have been Forged Long\nAgo. While Quite Old, the Leggings would seem\nto have been Very Well Preserved. The\nLeggings would be Covered in Intricate\nEngravings of Mali'Fenn Symbols, all of which\nEmbedded with Purple Crystals. These Leggings\nare said to have been Worn by Siol Atmorice,\nThe First Matriarch of The Atmorice\nBloodline.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Siol Atmorice.", "minecraft:diamond_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("The Boots of Siol Atmorice", "A Masterfully Crafted set of Bluesteel Boots,\nseeming to have been Forged a Long Time Ago.\nThe Boots would seem to have been Very Well\nPreserved, but the Soles would show some\nWearing. On the Sole of Each Boot, The word\nAtmorice would be carefully Engraved. These\nBoots are said to have been Worn by Siol\nAtmorice, The First Matriarch of The Atmorice\nBloodline.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Siol Atmorice.", "minecraft:diamond_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Acorn", "The acorns of an ent, with a slight potential\nto grow its own ent.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cave_Creature.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Sap", "The thick, syrupy substance bubbles with\nlife, renowned by alchemists and druids for\nits ability to bring life to the dying.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cave_Creature.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Crossbow", "The weapon is just your standard crossbow\nwith the main of the weapon made of ash. its\nbow would allow for a punch just under that\nof its steel bow cousins so plate can be\ndented but not pierced. The weapon has a\nwrought ferrum foot stirrup for ease fo\nloading and appears to have a trigger system\nmuch like the once famous 'pistol\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Count Durlak.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("✹ Horizon Rose Extract ✹", "This extract was gained by boiling a Horizon\nRose and adding some sage and mint to it.\nUpon consuming it would be able to heal near\nto any poisons and toxins. ((Screen of Rose:\nhttps://i.imgur.com/9R0eLdu.png ))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("If you're reading this you killed me", "Fuck you", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Get fucked, kid\" -Drone", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kodeh Longsword", "A sword consisting of a pale, bronzeish tone\ngiving off the same strength of a sword of\nold Carbarum. It is resistant to freezing\ntemperatures and does not shatter when\nbroken.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlit] Edgar Tresham.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Ring of Angelica", "A large gem, identical to the Silversteed\nring given by Avalon to Angelica\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bloodnight.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Silversteed Wedding Ring", "An incredible carved ring of emerald.\nEngraved with a stampeed of horses around the\nsilver band that makes up the circle of the\nring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ajax_Manslayer.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Westerlands Military Coin", "A solid iron coin. An engraving of a flame\nmarks its surface. The item seems worn and\ndried blood marks its northern edge.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Ring of Thomas Ruric", "The ring is beautiful and appears to be of\nDwarven origin. The crest of the ring bears a\nlarge red ruby, carved into the ruby is the\nsymbol of the winged Dragon. This was the\nring belonged to Thomas Ruric, before being\npassed to his trusted friend in days of yore.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Operation Judgment Day", "A map of a cavern system below Marna is seen\nwith several red x's. Next to each red x is a\nnumber, desribing how much explosives is\nrequired for each bomb site. This plan can\nmean the destruction of Marna, and the death\nof thousands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Th3_11th.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Mauntel Gazette of 1684", "The first issued Mauntel Gazette, published\nin the year of 1684. This edition mentions\nstatus of the city construction, news from\nthe Ursurian order, Curon Embassy, and even\nnews from our efforts against the Red Vaeyl.\n[ Contact GenericNerd#0966 for access to the\nGazette once purchased ].\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Grand Ambassador] Thornn Mauntel.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sword of Oscar Talos", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hanged Man's Shoes", "A pair of leather shoes removed from the body\nof a hanged man.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Lynched Woman's Suede Boots", "A pair of suede leather boots removed from a\nwoman's lynched corpse.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Hanged Man's Leather Boots", "A pair of leather boots removed from the\ncorpse of a hanged man.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Lynched Soldiers Boots", "A pair of worn boots removed from the body of\na lynched soldier.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("An Old Curonic Broach", "A number of pearls from the deep ocean blue", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("A Poorly Crafted Dagger", "The Dagger would consist of a thick stick\nwrapped with leather repeatedly then going to\na poorly shaped dagger wrapping the bottom of\nthat. The dagger would hardly penetrate\nanything other than skin, but if thrown at,\nit'd be quite irritating and painful due to\nthe weight being about 2 lbs and 6 inches.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Magnus's Great Bulwark Flamebrand", "A great rectangular construction of Ashwood\nbranches lashed together with bands of iron\nabout it, six inches of branch length\nseparating each iron band. The central boss\nof the shield would be a semi circular cup\nfilled with long burning Ashwood branches\ndoused repeatedly in Ashwood sap. The top of\nthe semisphere would be a cage, contrasting\nthe solid bronze cup of the base. The edges\nof the shield would be lengths of iron\nforming a square to contain the tightly bound\nAshen branches.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Flamebrand Shield", "A large Ashwood shield, something in between\na round and kite-shield. The wood is\nessentially normal wood, though reinforced\nwith a few bands of Black Ferrum and painted\nblack and red. At the center of this\ndefensive item is a large lantern-like\nassembly, containing a small flame fueld by\neither oil, ashwood sap, or a variety of\nother flammables. Albeit a tad bit heavy, it\nprovides a spectacular defense against all\nsorts of attacks, ranging from arrows to mace\nstrikes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TitanOfTheDepths.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Oryms Pants", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("~Spooky Horseshoe!~", "An especially spooky, black-steel horseshoe!\nThe horseshoe would be covered in\narticulately-formed, well-marked lettering.\nThe letters would state: \"Have a very spooky\nHallow's Eve! -The Horse-\" The horseshoe\nwould be heavy, and very dense, smithed to be\nthat way.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lullaby Crystal MusicBox", "When this sphere is wind up beautiful music\nis played and dancing lights can be seen from\ninside, various different soft colors\nbringing a light glow in a dark room as the\nsound is a soothing lullaby. Best for babies\nand children.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Dagger", "", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Rotten Food for Rotten Souls", "A book on abstaining from mortal pleasures\nand going beyond the need for\nthe sustenance of the frail flesh\nWhen activated:\n-10% Hunger", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("~A golden ring with bear on top~", "~A thick banded golden ring , with a golden\nshape of a bear on top of it, the details of\nthe fur would etched into the gold. Its eyes\nwould be fine cut diamonds~\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Curonic Jeweller.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart of Curon (Crusader Blade)", "An astonishing weapon, made with deep care\nand precision, easily proving itself to be\nboth eye catching, as well as serving with\nproper combat effectivness. Upon its wide and\nflat blade made from Jorgundic black steel is\nengraved \"Ad Maiorem Dei Gloriam\", and upon\nthe golden guard \"Nisi Deus\". Handle made\nfrom oak wood and covered with finest local\ncured leather seems to be comfortable and\nmade to fit in hand perfectly. Pommel from\nthe same material as guard holds a ruby\ncrystal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Pun_Themis", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Istrian Pan-Fried Raccoon", "Locally hunted raccoon marinated in a mixture\nof spices and pan-fried in virgin olive oil.\nIts aroma brings renewed vigour to all\naround, and its ochre hue seemed extremely\ntantalizing. A truly traditional Curonic\ndelicacy!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorpion Hide", "The carapace-hide of a scorpion. It is rough\nto the touch, and offers substantial\nprotection when worked into clothing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Da Weeeagcker", "This tin of cactus green is a special\nconcoction made by the Weeeghx. It will hit\nas hard as a horse, giving the user a very\nrelaxed high, mixed with other herbs and\npotions. The side affects are; a very lazy or\nrelaxed high, and will put the user into a\nhappier state of mind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Stuff", "This drink is a dark frothy dry stout with\nvoid colored liquid with a light creamy\nfroth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Man at Arms] Umar ibn salem.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("White Flowers", "Some white flowers given to Carolina, from\nFrederick,first ever flowers given to her.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Shattered Orb", "It appears to be a cracked crystal with a\nblack substance that had condensed in the\nmiddle of the orb... an omnious aura would\nleak from the cursed object.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ticket of Toriel Maddison", "This ticket is redeemable for a whopping\nTHREE Toriel Tokens, used for buying\nexclusive, unique and rare items at Toriel\nMaddison's shop. Show this ticket to claim\nyour bounty award (Message Talavok#3594 VIA\nDiscord)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("`~Mead~`", "This bottle held a dark brown liquid in side,\nWhen drinking this, You can tast some\nfermented honey, fruits, hops and various\nspices\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HopeSky123.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Wooden Body", "This wooden body would stand at 3.5ft, and\nweigh around 85lbs. Each joint would be that\nof a ball and socket joint, allowling 360\ndegree movement, except for the hands; only\nhaving angular movement to simulate an actual\nhand. The feet would both have a hidden\ndagger in the front, triggering with a button\non each foot on the interior side, being able\nto release and be pushed back in by pressing\nthe blade into the ground.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Azurite-Malachite Pendant", "This pendant has an azurite and malachite\nstone as its centerpiece creating a powerful\nblue and green color. The stone's setting is\nmade of Dwarven silver wire, a\ntarnish-resistant type of sterling silver. It\nshould last for ages.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Navin_.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("♝ Sword of Hallowfell ♝", "Long Sword made of silver that belonged to\nLord Wolf \"The Barbarian\" de Alba, it was\noriginally forged for the Battle of Elba, but\nafter such great victory the hilt and the\ncrossguard were replaced, now having the\nshape of the mouth of a wolf, with the blade\ncoming out of its maw. The sword actually\nseems very damaged after eighty decades of\nusage and bad reparations and the grips once\nblack, aquired a dark red hue due to exposure\nto blood. How this relic of House de Alba was\nlost is unknown.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Saddle", "", "minecraft:saddle", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Parrying Dagger", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gioia24.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Falchion", "A steel falchion of beautiful craftsmanship,\nwith a hex pommel and a silver wire grip\nwrap. On the upswept crossguard, the initials\nA.D.A.' are carved expertly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Rapier", "A simple rapier made of wood. For training\nuse only!", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Reading Comprehension for Children", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Alphabet for Children", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Rahdonir'ja Ofsareithi [Trollhunter Axe]", "This twohanded war-axe would be made from\ndamascus, crucible, steel while the shaft of\nthe weapon was of a burnished dark oak.\nStarting at the top, the width of the\naxe-head would be about 60 cm in width, while\nthe length of the steel was about 70 cm. The\nedge of the axe would be sharpened perfectly,\nbut have jaged and almost unrefined points to\nit, which would cause severe and nearly fatal\ninjuries. At the back was a sharpened point,\nfor stabbing into things, causing a hooked\nwound. Further down, the blade would hang\nfurther, creating a bearded edge. Tied to the\nshaft as well as the grip upon the steel axe\nitself would be dangling eagle feathers from\nleather straps, held taut with gold beads.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Ungur Hundur'de] Saoirse Ungur Ravja af Orvar.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Round Birds Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Ludovar Diamond Earrings", "A pair of pristine diamond earrings, cut into\nthe shape of small stars. When caught in any\nlight, the precious stones would reflect a\nfeint rainbow light. A product of the Ludovar\nLuxuries Company.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Charles \"The Bald\" Kung-Fu Action Figure", "A Charles the Bald action figure carved out\nof a bone. This one is of Charles The bald\nKung-Fu star\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Charles_The_Bald.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Pale Red Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Curonic Pan-Fried Raccoon", "Locally hunted raccoon marinated in a mixture\nof spices and pan-fried in virgin olive oil.\nIts aroma brings renewed vigour to all\naround, and its ochre hue seemed extremely\ntantalizing. A truly traditional Curonic\ndelicacy!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sexy Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Istrian's Delight", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Halbert", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarzulian Ale", "A dark murky drink only drunken by the\ntoughest of men and women alike, able to burn\nones nostril hairs with a single whiff of\nthis potent substance", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tickler", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornn Mauntel's favorite cookie!", "A cookie bestowed upon the Mauntel by a\ntrusted friend. The cookie dipped in silver\nto preserve it.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Caramelized Pork Strips ⌘", "This clear package contains pork chops,\nfashioned in jerky-like strips. It tasted\nhearty, yet sweet. The package was wrapped by\na red bow, with a stamp attached on its lower\nside. It read: \"Contains pig products.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kid Scouts Bakery and Shoppe.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Mauntel Wedding Ring", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Ring of Dunshire", "Made in the forge of Dunshire and attained\nfrom the Gnome Cave, this ring is both a ring\nfor great harvest and great love.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Euphoric Imperium", "A mixture of dried, shredded flowers,\nleaves, stems and seeds. It gives off a\nvery strange stench", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Dead Ashen Aquila Eggs", "", "minecraft:red_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Crusade Cross", "This shiny golden cross of Horen is coated\nwith wax. At its top a large chain ring is\nset in for it to be worn. Blessed by High\nPontiff Jude I", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Pirate Figurines", "The carefully designed pirate wore\nsimilar bandanas and cutlasses alike. The\nsmall set of five dastardly crooks seemed\nto have individual appearances; quite\ndetailed as well.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Sailor Figurines", "The set of four carved sailors wore\nsimilar uniforms to one another; proud\nexpressions written upon each individual\nface of the figurines. They were equipped\nwith swords and dirks amongst each other.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:pumpkin_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Viking Figurines", "The bearded set of three Northern raiders\nwore scars and axes alike; the giants\nshowing hearty expressions in their\ndelicately-carved form.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:melon_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Slime", "A jar filled with rather gross looking slime,\nwhich seems to have come from some sort of\ncreature. Perhaps someone might find a better\nuse for such a substance.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("D'eril Book", "A book with a sword shaped seal on its cover,\ninside it contains all Hiro D'eril Vitreous\nsecrets. ((to know a secret contact Gioia24))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gioia24.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("apple of eve adam date me please", "Who knows what will happen if you eat this apple?", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Zatanaes' Cane", "A rather well-made cane, much of the cane's\nshaft being made from polished dark oak. The\nlower end of the cane would have an Aurum cap\non it, while the top end of the cane would be\nalso be capped along with swirling patterns\nwrought of Aurum being present along the\nhandle. There'd be a few small oval shaped\nsockets in the handle, more than likely for\nsome sort of precious gem to be placed into.\nWith a twist of the grip though, a thin blade\ncan be drawn out - Quite handy!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Riftblade.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Vibrator", "", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("^TEST^", "A handful of joy and flavour.\nTaters of pride and bravery.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Norlandic Merlot", "A sweet, surtry tasting wine, as hearty as\nthe land it comes from; but as sweet as the\nheart of the people who grow its grapes and\nlabor to create it. The taste is soft, with\nhints of cherry and blackberry.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("▩ The Mages Bane ▩", "A helmet designed specifically to gag and\nblind whoever was unfortunate enough to wear\nit, cold metal covering the wearer's eyes and\nmouth. The seal of the Ministry of Magic\nAffairs rests on the front side, while two\nlocks can be found at the backside, keeping\nthe helmet in place and making it nearly\nimpossible to open without the proper keys.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Laethesia.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Antique Lyre", "", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Communication Tablet", "A flat piece of lightweight steel alloy,\nengraved decoratively all along its surface.\nOn its face are three diamond gems that\nsparkle with unseen power. Next to these gems\nare respective switches, faint wisps of amber\naura occasionally drifting off them. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Johnny", "A small pig with dark spots on his skin. His\neyes are black but warm, and has mud on the\nbottom of his feet most always.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("0.1158788155480579 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Care Cookies", "Half of a Care Cookie. Meant to be shared\nwith someone. Made by Khimi Goldhand.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemical & Herbal Treatment Kit", "This Herbal and Alchemical Wound Treatment\nKit would contain various surgical and\nnecessary items for surgery. It would be for\nthose who seek a fast, yet effective way of\nhealing wounds. This kit consists of various\nherb bundles, salves, potions, remedies, et\ncetera. Firstly you notice an abundance of\nherbs that are neatly placed within the bag\nas well as various alchemy potions/regents\nfor assisting in the healing process. Smaller\ntool likes, forceps, scalpel and clamps are\nthrown in.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Master-Surgeon] Nolan O'Hara.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbal Wound Treatment Kit", "This Herbal Wound Treatment Kit would be for\nthose seeking a Natural, yet Effective way of\nHealing Wounds. This Kit is effective for\ngashes, but is not a Substitute for Stitches.\nThis Kit consists of Aloe Vera Gel, Sterile\nBandages, and a Coconut Oil-Honey Mixture. To\nuse, first Apply the Aloe Vera Gel and let\nDry. This will Speed Up the Sealing of the\nWound. Once dried, Wash off and Apply the\nMixture Gently. Once Applied, Wrap in a\nBandage and let sit for a Few Days.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Herbal Remedy.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Jafnvaegi (Leafblade Claymore)", "A light claymore of Gorundyr make. The\nweapon's length is 50 inches while the blade\nitself is 34 inches. The crossguard is a\ntotal of 8 inches in width and each bar is\nslanted vertically upwards with the blade at\na 50 degree angle. The length of the grip is\n10 inches with a hard cilindrical pommel at\nthe bottom. The weight of this claymore is\n4.5 pounds and it is perfectly balanced. Upon\nthe length of the blade are number of\nGorundyr runes. The grip is wrapped in\nleather that is tied nicely at the\ncrossguard. This Gorundyr blade is made of\nslayersteel, and will easily cut through any\nundead being.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PosidonX7.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Prison Shank", "", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("poo boy sword", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Grizzly Bear Pelt", "A Soft and Rich color Grizzly bear pelt,\nwhich is nice and soft, and warm!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:brown_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("The Scary Pumpkin of Victory", "This pumpkin was won by tripping an Orc in a\nduel. The Orc would have won a horse, clearly\nthe worse end of the deal. This horse\nsymbolizes that pumpkins are superior to\nnearly all.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Runik'Kal.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Scepter of The Dragonlord", "", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Excalibur", "An iron sword with a better designed hilt,\nabout as efficient as your normal sword\nthat's used in the military though just\nbetter looking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Chimera Weeds", "Once the herb was in your system, minutes\nafter, you'd be placed in a zombie like\nstate.", "minecraft:yellow_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Gubglib sends his regards... see yu laytur at duh wedding", "", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Fox-hide Satchel Pack", "The beautiffuly crafted backpack would\ncontain a varity of different bottles of\nhealing herbs , and medical items. The\nsatchel would contain , Tippens root,\nBlisfoil, Night-Sap, Serpents Stalk , Atheros\n, Drakes Tail , and a few unknown toxens. The\nsatchel would also contain a wound stitching\nkit , a metal rod , many various bandages , a\nflip knife , and a small amount of general\nsurvival essentials.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Maxine Luftuns.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("LUERLENT", "Red-brown pot for indoor or outdoor use. Fine\nMali'aheral earthenware.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("bread with aids", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Serenity", "It would smell like liquor and a small smell\nof Berries, if drank their Reflexes would be\nenhanced for 5 minutes then their muscles\nwould tense up and they'd feel ill for an\nhour, may induce anger and temporary extra\nstrength\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Gold and Diamond Wedding Ring", "A thin rose gold band, with small vines\ntwisting up the sides to form the head of the\nring. A large rounded diamond would be placed\nin the centre, surrounded in a halo style\nhold. The phrase “Amor Vincit Omnia” would be\nengraved across the band\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("(( Hover your mouse over the paper inside your inventory to see the message ))", "Want to help people in need? Try joining the\nOzara. A group of good hearted people\ndedicated to helping all. For an interview\nplease talk or send a bird to Jaya Jayamen ((\nSofetios )). We are located north of the\ncloud temple. Housing available.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Diamond", "A small diamond made as a gift for special\npeople. It isn't very flamboyant however\nstill is a pretty gift to give to friends and\nfamily!", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Marcy's Old Saber", "Now a memento of the past, the enchanted\nSaber hums lightly.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Marcy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~Lashing Whip~", "This Whip is used to punish criminals for\ntheir wrongdoings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Man at Arms] Umar ibn salem.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderation Note", "Hey , so you npc at Adria has been removed.\nPlease refrain from making further npc's like\nthis - Mod Manger Pun- Pun#6347\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pun_Themis.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Potion of Infertility", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Viking Axe", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Arborian Strap-On Saddle", "This worn out and dingy saddle features\nlittle else apart from the many wears and\ntears on its leather skin, save for an 8-inch\nphalus in the middle of its seating. The\nsaddle would be completely useless unless its\nshit-stained peak was inserted.", "minecraft:saddle", ""),
        StaticItem("Large spider head", "This beasty head was once on top of a large\nspider the size of which would make your skin\ncrawl. It was slain by the dwarves of\nkaz'ulrah.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashes", "The ashes of a Strigae", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Wanton Soup", "Delicious and tasty Wanton Soup\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Officer] Aewion Silma.", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("The Crystalline Romantics", "A purple crystal carved into the shape of the\ntwo lovers Arwenia and Aewion Silma. They\nwould be holding eachother in a tight and\npermanent embrace, an enternal kiss taking\nplace between them. From Aravae and Carven.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ixli.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Tea herbs!", "A collection of green tealeaves, sourced\nfreshly from the curon forest!", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("definitely bandages", "", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Coconut Palm Frond Broom", "", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("fuck off you shill", "go get your own fucking food you worthless\ndutch maggot\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by fuck off sandey.", "minecraft:potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Berry Pie", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Fishing Rod", "The hook to this rod is well maintained;\nshiny and sharp", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Tusk", "A three-foot curved tusk that once adorned\nthe jaw of a Haensetian Mother Bear. Though a\nfierce hunter, the Mother Boar met its end at\nthe hands of some hardy huntsmen from Markev.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Amador Nectar", "To be fair you have to have very high IQ to\ndrink this.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Shining Glaive", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooled Longsword", "A weapon crafted with expertise like none\nother, the entire length of it a work of art.\nThe aurum gave off crisp aura, a cold\nsensation coming to those who touch it. Along\nthe crossguard was an inscription, and on the\nleather grip a stamp reading 'RHY'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Orvar Ash Beating Stick", "Get ready to hit Orvar. Hit him.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf Necklace", "A rare craft, forged from a Vanir direwolf\nupon it's death. Engraved is the name \"Embra", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Necklace", "A rare craft, forged from a Vanir direwolf\nupon it's death.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Dance", "A light dagger, made of daemonsteel. The\nhandle would be wrapped in a leather like\nmaterial, stained a soft ebony color. Real\ngold would wrap the quillion of the dagger, a\nsmall purple orb resting easily in the\ncenter. In all, this object is easy to handle\nand lightweight, great for throwing and/or\ncutting things open.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Merisify.", "minecraft:iron_sword", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_35(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Vine and Leaf Ring", "A silver band, with leaves and vines encasing\naround it. The leaves would have incredible\ndetail, with an encasing of gold lining it.\nThe ring itself would be fit for a man, fit\nfor an index finger or middle finger. Inside\nof the band it would have words etched into\nit, reading ‘Lothric’ with a heart at the\nend.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Merisify.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Brown Gauntlets", "A pair of brown gauntlets, wrapped in\nleather. The knuckles would be made of small\nparts of iron, leather stitched over. Great\nfor punching, or breaking things open.Its\ninside would be made of a soft cloth and fur,\ndyed white.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Merisify.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Beautiful Emerald Ring", "An excellent quality piece of Haensetic\ncrafstmanship, the inner band has a makers\nmark from The Wulf & The Bear Trading Co. Set\nwith a nearly flawless gem in a Haensetic\nSilver band. The gem is surrounded by tiny\nGold roses and vines.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("A Fine Quill", "Before you is a perfectly luxuriant Huia bird\nfeather, the top a lavish white and the main\npart flowing downwards to the platinum,\ndiamond-encrusted base, a soothing brown\ncolour.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Amethyst Trail Necklace", "A large platinum based necklace would dangle\nfrom the wearer’s neck, adorning six\nperfectly pressed amethysts surrounded by\nmany diamonds: the largest of which set at\nthe corners of chain.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rothchild Family Tiara", "Here is an emerald-diamond tiara. Stretching\naround were a very large array of six hundred\ncarat diamonds, ranging in size -\nasymmetrical pattern for those of the largest\nsize and cost in the middle. Pointing on the\ntop were a row of pear shaped, 500 carat\nemeralds.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Ball", "A glowing glass ball that was held above the\nground by a golden base. A small candle,\nunnoticeable, would go through the bottom and\nif lighted it would cause the entire ball to\nglow brightly!", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Pear Earrings", "A pair of white golden based earrings, on\neach side three diamonds, a smaller one\nstarting at the base, another beneath the\nfirst at a slightly larger volume and\nfinally, a large pear shaped one hanging\nbeneath the two above.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sleeping Pearls", "Three strands of pearls, each following each\nfollowing the other around a glowing platinum\nbase in the shape of a pentagon. Engraved\neloquently onto the metal was a large\nsapphire, encompassed by an array of\ndiamonds.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Arched Diamond Tiara", "A large white golden diadem, arching over the\nwearer’s head in a fashionable style. Hanging\nfrom some of the more intricate arches,\nbeneath the main were pearls shaped ovaly.\nApart from the pearls, were diamond, all of\nabout equal size and in the same pattern\nalong the base of piece.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Iaspis Viridis", "A beautiful pair of emerald earrings, the pin\npart of them made of gold and a small diamond\nlay perched in the middle of the emeralds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blue Pearl", "Many pearls were hung across a string of\nsilk, a path of luxury around the wearer’s\nneck, leading towards a large and beautiful\ndiamond that strung in the middle. Attached\nto a small platinum base, the diamond roared\na majestic beauty. ‘A de Savin Diamond’", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Silver Leaf Tiara", "Expensive platinum here has been molded into\nthe shape of leafs, curving into a majestic\nform and coated with an array of diamond,\nencompassing the curves around six large\npearls, going from one side to the other of\nthe wearer’s head.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Diadem of Pectus", "A Diadem, otherwise known as a tiara. It is\nmade of pure silver and shined vigorously in\nany sort of light - at the rising centre of\nthe piece of art was a large 400 Carat\nDiamond. Hanging from the diadem jingles many\nsmaller diamonds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cervus", "A lengthy 6'0 sword (5 feet) with the symbol\nof a stag engraved on its prommel. The blade\nis characterized by distinctive patterns of\nbanding and mottling reminiscent of flowing\nwater, such as those found in Damascus Steel\nblades. A cursively written sentence carved\non one side of the blade, Undecipherable by\nmost - \"Honor all living things\" can be read\nfor those familiar with the Cervitaurian\ntongue\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetian Bastard Sword", "A heavy bastard sword of cold Haensetian\nsteel. It's plain in design, but practical in\npurpose; if kept sharp, the edge can easily\nrend flesh, while the blade itself is heavy\nenough to break bones. A bear's paw print is\nimprinted on the blade's smooth surface. The\nhilt and pommel are plain, both brass, and\nwrapped in sheepskin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Edward Audemar Barbanov.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A glob of shit", "a piece of shit that represents the person\nthat this is given to perfectly", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Frostfall, Voidbow of Malevolence", "Found upon the remains of the Frost Wyrm\nTharrax, this bow was used by the creature of\nnightmare Mau'drozom in her assault in\nHalsworthy. How it ended up here, one may\nnever know. Inscribed along the Winteroak are\nstrange runes that would glow a deep green in\nthe dark. Interactable. [Legendary]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Mana Crystal", "Within this crystal would be a burning arcane\nessence, almost as if the very core radiated\nmagical power, a font for those who could\nbend the magic stored within this crystal,\nthe size of three normal crystals of the same\ntype.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Blowgun Darts", "A bundle of darts used for a blowgun. A small\nnumber would be inked onto the side of the\nbundle: 30 ct.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Square-Cut Ruby Ring", "A finely-cut square ruby, polished to\nperfection. It would glint in any form of\nlight, the gemstone affixed to a slim golden\nband engraved with intricate swirls. Sold by\nthe Thylseales Jewelry Co.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sea Pearl Diamond Earrings", "These earrings exhibit a unique sense of\nallure with white sea pearls and accented\ndiamonds. Crafted in glinting pure aurum,\nthese earrings feature a large sea pearl\nnestled amoung 82 sparkling round cut accent\ndiamonds that form a halo around the massive\nsea pearl.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dasdi.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Emberblood Ring", "Within your hand rests a miniscule ring\ninlaid with a single, blue diamond crafted\ninto the shape of a star. The silver band is\nintricately inscribed with several embers\nforming the shape of a man, and they smolder\never so slightly. To most this ring would do\nnothing when worn, and fewer still are aware\nof the innate power it holds. Should it be\nworn by an Ascended, however, they would feel\ntheir form shift drastically as their\ninherited flame is strengthened. The hair and\neyes would take on softer, lighter hues\nwhilst their skin pales. The flame within\nthem remedying any imperfections in the\nprocess of Soul Blanching that all Ascended\nundergo. Usable by T3 and up.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 10, column 4)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Freyja's Carved Step Stool", "", "minecraft:spruce_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Anoros", "The stone is flat enough on one side to hold\na large and rather complex rune. Upon the\napplication of the blood of he who wishes to\nuse it, the rune compels nothing but truth to\nflow from your speech as long as the holder\nis willing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zahrer Irongrinder.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Wickerwood Switch", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Honey Mead", "A hearty and belly-filling mead rests here,\nfrothy and delicious. If drank, hints of\nnutmeg and honey could be tasted amoungst the\nother Gorundyr spices, leading to a tasty and\nfilling drink for those long and cold winter\nmonths. A favorite of any town drunk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Viking Longsword", "For those who seek freedom, strike swift.\nis written within the steel\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Questgiver] Yulia Keint.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Otaminn'je fahdon (feathered Macuahuitl)", "This is a gorundyr styled macuahuitl. This\nmassive club type weapon is made of oak wood,\nmultiple black steel blades stick out of the\nsides of this weapon. The macuahuitl is\nrather large so smaller people might have to\nhold it with both hands, black stainned\nleather is wrapped around the handle aswell.\nRunes run down the entire weapon,\"Gorr'ga\nklubbur\" is carved down the wood. A few\nfeathers are tied to the top and bottom of\nthe club giving a gorundyr feel to it. Truely\na masterful weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl Earrings", "Graceful and elegant, the white freshwater\npearl and sterling silver earrings are eye\ncatching and memorable. The large white\npearls stand out against the Sterling Silver\nlever back hoops.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evert Lyons.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Ice Gemstone", "The gemstone would shine in the light, cut by\nan expert Jeweler.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by premiumroleplay.", "minecraft:diamond_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Epee de Moyien", "A foreign weapon, it looks Harian made but\nembellished with Auvergnian steel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharajyr White Peak Armor", "The Guard Uniform of White Peak, made to the\nsize of a Kharajyr.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mast. Blacksmith] Bjorn Adigard.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem(";)", "", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Popcorn", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Merry Fishmas", "A gutted out fish with all the insides\ncleansed and eyes cut out, if one were to\nlook into the eye holes they would see\nMerry' on the left and 'Krugsmas' on the\nright\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("~Ominous Broadsword~", "A wide,double edged steel blade with golden\netching of leaves and roots.The two handed\nHilt made from cherry wood, giving it pink\nbrown color. Detailed with golden vines,and\ngolden pommel and forward angled arms.Comes\nwith black leather sheath.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arwenia Kaeronin.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Apple", "", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Skipper1931", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson Stone", "A translucent crimson stone big enough to fit\nin one's palm. It is light and quite jagged,\nappearing as though it has been chipped all\nover.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("CHEESE", "A very suspicious looking cheese", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Maddened Scribblings", "A leatherbound book, seemingly average in\nevery way. The insides are filled with\ndrawings of figures with elongated bodies,\nmen being torn to bits by roots and other\ngruesome images. The writing is nearly\nunreadable, ink smeared and text frantic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Solaria Soulheart.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Tathvir Dragon Doll", "A small doll made of hay, cloth, and buttons,\nforming a small dragon, Or atleast, as close\nto a dragon as one would recall they look\nlike.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nafari.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Custom Infusion Ticket", "You can exchange this ticket for a\npersonalized holy weapon/trinket at the \"Holy\nShop\" (Pm Suxals to make your request)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Jagged Necklace", "A necklace with a jagged stone at the end\nroughly the size of a coin. It hangs from a\nfirm dark leather string. The stone is\ncoupled with various small carved bone beads\nat either side while the stone itself has\nvarious red runes carved into it. The runes\nalways illuminate a soft red glow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Illiran Drennan.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Bracelet", "A beautiful silver bracelet which appears to\nbe in brand new condition. It is perfectly\npolished and the linking is of a masterful\ncraft. The links are covered with darkened\nsilver scales, only adding to the relic's\nbeauty. The centerpiece of the bracelet is\nshaped into an oval bearing multiple red\nrunes carved into it. These runes would\nalways radiate a soft red glow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Illiran Drennan.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Sack", "A black sack used to kidnap people so they\ndon't know where they are going. It would be\nideal to knock the victim unconscious first\nbefore putting this on them", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Length of Dyed Hair", "This neatly-tied lock of hair appears to have\nbeen dyed after it was cut with pure indigo\ndye.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Book", "A black leatherbound book with fine workings\ninto the cover that depict a swirling mass of\ntentacles moving out from the center.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Block of Redstone", "This block of rock candy is huge! It is very\nsweet, and jagged all over from its crystals.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Spriggancraft Living Shield", "An oversized and gnarled wooden shield\ncovered in jagged bark and messily dispersed\nleaves. Much like its creator the shield is\nheavily resistant to mundane fire, but\nexceptionally weak to magical and draconic\nflame.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cielosoro.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Heavy Crossbow =~", "A masterfully crafted Heavy Crossbow, with\nSteel Limbs, and a Wooden Bowstave.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Steward] Bjorn Adigard.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Saddle", "A dark brown, leathery, saddle embroidered\nwith fine golden lines. Majestic as it was\nbeautiful, the object could be efficiently\nused for any means of equestrianism.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caranthir_.", "minecraft:saddle", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Dagger", "The dagger's hilt would be of soft and\nbounded leather, the weight distribution even\non both ends, the golden blade seeming fresh\nand sharp, whilst the hilt was adorned with\nvines and roses\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ballad of Sif the Terrible", "The Ballad of Sif the Terrible, popular among\nelvenkind. A somber piece to sing by the\ntavern fire on cold nights.\nSignature: Commodus de Jedih", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood-cursed Ascended Ash", "These seem to be the ashes of an ascended,\nbut curiously, they are not disappearing to\nsmoke. They are tainted with a foul, red,\nsticky substance, like congealed blood. To\npurify these ashes, they must be cast into\nred, blue, and then gold soulfire braziers,\nspending one elvish day in each color of\nflame.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [I Spread] Praepando.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Ash Tree Imprint", "This is an imprint of an Ash tree, taken from\nthe body of a great spider. It is made in\nblood. It has a distinct writhing style.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [!].", "minecraft:oak_planks", ""),
        StaticItem("gold dust", "", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Beating Stick", "A savage club of orkish craft engraved with\nOld Blah.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Wonk Spear", "This Spear Is Made With A Weak And Bendy\nWood, Holding A Golden Metal Spike At The\nPeak Of It.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kizaura.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Break the Cities", "Your blight healing damages processed wood,\nstone, and metal, at a rate ten percent that\nof normal, in a radius of thirty meters.\nHerbs enhanced through your herblore, when\nconsumed by a non-druid magic user, cause\npowerful nausea, reducing the rank of their\nmagics by one for twenty-four hours. This\neffect does not stack. This item works for\nthe signed name, so long as September wills\nit.", "minecraft:red_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gracious Prince, Make Aegis Whole", "When you roll to create a soul tree, increase\nyour roll with a modifier of +30. Soul trees\nmade in this fashion permanently destroy the\nbody used for Awakening, have autumnal\ncolors, and produce sap which can be used for\nThulean Druidism, with properties as blood.\nThis sap is also present in the Tree Lord.", "minecraft:lapis_lazuli", ""),
        StaticItem("Mushroom Lord", "Your Soul Tree transforms into a mushroom of\ncomparable size, and your Tree Lord body is\nnow composed of chitin, about as tough as\nwood. You become fond of decaying landscapes,\nand rot. You may disperse spores, with stats\nas a spriggan. This items works for the\nsigned name, so long as September wills it.", "minecraft:bone_meal", ""),
        StaticItem("Live for the Trees", "You can no longer be ordered by druids,\nexcept for the September Prince. You can\nsense the pain of trees within one-hundred\nmeters. This item works for the signed name,\nso long as September wills it.", "minecraft:blue_orchid", ""),
        StaticItem("Fungimancer", "You may pick any two of the three effects\nwhen casting spore expulsion, and use both at\nonce. Your spores additionally affect a\nfifteen block radius, instead of ten. Fungus\nand mushrooms now grow on your body. This\nitem works for the signed name, so long as\nSeptember wills it.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Pleasure of Carnage", "You hunger for the flesh of sapient\ncreatures. You can ignore any amount of pain,\nand your skin takes on a red coloration. Your\nhorns grow coiled, and your strength\nincreases by twenty percent. This item works\nfor the signed name, so long as September\nwills it.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Life's Swansong", "You gain one rank of communion and control,\nwhile playing music. Additionally, after\nlistening to it for fifteen continuous\nminutes, other non-fae creatures will\nexperience druidic dissociation, in the form\nof a sense of well-being, slothfulness, and a\nstrong feeling of oneness with nature. This\nitem works for the signed name, so long as\nSeptember wills it.", "minecraft:oxeye_daisy", ""),
        StaticItem("Freygoth's Plot", "When your shaman powers cause damage to\npassive animals or plants, or natural\ninorganic features, over the next twenty-four\nkrug's hours, they will be healed back to\ntheir normal status. Freygoth has vision\nthrough your eyes. This item works for the\nsigned name, so long as September wills it.", "minecraft:white_tulip", ""),
        StaticItem("Hoofmind", "You have immunity to illusion and mental\nmagics, but your intelligence is reduced to\nthat of a deer during the magic's duration.\nThis item works for the signed name, so long\nas September wills it.", "minecraft:skeleton_skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Grace Eternal", "Your hooves leaving heatless green fire,\nwhich burns for three elven minutes, and\ncleanse the ground directly beneath them of\ntaint, and processed wood, stone, and metal,\nto a depth of one foot. You cannot be slowed\nby natural barriers (e.g. mud, or thorns).\nThis item works for the signed name, so long\nas September will sit.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Life and Death and Love and Birth", "If you are slain, and your killer is\nthemselves slain within the next twenty-four\nelven hours, a flower will sprout from their\ncorpse. It will blossom after ten elven\nminutes, and you will be reborn from it. This\nitem works for the signed name, so long as\nSeptember wills it.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Fertilize", "You may water your tree with the blood of a\nslain descendant to gain 15% of their\nstrength, agility, and constitution for\ntwenty-four elven hours. Your skin takes on a\nreddish hue. This item works for the signed\nname, so long as September wills it.", "minecraft:oak_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Fight My Love", "You gain one rank of communion and control\nwithin two-hundred meters of your tree. Your\ntree is immune to non-magical fire damage,\nand can attack others autonomously by waving\nits branches at them (strength as Olog). This\nitem works for the signed name, so long as\nSeptember wills it.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Union of Flesh and Wood", "This item binds a dryad and spriggan, who\npossess the same tree, together. The dryad\nand spriggan are in constant telepathic\ncontact, and have the ability to share their\nsenses with each other at will. Fertilize and\nFight My Love now also apply to the spriggan\ncompanion, if possessed. This item works for\nthe signed names, so long as September wills\nit.", "minecraft:jungle_log", ""),
        StaticItem("Mariee's Longsword, Blood-Cursed", "This is an unremarkable longsword, worn with\nage. It is coated in a congealed black-red\nooze, that cannot be removed by mundane\nmeans. To cleanse this blade, it must be\npassed through blue, red, and golden soulfire\nbraziers, spending one elven day in each\ncolor of flame.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [I Spread] Praepando.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of ID55", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Fallingwood Shards", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Water of the Seasons", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Skofnug", "The Hatchet of Hakon Ruric, a gift given to\nhim when he was dubbed \"The Shipwright\" by\nJohn Horen I.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Horse", "", "minecraft:oak_planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Devvy's Staff Report", "Watch out, you could be next!", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Rum", "A sweet rum, fabricated by multiple fruits,\nalcohol and spices, giving the drink an\nunderlying kick when consumed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Raelynn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Roman Gladius", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Whoopingstick", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Respirator", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cobblestone Stairs", "leftovers of the horridly rafted Reiver fort.\nYou can see the salt in the foundation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:stone_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Cobblestone Slab", "leftovers of the horridly rafted Reiver fort.\nYou can see the salt in the foundation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Clockwork Crossbow", "A peculiar mechanism borne of engineering and\na practiced hand. It is somewhat akin to a\nmunitions crossbow but with a crank to aid\none during the reloading process as well\nmodified bits within. There is a built-in\ncartridge based systems for projectiles,\nnamely bolts. The design of the mechanism is\nforeign to those unacquainted with clockwork\nintracacies and workings. ((Contact Skylez1\nfor more information))", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA", "", "minecraft:beetroot", ""),
        StaticItem("Battlestaff", "", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fresh Blood", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Jellystone", "Petrified ooze, filled with an overexposure\nof natural energies. The flavorful taste\nbounded with exotic sweetness, and a hint of\noak texture. The perfect treat for your\nresident lifesucking entity! Or just a yummy\ncandy rock.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Experiment #11.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Calming", "A plain amulet of small iron links, a dull\nstone dangling from it, when one wears it ,\nthey would have an unexplained sense of calm\nand collectedness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("White Gold Bracelet", "An elegant bracelet, fashioned purely of a\nbeautiful shimmering white gold. It's sized\nto fit an average wrist of a woman!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand-Carved Bow.", "Sat in your hands would be a hand-carved bow,\nMade from oaken woods of the Mali'ame Forest.\nIt wouldn't be too intricate but it clearly\nwas just made for one purpose. However,\ngraved into the belly of the bow would be a\ngathering of leaves, Representing the tree it\ncame from. For the grip was just a tanned\nleather coil. A simple bow for simple use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ElevenJellyBeans.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashen beauty", "Asscher cut diamond with trapezoids with pave\nsurround in a split shank pave ring. In back\nof the ring there would be carved initials M\n& T.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Minecraft Block", "This item is a block from Minecraft and is\nhere to remind you that this is just a block\ngame. Dont be salty over a block game.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Minecraft Bully] Hamnil Frostbeard.", "minecraft:prismarine", ""),
        StaticItem("Nasal's Bane", "The blade which slew the noseless face of the\npeople\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ___Jacko_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tesco Leather Jacket", "col", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Well-Used Satchel", "The satchel of Evar'tir, Praetor of the\nDominion. It appears to have been looted\nheavily and discarded, with it's owner\ndisappearing with it..\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusionary Cuff", "A plain wrist cuff of dull iron, seemingly\nnothing of worth as the cuff is unadorned.\nThough when one taps the cuff three times the\npurpose is revealed. when someone does so\nthere eyes would seemingly change to a doe\nlike brown color, there mouth also would\nbecome disguised.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Candleholder", "A bronze candleholder, ideal for holding\ntaper candles.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("~Golden Attendance Medal~", "A golden medal in the shape of a leaf, given\nto those virarim who have shown great\nattendance and commitment to the Virarim.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Praetor] Arwenia Silma.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant's Small Toe", "The giant's toe is green, and serves as an\nexcellent trophy for -perhaps- defeating a\ngiant!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:jungle_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("bad boy compass", "Arcane I\nfor bad boys\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Langeschwanz.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Double Edged Bronze Shortsword", "A double edged blade made of bronze with a\nmild widening near the upper half of the\nblade. The sword is properly smoothened and\nshined, making it quite lustrous under light.\nThe blade seems to widen out ever so slightly\nnear the upper part of the blade, near the\ntip, being of what is referred to as a 'leaf\nshaped blade. The handle is made of oakwood,\ntreated with linseed oil. [For OOC visible\nreference, this is a 'Ewart Park Sword']\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Headsman's Axe", "The dark-tinted, one-bladed axe has a rather\nlong haft made of ebony wood. The axe always\nhas a slight dark red tint to it due to its\npurpose, but the actual metal is forged from\na rather sturdy black ferrum, with the blade\nslightly embellished to have rather rigid\ndesigns upon it. The haft's bottom has also\nbeen covered with a black iron nub, evidently\nto prevent the bottom of the wood from being\ndamaged when placed against the ground.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby and diamond stoned ring", "A large oval-shaped ruby sits in the centre\nof this ring, with smaller diamonds rimming\nthe edge of the halo-style head. Diamond\ninserts also line the upper half of the band,\nfading into a plain silver base.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Purest Diamond Engagement Ring", "A large Diamond centerpiece with Black\nSapphires surrounding it.. The Diamond is\nshaped in a unique circular pattern with the\nBlack Sapphires laid forming around the gem\ncenterpiece.. Exquisite craftsmanship.. all\nof this is laid on a 48k Gold Band with two\nsmall ruby feathers fitting onto the sides..", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Parrot", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Renatian Officers Shortsword", "An ornately made shortsword, forged with\nblack ferrum, the darkened steel containing a\nwavy design running the whole length. The\npommel is embossed with the Dragon of\nRenatus, a golden inscription reads 'For your\nservice as an officer, you have the Kingdoms\ngratitude.' Another inscription reads,\nForged by Caleb Crider, Master Smith of\nBelvitz.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Top Hat", "A rather fancy looking top hat that smells of\npumpkins. Within its interior is a small tag\nthat says 'You'll never get my real hat,\nbiggun!'. As you closer inspect the hat, it\nseems to be a well replicated copy of the\noriginal.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Snakefish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Sandfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Mace", "A rather unimpressive yet well-forged mace,\nperfect for unambigious and humble folk; or\nthose who cannot afford a weapon of a more\nregal quality.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Elder Nemorsa's Tongue", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Glass", "", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Prismarine Shard", "A lovely necklace that is formed from a shard\nretrieved within salty waters. It lays within\na wire base, it curved and twisted to be\nsecured in place. It was gripped onto by a\nsmall claw-like contour, hung down by a\nseries of interlocking chains\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by To Harlan from Hillith.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Faded Yar Necklace", "A very old necklace carved from a shark's\ntooth. It vaguely retains the shape of clan\nYar's turtle insignia.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whimsycal.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand Master Piano Installation Voucher ~Jaya Jayamen", "A voucher good for one Grand Master Piano\ninstallation. Comes with the piano, a sound\ntype for the piano (Normal, Bass,\npluck((guitar)), and wind((flute)), and free\ntuning for life. Signed by Jaya Jayamen. ((\nContact me for installation. Username:\nSofetios ))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsteel Breastplate", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsteel Boots", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsteel Helmet", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Basket of Assorted Herbs", "A hand-woven basket, with crimson rope\nthreated throughout the body of it. Filled\nwith an assortment of herbs, such as;\nBlissfoil, Frost Vine, Serpent's Stalk,\nTippen's Root and so on.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kythaela.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Crate of Medicinal Herbs", "A wooden crate, smelling of herbs and\nincense. Upon opening the crate, bushels of\nmedicinal herbs would be present, such as,\nbut not limited to; Blissfoil, Draugr\nTongues, Frost Vines, Serpent Stalks,\nTippen's Root and a few jars of Aqua Nymphs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kythaela.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Carcass", "A carcass of a rabbit, freshly killed...", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Buck Carcass", "A corpse of a stout male buck. It appears to\nhave been freshly killed!", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Harpy Feather", "A feather from a harpy, a woman-eagle beast.\nIt has alchemical properties, but one is\nunsure of what kind.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Virarim Helmet", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("His real dad", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Noob Weapon", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("sweaty butt", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Broad-Head Piercer Munition", "These arrows made of ferrum material weigh a\nstandard 580 grains each, the arrowheads and\nbroad shaped, designed for normal use from\nhunting small game to full out war\nskirmishes. The shafts are made of dark\nspruce lumber refined to a light flexible\nmass that can be manipulated with ease. The\nflights are dyed black and red in striped\nfashion. These arrows are generally for\nhunters, newbie and veteran alike.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of J33xt101", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Muu's Diamond Ball", "This tiny diamond ball appears to sparkle\nlike a rainbow, it seeming to pulse with\nMuu's heartbeat. Its surface covered in drool\nfor some reason.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice shoes", "These shoes grip to the cold ice much better\nthan any metal grieeves or leather boots\nwould. The fur near sticks to the ice.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("The Glittering Carbarum Necklace", "An article of jewelry wrought of cast iron\nand carbarum gems, it would be beautiful and\nimpart feelings of serenity, peace and\nbalance to the wearer. Forged in recent\ntimes, the gems are pristine and seem to\nglow, ancient runes complimenting the slim\nwork of metal.", "minecraft:diamond_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Gauntlet of Returning", "A crudely made Iron Gauntlet with a sapphire\nembedded into the back of it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KetchenX.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Statuette of BLESSED Jack Rovin", "A gold-plated statuette of BLESSED Jack\nRovin. Upon his chiseled torso, a Lucienist\ntabard is depicted waving freely, blade in\nhand. His blue eyes were replaced with\nsparkling emeralds, and his golden hair the\nsame as the statuette itself. Should one\nredeem this to Ser Pius, they may be afforded\na singular favor from the Order of the Red\nDragon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:totem_of_undying", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Medallion", "A badge awarded to Quigo Torena for killing\nNorlanders in the field during the defense of\nthe city. This signifies he got at least\nthree or more kills in battle. It gleams\nproudly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aspectist.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Badge", "Signifies Quigo Torena was conscripted for\nthe Ithelanen Brigade. All proud Brigadiers\nwear this on their chest to signify their\nwork in the field.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aspectist.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("I WILL DRINK FROM YOUR SKULL", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("✺꧁◊⋄ Barding of the Dusk-Strider ⋄◊✺", "Pale and luminous golden plate framed with\nheavy, crimson cloaking where the steed’s\nhindquarters and shoulders would be. The\narmor appears aged, yet shines still like the\nfinal hours of twilight at the behest of a\ncareful hand. Wrought into the chanfron,\ncrinet, and tail-guard are embellishments of\nthorny ivy and roses - and at the tail the\ntwining ivy blossoms with castings of long\nand elegant feathers. Studs of glittering\nchampagne-tinted crystals dapple the cloaking\ntowards the gold-silk trim, in reverent\nlikeness to the first emergence of stars at\ndusk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TwilightWolf9012.", "minecraft:golden_horse_armor", ""),
        StaticItem("Scaled Venator Hide", "Hard like boiled leather, and covered in dark\ngreen scales that reflect light poorly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Head of an Elf", "A bloodied male Elven head, \"gifted\" to the\nDominion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DiscoLiquid.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Leafblade Claymore: A Principio =~", "A longsword forged in the fires of White\nPeak, in the County of Götha in 1659 under\nthe close supervision of Count Eimar var\nBurgundar, the blade weighing 1,4 kilograms,\nwith a fine tip for thrusts and a leaf shaped\nblade for a strong cut the sword having been\nsharpened to the point of being able to shave\na man\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkways Inn Hat", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkways Inn Tea", "I mean, it LOOKS like tea.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:milk_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("what the fuck is this", "yeah I don't know about this one\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:lava_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of wurfv", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Spruce Rough-Hewn Composite Bow", "In your hands looks to be a rough designed\neastern based replica of composite bow. The\nshort frame makes it easily confusing for a\nrecurve topping off at 42 inches, the rough\ndesign of southern spruce wood tells a tale\nof proper reinforcement. The main advantage\nof composite bows were similar draweight with\nsimilar power, resulting in a quicker\naim-time with little delay. The highest draw\none can expect from this bow is around 70\npounds of force for a 540 grain arrow\n(Standard)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Charm", "A Tusk and various other bones tied to a\nstring, harvested from a boar. It honours the\nBeast Mani who bless the hunt.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Eagl'aja askr (Ranseur)", "This is a gorundyr styled spear. The head of\nthe spear is made from black steel and is\ndesigned with many odd runes giving a\ngorundyr feel to it. The long shaft of the\nspear is made from ash wood making it\nflexible and strong,\"Langur starfsfol \" is\ncarved down the shaft of the spear. The butt\nof spear is decorated with a few black, bown\nand gray feathers and the spear is 7ft long\nfor far reach. The spear is very well\nbalanced and very well made, Clearly the work\nof a masterful crafter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Keystone", "A shining gem of ancient antique. It is\ngrooved with purpose. Perhaps to unlock\nsomething.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Sul", "A beautifully crafted slayersteel longsword\nof elvish craft, with many intricate designs\ncarved upon the blade. It would be blessed\nwith Clericalism, capable of having the Light\nheld within drawn upon for use by a casting\nCleric or by merely allowing the weapon to\nburn away impure entities it makes contact\nwith. On each side of the blade is carved;\nKae'naeri Tenna Elaetah'eth.\" PM Fury_Fire\nfor more details.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Agent Orange", "Upon consumption of this beverage, the user\nwill find the urge to fight socialism and all\nit's vile ilk. However, at the cost of\nputrid, pungent, decaying skin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yung_N_Hung.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Good Stuff", "A potent stew of Zawabate and Phoenix tear\nsap brewed to induce an intense psychedelic\nexperience ((estimated to last roughly half\nan IC day if consumed in full))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheKingOfTheMoon.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("The Not-So-Good Stuff", "A potent stew of Zawabate and Phoenix tear\nsap with an added pinch of Alabaster Leaf\nbrewed to induce an intense psychedelic\nexperience... With side effects of intense\nnausea and fatigue likely causing a bad time\nfor most consumers. ((estimated to last\nroughly half an IC day if consumed in full))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheKingOfTheMoon.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Battle Bread", "This bread is full of RUSTY NAILS AND GLASS,\nINFLICT ALL THE DAMAGE, DO IT NOW!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by jdesarno.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Sycamore Seeds", "These several delicate seedlings would appear\nquite small individually. Bare-bone pods each\nin possession of a pair of seeds, spindly\nwings jutting from either side. As though\nready to take flight. Appearing none too aged\nand ready to plant!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("~= The Williams Heavy Greatsword =~", "The first hilt of the blade will have\nwilliams bloodline carved into it in cursive\non it with a unique handle design, while the\nsecond hilt is arrayed with ruby pendants\nencrusted into them while the blade has tally\nmarks carved in at the lower blade of how\nmany lives it took. As the long blade would\nget longer it would thin out by adding points\nat the tip moving back then continuing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mast. Blacksmith] Bjorn Adigard.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Plush Squid Toy", "A small, hand-made plush toy in the shape of\na squid. It would have 8 moderately-sized\narms, and two long tentacles to each side.\nTwo flat, button eyes would also be found on\nthe toy. The plush squid seemed\narticulately-made and anatomically correct.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonfruit Juice", "A mix of fruits native to the area of\nGladewynn. A secret ingredient gives the\nfruit juice a tangy kick making you want to\ndrink more.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roy D'Avre.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragons Milk Mead", "The staple of the Dragon's Den Tavern. This\nmead was specially made for those who like to\nsit back and relax with a glass of Mead in\nhand.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roy D'Avre.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Scale Tea", "A drink made for the more sophisticated\ncustomers of the Dragon's Den. Chef\nrecommends drinking it with some cakes or\npastries!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roy D'Avre.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragons Breath", "Do not drink this! I warned you...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roy D'Avre.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Petal Tea", "A strong, but sweet tasting tea that for no\nreason intoxicates the buyer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wynn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon Scale Wine", "A rich wine made with only the finest\ningredients, Moon Scale wine is the pride of\nthe Dragon’s Den. Aged in house and served\nonly as it reaches the peak of flavor, this\ndrink is a rare treasure.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Meatballs", "Horsemeat formed into small iconic round\nshapes. Most delicious in combination with\nmashed potatoes and sauce -- excellent food\nfor the hungry shopper.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Elevarir'leh Mahnihii", "A kite shield made from steel and iron wood.\nThe steel would be layered giving a sturdy\nform allowing it to withstand several blows.\nThe steel would glisten brightly in the\nsunlight, the wood being stained a dark\ncolor. In the center the the steel would be\nraised up coming to an edge and being\nslightly sharpened making it able to slash an\nopponent with it. The handle would be wrapped\nin a tanned leather giving it a comfortable\ngrift, a leave would be burned into the wood\nnear the handle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Whispering Secrets.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("The Benefactor's Boots", "The boots of a wanderer. He who walks on\nwater, he who brandishes the sceptre.\nExplosive, wear at your own risk.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Elennanore.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Bones Of A Cockatrice", "The bones originating from the ribs of a\nCockatrice.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Winterleaf Hurdy Gurdy", "This instrument resembles a violin with the\nneck folded back over the body through a\nkeybox, with 24 keys protruding from the\nside. There is a crank on the bottom and a\nwheel protruding from the body, which when\nturned causes the three drone strings to play\na constant, deep, rich tone. The keys change\nthe tone of the three melody strings, and\nprovide a deeper, violin-like sound. The body\nhas faint engravings of vines twining the\ninstrument, the Winterleaf craftsman's symbol\non the underside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Kuila Crystal Sliver", "It’s said that when a Druid utilizes their\nability the crystal begins to hum with life\nand emit a glow at the intensity of its user.\nThis one came from the corpse of a Imp, some\nof its flesh still within the piece...", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("minecraftcito", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("I Wish Tobias Staunton Was Real", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Coquito Cocktail", "An exquisite goblet with the Imperial Legions\nemblem on a label that stood wrapped around\nthe glass. This rum-spiked Coquito is\ngarnished with lightly sprinkled cinnamon or\nnutmeg. The coconut-based alcoholic beverage\nrevolutionized the way people saw drinks;\noriginated within Carolustadt of the Empire\nthough it became rather popular with the\nelven culture. It has become the signature\ndrink for the O’Hara family.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TwistedFries.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Slowness Black Arrows", "A slowness arrow, but something is wrong with\nit. The arrowtip is deep black, and wisps of\nblack smoke seem to hover and snake around\nthe wood. It feels wrong to hold it. The\nblack seems to give it no additional effects\nthan appearance.", "minecraft:tipped_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Witchdoctor Mask", "A skull cleaned and formed into a full mask,\npainted with exotic patterns.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Duhnah Skhelll Charm", "The charm would be made of aurum and iron\nalloys melted together. It would be in the\nshape of the mighty creature duhnah skhelll.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Ivory Ritual Dagger", "A ivory blade with a carved out icon of the\nyar clan. smooth yet sharp on one edge of the\nblade serrated on the other. Wrapped with a\nebony hilt.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Demigryph Pelt", "A think pelt, one would assume it came from a\nlarge lion, it is very thick and warm.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling's Grass", "A supple, chewy root,\nsmelling oddly pleasant, almost calming.", "minecraft:dead_bush", ""),
        StaticItem("Beastly Heart", "The heart of a Beastly Boar. It was filled\nwith such a rage before dying that it is\nstill beating after it was harvested from its\ncarcass. It seems the Boar had an affinity\nfor Rage.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hunter.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Femur Club of the Murûk'Thaguzg", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Senor_Tortuga.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("*Dushûrz Asht*", "A fairly large bone most likely belonging to\na mammoth. Embedded upon the staff would be\nmany spiritual emblems- most prominently the\nDuhnah Skhelll emblem. From the staff would\nhand a cluster of bones and teeth almost\nproducing chimes as well as a aurum-steel\ncharm in the shape of the Yar Emblem\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RalphGiezer.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Human Locks", "A chunk of seemingly soft locks belonging to\na certain human. The hairs are tied down into\na single braid\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RalphGiezer.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Mali'ame Locks", "A small chunk of soft red locks belonging to\nDelmira Aureon. The strands would have a\nsilky texture to the touch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RalphGiezer.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Uruk Locks", "A fairly short pony tail of coarse brown\nhair. Its untamed and soiled nature possibly\ntracing back to orcish origins\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RalphGiezer.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Human Blood", "A bottle filled with a mysterious murky\nliquid. Upon the buldge of the bottle would\nalso be a label baring the name Carolyn\nNorthman\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RalphGiezer.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mali'ker Blood", "A bottle of what seems to be a thick murky\nburgundy substance. A label upon the vile\nwould read Alydril Serene.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RalphGiezer.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Simo's Scorpion Dagger", "The handle is a finely decorated scorpion\nwith its tail being a long sickle type of\nblade, it hooked to rip flesh from bone.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Punjab Noose", "Weaved from fibers and the guts of a cat, the\nonly way to escape this omninous rope is to\nkeep one's hand raised to the level of their\neyes, thus preventing the loop from closing\naround their neck. If it is closed, agony\ngradually increases, more so with every\nstruggle. It would truly be a terrible fate\nto encounter this noose. Keep out of the\nrange of children.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Restraints of Silver", "Two pieces make of this set. A pair of silver\nshackles connected by a length of sturdy\nchain-length. Alongside these binds are a\nsilver mouthpiece oddly enough- something to\ngag and constrict the maw.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Aeriel's Bite", "A sleek dagger of sharpened steel, the hilt\nfashioned from pure silver. Two opal\ngemstones are affixed at the cross-section of\nthe weapon, on both sides. Wave-like\nengravings are carved into the hilt, intended\nto soften the look of the blade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Belka's Wand", "A finely crafted dwarven stick. It is lined\nwith a fine coat of pink paint and is\nengraved with the words 'Feel The Love' at\nthe bottom. A gold trim is seen around the\nhandle'.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Pink Present", "A strange box that gives off an odd aura to\nthose who hold it. It is incapable of being\nsmashed or pried open, regardless of the\nstrength or magical prowess of the person\nattempting. What rests inside of this box is\na mystery. Perhaps one day it will open?\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNoodle.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Forever Snowball", "A perfectly round snowball that never melts\nor loses its form. Whatever magic holds this\ntogether is a true Krugmas mystery.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Level 100 Shogging Pumpkin Helmet", "The Pumpkin Helmet Katari used when he won\nthe Shogging Competition during the Turkey\nand Pumpkins Festival on the 9th of The Grand\nHarvest, 1587!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Jandy_.", "minecraft:pumpkin", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_36(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("✢ Chunk of Spider-Queen ✢", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Spooky Pumpkin Mask", "A mask of a pumpkin, it fitting easily\nover a broad variety of faces. A\ndevilish grin stretches upon it's face,\nstaring ahead scarily.\n*DO NOT PLACE DOWN*\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Hirata Clan Katana", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aeldinic Crossbow", "This elongated, medium-sized arbalest is of\nsimple design. A stirrup is fixated unto it,\nand a hook is carved at it's end, allowing\nfor an easy way to latch it unto a baldric.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PapaVesemir.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharmandal Scimitar", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rhenôr Dwarven Axe", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Monster Repellant", "This tube would have the words 'Monster\nRepellent' wrote onto it in scruffy writing,\nif opened nothing would happen. The tube\nwould be filled with urine, and nothing else.", "minecraft:gravel", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruggine Flower", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Flex Tape", "thats a lotta damage", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("A Nomad's Guide", "The Spear's head would be sharp to a point,\nmade from the refined metal of a fallen\nmeteorite, it would seem to retain the\nattributes of the metorites metal. The shaft\nof the spear would be made with wood that of\nan Ashwood tree, engraved with exquisite\npatterns and designs this would make the\nspear itself quite light and easier for the\nuser to maneuver. It would be truely\nunfortunate for the being that finds\nthemselves in the wielder's path.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by N0tt.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Oknars Heart (Heavy Mace)", "Made solely out of Jorgundic Blacksteel, this\nweapon is oddly well balanced. It's covered\nin many places by runes, some simple, some\nreally complex, with steel handle despite\nhaving leather cover, is also decorated by\nchiseled serpent creeping up and around\ntowards the head of mace. Head itself being\nrather simple ball mace style. Large brads on\neach side make it a perfect weapon for\ndenting deeply armor, or busting its joints.\nOn leather covered handle there is a Wulfs\nDen rune.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Second Staff of Rebirth", "A long staff made of some of the strongest\nwood that a normal person could find, Along\nwith that it was studded at the ends with\ncaps of black ferrum. The middle had a nice\nleather wrap around it and on the wood was\ncarved the words 'Yar Harr!' . While at the\nopposite end was carved in the word\nExavier.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cider", "A cheap Apple cider.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Amethil Staff", "An ornately carved staff of ancient oakwood,\nbearing a great many scratches and cracks\nalong its length. Despite this it would\nremain sturdy and incredibly difficult to\nbreak. The object itself would seem quite\nwarm to the touch, and give off occasional\nglows from each individual crack present upon\nit. Atop the end would rest a pure white gem,\na strong air felt around it. Near the top\nalong its side would remain a small, glowing\nblue circle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("abc Heart of Corruption abc", "A purple orb the size of a Human's fist. It\nholds a thick milky see through outer layer,\nthe inner part having shadowy wisps of black\nmiasma moving about inside. The object would\npulsate with a pure and unretentive energy.\nIf one was to try and handle it, they might\nbe met with either vivid visions, Along with\nvoices, or a surge of toxic corruption that\nwould pour through every fiber of the\ncarrier.\n[[Not to be used in PvP.]]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:ender_pearl", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodwood Branch", "A branch taken from the bough of a bloodwood\ntree.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("⚓ Crusty Gem ⚓", "☀ A dazzling glow is given off by the gem. ☀\n✭ Underneath layers of barnacle, the glowing gem\ngives off a bright blue hue. ✭\n*Moderator Approved*\nDiscoLiquid approved this item.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("The Talisman of Hope", "Even in the most dire of times, there can still be hope\",\nwhen all else fails, and the wolves are before the gates,\nhold the Talisman tightly, and spark hope from the grasp of fear...\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sword of Songs", "Not all weapons are for war… a sword with the ability\nto emit soothing songs when struck with moonlight.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~+~Blunder-Busters~+~", "Arcane I\nA small Crystal Bottle coloured Grey in Hue\nwith a Gemstone Topper a bit larger than a\nfist that is cold to the touch. If smashed or\nopened the Bottle would suddenly produce an\nenormous amount of force caused by the\nrelease of a small Hurricane trapped inside\nthe bottle knocking down all but the heaviest\nof creatures within the range of 8 blocks. If\nused inside a small space like a room, the\nsudden pressure difference would disorientate\nand perhaps even burst the eardrums of those\nnearby as the concussive blast sweeps over\nthem. –THIS ITEM IS ONE USE ONLY-.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Notebook", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Journal", "A set of books and quills for the avid writers!", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Mucus", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand Pearl", "This is a pearl taken from an isle of rot. It\nis the size of a melon, and presents with\nsevere discoloring. It smells faintly of the\nocean.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:snow", ""),
        StaticItem("Tenebrific Tea Cup", "A simple tea cup, well designed and\nintricately made - its finish being not\nunlike glass. While holding it, the user\nwould feel a slight sense of dread, and\nanything drank from it would be slightly\ndeadened in flavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arzota.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Hermit's Shovel", "", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("tile.banner.name", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Seed Of The Big Gay", "You have planted with the Seed of Gay\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jeff.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Elvira's Adventuring Backpack", "A black backpack made of durable leather and\nbearing many pockets for different items.\nThis backpack contains the following: 1x Box\nof Matches. 1x Long Rope. 1x Big flask of\nMocha. 1x Whetstone. 1x Pouch of Food. 2x\nSimple Blankets.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Emberweave Bolt", "Looted off a Void Creature in the Firelands\nduring the Into the Firelands event.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Elephantoures Rex Fur", "This is very thick and dark fur taken from a\na large beast that ate trees.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cinderscreen Chainshirt [T5]", "A woven shirt of chainmail fashioned from the\nfinest dwarven steel. It faintly glimmers,\neven in complete darkness as faint white\nlights dance along the metal links in strange\ngeometric patterns. Those burdened by the\nmalformed souls of wicked creatures would\nfind their flesh searing with great pain\nshould they touch it unaided, their\nunprotected features likely set ablaze by the\npurest white holy flames.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Emberblood", "A small gold amulet bearing an intricate\ndesign of inlaid, white embers. To your\naverage person, this amulet does absolutely\nnothing. However when worn by an Ascended it\nwill, over time, forcefully evoke dominant\nphysical traits of an Ascended that may not\nhave naturally surfaced for a variety of\nreasons.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Blade", "The golden blade would seem to\nshine in your hand. The weapon\nitself looks to be holy in construct.\nThe hilt would have the symbol of\na Mongoose engraved into it. A\nsecond engraving of a brazier\nlit with the outline of a what\nappears to be a flame decorates\nthe base of the blade. When\nactivated by someone with a\nconnection to the song of Aeriel,\na silver light would pulse from them.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elephantoures Rex Hide", "This is the thick skin of the Elephantoures\nRex, It's skin is strong against blunt\nforces.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Natura de Flamma", "A staff made of a 6ft Acacia tree branch,\nwhich seems to bear a few cracks. Within the\ncracks, teal soulfire seem to run through the\nstaff, leading up to an orange crystal held\non top of the staff by a ferrum hold\nresembling brilliant flames wrapping\nprotectively around the crystal. The staff\nserves as a Dedicant's view that fire is\nvital of nature and how it benefits the\nbalance both negatively and positively in a\nnecessary way.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aeramus - The Kestrel Crossbow", "A wooden crossbow made from dark oak. It\nholds the carvings of kestrels within the\nwood and is rather complexly made. The string\nis strong and has a crank to pull back the\nstring, and a trigger to fire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Irenic", "Before you is a Estoc of bluesteel, sheening\ngently in the light, no cutting edge\nwhatsoever but a keen tip, meant for\npuncturing mail and plate. The basket-grip is\nis lightly curved, wyvern-bone ivory wrapped\nin fine leather, designed for one handed use\nstrangely, as if tailored to a specific\nperson,with an additional crossguard as well.\nOn the pommel is a jagged red sigil, with the\nwords \"For Eithne\" written. Great care seems\nto have been put into its make..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Meldstone", "", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Package", "A package wrapped finely and tied neatly.\nUpon unwrapping one would find a small case\nthat contained an ornant gold dagger and an\nemerald imbedded in the hilt.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Mace", "A heavy mace of frost-tempered bronze, used\nby the Knights of the Vaeyl Order and\nplundered from the storerooms of Lasthope.\nIts weighted, spiked head is engraved with\ncursive Aex letters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Elvira's Training Sabre", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("|-|[ Naromis Mocha ]|-|", "A Krugsmas mug full of a rich hot Naromis\nMocha. When drunk, the liquid tastes of a\nblend of coffee and hot chocolate, with a\nhint of hazelnut thrown into the mix. A\nspecially made drink and mug for a very\nspecial Granddaughter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Vine Noose", "", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Top 10 Egg", "", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Enderpearl", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Massive Onyx Feather", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("White Dice", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Magic Rock", "A smooth rock rests before you, giving off\nodd vibes for those who brush against it.\nUpon being held for a short amount of time,\nthe rock seems to give way to a large bouquet\nof fresh lilies that never wither. Light\nseems to shine down from the sky onto the\nperson holding it as a number of butterflies\nwould be seen fluttering about them. This\nwould only be visible to the wielder.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantPizza.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial License of Magical Arts", "Name: Tarian\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Einmana.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial License of the Magical Arts", "Issued to: Tarian\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tarian, Grand Magus of the Empire.\nSignature: Tarian, Grand Magus of the Empire", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("~Green Tea~", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hulda's Dagger", "A finely crafted steel dagger rests before\nyou, both edges honed to a razor sharpness.\nSupple black leather is wrapped around the\nhilt for a sure and firm grip. A pale blue\ngem adorns the pommel, glowing gently it is\nenchanted in such a way that it keeps the\ndaggers edge perfectly honed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fashioned Branch", "Beautiful carvings trace the natural form and\nshape of the piece. From top to bottom it\nseems to tell a story, the smooth lines\nslowly becoming more jagged as it progressed.\nOdd symbols and signs marked all over the\nlength of the stick, the meaning unknown.\nPerhaps a story? or just decoration?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TwinFeather.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Metallic Arm Cover", "A metallic cover that can go over the stump\nof a hand, and be attached on with a series\nof belts and straps. The inside of the cover\nhas thick leather and wool, providing comfort\nfor the one wearing this cover over their\nstump. At the top of the covering is a\nslightly thick metallic spike, reaching at\nsix inches and is very sharp. Both a cover\nand a weapon for someone who is handless.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Elvira's Smoking Pipe", "A small pipe made from well polished dark\noak. The pipe appears to bear the carvings of\ndragons and kestrels along the stem and base.\nIt has the initials 'E.N' on the stem of the\npipe, coloured in gold, and seems to be very\nwell taken care of.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Druidic Herbs", "These herbs are quite smelly and are quite\nfresh, despite finding them in someone's\npocket! Perhaps speaking to a Druid could\nhelp identify what they are and its usage!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Cossack Sabre", "A menacing, slightly curved blade without a\nhilt guard, designed to be wielded from\nhorse-back. 1 meter in length, steel-forged.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold and Ruby Ring", "A small golden band would a small ruby in the\nmiddle. So simplistic yet a bold statement!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheesus_Crustt.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cave Cookies", "Half of a Cave Cookie. Meant to be shared\nbetween two dwarves of different Clans. Made\nby Khimi Goldhand.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Tariem", "A swirling, bubbling and unstable liquid\nSneak or use /walk before handling!\nThis item is best transported via Llama", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Draskovits Emeritus Blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Odo's Baked Taters", "", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Aeldenic Wine", "A dry-red wine rests here, delightful on the\ntongue and best suited to red meat. This wine\nwould serve as a great intermediary for the\npalate, aged in an oak cask and with expert\nbrewing. A refined wine for someone of more\nrefined taste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Emberstream Vambrace [T5]", "An odd steel vambrace with leather strapping\nand a peculiar crimson ideogram emblazened\ninto it's center. Should one with a pure soul\ntouch the peculiar patterning, a torrent of\nrapturous soulflame will spew forth, putting\nany corrupted being into a comatose-like\nstate if they are caught in it for too long\n[PM AerielsVanguard for more info]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Starbreaker Warhammer", "A large war-hammer of a black ferrum alloy\nand of dwarven design, spanning to a whopping\n35inches with a a large, two-ended head,\ndwarven engravings stretched over the entire\nhammer, the hilt wrapped in a dark leather.\nAn anvil with three stars above it rested on\neither side of the hammers head. It weighed\nroughly 20lbs\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Stromnikar Starbreaker.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("✧⋄°•Onyx Spartan Warrior Sword •°⋄✧", "The heavy blade would curve inward before\ncurving back outward on the leaning edge.Upon\nadding mass to the blade as it expands to a\nheavy forward-cleaving edge , before\nrecurving into an efficiant point. The blade\nwould be onyx colored with a silver tint\nalong the sharp edges of the blade. The hild\nof the blade would be part of the steel blade\nwith a beattiful blue gem engraved in the\nmiddle of the crossguard.The hilt would be\nneatly wrapped in fox hide.Ingraved into the\nhilt would be Stalliano\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Maxine Stalliano.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Note #003", "Derrick's Log: \"I've finally finished setting\nup my preliminary workshop in this house. I\nfeel as if the design was a foresight on\nspace but no matter. It is calming and aside\nfrom Kyoores hounding my decisions, I can\nrelax for once.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Note #001", "Derrick's Log: Kyoores has been wondering\nwhy I've set up my lab on this tiny island\nfar removed from civilization. The answer is\nsimple. I hate crowds, and I hate politics.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Note #004", "Derrick's Log: \"The mutltitude of waterfalls\naround this island is evidence of a process\nI've decided to term, erosion. Just as time\nerodes us, water seems to erode stone. The\nsurfaces are smooth, polished, and cut into\nby water and time.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Note #002", "Derrick's Log: \"Devising an experiment to\ndetermine the origin of a mage's weakness has\nproven difficult. I'm unsure of what angle to\nstart at, and then how to go about it. How\ndoes one measure energy output?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Note #005", "Derrick's Log: \"This island is by far the\nmost beautiful representation of nature and\nbalance I've ever seen. No person on Atlas\ncomes close to such. Not even an elven woman.\nI could sit and meditate here for eternity.\nBut can't do that, can I.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Verdict", "Falling off of a cliff due to /sit does not\ncount as a glitch and thus we cannot recoverr\nyour items. Im sorry this had to happen to\nyou, next time do stay away from edges while\nusing the /sit command. May your 10 lockpicks\nrest easy..\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Aurum Ore", "", "minecraft:gold_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("Alexandra's Locket", "A gray quartz crystal is set in the silver\noutline of this locket, glinting in the\nlight. Should the wearer open it, there would\nbe a charcoal drawing of Alexandra and Elise\ngrinning at the viewer.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayersteel Bastardsword", "A masterwork slayersteel bastard sword rests\nhere, measuring 48 inches long and weighing\nabout 5 pounds. The edge of both ends of the\nblade are sharpened to a keen, practically\nglimmering in the light due to the\nconstruction. The pommel is set with\nironwood, giving it a sturdy heft to prevent\nit from being snapped in half. The durability\nwould be surprisingly supple, owing to the\nsteel laden within the mixture. Initials of\nWD' are set into the hilt, this blade would\nsee many spooks slain!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Father and Son's Rose", "A hand-sanded finish steel Rose, at the base\nbears a small insignia 'M&U", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("OwlBear Skull", "A Dented Skull of an OwlBear. The Skull seems\nto show signs of damage prior to Death.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of BigMemePVP", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart", "", "minecraft:beetroot", ""),
        StaticItem("Boner", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Dead Flower", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Saffvil Oil Mixture", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("You Suck\" Postlet notes", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Porkchop", "The porkchops were seasoned with light pepper\nand doused in a smokey rub before cooking.\nYou could smell a faint lemon along with the\nnatural flavoring. In all- it was a simple\nyet acquired technique.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Glob of Wax", "A rather large glob of tannish-yellow wax,\nthat seems to glow dully. Aside from it's\nglowing, it has no deviant properties from\nstandard wax. whether for use in a candle,\nseal, or as a glue.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Winged Screamer's Feathers", "Massive, dark feathers, clearly from some\nsort of massive bird. The wings have a clean\nsort of look to them, despite the bird's\nhorrendous fate.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceru'Ame", "A slender staff made from two materials in\nthe center melded together in a clean cut.\nThe bottom of the staff is a beuatiful dark\nmahogany. Carved into it's grain are\nbranching vines reaching upward, leaves\nsprinkled about it's carving. The Upper half\nis a long grown human's arm. Chisled into the\nhard surface would be detailed poppies and\nroses sprouting from sharp bramble branches.\nAt the base of the bone would be an intricate\nholly leaf border. A crystal spider held in\nthe hand's grasp\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("you are damned", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Captain's Compass", "A compass that has a large red 'X' engraved\non the back. It appears to be broken, as\nitalways changes direction when you move.. Or\nmaybe it isn't trying to point north. [PM\nFinalhazard for Interaction.]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ri'va T'sagari.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Deck of 'Atlas Cards", "A generic deck of 52 cards, with four\ncategories, those being spades, clubs,\nhearts, and diamonds. However, in the place\nof kings, queens, and jacks, would be\nregally-dressed Uruks.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Square Ferrum Frames", "A pair of glasses fashioned out of a singular\npiece of shaped ferrum, the frame itself was\nmundane in shape with square rims around the\nthick lenses. Though specifically sized for\nthe braincase of a specific high elf they\nweren't so oddly sized as to not fit on the\naverage person.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bboosey.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Moleman Spear", "A spear smaller than normal, with the tip\nencrusted with Mithril. The rest of the spear\nis made from fine Iron, making it quite the\nheavy weapon, unless one was short-statured.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Magnar's Flawless Dagger", "Forged as training by Magnar, this Steel\nDagger has a sharp perfect blade, a round\nguard leather grip and knob.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Hiebe Irongut&L", "", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Darius' Brew", "A drink palatable to the tastes of Darius,\nbut would kill anyone else who dares drink it\nin 5 seconds flat", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Brazen Four-Leaf Clover", "An immensely polished piece of brass shaped\ninto a four-leaf clover. Each leaf has\nidentical celtic-style engravings. They\nspread outward before dwindling off at the\nridges in a wave-esque pattern.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Full Helm", "A fine dwarven crafted full helm. The\nblacksmith who made this took his time in\nmaking this quality item.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Anbella's Hearth Hard Cider", "This drink is strong and sturdy, but not too\nsweet. It tastes heavily of the apples used\nto brew it, with a slightly-sour aftertaste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cpt_Noobman.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood-Stained War Cleaver", "The orcish weapon used to murder Tsisha, kha\nbarmaid of Holm.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mint Tea", "A pleasant tea made with mint leaves, can\nalso double as a breath freshener.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MintyKnight.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Worst Hide And Seek Player 2018", "An award given to the world's worst player of\nhide an seek\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by World's Hide and Seek Committee.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Waraxe", "A sharp axe with intricate designs, an\ninscription reads 'Krazdran, Ardol, Anart'.\nThe axe itself has a dark oak hilt and\nleather binding near the bottom for extra\ngrip, a slightly curved axe blade at the top\nmade of a strengthened steel.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Spade of Retribution", "", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Band", "This smooth bronze band has rims decorated\nwith polished, but uncut rubies. Inscribed\nalong the exterior of the band is this phrase\nin elven: \"Elemalonn larionn'ehya Malin'onn\nito kaean'leh.\" A single stylized thorn marks\nthe interior of the band, a maker's mark.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of the Green", "Dozens of strands of copper wire have been\nbraided and twisted into the shapes of vines\nand branches, shards of emerald held in their\ncoils. The centerpiece of the work is a\nplatinum medallion with a dwarf-cut emerald\nin the center. Around the cut emerald is the\nelven phrase: \"Taynan adontera\nadonterehya'yema, ehya keaen chul orbilokae.\nA stylized thorn marks the back of the\nmedallion, a maker's mark.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Ring", "Despite its cunning appearance, this ring is\nnot actually made of wood at all, but rather\nof brass. It's surface has the appearance of\nbark, and little flecks of peridot are\nembedded in the metal, like moss.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Salamander Ring", "A pewter ring in the shape of a salamander\nbiting down on its own tail. Faceted emeralds\nmake up its eyes. Primarily ornamental rather\nthan functional, the detail put into the\nanimal makes it uncomfortable to wear. The\nunderside of the salamander's jaw is marked\nwith a stylized thorn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackfog Brandy", "This rounded bottle contains a dark amber\nfluid that smells both arid and of fruit.\nWhen imbibed, it becomes clear that it's\nalcohol, made from various fruits, sweet.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Crystal", "A prized volcanic crystal found deep within a\ncave inhabited by goblins. The feral\ncreatures had kept the rare gem as one of\ntheir most prized possessions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Feathers", "A feather belonging to a Red bokolo. The\nfeather would be a rather vibrant hue of red\nfrom the specific bokolo it came from. From\nFeather tip to point the feather would be\nabout 10 inches in length\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rolien Vulnear.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Something Blue", "This stone has been carefully shaped into the\nshape of a lightning bolt, blue in color.\nWeird.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Droquar Tooth", "Evidently, a large, massive tooth, with\njagged edges. It seems to have come from some\nincredibly large beast.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Nihilrant", "The book talks to the one who grabs it with both hands,\nbut it only knows unknown words.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Bolt of Silk Cloth", "This thick bolt of silk cloth is about\nsix yards in length, it's threads a\nsimple white. The cloth looks to be of\nhigh quality, it's surface shining with\nan elegant sheen and it's softness\nunparalleled.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackened Dagger", "A sharp dagger, stained deep black\nSome might say it would be useful\nfor Scrying, mayhaps?", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Le bisou de la sirène", "The wine is a deep, almost blood red and is\ncreated using the Lotharingian style of\nmulling, it’s labeled “Le bisou de la sirène\n1589” Which translates roughly to “The kiss\nof the siren.” according to the back of the\nbottle at least. The wine tastes good, and\nthe fruity taste begins big, then quickly\nfades into no taste at all, and leaves you\nwanting more.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Undru's Robe", "It appears to look like some sort of flesh, together with\nred runes all over it. The runes seem to be from unknown\norigin and a strange whisper can always be heard\ncoming from this piece. Those that dare to hold it at their\nhome, will encounter nightmares while they are asleep.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Muyakelgism.", "minecraft:fermented_spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gislocinovi Petals", "The petals from a gislocinovi plant; a\ncomplicated mixture of red, green and black\ngiving it a naturally hostile apperance.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Shadowy Claws", "A dark gray metal shaped claw that emits a dark\naura, slithering incoherant whispers into the ears of\nthe holder.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Blemished Goblet", "This silver goblet has seen better days,\nmarked and scratched an individual might look\nover it. The shape itself is rustic,\ntraditional, perhaps even elegant when it was\nfirst created. With a little scrubbing and\npolishing, it seems likely that the price of\nthis goblet would increase dramatically. It\nraises the question, why has this not\noccurred already? On the base of the item, a\nstrange symbol could be observed, the purpose\nit serves is unknown.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lifeforce Gems", "This item thrums and vibrates softly, feeling\nlike a pulse if one is still enough while\nholding it. It almost feels as if it is\nalive.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Glass Dove", "A small dove made of thick white stained\nglass, with white wisp of Yeu inside of it,\ncausing it to glow noticably. The dove is\nmade into a resting design, with its head on\nthe top of it's body, and its chest puffed\nout slightly and its legs not visible. The\nlines of the bird's feathers are illustrated\nwith thin lines of redstone, well mixed into\nthe glass. Though probably very useless, it\nis unfathomably aesthetically pleasing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Summer Quill", "A magnificent quill with a spine of brilliant\ncrimson and feathers of gold, orange and\nyellow, forming a myriad of summer colours.\nIt is a fitting momento for a writer who drew\ninspiration from the Sun's Smile.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Descendant Flesh", "", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Academy of Holm Memento", "Roughly around the same size as the average\nmina, this coin is smelted from ferrum. It\nincludes the sigil of the Holm Academy on the\nfrontside. On the back is a Dwarf with a\nwhite beard, as well as a passage in Flexian;\nAgnitione Pacem.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dr. Beard", "The contents of this bottle would be the fine\ndrink, Dr. Beard. Dr. Beard is produced by\nthe Sons of Urguan, following the original\nrecipe from Urguan himself. Dr. Beard is\nfound to put hair on your face, chest, and\ndown under. Don't forget to shave. ;)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by a Dwarf.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar's Meat", "A darker slab of cooked meat, tasting like a\ncross between pork and beef. It is however\njuicer and nutty in flavoring. Aside the\noutside meat being darker, it looks like any\ntype of pigs meat. A typical slab is larger\nthan a human hand.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bouquet of Red Flowers from Tlaloc", "Gathered by Tlaloc to put on Tsisha's grave\nafter she was murdered by orcs on 15th Grand\nHarvest, 1662. When she reappeared and saw\nthe grave, he gave them to her instead.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell", "The opalescent shell holds a strange, dark\ntint, like nighttime made corporeal. When\ntilted to the light, it shimmers like\nmoonbeams through salt waves.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("The King's Pin", "A finely crafter rapier, sporting a\ncrossguard of Aurum and a tip as sharp as\nrazor. It's handle was constructed from\nvarious wirings, bestowing an excellent grip\nfor the weilder.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jelonny.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Candy-Cane Hot Chocolate", "A mug of steaming hot chocolate with whipped\ncream! It had a candy-cane sticking out of\nit, very tasty!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Consul Leyunia.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Wyvern Tail", "A master crafted long sword made to change to\na whip upon a contraption in a grip being\nused. (1 emote to change into a whip, two to\ngo back into a sword). A gem would be placed\ninto the crossguard that once tapped twice\nwould set forth sparks along the length of\nthe blade. (PM Darkelfs or hoster102 for\ndetails, or go to Tinyurl.com/TheWyvernTail)", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Nightglow", "A blue, bioluminescent flower with a small,\nbut flexible frame. It has been enhanced to\nbe alot more deadlier then normal. T4\nherblore, contact DarkSoundwave for more.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Amulet", "A necklace imbued with a charm of calming.\nThe wearer would begin to feel their anger,\nsadness, and fear being washed away as a\nsoothing feeling would wash over them. The\nwearer would hear a faint heartbeat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Flute", "A well carved and operating flute, sculpted\nfrom the bone of a now deceased stag.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Horsehair Bracelet", "A bracelet, made for a man's wrist. The band\nis carefully and tightly woven from\nhorsehair. The clasp is a piece of steel\nmolded into the shape of a horse's head, with\nthe mouth serving as the clasp itself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Captain Drunkbeard's Skull", "A skull of a human with one single golden tooth. It appears to keep talking\ndrunk gibberish and it will never stop.\n*Moderator Approved*\nTauFirewarrior approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Kris of The Crow", "An asymmetrical dagger with a delicate\npattern comprised of a detailed carving of a\nmurder of crows, dancing against each side of\nthe ebony based blade. The wavy blade is\nlong, and a light slayer-steel gilding runs\nthe edges, the curved handle comprised of\nivory of some sort, the contrast between the\ntwo parts of the weapon startling. A small\nred jagged sigil lays on the hilt, as well as\nthe name 'Briar', indicating who made it, and\nwho owns it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Staff", "This smooth ash staff is footed with a silver\ncap, and tipped with a jagged diamond. It\nseems to have no special properties.", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood H", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood D", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Banana", "", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Fang", "The fang taken off of an Amber Wolf's Head.\nIt would be covered with blood and various\nmeats.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Chunk Brownie", "A deliciously looking brownie with a crisp\ncrackly top, an ooey-gooey fudge-like center\nand stupped with chunks of molten chocolate.\nMade with the best cocoa beans for that extra\nbit of flavor!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Sentinel] Gilondir Oronar.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("A Qalasheen machalite Ring", "A Qalasheen machalite Ring with a Steel Lay\nOut of Vines, That magestificly hold onto a\nBeautiful eye dazzling Polished machalite\nthat Gleams Brightly In the Sun’s Embrace.\nDark Waves Within the machalite flow\nmagesticily like water like vines.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("A Sign From The Aspects", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("❊ Infused Stiletto Dagger [T5] ❊", "Fancy stiletto dagger, it would be made of\naurum with ornates in silver, on the hilt\nthere would be an ideogram, if it is tapped\nit would invoke a layer of golden soulfire\naround the blade with a set of small torn\nmade of the same ethereal energy, if a being\nof corrupted natures enters in direct contact\nwith the holy fire it would burn its tissues\nand cause a great pain. ((PM Suxals for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Ale.", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("[The Crimson Drain - The Ruibrium Ballista Bolt]", "A 10ft long bluesteel ballista bolt, hardened\nto the strongest durablity and capacity. The\ntip of the bolt is in a swirled formation,\nholding a single glowing Ruibrium crystal\nwithin. Those within close radius of the bolt\nwill faintly begin to feel their lifeforce\nbeing drained, though only bit by bit. The\nweapon is one of masterful creation, forged\nto deliver a heavy blow to the September\nPrince by draining his lifeforce. [PM Farryn\nfor more information].\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood X", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Purity Seal", "A long strip of parchment scrawled with\nmessages in High Imperial. At the top is a\nred wax seal, which can be stuck to surfaces\nsuch as armour or clothing for good luck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobbes and Schmick Boutique.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ole Obediah's Dragon Jerky", "The packaging for the Jerky is a small wooden\nbox made from Acacia. A small stamp on the\nbox says 'Made in the Empire of Man, for the\nEmpire of Man\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Navin_.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden necklace with ram shaped pendant", "A hand crafted ram pendant , with two\ndiamonds inserted into the eye sockets,\ndetails of the fur are etched into the gold.\nThe pendant is attached to a golden chain\nnecklace.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Bricks of Anti-Magic", "A bag of bricks that come with a short\nbooklet: \"When confronted by a mage that\nstarts twitching or showing any sign they may\nbe connecting to the Void, follow these\ninstructions. 1. Reach into the bag for a\nbrick. 2. Throw the brick.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Climbing rope", "", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Training Sword.", "A small training sword meant for a child!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kacper Silma.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Spear", "A finely crafted spear, with a solid oaken\nshaft and a sharpened iron head. It could be\nused to thrust, or even swing, if one aimed\nthe distance of the spear head correctly.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Swamp Club", "A barbaric club.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Maukta Wire", "A cruel iron wire dyed red with blood. It's\nintent and use very clear from the smell of\ndeath emanating from it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Norton's bottle of water", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Ring of Shiny", "a Diamond is placed on a golden ring.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("RootSword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sheepskin Pelt", "A set of white sheepskin pelts, soft to the\ntouch. They seem to be in no particular\nshape, but are perfect for keeping oneself\nwarm. It would be large enough to drape over\none’s shoulders, although not to cover their\nbody completely. Perhaps they could be used\nas a rug or blanket.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Tis a sign of the end.", "It's a sign of the end, the end is neigh.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Gilded Wooden Comb", "A fine-toothed wooden comb with golden flower\nmotif accents on the handle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Homing Shard", "The large, glasslike gem has no immediate\neffects, but one may notice that it\nbegins to glow a bright yellow when\npointed at a very specific angle\ntowards the north. This angle\nseems to point north and\njust west of modern Salvus.\n*Moderator Approved*\nCombustionary approved this item.\n((Contact Combustionary to interract!))", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Queen of Anarak Head", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Second Shard of Earth", "A stone colored circle that had bits of green\nstreaking through the surface of it. On the\noutside was unreadable text. When it was held\nnear the ground, it would vibrate ever so\nslightly. Part of the four circles, piece two\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Sling", "(Common) A simple sling recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. There does not appear to\nbe anything special about the sling, acting\nonly to fling rocks or missles at enemies.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Limited edition Shreck'Lak Lunch Box", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot of Snowman Soldier", "A pointy orange carrot with an icey end.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Water Cup", "A water cup; what did you expect?\n*Moderator Approved*\nFyaa approved this item.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The orb of thought", "The azure colored orb appears to be thinking,\nevident by the faint murmuring it permeates\nfrom its crystalline form. Although you can’t make out what\nit’s saying, it must be something important…\nor is it?\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Throwing Dagger", "a Daemon Steel tipped throwing dagger capable\nof inflicting great pain\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Athonir.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleshy Chunk of a Large Bird", "A sizable piece of a large bird once covered\nin blight and corruption. The flesh has dried\nup, but the smell of the blight lingers. It'd\nbe unwise to eat this.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:nether_wart_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Tree Lord Ichor", "A vial filled with viscous Tree Lord ichor.\n((Taken from Muildir (Corvoo) ))", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ratiki Wardrum", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson Vase", "A flower like an elegant vase,\nwith deep red, sweeping petals", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Drake's Tail", "An elegant, yet thorny herb,\nIt seems blackened, as if scorched", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Djaj bil-Bahar Il-Asfar", "This whole grilled chicken was rubbed down\nwith a thick paste of various spices\nincluding cumin, tumeric, chiles, ginger,\ngarlic, cardamom, and rosehips. The skin is\nperfectly charred and opens easily to reveal\nthe steaming, succulent meat.", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of a Mighty Polar Bear!", "You hold in your hands the head of a once\nfearsome beast! Bested in combat by the hardy\nEmberhorn clan. Its visage is covered in old\nscars. The beast has faced many opponents\nbefore, only to fall before Emberhorn might.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Cap", "(Common) A black beret recovered from a\ncultist of Vilketa. It is solely black in\ncolor, with a yellow-grey thunder cloud\nsymbol on the front.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Giantsbane", "The mace of Balgruff the Giant, wanderer of\nAtlas. To have this in your possession makes\ntrue of your strength and courage, both to\nhave bested such a legendary foe from across\nmany realms of the known recorded history.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Lightsaber", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Alchemical Ichor", "An alchemical oil with what seems to be\nspider eggs within it.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Holmite Railway Blueprints", "A compilation of various blueprints and\ninformative papers on the construction of\nDwinic Railways. It covers the production of\nrailway components, as well as safe tunnel\nsupports, redstone, and other dwarven\ntechnologies relevant to the project.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobolympic.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Falchion Sword", "The Small, Falchion Blade wielded by a\nStrange Knight. The blade would be rather\nordinary, seeming almost crudely made. The\nwooden handle would be wrapped in green and\nblack leather, and the pommel would be marked\nwith the symbol of a Burning Tree.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Thunder Cleaver", "A old dwarven steel axe. On the head of the\nweapon there are two runes. On the handle\nthere is another one as well. All runes glow\nin a light blue color.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel-Pointed Spear", "", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Balek Irongut", "An intricate piece of Dwed craftsmanship,\nthis staff was forged in the fires of\nKal'Karaad by the remnants of the now\ndeceased Starbreaker Clan as a gift to the\nSorcerer King. It has been Balek's most\nprized possession and companion ever since.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobolympic.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pack of Finely Wrapped Cigars", "Upon sight of the tightly packed group of\ncigars, one might see that outside of the\ncigar was finely-wrapped by an expensive\nseeming fermented wrapper leaf. The bunch of\nthe cigar was of an oblong spherocylinder,\nand packed with fine, air-cured tobacco. [[\nPM Hynek/Rheged for more specifications if\nthat's your thing. ]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rheged.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Space Elven Locket", "A golden, eight-pronged star shaped locket. A\ndiamond is fused into the back. The locket\nopens up so that it may hold two pictures.\nWhen worn, an artificial mind in the locket\nconnects with its partner, allowing\ncommunications between it and its partner\n(outside of combat.) ((PM SpodoKaiba for more\ninformation))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Runestone III", "(Runestone) A peculier iron 'stone' that is\ncovered in runes. The sphere shaped object\nhas very little space that is not covered by\nthe runic language, only an Arch - Runelord\ncould hope to understand them.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Thunderbird Stonecraft", "This is an exceptionally-crafted stone model\nof a thunderbird. It is encrusted with\nlimonite and magnetite, and encircled with\nbands of brown jasper. It is painted with\ncave-fungus dye, and decorated with giant\ncave spider exoskeleton. The bottom of the\nitem is stamped with the text, ‘MA’.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("A Lovers Rose", "The rose smells sweet and innocent, like the\nbeginning of a beautiful relationship.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Acaele the Beserker.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("The Duchess' Charm", "A golden necklace laced with diamonds. A\nsmall, iron, bear claw seems to hook around\nthe emerald. When held up to the light, small\nleaves become visible as they slightly\nprotrude from behind the claw.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlit] Edgar Tresham.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand King Action Figure", "A Grand King Action Figure for Charles \"The\nBald\" Kings guard Action figure to protect.\n(Very Rare)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Charles The Bald.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Charles \"The Bald\" Kings Guard Action Figure", "A Charles the Bald action figure carved out\nof bone, This one is of Charles \"The Bald\" in\nhis kings guard armor. (Rare)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Charles The Bald.", "minecraft:bone", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_37(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Greiret's Small Battleaxe", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolfs fang", "A sharp fang of a wolf\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Delfato.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Oil", "A substance reccommended in dealing with the\nmany ailments of the world. Considered a\ntreatment for baldness, impotency, lunacy,\nlarceny, cancer, cramps, and lolly gagging.\nKnown to provide all necessesary proteins\nneeded to grow big and strong.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aengoth.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gorundyr beer", "A standard beer rests here, made of malted\nhops and oats. The average man's beer, this\ncheap and potent beer would get the job done.\nHave some with your buddies to have a good\ndamn time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Faroean Arcwine", "A mysterious deep-purple wine rests here,\nbubbling occasionally in a similar manner to\nchampagne. In truth, it is wine aged in an\noak cask, fortified with grain alcohol and a\npeculiar potion-- Wizard's Wisdom! If\nimbibed, an effect similar to the potion\nwould take root, where the mind clears and\nallows for better decision making...though\ndrinking many leads to the alcohol taking\nroot, convoluting it! A scholar's favorite.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Kush", "Kin to the Sutica Kush plant and the Mango\nstrain, Sutica Kush is a pure indica with\nsome seriously tasty flavors.Aside from the\nfantastic taste of this tropical-infused\nstrain, you would experience a happy high and\na good nights sleep.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Core of the Construct", "A prized possession for the person who killed\nthe construct. The core seems to not\nfunction, but nevertheless it provides a\nreward for the defenders!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Moleman Mithril Gem", "A Mithral Gem shining bright and blue, it was\nstudded onto a Molemans pauldrons. From a\nbattle it had been disgarded, now leaving the\ngem itself.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Färoe Meister", "A delicious black liquid rests in this mug,\nsmelling deeply of some strange whiskey.\nKnown for it's stomach-cleansing properties,\nthis drink is best for those with an upset\ntummy from drinking copious amounts of\nalcohol or simply because they had some\nterrible drink or food that day. Oftentimes\ngiven by Faroean witch-doctors to their\npatients during their medical rituals.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Mushroom", "A divine Mushroom from outside of our realm\nwhich bruises a purple ichor. It seems to\nbreath softly to your touch, the spots on its\ncap swirling and reforming in strange alien\nshapes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PizzeriaDjango.", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Soup", "A thick golden-orange soup, primarily made\nfrom pumpkin flesh. The texture is smooth and\none could taste onion, ginger, cumin and\ngarlic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("The Gift Staff", "A carefully worked staff made from oak,\nnearly six feet long. The head opens into a\nshape resembling the crown of an oak tree,\nwhere a brilliantly-cut emerald sits.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of dwain_riongut", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Grandaxe Whiskey", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Small direwolf pelt", "The collor of this wolf pelt is a smoke grey.\nThe size of this pelt seems that of a dog.\nLooks like some one skinned it with little\nskill of skinning pelts.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Delfato.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Mournstone Style Krugsmas Fruit Cake", "With a dark coloring and dense cake, this\nfruity concoction combined with some\ndelicious rum spiked eggnog is a match made\nin heaven! Filled with fruits and nuts of\nvarious kinds and surrounded by a coffee and\nchocolate inspired moist cake, just a slice\ncan send someone into a food coma. It's\nrecommended to nap after eating; and you can\ndo that since it's Krugsmas and no one can\ntell you what to do!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Wrought-Iron Spear", "The spear infront of you, made of hardened\nwrought iron, bears small carvings within its\nhilt. The head of it bears a sharpened and\nrefined point.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Craftsman] Dürar.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Frendship Sord", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mournstone Style Krugsmas Pudding", "Baked with care, this old recipe calls for\nchocolate cookies, two kinds of eating\nchocolate and chocolate cake to boot. In the\ndense layers lay sweet marshmallows and juicy\ncherries. Through the pudding there's a\nmixture of cherry juice and white chocolate,\nmaking the pudding extremely moist and\ndelicious. To top it off, it's covered in a\ndrizzle of white chocolate and caramel and\ntopped with two large cherries.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Enhanced Arrow of Slowness", "Despite its obvious form, this arrow is\ndipped in a plethora of herbs such as\ncorvisange and phoenix' tear that result in\nthe stunning display of fatigue and slowness\nupon its intended victim.The words 'Ascanius\nare engraved into the head of the arrow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ascanius.", "minecraft:tipped_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Thick Silver Ring", "A large silver ring with a diamond in it.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Pinecone", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ol' Steel Hatchet", "A strange hatchet forged of steel. The butt\nof the hatchet-head has a form of spike\nprotruding from it while the hooks of the\nhatchet-head seem to curve back into two\nsharp points. Overall, this strange hatchet\nis quite effective at killing, as shown by\nthe finely sharpened edge and dangerous\ndesign features.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auril Grimhollow.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Tortoise", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Olivia's Wooden Flute", "A wooden flute masterfully carved from the\nfinest acacia. When flipped over, the word\nOlivia' is etched in small, crude writing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Olivia Thorn.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Yung Munk", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Gem", "The Sapphire, Part of the Gem Set, it Invokes\nPeace and Happiness on the person.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Deep Green Jewel", "The soul of a forest appears as if it rests\nin this shimmering, chiseled jewel. But it\nseems to be just a simple stone.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Mossy Pebble", "A palm-sized pebble, mostly covered in a soft\ngreen moss. Beneath the raw nature lies\nvarious shades of grey and speckles of blue\nand silver, lining the surface of the stone.\nUpon holding the pebble, an aura of peaceful,\nnature-like energy would befall the wielder.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Plush Axe", "It was just a stuffed red axe, carefully sewn\nto keep it's shape and texture. Being hit\nwith the blade was harmless as it was plush\nbut the handle was hand carved oak, made to\naccommodate a little girls tiny hands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:wooden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Hunting Knife", "A beautifully crafted wood elven hunting\nblade, carried by one of the Naelurir,\nVeidan.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf Claw", "The Razersharp Claws of a Direwolf. The Claws\nwould be about 4 Inches Long, easily capable\nof cutting through Flesh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Calia's Scythe", "Scythe of Calia Maehr'Tayna. Generally used\nas a walking stick, though on the end of the\nhandle would be a sharp curved blade. Calia's\nname is carved into the wood to authenticate\nownership.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netphreak.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("To Eadmund..", "When you open the thin book there would only\nbe one page. On the page would be a drawing\nof a young red headed women. Little Children\nwould stand at her left, and right side. On\nthe bottem of the drawing it would be signed-\nLove Adela", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Schreck's Head", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Waldenian Wine", "Some recently made wine, made by grapes in\nthe Rovin fort. It would taste a bit more\nsweet than the other wines.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood-Covered Dagger.", "A seven inch knife covered in a mix of human\nand elf blood. A lolipop for an orc!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thanhium.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Chocolate Bunny", "A chocolate bunny, this bunny would be filled\nwith several small eggs inside all containing\na delicious mixture.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbloric Alabaster Potion", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Recruiting Pendant", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Low IQ", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Azaghul Pick", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by welshnutter.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Soulguard Helmet", "Before you is an imposing and rather ornate\nset of plated ferrum armor, gilded with\nstreaks of aurum and silver. Centered within\nis an emblem of the twins flames of the\nAscended, overlaying a depiction of the full\nmoon. Darkness cannot avail this armor, and\neven in the darkest of nights a faint\nradiance is present. Burns and potentially\nignites any corrupted substance that comes\ninto contact. 10 charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Soulguard Cuirass", "Before you is an imposing and rather ornate\nset of plated ferrum armor, gilded with\nstreaks of aurum and silver. Centered within\nis an emblem of the twins flames of the\nAscended, overlaying a depiction of the full\nmoon. Darkness cannot avail this armor, and\neven in the darkest of nights a faint\nradiance is present. Burns and potentially\nignites any corrupted substance that comes\ninto contact. 10 charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Soulguard Greaves", "Before you is an imposing and rather ornate\nset of plated ferrum armor, gilded with\nstreaks of aurum and silver. Centered within\nis an emblem of the twins flames of the\nAscended, overlaying a depiction of the full\nmoon. Darkness cannot avail this armor, and\neven in the darkest of nights a faint\nradiance is present. Burns and potentially\nignites any corrupted substance that comes\ninto contact. 10 charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Soulguard Boots", "Before you is an imposing and rather ornate\nset of plated ferrum armor, gilded with\nstreaks of aurum and silver. Centered within\nis an emblem of the twins flames of the\nAscended, overlaying a depiction of the full\nmoon. Darkness cannot avail this armor, and\neven in the darkest of nights a faint\nradiance is present. Burns and potentially\nignites any corrupted substance that comes\ninto contact. 10 charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Northern Blade (Viking Sword)", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearthy Vodka", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("ol'Ale", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Oil Worker Rebellion", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bubblegum Kush", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Tobias' flute", "A quena flute made of simple wood. It looks a\nbit worn.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("》 Calico Karin 《", "A female cat like creature. The karin weighs\nabout 20LBS, and would stand at 24in tall.\nThe Karin is ginger , and cremem colored,\nwith unusual violet eyes. The panther like\ncreature bears tall pointy ears , and two\nlong tails.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MayRndz.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("⋄°✧ₒDoubble-Bladed Glaiveₒ✧°⋄", "The Glaive would consist of 2 small curved\nkatana like blades that would be latched\ntogather on their hilts. The mechinisum would\nbe a complicated concept , the glaives 2\nblades would beable to detatch from eachother\nforuming dual blades , and latch back\ntogather into one dual-sided glaive. The hilt\nwould be made of Rosewood with a red gem in\nthe middle .when a certian phrase would be\nuttered the balde would light aflame .The\ninitials M.Luf. would be carved onto the\nhilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MayRndz.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("THE  The Black Seed  THE -g", "This looks like a little sapling seed, but\nwhen approached, it imputes a sense of fear\nand utter evil. This does not seem to be\ntainted; it seems to be an embodiment of\ntaint itself. One could only imagine what\nmight happen if this seed was planted.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("fff  Cracked Gold Keystone    fff", "A golden triangular object. Though it once\nlooked like it might have been a fascinating\nornament, it is now cracked, and on the verge\nof falling apart.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Hrjóta, Throwing Axe", "A lightly constructed slayersteel axe rests\nhere, a haft composed of yew and a head of\nslayersteel. A light balance ensures this axe\nhas a safe and straight flight when thrown,\nthough just as capable of rending through\nflesh and bone with powerful strikes. The\nhaft was set with leather cording to allow a\nsnug grip in the warrior's hand, making it\ndifficult to disarm. Gorundyr runes line the\nsurface, although a patch of runed 'mist' is\nseen on the head, as if a victory was won\ninvolving it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum axe", "An axe made by a smith of utmost expertise.\nThe metal burns the flesh of unholy beings\nand chops through it with ease should force\nbe put into the swing.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Da Deff Rok", "Some say that the Rex plucked the meteor used\nin the creation of this beastly weapon from\nthe sky itself. It is essentially a\nBloodsteel 'sconce' accommodating a large\nmeteorite; a dastardly mace for an uruk of\nstatus.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Bullwhip", "A coiled up bullwhip, ready to be put to use.\nIt's nearly five feet long, and is made of\ntightly braided leather. Spiraling across the\nhandle are two mighty lubbas, their heads\nmeeting at each side of it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Wanderer's Note", "A brittle note stained a disgusting\ndark-beige, having come out of a mimic after\nit consumed the author. It reads, \"Dear\nPrincess Cyrene of Sutica, you do not know\nme, but I have heard of you, your city, and\nyour recent trouble with the of the Salt\nRider. It is an age old creature that can\nonly be pacified to stop it. You must return\nthe Salt Rider's eyes, you must, or Tahariae\nsave us all.\". Ominous. ((25/11/18 event\nitem)).\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum-Tipped Arrows", "A quiver of arrows with odd aurum tips!", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Maple Bowl", "A small bowl, small enough to be held in\none's hand. The wood is Maple, and treated to\nbe water resistant. It may be small, but it's\nlarge enough for a relatively decent serving\nof a meal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aron Hawksong.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("A regular stick!", "die", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Rage", "This morning star has a pommel made out of\nsteel, and a shaft of tempered iron wood. The\nhead of the morning star is made of black\nferrum with plenty of large spikes on it,\ngreat for fighting armored enemies. A deer\nskin is wrapped around the handle to serve as\npadding.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Branch", "A flowing and beautiful fire is carved into\none end of the stick. The tongues of fire lap\nover every surface to about half way. Hidden\namongst the detail are asorted words that\ndidn't seem to have any correlation. The\nother half of the stick has assorted symbols\nand tiny detailed pictures of what appeared\nto be memories. Embellishing the very end is\na mace. On the flip side is a smooth mask\nwith two thin slashes for eye holes. The\npiece shows great attention to detail.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Valkriin.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fish with aids", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("-=[Sea Shell Necklace]= .", "[!] Given the scent of saltwater, and the\nbits of sand that lay within the spaces\nbetween each bead of shell, it's apparent\nthat the necklace is of a laughable skill.\nWhile each shell is completely different than\nthe last, it is also apparent that it has\nbeen place together carefully. Just within\nthe center lies a relatively large shell,\nwith two letters carved into the clear\nbackside. It shows: Z+L within a crudely\ncarved heart.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("A wooden crutch", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Processed Ruibrium Powder", "A vibrantly glowing red powder encased in a\nfairly large vial. The substance has had its\ncorrupted energies removed, allowing it to be\ningested. When used, the substance offers\nextensive mana deposits temporarily. It is\nhighly addictive and often results in\nheadaches and tunnel vision\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kadarsi Sultanate Non-Agression Pact", "This treaty is a non-aggression pact, formed\nbetween The Trade Federation Of Sutica and\nThe Kadarsi Sultanate. It details in\nbeautiful calligraphy the specifications of\nthe agreement between the two nations. Signed\nby both parties, it is part of a two item\nset.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by adamc2000.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("PVDA", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Divinistone", "A small, teal stone about the size of the\naverage human fist. The stone emits a dim\nlight whenever exposed to a gleaming\nmoonlight. The stone has several foreign\ncharacters and words written on its face.\n((Contact Capace in order to interact\nfurther.))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ikurnamon Elven Blade", "In your grasp is a 39 inch Elven falchion\nsword. The handle is dark brown, at the\npommel would be a small sphere with a carved\nin tree; the very same tree upon the Dominion\nbanner. The top of the handle would have no\ncrossguard, unlike most other swords.\nInscribed along the handle is the Elven\nphrase, \"Eth'hiyem thur'sae\". The blade\nitself is a lighter shade of dark brown than\nthe handle and would start of straight,\nthough as it neared the tip a curve would be\nseen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serge4nt_Forge99.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mahogany Knife", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aron Hawksong.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dirt of Even Tempered Acceptance", "This peice of dirt reminds you that life,\nfull of its twists and turns, is much better\nwhen you accept the happiness you have.\nHolding it inspires you to live up to the\nexample set by this dirt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusionary Cuffs", "A plain wrist cuff of dull iron, seemingly\nnothing of worth as the cuffs are unadorned.\nThough when one taps the cuffs three times\nthe purpose is revealed, when someone does so\nthere eyes would seemingly change to a light\ngreenish hue, and there mouth would be\ndisguised, more smooth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Hont-ob Aan", "The orb would be comprised fully of gold,\nwith blood-red streaks running through it,\nadorning deep crevices acting as lines across\nthe orb's surface. Turning the orb around you\ncan see that there are four Suns marked into\neach side of it, signifying the cardinal\npoints, with each Sun being surrounded by\nhundreds of strange letters engraved into the\ngold. Oddly enough, it seemed as if the gold\nshined brighter than any other, as if\nharnessing the brightness of the Sun itself.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Lunais Gemstone", "This palm-sized fushcia gem has a strange\nrune on its surface which slowly pulses with\nyellow luminescense like sleeping breaths.\nRumour has it returning the gem to its maker\nwill yield grand rewards [\nTinyurl.com/huntsign ]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharaks Ember", "An engraved stone that glows a dim golden hue\nakin to that of fire. Any Lutauman would find\nease in utilizing it to gain entrance to\nStargush'Stroh, only to arrive in a familiar\ncavern...\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Pipe of Veist - Ilzgûl Udalgum", "The pipe would be made almost entirely of\niron, apart from the wooden mouth-piece. It\nwould adorn a red-tint mixed with the dull\ngrey of iron to form it's shaft. The only\nnoticable feature is the Shamanic writings\nalong it's spine.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Flute of Drelthok - Ilzgûl Udalgum", "The flute would be sturdy and straight,\nforged with iron. However, it seemed to adorn\na reddish tint. It appeared to be nothing but\na flute, aside from shamanic writings\ncovering it from side to side\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bûrz Honts", "This mask was black as the void itself: the\nonly sign of colour being the scarce streaks\nof white blazing across it's surface like\nstars, and the large bone-white hand-print\ncovering the left eye of the mask. Amongst\nthe darkness was a faint red-tint that\nglossed over the mask's surface, shining ever\nso lightly in the presence of light. Many\nstrange writings covered the mask's surface,\nthe right eye reading \"Ufum\" and the left\nTarbûrz\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Knife of Rolfizh - Ilzgul Udalgum", "A small iron knife, nothing noticable but\nshamanic writings all over it. Upon\nactivation , if one were to know how to, any\ncut by the knife will be poisonous. Leading\nto a painful death.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HBrules.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lock of Ogrol - Ilzgûl Udalgum", "The lock would be quite tough, forged with\niron, however, it did not seem to be of the\nnormal, bland colour. Instead, the lock\nadorns a red-ish tint whose mixes with the\ndull grey. An important fact to take note of\nis that the lock seems to lack a keyhole...\nit has no openings at all!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Matum", "The axe adorned a strange colour to its\nmetal, as crimson as the blood that flows\nthrough your veins, with long streaks as\nwhite as bone running along it's surface down\nto the handle. The handle of this gruesome\nweapon had been charred to become as black as\nthe night sky, etched with strange and jagged\npatterns. Though the whole design of this axe\nis certainly unorthodox: the writings etched\ninto it's head were much stranger... They\nwere most definitely ancient words, lost to\nthe World.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mazauk", "The axe adorned a strange colour to its\nmetal, as crimson as the blood that flows\nthrough your veins, with long streaks as\nwhite as bone running along it's surface down\nto the handle. The handle of this gruesome\nweapon had been charred to become as black as\nthe night sky, etched with strange and jagged\npatterns. Though the whole design of this axe\nis certainly unorthodox: the writings etched\ninto it's head were much stranger... They\nwere most definitely ancient words, lost to\nthe World.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Zugrish", "This spear's head would be a dark crimson\nred, glimmering in the Sun's light. It's\nentire surface was etched in Shamanic\nwritings, with not a single spot unscathed.\nSmall bone-white streaks ran like veins\nacross it's surface, running down to the\nshaft where you could see an array of\ncoloured feathers tied around it. Small bones\nand teeth dangled from rope, clacking\ntogether in a discordant melody.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Arend's Ring", "A simple ring, looking like gold!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Burning Wick", "An extravagent weapon whose blade consisted\nof a bright red hue. The metal would always\nhave an idyllic sheen to it, no matter the\nerosion. Around the handle was wrapped a\nblack leather, into which the initials 'RHY\nwere stamped. At the end of the weapon was a\ncrudely yet recognizable candle lit aflame.\nThe user of the sword would find that the\nweapon would be almost entirely resistant to\nheat.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Icepick", "This tool is great for grappling into cracks\nin stone and ice.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Tall Staff", "This tall staff stands and 7 feet tall, with\nan odd hole seemingly grown into the wood at\nthe top-most end of it. The shaft of the\nstaff is completely smooth, to the base,\nwhich was studded with steel.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Alligator Meat", "The meat of an alligator.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Alligator.", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("The rose of friendship.", "Rose has given you the rose of friendship!\nLet's be friends!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Purity Mask of Aeriel [T5]", "A sheet white mask resembling an owl with odd\nscarlet patterning emblazened into its upper\nend. Should one touch the patterning, a\ncrimson torrent of soulflame will shoot\nforth. Any tainted creatures engulfed by the\nflames will become very exhausted, most\nlikely forced into a comatose-like state.\nWhoever wears this mask will be filled with a\nsensation of closure and calmness [PM TheTri\nor AerielsVanguard for more details]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Bel Homme", "An intense and subtle fragrance that tells\nthe story of a man, both virile and\nvulnerable. This striking aroma of lavender\nand rare complex leather accords are\nheightened with wood and spices. Its exotic\ntrail is enriched with notes of sage.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dame de la Nuit", "An intimate, seductive and intensely\nbrilliant fragrance with luminous notes.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Virtue, Sword of House Curthose", "A well-made arming sword crafted with ferrum.\nThe wooden handle is adorned in red cloth and\na leather grip. Along the blade are etchings\nof sun rays, emitting from a large sun that\nis located near the cross guard. A yellow gem\nlies between the pommel of the blade. It is\nsaid that a Curthose who pronounces the house\nmotto can cause the blade to protrude fire\nfrom the sun engraving. If you tap the gem,\nthe fire will shoot from the tip. (Pm bolon_\nfor more info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Robyn vulnear.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Lizard Shot", "The drink doesnt look appetizing, but is\npacked with a punch, along with a bit sour\naftertaste. Quite delicious when warm, and is\nusually served along with meat.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Alléchant", "Difficult to define, impossible to resist,\nthis perfume is the fragrance of a true,\nradiant woman with innate elegance. The\nfloral-fresh aroma is refined, notes of\norange blossom combine with the softness of\nrose and the sensuality of vanilla.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Apotheke No 5", "An abstract, mysterious scent, alive with\ncountless subtle facets, radiating an\nextravagant floral richness.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wool Jacket", "A large piece of wool taken from a Sheep,\nfashioned and torn into a small Jacket to\nkeep you warm\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("۞ Permit for Leona Amori ۞", "This official-looking document is a permit\nfor Leona Amori, a Woman of Human blood, who\ncan be distinguished by her bright red hair\nand emerald-green eyes. The permit has been\nofficially signed by the Minister for Magical\nAffairs, His Excellency Vahyru Daluon. By the\nrights of this document the named person is\nlegally allowed to cast the following forms\nof magecraft within their permit’s\nboundaries; Arcanism.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("✭вluє-ѕtєєl ѕαвrє✭", "thє ѕhσrt ѕwσrd wσuld вє αrσund 10ín,\nwєíghíng αвσut 1 lв.mαdє σf ѕtєєl ít wσuld\nhαvє α ѕlíght вluє tínt .upσn thє cєntrαl\nrídgє σf thє вlαdє, ít wσuld curvє σutwαrd\níntσ α fσrwαrd-clєαvíng єdgє thєn curvíng\nínwαrd íntσ α pσínt.thє hílt wσuld вє α\ndαrkєr вluє ѕtained rosewood wíth α\nвєαutífullч dєѕígnєd crσѕѕ guαrd, αn σcєαn\nвluє shaped ѕtαr gєm ín thє míddlє σf ít.\nArσund thє hílt wσuld вє вlαck αnd вluє cσrd\nmade frσm fσх hídє.Thє pσmmєl of the hilt\nwσuld cσntαín α gєm ѕímílαr tσ thє one on\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Maxine Luftun.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Acid Poison Bottle", "Inside the flask a green liquid made mostly\nfrom fire reagents flows, creating a\nyellowish smoke that, when entered in contact\nwith skin, causes corrosion. Will make a\nscorching sensation in every spot of the body\nthe liquid touches.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dilory Lada.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Venom Flask", "This glass bottle contains a light green\nliquid, made mostly from spider venom. Its\nsmell is irritating for the eyes without\nprotection. The poison is harmful enough to\nincapacitate anyone who drinks it, depending\non the quantity ingested.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dilory Lada.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Torn Aex Page", "A torn piece of paper, somewhat burnt, with\njagged characters of an unknown language.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Man", "A small Pumpkin figure's body was crafted out\nof wood, the head was a small pumpkin tied\ntogether to its wooden body.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sandey0000.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck's Rat", "This is Shreck'Lak's RAT. big boi\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bjor's gifting carrot", "A rather large, bright orange carrot. Freshly\nharvested with much Cottonwood love. \"Maneh\nlove frem Bjor\" would be carved into the side\nof the carrot.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [High Chief] Bjor 'Sugartits' Cottonwood.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Fishing Spear", "An unorthodox choice of metal for\nspearfishing. Unless you just so happen to be\nhunting undead fish.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane: An Overview", "This book would have a fine leather cover\nwith the title stiched into the front and\nspine of it. Also stitched into the front\nbelow the title would be a circle, seemingly\nboring - at least until the book was touched.\nWhoever would open this book would be the\nonly one to percieve it as the circle lit up\nwith a faint purple glow, wisps of energy\noccasionally rising up from it and the pages\nwhenever they would be turned.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.\nSignature: Friedrich", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Basket of Tropical Fruits", "A woven basket filled to the brim with\nmangoes, papayas, bananas, and a pineapple.\nThey've been harvested recently, and are at\nthe peak of freshness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eranikus.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Ufiikbaen (Trollhunter Axe)", "A large axe. Forged with black ferrum. The\naxe in very unbalanced, creating devastating\nand horrid wounds with every heaving blow. It\nis said to be used to take down giants in\nonly a few attacks.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Askr (Short Spear)", "A spear measuring nearly 7ft long, with a\nspearhead that measures 17\" inches. On either\nside of the socket of the spearhead are 4\ninch long wings. The shaft of the spear is\ncrafted from heat-treated dark oak. Along the\nmiddle of the shaft there are runes visibly\ncarved into the wood - ᛁᚾᚷᚠᛇᛚᚦᚱ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by R_azam.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Seax (Short Dagger)", "An all-purpose knife of Gorundyr style. The\nblade would measure about 8\" inches, with a\nleather-wrapped tang handle measuring 5\ninches. This seax was forged by a\nmastercraftsman, who sharpened it thoroughly\nand paid every attention to the balancing of\nthe blade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by R_azam.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum dagger", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Oblivion's Grimoire", "A peculiar tome set with richly bound leather\nand blue accentation. A cryptic sigil was on\nthe front-- a rune of some sort of archaic\nand long-lost language.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Lance Feather", "A single feather from a Red Lance Bird, a\nmessenger bird native to the snowy southern\nreaches of Atlas. Remarkably, its plumage is\na vibrant colour that would stand out for\nmiles in the snow. Perhaps it is a point of\npride.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Ring", "A nut-sized fire-opal, nestled within the\nWooden Ring. It's iridescent hues of blue and\nred seemingly cast forever within the stone.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Blunted Heavy Longsword", "An intentionally dulled longsword. Roughly\neight or nine pounds in weight.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Light of Akezo", "The palm sized glass ball is etched with\ncurving and swirling lines, painted with blue\nand cyan paint. In the middle there seems to\nbe a blue colored liquid which emits soft\nblue light, around the mid-line of the ball\nthere is an inscription; \"Akezo's healing\nlight shines upon you\". At the 'bottom' of\nthe sphere lies a small 'W' which is carved\ninto the glass.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cold Bear Horn", "The curved, and vicously sharp horn that once\ncrowned the head of a Cold Bear, the\nsupernatural beasts that roam the Yatl\nWastelands. It seems sturdier than any common\niron, though the material does not feel like\nmetal. It makes for a fine trophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Parir of Igne", "An elven styled shortsword made of black\nferrum. The blade would seem to be well\ncrafted by a very skilled smith due to its\ndetails. Along the blade would be engravings\nof flames that snake all the way to the tip.\nThe cross guard would be shaped slightly like\nan S, a sapphire embedded at both ends. The\nhilt would be wrapped in black leather that\nleads down to a pommel shaped to depict a\neastern styled dragon coiling around a hawk.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Weapon", "The weapon seems to be engraved with ancient\nmarkings, used by a Dungrimm cultist.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Dungrimm Cultist.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Gift", "Upon opening the elaborate lid you discover a\ndelightful item inside! [Pm MisterPapiOfLOTC\nto redeem]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Ghazrial", "The Legendary Skull of perma banned player\nwho has more alts than the Flays!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Thanhium.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mid-Life Crisis Fishing Rod", "Ever felt like your life wasn't going\nanywhere? This quality fishing rod is a\nperfect tool to escape reality for a few days\nas you contemplate your existence and if what\nyou are doing is even worth it.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand Piano Installation Voucher ~Jaya Jayamen", "A voucher good for one Grand Piano\ninstallation. Comes with the piano, a sound\ntype for the piano (Normal, Bass,\npluck((guitar)), and wind((flute)), a guide\nbook, and free tuning for life. Signed by\nJaya Jayamen. (( Contact me for installation.\nUsername: Sofetios ))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashard", "", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Lohjsjur, Wavy Greatsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Bearded Hatchlet", "An axe of the 'Oxo' variety. Unique to the\nvillage of Skattegon, this type of hand-axe\nis unbalanced and relentless in top-heavy\nstrikes. The axehead has an extended beard\nfor longer reach.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Languralmr (Heavy Warbow)", "A heavy-limbed long recurve bow. The\nbowstring requires a strong arm to fully\ndraw. The grip is made from Slayer Steel, and\nis casted to fit the hand of an adult. The\nserving of the bowstring is wrapped in bear\nhide to allow sure-grip.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by R_azam.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Dagger", "A simple yet effective dwarven dagger. The\nbalde seems to be crafted by an expert\ndwarven smith with a Dwinic Style.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stalr Bearded Hatchlet", "A black ferrum war axe. The haft would be\ncrafted from dark oak wood. The axehead has\nan extended beard for wider hit. The axe\nwould be unbalanced, creating devastating\ntop-heavy attacks in every hit. Overall,\nstrength is over agility with it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by R_azam.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ufiik hundur''de Axe", "A one handed axe rests within your hand. The\nhead is polised, shining in the light of day,\nand the edge sharpened to perfection. Runes\nwould run along the axe head, reading \"Troll\nhunter\" in Jolfmarr'Tal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Spear (Short Spear)", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Joker's Oil", "A bitter-smelling oil rests here. If\nuncorked, a strong burning sensation is felt\ntraveling up your nose, likely inducing a\ncoughing fit. This is an oil composed of\nJoker's Scum acid and lard as a base, formed\ninto an oil to apply to weaponry or other\nitems. If contact is made with flesh, it\nwould begin to sear and burn away in effects\nvery similar to hydrofluoric acid. Care must\nbe given that the acidic oil does not get on\nthe hands during application. It does not eat\nthrough metal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Freezing", "A peculiar chilled potion rests here,\nsurrounded by a fur sack to keep it from\npassing frostbite to the wielder. This potent\nconcotion would freeze water and other\nliquids upon contact, causing a slippery\nsurface. Seemingly benign and simple, one's\ncapabilities are only limited by their own\nimagination. It is also capable of keeping\none at a pleasant temperature while\ntraversing warm areas, such as the Firelands\nor a Desert.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Adventurer's Rucksack (Heavy)", "A burlap sack rests here, measuring the\nlength of one's back and more than capable of\nholding supplies. Within, one would find an\nextensive set of supplies great for\nadventuring! A day's worth of Pemmican, a\nfull canteen of water, two 20-foot long coils\nof rope, wheat chaff for tindering a fire, a\nflint and steel for lighting said fire, a\ndeployable tent fit for one person, and a\nserrated knife. Weighing in at 20 pounds, it\nwas hefty, but could save your life in a long\ndungeon crawl.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Knucklebone Fetish", "A strange and small set of knucklebones,\nglowing faintly red. How quaint.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("whet", "whet\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Uruk Glaive", "A tribalistic glaive rests here, the\nblack-ferrum blade measuring in at 18 inches\nresting on top of a 7 foot long shaft\ncomposed of Ashwood. Beneath the glaive-tip\nrested a set of red-and-black feathers,\ngiving the brutal weapon some much needed\naesthetic. The blade of the glaive was hewn\nwith deep grooves and channels to allow for\noils and poisons to be properly held within\nthe blade! A regal sense comes from the\nweapon, strong and noble for the one who\nwielded it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Angus's norlandic bluesteal", "A heavy sword that would be hard to swing and\nmaster, only a norlander could know how to\nuse this weapon with skill\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Undeath's Smite", "A Bluesteel bastardsword at 35 inches in\nlength. The pommel was made of a lighter\ngreen gem - Verdantium. The hilt was covered\nin overlapping red and black processed\nleathers. The crossguard bore on both sides\nthe name, engraved in the polished bronze,\nRuric\". The weapon was clearly very\nexpensive to forge and process. On the very\nbottom of the blue-tinted, semi-transparent\nweapon, sat engraved the letters 'TT'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tam'naeuth Terin.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kaedreni Longsword", "A finely crafted Kaedreni Longsword, accompanied\nby a leather sheath.\n*Moderator Approved*\nman5791 approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Northbroek Family Sword", "The blue-steeled cutlass has a helve which\nwas bound in black leather, the pommel was\ncarved mahogany and looked slightly worn;\neven the most gentle of touches to flesh\nwould result in one bleeding profusely. The\nname 'Northbroek' was etched into the hilt.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hneef af Beira", "A finely made knife, with a blade of crucible\nsteel. Once brittle and unstable during its\nmaking, it had now become one of the most\nrenowned metals - and blade searched after.\nThe blade sits attached to the handle, runes\nengraved into the blade. For those known in\nJolfmarr'tal - it would read \"Skarpefanger\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("OH FUCK HE HAS A BERSERKER AXE", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Uhd'krimth Szevk", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Modir'je bita (Double Flail)", "This is a gorundyr styled flail. The two\nheavy flails are made from Jorgundic Black\nmetal with various runes carved into it. The\nhandle of the double flail is made of oak\nwood with a handle wrapped in black stainned\nleather, In between the two flails is\ndecorated with a small wolf skull while the\nbutt of the handle has a bone tooth neckalce\nhanging from it. \"Sw'yr\" is carved into the\nshaft of the flail. Masterfully made weapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rokodra Khopesh", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Monk Champagne", "Tastes like sweet sweet victory.\nExpires once the hangover ends\nNaturally Soulbound\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gorundyr Vodka", "A potent and nose-curdling liqour rests here.\nThis stuff burns like hellfire going down,\nwith a taste that...well, look, you need to\ncut this thing to drink it without squirming.\nEssentially vodka but increased to 100 proof,\nthis thing will knock the heaviest berserker\non their ass with a murderous hangover for\ntheir troubles.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Skatten Mead", "A clear-looking bottle rests here, smelling\nof honey with a heavy alcoholic scent.\nIntensely fortified, this drink had the taste\nof honey but a strong aftertaste similar to\nvodka, but damn if it didn't warm the belly\nas it goes. Known to be drank in the colder\nmonths, this drink is a favorite of Kaethryn\nOjorna, from whom the recipe was taken.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kholidav.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand Stag Pendant", "The emerald gem stands around the size of an\nadult palm - masterfully cut, the shape of a\nstag's head is clearly present. Large antlers\nprotruding sidewardly, in a grand almost\nregal like stature. The eyes of the pendant,\nhas a more rugged black rock central to the\nsockets. If turned over, there were clear\nengravings against the gem reading \"Peace and\nfire, baby brother. - Quillian\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Tooth", "A tooth of a wyvern, stark black bone-like\nsubstance stained in some places with a\nreddish hue, akin to blood.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodsteel Ingot", "A finely forged ingot of pure bloodsteel. The\nmetal surface has a rough finish and the\ncolor is a deep and dark red.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by WAAAAAAAAAAAAAGH.", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Shield", "A round shield with an iron rim. The wood\nwithin the rim is oak, engraved with old\nrunes, painted over with a layer of gray\npaint.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Elkbear Antler", "A quite massive antler, roughly six feet long\nand composed of many sprawling branches of\nbone matter. Its surface ashy, a thin powder\ncoming off of it upon bare touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("rock", "you probably thought this was gonna be the\nkeystone huh\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Demon Blood", "The blood of a greater demon. It is unusually\nhot, around 50 degrees centigrade. It\nmaintains this temperature even in cold\nenvironments. A perverse sensation can be\nfelt by those in direct contact with it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Quillian's Wineskin", "A rather worn and clearly used gambeson\nwineskin sits in your palm, engraved against\nthe thick unknown animal hide reads \"Drink\nspirits, to keep your own lifted\". Below the\nphrase, a small Azalea flower was too\nimprinted. Quillian's Totem, The Azalea\nDruid.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Quillian Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon Necklace", "What appears to be a lovely necklace of a\ncarved oceanic shard; shaped to appear as if\na half moon. It possibly holds another part\ndue to its ragged edges, indicating another\nbit fit into it. A message is etched onto its\nback; \"To my lovely Neoma, haelun.\" [Contact\npapikite for further interaction]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melia Finnigan.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Lur Wolf Tooth", "A fang that once adorned the mouth of a\nfearsome Lur Wolf. Sharp and jagged, this\ntooth could be used as a dagger in combat, or\nan impressive keepsake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodstained Silk", "This thick bolt of silk cloth is about 6\nyards in length. The high-quality cloth once\nbore a flawless white sheen, but is now\nstained with blood: a reminder of a violent\nact.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Finger", "A Finger taken off of the Wing of a Wyvern.\nIt would around A Foot Long, covered in a\nTough , Black Leather.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Note", "We will meet in the hotel - V.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ikurnamon Staff", "Within your grasp is an Ikurnamon smithed\nstaff, at roughly 4 and a half feet. The long\ndark brown handle would be polished. Along\nthe handle in an upward direction is\ninscribed the Elven phrase \"Iheiuhii ito\ntaliaman\", accompanying the top and bottom of\nthis phrase would be two small emeralds\nplaced into the straight long handle. Very\nnear the top the brown handle would become\ngray, with small branches perpetuating from\natop the handle. On the bottom of the handle\na set of stag horns is carved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serge4nt_Forge99.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Arganos' Beard", "An edible cave litchen of a faint blue green\nhue. When one eats the dry, paper like moss\nthey soon experience a rather joyous drunken\nstate. Colors brighten and music intensifies\nas you feel the urge to dance.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dakirennis.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("ThunderKrug", "The most potent strain of Cactus Green\ndiscovered or produced. It was collected from\nthe newly bloomed World Cactus itself.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Raskalyvat (Wavy Greatsword)", "This zweihander was once wielded by Sylvia\nAstri, Captain of the Hearth Guard. Etched\ninto the blade is a phrase in Raevir: \"Честь\nи Верность\". The legnth of this zweihander is\na total of 70 inches while the blade itself\nis 55 inches. The parrying hooks are 4 inches\nfrom the crossguard and the crossguard is a\ntotal of 10 inches in width. The grip is 13\ninches long with a round pommel at the\nbottom. The grip is also firmly wrapped in a\ndark red leather to provide the best hold\npossible. This blade was specially crafted\nand forged from slayersteel. It would have\nthe strength of steel while holding the\nproperties of aurum. This blade has seen many\nbattles, and has served its purpose.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PosidonX7.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Chimera Tail", "The tail of a once mighty chimera! The tail\nhas been cut clean from the rest of its body.\nThe tail would be spiked along the shaft and\nhas the prick of a scorpion's stinger at the\nhead of the tail.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Zeugl's Eye", "The eye of a horrendous Zeugul, a tentacled\ncreature that had made its home in the\nshipwreck of the Ruthern ship. It has been\npunctured by a sharp weapon. This trophy was\nreclaimed from the Zeugl's body after it was\nslain in an underwater battle by the\nHaensetian Royal Army.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:magma_cream", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Bone Sword", "This bone has been carved and crafted to look\nlike a sword, jagged 'teeth' run down one\nedge. The hilt of the blade is wrapped in\nblack leather, with a green gem mounted at\nthe pommel.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Enchanted Pillows", "Arcane I\nThese pillows, when slept on, will give\ninduce good dreams and a well rest. Perfect\nfor relaxation.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("The Purity Mask of Ignis", "The maks is a pure white Dove color. You feel\na sense of closure and comfort when holding\nit. The Black coloring that once poisoned the\nmask is now gone, leaving behind a pure\ncolor. It is a symbol of the good that lays\nin the hearts of all souls, even in those\nthat stray from the light. The mask can be\nworn, and is made of a very hard almost iron\nsubstance but it is very light. Once could\nput their weight on it and it would not\nbreak. Nor would a arrow or crossbow bolt.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elumeria's Pumpkin Ale", "The slightly sweet yellow drink has a\ntraditional light ale taste, combined with\nthe sweetness of a pumpkin, giving your taste\nbuds a nice caress while also making your\nhead tingle in a pleasant way. - Elumeria's\nWild Brewery", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Confit de Canard", "Specially prepared using a centuries-old\npreserve and slow-cooking process, the duck\nmeat is marinated in salt, garlic and thyme\nfor 36 hours and then slow-cooked in its own\nfat at low temperatures. Served with confit\nroasted potatoes and garlic", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Bird House Red", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Locket", "A well made locket melted of a mixture of\ngold and silver. It is a link of many little\nchain-rings which form up to the locket\nitself. If opened, it has one empty side for\na picture to be put, and the other side\npadded with soft red cotton.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Brokenhelix.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Goldy", "A simple yet sharp Aurum dagger bearing the\nengraving of a hedgehog with a stern look.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Longsword", "A thick blade of frost-tempered bronze, used\nby the Knights of the Vaeyl Order and\nplundered from the storerooms of Lasthope.\nIts flat surface is engraved with cursive Aex\nletters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Withered Maple", "An occult symbol for sure, this elder maple;\nOnce strong and beautiful livingwood, it has\nbeen twisted into a gnarled, cursed token.\nEven those not attuned to the hexer's craft\ncan feel an uneasy aura surrounding it, as if\none isn't truly alone when in its presence. A\ntestimate to how even the strongest roots and\nbrightest lights can be subdued. [ PM Gallic\nto interact! ]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Solace.", "minecraft:deadbush", ""),
        StaticItem("Kingdom Castle of Wood", "an elegant little castle made completely of\nwood with alot of rooms inside, Elegant cloth\ninterwined in the wood to keep it up, it's\ncolor is an brown bordeaux and in it's inside\nit seems that there are some steel soldiers,\nwhich are dressed with clothes made from\ntheir size\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gioia24.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Commander Boots", "(Rare) A pair of Iron boots recovered from a\nCultist Commander. The boots themself are\nmodeled on standard steel toed hiking boots,\nbut these have small spikes lining both the\nheel and sole.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugarfoot's Flute of Wisdom", "This flute was grown from a sapling of an oak\ntree, one solid piece perfectly grown through\ndruidism and careful hand carving to provide\na beautiful, resonant tone with its notes.\nIntricate carvings of vines twist around the\nbody of the flute, with a small emerald\nembedded beside the mouthpiece. The\nWinterleaf symbol is embossed in a small\ncraftsmans' mark on the underside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fungal Cane", "A crooked cane forged from the bark of a tree\nridden away by necromantic manipulation,\nsprouting mushroom buds and fungal plates\nwherever it may. It, surely, has existed for\nlong enough to warrant such growths.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Glineth.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Nicolas", "A small baby Nicolas wrapped in a white\nblanket!", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Quartz Ring", "An elaborate ring of quartz carved to have\nthe appearance of many overlaying leaves.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Venator Head", "Head of a slain venator, eyes glassy. The\nshape is akin to a raptor's, though a bit\nbulkier. Atop its skull, still intact, are\nscales which seem more rufescent than the\nother dark green ones.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Nautilus Shell Necklace", "A golden shell with eye-catching looks,\ncrafted by the best. It seemed to just be\nplain and boring, however if examined\nclosely, within the spiral end, a ward of\nfire can be seen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by not_wiseacres.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Random Blood", "", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Acorns", "The acorns came from an ent, having a small,\nrandom chance to grow another one.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cave_Creature.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Fièvre Brûlante", "A beautifully dated wine, being held in a\ncool basement for over fifty years. Its taste\nis extraordinary. A date is engraved upon the\nbottom of the bottle; '10th of Snow's Maiden,\n1585'.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("shrooms", "Shrooms picked from the dankest swamp.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Multi-task Boar Bone", "A jagged Boar Bone with a short tip at the\nend, slightly charred at the middle as though\nit were used to cook over a fire, not great\nfor impaling, but great for cutting and\nchiseling\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("ↈ ＣＯＢＡＬＴ ＧＬＡＳＳ ＶＡＳＥ ↈ", "Ａ ｖａｓｅ ｍａｄｅ ｏｆ ｃｏｂａｌｔ ｇｌａｓｓ. Ｔｈｅ ｇｌａｓｓ ｔｈｅ\nｖａｓｅ ｉｓ ｍａｄｅ ｆｒｏｍ ｉｓ ａ ｄｅｅｐ ｂｌｕｅ, ａｎｄ ｉｓ\nｍｉｌｄｌｙ ｔｒａｎｓｌｕｃｅｎｔ, ａｌｌｏｗｉｎｇ ｔｈｒｏｕｇｈ ｓｍａｌｌ,\nｗａｒｐｅｄ ｒａｙｓ ｏｆ ｌｉｇｈｔ ｔｈｒｏｕｇｈ ｉｔ＇ｓ ｓｕｒｆａｃｅ.\nＴｈｅ ｖａｓｅ ｉｓ ｏｎｅ ａｎｄ ａ ｈａｌｆ ｆｅｅｔ ｔａｌｌ, ａｎｄ ｃａｎ\nｈｏｌｄ ｏｎｅ ｇａｌｌｏｎ ｏｆ ｌｉｑｕｉｄ. Ｔｈｅ ｎｅｃｋ ｏｆ ｔｈｅ\nｖａｓｅ ｔａｐｅｒｓ ｉｎｗａｒｄ, ｔｈａｎ ｔａｐｅｒｓ ｏｕｔ ｎｅａｒ ｔｈｅ\nｔｏｐ, ｆａｎｎｉｎｇ ｏｕｔ ｓｉｍｉｌａｒ ｔｏ ｔｈｅ ｅｎｄ ｏｆ ａ\nｔｒｕｍｐｅｔ. Ｔｈｅ ｖａｓｅ ｂｅａｒｓ ａ ６ ｉｎｃｈ ｔａｌｌ ｓｔｒａｎｄ\nｏｆ ｒａｉｓｅｄ ｇｌａｓｓ ａｔ ｔｈｅ ｍｉｄｐｏｉｎｔ ｏｆ ｉｔ＇ｓ\nｓｕｒｆａｃｅ, ｗｉｔｈ ｖｅｒｔｉｃａｌ ｌｉｎｅｓ ｉｎｄｅｎｔｅｄ ｉｎｔｏ ｉｔ\nａｔ ｈａｌｆ ｉｎｃｈ ｉｎｔｅｒｖａｌｓ, ｇｉｖｉｎｇ ｔｈｅ ｓｔｒａｎｄ ａ\n＇ｓｔｒｉｐｅｄ＇ ａｐｐｅａｒａｎｃｅ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Glassblower] Ypres.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Beekeepers Hat", "A beekeepers helm to get honey from bees", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("DPM's tablecloth", "", "minecraft:carpet", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_38(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("A Blacken Tungsten Qalasheen Ring", "A black tungsten Qalasheen ring that would be\ncovered with sparkling ornate crystalline\nleaves. A Qalasheen vector design of the\ntungsten gives the ring a unique view that\ndazzles the eye. Diamonds embedded in the\nvector design all the way to the centerpiece\nwould hold a heart shaped emerald that would\nglisten in the light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Tickig Clock", "A steam clock that well its a clock...\nNothing else", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sarkozic Crow", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Spruce Leaf Insence Stick", "", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Pieces of Rock", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("One Consultation", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Scout Report #72", "A scouting report: About half a mile west of\nthis location we saw reports of shrubs and\nbranches being displaced. Also sights of\nblood being seen on the ground. Need to look\nfurther with a bigger group.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Jorik's Special Potato", "A very \"Special\" Potato for very \"Special\npeople", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Easterner Fire Crackers", "Obnoxiously loud fireworks created by the\nEasterners of Oyashima. Used for celebrations\nand distractions. Keep out of reach of\nchildren.", "minecraft:fireworks", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Hand", "One of a set of armwear. The bracer component\nis steel chainmail, covered with the shaggy\npelt of a great bear. The glove is of more\nflexible direwolf pelt, its finer, white fur\ndyed brown to match that of the bears.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Short Spear of White Peak", "A long spear forged in the fires of the White\nPeak forges. having a long and broad tip,\nperfect for hunting and fighting purposes,\nsix feet in length with a wellbalanced grip\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Puppet of bone", "A puppet carved out of bone, ressembling a\nmostly human shape, although with the ability\nof being modified, two holes are carved\nbeneath the eyes, the very item seems to give\noff a rather dreadful feeling.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jentos.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Fisherman's Boots", "Thick, brown leather boots. They are\nwaterproofed for use in muddy or wet\nenvironments", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Deep Roads Key", "(Key) A key for the Deeproads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Prepared Cloth Sack", "A medium size sack, including some\nStrawberries, Apples, Blueberries, a few\nPotatos, other than food the sack would also\nhold a some decent bandages.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Missed Payment Warning", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by SaintPaint.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rams Horn", "The hilt of the sword has Wp Carved into the\nhandle in a majestic writing and the sight of\nthis sword is enough to make a man tremble in\nhis footsteps for it glistens in the sun as\nit is a bastard of a weapon and the bane of\nyour existence\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Boots", "A set of simple rough leather boots, the fore\nand the sides lined with strips of iron to\nprotect from low swings. The interiors are\nlined with Highland wool to ensure the wearer\nremains warm in the cold winters of the\nNorth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Greaves", "A simple pair of iron greaves meant to cover\nthe shins. The interiors are padded with\nHighland wool, meant to be worn over the\npants or to keep bare legs from immediately\nfreezing in the northern cold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Curiass", "A simple iron curiass, lined with Highland\nwool. Straps would hold the fore plate to the\naft plate. Some simple runes would be carved\nabout the pauldrons.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Helmet", "A simple iron helm, clearly made with care.\nIts interior is lined with Highland wool. The\nhelm would be of the pot helm pattern. Some\nold runes are carved about the facial\nopening.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 3, column 2)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Longsword", "A well crafted double edged longsword of\ndwarven design. A bloodline would follow\nalong the edges of the blade. The crossguard\nwould be rounded hardly extending from the\nedge of the blade. The pommel would be the\nshape of a mallet, smaller than the closed\nfist of a dwarf.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bergukli] Addek Hammerforge.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghoul-Slayer Longsword", "This blade killed the ghoul that slew High\nPontiff Jude, it's somewhat Holy.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Lightsaber", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("nice gaming chair", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Moo Food", "Cow fooderino yearino\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("A Red Glowstone Fake eye", "A Magnificent Red Glowstone Eye, It’s pupal\nis made of pure black obsidian that is as\npure black as the darkest cave. The Glowstone\nIs a Beautiful bright red, That Glows Red\neven in the daylight yet in the dark, it is\nterrifying with the Obsidian pupal that\nstares into your soul with the red glow of\nlava around it! This must have taken months\nto make.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Gioia24", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of the Night Eater", "The skull of an undead abomination. The\noriginal creature it came from looks like it\nwasn't of this realm.. Just holding onto it\ngives you unsettling thoughts.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Undead Abomination.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Curon Officer's Dirk", "Short-bladed sidearm, utilitarian yet elegant\nin design. A badge of office, this finely\nmade weapon's blade bears a small national\nsymbol near the hilt. The ferrum, once a\nglimmering silver, has been tarnished with a\npeculiar greenish grey, and seems to fume\nwith a gentle black mist. Its bite incites a\nburning sensation not unlike that of alcohol,\nhowever rather than cleanse as that might,\nthis pain heralds the spreading of necrotic\ntaint that will fester as infection until\ntreated with holy magics. [t4 or equivalent.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kalehart.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ajax's Killer Machine", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Stone Club Of Prizes", "", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengrad Lager", "A crisp golden liquid with a refreshing taste\ntinged with light biterness. It is\nencapsulated in an elegant bottle of some\nlitre in volume. Upon its front the Ruric\nseal would be stamped in wax.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloddrycker", "Ett mörkt rött svärd, färgat från det\nkonstanta blodet, sappat från sina offer. Det\nger en liten hum när det svänger som det\nglänsar i månskenet.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoke Whisper", "Also known as \"Smoke in a Bottle,\" when this\ngray mixture is exposed to air, a mass of\nsmoke will cloud the area. It will cause\nirritation when breathed and and when it\ncontacts eyes.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Military Fork", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Shortsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The little corpse of a rat", "The little corpse of a rat which has gone\nthrough rigor mortis, as the body had\nstiffend up when the last breath had left its\nbody.. its grey fur covered in a few blood\nsplatthers and its yellow teeth sticking\nforward in terror.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [High Chief] Bjor 'Sugartits' Cottonwood.", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Katana", "This wooden katana is used as an inexpensive\nand relatively safe substitute for a real\nsword.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toyotomi Ashigawa.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven bones", "These are the bones of a dwarven farmer that\nwas a victim to a horrible mutation...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Haeseni Bread", "This bread is produced in the Kingdom of\nHaense.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Doggedwasupxxx.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Daemon Steel Longsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Map (row 2, column 10)", "", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("~-=+=-~ Sweet Tea ~-=+=-~", "This tea has a sweet flavor. It would be a\nlovly amber color and would smell or furit", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Looter's Chestpiece", "The item is dwarf sized, made of rusted\nferrum chainlinks. As far as condition goes\nit would have a few messed up places from\ncombat as well as a few holes cut into it but\nall over its still one piece\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Strong Wooden training sword", "A marvelous replica of a sword, but safe for hitting!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sandey0000.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The eye of a Thomson", "Legend has it this eye was carved from a\nyoung man upon his wedding day..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Damascus Rapier", "A Cup Hilt Rapier that uses a Twist Damascus\nStyle for the Blade to give it a Unique Color\nand Strength, it would have a Cup Hilt with\nTwo Sprouting Angles to help support the\nBlade by allowing the User to get a Grip on\nthe Blade. It would also have a Cup-Hilt to\ndefend the User from Attacks to his Hand, the\nbase of the Pommel as the Insignia 'GS' on\nit.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rotella Shield", "A Rotella made of Light Strengthened Steel,\nit would have a Black Leather Layer with a\nGrip Reinforced with several rivets, an\nEmbriodery on the back would bear the letters\nGS' most likely marking the Owner of the\nShield. On the front side, however, an Inlay\nWeaves around the Outside Aesthetically, as a\nGold Inlay would Bear the Words \"Stafyr and\nStrong\" would gently move along the Curve of\nthe Shield.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("The Bear Breastplate", "A well made breastplate forged with a mixture\nof ferrum and bronze, upon the chestpiece is\nan intricate sigil of a bear with it's maw\nopen threateningly. Smithed by Edward\nBarbanov.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Theodosian Municipal Library.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Chess Board", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lapis Charm", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorpion Flesh", "The flesh of a scorpion. It has a spicy taste\nand moist texture.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("15th Century Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Roman Scutum", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Monstrous fingers of the 'purple s'it", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Battleaxe", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Gnome Cleaver", "An abnormally large carrot is carved into the\nshape of an axe head..though a carrot it is\nsurprisingly sharp and capable of slicing\nthrough flesh. Its hilt is made of a oak wood\nbranch, carved with a intricate pattern of\nheadless gnomes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Pork", "Called “Pork” by Bjor who gained the boar's\ntrust after he saved the Alpha boar from a\ngroup of hunters and cleaned its wounds with\nsome good Dwarven ale. It's a muscular & fur\ncovered rather large boar with 2 big tusks,\nstanding roughly at the same height of Bjor\nwhom is often accompanied by other smaller\nboars of the herd. Pork can be seen following\nBjor or roaming around at Bjor's abode. Bears\n(or boars) a tattoo ditto to Bjor's. ((Msg\nAfoc17 for info))!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bjor.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rack of Pork Ribs", "Spare ribs slowly and carefully braised with\nalot of Cottonwood love. As one would chub\nthrough the meat, you could see it would be\nnice and juicy. The ribs would be corved in a\nsweet sauce, containing mainly honey and some\nsecrets spices, which would cause the sauce\nto caramelise a bit, giving the ribs a\nbrown-goldish colour on the outside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chef Sugartits.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("~ - x Stall Tax Sheet x - ~", "A Paper Labed \"Barmount Horse Stall Tax\nSheet\". If not paid on due time ((Once a\nweek)) your stall may be evicted.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Boonay_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("~`TeddyBaer`~", "This TeddyBaer is a sany color, it's fur a\nlittle long with a red bow tie around it's\nneck, it's button eyes are black as well with\nit's button nose, it stands 15 inches tall\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HopeSky123.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Golden-Apple Cider", "This cider seems to reflect in the light like\ngold. Fine gold crumbs float in the drink,\nwhich are seemingly crushed gold leaves. The\nsmell of this cider is a bit rustic, but very\nfruity with a slight sour note, very popular\nwith noble families.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Barkeep] Lucian Curaçao.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rotten Carrot", "", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Elumeria's Watermelon Tequila", "The pure red drink has a sweet aroma of\nwatermelon mixed with strong alcochol. The\ntaste is rather weird, but oddly makes you\nwant to try just one more sip. - Elumeria’s\nWild Brewery", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Suffonian Wedding Ring", "A pure golden wedding ring with the names\nFiona & Oscar engraved inside. A red ruby\nplaced in the centre with leaves surrounding\nit made out of silver. Along the outside of\nthe ring markings were scratched into the\nring, one being a dove, Symbolizing\nEverlasting care and love for one.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Celaena Annungilben.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("High Elven Bow", "A polished bow carved from white wood and\ntrimmed with silver. The symbol of the\nMali'thilln is carved into the wood with\nmasterful skill.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Fox ~", "This fox was left on your doorstep Krugmas\neve, will you care for this baby fox?", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("White And Red Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lain's Tear", "A marquise sppahire hangs vertically cupped\ngently in a pair of fair, silver hands. The\nhands themselves connected by a lithe, spiga\nchain. It's small silver rings etched by the\ntelltale twisting knots of dark elven design.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dakirennis.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Jewel of Haense", "A necklace with a beautifully carved and\npolished blue gem hanging from a fine line of\nweaved silver strings. A work of true\ncraftsmanship, it's probably rather\nexpensive.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("A Cultured Pearl and Diamond Necklace", "The necklace contains 4 Pearl Strands,\ndouble-knotted, containing 48 pearls total.\nThe Pearls match well and exhibit beautiful\nPink Tones with magnificent luster, and only\na few slight blemishes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SpoopyBoonay.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Tennis Bracelet", "A Bracelet that has Been Beautifully Crafted\nInter-Locking Links, Containing Cut Diamonds!\nThe Clasp is a Sliding Tab Style Clasp and\nhas a figure eight safety hook. The Bracelet\nis durable and heavy and lays beautifully on\nthe wrist.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by killumantii_.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Orchid Pendant", "A Long Gold Chain, encrusted with cut\nSignificantly-Perfect Diamonds! The End's of\nthe Chain meet, by a Dangling Blue-Orchid\nmade out of Blue-Diamonds. Like it's Twin\nPedant, along the Stem of the Orchid, the\nname Isabella would be visible.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial de Ruyter Signet Ring", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull splitter (Warhammer)", "This warhammer would be made of a high carbon\nsteel, it's handle would have red leather\ncovering from the bronze pommel to the hammer\nhead for easy grip, the hammer head would\nconsist of a hammer and on the other side\nwould be a spike. The Warhammer would weigh\nat around 7,5 kg's at the head of the hammer,\nthere would sit a signature of Mariane'a\nAbernathy, burnt into the leather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mariane'a.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Topaz Chest", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Wooden Doll ~", "This doll would look like a would like the\nwoof elf named Aster. The deep dark brown\neyes would be painted on, same with the rest\nof the face. The red-ish brown hair.. looks a\nlittle to real and is in a thiccc braid", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Final Testament of his Former Lordship, Henry Sinbad de Azcona of Riviä", "This is the final document by his Former\nLordship of Riviä, Henry de Azcona. The note\nwould be neatly written with a black ink and\nit'd be clear that Henry wrote this himself\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MCVDK.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Grapefruit", "this is a Grapefruit", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Ruby Heart Earrings ~", "These sliver and ruby earring as shaped into\na heart with the ruby at the center of each.\nA great component to your jewelry collection!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bethinwonderland.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Small Sliver Rose Ring ~", "Inspired by the beauty and wonder found all\naround us, capture a symbol of nature's\nenduring spirit with this delicately crafted\nSmall Rose Ring. It also fits most fingers\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bethinwonderland.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Arrow ring ~", "This ring is in the shape of an arrow, it\ncurls so the feathers and tip of the arrow\ndon't touch, it is simple yet beautiful. It\nis best worn as a pinky ring\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bethinwonderland.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Fox Head Pendant ~", "This rose gold fox head would hang from a\nwhite gold box chain, if one looked closely\nat the eye of the fox it would be some kind\nof black gem stone\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bethinwonderland.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo War Monger", "The Bokolo Bird would have a red face paint\nover its right eye, feathers tinted white and\ngrey. The bird has quick agility and is\ntrained by the one \"Eric.\" The Bokolo is\nseven feet tall when stood straight and has\nyellow eyes.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blow-Gun", "A roughly fashioned blow-gun designed to fit\na small dart, capable of shooting precisely\nat a good range.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Petrite Sword", "This khopesh looks to have a dark smokey\nstonelike appearance and seems to have a very\nrough look, from a distance it would be\nmistaken of a rock. Infact as you look at it,\nit is a steel sword and seems to be well made\nand quite sharp.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by loupgareu.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blade of storm's", "This blade was forged in Kaz'ad Barakir by\nthe runelord's the blade when activated by\ntouch would encase itself in lighting and\nwhen coming into contact with another object\nat the blade's edge it would hit that object\nwith the power of raw lighting [uses 2-3\nbefore refuling at the city] [pm for use\noverlord8000]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rivian Baton", "a Fair sized, weighted baton. It has the\nRivia symbol encrested into it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jacobcraft04.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling's dagger", "A short dagger, smaller than many and most as\nit's suited and re-sized for a halfling.. or\nperhaps a midget, gnome or goblin of smallest\ncaliber? The blade is sharp and has flowers\nengraved into the metal, the handle bears\ngolden outlines.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Behelit", "The Behelit is too large to be a proper\nsword. Massive, heavy and rough as its blade\nruns down being about 55 inches long;\ndefinitely a claymore, powerful, raw and\nintensely forged. Its blade has runic\netchings that harken to past ages of sorcery\nand magics long since forgotten. The Blood\nSteel length is satured in the blood of Orcs,\nGhouls and Frostwitches, capable of stinging\nwith a frosty chill when it cuts flesh and\nsinew. It glimmers with icy power, drawing\nblood with indifference as cold as its red\nsteel. The wyvernbone hilt is bejeweled and\nacts as a potent catalist for magic, its\ncenterpiece having small embedded ruibrium\ngems that glitter provocatively when blood is\ndrawn.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Spooky Dwarf Mask", "A rubber mask made out to resemble a\nterrifying Kin-Slayer!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Cigar", "", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Aloe Vera and Almonds", "A drink containing Aloe Vera, and bit of\nAlmond. (Upon consumption the drink will give\na heart attack)", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Compass", "(Common) A compass recovered from a cultist\nof Vilketa's layer. While at one point this\ncompass may have worked, its needle simply\nspins in random directions now.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Paleknight Bane", "In the hands of Dwifar 'the fat' Goldhand it\nslew Baldin the Paleknight\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Diddyski.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("~Malvegil~", "Steel blade with gold etching of leaves and\nroots on the lemmet, The Hilt made of wooden\nwith golden roots hand painted on to it.The\nblade itselt being around 60cm in length,\nsharpen on both side.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arwenia Kaeronin.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Great Axe", "A large war ax of dwarven make. The head is a\nsimplistic double bit, the middle of the\nweapon shaft having a band of similar looking\nsteel. The center band is the weakest point\non this basic weapon. Its shaft is made of a\nHoney locust for a heavy but reasonably\nuseful shaft\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pork Jerky", "Dried pork strips smoked over an oaken fire", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrew Meat", "A premium cut of shrew meat, a little gamey\nand chewy but the proper stew could bring\nthat right down to a tender selection of\nmeat.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrew Skin", "The item is a chunk of fur from what was\nseemingly agiant shrew. the edges would have\ndried blood in its tuffs and part of the fur\nwould be burned but over all not a terrible\nprize from a beast.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Red lizard remains", "This is the body of a wierd creature recently\ndiscovered.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial o' wisp", "A medium vial of master alchemy sits within\nyour hands. You can see a thin layer of black\nliquid sticking to the bottom of the vial,\nthick black smoke fogs the bottle.. Upon\nthrowing this on impact it will release the\nsmoke, those who take in the smoke will not\nonly cause temporary breathing problems but\nirritation to the eyes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nafari.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Urist's Walking Stick", "On first glance this appears to be a ordinary\nwalking stick made out of thick sturdy oak\nwith some basic carvings engraved onto the\nwood, on closer inspection it looks to be\ndetachable in the middle which would create\ntwo clubs when separated.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HeadcrabD.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of hemp_hood", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Plated Pickaxe", "this pick have been platted beautifuly with a\ngolden layer", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Hillclimber boots", "boots with a layer of direwolf pelt inside to\nallow for more comfort and warmth during the\ntimes when you just got to climb\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by welshnutter.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Human Seeds", "A bag of seeds with a tag that reads \"100%\nRIGHT FROM YOUR FIELDS! YOU CAN THEN USE\nHUMANS ARE ONLY GOOD TO BE USED AS SLAVES.\nENJOY. -KRUGKORP", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Charm Box", "It's a tiny, fist-sized box with delicate\nscroll on the lid and small metal hinges. It\ncloses with a latch, and is made for holding\ntrinkets and jewelry.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Stew", "This bowl of stew was perfectly mixed with\nhearty prok broth and wheat flower to create\na thick mixture. Young potatoes chopped into\ncubes, slices of brown mushrooms, and pieces\nof carrots would litter the thick food to\nmake a delicious meal. Thyme, season-all\nsalt, pepper, and lemon pepper with a pinch\nof leon zest would mix with the food to offer\na savoury taste. Chunks of rabbit would also\nbeautifully add to the stew!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:rabbit_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Gorundyr Steak Pudding Pie", "This delicious, boiled, meat pie would be\ncovered in a golden wheat crust with suet\npellets mixed within. Inside of it would be\nthinly sliced, stacked, lean cuts of stead\nthat was rubbed and seasoned with pepper,\nsalt, thyme, season-all, a pinche of mace, a\nsprinkle of nutmeg, a small spoon of\nbrownsugar and honey, and a dash of lemon\njuice. The round pudding pie would have been\napproximately boiled in a cheese cloth for\nabout three or so hours, as the meats within\nwould have cause the excessive time. The\ndelectable blends of seasonsings would taste\nabsolutely divine with the wheat taste. What\na meal!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Saoirse] Maehb Ravja-Vigten.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Freshwater Agnarum Oiysters", "Palm Sized and tender, from the waters inside\nAgnarum and seasoned with chives and garlic\nbutter. Comes in batches of twelve", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Chateau Mounton", "Simply perfection, a label on this bottle of\nchampagne reads: Chateau Mounton. On the\nbottom also reads 1500. It tastes wonderful.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cheesy Pork Gizzard over Egg Noodles", "Thickly sliced pork gizzard slathered in\ncheese could be seen here over a healthy bed\nof buttery egg noodles. Mushrooms and onion\nalong with garlic are strewn in the cheese\nsauce adding flavor to this dish", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Hunting Event Ticket", "Merry Krugsmas! This ticket will grant you\naccess to one free hunting event (whenever\nneeded) from your local ET, Bluee. Simply\nchant the words \"I'm Bluee da ba dee da ba\ndaa\" (then /whisper Bluee) and a mystical\ncreature will appear at your whim!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Embottled fart of a grey sprite", "A fart which has been carefully stored in\nthis bottle. The fart would originate from a\ngrey sprite giving it the property, if\ninhaled, that the person would fall asleep. A\nd20 would be rolled for the effectiveness of\nputting the target to sleep.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Grey Sprite] Muu D'eril.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Sword", "This carrot is sharp and is the size of a\nsword, much sharp much danger\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Falk'je gron (Bardiche)", "This is a gorundyr styled axe. The massive\nhead of the axe is made of Jorgundic Black\nmetal and has gorundyr runes carved into it\nleading down into the ashwood shaft of the\naxe. Many black, brown and gray feathers hang\nfrom the axe head while a bone necklace hangs\nfrom the butt of the handle that is wrapped\nin brown stained leather decorated with soft\nfur. This is a well made and crafted weapon\nwith \"~Arberrang~\" nicely carved into the\nshaft of the massive axe.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Keldar (Dwarven Spear)", "A 6ft long Dwarven style spear. A golden\nhandle with a steel tip. The handle itself\nwould be religiously decorated with the\nsymbol of Anbella.The whole spear is wrapped\nwith a dark green moss. The butt of the spear\nwould have the seal of the Dwa\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by J33xt101.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Brooch of the Bachelor", "An ironic name for a brooch given to the best\ndressed man at the Fennic Ball. This piece is\ncrafted in the shape of a snowflake, which\nshimmers faintly. The piece showcases the\nsame excellent craftsmanship as its\ncounterpart, the Diadem of the Debutante,\nwith swirling patterns engraved into the gold\nto give the user even more of an air of\nfinery about them. The bachelor who this was\nawarded to is sure to not remain one for\nlong!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aeldrin.", "minecraft:gold_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Morko Bear Pelt", "A large section of bear pelt. The fur is\nshort to medium length, stiff, and brown.\nThere is enough of the pelt here to be used\nas a blanket for a dwarf and has a slight\nshine to it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Garlic Roasted Chicken", "", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Meat Pockets", "Animal hearts stuffed in a soft bread shell ,\ncheese oozing out the hearts with garlic ,\nonion, mushroom and hot pepper", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Blowgun", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Mutant Flesh", "A blanket-sized portion of flesh from a\nmutated creature. It is quite heavy and\nrather rough.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of magicalpie4000", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Princess' Gem", "A golden based necklace, with strands going\ndown in the shapes of irregular crystals. On\nthe crystal shaped strands were pressed in\ndiamonds, of about 30 carats each.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Written Book", "A master's guide on the arcane art of fire\nevocation. Details all known specifics and\nlevels of evocation known currently. A\nthorough and comprehensive textbook that will\naid your fire evocation journey greatly.\nSignature: Aerolun Cyredaer", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Dewper's Ego", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Bands", "A wedding band for the marriage of Leila\nRubens and Véres Draskovits, this one was\nhand-made by Véres, for his bethrothed on the\n3rd of the Grand Harvest, 1658. It appeared\nto be encrusted in some sort jewel, similar\nto that of a ruby.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chorale_.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandit's Bow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ladies Woolen Scarf", "A scarf made of real wool. It was plain in\ncolour; a light creamy-white. It's length was\nenough to have it reach five foot from one\nend to the other, meaning it was perfect for\na lady who wished to stay warm and cozy. Each\nend was frayed, decorated with soft, almost\nsilken feeling tassles. Finally, scattered\nwithin the knitting pattern, were designs of\nflowers and leaves.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Laurelin.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Upir's ears", "A pair of ears belonging to an Upir. They\ncould prove as a strong alchemical\ningredient, a symbol of air.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Norman Helm", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Oversized Raven Feather", "A sword like long, dark feather. The seize of\nthe single feather indicates, how big the\nentire beast must have been! Trophy for\nkilling the posessed Haense raven.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Bridge Deed", "The deed to a bridge scrawled on parchment\nwith a steady hand, complete with wax seal\nand signatures.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ringlet of Red and Gold", "A crown of tulips, coloured red and gold, has\nbeen woven together to fit the form of a\nmale's head. The stems have been perfectly\nslit in half - interlocking with their\nneighbours to ensure the ringed crown is\nsecurely fastened. It seems to have been made\nwith great care and experience.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eleaina.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Yellow Marble", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("WarPick - OP", "", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Lamb Chops over Egg Noodles", "Lamb chops over egg noodles can be seen with\na type of gravy poured overtop , garlic and\nonion also garnish the dish with a side of\nsalad", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Grandaxe Vodka", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Blow Dart", "A blow dart carved from a carrot. It inner\nchamber is lined with a poisnous concotion of\nAlabaster Leaves and the spores of the\nBlistering Toad fungus\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Shurikens", "Small carrots are carved into the form of\nshurikens, the edges capable of piercing skin\nand leather clothes. A gnome skull is carved\ninto the center on each\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Band", "A wedding band finely crafted from gold, and\nset with a series of oval cut emeralds,\nembedded with smaller white jewels. Thin\nvines would be embossed about the sides of th\nring, entwining with leaves and verious\ngreenery. This ring belongs to a pair.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imibee.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Forktail Wyvern Talons", "*Moderator Approved*\nAengoth approved this item.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Shifter's Blade", "A thick curved dagger with a blackened steel\nblade of 18 inches long, 2.5 inches thick.\nThe hilt of the dagger is large, fitting for\nthe transformation such a weapon can go\nthrough, with a white diamond embedded. The\nblade is heavy and dense, providing more\npowerful but slow motions. This dagger is\nsecretly enchanted with a second form,\nbecoming longer (30 inches) and thinner (2\ninches): a sword. [T5 enchantment, 1 month\nrecharge, msg Original_Potato for info].\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cultist Sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrew skull", "The damaged skull of a giant shrew. the head\nwould have a chunk missing from the top of it\nas well as the jaw but is otherwise a well\nkept skull.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cougar fangs", "Some sharp fangs, once belonging to a cougar.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("A strange, purple and pink mushroom...", "", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Diseased Hulking Mass Flesh", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Pelt", "A portion of high-quality fur, originating\nfrom a large bear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironborn Short Sword", "(Rare) An Iron short sword recovered from an\nIronborn. The sword itself was obviously made\nby a master Dwarven smith, but it\ndistinguishes itself by having the sigil of\nthe Ironborn clan printed onto the pommel.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Runestone V", "(Runestone) A peculier iron 'stone' that is\ncovered in runes. The sphere shaped object\nhas very little space that is not covered by\nthe runic language, only an Arch - Runelord\ncould hope to understand them.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Concoction Recipe", "(Legendary) A recipe recovered from an\nIronborn citadel in the Deeproads. It\ncontains the secrets as to how to construct a\nMysterious Concoction.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood", "", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Mortal Blood", "", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Match", "A stick that can be used to burn the world!\nOr just some pipeweed.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosenyr Tax Papers", "Tax papers worth 50 minas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Stack Of Scripture", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("✸ Pearlescent Emberstar [T5] ✸", "Arcane I\nOne of many weapons made popular by Emberco,\na holy weapons company stationed in the\ndwarven city of Kal’Omith. The Emberstar is\nthe latest and greatest answer to the age old\nquestion: ‘How the nether am I supposed to\nkill a pale/dreadknight?’ Emberstars come in\nmany different colors, be sure to collect\nthem all! Unscrewing the pommel reveals a\nhidden manual. https://goo.gl/ZZqwTP\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("✸ Persimmon Emberstar [T5] ✸", "One of many weapons made popular by Emberco,\na holy weapons company acting as a subsidiary\nof the Ascended. The Emberstar is the latest\nand greatest answer to the age old question:\n‘How the nether am I supposed to kill a\ndreadknight?’ Emberstars come in many\ndifferent colors, be sure to collect them\nall! Unscrewing the pommel reveals a hidden\nmanual. https://goo.gl/ZZqwTP\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("✸ Vermillion Emberstar [T5] ✸", "One of many weapons made popular by Emberco,\na holy weapons company acting as a subsidiary\nof the Ascended. The Emberstar is the latest\nand greatest answer to the age old question:\n‘How the nether am I supposed to kill a\npale/dreadknight?’ Emberstars come in many\ndifferent colors, be sure to collect them\nall! Unscrewing the pommel reveals a hidden\nmanual. https://goo.gl/ZZqwTP\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Myrian Axe", "An ornate golden axe, a smaller, concave\nblade set upon a larger, more conventional,\nconvex one, bound to a staff, the three\ntenets carved upon it, with steel. The image\nof an ashtree is engraved on one face of the\nblade, the flames rising off it depicted\nblowing around to the other side.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Patriach's Shield", "A finely crafted roundel shield with steel\nrims wrapped around the circular border.\nBolts are sewn throughout the metal edge to\ntie the iron to wood. Lathered around the\nvery center is a deep black paint and\ndirectly in the middle is a ferocious\npainting of orange, yellow, and red hues. A\nbrilliant fire.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Flute of the Lost Dream", "A wooden flute made of dark-oak wood. It has\netchings of various animalsaround it's base.\nOne who plays the flute may notice various\neffects depending on the tune played.. [PM\nFinalhazard when being used.]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Captain's Pocketwatch", "A pocketwatch. It always seems to be stuck\nwithin the twilight-hours of the day.. Odd.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Pyraktó - The Black Metal Bastard Sword", "A bastard sword made of pure black ferrum\nfolded over in damascus fashion, leaving grey\nripples throughout the blade. A truly\nwonderful craft, made for a truly evil\npurpose yet used for good. Within the\ncrossguard of the sword rests a bright gem,\nan Aengul eye that is almost pulsing with\nmana. With the whispers of a key word, the\nblade will be emcompassed with flames. (Can\nbe activated 10 times before enchantment must\nbe recharged._\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag o' halflings candy", "Many assorted candy are inside this bag,\nsweet and tasty some, other sour, and even\nsome bitter. All had individual wrappers but\nsome said ‘Drugged’ on the surface of the\nwrapper, specifically green ones. If eaten\nthe green ones was enough to ma\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:pink_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Whiskey", "A potent amber colored brew sat within a dark\norange glass with a silver Ashtree logo. The\ndrink would smell pleasantly of spiced honey.\nThe warm blend would linger and warm the\nthroat leaving a strong cinnamon aftertaste\nthat would often overpower first time\ndrinkers. “Nordengradic Whiskey” would be\nprinted on the side of the bottle. Each\nbottle having a unique prayer to the All\nFather on the back.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternal Rose", "The long-stemmed rose never seems to decay,\nforever keeping its fresh form.", "minecraft:poppy", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Bean", "A special bean, enhanced through intense\ndruidic energies and exposure. If planted, it\nwould sprout some strange assortment of a\nbeanstalk. Peppermint candy would dangle off\nthe ends! Happy Krugsmas 2017.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Longbow", "A black, noticeably heavy longbow designed\npredominately for aesthetic elegance and\ndisplay, though with admirable talent could\nbe an effective weapon. The crown of both\nlimbs adorned by large silver petals, the\nstems entwining down the long, smooth black\nbody of the bow. Twirls and floral patterns\nare attached to loose the ends of stem. When\nvertical, it stands at about six feet. The\nbowstring is made of an elegant yet sturdy\nsilk.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Flamebrand Staff", "A tall staff made from the fallen branch of\nthe Ashwood Tree. It is rather sturdy and a\nbit thick, but still just as strong as wood!\nAt its top would be a small lantern like cage\nthat contains a flame, with a small\ncompartment for storing oil, ash syrup, or\nany other variety of flammables. You could\nuse this as a weapon, though it would be\nblunt and not that affective against armored\nopponents.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Direbear's pelt", "A Massive Direbear's pelt, this beast stood\nnearly twelve feet tall.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:black_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Spice Ale", "The ale has been prepared with pumpkin spice\nto help fit the holidays!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian Chunk", "A small, palm-sized chunk of obsidian from\nthe Burztorgo Firelands. Its smooth to the\ntouch and a glossy black.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Dank Ass Weed Yo", "", "minecraft:rose_bush", ""),
        StaticItem("Shriveled Twigs", "Just as a loving relationship, this dead\nshrubbery shall endure even with its\neccentric appearance.", "minecraft:dead_bush", ""),
        StaticItem("Horn of the Cygor", "This Horn, twisted and mangles like that of a\nwarped tree after a storm, belonged to a\ngiant Cygor. On him, it would've been a\nfearsome weapon. Off him, its gone brittle,\nbut good for decoration.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Hemlock", "Crafting component and alchemy ingredient.", "minecraft:dark_oak_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Yellow Bokolo Plushie", "A yellow bokolo plushie with a pink plush\nsewn onto it. The yellow bokolo tend to be\nvery friendly and are quite common around the\npark. (He'd radiate a feeling of sunshine and\nhappiness)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Adolescent Direbear's Thigh", "A cut of an adolescent direbear, slain by\nNordengrad's hunters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Adolescent Direbear's Breast", "A cut of an adolescent direbear, slain by\nNordengrad's hunters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Nails", "An inch and a half long ferrum nail! The top\nstarts off thick and tapers down into a point\nat the bottom. This would be good for\nconstruction work.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Rune Scimitar", "A vicious, curved sword.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Queen of Diamonds", "A monstrous diamond necklace, each diamond\nconnected around a string of silk, like an\narray of sparkling pearls. They were\nbeautiful to the eye, a turquoise delight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by strifeg0d.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl Choker", "Four strands of pearls stretch around the\nuser’s neck, meeting at the middle was a\nlarge platinum base with a diamond sparkling\nin the middle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by strifeg0d.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("La Diadema de Savin", "A platinum tiara would sit on the wearer’s\nhead, the metal’s bands shaped like ivy, and\nat each end the thorn a sparkling diamond of\nthe most blissful quality. This tiara made\nfor a member of the Royal Santegian family.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Illiran Drennan.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Butterfly Bracelet", "Twirling in exotic shapes, the platinum\nbracelet spiralled in a beautiful array of\nluxury. The beautifully smelted metal was\ncoated by a layer of diamonds, rubies and\nother priceless gems. They would be twirled\nin the illusion of an array of flowers. ‘A de\nSavin Diamond piece’", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Tatiana's Ring", "A wedding ring made of black ferrum, with a\nlarge, well cut diamond in the middle of it.\nDesigns of a sea serpent coil around the\noutside of the ring, the tail and head\nmeeting on either end of the diamond. Gold\ndesigns run along the sea serpent as well,\ncausing it to shine and sparkle in the right\nlight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Big_Sexy_Beast.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Low Quality Cactus Green", "A foul smelling dried plant. If smoked one\nwould find it to be of very low quality,\nhaving little to no effects.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Novastral.", "minecraft:green_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Your Dad's Penis.", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cod", ""),
        StaticItem("Kowacoins", "", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Psilocybin 'MuUzhiez", "A meager batch of small, dried mushrooms.\nWhen consumed, they may instate various,\nstrong hallucinogetic effects upon it's user.\nThe word 'IzIg' is written unto the bag,\nsignaling it's orcish origins.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Joltastik.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Nûrzum's Eye", "The charred, bulbous remains of a severed\neyeball. It seems to have been removed\ndeliberately, in ritualistic fashion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Joltastik.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Fi'halen Mulled Cider", "Another powerful tool in their arsenal\nagainst the cold, The High Elves of the\nSilver Enclave heat and serve a mixture made\nout of apple cider. Citrus juice, cinnamon,\nnutmeg and star anise are heated together\nwith the cider. Additional sugar is added to\nhave the cider join with the spices properly.\n[1694]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aythyinae.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Iheuii'ante", "Iheuii'ante - The Last Whisper. A blade\ndating back to Cirnellie Atmorice and Thar\nTundrak, marking the end of the First\nPrincedom. Lost with the princess, it was not\nseen for over a hundred years, until the\nprincess reappeared, battered and muddied. It\nserves as a reminder of the many tragedies of\nthe Mali'fenn, and some say it echoes the\nwishes of a thousand long-dead elves when\nswung.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EtherealPvP.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pipeweed rations", "Dried leaves from a pipeweed plant. Happy\nsmoking!", "minecraft:reeds", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_39(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Calligrapher's Set", "A large collection of vials and quills from\nseveral avian species. Many different colours\nof ink are included in this box set.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugtel Protection Token 6th Amber cold [[April 9]]", "This person is protected by the Krugtel for a\nweek after the token date. Attacking them\nduring the token date is an attack on the\nKrugtel's leader Zagruck'Gorkil\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LatePopeTrudeau.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Skaatchnak's Horn", "A malformed horn shaped after a shaman\nperformed last rites over an orc, and yet the\nburned remains of an orc still breathe.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Skäätchnak'Izig.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Waghzult ob Krugmar", "In your hands is a massive zweihander of\ncruel Orcish design. It weighs at about\neighteen lbs and is nine feet long in its\nmonstrous length. Comprised of the rare\nmaterial known as bloodsteel which it seemed\nto have been used for the entirety of the\nblade to maximize its effectiveness with it’s\nlower weight but higher durability, the\ntexture of the blade would be a refined,\ngothic crimson - grim to anyone. It has a\nlarge gripped hilt created from delicately\ncoiled scaddernak hide, a second gripped\nportion just above the lower curved\nhilt-guard to enable the user with more\nstrength while controlling the blade more\neasily. A blade for true Orcish massacre,\nthis artifact will stay in legend like the\nspirit which made it.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Antlion Eye", "This eye is dark red, with a faint dark green\nseen somewhere within. It stares listlessly\nforward, taken from a slaughtered insect that\nwas clearly large in nature given the size of\nthe eye.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBigThonk.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Chitin", "Big plate of chitin gained from a sand\nmonster. Incredibly tough to break, but due\nto that also very hard to work with in\nregards of any smithing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Prismatic Pharynx", "Breath blown through this pharynx will, if\ninhaled by another, cause one of 1d7 feelings\n(1 = angry, 2 = clarity, 3 = energetic, 4 =\nparental, 5 = curious, 6 = willful, 7 =\nanxious).\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Iron Warhammer", "A worn yet still resilient black iron\nwarhammer. It has several notches upon the\nend, likely indicative of the foes it has\nslain. Its long, thick stave is made out of a\nfine dark wood, sturdy and resilient, yet\nburdensome to any who would not be a son of\nKrug. The warhammer would also be flat on one\nend with a spike on the other, evidently\nintendedfor an icepick-like stab.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blakzmiff] Warchief Shakul'Gorkil.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Head", "The tattered head of the alpha male of a\ngroup of direwolves. Its skin would be laced\nwith small red glands that once glowed and\ncontained an acidlike secretion within them,\nand its head would be laced with wounds from\nits fight with the hunters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Antlion Pincer", "This is a large pincer of a massive species\nof Antlion, roughly the size of a normal\nhuman male's hand. It was sharp and meant for\ngrabbing and tearing at flesh. A perfect\ntrophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBigThonk.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Antlion Carcass", "This carcass is thick and littered with\npuncture wounds. The creature it came from\nwas the size of a large husky or a great dane\nat least, and had many small legs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Scaddernak Fangs", "The fangs of a scaddernak, they are the\nsharpened and refined tools of an apex\npredator. They would be suitable for\nconversion into an iron-class weapon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:spruce_fence_gate", ""),
        StaticItem("Frostvine Potion", "The liquid freezes any organic material it\ntouches. Useful for creating flame retardent\narmour and clothing. Will cause frostbite if\napplied to skin.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Antlion Head", "This antlion head would have four eyes, and\npincers protruding from its gnarled and\nbeaten head. It was roughly the same size\nhead as a person.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBigThonk.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Swamp Onion", "", "minecraft:beetroot", ""),
        StaticItem("Veizt'z key", "A dagger made of throqual teeth and iron with\nleater bindings lined with Veist glyphs. Upon\nthe pommel is a depiction of earth.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Diseased Blood", "A waterskin containing the blood of a\nmutated, diseased hog. It is diluted, as it\nwas collected from blood spilt over snow; its\npotency affected little however. It carries\ndisease as disgusting as greywater.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl of the Queen", "A Giant Pearl, shimmering a blue-green light.\nIt is as hard as a diamond, and exceptionally\nheavy, about the size of a basketball and 40\nlbs. Untold values lie within it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Bone", "The bone of a straadoth. It is slightly less\ndense than the bone of a descendant.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Muyakelg Segment", "Ancient stones with orkish runes embedded\nwithin. They seem formidable and strong,\nhaving once belonged to a Muyakelg of\nantiquity.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by PoliceStateLoTC.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Fool", "A strange coin made of plain stone. One face\nbears the carving of a three-eyed sheep. The\nother face has the word \"Fool\" inscribed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantWhim.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Enchantment Table", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Copper Flask", "A small, square-shaped flask of polished\ncopper. A large 'B' would be engraved on both\nsides, the screw-on lide being made of what\nseems to be a molded mina coin.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Oil of Paralysis", "An alchemical oil that can be applied to a\nweapon. Essentially an altered potion of\nparalysis, This should be good in a fight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Weeagcking Ztik", "This steel baton is extendable and\nretractable, by simply lifting the lever\nupwards and outwards, unblocking the pieces\nfrom extending and retracting. The handle is\nwrapped in wire for a better grip, the end\nhas a simple rounded cap on it. The tip of\nthe baton has a sharpend tip, able to be\nreplaced with different tips of Aurum, steel,\nor anyother preferred metal. The tips are\nattached by a pieces of the material inserted\ninto a hole, with metal 'claws' grabbing onto\nit; thus locking it in.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Weeagh Baton", "This steel baton is extendable and\nretractable, by simply lifting the lever\nupwards and outwards, unblocking the pieces\nfrom extending and retracting. The handle is\nwrapped in wire for a better grip, the end\nhas a simple rounded cap on it. The tip of\nthe baton has a sharpend tip, able to be\nreplaced with different tips of Aurum, steel,\nor anyother preferred metal. The tips are\nattached by a pieces of the material inserted\ninto a hole, with metal 'claws' grabbing onto\nit; thus locking it in.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ranseur", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Giselin Tonic", "A sugar-water drink from the Almenodrim, made\nfrom the Giselin plant. While the plant\nitself is toxic, and lethal, the distillation\nprocess leaves the tonic safe. Although, the\nleft over toxins may leave the individual a\nbit dazed or drugged if they drink too much.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Eriş Rose Wood Flute", "A Beautiful hand-crafted Rose Wood Flute. It\nhas vine and flora carvings wrap around the\nflute with rose gold accents. The timbre is\nexquisite and warm, with an airy quality. On\nthe side the name Karlia Eriş McBride is\ncarved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by emmalinea.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Redemption", "Redemption is a one handed Steel blade with a\ncrossguard shaped with Angel Wings, in the\nmiddle of the crossguard is a blue gem being\nheld by an Aengul, along the blade are runes\nand is edged in gold, on the pommel is an\nAngelic character.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jondead.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Special Brew for Cameron", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dagger of Koltirax", "A dagger with a steel hilt wrapped in black\nleather. The blade of the dagger seemed to\nhave a darker tint to it, though would be the\nsame material as the hilt.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Radiance of Laura", "The palm sized glass ball is etched with a\nlarge crescent moon illuminating a dark\nnight, painted with white, yellow, and black\npaint. In the middle there seems to be a\nyellow colored liquid which emits gentle\nlight, around the mid-line of the ball there\nis an inscription; \"Laura's radiance\nenlightens you\". At the 'bottom' of the\nsphere lies a small 'W' which is carved into\nthe glass.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Virarim Head", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Vulnir's Staff", "This warped staff of untreated ironwood\nappears although it is made of emerald from\nthe many gems tied into the wood. Only Vulnir\nknows how to use them, if someone else were\nto try the staff would most likely\nelectrocute them.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Elephant Skin", "A large section of elephant hide able to be\nuse for a range of things.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugarcane flute", "A simple sugarcane that has holes drilled in\nits lenght, leaving a hollow inside. 7 holes\nhave been carved out from the front and 1\nfrom the back. A slight opening has been cut\nout on the front to let breath enter the\ninstrument and resonate. Some elven-designs\nare carved all over the cane, giving it an\nelegant texture. The whole cane has been\ntreated, preventing it from rotting. Its\nsound would recall the blowing wind.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Heat-Treated Throwing Spear", "A light-weight, sharpened wooden spear that\nhas been heat-treated to prevent dulling or\nbreaking. It's pointed edge and weight are\ndesigned to cause the greatest possible harm\nwhen thrown. It's light weight makes it ideal\nfor both throwing and close combat, though it\nis not the sturdiest and tends to break if\nnot thrown well.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Heat-Treated Jabbing Spear", "A large, heavy, sharpened wooden spear that\nhas been heat-treated to prevent dulling or\nbreaking. It's pointed edge is honed to make\npiercing skin or hide it's primary use. It is\ntoo large to be thrown easily, accurately or\nat any great range.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Bone Fragment", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Icy Tankerds", "This tankered would seem to be like any other\nat a glance. Oddly though the metal of the\nbody would seem to have a icy chill to it.\nThis chill is not cold enough to freeze but\nit will keep any liquid inside it cold. [PM\nloupgareu for information]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Pariah] Nesrine.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Intricate Shortsword", "A rather wide shortsword wrought from\nSlayersteel. The blade spans approximately an\ninch and a half across and reaches 18 inches\nin length. The flat of the blade is decorated\nwith various silver engravings; they span out\nfrom above the crossguard and stretch halfway\nup the blade on both sides. From there, they\nretract towards the central ridge and dwindle\noff in a circular pattern. The thick\ncrossguard seems to be decorative, more than\nanything. Just below it is an ashwood hilt\nsegmented by thin bands of steel. The pommel\nis embedded with a compact ruby.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Green Roll", "Strong-smelling cactus green, rolled up into\nthick tubes ready for smoking.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("[Sarissa] Black Ferrum Spear", "A ten foot (~3 meter) spear of cord-wrapped\npine and Black Ferrum. The tip is\nsemi-barbed, allowing it to find purchase in\nflesh, though lodging it between the chinks\nof plate or scale may prove rough. The\nopposing end is capped by a small amount of\nferrum aswell, allowing one to baton their\nopponent if the need arises. Overall, it\nseems to be a simple creation and lacks much\ndetailing otherwise. There are various crude\netchings along its length, though none of\nthem seem to be important.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Schrak.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elephant Tusk", "An ivory tusk about the size of a small\ncottage, multiple people are needed to move\nit if it is being rp'd\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Uruk Hunting Spear", "The spear in front of you would be made of a\ndark oak wood, wrappings of rope surrounding\nthe shaft, whilst the head, made of ferrum\nwould meet at an un-even point.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Madur'Lur.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mali'Ker's Darkest", "A double shot of strong rum, black as night\nand just as fearsome. It has a fierce kick to\nit, heavily spiced with notes of cinammon,\nnutmeg, and vanilla and has an\norange-flavoured aftertaste. It contains 40%\nalcohol content.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Imrath Valour", "A dram of dark hued whisky sitting\ncomfortably at 38% alcohol content. It has\ncaramel undertones beneath an powerful\naromatic initial kick, leaving a spicy\naftertaste.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Clan Uuthlini's Bilbemel", "A hearty, sweet blueberry mead made from the\ndarker honey of the blueberry blossom,\nseasoned with a generous dose of the\nplumpest, sweetest, most luscious blueberries\ngathered by the dark elves of Clan Uuthlini\nfor a fresh-tasting, healthy mead with an\nalcohol content of 13%", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Windswept Wooden Rod", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Twisted Wooden Rod", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Mar'zuuk", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Mud_Crab", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lion Teeth", "The teeth of a great black lion slain in the\narena. They would still bare the blood of the\ncombatants, now dried and cracked.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Black Lion Pelt", "The pelt of a great black lion, slain in the\narena by Skaatchnak. All of the cuts and\nwounds the lion sustained would appear as\nslits and tears in the pelt of the lion, now\nslain.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Skin of a Male Morko Bear", "The object you see is the huge pelt of a\nWhite and Grey Morko bear. The pelt is nearly\n10 feet long. Bloodstains could be seen in\ndifferent areas towards the edges of the fur.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("6.266028465330601 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Larg'Ana : Whetstone of Gentharuz", "A smooth stone cut from the rocks that reside\nin the hellscape of the badlands. One can see\nfine engraving on the sides that bring\nreference to Gentharuz and His Celestial\nForge. A limited edition item crafted with\nthe aid of the finest stonemasons the\nMali'Ker have amongst them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Jabbernak Claws", "A pair of extremely sharp Jabbernak claws\nthat were taken to serve as trophies. They\nare bound together by a thick brown string\nthat is laced through a small hole at the\nbase of each claw. Both of them are off-white\nin color and surprisingly lustrous.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Adult Jabbernak Tail", "Reaching an impressive seven feet, this\nscale-covered tail seems to be mostly intact.\nA collection of age-old scars are scattered\nabout the bottom quarter, where it seems to\nlack much protection, and it's fairly obvious\nthis trophy was recently rended from the body\nof a fully-grown Jabbernak lizard. At the\nvery tip of it, a plethora of small spikes\nseem to jut off. This could likely be used as\na gift to the Spirits, a weapon, or a source\nof crafting materials.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Keening's Awesome Shovel", "", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Here Have Wood!", "Hey, this is wood, wood is pretty nice and\nhelpful during your journey as a mineman\nplayer, keep on left clicking, shred the\ngnar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Lackless_.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Lur Wolf Head", "The disembodied head of a LurWolf, in almost\npristine condition. A trophy from the man\nSkale's combat with the creature in which he\nran it through with a sword to slay it\ndespite being ravaged in the face by the\nbeast's teeth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Instinct of Votar", "The palm sized glass ball is etched with a\nbow firing and arrow towards a pack of\nwolves, painted with brown and red paint. In\nthe middle there seems to be a dark green\ncolored liquid which emits a piercing green\nlight, around the mid-line of the ball there\nis an inscription; \"Votar's instinct surges\nthrough you\". At the 'bottom' of the sphere\nlies a small 'W' which is carved into the\nglass.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("fat man's bow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Blayde Katchers", "This pair of leather gloves have the fingers\ncut off of them and steel plates and\nchainmail attached to the palm of the glove.\nThey are capable of 'catching' daggers,\none-handed swords and the like. The plates\nlimit dextrerity in exchange for protection\nof the hands, making it possible to stop a\nblade from carving into their flesh\nunhindered.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Elora's Signature Cookies", "The wonderful scent of cocoa and vanilla\ngrows stronger as these lovely round sweets\nof meticulous make attract the view of any\npasser-by. Gooey pools of milk chocolate are\ndotted about the surface of each cookie, held\nin by the crisped shell of dough protecting a\nchewy interior laced with butter. The\nflavours where of tradition, yet measured to\nmingle perfectly with the nostalgia of devine\nhome cooking. These cookies are often sure to\nput a smile on the taster's face!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elora Silma.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Beast Slayer", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Myzteriouz Znowy Ztew", "", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Sling", "A small leather sling that has the\ncraftsmanship of a goblin radiating off of\nit. Used to hurl projectiles and small\nmissiles toward a foe at a formidable speed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by NTE_Killer4life.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Spider silk Cloak", "This blue and light-blue cloak is made of\nspider silk thread and is quite weak for its\nlook, but when woven together, it becomes a\nmaterial that can best a sword slash.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blayde Katcher", "This pair of leather gloves have the fingers\ncut off of them and steel plates and\nchainmail attached to the palm of the glove.\nThey are capable of 'catching' daggers,\none-handed swords and the like. The plates\nlimit dextrerity in exchange for protection\nof the hands, making it possible to stop a\nblade from carving into their flesh\nunhindered.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Young Zauzage", "A ~young~ cut of meat, which tastes oddly\nfamiliar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Lily Pad", "Seemingly to be useless, an extraordinary\ntechnique was developed to give the plant a\npurpose. For proper and optimal use, one must\nthrow the lily pad down faster than a blink\nof the eye, right before the feet touches the\nwater. The technique would give its user a\nwater-walking like ability. Extremely\neffective against cowards who know only to\nrun.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Pepe the Frog.", "minecraft:waterlily", ""),
        StaticItem("Sharpened Stone", "A heavy, sharpened stone ideal for a sling.\nIt can cause quite a bit of damage if it hits\nbare flesh, possibly bleeding.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Goblin] Priekz'Weigh.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemists Dust", "This dust is made of wood dust, soked in a\nred hued liquid and dried for a time. This\npowder is combustible and violent when it is\nignited, its creation is somewhat akin to\nAlchemists Fire. The Alchemists Dust will\nburn speedily and violently, likely able to\nmelt soft iron, and ignite wood of most\nkinds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Chinese New Year Bow", "A bow for the Chinese New Year Dunk Tank!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("OG Mudbone", "Weapon of choice used by the legendary Limmy\nGuthrie to send his enemies to the sky gods.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Izkuthii Mage Blood", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ram Horns", "A set of two, underdeveloped, curved horns,\ncut from their roots from the scalp of a\nyoung Ram. They seem battered, signaling the\nhistory of many battles of dominance.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Joltastik.", "minecraft:spruce_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Bull Horn", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Urag's Club", "Your muscles strain to hold this bloodied\nmetal club, the name \"Urag\" seems to be\nscratched on the grip.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Holmiote Bullions", "A large bullion of fine silver alloy\nimprinted with the seal of the Despot.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PizzeriaDjango.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Maukta Tradin und Ko.", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Rage of Enrohk", "The palm sized glass ball is etched with hard\nangular lines, painted with black and red\npaint. In the middle there seems to be a red\ncolored liquid which emits a harsh red light,\naround the mid-line of the ball there is an\ninscription; \"Enrohk's rage flows through\nyou\". At the 'bottom' of the sphere lies a\nsmall 'W' which is carved into the glass.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Weeeghx] Gruzg'Weeagh 'Birb-Head'.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Orcish Blade", "The ancient and slightly rusted blade of a\nresurrected, mummified orc. The blade still\nhas the blood of the living orcs who\ntriumphed over the raised creature within the\ncracks and crevasses of the corroded metal.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Brogb'Riit : Fishing net of Ankrus", "A finely made fishing net that can contain\neverything from large portions of smaller\nfish to larger aqueous game. Two wooden hilts\nare littered with shamanic runes referring\nand bringing praise to Ankrus. A limited\nedition craft made by the combined skill of a\nwoodworker and rope craftsman.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Flauth'Grish : Bloodied feathers of Enrohk", "A chime made of beads and feathers dipped\ninto the fresh blood of an unknown passed\ndescendant. The beads contain small\nengravings referring and praising Enrohk,\nSpirit of Bloodlust. A fine artpiece to\ncompliment one's attire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood of Leyd", "This is a vial of blue blood, captured from a\nlesser spirit of Leyd through its defeat in\ncombat. It seems to almost thrum with some\nform of unseen spiritual energy. Perhaps in\nthe right hands, it could be used for\nsomething?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBigThonk.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("75.01065518844939 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Southeron Bronze Ale", "The drink before you is Bronze ale but with a\nSoutheron twist containing potatoe skins and\ncactus juice seemingly more bitter to the\ntaste With a Nose hair singing smell to it as\nwell", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("McCow With Cheese", "A McCow with cheese from sources that do not\nviolate HFD standards.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("horse meat", "", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Quarter Staff", "The quarter staff would be made out of a\ncrimson red wood of the harder variety. The\nmiddle of this weapon would have an engraved\neagle etched in decorative gold. At the top\nof the weapon is a polished steel Wolfs head\npointing outwards. The back of the wolfs head\nwould have a trident with a horizontal line\ncrossing through its shaft to show who made", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Vibrator", "", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Brick", "A brick", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Barrelfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Special Carrot", "This carrot isn't all that special, not sure\nwhy it's named that. Enjoy!", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Hourglass", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cargo Sword", "A beaten up sword sharpened by Cargo's mighty\nteeth. You can easily give someone HIV by\nstabbing them with this.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cargo.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Embroidered Lace Dresser Scarf", "Sheer white nylon with pink embroidered trim\nstyled as flowers on each side, with pink\nbumblebee garnishes dotted around the\ncenterpart of the kerchief.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Garolletios' Regeneration Potion", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by [One-Eyed] Verdant the Flowergod.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Arcane Bolt", "A scroll with various runes on its parchment.\nWhen the word \"Viscero\" is uttered, the\nparchment gleams and manifests arcane energy\n- discharging a small arcane bolt at high\nspeeds; when it hits, it impacts with the\nforce of a crossbow bolt, only to burst after\nin concentrated kinetic energy. Once the\nspell finishes, the scroll will burn up.\n((1-2 emotes for the small arcane bolt.\nContact Niv_Mizzet for more information.))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Ring", "A beautiful ring of aurum and placed atop it\nfirmly secured in place is a hunk of diamond.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("SandRipper Painting", "A painting displaying the orcish monster, a\nleviathan of a worm seen to be slaughtering\norcish cubs and folk alike. The color is\nstrikingly vivid, and the blood appears to be\nreal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DivineJustice.", "minecraft:item_frame", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Arcane Shield", "A scroll with various runes on its parchment.\nWhen the word \"Y'drel\" is uttered, the\nparchment gleams and manifests arcane energy.\nThe energy swiftly spreads out, interlocking\nto form an arcane shield the size of a viking\nroundshield. This can take strikes from\nbladed weaponry, yet a few strikes with a\nmace will shatter and burst the shield into\nforce and second-lasting shrapnul. When the\nspell is finished, the scroll expires. ((2-3\nemotes for shield. Contact Niv_Mizzet for\nmore info))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Mask", "An expertly crafted mask, it looks remark\nremarkably in the visage of a wolf.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hapi the Masksalesman.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Shogging Tournament Trophy", "A wooden, carved pumpkin to commemorate the\nShogging Fest of 1572.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown Pumpkin", "The small pumpkin would have a large grimace carved into it's face. Were one to look\nat the pumpkin, it would remind them of Lord Knox, the same features upon the pumpkin.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Jim the Slab", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by HotBurritos.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Nature Walking Stick", "A reed and sugar cane made walking stick,\nintended to help the user who is blind or\npractially blind to help them navitgate. It's\nuseless as a weapon, and measures about 3\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Quality Slime Ball", "", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana Gem", "Before you rests an arcanic treasure, an\nextraordinarily pure diamond. A menagerie of\nflickering auric lights are held within the\ncore of the stone, producing a dim glow as\nwell as hinting at some form of imbued\nenergy.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Nail", "A 4 inch iron nail that'd strangely, have a\nrusty body. Near the end of the nail would be\nseveral barbs, these barbs having no rust\nperhaps showcasing the nail's condition was\nnot due to negligence.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mavromino.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Av's key", "A simple small key made of steel that is\ndesigned for only one lock. (Once you have\nthis and the location of what it unlocks send\nme a screenshot you looking at the box,\nshowing the sign, then a screenshot of this\nto me.)", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Dueling Crossbow", "A smaller, more lightweight crossbow. It'd be\nintended to be used in a duel with an\nopponent. The crossbow has no special\nattachments or modifications that make it\ndifferent from a normal crossbow. It's just\nslightly smaller for better mobility.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the Forge of Nordengrad.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Infertility Potion", "A thick black potion, this would be made from\na mixture of Black Sun's Spinster and\nMandragora. This would mean, if ingested\nroughly 20 minutes before sex, whoever drunk\nthe potion would become infertile for roughly\n2 IRL hours before returning to their normal\nfertility. This potion works on both Genders\nand would taste likely slightly sour water,\nalthough not unpleasantly so.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mavromino.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkbringers Boots", "The boots of Voidbringer Darius, denizen past\nthe wall.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("My Very First Instrument of Death", "A very crude, yet bone-breakingly heavy,\nblade. The edge is dulled, but that makes it\nall the more lethal when used as a smashing\nweapon. It was the baby Olog Graar's first\nweapon, and he cherished it since birth.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Notice!", "Contact Deer__ when you're online either on\nthe server or on discord at Deer#0793", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Moustache Ring", "A small ring with an emerald on the top, when\na user puts on the ring, a black Toothbursh\nMoustache would appear underneath their nose,\nthis will last until they take the ring off.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner of Grandaxe's", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner of Old Mynebor", "A banner of old Mynebor used during the time\nof Mynebor I, and Mynebor 1.12. It has been\nused in defense of both Kaz'Ulrah, and\nMynebor multiple times.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner of Khorvad", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Daar", "This crown, forged deep inside the mountain\nof Mynebor, made of solid Gold, and inlaid\nwith finely cut Diamonds, is the crown of the\nKing of Agnarum. It symbolizes the\nresponsibility the King has to his people,\nand his nation.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Forge Lord] Balrog Grandaxe.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Elumeria's Baby Mead", "The dark brown mead has a strong smell. The\ntaste resembles a mix of honey, the Krugsmas\nBaby Brain candies, and a LOT of alcohol. The\nbrew is capable of downing even a grown dwarf\nlike a kick in the groin, if only for a short\ntime. -Elumeria's Wild Brewery", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("My King", "Otto you are the most amazing person I could\nhave ever asked to meet. How happy and lovey\nyou make me is on an unearthly level but I'm\nglad you do. You mean everything to me and I\nlove you so much.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AggroRaven.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Voidal Horror Blood", "The Musky fluid gathered from the remains of\na live Voidal Horror. It seems to be slightly\ndilluted, as to prevent it from fading away\ninto nothingness.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by PapaVesemir.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueberry Wine", "Blueberry wine. Made with fresh blueberries\nand a liquior content of 11%. It tastes very\nfruity.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand-wrought Iron Nails", "", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Valic Dry Aged Pork", "The Dry Aged Pork of the Valic Family. Kept\nin a large freezebox for 52 days, prepared by\na master chef from Markev. The texture is\nunmistakeable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Gleaming Topaz", "", "minecraft:yellow_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Roses", "Floral graced by GOD, distributed on 5th of\nThe Grand Harvest, 1608; The day Callixtus\nthe I and Najila Shadid joined in wedlock.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Church of the True Faith of Old Believers.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Flowers of Love", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser William Gromach.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("ＭＥＡＤＯＷＳＷＥＥＴ", "An herb that grows in damp meadows. It's said\nthat its properties aid in upset stomachs and\nheadaches. Among the most pleasant smelling\nof herbs, some use it as an incense for their\nhomes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobsin.", "minecraft:azure_bluet", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Lense", "A clear shining lense of delicately carved\nand shaped diamond. It reflects beautifully\nin the light, and would be about the size of\na large man’s palm.These delicate lenses\nwould be used within a magic engine to\nstrengthen and enhance magic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Appetizers", "A yummy looking tray of Bear Appetizers,\nthese bear appetizers are of the highest\nquality.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Rondothhand's Remains", "The remains of a valiant warpig belonging to\nUlhart Grandaxe. Rondothhand met his demise\nin 1635 during the War of the Beards.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by McBurnsy.", "minecraft:porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarf Cop Batton", "★Developer Approved★\nSigned by Llir.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer Steel Sabre", "A Masterfully Crafted Sabre. The long blade\nwould be made of Slayer Steel, with a sharp\npoint, perfect for penetrating armor, or\ntough hide. The grip would be wrapped in\nblack-stained leather, making a tough, yet\nstrong grip.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Embrace", "A chilling powder, cold to the touch. An\noverwhelming aroma of spearmint radiates from\nthe dust, overwhelming the holder at times.\nIt glows a vibrant light blue, with glints of\nsilver ocassionally shining through.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Mirror", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Khorvadic Pendant", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck'Lak Flavoured Ice Cream", "", "minecraft:ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Elmurium", "a highly addictive substance", "minecraft:milk_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Najorda'je vordur (Short spear)", "This is a gorundyr styled spear.The Khadarsi\nsteel head of the 6.5ft long spear has many\ngorundyr runes carved into it that lead down\ninto the oak wood shaft of the spear where\nit's decorated with various owl talons and\nfeathers at the butt of the spear. Black\nstained leather is wrapped around the\ngripping point of the spear decorated with\nTiger fur. The spear is well balanced and\nseems to be very well crafted. \"~Arberrang~\nis carved nicely carved into the upper side\nof the shaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring Of Fate", "A ring made to resemble two snakes coiling\naround each other. It gives off a golden\nshine indicating the quality of the material\nused to create the rings. Once the rings are\ntapped twice in rapid succession the pair\nwould change from a golden color to more of a\nredish brown no matter how far apart the\nrings are.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("World's Hide and Seek Committee", "An award given to the world's worst player of\nhide an seek\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sneakybandit.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Sock", "As you tip over the handy dandy Krugmas sock\nendless treats pour out from it!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Senator's Senate Knife", "A knife best used in a senate. Use 26 times\nfor maximum efficiency.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Forsja'je mattur (Ranseur)", "This is a gorundyr styled spear.The Khadarsi\nsteel head of the 7ft long spear has many\ngorundyr runes carved into it that lead down\ninto the ashwooden shaft of the spear where\nit is decorated with various black, brown and\ngray feathers at the butt of the spear. Black\nstained leather is wrapped around the\ngripping point of the spear decorated with\nwolf fur. The spear is well balanced and\nseems to be very well crafted. \"~Arberrang~\nis carved nicely carved into the upper side\nof the shaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ram'je thruma (Polelance)", "This is a gorundyr styled spear.The Khadarsi\nsteel head of the 7ft long spear has many\ngorundyr runes carved into it that lead down\ninto the oak wood shaft of the spear where\nit's decorated with a small ram head along\nwith it's horns at the butt of the spear.\nBlack stained leather is wrapped around the\ngripping point of the spear decorated with\ngoat fur. The spear is well balanced and\nseems to be very well crafted. \"~Arberrang~\nis carved nicely carved into the upper side\nof the shaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dyr'je detta (Ranseur)", "This is a gorundyr styled spear.The Khadarsi\nsteel head of the 7ft long spear has many\ngorundyr runes carved into it that lead down\ninto the ashwooden shaft of the spear where\nit's decorated with a bone tooth necklace\nfrom various beasts at the butt of the spear.\nBlack stained leather is wrapped around the\ngripping point of the spear decorated with\nwolf fur. The spear is well balanced and\nseems to be very well crafted. \"~Arberrang~\nis carved nicely carved into the upper side\nof the shaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sand", "A powdery material that resembles gold dust,\nit is however, just very fine golden sand.\nWhen thrown in to sombody's face, it could\neasily blind them for a short while\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Spr0nk.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackened Undead Heart", "As a result of a long time trapped within a\nlabyrinth, this heavily-rotted heart belonged\nto an undead being who had nothing to do but\nrot! In return, the heart is a fickle,\nfragile black husk of its former self.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Winter Toy", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Eye of Khorvad", "", "minecraft:end_crystal", ""),
        StaticItem("Sunderfrost Heavy Warhammer", "A solid black ferrum warhammer. It bears\nthese words on the haft: \"Woe to ye who bears\nthis hammer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bandage Roll", "A long roll of wide, soft bandages. Tightly\nwoven and well made, they can be used to wrap\nany injury.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Chunk of Bear Pelt", "The chunk of a large bear's pelt. The poorly\ncut piece is no larger than half a dwarf's\ntorso but can be used for a range of\ncraftable items. The bears fur seems\nunremarkable and brown with blood mixed in.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Thickly cut T-Bone Steaks", "Thickly Cut steaks can be seen here covered\nin onion and mushroom", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("➵ Tanalah \"The Patient\" ➵", "Elven bow of small size, both limbs were\ncreated with the wood of an elder sequoia and\nare ornated with elven ideograms that\nrepresent hunt and good luck, the grip was\nmade with the fur of a deer and it displays\nthe word \"Alana\" which is written with gold\non it.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Kanendi'us' [T5]", "A scroll with a strange word upon the outside\nof it -- If one were to open up the inside of\nthe scroll, they would see some form of\nstrange blue ink that was used to scribe in\nmany strange symbols and such. After the\nstrange word on the top was spoken, a\nspherical arcanism projectile would form\nafter two emotes -- Capable of being flung\ntowards the closest individual and dealing a\ndecent amount of brunt force. Obviously, it\nonly has one use.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Pelt", "A large white pelt\ntaken off a direwolf.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Father Krugmas Plush", "A one of a kind Father Krugmas Plushie! It\ncomes with a small candycane sewn to a big\ngreen hand. 'Hur, hur, hur!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Maple Wand", "A thick maple wand, carved into a rounded\npoint. It is around 9 inches long, and has a\nhand guard about half way up the wand. It's\nencrested with jewels, and carved with\nvine-like patterns.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jacobcraft04.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll's Skull", "Though robbed of its fearsome tusks, this\nmassive skull is a fine trophy, and testimony\nto the owner's courage and skill in battle,\nfor a beast of this size is no easy prey.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Thomas Summerfield's Seed", "A handful of seeds, they are certainly green.\nFound by the Human adventurer Thomas\nSummerfield.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Shifting Journal", "A book that had a shifting figures for a\nname, slowly forming into the words 'Shifting\nJournal'. Inside is ancient wording. [Contact\nZachsSlayer for the doc info.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Boggen Claw Zweihander", "A Zweihander which hand a curvacious tip,\nakin to what farfolk blades were to be.\nComprised of a brown tattered cloth wrapped\namongst leather straps as the handle and\npommel, whilst two bridges of bone acted as\nhilt guards. The blade itself was a dark gray\ncolor, and once could tell it was a bone like\nmaterial. A claw from a rather large boggen,\nin it's small cracks scattered alongst the\nblade-like claw's length; emitted an awful\nstench, and an abysmal smog.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dwarven Greatsword", "This ancient weapon was left in the ruins of\nan old dwarf settlement deep under the earth,\nfound in a broken chest. The head of this\nsword would be made of Kodeh Steel, giving it\nan amazing resistance to the cold; not very\nuseful in a place so hot but this should be\nquite handy in any place with chilling\ntemperatures.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("╁ Living Neothorn [T5] ╁", "Within your hand rests an arming sword\nmeasuring four feet in length, its silvery\nblade displaying a brilliant sheen. Twisting\nthe pommel of this weapon would cause the\nsharpened blade to become surrounded in a\nthin veil of condensed Soulflame, giving it\nthe properties of aurum when used offensively\nagainst a creature of the Dark. The Emberco\ninsignia is present on the hilt, offering\ninsight to this weapon’s origin.\nhttps://goo.gl/iWqvYC\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Symbol of God", "this Symbol of GOD is evidence of a murder...\nthe most moral thing would be to leave it to\nthe grave with the woman who held this symbol\ndear...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Theodorus' Key", "A heavy, brass key found in the Outer Sanctum\nof the Dragontomb Temple. Chipped and eroded\nas it is, it looks as if this key opens a\nlarge lock.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("THORODUS' KEY", "A heavy, metal key that seems to hum with\nsome kind of power. It is warm to the touch,\nand cackles as if charged with electricity.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Talon", "A talon nearly as sharp as a blade, the same\nshade as dark coal.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Hammerforge Moonshine V2 c. 1584", "A large glass jar with a metal-hinged lid.\nWithin the container is a highly potent\nliquor that's been refined to the last drop.\nVery lightly etched into the glass is the\nletter's R.V. on both sides, while having the\nhammerforge clan's symbol carved into the\nlid. A small note be attached to every bottle\nstating \"Warning: Highly Potent Alcohol.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [R.Arm.Missing] Rolien vulnear-HammerForge.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("✿ Bouquet of Flowers! ✿", "A lush assortment of light-colored flowers.\nTheir vibrant colors and floral smells add a\nlovely accent to any scene!", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Oaken Guitar", "This guitar, made of solid, smoothly grown\nwood, looks beautiful in make. the wood is\nstained to give it a slightly darker look, as\nwell as a smooth slightly glossy finish. The\nstrings themselves, six in total and made of\ntightly woven horse hair and plant fibers,\nare painstakingly stretched and fine tuned\nfor a perfect sounding instrument. If played,\nthe guitar would make a slightly deep, yet\npretty and twangy melody.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Magnus' Blue Mining Boots", "These boots are perfect for mining! The tough\nand rugged leather that they are made from\nmake them durable and well-suited for mining\nconditions! The insides are lined with a\nthick fur to keep the toes warm during mining\nseason! On the side of each boot the word\nAnart' is etched into the leather.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("The Striker", "The pickace would be made of the purest\ndiamonds and would have a polished wooden\nhandle. The name 'Kalviin Ireheart' would be\nengraved at the bottom of the handle.\n((Contact z3m0s for more information))\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Dancing Pumpkin", "A normal pumpkin in all physical appearances,\nexcept it doesn't seem to rot or decay with\ntime. To those druidly attuned, they would\nfeel a powerful aura of sentience radiating\nfrom it. When someone mentions the word\ndance' outloud, in any compacity or\nlanguage, the pumpkin begins to shake and\nwobble! If communed with, the pumpkin seems\njust a normal pumpkin, if perhaps a bit on\nthe more sardonic side.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Demascus Steel brestplate", "This breastplate has a very intresting\npattern in it from the forging process making\nit unique\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bwelch Azaghul.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Beating Stick", "This stick would be used to beat the ones\nthat deserve a beating.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Endershadow292.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Anvil Spliter", "A beautifully ornate warhammer forged with\nthe best steel and the strongest of Axefeller\nwood, The hammer is perfectly balanced, its\nhead is a 6 inch square and it has a 7 inch\nlong spike on the rear ground to a sharp\npoint.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bwelch Azaghul.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Small bag of Ground up Halfling grass.", "Inside a small leather pouch is a bunch of\nhalfling grass ground up to be used for\nblunts, pipes, etc.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Flaying Knife of the Slayer", "An exquisite blade made of a white iron\nmaterial. It is quite sturdy, and the hilt is\nadorned with the sign of the Flayed Man.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternal Reckoning", "", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mental Ward", "Arcane I\nA pendant for the user to wear. This bejewled\nwear has the ability to ward off adept mental\nmages from the mind, requiring an hour's\nrecharge after. ((Able to resist five T3\nmental invasions or weaken five T5 mental\ninvasions. Contact Niv_Mizzet for more\nInformation))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Karaad Ithring", "An expertly smithed and jeweled band with\nintricate spirals which curl around the\nmetallurgy. With a beautiful and ornate\nencrusted gem seated in various points around\nthe band, the ring would give off a gentle\nglow and a soft hum when placed near one's\near. - Acting as a conduit for a powerful\nEvocation Spell, when activated a sphere of\npure fire would ignite against your palm.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena, The Artificer.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gutbuster Helm", "An iron helm featuring a long curved spike at\nthe forefront, surrounded by a crown of\nspikes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Gutbuster Chestpiece", "A sturdy iron chestpiece covered in spikes of\nvarious length. The most important part of\nthe suit, allowing the wearer to barrel into\ncombat as a berserker.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Gutbuster Leggings", "The leggings of the suit of armor would\nfeature but a few spikes, primarily on the\nknee and shin.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Gutbuster Boots", "These humble boots would hold a few spikes on\nthe sides and one just above the toes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Zu'bawe", "This is the skull of the infamous\nhornet-creature Zu'bawe, capable of a strange\nability to engorge it's body with a bolt of\nenergy and display its form in a minimized\nfashion capable of flight. This actual item\nholds a power within should the user be able\nto channel mana through it's crystal in the\nbase of the item, the user will be allowed\ntemporary shrinking of their persona by one\nmeter in size for thirty seconds.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Manok Kladian", "An beautiful and jeweled band with intricate\nmarkings which ensnare around the metalwork.\nWith a brilliant and ornate gem seated in\nvarious points around the band, the band\nwould seem to give off a gentle glow and a\nsoft hum when placed near one's ear. - Acting\nas a conduit for a powerful Evocation Spell,\nwhen activated a shield of pure purple auric\nenergy would form along before the outside of\nan enclosed fist.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena, The Artificer.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Horror in a Bottle", "Within this carefully sealed bottle sits a\npurple substance, appearing like goo and\nabout a fist in size, a small light blue orb\nwould be seen within the substance itself,\nperhaps an eye? Contact ET Manager\nA_K_Production to interact!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by A_K_Production.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Draiochta's Wing", "A shimmering clipping of one's golden\nwings, come from those in far off lands.\nThough it does not hold much power,\nit certainly looks great!\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Varekan'Raz ur Akkor", "A hilt forged in a quintessentially Elven\nstyle, elegant and beautiful yet sturdy in\ndesign and execution. It is engraved with\nElvish script, which glows like starlight\nupon it- and the crossguard resembles two\nascendant eagle's wings. Upon the uttering of\na command phrase a blade of silver flame will\nissue forth, resembling a captive bolt of\nlighting. It consist of t5+ Soulflame.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Head", "The head would still have horns upon it\nthough the skin and hair would seemed to be\nsinged off, as if something had burnt it\nquite roughly. The eys of the Minotaur would\nbe staring ahead as if it were still alive,\ngiving off an earie apperance, being somewhat\nheavy in weight it could be quite a burden to\ncarry...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:wool", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_40(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Seed of Stratum", "A small, crystalline structure holding\nimmense power. Coloured with the aura\nof the holder, a mysterious essence\nis evoked from its image. Only when\nimbued with the power of a revenant\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Boomerang", "Arcane V\nTo the normal eye, the piece would look like\na large amulet, stone surrounding a very\ntightly fitted Aengul eye. To those\nknowledgable on the item, it could be\nactivated to produce arcane wings to either\nside of the stone, creating a throwable\npiece could be thrown to quite significantly\nspecific distances if the holder had\npractice. The Boomerang able to be called\nback to a specified gauntlet via a binding\nrune.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Jeweled Key", "A mysterious Bejeweled Key, it has runes\ncovering its entire surface. (remade for map\ntransfer, contact z3m0s for screenshot,\noriginal event item signed by Dreek.))\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring Of Serpents", "A large golden ring with a magnificent\ngleaming emerald as its centre piece. The\ndetailed art on the ring suggests it is\nobviously of dwarven make, while its aura\nsuggests its power is intense. A significant\nmarking could be made out to any fluent in\ndwarven tongue that this piece was indeed\ncrafted by the grand master blacksmith\nKalviin himself.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("The Timekeeper‘s Call", "Magic V\nEnlightenment II\nSoulbind I\nAn impressive staff composed entirely of glistening\nCarbarum. The staff resonates an aura of absolute\nwisdom. Numerous numerals and Arcane-like-icons\nline the shaft of the mighty staff. Shimmering with a\nperception of sagacity. At the very tip of the staff lay\ntwo arrows; one long and narrow and one half as\nlong as it's larger companion, crossing over one\nanother and pointing upward. Appearing rather\nsimilar to that of a clock's hands striking twelve.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDizzy771 approved this item.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dagger of the Hunt", "The dagger would shimmer with a small static\nglimmer upon the head of the weapon, the\npommel worn and ragged marking it clearly\naged. If an individual is cut with the dagger\nthen they will begin to see shadowed figures\nof soldiers. ((Message Torkoal_Tom for more\ninformation))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("-=Kolol ur Azmoroth=-", "The power resonating from this remarkable\npiece is near unbearable to anything less\nthan an Arch-Mage, the intricate markings\nappear to be dwarven, lined with priceless\ngems and runes it is clear the piece was made\nby a master craftsman. Adorning one end is a\nblade, made of strong Arcanium with some\nrunes at the base. The other end holds a\nlarge orb, encased in glass appears to be a\nlarge Scaddernak eye, twitching slightly it\nlooks as though it's watching you as you\nmove.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Bonespear", "A crudely fashioned spear with a bone tip.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bokermon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bear Rib", "A long bone that belonged to a black bear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("<*>Klomper<*>", "A simple brick to some, but a powerful weapon\nin the hands of the brick knight! If thrown\nit would always strike its target with\nconcusive damange! A golden light seemed to\nsurround the brick, and blood caked its\ncorners. On the underside the initials A.V.\nwere carved surely said owner of this\nLegendary Brick!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Atticus Vesryn.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Gremlin Ring", "A small pure golden ring inlaid with multiple\nglittering diamonds. Strange runes are carved\ninto the underside of the ring, right the way\nround. A message one would not be able to\nread normally. Unfortunately,\ncircumstantially to be able to to be able to\nread it, is to be unable to read it.\n((23/11/18 Event Item. Dont sell unless RPly\ngenuine.))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Music Box", "Plain looking stone box, that seems to have\nan iron key sticking out of the back of it.\nOn turning, the key makes a creaking noice as\nsome kind of mechanism turns inside the box.\nIf one would the sound of a violin but softer\nwould be audible from inside. Small metal\nworks begin to move a small metal finger\nthat'd be running quietly across a few\ndifferent strings\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Clan Klazrel] Voric Hammerforge.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Pendant Necklace", "A shining Khazadmar made silver necklace,\nwith a sapphire pendant. Forged by the Expert\nJewelsmith Koralon Doomforged.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Wyvern Head", "Before you is a black variant of Wyvern head,\nwithout its much larger figure behind. This\nsingular head is over two and a half meters\nin wholesome size while keeping its\nintimidating looks even after decapitation.\nThe leathery, scaled covered trophy is\nclearly well preserved, having it's horns,\nbone marrow innerworkings and its main\nfunctionality entirely intact. The skull is\nlarge enough for a person to fit their head\ninto and wear similarly to a helmet, though\nthis isn't advised due to weight\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Scaddernak Blood", "A thick flask of the rich red blood of a\nScaddernak. An incredibly rare resource\nuseful in all manner of alchemical creations\nand some rare food dishes, this flask would\nbe the largest stored amount in posession by\nany other than a Scaddernak itself.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:dragon_breath", ""),
        StaticItem("Gremlin's Ring", "A small pure golden ring inlaid with multiple\nglittering emeralds. Strange runes are carved\ninto the underside of the ring, right the way\nround. A message one would not be able to\nread normally. Unfortunately,\ncircumstantially to be able to read it, is to\nbe unable to read it. ((21/11/18 Event Item.\nDont sell.))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Shrapnel", "Arcane I\nShrapnel plate, of small size which fell from\nsomething gargantuan. Extremely resilient to\nharsh conditions, and almost as hard as\nCarabum. Glowing streaks of light and dark\nblue-hues in random areas of the piece. It\nseemed to have no use… perhaps.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Rich Ancient Pelt", "One of the most attractive pelts, adorning\ngolden stripes across raven-black fur. The\nunderside of the pelt was riddled with\nindecipherable inscriptions. Despite its\nyears spent underground, it retains a\npristine appearance.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Dag'Dur", "A finely crafted knife forged from bloodsteel\nand is engraved with shamanic scripture. The\ntexts refere to the spirit Gazigash.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Head", "The head of a southron wolf that once hunted\nin the woods south of Makrev. It's dead eyes\nare glazed over, and staring into nothingess.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Ducklingator", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Warm Stew Pot", "A rather large pot, made from a hard and dark\nmetal. It would be immensely hot, and require\nmitts to hold. Upon opening the lid, beef\nfilled stew would fill it and be the cause of\nit's warmth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by draja.", "minecraft:trapped_chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Bowl", "A bowl made from clay. It would be incredibly\nsturdy, and be able to hold most soups and\nstews with overwhelming success.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by draja.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf's Fur", "A portion of a direwolf's fur, which would\nfeel soft to the touch, once belonging to a\nferocious animal. The fur would be good for\nkeeping in heat, as it was incredibly dense\nand warm.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("~<Winged Trauma>~", "A steel warhammer that seems to have a rather\nsmall handle in comparison to it's head. The\nside of the head would be majestically\ndcorated with carvings, which would seem to\nrepresent a set of wings with the word\ntrauma\" inbetween, a golden shield with red\nstripes would represent house Draskovits\norigine. The handle would be rather pale, a\nfew inches of it would be wrapped with\ndirewolf pelt and a chain would dangle at\nthen end of it, allowing the wielder to twirl\nthe hammer around, or attache it to their\narmour. \"A true dwarf with a hammer sees\nevery problem as an anvil\" is scrawled down\nthe shaft of the weapon\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kirrek.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Azaghul clan helm", "This helm is made of the purest gold with a\nemerald inlayed in the forhead but there is\nsome tarnish that shows its age aswell as\nsome damage as if it had been worn in to\nbattle", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Elephantoures tusk", "This is the strong tusk of the beast that\ntook many dwarven lives.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Roast Beef Pie", "In this pie lies juicy medium rare beef roast\nwith gravy, carrots, garlic, onion,\nmushrooms, and corn", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Gerbil", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Thalgrim", "A tiny baby boy, blonde hair and perfect blue\neyes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mother] Vagronda \"Dorzada\" Ireheart.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Glorivela", "A tiny baby girl, blode hair and perfect blue\neyes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mother] Vagronda \"Dorzada\" Ireheart.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Freshly picked flowers", "A bouquet of flowers collected by Utak\nIreheart while taking Vagronda on a trip to\nHolm, the item was given out to thank her for\na great evening.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Warden] Utak Ireheart.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("~<Bunny>~", "A mighty, steel cleaver, marvelous for\nchopping up meat or vegetables.. or people.\nThe blade would be filled with carvings,\nrepresenting a bunny and a carrot. The handle\nwould be rather dark and have the name of the\nfirst owner carved into it \"Isbara\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kirrek.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Teddy bear with ribbon", "A teddy bear like plushy with a ribbon on it.\nA normal sized Teddy bear. The bear seems\nreally stuffed with soft feathers, and its\nmade out of a really soft quality material,\nthe red ribbon is also a high quality fabric.\nIt has buttoms for eyes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Delfato.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sharp Stone", "a few sharp stones, they have traces of\nminerals in them, which glisten on the\nsurface of the rock.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Oathbreaker, The Restless Hunting Knife", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Doughnut", "Cream filled chocolate doughnut with a\nwhipped cream topping", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Peppermint Mocha Coffee", "In this coffee is hints of pepperment mocha\nwith a striped cane inside\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vagronda \"Dorzada\" Ireheart.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray oblong pill", "Ingested by Ennulia\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Nome", "", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrew Poison", "A bottle of a swirling blue liquid, the smell\nseems to attract shrews specifically. Should\nthe potion be consumed by an animal relating\nto the hedgehog the animal would begin to\nenter a forced stupor.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ikvorar", "A long and hefty spear rests here, coated in\ntribal runes of Fae origin. At a length of 10\nfeet long, it would be an intimidating sight.\nThe blade of the head was serrated\nblacksteel, set with deep grooves to better\nhold poison until striking. The shaft was\ncrafted of blackwood, affording it a great\ndurability whilst giving it a good heft, hard\nto snatch from the hands. A rustic looking\nweapon for a rustic defender, this weapon\npromises safety to one's tribe and death to\nyour foes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Drum", "A small handheld drum with a leather cowskin\ncover and marked with a star * and MC on the\nbase\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Flute", "I small wooden flute with a night sky scene\ncarved all around it, it is marked with a\nlarge Star * and MC\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Violin", "A intricatley carved violin, with a Star *\nand MC Carved on the back\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cronenburg Tax Papers", "Taxe papers for the barony of Cronenburg, it\ncarries the seal of house Solidor\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring of the Rose", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Necklace of Kale", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("A Sacrificial Ferrum Kopis", "A single edged, heavy knife with a forward\ncurving blade primarily used as a tool for\nthe cutting of flesh in animal sacrifice. The\nmetal handle is covered in shagreen from a\ngreyish green shark skin. The recurved shape\nof the kopis allows it to deliver blows with\nthe momentum of an axe. Along the back of its\ncurve is the etching ‘Cali’, the blacksmith’s\nprint on a fine piece of work.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caliban.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kavietsby House Brooch", "A snake is carved out of priceless emerald\ngemstone, and studded with golden flakes that\nemphasized the texture of the snake's scales.\nThe unmoving creature was spun around a\ngolden pin-needle, and worn by any member of\nHouse Kavietsby.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold-Encrusted Musical Lyre", "The instrument was finely crafted of bronze,\nwith silver strings that rung in a beautiful\necho when plucked. It stood the size of a\nnormal chair, though was effortless to carry.\nThe bronze was embroidered with gold and\nrhinstone lining, that created the true\ncostly worth of the item.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Royal parrot feathers", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by lalvirgen.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Family Portrait", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Carriage", "", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Myumier Lae Ahern", "This exquisite silver wedding band incases\nmany jewels that resemble tiny droplets of a\ndesaturated greenish-blue ocean. If looked\nclosely at the inner side of the ring, the\nwords 'Myumier Lae Ahern' would be engraved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheesus_Crustt.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Curry Pork Rice Bowl", "Curry over a rice bowl served with a fried\npork cutlet in Easterner fashion. The curry\nitself is incredibly spicy using the Ryuu\npepper, originating from the Bay of Echoes\nand named after their Khan.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Nummy Choy", "Easterner cuisine at it's most dangerous.\nSlices of pufferfish are served over wet\nEasterner noodles and some green stuff Jo\nGuong won't say what it is. May cause numbing\nof the mouth if there's a slight bit of\npoison left in the pufferfish flesh but not\nenough to harm you. It's mostly harmless!", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Tokoko Lotus Sake c. 1696", "A chilled 'rice-wine' with a sweet, rose\ntaste. It is served in a cermaic flask called\nthe tokkuri and is accompanied with small\ncups called choko. The liquor goes down\nsmoothly when taken as shots but intoxication\ncan come eruptly even for seasoned drinkers.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tokoko Pineapple Wine c. 1696", "A homemade dessert wine made from pineapple\npulp with a low end alcohol content. Best\nserved concluding the main entree or anytime\nalongside slices of cake or fruit. The stark\ntropical citrus flavor falsely makes the\ndrink seem refreshing on a hot summer's day,\nbut be forewarned.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tokoko Shatei Sake c. 1696", "A hot 'rice-wine' typically reserved for\nwinter nights out. It has a balanced sweet\nand bitter taste, the latter being restrained\nby the heat of the brew. Albeit the alcohol\ntaste is mild, the drink can hit even more\nexperienced drinkers from out of nowhere.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bamboo Crafted Blowgun", "A 10 inch wooden narrow pipe/tube made for\nshooting darts, it holds space for one dart\nthat is activated with the persons\nexhalation; the stronger your lungs, the\nfarther a dart would go. (Similar to a bow,\nit requires 2 emotes to be armed and shot.\nRequires ammo in inventory.)", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Zhao's Cane", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Tuna", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Noodle Batch", "", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Rice", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("宣誓者", "This Katana Blade, folded many times to the\npoint of perfection is sharp as dragons\nteeth, it's handle covered in a soft red\nleather with a golden handguard and it's Red\nwooden Sheath would be engraved with the\nletters 宣誓者 - Read by an easterner would say\nSensei-sha which means \"Oath Taker\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Tempskin] Toyotomi Ashigawa.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Primitive Rule II", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Hammer", "A simple hammer made for use with a single\nhand, black leather adorned it's pommel.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pearl Necklace", "Many strings of pearls seemed to have been\nmerged into one, very long, set. They would\nbe shining and recently polished, dripping to\nthe users waist; and, at the sides of each\nthere would be two, single metal clips.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Skewered Fried Squid", "The fried batter flakes off a bit upon biting\ninto the lightly salted chewy squid. A wooden\nskewer had been stabbed through twice making\nit easier to manage while eating. It's served\nwith a small bowl filled with a sugary soy\nbased sauce.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Tempura Fried Shrimp", "Battered and deep fried Oyashimian Style, the\ntiger prawns has been prepared in a clean oil\ntelling from the batter's light color. The\nfried decapod melts in one's mouth and is\nserved with a small bowl consisting of a\nsugary soy sauce.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Amenoumi no tsume", "A finely forged nodachi, gold would outline\nthe tip of the blade. A shark as well could\nbe scene on the blade also.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by CashDinero.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rice Ball", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Melonpan", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Sushi Mackeral", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sushi Roll", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiramisu", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarger's Left Eye", "Howler used Silver Holy Claws to rip out this\neye from its socket!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StripezPurple.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pancakes", "Delicious Fluffy Pancake\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ToyBus.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Leech Hide", "This thick, black hide once belonged to a\nlarge and ferocious leech, its slick, black\ntexture feeling as slimy as the creature once\nwas. It would feel dense in the palms of\nwhosoever held it, and carries a thick,\nleather-like composition.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Magma Stone Shard", "A grey porous shard of a cooled magma stone.\nIt nice souvenir from the fight with the\nDungoth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruthern Style Salted Pork Belly", "Lean pork belly made from freshly hunted boar\nfound within the forests of Haense, cooked to\nperfection using an ancient Ruthern family\nrecipe passed down through the generations, a\ntradition since the era of the Raevir Prince.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant's Finger", "A massive bone, that of a finger of some\nabomination or creation. It always feels cold\nto the touch, and fills you with dread. The\nfinger bone is about half a foot long, and is\nmarked with strange etchings and sigils.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DivineJustice.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Druid's Breath", "This is a finely-crafted jadeleaf bottle\ncontaining druid’s breath. It is encrusted\nwith fen moss and banded with oak fiber\nstring. It smells of petrichor and lilies.\nWhen emptied onto a shrub or flower, causes\nthat plant to grow twice as fast for one\nelven day.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cossbow Prototype", "The handle would be made of Dark Oak Wood,\nThe Limbs be made of a Soft Copper like Metal\nand a The String be made of a strange Golden\nSpider Silk, on the right of side of the\nhandle there would be a Silvervein Emblem.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StripezPurple.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bluesteel Warhammer", "A perfectly balanced bluesteel warhammer, the\nhead of the hammer has a hook on the back and\nan aurum capped spike protruding from the\ntop.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Popa_Xan.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blunt Bolt", "A blunted crossbow bolt.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Lunalum Shield", "A finely made heater shield made of darkoak,\nblack ferrum. Silver would be along the edges\nand etched into the black ferrum to create a\nbeautiful, intricate, swirling pattern with\nan emblem of the moon in the center. A silver\nglow would resonate from the shield,\npulsating every so often.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("♦ Spear of The Holy Hearth [T5] ♦", "Arcane I\nA beautiful aurum spear bearing an imagery of\nwhite diamonds upon the hilt. Touching this\nimage will ignite the spearhead with ruinous\nwhite flame, banishing nearby darkness and\ncausing considerable damage to dark\ncreatures. Prolonged contact may ignite a foe\nin flame. Vanquished dark creatures will burn\nto cinders and be absorbed back into the\nspear, refueling the infusion. A custom order\nproduced by Emberco, a holy weapons company\nin Kal’Omith.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Cowfish", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Sakura Egg", "Using this egg spawns one Sakura to hangout\nwith, or kill. But why would you do that?", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of tythus", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ban Hammer", "", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Last Living Kha", "", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Idea Forge", "", "minecraft:anvil", ""),
        StaticItem("Druid's Bush", "A beautiful bracelet of roses imbued with\nSUPREME SKYGOD DRUID POWER. May or may not\nallow for Tree Pugsying", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Xalid's ambition", "", "minecraft:barrier", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Posion", "A bottle of poison that makes whoever drink\nit extremely ill and experince agonizing\npain. It doesn't take much for this to kill\nyou.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Parts of an Unknown Flower", "A petal of a unknown flower, its thick and\nleathery to the touch, indicating a much\nlarger origin. It seems to give off an almost\npungent smell, a mix between musk and rotting\nfloral.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Flametongue", "A thorny rose that only grows in the hottest\nregions, its seen to bloom commonly after a\nforest fire. Its roots are used in particular\nas a reagent in alchemy, but also able to\ncoagulate open wounds. Its spores however\ncause excessive pain.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Rough Golden Sphere", "A simple golden sphere, the surface is rough\nand uncomfortable to the touch, while the\ngold itself is unpolished and filled with\nsmall dark impurities.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aythyinae.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Blazing Ferns", "A colourful vine plant that changes colours\nconstantly, it is the reason that the\nAmberwoods are called as such, with the\nillusion of a burning forest from afar.\nGrowing in hues of deep red to brilliant\norange, they are used to reduce fevers.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Liquid Mana Tatoo", "Intricate drawings would cover the right\nshoulder of Odessa Visaj. Upon touching them,\nthey would light up and blue wisps would come\ntogether to form an arcane shield surrounding\nher being. One time use.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Hate Mail", "No one likes you, I want you to leave, get\nlost loser, watch your back. - Love C", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Birch Sapling", "The sappling of depression. Absolute\ndepression. Looking at it makes you already\nfeel somehow depressed, so depressed to a\npoint that you might stop planting other\ntrees. Nonetheless, it fills you with no\ndetermination.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Despoiled Anvil", "It's an anvil, broken in half, covered in\ngore and splinters of bone. It was the weapon\nof one of the goliaths you fought. You can\nfeel something dark about it, like the\nsuffering of the men it crushed still\nlingers. It is a fitting trophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Medallion", "A palm sized, circular hunk of aurum with a\nsmall hole on one ends with a leather rope\nstrung through it so it may serve as a\nnecklace. Pressed into it's center is a\nsurprisingly detailed depiction of a laughing\nman\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterGoosey.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Silvervein Clan Father Cheek Burnt", "The great dwarger silvervein, clan father of\nsilverveins burnt cheek", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian-Tipped Arrows", "This is a finely-crafted redwood arrow. It is\nbanded with copper, and has an obsidian tip.\nThe object has hawkfeather vanes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Aureate Ranseur", "Sheening in the nearest source of light be\nthe head of this seven foot long polearm, the\nhead of such being a cross hilt spear-tip,\nwith emeralds embedded in thickest portions\non each side, aurum gilded onto strong\ncrucible steel, and affixed on a long,\nreinforced red-wood handle. Etched into the\nwood would be a feather like pattern,\ntrailing up to the tip where the metal meets,\ncasting up onto the cross hilts which would\nimitate the shape of doves wings. A red,\njagged circle sigil on the end.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lonesome Toad's Scepter", "Quite the abnormally tall staff, reaching\nfour feet in height. It's pommel would be a\nstone, strung to the wooden hilt, carved into\nthe shape of a sad, lonesome toad. The end\ntip of the stave was chipped into a pointed\narrow, perfect for hiking.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Taint", "A vial containing dark taint. This mixture is\nextremely dangerous and must be handled with\ncaution. Contact will cause severe pain and\nspread quickly. If contaminated, seek medical\nassistance!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Artimec Camoryn's Head", "The severed head of Ex-High Prince Artimec,\nthe base still dripping with blood... It\nseems the blow was delivered quite well, a\nclean cut.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Pond__.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Red-elm Warhammer", "Six feet and five inches of Red-elm wood,\ntailored to suit the needs of someone\nphysically able. It weight approximately nine\npounds in total, most of the weight coming\nfrom the massive metal piece. It sported a\ncrows beak, and another side sported a\nhammer-head, carved upon it's flat were\ntriangle designs meant for more points of\ncontact. The bottom of the piece sported a\nmetallic cap, an alloy of steel and copper.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sali.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Falum'Lur VOL I", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Pot of stew", "I wonder what's in it!?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("The List", "A small, leather bound book. The pages would\nbe smeared with blood and natural dyes. No\nmarkings would indicate who it belongs to.\nOnly the front had decoration. A picture of a\nwolf, snarling, was impressed into the\nleather. Red would drip from it's fangs.\nWhether that is dye or blood, who can tell?", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Fraut", "A mullberry purple metal ocarina, shaped with\ncareful precision, an inscription of old blah\ncarved onto its visage, along with a red palm\nholding a pair of golden goggles painted upon\nits face. When the inscription is read, and\nthe instrument played, it will evoke sleep\nonto all who hear it, the effects decreasing\nthe further away the beings are, and the more\npotent the closer. ((Effects are not instant,\nalso contact MotoSCP173 for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Token", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Token", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Slot not in play", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Blue Token", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Token", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sofetios.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Alayne's Special Leaf Hat", "This leaf seems to have healing properties.\nJust the touch of it gives a person a\ncalming feeling.", "minecraft:waterlily", ""),
        StaticItem("Whisky", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Test112", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("&6 :^) (^: :^) (^:", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeds", "What appears to be a handful of seeds which\ncling to one another, holding an eerie hue of\nblue akin to that of lapis. They held onto a\nvague glow and buzzed ever so gently to where\none would have to concentrate to hear such\nsoft melodies.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by papikite.", "minecraft:pumpkin_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 8", "This card with the number 8 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 3 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 5", "This card with the number 5 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 2 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 16", "This card with the number 16 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 4 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 12", "This card with the number 12 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 3 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 10", "This card with the number 10 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 3 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 11", "This card with the number 11 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 3 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 9", "This card with the number 9 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 3 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 4", "This card with the number 4 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 1 Star.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 7", "This card with the number 7 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 2 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 6", "This card with the number 6 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 2 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Number 13", "This card with the number 13 is for the game\nSeto. This card gives 3 Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Totem of Glutros", "[Legedary] A figurine that displays the\ndepiction of glutros: a serpent entwining\nitself around a pile of loot. It’s imbued\npowers are unknown. . .\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Water to Wine", "[Rare] A gem-encrusted chalice that will turn\nwater to wine- as the name implies.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Glutton's Load", "[Uncommon] A large loaf of bread that\ngradually replenishes itself with each bite\ntaken. Careful, though, don't eat it all!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem Encrusted Circlet", "[Uncommon] A circular, golden headpiece\nencrusted with gems of every type, shape,\nclarity and colour. At its forefront sits a\nlarge diamond which was almost completely\ntransparent.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Bullion", "[Mundane] A small gold bar with what seems to\nbe an Old Blah character stamped on its top.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Coin", "[Mundane] A mundane coin with what seems to\nbe an Old Blah character stamped on one side,\nwith a depiction of Krug on the other.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Irinej.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Retard Token", "Redeem at your nearest Potion Seller to\nreceive his strongest potions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Dralachite Warhammer", "An ebon warhammer with a grip and neck of the\nsame material, seemingly crafted by a\nskillful smith.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Clay Axe", "This axe seems to be covered in hardened\nclay. The form suggest that it was forged in\nancient times. Maybe a skilled archeologist\ncan uncover the ancient weapon from the\nclay...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider Saliva", "A vial of spider saliva. It's sticky and\ngross. Don't get it on you!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Vorgo'Yar", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Remains of Puknaak'Lak", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lukra'Braduk's War Axe", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Drokon'Ugluk's Rex Cape", "", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin's Skull", "The skull of the dead goblin Rex.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("cookie.", "", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Bradiche", "Before you is a large four foot tall polearm\nwith a huge axe blade on it. It's blade was\naround 3/4 of a foot long and came to a point\nat the end, making stabbing with it rather\neasy. The wooden shaft was wrapped in leather\nbindings for a nice grip on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JDG617.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("YEW EVALUATION", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar bones", "This white kalk bones are what remains of a\nboar, the bonemarrow seems to be mostly\nintact and would make a great trophy for any\nhunters. They also seems to have withstood\nsome damage on some parts looking almost\nbluntly hit.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Jondead.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bent Sword", "A bent, rusted and blunted sword hailing from\nSutica following a raid upon it. It, though\nbroken, was pristine: clear from any dirt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Targoth Leydluk'Raguk.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lady's Sting", "A bow made of fine & smooth birch wood, gold\nbands on both ends and at it's center. The\nstring is made of fine, white horsehair.\nEngravings are made in the wood, depictions\nof vines, roses, and thorns. A fine weapon\nfit for hunting and sport.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Dagger", "A short, black dagger with a golden\nengraving.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Winterleaf Dagger", "This small blade has a slight curve to the\nserrated blade edge, and would slice hide and\nflesh with ease. The full tang blade is\nforged from tempered and folded steel,\nengraved with designs of weaving vines and\nleaves. The mahogany hilt is wrapped in\nblack-dyed leather, the crossguard stylized\nas eagle talons. A small Winterleaf symbol is\nstylized on the base of the hilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Menarra Reffahc.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Poppy", "A type of flower which grows well on blood,\nor in ground fertilized with dead bodies. It\nis typified by its blood-red petals. It\nsmells of carrion.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("ᝨ Ｂｒｏｎｚｅ Ｓａｌａｍａｎｄｅｒ Ｓｔａｆｆ🐍🐍 ᝨ", "A staff made of palm wood, with a bronze\nornament in the shape of a salamander on the\ntop. The palm wood the staff is made from has\nbeen treated with olive oil. The bronze\nornament depicts a salamander sitting on the\ntop of the staff, with very small eyes, and a\nflat head, being modeled after a giant\nsalamander. The salamander's eyes are 2 small\nazulite gemstones , that upon the word\nmagelight' being uttered, would begin to\nglow brightly, eventually reaching the\nbrightness of torchlight. [2-3 emotes to\nattain maximum brightness, will remain for 3\nemotes.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bolon_.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Rubber Boots", "Before you is a pair of bright yellow boots\nmade of some synthetic material called\nrubber. They are massively sized and look to\nbe for someone pretty big, like an orc maybe.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JDG617.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Crate", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Whittled Mask", "A simple mask, fashioned from a section of a\nbirch log, its eye-holes are outlined with\ncharcoal. It leaves the bottom section of the\nface and base of the nose clear, save for two\nsmall extrusions at either cheek. Near the\ntop, a pair of horns, also carved from the\nwood, sweep backwards toward the crown of the\nhead.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar 'Zoop", "A serving of Malog'Yar™ soup, freshly cooked\nfor one hungry pregnant fe-uruk. Contains all\nthat a growing unborn kub could need!", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Antlered Hunting Spear", "A Hunting Spear, crafted by a young\nMalohk'Yar after visiting Votar's realm. The\nspear has carved antlers sticking out the\nsides both as tribute to Votar and as a way\nto do more damage once pulled out a beast.\nThe size and weight are well-suited to be\nwielded in close combat by Uruks and it is\npainted white in places as a tribute to Yar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malohk'Yar.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Sharpened Boar Tusk Knife", "A crude tool, a sharped boar tusk, good for\ncarving meat and body parts. Adequate for\nstabbing in the right circumstances but by no\nmeans a weapon designed for combat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malohk'Yar.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("8' Elephant Tusk", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald-Inlaid Necklace", "A silver length of chains compacted together-\npolished and buffed so as to give off a fine\nluster. The centerpiece of this small jewelry\nis a dazzling emerald embedded into a front,\nmetal holder- the gem comprised from some\nfine cut.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Eric the Adundians Severed Tongue", "A grusome severed tongue, once giving a man\nthe ability to speak.. he may have taken it\nfor granted from the looks of it.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Meat", "The meat of a straadoth. It has a stringy,\ngamey taste to it. It is excellent in a\nkebab.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Sliver Dagger", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Grub Bowl", "A small bowl full of what can be described as\na mess of meat, grit and vegetables.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Madur'Lur.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Rotten Scaddernak Chitin", "Defamed and ruined, the armor of the mighty\nScaddernak has been worn away by acid and\ndisease, too weak to provide any real sort of\narmor. It's strange how flimsy and brittle\nthis material is. What could have happened to\nthe beast?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Krathol.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Alphonse's Large Flanged Mace", "A large and heavy steel flanged mace, anyone\nsmaller than 7ft would struggle to keep it\none handed and requires two hands to properly\nuse it. It's coated in white, with slightly\nsharpened flanges, a blood red ruby adorns\nthe tip, the handle is covered in dark green\ncolored leather with a sharp blue diamond on\nthe pommel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gioia24.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of appropriateIGN", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Apple Fritters", "", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Urk Steel Sword", "A steel-borne weapon with a weight of 6 lbs,\nit was oddly large for a sword, perhaps a\ngreat-sword for man but for beast, naught. It\nhad a rough leather-bound handle and it's\npommel was weighted to distribute it evenly.\nThe entire length was around 80 inches, and\nwas thicker than most claymores. It packed a\npunch with both mass and could definitely\nbreak through chain and dent steel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Artemis.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Large piece of Forest Titan bark", "A large and sizeable piece of durable Forest\nTitan bark. It would be near the same\ncalliber of iron. Perhaps it could be made\ninto a weapon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon-Garlic Seasoned Shrimp Pasta", "A pasta with a lemon-garlic sauce also served\nwith de-tailed shrimp!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MintyKnight.", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Mussels with Herbed Vinaigrette", "Three mussels served in half of their shell.\nThey sit soaking in a red wine vinaigrette\nand various herbs.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("S", "SSSSSSSS\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by PapaVesemir.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Victory Bread", "This bread smells awfully rich in herbs! With\na mild seasoned crust, this bread is rewarded\nto those who participated within the recent\nwarclaim, VICTORY FOR GLADEWYNN!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bobby's Bread Statue", "It's a statue of Bobby, made out of bread.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Lotus Crunch Bar", "A Blood Lotus bar with wheat and chocolate\nfor a hint of flavor, some oats as well.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Axe of Light", "The Axe was blessed through the ways of an\nelemental ritual. Its presence would appear\nto passively amplify light sources. Upon\ncontact with blood the axe will glow the hues\nof fire with the intensity of moonlight.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Copperpot's \"Finest\" Mead", "A finely distilled bottle of mead. It has a\npleasant aroma and a sweet aftertaste, though\nis rather potent. A normal person would not\nlast long from one of these.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("llyth'mya", "llyth'mya is a sword forged by ancient Elven\nweaponsmiths. It is light for it's length,\nabsence of a guard and a long extended grip.\nThe name is as ancient as the sword, meaning\nStrike of mercy\" in common.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aythyinae.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sprig of Larihei's Fingers", "A white herb native to mountain ranges, used\nfor many weak salves. Perfect for the\nAlchemist-in-training.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Slightly Fluffier Bread", "Stale bread, made slightly less dense for\nsome indiscernable reason. It's still hard,\nbut it's not too dense.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Delos Telperion.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf Plushy", "Made from the soft pelt of some fuzzy animal,\nthe plushy would be shaped into an auburn\nwolf, the eyes made of highly polished and\npainted wood to resemble the lifelike stare\nof its conterpart. Alot of care and stuffing\nwent into this plush and it would be the\nlargest in a set of three.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Barrel O' Grass", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mortar & Pestle", "A mortar and pestle set made of birch wood.\nThe exterior of the mortar would be filled\nwith carvings of leaves and a single large\ndepiction of a Hedgehog.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemist Knife", "A rather plain knife. It has serrated teeth\nat the bottom of the blade and a standard\nedge throughout the rest. This tool could\nlikely be used for cutting rope or cutting\nherbs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ellenora.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Sack of Woodworker's Tools", "A burlap sack containing various tools used\nby a woodworker, tied together and separated\nby cloth. In total, the sack contains 2 iron\nchisels, 2 iron files, 3 strips of sanding\nleather, 2 carving knives, and a whetstone.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Irawyn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Mana", "A just about wine bottle sized piece of\nglassware, full of liquid mana. Refer to\nLiquid Essence\" lore.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by bboosey.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Masked Herbs", "Various burnt herbs to put within a mask to\nprevent fumes from entering", "minecraft:coal", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_41(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Emerald Bat Trinket", "An incredibly detailed bat, carved from the\nbody of a large glimmering emerald. When\nshone on by a light, the trinket would\nrefract it, casting brilliant displays of\ngreen light, resembling the aurora borealis,\nonto the surrounding area. Engraved on one of\nthe wings is a small phrase: 'A.S. Animalia\nCollection'. The top is strung through by a\ngolden chain, like a necklace, and the bat\ncould serve as the mana gem for an\nenchantment.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ahryn Skelt.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Golem Finger", "A severed finger from a long forgotten golem\nconstruct, the finger feeling somewhat\nlifelike even with its stony texture. Wavy\nwater designs roll all around the finger up\nuntil you reach the rocky chipped area.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Eternity Wedding Ring", "Diamonds wrap around either side of this\npolished sterling silver ring. Engraved on\nthe inside of the band would be \"I will love\nyou forever.\" Each tiny diamond wrapped\naround each side of the band would give off a\nsparkle in the sunlight\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lilith Kelfiel.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Ingot", "A ferrum ingot that is 8 inches long, 3\ninches wide, and 3 inches tall. It holds a\ndark grey color, not quite black, but its\nname does entail its appearance. This is high\nquality crafting material, usefully for wide\nvariety of purposes!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ellenora o' Nordengrad.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashwood Bastard Sword", "This bastard blade styled sword is under four\nfeet in length and made of a reddish-black\nsteel. It glimmers in the sun, but not in the\nway simple steel would. It has a black\nleather grip upon its hilt. The hilt also has\na large oak tree engraved upon it. Under the\ntree in a semicircle pattern is the name\nMagnar Ruric. If one was cut with this sword,\nthey'd find themselves bleeding slightly more\nthan normal (this is not to say immediately\nbleeding out). This is a formidable sword\nindeed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SoulStrung.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Winged Screamer Feather", "Winged screamer feather. This large feather\ncame off of the infamous winged screamer its\nthe mark of a seasoned hunter.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Sack", "A large bull leather sack, sewn together well\nand reinforced with thick twine. It would be\na good container for carrying large\nquantities of heavy material.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ellenora.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Bucket", "A medium sized bucket, however, large enough\nto carry a child grown to the age of 5. It\nappears to be quite worn and used!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TitanOfTheDepths.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Jabbernak Teeth", "A plethora of semi-large teeth collected from\na deceased Jabbernak as trophies. Judging by\nthe weathering and size, these must have been\nobtained from the corpse of a deceased adult.\nThese could serve as items to personally\nadorn oneself or as a gift to the Spirits.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("maehr'sae hiylun'ehya", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("1.4573397490156154E-25 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bluesteel Hammer", "A hammer made from bluesteel that allows the\nsmith to forge weapons up to Bluesteel. The\nhammer's grip is made of strong leathery\nfiber that allows for both comfort and strong\ngripping. The head is made of pure bluesteel\nalloy that makes it durable to the hot\ntemperatures of a forge. Since it is made of\nbluesteel, it can be used for a while before\nbeing rendered unusable. On the head of the\nhammer, there is a symbol of a phoenix.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jarsek Mrysta.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("#PVPForLarihei", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Crank", "A Wooden Crank, most likely used for a Lift.", "minecraft:wooden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Bone-Knife", "", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("inflated ego", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Thill'fiyem", "A steel sword that bears intricate engravings\nthroughout it. Along the spine of the blade\nwould be engraved the name Thill'fiyem\nmeaning purity reborn. The hilt of the blade\nwould be wrapped in a velvety red fabric with\ngolden embroidery lain throughout. The pommel\nwould contain a single green emerald, cut to\nfit the pommel specifically.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelrindel Soulheart.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("65.0 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mod Notice", "The heads placed in the chest located at 1950\n67 398 were removed and returned to the owner\nfrom whom they were stolen. Thank you for\nkeeping them safe.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Valarin_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanium Container", "A closed container with a small chunk of cold\nThanium inside.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ShadowedOblivion.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Torn Rags", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Soaked sack", "A sack bearing quite the foul stench with\nflies and other insects occasionally swarming\nthe bag, It would contain the hands and head\nof a kadarsi male", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of KilledByGrace", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bar of Chocolate", "A bar of hard bitter chocolate, acquired at\ngreat expense from a travelling merchant. The\nchunk of dark brown chocolate would be\nshapped irregularly and wrapped tightly in\nwaxed linens, secured by layers of twine.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Otsugowara fleece", "The wool quality is of a superior quality,\nwith a paper bookmark within bearing the mark\nof the Otsugowara Clan. It is soft and fluffy\nto the touch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cassiflorn.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Troggen's Hardclub", "Blotched with patches of dried and caked\nblood, this club was used by the foul Troggen\nwho had happened to wander in to the Imperial\nCapital of Carolustadt, felled by Leonard of\nGlythen, this club had struck down many a\nwarrior with it's intense size and shape,\nthis was a weapon befitting even the largest\nof warriors.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mace of the Ancient Construct", "A mace made of stone, aged and cracked. It\nwould not be very effective. It does,\nhowever, serve as a reminder of times before.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Punished_Mackin.", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Gaekrin Gang Shooter | Oak Longbarreled Slurbow", "A long-barreled shooter which had a complex\nmechanic, it was made from simple Oak-wood\ntreated with an adhesive, and the only iron\npieces were the barrel, mechanics and\nbutt-cap. The barrel could be unloaded with a\nsmall protruding handle that could be pushed\nup to reveal the open slot to slide a very\nspecifically narrow bolt in, where it would\nrest on a small pedestal that was attached to\nthe bowstrings. On each side of the wooden\npart of the barrel, would be two long pieces\nthat could be expanded to act as a bow. Ｔｈｉｓ\nｗｅａｐｏｎ ｔａｋｅｓ ａｔ－ｌｅａｓｔ ｆｏｕｒ ｅｍｏｔｅｓ ｔｏ ｆｉｒｅ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gaekrin Gang.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Cannibal", "The small crystaline shard would be cold to\nthe touch, an aura of dread eminating from\nsuch an item. The inside of the shard is that\nof a milky white, clouded of what is inside.\nIt seems to be some strange catalyst. [\nContacting ScreamingDingo more information ]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("A Peculiar Tome", "A normal leather tome which feels a deathly\ncold. A neat leather strap binds its\ncontents, with a neat scrawl adressed to\nBelestram' ornately stitched into the cover.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.\nSignature: ጕጌቻጕጋልኗጌልል ልዪልኗል", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Brass Sextant", "A decent quality sextant made from brass and\nunblemished, doubly-reflecting glass. It\nallows the user to measure the angular\ndistance two objects.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Scythe of Enduring Flame", "A superb scythe rests before you, the long\nshaft made from a single length of sturdy,\nsmooth oak wood, the end of which seems to be\ncapped with a glittering ruby. The blade\nitself would be a sleek shining steel with a\nfinely honed edge. When one taps the gem on\nthe other end three times, it would appear to\nglow, embers and flares appearing on the\nscythes blade and before too long, igniting\nit in a wreath of flame.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mammoth Bone Knife", "This white seax styled knife seems purely\nceremonial. It would most likely chip or snap\nunder pressure, as it is simple bone. It's\nhilt is smooth with small curves for fingers\nThe 'blade' part of the knife seems like that\nof a kitchen knife, although the point is\nfine, it could only really be used once\nbefore becoming duller. It is a fine knife\nfor display however.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Dinner Plates", "", "minecraft:light_weighted_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("Oknars Horn (Bearded Hatchlet)", "Powerful bearded axe made out of Jorgundic\nblacksteel and Yew timber. Head of this\nstunning weapon has runes of gorundyr culture\nchieseled into it, forming altogether\nawe-inspiring shape of bear paw print. Steel\nused holds outstanding durability, able to\ntake blows from much larger weapons without\ndenting. Handel covered with carefully\nprepared leather by Karyssmov Faroe fits\nsurprisingly well in hand. Wulffs den rune is\nbranded on top of blade side.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wulfery.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Sushi Salmon", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Gold Chalice", "This ornate drinking cup has four rubies set\ninto the sides of it.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Longbow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ear Plugs", "A pair of ear plugs. Made with the use of\nleather, fur and a bit of bees wax. A small\nbottle of bees wax would also come along with\nthe item.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rolien Vulnear.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Nivinese Bowie Knife", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Beer", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rye Bread", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Empty Mug", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Navigator's Chart", "A chart of parchment bearing complicated\nnautical navigation calculations. It does not\nlook like anything a sailor from Atlas might\nuse.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bundle of Maps", "A bundle of parchment maps, well preserved\nfrom dampness. They show a somewhat\ninaccurate sketch of the Santegian coast,\nalong with detailed nautical maps of some\nunfamiliar land with a very jagged coastline.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tideborn Siege-Arrows", "Nearly three feet in length, these heavy\narrows are fletched with exotic, colourful\nfeathers - akin to a parrot's plumage - and\nmounted with heavy iron arrowheads. They are\ntoo large for a conventional bow, but a\nlarger bow could use these arrows to puncture\nthe hulls of ships at sea.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Tideborn Siege-Bow", "A tall greatbow, six-feet in height, with the\nwood banded with bronze plates at the\nbowstring treaded with quicksilver. It looks\nas like a cross between balistae and bow, and\ncould puncture the hulls of ships with heavy\narrows.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Spud -Irish approved", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by GrimDeValhalla.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodied Arrow", "The Arrow which saved Multiple Curonians from\nThe Strange Knight Aische, shot by Liz\nLongalley of Ursus. The arrow's tip would be\nchipped and covered in blood, but would hold\nmany stories.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("CT Flower", "Toatally from CT, promise\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("You smell, form yagami :D", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Mady's mega cookie", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Spoon", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Jacob", "A bundled baby boy. Don't kick it", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Transportation Cart", "", "minecraft:minecart", ""),
        StaticItem("Harley's Steel Arm", "", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Crusader", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("The Keys of Ser Mattington", "The Keys lifted off Ser Mattingtons belt.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by InfamousCanadian.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Santegian Cabernet Wine", "This full-bodied, richly-colored red is aged\nwith just a touch of oak to complement the\nripe berry aromas, offering a silky smooth\nfinish laced with vanilla and cherry.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tranquil Chances", "Inside a simple glass wine bottle is held a\nsweetly herbal, spiced brew created with\nexpert care. The wine is aged and fermented\nto near perfection, almost magically so. It\ngives a warmth to those that drink it, yet\nnot in any way that suggests something\nabnormal. Authentic and true, the wine\nremains corked and ready to be enjoyed. Near\nthe front one would see a small label,\ndisplaying its title in elegant font,\nTranquil Chances'.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of daxxgamer_", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Halsworthian Dagger", "A close-combat weapon made out of a fine\niron. Its hilt is adorned with the\nHalsworthian emblem\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kalesius.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Polished Golden Amulet", "The Polished Amulet would shin as you held it\nin your hands, the chain would be perfectly\ncrafted gold inter linked into each other, at\nthe base of the amulet would be a single pure\nemerald, clean and shined.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Accrayer.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Liquid Mana", "luminescant light blue liquid that could be\nidentified as liquid mana.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dwarven Bones", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ethel's Steel Hand", "An arm fitted specifically for Ethel, made of\na lightweight steel alloy. It functions\ngenerally as a normal arm might, if but just\na tad slower at times where the mind might\nfeel stress. There is a hatch on the upper\npart of the arm by the shoulder, and another\non the back of the hand - A glowing diamond\ngem present within each to power the\nenchantments that allow it to function. PM\nFury_Fire for info.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodwood Puzzlebox", "This is a masterfully crafted bloodwood\npuzzlebox. It has a lock which requires the\nblood of a (1d4 where 1 = human, 2 = elf, 3 =\norc, 4 = dwarf) smeared on it to open.\nContained within is an experience tome of\n(1d4 where 1 = enchanting, 2 = alchemy, 3 =\nblacksmithing, 4 = fishing).\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Elyrus' Ward", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiny Gold Ring", "A well-crafted, detailed, golden ring, with a\nsmall, but multi-shaped gem on the top. The\nname 'Merial' would be inscribed on the inner\nand outer sides of the gem, while small\nleaf-patterns and laurels would be inscribed\nalong the gold band.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("the diamond of i love you im sorry dont hurt me please bb :(", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Climbing Bolt", "A bolt is a piece of gear that is inserted\ninto rock or ice. You can attach your gear to\nthe bolts to help you climb up the rock or\nice.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutican Aphrodisiac", "A silver gooey fluid procured by the famed\nalchemists of Sutica. It is rare and is\nrumored to have a mix of emberberries and\npegasus parts. It is used to incite the want\nfor love in both females and males. Doesn't\nwork on orcs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Key", "", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Sasumata", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Patchwork Genevieve Doll", "This stuffed patchwork doll depicts the Fi\nmage Genevieve in an as close as possible\ndepiction. The skinny arms and matching hues\nof blues and pale skin seem to be carefully\nworked on by an amatuer dollmaker. A small\nred E under the left armpit.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Oak Recurve Bow", "The bow is a large curved bow crafted in the\nwoodlands of the dominion by the Highelves of\nyears past. It has a small leather grip, with\na silk thin bow string. On the side of the\nbow is a small eching reading \"Momento Mori\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ze_claus.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Milk Chocolate Easter Bunny", "A chocolate bunny, this bunny would be filled\nwith several small eggs inside all containing\na delicious mixture.\n- Created by The Evocress Produce Company -", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Orenian Cavalry Horse Armor, 5th Empire", "Orenian Cavalry Horse Armor from the Imperial\nArmy of the Fifth Holy Orenian Empire. The\nwell preserved fabrics that emblazon the\nferrum horse armor are Purple and Black, the\ncolors of the Imperial Royal Family, House\nHoren. In Golden Letters on the decorated\nhorse armor, it is written *DEUS MAGNUS, DEUS\nVULT.*\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Grandmaster Rakim Yar.", "minecraft:iron_horse_armor", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Short Sword", "A short sword taken from a slain Deeproad's\nGoblin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rhum de l'Aube", "A well refined drink, distilled from a blend\nof seven varieties of sugarcane alongside a\nvariety of spices before being left to sit\nfor several saints months. Although not the\ncheapest of rum, it would hold a rich but\npleasant sweet orange flavouring among its\nnaturally occurring strong taste.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Bracer", "Arcane I\nA bracer with various gems imbedded into it.\nBy tensing the arm, arcane energies sprout\nabout the item - forming an arcane shield the\nsize of a roundshield. It can take a variety\nof hits, though heavy force and blunt force\ntrauma will cause cracks on the shield. After\nsix powerful strikes on the shield, it will\nshatter and expell energy for a moment. (2-3\nemotes to activate and the user is able to\nmake eight shields every sixty minutes.\nContact Niv_Mizzet for more information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bamboo Wind Chimes", "A well-crafted set of bamboo wind chimes. It\nis made of bamboo stalks for the chimes,\nbirch wood for the disc and knocker, and held\ntogether by strong, long-lasting hemp thread.\nWhen caught in the wind, it produces a melody\nof hollow knocks that can be both calming and\neerie to hear.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roxforbraynz.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Western Khorghul Flower", "A rather thin and ragged flower that oddly\nsmells like ash, ash created out of burnt\nbodies, vegetation and the West.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("FM Cookie", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("An Ornate Ring", "", "minecraft:prismarine", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Training Sword", "A standard wooden training sword made for a\nDwarf. The sword would mimic other swords\nused in the Legion, though would be\nnoticiably thicker and heavier than its metal\ncounterparts.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Rhetanine Powder", "Mined in the depths of the Mountains of\nUrguan. This powder comes from a solution of\nFerrum ore, small doses of Thanium and a\nbroader mixture of dough and sugar. Dangerous\nto acquire and even more dangerous to abuse,\nit is used as a stronger pain reliever than\nopiates but when taken in too large a\nquantity can cause a fatal overdose without\nwarning. It can be smoked or inhaled but is\ninsoluable.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Scaley Leather Leggings", "A pair of masterfully crafted blue leggings\nfrom the scales of a Lubba! Despite being\nlighter than hauberk, they're as strong as\niron.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpodoKaiba.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("The Great Diamond Pumpkin", "Carefully cut and shaped into the form of a\nharvest pumpkin, this diamond trophy is a\nmasterpiece created by the finest Hansetian\njewelers. Any light directed into this prize\nwill send fractured rainbow light in all\ndirections, a truly beautiful sight. This\naward was granted to the winner of the Autumn\nSolstice Costume Contest of 1687, held in the\ncity of Markev.", "minecraft:diamond_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Tribal Longbow", "A longbow coated in purple feathers and\nteeth, the string is coated in a blue dye, it\nhas an overall tribal feel. It is quite a\ngreat make, being crafted from Highland Yew\nwood. The Highland Yew makes the bow\nextremely durable, able to be used for many\ndecades, which seems to be the case. The bow\nwas about 5’9” with a draw strength of 90\npounds. The bow seems to have many names\netched into the side of it, having no\nrelation. Nathan, Cyrelas, Brok, Jonas,\nGrimlak.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Luzdeldia", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashwood Ale", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Nemiisae Statuette", "A skillfully crafted statue which depicts a\nwoman with a spider body. Her hands lay open,\nalmost as if welcoming those who make their\npath towards her. Those who are familiar\nwould recognize the woman as Nemiisae, The\nAutumn Lady. One of the Druidic Aspects. The\nstatuette is almost perfect for display\npurposes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ascanius.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashwood Chalice", "Before you appears to be a wooden chalice,\nfilled with mana and forged of ashwood.\nElegant engravings span the entire chalice,\nbut the inside remains entirely smooth, this\nlack of a coarse texture due to a layer of\nblack ferrum. The applications of the liquid\nmana vary, but one with the proper knowledge\ncould use it to its fullest extent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ruibrium.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Varis Ithelanen's Blood in a Vial.", "Blood drawn directly from Varis Ithelanen due\nto a bloodpact. It appears to only be a small\namount of blood, however it could be enough\nfor some interesting results if used\nproperly..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [LvL 79 Paladin] Ascanius.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Aqua Nymph", "A small chain of blue baubles in a large jar\nof what looks like swamp water and mud. If\neaten raw, it will induce hallucinations and\nclose one's windpipe. Boiling it creates a\nthick oil useful for treating burns.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Hourglass Of Time", "An old magical relic used by some Halflings\nin days gone by to travel through time...\nseems to be broken now, though.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("1  The Sorceress' ۞ Sanguine Stone 1", "As you stare at this scarlet gem, a\ntemptation most primal inspires atavistic\ndesire to claim it. An unwavering notion\nfills you: this gem belongs to you. It is a\npart of you.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Sticky Bollock", "", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Tragic Rose Sculpture", "A Beautiful Sculpture That Would Look Good On\nThe Mantle, A Rosy Red Rose Formed From\nPottery, The Petals Make Slight Heart Shapes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Percius Karlstwight.", "minecraft:red_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Platinum Snowflake", "A delicate platinum snowflake on a chain. The\ntips of the spokes are decorated with small\nspheres of lapis lazuli, and the center is\ntaken up by a gleaming faceted sapphire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("rodent sweeper", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by hrasion.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Candle Painting", "A simple circle of candles painted in what\nlooks to be a dark cave. Flora and plantlife\nsurround the edges of the artwork and in the\nmiddle of the circle of candles sits a druid\npreying to the Mother.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sar-Isbandian Golden Elven Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Gadhrinion Family Leafblade Claymore", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gadhrinion Heavy Greatsword", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gadhrinion Family's Elven Longbow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Sar-Isbandian Bardiche", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rhenôr Dwarven Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Rhenôr Heavy Warhammer", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hyel Dorei Conquest Heater Sharp", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Rowan Spaling", "A spaling with a few small red pome on the\nplant that looks well enough to be eaten.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Wood", "There is a perfectly made series of dents in\nthe wood which form a sentence, so well made\ninfact that the wood is not at all harmed and\nwas clearly made by an experienced druid. The\nsentence reads; 'Nesrine is my dedicant,\nplease do not harm her. Signed, Toren.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toren.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Box of Matches", "A small ornate box filled with red matches.\nWhen the head of the match is struck against\nthe side of the box \"Alchemist magic\" would\nlight it up in a small flame that lingers for\naround 30 seconds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Wedding Band", "A Wedding Band made from Pure Emerald, Carved\nto fit perfectly around ones finger. The\nBottom of the Ring would hold the name\nAesilnoth, while the top would hold A system\nof Engraved Branches. When close to its\ncounterpart, the Branched Engraving would\nGlow, showing a connection to the other\nwearer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Star Bronze Ingot", "A ingot of an alloy between copper, and\nmeteorite ore. The ingot is mildly\ntransluscent, small amounts of bright light\nbeing able to pass through it. The ingot\nseems to have what looks like small stars\nthroughout it, glowing dimly, likewise, small\nbands of discoloration arc throughout it's\nbody, looking very similar to the bands of\nlght created by celestial bodies, like\nnebulas. The hardness of the alloy is akin to\nthat of low carbon steel. The alloy is able\nto be melted down, and properly cast and\nrecast into molds effectively, like bronze.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Double-banded gold and diamond bracelet", "This bracelet features two thick golden\nbands, incorporating a crossed patterning\nwithin. Diamonds line the interior of these\nbands, scattered throughout the golden form,\nattached with laced vines of gold and silver\ncord to form teardrop shapes\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("The Spirit of Magic", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("~= Excalibur: Fortis Fortuna Adiuvat =~", "A stout Longsword forged in White Peak, in\nthe County of Götha in 1659, the blade\nweighing 1,3 kilograms due to the heavy\nornaments upon it, made for ceremonial use\nprimarily, but still able to be swung\neffectively in any battle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown of Amaethon", "A stag's skull adorned with decorated\ncarvings etched into the bone and lined with\nfine furs.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bane of the Hunt", "A curved blade blessed by Votar - its bone\nhandle comes from a Scaddernakk and the\nserrated blade appears sharp enough to cut\nfrom a graze.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Wargoth] Gilgamesh'Braduk.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Knuckles", "Wooden knuckleduster with four holes where\nfingers can be slipped through them, and a\nstandard grip for the palm. Seems to fit a\nmale hand, and they're made of some dense,\nbeige wood. Wielded in order strengthen the\nimpact of a punch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Sacrifical Bloodied Lambs Wool", "This item is saturated in fresh lambs blood ,\nthe wool the size of a small napkin and torn\nin places as if ripped from the animal.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Elandria Caerme'onn", "Elandria Caerme'onn lays nestled in thick\npelts and blankets, red curls sweep against\nher forehead and bright blue eyes glance up\nat you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Goatskin", "A dark, stomach-shaped goat leather bag meant\nto serve as a liquid receptacle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Toothed Bat", "A crude wooden branch, whittled away until it\nwas rid of its twigs and bumps. It's around\n4.5 feet long. The handle is leather\nwrappings enveloping the first seven inches\nfrom the base. The rest of the bat has been\ncovered in a sap that had hardened, and has\nmany teeth of a carnivorous beast embedded in\nthe sap. Looks like a gnarly, brutal weapon,\nfit for a savage.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Rilandhir", "This longsword is primarily made of tempered\nsteel with an aurum tip, but silver is laid\nalong the length of the flat side in a\nlooping pattern. The crossguard forms into\ntiny steel trees on both sides. When in the\nlight, clear polished quartz shines from the\nhilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Qyehm.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Apothecary's Box", "A simple box of dark oak has numerous little\ndrawers and compartments. Within each one\nrests a bundle of herbs, or a collection of\ntiny glass bottles; all neatly labeled. The\nexterior of the box is carved with delicate\nvines and blooms.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Tippen’s Root Balm", "Sickly yellow and smelling of death, this\nbalm is a miraculous coagulant. Even though,\nupon opening, the revolting stench would\npermeate the immediate area, when applied to\nopen wounds the bleeding is staunched almost\ninstantly.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Peppermint Oil", "Once unstoppered, the contents of this bottle\nsmell strongly of peppermint. Perfect for\ncounteracting the terrible smell of Tippen's\nRoot!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tawfeeee.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chef's Knife", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Trial GM Commemorative Item!", "An item commemorating oblivionsbane's GM\ntrial!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by oblivionsbane.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck's Shorts", "Fine furs of swamp critters would be stitched\ntogether into this lovely pair of trousers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Ako Oodw Lapnks", "It is Ako!", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Mixed Berry Tart", "A freshly baked and delicious looking mixed\nberry tartlet. It is filled with a gooey\nfilling of blackberries, black currants,\nboysenberries, elderberries, and blueberries.\nThe tartlet would be covered on its surface\nwith a brown sugar and cinnamon streusel\ncrumble and decorated with a vanilla icing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Avia Silma.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("~-Amaranthine Crown of Flowers-~", "This flower crown is unlike any normal made\nflower crown. It is not made from flowers\nthat will wilt over time; instead, the petals\nof each flower is made from polished and\nrefined stainless steel. The stigma of each\nflower would be made with different gems,\nsuch as sapphires, rubies, emeralds,\ndiamonds, amethyst, even moonstones. The\nflowers would be fixed onto a comfortably\nmade metal band, just the right size for\nanyone!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Marten Druid.", "minecraft:poppy", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of SmartScout", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("this is so shit", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by hrasion.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorpion's Chitin", "A large chunk of a large scorpion's\narmor-esque chitin, hard to the touch, and\nabout the size of a large dinner plate. The\nchitin-chunk would hold a very unremarkable,\nbland, sandy scent.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ball-Peen Hand Hammer", "This hammer is rather big, the head having a\nflat side and a balled end on the other side.\nIt's well fitted to the wood and is the\nperfect size for Ruben.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] Ruben.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Ribcage", "This rather large ribcage sits at a size of a\nfew feet in width, give or take. It's unable\nto fully discern exactly what it came from,\nbut whatever it came from, it was a\nrelatively large animal. The bone was cleaned\nproperly, and well, showing off the radiant\nwhite bone. Near the middle one of the ribs\nseems to be missing, assumingly by the cause\nof an arrow.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Farah's Gift", "A high carbon steel arming sword with a\nmushroom shaped pommel. On the rectangular\ncrossguard are etchings of leaves and the\nmessage \"Love, Farah\" on it. The crossguard\nalso has ring guards on the side to aid in\nparries. Created by Halern'evar on 5 Malin's\nWelcome, 1677\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Partridge", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiva's Bird-Form", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Katana", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Earth'je dyrth (cleaver of the dragongod)", "This is a massive gorundyr styled cleaver.\nThe black steel blade is perfectly sharpened\non one side leaving the spine thick,\nheav'ga\" is carved along the massive blade\nof the cleaver. The long handle is made from\nbeech wood wrapped in black stainned leather\nwith a rough texture giving a better grip.\nThe spiked aurum pommel has a piece of string\nthat runs through it holding a few brown,\nwhite and black feathers. This two handed\nweapon is was made with masterful\ncraftsmanship.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusion Amulet", "An amulet that hangs from a silver chain. The\nemerald is chipped slightly on it's sides and\na dull arcane glow emits from the core. If\nworn, a person would take on the appearance\nof Stella Evaglno.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Drak3_.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("25.0 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("57.5 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Viper", "Within your hands is a ᛤ Master ᛤ Crafted ᛤ\nBlack Ferrum Scythe, One obviously meant for\nCombat and No tool like use. A 5. CM thick\ncut of Dark oak, painted Jet-Black, the paint\nstill 'factory new'. 6 FT 5 Inches, allowing\nfor reasonable reach. The Black Ferrum arched\nblade as all scythe-type Weapons have was\nabout two feet off the Black Hilt/Handle.\nEtchings of a Viper ran down the staff of the\nScythe, and Black Leather pading makes a\nperfect pair of grips. The Black Ferrum Blade\nseemed to extend from the Staff like the\nFang' Of the Viper. Branded into the Blade\nItself was a Firey Orange insignia of Dwedish\nScript which spelt out the initials D, K,\nDoomforged. - \"The Blacksmith\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [MasterSmith] 'The Doomsmith'.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of NYoshiR", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Caltrops", "A handful of clusters of metal shards, fused\ninto a clump. One blade is always pointed up.\nThey are kept in poor repair, left rusty\nintentionally. Walking over these can tear\nshoes, lame animals, and immobilize seige\nweapons. Few stand taller than grass, making\nit an annoying task to clear them from the\nground they are scattered over.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ComboFodder.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Scarecrow Puppet", "A scarecrow puppet, seemily roughly done hard\nto decipher if it looks like anything besides\na humanoid shape. If you dig into the puppet\nyou'll find; Straw to be under the patchy\nclothing, interweved over eachother to create\na strong base, moss pressed in, over the top\nof a clay humanoid shape mold\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evark Evocress.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("The Legendary Potato Gun", "An oak wood contraption who's shape resembles\nthat of a gun. It has a wide round opening on\nit's top end for an object to be placed in\nand a rope on it's back end. When the rope is\npulled back, the gun will gain suprising\namounts of potential energy that will send\nthe object flying towards its destination\nwhen released!", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("dork", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Arcitc Mists Potion", "A vial with a glowing aqua liquid inside.\nThis liquid emits a cold aura that is far\nbelow freezing level, if smashed it would\ncreate a mist that creeps around.Steel would\nturn brittle, air crispening, skin numbing\nand even breaking if close enough, water\nalmost instantly freezing, exposed blood\nmight also. The initial mist lasts at most 15\nseconds but its after-effects would be left\nbehind.Frostbites, immense freezing, brittle,\netc..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Jodal's Snowy Tear", "A white crystal, shaped like a tear.\nIt's very cold to the touch and lightly freezes water.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashen Trident of Ebræitus", "Within your hand rests a four-feet long\nbronze trident speckled with flakes of aurum,\nboasting three prongs six inches in length.\nUpon the hilt you notice a foreign imagery of\nwhite, diamond shapes forming an intricate\npattern; and should it be touched, the prongs\nof the trident would immediately ignite with\nethereal white flames. These flames are\nexceptionally painful and damaging to the\nunguarded flesh of soul-altered beings.\nCausing intense pain and burning away\ntaint[Msg ZachsSlayer for more]", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fox Mask", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Snow Globe", "A glass sphere has been carefully seated into\na base of dark oak. The scene set within the\nglobe is one of a pine forest in winter. The\nground pure white while the needles of the\npines are varying dark greens. Water fills\nthe empty space and when shaken some of the\nsnow dislodges from the ground to slowly\nfall. The snow is actually made from very\nthin flakes of bone while the trees and\nground are painted wood.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Hound Mask", "A rather well crafted hound mask, the floppy\nears of the headwear would be made from\nsoftly prepared white wool whilst the fur of\nthe hound would be a soft grey silk\nconsisting of the same wool but black in\ncolour for effect. The back of the mask has\ntwo pieces of twine stitched upon the oaken\nframe to keep it secured against ones face.\nQuite a fine piece to wear to masqurades and\nfestivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Crate of Ale", "A Crate of Strong sweet apple ale with \"A\nengraged into the top\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheAnorak.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Purple Raven Feather", "An overly large purple feather plucked from a\nraven", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Mosaic Sky", "A potent, mood-changing drug in the form of\ngelatin squares. Best taken in a comfortable\nenvironment as to not have a 'bad trip'.\nFeelings going into the experience are\nenhanced greatly.", "minecraft:stained_glass_pane", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Stone Tablet", "Dark basalt is carved with ancient elven\niconography, depicting the moon in its many\nphases. The constellations are\nunrecognisable, as many have been worn smooth\nby water. Down the tablet’s centre is a strip\nof an opalescent gemstone, which curiously\ncatches the blue light of the moon…\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Woodlaw's Ring", "A fine ring of wrought silver, set with a\ncrowned crimson ruby which dances with\nethereal light. Starlit, flowing Elvish\nscript is engraved along its inner circle, an\ninvocation against the darkness in the name\nof the Caretaker- and upon the utterance of a\ncommand-phrase the ring may be cast ablaze\nwith a powerful silver conflagration. A\nmaker's mark in the shape of a hammer and\nanvil is upon it, the sign of the Wright. (T5\nRuinous Soulflame)\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Woodlaws Sword", "Woodlaws Sword' is the ancestral longsword\nof the Woodlaw family, a small yet\nprestigious family in the Dominion of Malin.\nIt was forged by Thomas Woodlaw in the year\nof 1654", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearts Tea Pot Collection", "A set of wonderful marble made tea pots of\nexotic style, a large pot for pouring and\nthree others for drinking tea from. Around\nthe hands and rim there would be 50 Carat\nGold laced like paint.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Rose Plant", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sandalwood Scented Perfume", "A vial of warm scented perfume! Its rich and\nwoody texture gives you hints of summer even\nin the depths of winter. The liquid within\nwas made of various other liquids and a\ndistilled sandalwood scent.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("The Duchess", "A large beautiful diamond hung down in the\nmiddle of a white-golden chain. At the back\nwere four other small diamonds, though still\ntwinkling in any form of light", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Leather Satchel", "A notably large satchel coated in a small\namount of beeswax to resist water. Along the\nfront are two leather straps for keeping it\nclosed, which are reinforced with ferrum\nstuds. Within the satchel is an assortment of\npouches that are pliable for ingredient\nstorage. The pouches themselves seem to be\nfilled with an immense variety of medicinal\nherbs. Along the front face of the satchel is\na smaller pouch filled with lavendar to\ncounteract the scent of herbs within.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Massive Wyvern Bone", "The large bone of a slain wyvern. It would be\nover 6 feet in length and held the strength\nof a large piece of ferrum.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon and Strawberry Cream Cake", "A 2 layered sponge cake with white icing an\nstrawberries between its two layers, and\nontop of it. The cake bears a notable lemon\ntaste, and bears a soft, notably moist\ntexture. The icing is creamy, vanilla\nflavored, and firm. The strawberries are\nfresh picked, and bear a notable tang.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Elora's Pumpkin Pie", "A lovely homemade pumpkin pie catches your\neye. Delicate wisps of cinnamon spice scatter\nover the thickened surface of the finely\nwhipped filling comprised of pumpkin and\nvanilla in a smooth custard like batter. The\nflakey crust lays wedged between a copper\nbaking tin, emerging in fluffy ridges of\nbuttery crust. Eight soft little dollops of\nwhipped cream are meticulously placed about\nthe heavenly scented surface of the pie,\nfinishing the extraordinary baked good off in\nthe best way possible.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elora Silma.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Bugle Horn", "A hollow horn, quite possibly from a domestic\ncow. The tapered end has an openning allowing\nfor it to be blown into in a manner similar\nto a trumpet. When blown, it produces a deep\nresonating note.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pie", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Barbed Wire", "", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Elizabeth Azalea Bell", "Elizabeth Azalea Bell lays in pink blankets,\ncovered by a small fur pelt. Her cute little\ngreen eyes looking up at you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Alexander Julius Noah Bell", "Alexander Julius Noah Bell lays in light blue\nblankets, covered by a small fur pelt. His\ncute little green eyes looking up at you.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tick-Tock Tinker", "", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Worn Steel Falchion", "A steel falchion, its single-edged blade is\nbattlescarred and worn. It sports a couple of\nscratches too deep to entirely remove. The\nlength of the blade is a total 80cm,\npossessing a beveled point. Its handle was a\nsimple oak, wrapped with equally worn\nleather.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Round Shield", "This heavy shield is made of overlapped\nwooden planks with a spreak of leather over\nthe outer face of the protective device.\nWhile nailed together it also sports an outer\nwrap of a thinner leather dried around the\nouter circumference to cause a friction hold.\nThe center was riveted iron, the domed iron\nboss placed with the intent to shield the\nhand while using the device.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Potion Bottle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cheddar Cheese", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Luscious Extra Virgin Olive Oil", "The bottle of liquid has a slight green hue\nto it. It seems to be olive oil!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("0.19754620431058356 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Round Cut Emerald", "An emerald that possesses a bright green\ncolor, yet appeared to have a slight aqua hue\nto it. This precious gem would be round cut,\nproviding great brilliance. Most if not all\nlight that makes contact with the emerald\nwould be reflected near flawlessly. One could\ncertainly tell that much attention and care\nwas put into the refining of this gem.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Riftblade.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Emerald Necklace", "The pendant of this necklace would seem to be\na finely cut, bright green emerald about the\nsize of a large marble. Its sides would be\nlined with silver and gold. The chain and the\nmetal around the pendant would be very finely\npolished, and no matter how hard you may try\nto scuff it up, it would somehow always\nretain the polished look.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dymase.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Lubba Horns", "The horns taken from a lubba. Known for their\ndurability and sharpness, a lubba horn is\noften sought after by weaponsmiths and\nfletchers alike to create powerful tools of\nwar. ((02/12/18 Event Item. Dont Sell Unless\nW/ Proper RP. @ Original_Potato for info))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lubba Heart", "A heart taken from a lubba!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Lubba Scales", "A square foot worth of shimmering prismarine\nlubba scales, torn off the lubba hunted by\nAegrothond. They are light, tough and\nresilient. Refer to lore for more. ((02/12/18\nEvent Item. Dont Sell Unless W/ Proper RP. No\nDumbass Voidmage Armour ples @\nOriginal_Potato for info))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Snad", "It is snad!", "minecraft:sand", ""),
        StaticItem("A Blacksmiths Rasp", "A blacksmiths rasp. A rasp is a tool similiar\nto a sword, long and similiar in shape to a\nshortsword yet completely blunt and flat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ixli.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Empty Core of Ichor", "Here rests the now empty core of a Golem once\nbelonging to the construct named Ichor. The\ncore would have cold resinating from it hints\nat its Thamium origin though it now rests\nquitely, and empty devoid of its previous\nlife.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("MedKit", "a medkit containing scapels, surgical\nequipment bandages and several types of\nsalves\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Antler Necklace", "The immediate impression is that this object\nis one half of the whole. It is a carefully\ncarved antler from some animal or another,\ncrafted into a simple hook-like shape. Along\nthe longer straight portion is carved a name,\nDelmira' in elegant hand, before it was\nattached to a length of leather cord.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Leyne.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｓｉｌｖｅｒ Ｅｌｖｅｎ Ｈａｎｄ Ｊｅｗｅｌｒｙ", "A piece of hand jewelry, suited for the left\nhand of Delmira Aureon. Silver branches wrap\nfrom what would be a slender wrist across the\npalm to the middle finger. Small emeralds\nwink from the blooms.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fëanor Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling Shekels", "Coins made out of melted down silverware,\nstamped with a pumpkin on one side, and the\nface of Petyr The Dreamer on the other", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Painter's Palette", "A thin oak painters palette.", "minecraft:wooden_pressure_plate", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_42(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Painter's Brush", "A glazed oak handled, boar bristled bright\nbrush.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yeveth Flormai.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Gladewynn Vodka", "A bottle of classical Gladewynn vodka, ready\nto be downed by an alcoholic. This'll have an\nelf on their bum in seconds\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladewynn bitches idk.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Optical Magnification Lenses", "Low grade magnification lenses for the\nobservatory in Aegrothond.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Celestial Lenses", "An extremely fine craft of optical lenses,\nmade by the hands of the jewel smith Renarion\nUradir. These lenses are powerful enough to\nglimpse any and all heavenly forms in the\nsky.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Almenodrim Spyglass", "A powerful spyglass with interchangeable\nlenses. Although not powerful enough to\nglimpse the fine details of the night sky, it\nis a well made and useful tool.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Sirene Hair Bindings", "Hair of a beautiful Sirene, a magical\ncreature of the seas. The hair has been\nweaved to be a small, light, string, though\nas strong as any metal.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard Of Elsil'Khaleer", "One of the four broken shards of\nElsil'Khaleer, the sword of stars. Legend\nsays the blade was crafted from hardened\nstarlight by the Almenodrim, but was\nshattered, and the pieces lost.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blue Hilt", "The hilt of Elsil'Khaleer, made from some\nstrange hardened blue material. It seems to\nbe like blue wood, though the truth is lost\nto history.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ethnic Delicacy", "", "minecraft:melon", ""),
        StaticItem("<=Glorious Banner=>", "Treaty i need voxelpex please, building caves\nis like sucking a cactus.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Utak Ireheart.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Marble Ring", "A ring made of bronze, with a smoothed marble\nstone set into it. The bronze has been shined\nexcessively, making it very shiny and\nreflective. One can view their own, ableit\nwarped, reflection in the metal. The marble\nstone is about 8 millimeter and is has been\ncut into a circle. The marble stone has been\nwell shined and sanded, making it rather\nsmooth to the touch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruibrium Shrapnel", "", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Tea Cup", "A clean and empty tea cup, perfect for\nserving tea.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Blissfoil", "A small glass jar with streaks of white on\nits glassy surface, the top and bottom are\ncaps made of fine bronze and inside is a\ndozen small doses of a numbing paste known as\nblissfoil, if rubbed onto the skin of a\nperson their skin would numb. if not removed\nless than an elven hour later, the persons\nskin will begin to go numb forever. WARNING:\nRise after use! [Contact ZachsSlayer for any\nhelp!]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Paintbrush", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar-Zilla's spine", "The spine of Boar-Zilla ripped out by A Ramen\nChef as he tried desperately to find J'alan a\nsuitable reward. Perhaps it can be used as a\nweapon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of blood.", "A vial of blood. Something about it just\nfeels.. Off. (Message RancidHound for\ninteractions)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("White Tulip", "A beautiful flower with a nice aroma. The\nflower would be full with life and young,\nflowering love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Uther Grimlee.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Wedding Ring", "This beautiful silver ring would be decorated\nwith a small, exquisite deep blue sapphire.\nThe silver body would have small waves carved\naround the whole of the ring, all leading\nback to the sapphire. No matter what\ndirection you would point the sapphire, light\nwould always seem to reflect off of it,\ngiving a shine that’s pleasant to the eye.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Duncan Lefay.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Engagement Ring", "A small, fine, ruby would be placed in the\ncenter of the ring. The silver making up the\nmajority of the ring would be finely\npolished, small and intricate patterns carved\ninto the metal. Upon closer inspection, one\nwould see a small carving of a stag on one\nside and a flame on the other.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dymase.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Sun's Embrace", "An elegantly made white gold ring rests\nbefore you. All along the metal etched in\nwould be images depicting the rising sun\nleading up to the center were a beautifully\ncut diamond rests giving the view of a\ndazzling sun and giving off a warm glow when\nsunlight passes through it. On the inside of\nthe band would be a inscription that said Oem\nkae marchen perithnere ito naeleh karinto.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlight Druid] Eryn Nailo Serene.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Bracelet", "This beautiful ornate bracer would lay\ncomfortably around one's wrist. It is made of\ngold and silver, formed in a woven patern,\nover eachother. The gold and silver streaks\nare set with diamonds and opals,\nrespectively. The gemstones would shine\nbeautifully when light hits them.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Delmira's Harp", "This lap harp is fashioned from a mix of\nferrum and bluesteel, forming an alloy with\nflowing tones of silvery blue. The soundboard\nof the harp is engraved to look like a tree's\ntrunk, the neck an angelic wing. There are 26\nferrum strings, the melodies produced by the\nmetallic intrument almost like heavenly\nbells. This instrument was made with careful,\ndelicate craftsmanship almost beyond compare.\nThe Winterleaf craftsman's mark is engraved\nin the underside of the body.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar Water", "More sugar with water than it is water with\nsugar.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Scaled Leather", "The thick serpent like leather from the wing\nof a wyvern. not really different from any\nother source of leather, it is roughly 1\nmeter by one third meter in size.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("⁜※✵ Ａｎｔｈｏｓｉａｎ Ｃｌｅｒｉｃ Ｒｉｎｇ ✵※⁜", "A signet ring, made out of silver. The silver\nthe ring is made from is well shined, and is\nquite lustrous under light. The ring bears\ncurved edges, and a flat interior, similar to\na wedding band. The ring fans outward ever so\nslightly on it's front, and bears the symbol\nof the Clerical Order, during the lands of\nAnthos.\n▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢█▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢\n▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢█\n▢▢█▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢\n▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢█▢▢▢█▢▢\n█▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢\n▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢█\n▢▢█▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢\n▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢█▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢▢\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Soapstone Ringmold", "A small, squarish, 2 part mold made of\nsoapstone. The soapstone is black, and has\nbeen smoothened notably. The mold is 6 inches\ntall, and 3 inches long and wide. The mold\nbears a small hole on it's top, and comes\napart down the middle. The mold, if fastened\nclosed, and filled with molten metal, can be\nused to cast a small wearable ring, fitted\nfor a average sized male ring finger. The\nmold is somewhat heavy, weighing over a\nkilogram.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Otter Plushy", "Sleek and cylindrical, with a small,\nbutton-eyed head, feet webbed with velvet and\ntapered off cloth for claws, the plush River\nOtter toy would be able to stand on it's\nhindlegs by being set down, dense wool in its\nlong tail counter-balancing the rest of its\nbody. The whiskers sewn around the mouth\ntapering alongside the shape of a crafty\nsmile, from the looks of it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hareven Lorenthus.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Elnarnsae'ame Stonespear", "A sturdy stone spear, made by an excellent\nsmith, standing at about six foot. Carved\ninto the spearhead would be depictions of\npowerful mani, giving the hunter strength\nduring their hunt. Upon the wooden shaft of\nthe spear would be decorations of vines and\nsmall prayers that could be said during an\noffering. A true weapon for a true hunter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Myumierir'sul.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Set of Calming Tea Blends", "The container would hold a collection of teas\nmeant to calm and clear the mind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Readicti.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Beef Stew", "A Tasty Beef Stew made from Steak, Potatoes,\nCarrots, Leeks, Garlic, and Lemon. The Stew\nwould be Served in a Warm Stock, providing\nthose who would Eat it Burst of Flavor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Flavortown.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Wooden Club", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by SirVictim.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Thunder", "", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pouch of Rattlesnake Fangs", "A small leather pouch containing a dozen\ncleaned and discarded fangs from a\nrattlesnake, each one measuring an inch long.\nSnakes will lose and regrow their teeth\nnearly as often as they shed, and it’s\nentirely possible all these fangs came from\nthe same snake. These fangs are hollow inside\nand exceptionally sharp, much like a\nhypodermic needle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Old Rattlesnake.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Peculiar sample", "Within this vial is a peculiar sample of some\nsanguine growth, it squirms and writhes amok,\ndesperately try to escape.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Sable Parasite Portions", "Two halves of a black and lime hued insect.\nIts minuscle, lean limbs coil and curve\nbeneath its lifeless, firm body. It had been\npried in half right down its center, the\nwound protuding a form of thick slime. At its\nsides, a variety of seared nubs span out.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreamer's Dust", "A fine dissolving white powder that emitted a\ndruidic energy from it. Within the vial\ncontained the crunched upon herbs of\nGrefloots, Night Sap, Zawabate. The Grefloots\ncausing some confusion within the mind as the\nZawabate caused hallucinations and pain\nnumbing. Yet as the experiences roll through,\nso does the sense of tiredness. The sense\ngrows stronger by the minute, causing the\nvictim to either become extremely sluggish or\nto become incapacitated.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Slayology.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Diluted Rattlesnake Venom", "Venom milked from an Eastern Diamondback\nRattlesnake that has been diluted with water.\nIn this state it's not nearly as potent as it\ncould be, and at best will inflict\nlightheadedness and weakness. Will not\nfunction if ingested, must enter the\nbloodstream to take effect; such as when used\nto coat a sword or arrow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Old Rattlesnake.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Slime!", "A thin, clear vial filled with a thick,\ngelatinous substance. The slime itself seems\nto possess a few morsels of a sable shell\nwithin its collection. The slime gurgles and\nbubbles during the presence of a full moon!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Philter of the Crone", "This potion, when imbibed, makes the drinker\nVERY LOUD for a few hours.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonflame Dagger", "Vibrant hues of red shone off of the steel\nthat formed the small blade, a result of some\nwidely unknown procedure, drakesmithing. The\ndagger possessed no crossguard. Stabs and\nwounds in general endow a slightly greater\namount of pain to whoever it befell, a weak\npoison somehow imbued upon the metal itself.\nA stamp is pressed into the leather grip,\nreading 'Rhy'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("De Castro Ring", "A simple but elegant ring that looked as if\nit was passed down from generation to\ngeneration. The sigil pressed to the ring\nwould be of the de Castro family, and around\nthe band would be faint and simple line\ndesigns.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Susanne de Castro.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cast Bronze Cudgel", "A blunt weapon consisting of a bronze\ncylinder at the end of a oakwood haft. The\nhead of the cudgel is cylinder shaped, and\nhas been well shined, making it quite\nlustrous under light. The head of the cudgle\nbears various vertical lines etched into it.\nthe head of the cudgel is 7 inches long,\nwhislt the haft of the cudgel is roughly 2\nfeet long. The cudgel head is technically a\ntube, seemingly having been rivetted on, and\naround the haft. The wood the haft is made\nfrom is oakwood, treated with olive oil and\nlinseed oil, giving it a smooth, glossy\nfinish.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Flail of Brutality", "A flail bearing a three foot long handle,\nwith an equally lengthed chain. The chain\nconcludes with a maliciously spiked metal\nball. Based on the chipped and weathered\nappearance of the handle, it has seen plenty\nof use, with blood crusted in all of those\nhard-to-reach places.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Hard Gorundyr candy", "This is hard candy Only offered here by the\nCandy man himself!", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Soft Gorundyr candy", "This is soft chewy candy Only offered here by\nthe Candy man himself!", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosnian Black Ferrum Dagger", "A Curved Black Ferrum Dagger, crafted in the\nforges of Rosenyr. The Blade itself would be\naround 6 Inches Long, holding a Slight Curve\nin the back. The Handle would be made of\nSpruce Wood, Sanded and Wrapped in Tough\nLeather, providing its holder a Strong Grip.\nThe Blade would be engraved with the marking\nof a Rose, the Symbol of Rosenyr, something\nany Rosnian would recognize.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rosnian Master Smith.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("❄ Thanhium-Powered Foodbox ❄", "A sealed foodbox kept cold by thanhium. Food,\nraw or cooked, fresh or old, is safe to store\nin here and be eaten. May occasionally freeze\nand is often cold.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Flask of Lamp Oil", "A small flask of bronizish clear liquid\nsuitable for use burning in a lamp for light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("<oak bote>", "it is an oak bote with ors\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cristata.", "minecraft:boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Winner Coin", "A coin won at the Adelburg Ball that has a\nbig \"2\" engraved into it, for recieving 2nd\nplace in the talent show!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("slob me knob", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Exfoliator Sponge", "The sponge is made soft enough for gentle\nexfoliation when drenched in water to remove\ndead skin and freshen the body. Great present\nfor a loved one!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Diddyski.", "minecraft:sponge", ""),
        StaticItem("The Glowing Crystal Of Boredom", "Your concept of time will slowly fade out as\nyou stare at the crystal for minutes, hours\nand days. The glowing ball within will\ncontinue to spin around without finding its\nend, the boredom consumed by it will\nabsolutely do nothing in the end.", "minecraft:end_crystal", ""),
        StaticItem("Hickory-wood Flanged Mace", "A bludgeoning weapon of steel, it's shaft was\nmade from Hickory wood which had been roasted\nto give it an ashen display and texture. The\nmace consisted of four flanges which were\nsharpened and hooked downward to the bottom,\nand the very opposite end of the weapon had a\nwrought-iron cap. The weapon weighed\napproximately 4 pounds, and was 3 feet in\nlength. The wood was treated with a sweetened\nTung oil to bring out the Hickory woods\nnatural aroma. Branded upon the very bottom\nof the iron cap was, Տ. Leather was\ndelicately woven around the middle-shaft to\nallow easier handling of the weapon. [[Ｔｈｉｓ\nｗｅａｐｏｎ ｉｓ ｍｅａｎｔ ｆｏｒ ｂｌｕｄｇｅｏｎｉｎｇ, ｔｈｅｒｅｆｏｒｅ\nｈｉｇｈｌｙ ｅｆｆｅｃｔｉｖｅ ａｇａｉｎｓｔ ａｒｍｏｒｅｄ ｆｏｅｓ.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mastersmith] Sali.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Astalda", "A bow crafted from one of the trees of Caras\nEldar, enlayed with golden designs of an\neagle , a tree with s in its trunk and the\nstring made of rope soaked in starch to\nstengthen it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Praetor] Arwenia Silma.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Bodkin Point Arrow", "A footed arrow, with a aurum arrowhead. The\narrowhead is a bodkin point arrow, and is\nshaving sharp on both edges. The arrowhead\nhas been coldforged, as to strengthen it. The\narrow is footed, with the upper, harder part\nof the arrow being maple wood, and the lower,\nsofter part being made of hemlock wood. the\narrow is stabilized with 2 hawk feathers,\nmaking an 'x' on the back of the arrow. The\naurum the arrowhead is made from has been\nshined painstakingly, making it quite\nlustrous under light, and it is reflective to\nthe point one can see one's own, blurry and\nwarped reflection on the side of the\narrowhead.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Wayfaring Stave", "A walking staff crafted from simple Oak, fit\nfor a human. It seems to be just the right\nheight, just the right weight, for traveling\nlong, or difficult, distances.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Amaethon's Skull Crown", "A crown made of bone for the winner of the\nWinter Solstice Festival archery tournament.\nIt's skillfully crafted, with long\nantler-like pieces coming from either side of\nthe crown. An emerald sits in the middle of\nthe front, shining brightly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by wryssa.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Bush", "A cluster of roses with their thorns removed,\nstems chopped, flaws trimmed. They remain in\na crimson silk in a large arrangemnt; to\nwhere it can be assumed an entire bush was\nremoved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hillith Athna.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("¶ － Ｗｅｉｇｈｔ-Ｌｉｆｔｉｎｇ Ｓｔｅｅｌ ＇Ｂｉｒｄ＇ Ｃａｇｅ", "This steel 'bird' cage is composed of loose\ntwisted bars which measure 6cm in diameter\nand run 2m long, 13cm between each bar. The\nbase of the cage is 1m in diameter and 8cm\nthick. A 22cm high dome of the same metal\nbars, topped by an anchor for chain sits at\nthe top. Six bars make up the 2m high locked\ndoor. [2.13m tall, 47.6kg, 1m wide - maximum\nhanging carry capacity of 135kg, bends and\nbreaks past this.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fëanor Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:iron_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Whitewash Orc Tusk", "A tusk removed by dishonorable whitewashes\nthat strayed away from Krug's Herd.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Engagement Band", "An engagement ring made of well crafted\nmetals, holding many ornate carvings across\nits surface. A singular, well sized golden\ngem would rest upon it. The ring itself is\nblessed with Clerical magic, causing pain to\nthose tainted beings it touches.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Metallic Orchid", "A metal flower, smithed very carefully to\nlook akin to an Orchid. Dark Ferrum makes up\nthe stem, while thinly hammer bluesteel makes\nup the petals. A small hook is included, so\nit may be used as a cloak, or shirt pin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arik Vanir-Iyliar.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Siol'sil", "A longsword of elven make, forged from slayer\nsteel and always sharpened. Its pommel bore\nthe mark of Silma, a great golden oak tree\nreaching out with its branches, while the\nblade itself carried the phrase, \"Sil’saneyr\nito tuva nae ayilu\" along it on both sides,\netched into the metal.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("⚘－Ｍｅｍｏｒｉａｌ Ｂｏｕｑｕｅｔ－⚘", "Polished tin flowers replicate the appearance\nof azalea flowers in full bloom. Along the\nouter perimeter of the hardened, white clay\nvessel were 2 vertical slots no more than 1\ncentimeter thick, suitable for incense. Near\nthe base of the vase the following was\nengraved: \"Ａｓ ｆｌｏｗｅｒｓ ｗｉｌｔ， ｔｈｉｓ ｌｏｖｅ ｓｈａｌｌ\nｎｏｔ ｔａｒｎｉｓｈ． -Sun's Smile, 1700\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fëanor Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos Feathered Pin", "This pin is in the shape of the sigil of\nCernunnos , father of the hunt. It made of\niron and finely decorated with red dyes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Serving platter", "", "minecraft:heavy_weighted_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("Led Zeppelin IV", "Some say upon listening their ears fell\npregnant.", "minecraft:record_mellohi", ""),
        StaticItem("Spool of Bronze Wire", "A small spool of bronze wiring, fully\nunspooled the wire would be roughly 24 feet\nlong. The bronze wire is somewhat thicker\nthan standard, and takes notable effort to\nbend. The wire has been sanded, and is\nsomewhat shiny. The bronze wire is not too\nsignificant that it is difficult to cut or\nbend apart with pliers. This seems well\nsuitable for being used to fasten, or wrap\naround something, though it is too thick to\nbe used for chainmail.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blonde Blossom", "By far one of the nicest looking types of\nflora to be found in the realms. It's a\nsmall, yellow petaled flower, occasionally\nfeaturing a white to yellow gradient. The\nBlossom has been found in large numbers in\nall realms, making it one of the most common\nflora ever encountered.", "minecraft:dandelion", ""),
        StaticItem("Buttered Biscuits", "Soft and flaky biscuits with a generous\nheaping of butter!", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Red and Green Plaid Kilt", "A kilt artfully crafted by some fine tailor's\nhands. Its patterning was a green and red\nplaid on top of a warm wool material.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Leyne.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Woodworking Tools", "A set of woodworking tools! It contains quite\nliterally every item imaginable to carve,\ncut, and generally shape, as well as treat\nwood. All in a rather large satchel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Curved Dagger", "A small but sturdy silver dagger that has a\nmediocre engraved design along the blade. The\ninitials K and A are coarsely dug into the\nhandle.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl ring", "An elegant pearl ring, though instead of a\nwhite pearl this one was dark, the band was\nmade of pure silver!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonflame Broadsword", "A relatively large armament compared to its\nsmaller cousins such as long swords. Whilst\nnot as massive as a Zweihander one would have\nto use two hands to utilize the weaponry. A\ncertain sturdiness was felt within the metal\nitself, hardly ever would it chip or dull,\nalways carrying a pristine outlook no matter\nthe wear. Faint icy vapors resonate around\nthe blade, chilled to one's touch. A small\nstamp is pressed onto the leather grip,\nsimply reading 'Rhy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~Malin Longsword~", "A Steel Longsword , with golden etching of\nvines along its center. The Hilt made of\nCherry wood , with golden vines wrapping\naround to an Elk Shaped pommel.The blade\nlength around 90cm.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arwenia Kaeronin.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand-carved Statue", "A hand carved statue from oak wood, standing\nat about 8 inches tall. Greatly detailed, it\nwould depict two mali, a woman and child. The\nboy would be in a crouched position, his\nhands claspsed together. If one looked\ncarefully, they could see a tiny frog held in\nhis hands. Pride and happiness on his face,\nhe looked towards the woman. She in turn\nwould be seen laughing, mirth and joy clear\nin her expression. It would perfectly capture\nthe first meeting of Elora and Damien, and\ntheir adventure.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MiaKestrel.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("The Remains of Thyme..", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Shield", "A small shield, the perfect size for a child.\nIt would be finely carved on the front, the\nimage of a tree clear and proud. Delicate\nthough the wood work was, the shield itself\nwas sturdy. It was made to be used. Two soft\nlether straps were attached to the back, to\nhold it on the arm.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Worn Pirate's Hat", "A leather pirate's hat. The leather would be\nthin in some areas, worn from time and usage.\nA few areas are sunbleached yet the hat's\npurpose to keep sun and rain from your brow\nis still possible. A feather seems stuck\nwithin the hat, remaining in place no matter\nhow strong a breeze may be. The smell of salt\nwater seems forever trapped within the hat.\nAh, the life of a pirate.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("A Cowboy Cat", "A beautifully sculpted feline seated on it's\nhind legs wearing a strange wide brimmed hat\nwith slightly upwardly turned edges\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SeventhCircle.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Hide", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bow of Narn'wynn", "A large longbow of about 5 feet in length\nwith purple and white marks painted along the\nwood. It has many arcane symbols carved into\nit as well, perhaps giving clue to its\npurpose. A sentence written in common is near\nthe handle of the bow, \"Forgive those who\nwish it and those who don't, let none die\nunforgiven.\" If one were to use the bow they\nwould notice it is extremely hard to pull\nback, the strength of an orc or close needed,\nas metal is used for its construction.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GotXanned.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Estel'leh Haler", "A delicate chain holds a simple ring of\nglimmering Aurum. When up close one would\nnotice elegant writing etched into the\npolished surface of the jewelery. It reads\nIl'estel, lin'ir.\" in Elven. A promise ring,\nperhaps.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Freyja.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("The Weeping Staff of Umbrage", "A gnarled staff crafted from a dark oak\nsappling. At the top, a small black gem emits\na dull grey glimmer that allows a faint hue\nto luminate in gentle thrums from the\ncrystal. As one grips the staff, a sickly\nfeeling of dread and dispair would overtake\nthe feelings of the being who held the vile\ncreation. Flakes of Amber mixed with wisps of\nnecrotic taint would swirl about the shaft of\nthe stave and gently begin to pull away the\nlifeforce of the handler.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Leolin's Poppy", "A wonderful blooming flower of crimson.\nLeolin loves you.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll of Manifest Javelin", "A condensed scroll with a red seal clumping\nit onto whatever attached. When a certain\nphrase is spoken the script itself\nilluminates, parchment burning away as a\ncobalt-hued javelin is gradually manifested\nfor the bearer's use. ((2-3 emotes, contact\nSkylez1 for more info)).", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lance of Man", "Arcane I\nA 11'5\" long lance with a sharpened ferrum\ntip that allows an erruption of arcane energy\nto emit from the top, coating the alloy with\na gleaming radiance. The length of the lance\nwould have many intricate carvings that tell\nthe pictorial illustration of the creation of\nthe four races of the creator.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackberry Wine", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayersteel Broadsword", "A finely forged slayer-steel broadsword. It\nwould be shorter than most, only about 30\ninches in length. Highly polished, the edges\nwould be oddly round and blunted, so as not\nto inflict any cuts. They would be able to be\nsharpened into a cutting edge however.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Woven Reed Basket", "A woven basket, roughly the size of a dwed's\nhead. The design of it would be round, made\nfrom a plain weave, and tightly packed. Flat\nreeds were used for both spokes and the\nwalls. Thread would be used on the last part\nof the rim reed, holding it in place and\npreventing it from unraveling. This basket\nwould be useful for holding tools, household\nitems, or food.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Pale Orange Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Demetriou Family Sword", "An old, yet refurbished longsword, clocking\nin at a few feet long. The leather that was\nbound on the hilt was rubbed almost all the\nway down, creating perfect notches for\nfingers. Along the base of the blade, the\nfaded words of Demetriou in elegant letters\nwould have been engraved, assumingly this\nbeing the Demetriou family sword. It's\nmagnificence had long died out, although it's\nusefulness in a battle surely has not faded\nby one ounce!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kacper Silma.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Estel", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Pura", "A small platinum ring, it’s beauty immense\nfor it be thriving in emeralds, rubies and\ndiamonds. Flustering all over the base, a\nlarge diamond of about 600 Carat lay perched\nfirmling in the middle, shining and its\ncutting so beautiful it was blinding.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dead Rabbit", "", "minecraft:gravel", ""),
        StaticItem("✺✮✫✩✪ Ｌｅｙｎｅ＇ｓ Ｂｒｏｎｚｅ Ｓｐｅａｒ ✪✩✫✮✺", "A 6 foot long spear made of oakwood and\nbronze. The oakwood the haft of the spear is\nmade from has been treated with linseed oil.\nThe bronze the head of the spear is made from\nhas been shined extensively, giving it a\nmirror finish, allowing one to see their own,\nalbeit bronze shaded, reflection in the\nmetal. The haft of the spear is 5 and a half\nfeet long, whilst the spear head is 6 inches\nlong, bringing the total length of the spear\nto 6 feet long. The spear head has been honed\nto being shaving sharp. The spear weighs 2\npounds. The spearhead is of a simple broad\ndesign, the haft fitting into a socket cast\ninto the spearhead, which is attached to the\nhaft with pitch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Flameborne Steel-Tipped Javelin", "This javelin measures eighty inches from\npoint to end. The shaft of the weapon is\ncomposed of polished spruce and possesses a\nsubtle tapering to ease precise throws. The\ntip of the weapon is steel with a curious\nblue tint. \"Leyne\" is inscribed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fëanor Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Demon trophy", "A simple stone brick, words being carved into\nthe side of it. \"Battle for the Druidic\nOrder\". It would be decorated with various\nform of demons and elves fighting an endless\nwave of undead. Then a wonk being displayed\non the other side, slain by the all mighty\nAewion the Great.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Abelai Silma", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Lysi Silma", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Darkblade", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by ACU20.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~Ironwood Sword~", "Ironwood sword,the blade engraved with\nvarious trees ,vines and two elks and the\nwords \"Melme\" meaning love and \"Aira\" meaning\neternal engraved near the hilt, with the\nrounded pommel marked with 'A+A'.The wood has\nbeen dyed red and orange.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Lady Imperator] Arwenia.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Woolen Prop Blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ensis", "An estoc, a sword with a thin yet sturdy\nedgeless blade that had a rather sharp point,\nwith a blade wrought from darkened steel. On\neither side of the sword's quillions would be\na ring-guard wrought from the same material\nas the blade. The blade was at least forty\ntwo inches in length, with swirling patterns\netched onto the blade's surface giving it a\nrather ornate appearance.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Riftblade.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("¡A Ghast's Blight!", "An all purpose machete that’s 16 inches in\nlength and a tenth of an inch thick. It is\naccompanied by a dark leather scabbard. The\nblade is tempered to maximum toughness,\nmaking the blade a lot more durable. It’s\neasy to sharpen but due to how the blade is\nmade, it will need to be sharpened\nfrequently. The machete’s hilt is made of\ndark oak with matching leather covering to\nthe scabbard. Embedded into the hilt is a\nsilver engraving of stag antlers. On the\nheavy spine area of the blade by the hilt is\nthe engraving ‘Cali’.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caliban.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Short Sword", "This smaller blade is made of a fine craft,\nperfect for a young master of the arts of\nsword fighting to start out with.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Holding baby] Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Short-Spear", "This spear has a total length of 3 feet, the\nhaft makes up two thirds of this and is made\nof elmwood treated with linseed oil. The\nspearhead is broad and made of ferrum,\npossessing a length in total to 1 foot. Tied\noff with leather cord between the blade and\nthe haft is a set of feathers, and beads of\nvarying colour.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Leyne.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Skinning Knife", "A simple steel knife, its shape designed for\nskinning its blade possesses a soft lustre\nupon the grey metal. Its handle would be made\nof carefully carved dark oak with an\nengraving done in aurum. The elegant text\nwould spell out, 'Leyne'.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Slimed Coated Plush Teddy Bear", "A pale, discoloured teddy bear that was once\ncoated with a thick layer of sludge. It bears\na thinly tied crimson ribbon around its neck\nand a faded pink dress similar to that of its\nprevious owner. It bears an overall gloomy\nessence.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("the Big Gay", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Dick Reiter", "A Large Bezerker Axe, belonging to the finest\nof Dick Riders. Beware of such an axe, for\nthe strong Oracle defeated the Dick Rider who\nused it\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Glistering Bow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Lawn Statue", "A statue covered in moss, it used to decorate\nlawns and yards.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Grey Sprite] Muu.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
