        StaticItem("Sapphire Circlet", "A small, steel circlet woven together like\nwires, with a shiny blue gem. The steel would\nfeel smooth, and delicately made, as the blue\nsapphire in the center would be shiny and\nexquisite. When light strikes the sapphire, a\nlight ocean-blue hue is softly radiated from\nthe gem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
