        StaticItem("Event Token", "Use this to redeem for an event item after\nthe event.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Yrodholm Diary 6", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Arcanist's Blade", "A finely made Arcanist's blade, consisting of\na Magegold hilt with a diamond managem. The\nblade was light blue and transluscent, and\ngave off a light glow. It would be about as\nstrong as steel, but the weight would lay\nentirely in the handle. The enchantement\nwould require recharging every Elven Week.\n(PM FlemishSupremacy for more information.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elennanore.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Nordengradic Longbow", "A well made but simple long bow wrought from\na handsome length of yew. Elaborate carvings\nof elk, rabbits and bears would line the\nlength of the bow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Narthok.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Statuette of Donald Dabber", "A small, golden plated satue of Donald\nDabber. Its physique appeared chiseled, and\nthe curves of its hardened abs reflected the\nbright shine of light. Above his charismatic\ngrin, two emeralds were embedded where eyes\nwould be. A note is attached to this,\nreading: 'Whoever brings this back to the\nPriorist Party Chairman may ask for one\npolitical favor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:totem_of_undying", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Scale Armor", "Crafted from the natural scales of the fierce\ncockatrice, it offers the same protection as\ntraditional plate, without the burdens of its\nweight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolatey Armour", "Magicked and forged from Candyland, this chocolate\narmour piece is sturdier than it looks.\n*Moderator Approved*\ndagothagahnim approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("The Misfortune Boots of Failure", "The wearer will always\nstumble around, sometimes\neven fall!\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Rock", "A segment of solid magma.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Orithur's Ashes", "The ashes of the Founder of the Library Of\nDragur\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Pearl", "A large fist sized pearl that gleams a proud\nsilver tint. If held into direct sunlight, it\nwould emit a soft rainbow reflection in a\nsmall radius around the holder. Probably\nworth a hefty sum of minas due to its size!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Moleman Skull", "The skull of a Moleman, cracks could be seen\nrunning down the top. Its small in size,\nsimilar to a ball.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:skeleton_skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wild Man Portrait", "This oil painting, created from a rough,\nearth tone base, depicts an amazingly hairy\nman. He'd be neatly smiling, his hands folded\nas he sits in front of a fireplace, atop a\nleather couch. . . Though, the painting\nemmitted a rather eerie aura.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Lonely Winter", "A brilliant diamond necklace weaved with a\nstrong frosty spell. Upon activation of the\nenchantment the wearer is encased in a\nstrong, sturdy magical ice barrier for a few\nminutes. After which the wearer will be quite\nchilly! The initial 'C' is engraved on the back.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Abyssal Catalyst", "A wretched shard of black stone no\nmore darker than volcanic glass. It brings\nthose that carry it an unending\nsense of discomfort.\n*Moderator Approved*\nmerrymoogle approved this item.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Tance's Axe", "This axe screams with glee as it\ncuts down trees.\n*Moderator Approved*\nFrottimer approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Crystal Of Eternal Madness", "The stone never shuts up; it continues\nto talk and talk random stuff and Facts.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Helm Of The Pumpkin Lord", "A wretched smiling mask, pulsating with a strong energy.\n[[DO NOT PLACE DOWN.]]\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:carved_pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Harbinger's Boots", "The heavy boots are a Thanhic alloy, worn by\nthe dreaded Harbingers of Setherien from the\nrealm of Anthos. This pair belonged to\nHarbinger Orithur, and are so cold to the\ntouch that even water freezes beneath their\nstep.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Forest", "The gems glimmer faintly with green light,\nbut otherwise seem completely ordinary.\n*Moderator Approved*\ndagothagahnim approved this item.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Order Arrow", "An arrow used by the Vaeyl Order, a militant\ngroup of sentient specters who were native to\nAtlas. The arrows are shot by mystic flying\narchers and cause a man to slow like\nmolasses.", "minecraft:tipped_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Tooth Necklace", "A large tooth from an ancient beast.\nThis necklace appears to have been strung ages ago.\nMany Kharajyr hunters have possessed this piece of history.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("The Titanic", "This beautiful boat once guided Bastien and\nGregory across the ocean. Together, with\nGregory behind Bastien briefly had a moment\nof humanity as he whispered \\\"Greg, I'm\nflying.\\\"Before forever returning to his dull,\ngolem status.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:dark_oak_boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengulforged Brightsteel Helmet", "*Moderator Approved*\nConspiracyOps approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengulforged Brightsteel Chestplate", "*Moderator Approved*\nConspiracyOps approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_43(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Aengulforged Brightsteel Leggings", "*Moderator Approved*\nConspiracyOps approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengulforged Brightsteel Boots", "*Moderator Approved*\nConspiracyOps approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Flames of Festive Wroth", "This sword burns with the passion of a thousand festive children.\nWith the solemn purpose of bringing down all that ruin the cheer.\nGifted to the one who is entrusted to chosen one!\n*Moderator Approved*\nMittoTheSavage approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Harvester Sickle", "An ornately engraved sickle made of brightsteel. The runes emanate a Holy\naura and glow a faint red. Ever brighter with every soul it is fed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Stone Titan Skin", "A sizable chunk of stone, taken from the\ngiant Stone Titan after it's death. The stone\nwould appear to be from the exterior skin of\nthe Titan.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("[R] The Ass Irons", "A pair of handcuffs that prevent the wearer from speaking.\nAny noises they make sounds like a donkey speaking.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:gray_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Mermaid's Scales", "The scales from a mermaid's lower fins. They\nglisten in the sun, but when placed inwater\nthey become translucent. While not extremely\nhardy, they'd make for a great jewerly piece.\nOr allow for one to make armor that moves\nswiftly in water.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("A rather unregular skull.", "It looks like a regular female. Except for\nthe dull eyes & sharp teeth.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:skeleton_skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Canonist Bible", "A golden canonist cross is painted onto the\nfront cover of the thick leather book. The\npages are a ivory white, and in perfect\ncondition. Upon the many pages of the book\nare canonist scrawlings. The book is sealed\nwith a heavy iron clasp, that requires a key\nto open.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Prairie Dulk Hide", "The rough, thick and hairy hide of a Prairie\nDulk.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bastien's Eye", "The enchanted eye of a golem, belonging to\nBastien. Somehow, it is no longer attached to\nhis face.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Skeleton", "The nearly-intact skeleton of a rabbit that\nwas eaten and processed by a harpy. Gross!", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Hippogryff Egg", "A dormant egg.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:end_stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lefkos' Flamboyant Boots", "These flamboyant boots would be bright red, made of some of the finest leather known to\nman. The flamboyant boots would hold equally flamboyant laces to string up the shoe, the\nlaces would seem to be made from a high-quality material. The boots would also seem to\nbe soft to the touch, such a flamboyant texture presenting itself. Along the sides of\nthe boots there would be the word 'Flamboyant' written in a highly flamboyant font. The\nwearer of these boots would clearly be extremely flamboyant himself as he'd stride\naround in them.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Vile of Meteor Liquid", "A liquid extracted from a meteor that crashed\ndown in Vailor. It looks like a galaxy inside\nof a bottle.. It seems to behave differently\nunder different temperatures.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Halcyon, Blade of the Grey", "A purple-hued steel shortsword, emitting an\never-present dull glow. It is adorned with\netchings of a landscape scene; trees, rivers,\nhills and mountains with a singular lightning\nbolt play across the broad sides of the\nblade. A single wreath of flowers encircles\nthe blade just above a large emerald that\nglows with a green radiance which is embedded\nin the crossguard. The hilt is made of ivory,\na dragon carved into the pommel and the\nhandle being wrapped in a light brown\nleather. ((PM Cablam))\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mangled Brood Mother Appendage", "Nearing the height of a wooden doorframe,\nthis crude appendage appears to be construed\nout of a thick carapace, ebon and sleek as\nwell sharp.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Fireproof Vest", "Made from the wool of a demon sheep.\nIt doesn't burn, but it only covers the\ntorso. The arms, legs and head are exposed.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Wand", "This carved length of wood has ivy etchings\ncurling around the top section. The handle is\nsmooth and plain.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ermine Vest", "A pure white vest made of ermine with fine\nround buttons made of dark blue spinel. Who\nknew weasel could be this luxurious?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Skippy Ironguts' Heart", "A well-preserved large red heart, believed to\nbe from Skippy Irongut, Grand King of the\nDwarves during Vailor. Rumor has it that the\nheart was removed by his Dark Elf assassin\nand stored in a lead box. The holder inherits\nclogged arteries.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Skippy Irongut.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Hug", "It feels like kittens.\n*Moderator Approved*\nKowaman approved this item.", "minecraft:pink_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottled Arachnid Acid", "Within your grasp is a tempered vial, thin\ncracks sprout among the glass - a thick green\nsubstance therein of Arachnid nature,\ncorrosive.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:slime_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Odd Locket", "You see a small girl standing beside her\nmother within. (This item begins an event!)\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kodokunaa.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A strange clasp", "", "minecraft:emerald_block", ""),
        StaticItem("A Dog Collar", "A leather collar with a simple clasp in the\nback, mild gilding coating the entirety of\nthe object. In place of a tag, a ruby hangs\nin a silver, cage-like fitting. If one wraps\ntheir hand around the gemstone and says the\nname 'Kairn', a fog would begin to fill out a\nnearby open area, taking the shape of and\neventually becoming a golden retriever over a\nperiod of five emotes. It would be loyal to\nwhoever 'summoned' it, but disinclined\ntowards violence. It seems happy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LamajVsErioioire.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("thin cotton-weave blanket", "This blanket is small, light- and rather\neasily portable, from one's view it could\neasily cover a small human. Though to some,\nthis could also double off as an impromptu\ncapelet, none the less- whoever took the time\ninto weaving such delicate cotton material\nshowed modest care. The white, similarly\nfluffy like fabric refuses to cling to the\nskin, simply in gentle hold, similarly to a\nhammock. Don't expect this to protect you\nmuch from harsh blizzards, however.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:white_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Mermaid Egg", "Roughly three-feet in diameter, these eggs\nare mucher lighter than they appear to\nbe.They are a bright blue and blend in well\nwith the ocean. However, without their mother\nthey likely won't survive, or develop\nany-further.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:popped_chorus_fruit", ""),
        StaticItem("The Jojo Mojo Rojo Sword", "Swinging the sword will cause it\nto burst into crazy laughter while\nsometimes, weird animal noises will\ncome out of it.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloud Feather", "A very soft feather. It smells fresh and\ncalms the holder down.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Hydra's Smallest Head", "The smallest head of a Hydra. Still huge and\nvery hard to carry.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("The Coin of the Draiochta", "*Moderator Approved*\nIrishPerson approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Dove", "A shimmering slayer-steel bastard sword,\nrunes decorating its double-edged blade. The\ncrossguard of the weapon is neatly curled\nnear the ends, gems laying within the curls.\nThe leather pommel seems to be well crafted\nand barely worn.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Greg's Pocketwatch", "The pocket watch would be made of an arcanium\nshell, expertly inscribed with various\npatterns, seemingly runic symbols and the\ninitials ‘GD’. Behind the watchface itself,\nto which perpetually retains the time, there\nwould be a sizeable gem of unknown origin.\nShould the user allow a flow of mana into the\nobject through transfiguration, a sizeable\nward would surround the user within the shape\nof a bubble. ((Wards: Elemental Evocation,\nArcane Shifting, Telekinesis, Translocation,\nSensory Illusion)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gregory.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Pocket Watch", "The small pocket watch is an intricate golden\npiece made by the most skilled of dwarven\nhands. The time is accurate to the second\nwithout need of winding or tuning.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Memory of Summer", "A physical representation of the Grand\nHarvest. This slender branch of an ash tree\nflickers with a flame that radiates a soft\nheat rather than an intense one that might be\nexpected of normal fire. This provides light\neven on the bleakest of days, and the flames\nnever spread to other materials.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Replica Of The Golden Lance", "The ornate lance shimmers in the light,\nadorned with various runic symbols and\nphrases from an unknown language. The replica\nseems to encapture most of the physical\nqualities of the lance, bar the hum of its\npower and the glow of its many powerful\nenchantments. The weapon appears abnormally\nlong even for a lance, and must have required\ngreat strength to wield.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Replica Of The Axe Of Krug", "The double-bladed waraxe appears to be forged\nwith carbarum, giving it a dull blue tint.\nThe sharp edges of the bladed sides seem fine\nenough to cut through solid matieral, as does\na large portruding spike that sits between\nthe bladed sides. The handle of the weapon is\nengraved with various ancient Uruk symbols,\nit too made of Carbarum and melding neatly\ninto the axehead. The weight of the weapon\nseems obscene.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Replica Of The Gorloth Staff", "A gnarled, oak staff bearing a thanic alloy\nthree pronged claw at the top. The wood has\nbeen charred black, with red tinted\ninscriptions riddling its shaft in the\nunknown language of dragons. The original\nstaff was forged by the fallen Orithur during\nhis servitude under the Drakaar Setherien,\nand was said to be able to violently tear\ncontrol of Golems away from their impera, and\nunto the staff wielder.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Black Book", "The book bears a thick, black leather cover,\nand appears to be covered in chains. A note\nis pinned beneath its title, reading: \\\"If you\nvalue your life, you will not read on.\\\" There\nis a heavy lock on the book, a small key\nalready inside it.\nSignature: The Fallen Monk", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Effect of Funnelling Deity Powers", "The following is a liturgy bound by text,\nscribed by the infamous Gudour, the Drake\nself-proclaimed as the Herald of Man. Betwixt\nthe decrepit pages of a leather-bound book\nand scripted into the ancient tome would be a\nmixture of the eldritch tongue of Flexio and\nthat of Man. Its spine cast iron to protect\nit against the annals of time, the book\nappears to have lasted many centuries without\na scratch.\nSignature: Gudour", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Necronomicon", "The tome's cover is a putrid blend of metal\nand purple flesh-like material, a large\ntoothed demonic head juts out from the centre\nof the front cover, its eyes constantly\nmoving, mouth opening and closing. The tome\nhas been tightly chained up, you are unable\nto open it without its key.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Planar Dictate", "A thick, heavy tome with a swirling vortex\nupon its front cover. The tome is rough to\nthe touch and appears to be very old. While\nit may have once brimmed with energy, it now\nrests dormant. The pages inside are filled\nwith unusual circular diagrams, you can't\nmake any sense of it.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Team", ".", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Team", ".", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem Encrusted Battle-Axe.", "A double headed, peculairly light battle axe\nwith a large ruby resting between its two\nheads. It'd have a series of odd carvings\nrunning along either side of the metalic\nheads - Should a certain command be uttered,\nthese carvings would light up a bright\nyellow, before the axehead would begin to\nspew electricity in all directions.. More\nthen likely enough to paralize a human\nsoldier on contact with their metalic armor\nor flesh.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupted Olog Head", "The nasty, decaying head of an obese,\ncorrupted Olog. Its smell is quite putrid.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclops Toe", "The Big Toe of a Cyclops. Seen as lucky in\nSome Cultures, The Toe of a Cyclops would be\nabount Six Inches Long. Lucky or Not, it is\nquite the Trophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("[B] Galeam", "A stirling helmet as hard as\nCarbarum yet translucent like glass.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDohvi approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Toad Lord Eggs", "These eggs are the spawns of the toad lord.\nHis brood of unhatched slime eggs are now\ndormant from the conflict that came to the\nacquisition of them. At times a tadpole can\nbe seen floating around in the suspention\nliquid inside the egg sac.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by The Toad Lord.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Rose", "A beautiful Rose! If you sniffed it, then you\nwould probably be inclined to smile it\nsmelled so gosh darn good. The perfect gift\nfor a lover!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GloriaPreussens.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Idol of The Forbidden", "Accursed I\nA disturbing looking doll figure retrieved from\nan ancient ruin. Its face is cracked, its figures\nworn with age, although it seems to emulate a\nfigure of malevolence.\n[PM HeeroZero or Daelaris to interact]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Bokolo Staff", "A staff made out of a burned and fragile\nbranch with the skull of a Bokolo bird melded\ninto the tip, the skull forming the head of\nthe staff.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Essence Reaper", "An aurum sickle that seems to have been forged\nrecently, cursed with a twisted dark magic. The\nsickle causes the aura of any pierced by it to\ndarken for a prolonged period of time. It also makes\nthose pierced feel gloomy and depressed for the\ncoming days, only to recover as the wound heals.\nThe gypsies claim it was once wielded by a necromantic\nlord who shepherded the dead with an iron fist.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dog Plushie", "A lovely stuffed dog toy perfect to cuddle\nand play with also a faithful compainion who\nwill guard its owner in their sleep.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DrususTheDumb.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Soulsong Music Box", "A small box made of spruce wood and silver.\nThe outside shell is engraved with the\nvarious cycles of the moon and a depiction of\nthe Archaengul shepherding the deceased. When\nin the presence of moonlight, and when\ncranked three times, the box will open and\ndisplay a silver dancer twirling in circles\nto the ethereal music of the Soulstream. To\nthe pious and kind the music seems sad and\nmelancholy, but to corrupted souls the music\nis intensely disturbing and uncomfortable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Desires's Desire", "A fragile pendant cut from a shimmering white stone.\nA symbol of Druidic-like dialect is carved across the\nfront of the pendant and suspended by a thick and\nrather itchy weave of yarn. When donned the\nwearer would feel an unquenchable desire to\ntend to the fauna of the realm.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wytchlings.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Celestial Harp", "A very well made harp, made with 'catgut\n(not actual cat) strings, its frame made out\nof birch wood, with intricate designs of the\nconstelations carved into its pillar and a\nsmall flat carving of the sun as it's crown,\nwhilst the legs bear the carvings of two\ncrescent moons. Even the soundbox, and\nsoundboard of the harp seem to bear carvings\nof constelations and stars.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Lolita's Moderator Request Addiction Quill", "The quill is barely existant after apparent extreme\noveruse, the tip completely demolished as the\nfeather hangs limp, giving the overfall feeling of\nexhaustion. At least you did so many modreqs!\n*Moderator Approved*\n501warhead approved this item.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos' Resolve", "A pendant made of vivid green emerald and\nshaped into the likeness of a stag, complete\nwith protruding antlers that curve\nmajestically above it. The jewel hangs from a\nsimple cord to be worn around the neck or\nwrist. Should one clasp the pendant tight, a\na faint sense of warmth floods them\ntemporarily.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Ancients", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. Scratches, dents and a\nmisshapen form indicates it has been through\ntime. [PM Murlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Enchanters Delight", "The present pertains a neat bow and a gilded outline,\nits contents brimming with chocolate ranging from milk to dark.\nThe chocolates themselves are a variety of shapes albeit would be\nmainly hearts; upon closing, and opening the lid, the contents would\nbe refilled. The box itself, glimmering the a darkened hue of violet.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghoul Teeth", "The upper 16 teeth, belonging to the ghoul\nShamblebones after he was brutally killed in\nthe streets of Sutica.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LumberjackMack.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sting of Skjoldier", "Icy Flows I\nA dagger of sharply carved stone, the blade of which\nis drawn upon with icy blue veins. the veins feed into\nthe hilt, making it cool to the touch. Any who are cut\nby the blade will feel deathly cold, unable to warm\nthemselves until the curse subsides. It is said this\nblade was once guarded by Bran Volsung the water mage.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Nature Stone of Sildur", "The leaf like crystal appears\nto release a calm aura for anyone who wears it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TheWildHunt.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Potent Strychnine Poison", "A vial of lethal poison created from\ndruidic-enhanced strychnine seeds. Even\ninhaling the rather putrid aroma can cause a\nfew issues. If ingested, it will cause\nconvulsions, paralysis, and intense\nasphyxiation.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornweed Dart", "A set of darts crafted from modified\nthornweed. Each thorn is tightly woven in\ndurable behemoth spider silk. This allows\nthese darts to be able to absorb liquids, and\nhave a cushioned tail while also retaining a\nsleek design.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Sword", "An ancient sword used by one of the many\nnative tribes of Vailor. While the blade\nisextremely worn-out, it still can due a lot\nof damage. A thick layer of rust coats the\nhandle, leaving you to believe that it wasn't\ntaken care of very-well.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Diluted Nightglow Poison", "A weakened variant of poison created from the\nnightglow flower. The lightly-coloured liquid\nwould offer faint illumination as well as a\nsweet scent when opened. However, if the\nnightglow poison was ingested it would\nrapidly increase heart rate, cause intense\nnausea, and induce temporary cardiac arrest;\nor severe heart palpitations.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Black Craft Venom", "A vial of faintly-coloured venom. Derived\nfrom the black craft worm, the thin ooze\noffers little to no aroma; and the taste is\nbeyond horrid. When ingested, the venom\nprogressively paralyzes its victim. Through\nsluggish, painful aches the victim eventually\nbecomes completely incapacitated. The effects\nlast upwards of an hour.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Writ of Birth", "This writ here signifies this baby here is\nreally cool.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("_-~Fiya'lukot~-_", "A dreamcatcher comprised of small entagled\ntwigs and bones with bright blue feathers and\na cord to hang it up with. The thing itself\nis no larger then a fist and thusly is\nwearrable around ones neck\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("How to Cook Fox", "A small recipe card of how to prepare Fox\nStew.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Metallic Ring", "A thick steel band with small etchings that\nresemble a series of tiny flowers. Upon its\ninner-center lay a small name; Taeleh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by papikite.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Merriment", "A bountiful bouquet of grand proportions.\nBrimming with vibrantly colored flowers of\nall varieties. White daffodils, tulips, and\njasmines, to the velvet vervain and hues of\nlavender, lilac, and mallow. Arum, amaranth,\nprimrose, honeysuckle, mayflower, there was\nwithout a doubt no shortage of diversity.\nAmidst the verdant assembly, only one bud\nwould remain closed. A single moonflower\nnestled into its center. The strengthed\nbouquet lasting for years on water alone. Its\ncontents replantable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Guyden Aureon.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("The Eagle's Eye", "A beautiful gold necklace that has a lot of\nsmall diamonds embedded, in the medallion you\ncan see a big emerald with a carved eagle, if\nyou open it, you could see a small image of\nTobias Stauton and a note that says : \"He\nwill always watch you\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Guilded Hand Mirror", "An exquisite guilded hand mirror of highly\npolished gold. Its handle engraved with all\nsorts of delicate floral patterns. Truly a\nmirror to be sought after!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Eleciw'evarir", "A wooden staff made of a Flowering Dogwood\nbranch. The top would curve into a U shape,\nthe end of which sharpened to be deadly, and\nwould hold a dreamcatcher within. Several\ngrips would be upon the staff, allowing it to\nbe held in more ways than just a staff way.\nBeads with seeds inside of them would hang,\nrattling as it was walked with. The bottom\nhowever, wouldn’t be normal. There would be\ntwo sharp points, one longer than the other.\nWith enough force, it could cause serious\ndamage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DaHazelWazel.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Two Toned Wedding Band", "A 'two-colour' wedding band, of polished iron\nencircled in gold. Inscribed into the gold\nare the words \"Kae Mayilun. Kae Taliiyna. Kae\nTaynan\" in an beautiful Elvish script. The\niron band in the words \"Thas Nogazen. Thas\nAmoruk. Thas Anym\" are inscribed in Dwarfish\nrunes. Small patterns of leafs would seem to\ndesign the outside band, and the inside of\nthe band would have a small engraving of the\ndate: 'Grand Harvest, 1681\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DaHazelWazel.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Inspiration d'Emeraude", "This is an exceptional and unique ring that\nwill delight any jewelry passionate. The ring\nfeatures an oval emerald mounted horizontally\non a thick, gold band. Over the course of the\nband, there’d be rustic designed carvings\nalong with the forrester dragon. On the inner\nsurface of the band, words would be engraved.\nThose words read, “We rise by lifting\nothers.”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Désirée Travail acharné.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower Bouquet", "A wonderfully arranged bouquet of flowers.\nThey seem to be a mixture of white, pink, and\npurple tulips. It's evident they've been\nhandled with care, as they are in near\nperfect condition. There seems to be a small\npiece of paper wrapped around the stem of one\nof the flowers. Upon unfolding it, it would\nread \"For Elenora, World's Best Mom. ♡\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Blueberry Canoli With Lemon Zest Icing", "A delectable custard wrapped in a hard,\nsugary exterior crust. Despite its difficulty to\neat, the flavor is infinitely rewarding.\nFood: 9\nSaturation: 8.0\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrLollytime.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Dulce de Calabaza", "These delicious treats are made by first\ncutting, peeling, and deseeding a pumpkin\nbefore chopping it up into small pieces to\nboil. Brown sugar is then stirred in to water\nwith a mix of cinnamon, poured over the\npumpkin pieces, then boiled again. For at\nleast a quarter of a day after that the\ncovered pieces soak up the syrup. They are\nthen boiled one final time before being\nallowed to dry out for at least half a day.\nTo finish it off, they are sprinkled with\nsugar!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Khroven", "As the haft of this Battle-axe rests in your\nhands, one would notice a multitude of\nassorted details. The head of the three foot\nlong weapon appeared to be formed out of a\nform of bone, that of a wyverns femur. The\nblade, gilded with basic ferrum, would be\nsharpened to a fine edge, and the haft itself\nseems to be derived of elder wood, no doubt\nsturdier than any other wood. Each side of\nthe head would hold a different name. One\nside Elenora. The other side Vosirk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hareven Lorenthus.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Herblored Javens", "A bag of several large sand-spurs, green with\nyellow stripes. If ingested, they'd bring\nrapid, dreamless sleep for around eight\nhours. There would be absolutely no harm to\nany fetuses inside of pregnant women.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of 25yr. Herendulian Whisky", "This bottle of whiksy would be covered in\ndust, and if opened, would have a peaty\nalmost earthy smell to it. This aged whisky\nis almost unheard of in the land of Axios\nanymore.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Alluring Sword", "What was once stuck in the depth of a stone\nprison, tugged free is an alluring weapon of\nstained metal, ornated lightly so it is not\nfeeble - but precious in appearance that it\nmight seem so.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Gorilla Tibia", "A large tibia that originated from an even\nlarger gorilla! The bone is quite heavy and\ndense from supporting so much weight! This\ncan be a wonderous trophy, or perhaps you can\nuse it to craft something! The leg bones\nconnected to the.....\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("☆✿☆ Wispal Companion ☆✿☆", "A somewhat large, glowing rotund blue\nrabbit-like creature. The creature is quite\nround, with a small, low to the ground face.\nIt bears 2 black eyes, a small button nose\nand a split mouth, similar to a rabbit. It\nbears 4 small legs, with 4 small toes on each\npaw. The creature's back is 2 feet tall,\nwhilst the creature itself is only about 3\nfeet long. Due to the creature's short legs,\nit does not walk, or 'hop' high off the\nground. It is herbivorous, and eats plants.\n[Contact Auric_Saint]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Suxal's skin", "Arcane X\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Narvak Thoth Kavir", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Acid", "The amber fluid coating the amber wolves, it\nis said that it is the acid, and not the fur\nthat gives the beast its distinctive colour.\nIt glows in the dark with a soft orange hue.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by shimmeringbliss.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ground Bone Meal", "A pouch of freshly ground bone meal! It\nappears to be a fine white powder,\naccompanied by a soft yellow tinge. The pouch\nweighs roughly four to six pounds. It would\nmake a perfect fertilizer for both avid\ngreen-thumbs and average, everyday gardeners.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Bonetooth Necklace", "An assortment of sheep teeth and bones\narranged into a necklace. The sharp edges\nseem to be sanded down somehow, to ensure\nwhoever wears the necklace has no worry about\ninjury. There is a pattern to the arrangement\nof them, with the largest pieces being placed\nin the middle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lamb Skull", "The skull of a lamb. It’s been hollowed out\nand seems to have a slight shine to it. It\nmight not have the most practical uses, but\ncould definitely be used as a decorative\npiece. The lack of cracks and overall\ncondition of the skull infers the cause of\nthis lamb's death had nothing to do with it's\nhead.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Direwolf Bones", "Some direwolf bones, soiled by dirt and\ndecaying matter. They span no longer than six\ninches in length from bottom to top, and can\neasily be held within any descendants hand.\nIf one were to dust off the grime and filth,\nthey would carry a light yellow tint to them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Spruce Sapling", "A potted spruce sapling, uprooted from a\ntundra biome. It’s a rather small plant,\nstruggling to adapt to the calmer and unusual\nenvironments outside of its home. The soil is\na lush brown colour. It seems whoever found\nthis sapling seems to be be taking vigilant\ncare of it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodstained Arrows", "A set of bodkin arrows, stained by blood\ndried long ago. A hue of red reaches up about\na third of the shaft, beginning from the\narrowhead. The tip of the arrow is dulled\nfrom use. For some reason, they are snapped\nin half -- perhaps when retrieving them from\nhunted game?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("owo wats dis?", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Hexe_.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Chick Mask", "A rather well crafted chick mask, the fluffy\nyellow feathers would be rather realistic,\nmuch akin to a chick, whilst the beak of the\nheadwear would be made from the wood of an\noak tree. The back of the mask has two pieces\nof twine stitched upon the oaken frame to\nkeep it secured against ones face. Quite a\nfine piece to wear to masqurades and\nfestivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Knitted Sheep Plushie", "This soft sheep would be completely made out\nof knitted white and grey wool. It would be\nplushie sized sheep, the 'wool' of it made\nfrom fuzzy yarn to give it said wooly\nappearance. The face would be a greyish hue,\nwith two buttons for eyes. It would be\ndelicately made, and fun to hug and squeeze.\nThere would be a little tag hidden on it's\nfoot which would read: \"Baah! ❤\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elenora Zytiaear.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Peacock Plush", "the plush toy would resemble a . . . Rather\nexotic bird? It seems to be a peafowl. Blue\nand green wool would be carefully sewn\ntogether to create the plush bird's exquisite\nplumage, along with velour, pelt, and wool\nwould be used in making the rest of the toy.\nThe peafowl plush would have been crafted\nwith great care, making for a great toy for a\nchild to play with!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Riftblade.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Plush", "The plush toy would appear to resemble a\nwhite furred wolf. It would be made from\ncotton, velour, and felt, all stiched\ntogether with great care and attention.\nOverall the plush would be a soft and\nadorable toy, great for a child to play with!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Riftblade.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Knitted Lynx Plushie", "This knitted Lynx plushie would be rather\nsoft and squeezable. It's ears would be at a\npoint, with black tips. The tail upon it\nwould be rather short, with a black tip as\nwell. The wool would be a shaggy texture,\ngiving it the apperance of fur and fluff.\nThis would include at the paws, and around\nit's face. The eyes would be little buttons,\nand the nose a light pink rock seeming stuck\nonto it. A little tag would be hidden by the\ntail- with the message: \"Lynx ❤\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elenora Zytiaear.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A Well-Nurtured Rose", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Drake's Horn", "A void-black horn shot from the serptentine\nhead of the Smoke Drake Avendal when he\nattacked the city of Santegia.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Slime Chunk", "A chunk of charred, blue slime. Although\nseperated from the main body, it continues to\nwrithe and wiggle. Perhaps it can be used to\ntrack the original monster. [PM Xarkly for\nfollow-up event]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:slime", ""),
        StaticItem("Harold's attempt at a wedding gift", "A wooden vase shaped out of hickory wood.\nIt's exterior would be filled with carvings\nof leaves with an iron ensign of a scorpion\nembedded into it as the centerpiece.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sign From the Aspects", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Empty Winterleaf Wine Bottle", "This bottle smells very faintly of strawberry\nand alcohol, and has a faded handmade label\nthat reads 'Winterleaf Strawberry Wine,\nvintage 1445' and seems otherwise\nunremarkable.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dagothagahnim.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Ballista Bolt", "A cleric blessed bolt for ballistas. It has\naurum on the tip and is heavily barbed. A\nbright silver and crimson light surrounds it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond-Studded Glove", "On squeezing the palm, an orb of water\ncharges in the palm. After three emotes, it\nreleases the orb in a pressurized stream,\nstrong enough to knock the average person off\ntheir feet. Three charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Handcuffs", "A pair of rusty handcuffs. Easy enough to\nshim.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by tavBEAN.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Beating Elderwood Bracelet", "A coiling bracelet of elderwood, it sings of\nliving wood to those attuned, and coils\ngently to the wrist of those who are granted\nit, removing when tugged hard enough. From\nit, who creators heartbeart is transmitted to\nit, making it beat with it steadily in\nrealtime, but still requires to be treated\nwith natural energies every three elven days\nor it should go inert. Inscribed into it is a\nE\", perhaps denoting who it was given to. PM\nA_Keefy for interaction.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Great Bow of Hollowfell", "A long bow made of an excellent dark wood,\ncarved and polished by hand. At the top you\ncan appreciate the head of a wolf and at the\nbottom you can appreciate the letter 'H' of\nHallowfell and next to it the letter 'W' of\nWolf.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Silber", "Sibler is a bear and animal companion to\nElenora, a very large and passive huggable\nfluff ball.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mismatch Bundle of Flowers", "This bundle of flowers would look as if a\nchild or someone blind had picked it. They\nwould be mismatched, designed with no exact\norder. Some of them would be rather broken\nand none of them the same length. It would be\nwrapped up in a bright red ribbon. I suppose\nit's the thought what counts!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DaHazelWazel.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem(";;Tahariae's Healing;;", "A parchment written with a light golden ink,\nthe words centered on the page with an elven\nprayer; “Tahariae, marmathill Elengulan’leh,\nnae lye iller ahern’ley ern eth elatan ito\niylmadiln. Nae laeh-hae iller iheuiuii\noemhyem, lae-hae ito bilok evar’ehya\nadrionn.” When read the script would alight\nwith a golden glow, the Light seeking out the\nnearest injury of severity equal to a broken\nbone or otherwise large wound. Four emote\nuse. Pm Fury_Fire for info.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Jump Rope", "A thin and elastic rope of 3'5 feet, it seems\nperfect to perform some kinds of games.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Gray Bear Plushie!", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorpion plushie", "An adorable yet fairly detailed plushie that\nlooks like a scorpion. It would be good a\nsize, perfect for hugging no matter the age!\nThe fabric itself would be both warm and soft\nto the touch all coming together quite well\nfor the stuffed toy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DrususTheDumb.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber the Dagger", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Beautifully Polished Gem", "A gem so finely polished that you could see\nyour own refleciton in it as if it was a\nmirror. A gift to Vosirk Grandaxe and Elenora\nto commemorate their wedding.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Altar Key", "A key retrieved after sacrificing a Dwarven\nChild, for shame. The key looks as if it\ncould be used at a nearby fort.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ghul Ash", "The charred ash of a deformed Ghul, killed\nin the sewer system of Sutica. It was\ndestroyed during the cleansing of the sewers\nwhen the Love Stone was discovered.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LumberjackMack.", "minecraft:gunpowder", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Orange Present", "A large boxy parcel, wrapped with bright\norange paper and finished with a cloth ribbon\nof metallic sky blue. The contents seems to\nrattle and clink softly within a box beneath\nthe wrapping. A tag reads, \"Vosirk, Merry\nKrugsmas. With love from Niv.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Eau Royale", "This perfume is the expression of a man’s\ncharisma and inner strength. A fresh, spicy\nand woody composition that reveals the\npresence of the man who wears it.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon-Garlic Shrimp Pasta", "", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Living Instrument", "A rather simple flute, little more than a\nside-blown branch... But its value lies not\nin its ornamentation, but in the soul of its\nsound. Low, primal, but delicate... Tuned\nwith great care as if to refuse to be played\npoorly, once one tames it. Brother to the shy\nbirds after heavy rain, or to the spirit of a\ncampfire. Even a veteran music enthusiast\nwould have difficulty learning to play it,\nunless already accustomed to transverse\nflutes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Slimy Saliva", "A bottle of thick, groggy hued salive\ncollected from a mysterious undead creature.\nOnce entered through the body, it acts as a\npowerful sedative.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Lumbering Axe", "A common implement for cutting wood. This\nparticular one has faint red stains on the\nhandle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whamsickle.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("~Ritualistic Silii'tur~", "A sprawling section of red stag antler,\ncracked off of a proud beast. The points of\nthe sprawling branches of the antler have\nbeen chipped away and painstakingly sharpened\nto a sharp spike. Varnish has been slathered\nover the, now gleaming, white bone. The\nthicker trunk of the antler has been carved\nto produce an ergonomic groove, a length of\nfine leather has been twirled round and\npinned to the end. Despite these measure, the\nsheer nature of the material means it has\nlittle use in combat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nerrin Delevoye.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Slimy Concoction", "A thin, clear bottle filled with a thick,\ngelatinous substance. The slime itself seems\nto possess individually sized chunks of flesh\nand rotten cloth. It seems to gurgle and\nbubble but only in the presence of a full\nmoon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Izkuthii.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeds of Love", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider in a Jar", "Trapped within the glass jar was a Black\nWidow spider, the spider was alive, but\ndidn't appear to be happy. The spider would\nconstantly be trying to attack the person\noutside of the jar.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Love Potato", "This potato reminds you to get enough sleep,\ntake your meds, and drink enough water\nESPECIALLY in the winter like this !!!1!! u\nare loved and appreciated.. . . okaykthxbye\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbal Paste", "A paste made from a small amount of ground up\nBlissfoil for numbing, a tiny bit of\nmandragora for regeneration, and the tiniest\ndroplet of a Phoenix' Teardrop petal mixed\nwith sap to create a very effective healing\npaste. The paste also has some slime and\nhoney so it's sticky yet not firm enough that\nit stays in place. This can be used as a\nlotion to help muscles or rubbed into a wound\nto help it heal faster.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anthron.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Phoenix' Teadrop Nectar", "A vial of a red liquid that glistens when\nheld up to any source of light, but the\nliquid itself does not create light. When\nconsumed, the person would feel nothing until\nthey begin to fall into a trance-like state\nfilled with halucinations. After ten minutes\nof this, they will fall unconscious for an\nhour and wake up with a bad headache.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Axolotl Druid Anthron.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Reed Panflute", "A small, well-made panflute\nheld together by hempen twine.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roxforbraynz.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugared Cranberries", "Perfectly-ripe cranberries that were boiled\nin water with a half cup of sugar, soaked and\ncooled for one elven hour before draining,\nthen rolled in another half cup of sugar on a\nbaking sheet. Afterwards, they are dried for\nfour elven hours. An amazing sugary sweet!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Mo' Eggnog", "A mug of warm eggnog! The large container\nwould feature a creamy delight waiting\ninside. For those that sipped from this\ndelectable drink would feel themselves devoid\nof any coldness. Though only for a small\namount of time. Happy Krugsmas 2017!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Candy Fishing Rod", "An expertly designed fishing rod made of ..\npeppermint candy! The sugary delight was\nrefined so much that it could withstand most\npressure and heat without melting or\nbreaking. Happy Krugsmas 2017!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag of Chocolate Truffles.", "A small bag of small chocolate spheres with a\nslightly hard shell and a softer inside.\nDespite the name, these candies are completly\ndevoid of truffles, yet the sentiment of the\nname is enough to be dispensed by the truffle\nseller.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:cocoa_beans", ""),
        StaticItem("Enhanced Nightsap", "This herb has been rendered into a gaseous\nstate, capable of knocking someone\nunconscious within seconds after being\ninhaled. It releases a white shimmer.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rugged Bark", "I lay face down,on a branch leagues above\nthe ground. Down far below me are those who\ncrave monumental powers, now i see that it is\nthe force which devours. They claim to be\nthose who serve, but I know they murder and\npillage with lusty verve. The ground below is\na splendid shade of brown, I wonder what it\nwould feel like if I just fall down. They say\nwisdom is born from experience, from wisdom I\nknow the best path is to follow with\npersistence.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Senor_Tortuga.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Druidic Herb", "The strange herb seems to have untold druidic\nproperties perhaps a herbologist or a\nknowledgeable druid could uncover more?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SeventhCircle.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("*A leather bound book with thick lettering engraved on the cover: The Final Will and Testamony of Herun Athna I", "★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Herun Athna.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tome of Inner Balance", "A leatherbound tome, the cover of which is\nembossed with the outline of a cutting of\nsage, the shape of its leaves and flowers\ndistinctive. The book is fifty-six pages\nlong, filled with the teachings of the Owl\nDruid and the Heralds of the Sage way, as\nwell as artistic illustrations, including a\nfew diagrams. (( See the following link for\nits contents: https://tinyurl.com/ybfg3kse ))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhium-Powered Enchantment Charger", "A sizeable, light blue crystal with a mage\ngold base. Offshooting from the base's side,\na smaller, cleanly cut thanic crystal would\nprotrude.. Sapping heat from all around it.\nEnchantments crafted by the elf Lhindir would\nrecharge whilst being within a very close\nproximity of the device.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag of Marbles", "A small cotton bag that consists of several\nmarbles of which each are a different color.\nPerfect for decoration or to play a game of\nmarbles with.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Bark", "The bark is fresh and scaly, the bark of an\nent - valued for its alchemical ability.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cave_Creature.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("A pound of Rotted Flesh", "The pile of rotted flesh gave off a rather putrid, cringe-worthy smell.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDohvi approved this item.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("MoonSeeker", "A beautifully carved staff rests before you\nwith intricate patterns of the moon cycle\ncarved into the staff in a flowing circular\npattern running along the entire length of\nit. At the top of the wood, would appear to\nbe fashioned in a way that would make it able\nto hold a single stone. A pale opal rests on\nthe top, glowing ever so faintly when\nmoonlight touches its surface.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrsWhiteKnight.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Eryn's Bracelet", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrsWhiteKnight.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Hochmeister Mirtok Poseable Action Figure", "A POSEABLE HOCHMEISTER MIRTOK ACTION FIGURE,\nCRAFTED DETAILS. GO BACK TO THE DAYS WHEN THE\nTHIS!\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Rice Crispie Treats", "A plate of Rice Crispie Treats, seemingly\nhomemade. Made with love and some chocolate\nchips.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Trout Druid Kasfer.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("WE Tool", "", "minecraft:wooden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ker'Wolf puppy plushie", "A plushie of a ker'wolf pup that is so cute\nit should be criminal. The incredibly fluffy\nfabric is lovely and soft to the touch, warm\ntoo! Without a doubt it'll be a great thing\nto cuddle while napping.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DrususTheDumb.", "minecraft:black_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Hammer of the Forgotten Flora", "", "", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bargain Fulfilled", "This is twelve locks of elf hair. They are\nauburn in color, smooth to the touch, and\nairy. They smell of spice. They constitute\nacceptable currency to all individuals,\nincluding supernatural creatures or creatures\nwith no concept of currency. For example,\nfive locks may be traded to a bear for that\nbear’s cave. This includes entities which\nnormally do not trade, such as divine and\ndark creatures of all kinds. Each lock is\nworth 50 mina, or an equivalent expenditure\nof effort or wealth relative to the entity\nbeing given the locks.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("::Tahariae's Healing::", "A parchment written with a faint golden ink,\nthe words centered on the page - An elven\nprayer; \"Tahariae, marmathill Elengulan’leh,\nnae lye iller ahern’leh ern eth elatan ito\niylmadiln. nae (lae/hae) iller iheiuii\noemhyem, (lae/hae)ito bilok evar’ehya\nadrionn.\" When read, the page would begin to\nglow with a golden light, seaking to gather\nat any nearby injury to the severity of only\na medium cut. Once used, the scroll will be\nuseless. PM Fury_Fire for questions.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusted Ferrum Blade", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Druidic Tome", "Elder roots bind the book together,\nunhindered by any force acting upon it. It\nwould take a tier five druid in control and\ncommunion to unlock. The pages inside would\ncontain ancient, yet indecipherable writings.\n[PM Murlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Lost Fox.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Nightmares", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. The shape was formed and\nwarped, darkened in hue. [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Lump of Ashwood", "A small piece of ashwood small enough to fit\nin the palm of your hand. It looks lively and\nwithout rot. To those with druidic\nattunement, they feel it is indeed alive! [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ram Druid Jeremiah.", "minecraft:spruce_log", ""),
        StaticItem("Livingwood Arrow", "A bodkin arrow with simple white feathers for\nstreamline effect. The wood of the shaft is\nmade from hickory, but it seems barky and\nwith several leaves protruding from a couple\npoints. A druid may confirm that they are\nindeed pieces of living wood. [PM Gladuos for\ndetails]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ram Druid Jeremiah.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Life", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. Glistening moss and\nleaves coiled around its form indicates it\nwas once with nature. [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcadian Helm", "The piece is rather small as if made for\nsomeone small of stature. Large, spiraling\nrunes dominate the surface of the plates and\nthey glow softly with a dark purple hue when\nworn. To the skilled eye of a runesmith, a\nmix of Dungrimm and destroy fire runes cover\nthe metal, absorbing and dispelling sprays of\nfire or smaller amounts of voidal magic.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcadian Chestplate", "The piece is rather small as if made for\nsomeone small of stature. Large, spiraling\nrunes dominate the surface of the plates and\nthey glow softly with a dark purple hue when\nworn. To the skilled eye of a runesmith, a\nmix of Dungrimm and destroy fire runes cover\nthe metal, absorbing and dispelling sprays of\nfire or smaller amounts of voidal magic.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcadian Leggings", "The piece is rather small as if made for\nsomeone small of stature. Large, spiraling\nrunes dominate the surface of the plates and\nthey glow softly with a dark purple hue when\nworn. To the skilled eye of a runesmith, a\nmix of Dungrimm and destroy fire runes cover\nthe metal, absorbing and dispelling sprays of\nfire or smaller amounts of voidal magic.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcadian Boots", "The piece is rather small as if made for\nsomeone small of stature. Large, spiraling\nrunes dominate the surface of the plates and\nthey glow softly with a dark purple hue when\nworn. To the skilled eye of a runesmith, a\nmix of Dungrimm and destroy fire runes cover\nthe metal, absorbing and dispelling sprays of\nfire or smaller amounts of voidal magic.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Briar Baton", "", "minecraft:dandelion", ""),
        StaticItem("Birch Bark", "", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Acacia Flower", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbal Headache Rememdy", "", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbal Pain Remedy", "", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Yarrow", "A white to pink flowered plant, clipped from\na larger specimen and dried to preserve the\npetals.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Pipe o' The Ol' Green", "An ancient pipe carved by the Pine Druid.\nHerbs smoked through it seem to be more\npotent...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gigarun.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dart", "A green and yellow dart with an iron tip. the\nfeathers on the end of the dart have been\ntrimmed and slightly curved.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Hedgehog Druid's Staff", "A 2ft. long staff made from an apple branch.\nBark still covers the stave's shaft, with a\nleather strap bound around the base for a\nsoft and comfortable grip. The \"head\" of the\nstaff is a collection of roots curling around\na spiked ironwood core that can extend itself\noutwards if communed with. Just above the\nleather wrappings is a sea-blue sweet pea\ngrowing from the stave, instilling a sense of\nserenity and stillness in any chaos from\ntheir life,", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Booger in a Jar", "A fragment of an Ooze that lurked Linandria\ntrapped in a glass jar. It occassionally\nmoves.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("[Name for the item]", "", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Cerridwen's Grace", "A pendant made of a lustrous gold and shaped\ninto the likeness of a doe, complete with\nprotruding antlers that curve majestically\nabove it. The jewel hangs from a simple cord\nto be worn around the neck or wrist. Should\none clasp the pendant tight, a a faint sense\nof warmth floods them temporarily.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wytchlings.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cedar Seeds", "a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a\na a a . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .\n. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .\n. . . . . . . .", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Pine Seeds", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Halfling Lamellar Chestpiece", "A small chestpiece and 2 pauldrons made of\nsmall bronze plates, known as lamels, woven\ntogether. The lamels of the chestpiece are\nwell shined, and are quite lustrous under\nlight. The lamels are woven together with\nstrings of jute, which is quite strong under\nduress. The tunic is sized for a halfling,\nand is unwearable by people larger than 4\nfeet tall. The pauldrons are not attached to\nthe chestpiece, and are put on separately.\nThe lamellar pauldrons cover the shoulders,\nand the outside of the upper arm, ending at\nthe elbow though bearing no armoring on the\ninner arm. The pauldrons are held on by 3\nleather straps. The lamellar chestpiece is\nheld on by 6 tieable strings on its sides.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Hedgehog druid's spade", "A 2ft. long shovel made from an apple branch.\nBark still covers the shovels' shaft, with a\nleather strap bound around the base for a\nsoft and comfortable grip. The head of the\nshovel would have engravings of Hedgehogs in\nsilly poses, and would contain a lot of roots\nbound into a couple of holes around the\nbottom of it, as to keep it atop the shaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Communisto Books", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Natural Sandwich", "A whole hearty sandwhich, fully natural!\nExpertly made from the finest breads of Fenn,\nalong with lettuce, tomato, sugarcane and a\ntad' bit of beets in the middle. This\nwonderful' bread will surely pack a punch to\nany vegan who wishes to fill their mouthhole\nwith it!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ascanius Dunlain.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Naughty List's Spanking Shovel", "", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Hedgehog Mask", "A rather well crafted hedgehog mask, the\nbrown pelt of the critter would be formed\nwith a fine light brown silk fabric, whilst\nthe spines of the headwear would be made from\nharmless twigs of an oak tree. The back of\nthe mask has two pieces of twine stitched\nupon the oaken frame to keep it secured\nagainst ones face. Quite a fine piece to wear\nto masqurades and festivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ham Sandwich", "Great for picnics!", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Staff", "A staff with a long wooden shaft. At the end\nthere would be gold with a design of flowers.\nThis would make a great gift for a friend.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ChiakiTheNeko.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Quill", "A quill with spines of shifting shades of\ngreen, resembling a birds-eye-view of a vast\nforest canopy, and it instils feelings of\nnature and spring. It is a fitting momento\nfor a writer who drew inspiration from the\nFirst Seed.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Cherry Staff", "This birch staff is 4’9 feet tall with a\nslight curve at the top. Right above where\nshe holds the staff are two carvings, one of\na tree and the other a flower. Below where\nshe holds it is a carving of a sheep. The\nwhole staff is wrapped in thin vines with\nBlue Morning Glories weaved through.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ChiakiTheNeko.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Lily Flower", ".", "minecraft:white_tulip", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum", "", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Herbal Remedy", "A remedy consisting of Lavender, Basil,\nPeppermint, and Ginger. While not tasting the\nbest, it can Supposedly help with Headaches\nand Migraines.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Floral Ring", "This living ring is made out of a small\nplant, wrapped around in a circle. Tiny white\nflowers run along the band.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Katherine1.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet, Sweet Potaoes", "These juicy peeled sweet potatoes are first\nbaked, cooled, then mixed into a concoction\nof sifted sugar, margarine, milk, cinnamon,\nalmond extract, and vanilla extract.\nAfterwards, this mixture is kneaded until\nsmooth with added coconut bits, shaped into\nsmall ball-like formations, dusted with\npowdered sugar and finally refigerated in\nyour local thanhium cooling unit!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_44(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Pineapple", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Stone", "A medium sized stone, which actually feels\nheavier than it looks. Attuned Druids would\nfeel quite powerful energies coming from\nwithin said stone. ((PM Corvoo to interact\nwith this item)).\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Druid Magicks", "A rather large cluster of living vines! They\nemit large amounts of Druidic energies, which\nany Druid would be able to sense rather\neasily. ((PM Corvoo to interact with this\nitem)).\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Arlen Teharissa's Compendium Vol. 1", "The original copy of Arlen Teharissa's\nThesis that he turned into Prince\nArtimec, on20th of The Deep Cold, 1561.\nThe book details Arlen's vision on what\nnature is, how it came to be, and why The\nAspects are representatives of nature,\nbut not actual nature itself.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.\nSignature: Finalhazard", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Moot 8th Of The First Seed 1606", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("A tree Grows", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Recovery of an Ancient Elven Scroll", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.\nSignature: Renn", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("A Mysterious Tome", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("its a sign from the aspects", "the aspects say stop", "minecraft:oak_sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Pot full of Melon", "A clay pot full of fresh melon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Trout Druid Kasfer.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Origami Rose", "A messily crafted, Origami Rose. The paper\nwould be red to match and would have the\nwords \"Love, Ryul\" written in ink on one of\nthe petals.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rickson.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ryul Oro Deathsbane", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:blue_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Leg", "The leg of a Giant Hawk. It's muscular leg\nseems to be covered in small soft feathers.\nSurprisingly light and gentle to the touch.\nQuite the trophy, good hunt!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Plant Plume", "Contained within a small leather bag would be\na mysterious green powder. When tossed on a\ngrowing plant, a puff or plume of jade mist\nwould appear for but a few seconds. In its\nplace, the plant would have enhanced growth\nof almost ten times its original speed until\nit reaches maturity! [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nature.", "minecraft:bone_meal", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl Bracelet", "A small, and pretty pearl bracelet, all of\nwhich shining merrily.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Shimmering Scale", "A shimmering blue scale that has a tinge of\ngray coursing through it. It shimmers\nvibrantly when exposed to sunlight, the\nreflected color reminding one of the ocean\nduring a storm.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Rorel.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Sickly Bone", "The bone appears to have a green colouration,\nits structure rather precarious and weak,\nwith a sharp, protruding end at either side.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Smawton.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Willow Soul Tree Seedling", "A powerful seedling embedded within a pendant\nand attached to a string necklace. The\nseedling itself gives off a calming aura.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elswyen.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspect’s Token", "This is an exceptionally crafted fired-clay\ntoken. On the item is an image of Cerridwen,\nas an immaculate doe. Cerridwen is sleeping.\nWhen pressed into the forehead of a spriggan\nor ent, this item evaporates into a puff of\nsmoke. For the next saint’s day, the spriggan\nor ent cannot attack the person who pressed\nthe token into their head, unless they are\nbodily harmed.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Mama Wolf Plushy", "Made from the soft pelt of some fuzzy animal,\nthe plushy would be shaped into a white wolf,\nthe eyes made of highly polished and painted\nwood to resemble the life-like stare of its\nconterpart. Alot of care and stuffing went\ninto this plush and it would be the second\nlargest in a set of three.", "minecraft:white_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Miruelkurn", "A tower shield composed of solid ironwood,\ntinged a verdant color. Spanning five feet in\nheight, it would be cumbersome for any normal\nhuman or elf to carry, but quite fit for a\nTreelord. Its face featuring a bright rose\nhead emblazoned in the center. Various live\nvines clinging to the rims.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Velanna Cecile Deathsbane", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:pink_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Decorative Eagle Feather", "This tail feather is large and full, it's\nbristles undamaged and healthy. A dozen\nlines of black and blue beaded string are\ntied about the stem, holding a small\nleather cord in place. From this cord\ndangle several silver disc-like charms,\neach carved intricately with mountains.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Beylund] Ruari Hoarfrost of Orvar.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Poisoned Apple Sparkler", "A sparkler that lights up with a sickly green\nand purple glow! Said to ward off those evil\nspirits on All Spirit's Eve. A small token of\nthanks for attending the All Spirit's Eve\nevent of Linandria, 1583.", "minecraft:firework_rocket", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Petal", "A large red petal from an overgrown flower.\nIt seems to be charred a bit. It gives off a\nrather sweet smell, but the pollen seems to\nbe washed away from it. The coloring is\nbeautiful and bright, bringing cheer to those\naround it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:poppy", ""),
        StaticItem("Raim Plushy", "A nice plush in the shape of a nature\nphoenix! The feathers are made out of loose\nstraps of clothes, but the rest is just\nnicely sewn velvet, looking like the playful\nphoenix that follows a certain dwarf around!\nThe stitching would make it apparent that\nwhoever made it was nervous. Nice, preserved\nherbs were placed inside of the large plush,\ngiving it a nice aroma!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:green_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Tree Sapling", "A healthy pine sapling cut from Father\nKrugmas' very own Krugmas tree. It seems to\nthrive regardless of the conditions around\nit.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:spruce_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Living Bouquet", "A bouqet that radiates living druidic energy,\neach of the flowers retaining it's life as\nlong as it's held by or near a druid. The\nflowers hold beautiful colors, vibrant reds,\ngreens, blues, and purples, all entwined.", "minecraft:rose_bush", ""),
        StaticItem("Andrew the Tortoise", "A young, healthy looking tortoise. His name\nis Andrew, but you don't know that.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Leap1Ghosts.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Cerridwen’s Light", "A scarlet substance inhibits the smooth\nbottle of wine, with a thick scent\nreminiscent of pomegranate and rosemary,\nmixed together to produce one of the most\ndelicious wines to date. The mixture, working\nso brilliantly well, has earned the ire of\nwinemakers from the four corners, with its\nexact recipe dating back to an era\nunbeknownst to we, mankind. Fanatics would\ndub it the drink of Mother Cerridwen.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen__.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lynx Fur Coat", "A handsewn furry coat made directly from a\nbig cat's pelt. It offers exceptional warmth\nand comfort to those that wear it, and would\nbe nice for travelling in cold environments.\nCrafted with a nature-oriented methodology,\nthe animal was likely hunted and skinned with\nrespect.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood Carving", "The carving itself looks like it was made\nwith care but nothing about the shape is even\nand it looks like a child would have been\nbetter at making it then them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by loupgareu.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Cat Necklace", "Upon a small golden chain hangs a small cat\nadorned with sapphire eyes. A small pink\ncollar rests around it's neck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rella101.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Blue Present", "A squarish box-like parcel, wrapped with sky\nblue paper and finished with a cloth ribbon,\nmetallic gold in colour. If shaken, the\ncontents makes a dull rattle in the box. A\ntag reads, \"Tailesin, Merry Krugsmas. With\nlove from Niv.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｃａｓｔ Ｂｒｏｎｚｅ Ｋｎｕｃｋｌｅｓ", "A set of bronze knuckles to be used as a fist\nweapon. The knuckles are 4 and a half inches\nacross, half an inch thick, 2 and a half\ninches high at it's highest point, with each\nfingerhole being an inch in diameter. The\nbronze the knuckles are from has been shined\nextensively, giving it a near mirror finish.\nThe knuckles weigh 170 grams. The knuckles\nconsist of 4 identical holes arranged into a\nslight arch, atop a somewhat squarish frame.\nThe bottom of the frame bears a slight curve\noutwards, as for ease of wear. The knuckles\nseem to've been cast in a single part, with a\nconsistent thickness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Incense Pouch", "This small, dark pouch was loosely woven with\ndark roots, small in size with a thin belt to\nstrap over the shoulder. It had no lid and\ninstead was a more secure basket in\nstructure, inside lied several bundles of\nherbs. A sage smudge stick for cleansing\nnegativity, dried lotus pods to bring peace\nand harmony, and dried passionflower to ease\nworries and assist sleep. The loose incense\nis to be burned in a separate, fireproof\ncontainer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Taliame'onn.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Athame", "A small dagger with a polished and smooth\nwooden handle, an iron blade with a pointed\ntip topped the handle, on which several\ndesigns were made with green Kuila Dust,\ndesigns depicting vines and flowers and\nskulls and antlers, artworks surrounding the\nAspects on both sides of the blade. Should a\nDruid cast their magic whilst holding the\ndagger, the design glowed a radiant green\ncolor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Rainbow Druid] Skylar Taliame'onn.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("TCloud TearT", "A mystical Atheran artifact, dating back\nnumerous millennia. The crystal appears to\nlook like that of a white teardrop. If two\npeople who have deep affection for one\nanother hold the artifact, it will glow a\ndeep red. Where-as, if held by two people who\nhold dislike or even hate one another, it\nwill fade into an ebony black. The intensity\nof these colors depend on the strength of\nthese emotions.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Atheran Artifact.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Hot Potato Soup", "A creamy, savoury smelling soup, resting in a\nhand carved wooden bowl. The soup would smell\nlike a fresh garden, potatoes being an\noutstanding character, a blend of spices and\ncheese, creating the best bowl of comfort\nfood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor Al'Abass.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Handmade Bread", "This loaf of bread is shaped in a delicate\nbraid. It's baked evenly, slightly toasted on\nthe top of each braid, the outside of the\nloaf smells lightly of cinnamon.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Hat", "A wonderfully sewn Krugsmas hat. It's fits\nsnug on the head and is soft to the touch.\nVery fluffy, and perfect for Krugsmas\nfestivities!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Instant Bush Boom!", "To the average Joe, the handful of seeds\nappear quite normal. To a druid, however,\nthey shine with condensed druid energy. If\nthrown roughly against the ground, they would\nexplode outward into a small push, with\nincredibl speed. ((2x2x2 irply, pretty\nflammable.))", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Chocolate Surprise!", "A small bag, containing a handful of\nseemingly harmless, delicious chocolate bits!\nHowever, when consumed, the user is sent on a\ndrug trip powerful enough to incapacitate a\nsmall bear. Highly Addictive! Oh boy!", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Dedicant Whacker", "This whacking stick was made with dedicants\nin mind--the head of the cudgel has the face\nof a very upset person on it. A dedicant?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sorcerous_.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegantly Dark Oak Crafted Flute", "The object before you is an elegantly flute\ncarved by a skilled woodworker from dark oak\nwood. Carvings of flowers, vines, and other\nvegetations are used as decoration thought\nthe wood, the flute itself skillfully sand\ndown for a soft and smooth feel. When used,\ncan produce lovely tunes if played right.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bow of the Mother", "The bow seems simple enough, the made of\nstring oiled horse hair. However, the limbs\nare made of living, yet very flexible wood.\nThey never seem to wear and tear. However,\nit's quite flammable, likely to catch at the\nslightest spark.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("[!] Books that need to be rewritten ->", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("[!] Books to be sorted into shelves section ->", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("[!] Books that are already on the shelves ->", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Mister Squeakums", "The green ball is made up of solidified slime\nwhich causes a loud squeaking sound when\nsqueezed. Once squeezed, small-sized plants\nnearby would begin to jiggle as if dancing.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Diamond Ring", "A round cut diamond ring.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Souvle Angelcake", "This is a masterfully-crafted angelcake. It\nis three tiers in height and is relatively\nspongy, with white chocolate truffles grated\ninto the dough. The tiers are apricot, lemon\nmeringue, and dark chocolate. It has layers\nof striated rene and mesquite honey between\nthe tiers, is coated in angelmilk frosting\nwith masterful flowering, and is dusted with\ngold, vermillion, and powdered watercrest. It\nis decorated with gold leaf, fondant\nsculptures of masterful quality, and voile\ncaramel illustrations of masterful quality.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Stack of Scriptures", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Blubber", "The blubber is very slippery to touch, and\nwill probably rot after a few days.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Sacrificial Cauldron", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Books", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Oceana", "A pendant of silver, within which is carved\nexceptional patterns of swirling branches. A\ntiny gemstone of deep, vivid blue is set in\nthe very center, pulsing ever-so-noticeably\nwith a gentle glow of green lights. It\nappears that when in use, the wearer's eyes\nbecome a deep-sea blue, to match the sapphire\ngem embedded.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by neopsychedelia.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A very crude heart-shaped pink rock", "It looks very basic and not very good.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ChronicFever.", "minecraft:pink_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Bar", "This bar seems to be perfectly processed and\nshimmers in a bright glow. Undead can not\neven put their eyes on this extremely\nvaluable piece!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Arbor", "A quite normal training sword that has been\nsharpened. It seems to have been carved with\na multitude of runes up along the blade. The\nrunes upon it were the reinforce runes that\nallowed it to be able to be more sturdy then\nnormal training swords. It did not make it\nsharper whatsoever. [[ Contact PurpleCola for\nmore info. ]]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorpion's Venom", "The blade of this dagger is made of black\nferrum and is curved much like a Scorpion’s\ntail. The blade itself is double edged and is\nabout 10 inches in length and would be\npolished to give of a small glimmer whenever\na ray of sun hits it. “Scorpion Druid” would\nbe engraved into the blade at the base by the\nhandle which would be wrapped in a dark\nleather. A small scorpion charm would dangle\nfrom the handle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Marten Druid.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Dwedish Soldier", "A well crafted wooden doll that represented a\ndwarven soldier. About the size of a man's\nhand, it's eyes shone with beautiful green\ngems and it wore a helm. The doll seemed to\nbe only for sentimental value, and had no\nother use.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Doctor's Note", "This is a certificate ensuring that Liri\nZytiaear possesses the ｈａｌｆ ｇａｙ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Liri.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Virasulii", "A livingwood staff twisted and bent into the\nshape of a lightning bolt. Its handle\ncomforted with deer hide. From its crown\nerupt a bouquet of blossoming purple-hued\nasters, irises, and a single wolf's bane.\nDown the shaft would wrap a thickly verdant\nvine, coiling off at the end to sprout\nseveral spindly passion flowers. Periodically\nthe staff would permit ventral roots to dig\ndown into the earth, absorbing nourishment.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ThatGuy_777.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Peonies", "To the elegant Reina. I apologize for my\naccent, for it prohibits me from speaking\nclearly.I understand that your heart was\nbroken, and that perhaps our betrothal was\nsomething you secretly detest. In fact, this\nentire ordeal may appear as strange to me as\nit does you - if you do - for it was Commodus\nwho called upon my debt to engage in such a\nrelationship. Unfortunately, I am not a\nromantic, nor am I known as a lover - and\nthese are two things in a man Commodus told\nme you sought. What I am, however, is an\nhonor-bound gentleman, and I strive to uphold\nmorality above all. I shall defend your\nhonour, even if it means putting mine aside.\nI hope to one day be a consort worthy of your\nfiness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Anorak's Staff", "A complex staff, Left helix representing\nCerridewn and Cernunnos and the Right\nrepresenting Nemiisae. Each having countless\nengravings representing each and their\nrituals. The core has Ferrets, Marine life\nand a Tree ecosystem with a handle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheAnorak.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cake Shaped Bed With Frosting Colored Sheets", "This tiny bed, meant to fit a tiny dark Elven\nDruid, is supported by a rich ebony colored\nwood bedframe, merged together piece by piece\nthrough Druidic means. The matress is a\nchocolate colored, filled with down feathers.\nA neatly arranged bedsheet, which looks like\nred velvet frosting, covers the bed,\ncompleting the piece with two cherry shaped\npillows.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kyral Winterleaf.", "minecraft:bed", ""),
        StaticItem("Doll-Sized Fireplace", "A miniature stone hearth, which fits snuggly\ninto the livingwood doll's house. It\npossesses a tiny iron safety-grate and its\nflagstones extend some into the room to\nprotect the house from stray embers.", "minecraft:furnace", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiny Dining Chairs", "A small dining chair, scaled perfectly to the\nlittle livingwood house. When prompted, it\nwill retreat its roots and allow one to move\nit as needed, but will then root in place\nshortly after becoming still again. A small\ncushion of moss pads the seat, a gleaming\ngreen in colour, while the back allows for\ncomfortable sitting.", "minecraft:oak_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("~Flower Circlet~", "An extremely tiny crown the size of a finger,\nwhose entire outlook is a majority of leaves,\nalong with beautifully grown heather flowers\nblooming out of its center.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kyral Winterleaf.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Diminutive Dining Table", "A dining table fit for a miniaturised home.\nIts legs are rooted into the floor, but\nshould one prompt the table, it would unroot\nitself to enable repositioning.", "minecraft:trapdoor", ""),
        StaticItem("Remembrance Ball", "Don't forget important things. We love you.\nDon't forget about us. We will miss you and\nadore you for all your hard work. You are\namazing and will be a great leader no matter\nwhat you do.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Khaine's Flask", "A small gold plated flask engraved with\nleaves and stag horns. It is filled with a\npotent liquid, and has a rosy hue in some\nlight. The bottom of the flask is engraved\nwith simply, Khaine.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Valkyrie", "Forged in dragonfire, Valkyrie is a blade of\nthe finest quality slayer steel. With a\ncrossguard of outstretched dragon wings, the\ngrip of the blade is made of tanned Droquar\nskin, which leads up to a golden dragon head\nwith amber eyes thatserve as the pommel. The\nblade itself is curved, and embellished with\ndelicate ancient elven script that runs along\nthe inner edge of the blade, naming this\nblade “Valkyrie”. The jewel of this blade is\nwhat is set between the outstretched wings,A\nGolden Dragon scale.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze and Cobalt Glass Ring", "A bronze ring, with a secondary band of\ncobalt glass around it. The bronze the ring\nis made from is shined extensively, giving it\na near mirror finish. The bronze part of the\nring bears a constant outer edge, as if it\nwas cut from the middle of a tube, whilst the\ninner edge of the ring has been filed to a\ncurve, ensuring ease and comfort of wear. The\nring bears a wide band of cobalt glass melted\nonto the outside of it, being ever so\nslightly not as wide as the ring, and raising\nupward off the bronze roughly a millimeter.\nThe cobalt glass is smooth, and vaguely\ntransluscent, with miniscule air bubbles\nbeing able to be seen inside the glass, and\nthe bronze base being visible through the\nglass at certain angles.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:diamond_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Bonsai Pinus Parviflora", "Also known as the Five-Needle Pine, this\nbonsai plant is a coniferous evergreen tree -\nit is as broad as it is tall, forming a wide,\ndense, conical crown. The leaves are needle\nlike; in bundles of five. Such a small and\ngraceful plant surely would have required\nfine skill and discipline to be grown.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Starfelt.", "minecraft:oak_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("The Red Bolt", "The bloodstained balista bolt\nlaunched by Ethildor which\nlanded a near mortal wound on\na massive wyvern.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Leaf Broach", "A vibrant green emerald shaped like a maple\nleaf, approxomately two inches long and two\nand a half wide. Thin golden wire adorns the\ncarved veins.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Izalith's Cube", "A three-dimensional combination puzzle,\nshaped as a cube with six faces, all covered\nby nine painted various colours. The puzzle\nis split into interlocked cubes, each holding\ntheir own colour. The puzzle is separated\ninto rows and columns, both easily twisted\nand turned around.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Aliyard Izalith.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Ajax's \"Seed", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Wolf Plushy", "Made from the soft pelt of some fuzzy animal,\nthis plushy would be shaped into a baby wolf\nwith eyes made of polished wood and painted\nto reflect a life like stare. This would be\nthe smalles and cutest from the set of three.", "minecraft:brown_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Flash Fruit", "These yellow fruits with orange streaks emit\na rich sweet smell, luring animals and people\nfrom all around. Growing upon the tallest\ntrees with their vines, they dangle\nenticingly out of reach, usualy found on\nElder Trees or in the tall jungles.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of White Roses", "A bouquet of white roses\nto represent a more innocent\ntype of love, usually a\nlove between close friends.", "minecraft:white_tulip", ""),
        StaticItem("DETECTIVE TOAD", "IN A CITY THAT NEVER SLEEPS, ONLY ONE TOAD\nCAN HANDLE THE HEAT. DETECTIVE TOAD. PRIVATE\nEYE. (It's wearing a sleuth hat and has a\nlittle pipe).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Ice Cream", "A lovely, creamy frozen dessert that tastes\nstrongly of freshly picked, Devirad-grown\nStrawberries.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Milkshake", "A rich, decadent chocolate flavored frozen\ndrink. It's thick and creamy. Seems someone\nspent quite a while making this!", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Blistering Toad Sample", "A small ceramic jar sealed with a cork\nstopper. Growing inside is a self-contained\nculture of blistering toad fungus, which\nsubsists upon a small bed of compost, cocoa\nbeans and bark. If opened, one would find a\nsquat red mushroom sitting inside. When\ndisturbed, the 'shroom will dispense a cloud\nof ember-orange spores, which painfully\ncorrode the soft tissue of the throat and\nairways. The effectiveness of these spores\nhas been amplified using Druidic Gifts. T5\nHerblore.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Shade Leaf & Elf's Hair Vine Tea", "A clay jar, small enough to be easily\ntransported within a satchel or rucksack. The\ncontents within is a faintly yellow-green,\nfinely chopped tea created from dried Elf's\nhair vine and shade leaf. Their potency has\nbeen greatly enhanced with Druidic Gifts.\nWhen infused into hot water, the resulting\ntea will provide a stress-relieving calmness\nto the drinker, and encourage smoother\nmovements of the body, such as the limbs.\nOverdosing may result in hallucinations and\nexhaustion. Herblore T5.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Flametonue Cutting", "A rose-like flower head, sitting atop a\nthorned stem. About the stem and thorns,\nthere appears to be a coating of dry\npollen-like powder. This has been enhanced by\nDruidic Gifts, to burn and irritate the skin\nshould one touch this powder.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Crouching Feather Leaves", "Very strong crouching feather leaves prepared\nby the Pine Druid. Consuming will knock\nsomeone out for about eight hours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gigarun.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Box of Chocolate Truffle Assortments", "A polished wooden box, lined with baking\nparchment and filled to the brim with an\nassortment of handmade chocolates. Each\nchocolate is shaped into little flowers or\nleaves and emits a fruity aroma, mixed with\nthe warm scent that only cocoa could provide.\nThere would be five kinds of white, milk and\ndark chocolate, each truffle drizzled with a\nmix of all three delicacies, which would\neasily melt in ones mouth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wytchlings.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Venison Chili", "A bowl of hearty chili. Thick and delicious,\nupon initial taste it has a rich earthy\nflavour, which gives way to aromas of\ncoriander, paprika, a hint of cinnanom and\nred-eye chillies. The dark brown stew-like\nchili also contains diced onions, thickly\nchopped bell peppers and rough cubes of\nvenison, which fall apart in the mouth from\nhours of cooking on a low heat. A pleasant\nspicy flavour clings to the mouth and warms\nthe belly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Jasmine Tea", "This delectable organic tea is made from the\nlong and graceful leaves of the tea plant\nwith slender silver buds which are hand\nrolled into tight pearls. After completion,\nthese pearls are infused with fresh Jasmine\nblossoms producing a delicately perfumed tea\nwith the typical well-roundedness of the\ndominant green tea leaves.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Hammer", "A broad-headed mallet, with an thick\nnine-inch haft. The head appears to be made\nfrom polished stone, shaped into a chunky\ncuboid. In total it weighs about 6lbs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Itinwood Prosthetic Arm", "A wooden prosthetic arm designed to replace a\nmissing limb from the shoulder downwards. The\ndense hardwood makes for a heavy, but solid\nstructure and possesses a rich dark colour,\npunctuated with careful grooves formed in the\nwood filled with a hardened resin, containing\nKuila dust, which forms the ilmyumier of the\nAureon Seed. The elbow and fingers have been\ngrown to form hinged joints. The wrist\noperates on a socket joint, allowing for\nnatural movement. A Druid could sense the arm\nis living.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:log2", ""),
        StaticItem("Artic Mists", "A greater potion of Arctic Mist, does not\nfreeze through clothing but will feel very\ncold as it can reach temparatures far below\nthe freezing point. It reacts to motion and\nquickly form a mists that freezes anything in\nthe mist's vicinity, caus ing frostbites that\nare unknown to those with lower alchemical\nknowledge. Steel would turn brittle, air\ncrispening, skin numbing and even breaking if\nclose enough, water almost instantly\nfreezing, exposed blood might also.Lasts for\n15 seconds before ending\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Alitruist.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Waterskin", "The dark brown leather is etched with a\ncollage of flowers and vines, signifying the\nAspect Cerridwen. At the base of the skin,\nthe inscription reads \"Water of Life\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GaiaLoTC.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Willow Bonzai Tree", "A beautiful and masterfully shaped Willow\nBonzai Tree that appears to be planted in a\nbucket. Upon closer inspection you'd find\nit's soil is much shallower and tools for\nupkeep are kept hidden in the bottom of the\nbucket.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Venus Flytrap", "A strange plant with leaves that form mouths\nwith thin, needle-like 'teeth'. Whenever\nsomething touches the insides of the leaves,\nthey close and secrete an enzyme to break\ndown their prey.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Ring", "A band of polished iron, covered with small\ngrooves that twist and turn like vines across\nthe metal and making it much lighter and\nelegant. Set in the center is a singular pink\ngemstone, glittering at all those who look\nupon it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ElevenJellyBeans.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Nature Phoenix Feather", "A large, leaf-like feather, gleaming with a\nsharp tip but soft edge as one would touch\nit, it would be a fine sign of trust from a\ncertain phoenix.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by A_Keefy.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ohowaki Circlet", "A sturdy and soft rope circlet, small elven\nprayers painted along the fibres of the rope.\nFixated to where the back would sit on one's\nhead, sat two pristine owl feathers. A\nperfect headress for any Priest or Priestess\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kythaela Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Amaethon'leh Elorsohaen", "A beautiful recurve bow, the limbs of which\nresemble the antlers of a stag, curling\nprongs have been carved or perhaps grown from\nthe yew wood. When unstrung, the recurved\nstave reaches a length of fifty-eight inches.\nThe wood possesses a richer, darker colour\nthan that of unstained yew, for the bow had\nbeen treated with boiled linseed oil to\nprotect it from moisture. Felted leather had\nbeen wrapped neatly about the grip, to ensure\nboth comfort and a firm hold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Elk Skull", "A recently cleaned and skinned elk skull.\nIt's not perfectly clean, there are bits and\nflecks of mud, or residual meat left on it.\nMost of it is scraped off, though.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Karin Plushie", "Sporting two tails and horns this small cat\nplush is sewn from black tinted hide, and\nfilled with wool stuffing. A small face is\nsewn on with white thread making it look like\nthe karin was smiling. It is soft to the\ntouch and perfect for hugging.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lyadrian Des'Nox.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A sign from the Aspects.", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Indigo Present", "A wide cuboid-shaped stiff parcel, wrapped\nwith plum purple paper and finished with a\ncloth ribbon, metallic pink in colour. If\nshaken, the contents makes no noise\nwhatsoever. A tag reads, \"Hareven, Merry\nKrugsmas. With love from Niv.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Task Painting", "The painting depicts Cerridwen standing in a\nlush forest, surrounded by beautiful flora\nand young fauna. It then blends to a deep\npink twilight of Cernunnos standing in a tree\nabove a group of wolves eating their prey.\nThey all stand in a wicked and dark looking\nforest. In the final frame is a dark and dead\nforest, full of animal skeletons. A single,\nspider bodied woman stands as a silhouette, a\nshadow in the back. She isn't detailed or\ndepicted beyond this.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ChrisChroma.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Dream Catcher", "A dream catcher created from the bones of an\nanimal. The bones have teal markings running\nover their length. The strings within the\ncenter are a deep ocean blue, that turn to a\nsky blue in the center. Feathers and sea\nshells hang from the dream catcher. There is\nan inscription along the bones, it reads \"May\nyour dreams be well and without fright, for\nin the dark is where the monsters spread\ntheir blight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rakai.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Sippy Cup", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Aspects know what U Cookin", "", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Draugr Tongue", "", "minecraft:orange_tulip", ""),
        StaticItem("Kink Rope", "★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Loremaster Of Kink.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Irrin'sil", "A crystalline-esque near transparent\ndouble-edged blade. It was forged using a\nblue-steel alloy tempered carefully. The\nlength of the blade was 40 inches long and\nwas thinner along its edges. It had a diamond\nshaped cross-section whilst its guard was in\nthe shape of a narrow 'W'. The guard itself\nwas crafted with a lighter material, that of\niron-wood. Heat treated in Tung-seed oil. The\nhandle was wrapped with delicately interwoven\ndark-tanned leather, etched with the letter,\nՏ.\n－ https://tinyurl.com/lotc-id3 －\n.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the Bronze Elf,\n- Sali", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kava Tea", "A somewhat unpleasant but also sweet tea that\nhelps soothe nerves and relax the body.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Scrap cloth", "Perfectly sized for a tiny blanket!", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidically Enhanced Drilltongue", "A tough cluster of vines. If unraveled, one\nwould find the durability of each vine to be\nfar beyond what it normally should be. Small\npurple flowers are present, dotted around.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Native Wedding Feather", "A flower with three white petals,\nlending a feather-like apperance\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Native Minister.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ithuriel's Staff", "The tiniest little Druid staff you've ever\nseen. Eight inches long, and quite thin--\npractically a twig with a rounded end at the\ntop. It's decorated with white feathers that\nspan half of its length, with glittering bits\nof amber encrusted in the top. Carvings too\nsmall to perceive span its length. Druids\nperceive a sense of life radiating from the\nminiscule implement.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiny Wooden Cup", "A small, hand-carved cup made from oak wood.\nIt has a little handle on the side, and there\nare tiny grooves along its height from where\nthe whittling tool carved it down to size.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eranikus.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ithuriel's Miniature Crossbow", "This small crossbow would be a very small\none-handed weapon to most people, but is\nsized to the stature of the druid Ithuriel.\nIt is a solid, grown piece from a single\nbranch of birchwood, the stirrup and Lath are\nstyled as leafed branches, the string is a\nseries of thin vines woven and grown together\nto make a strong cord. The body is carved to\nresemble a tree's bark covered trunk, the\nWinterleaf craftsman's mark on the underside.\nAll the pieces are still living, like an\nawakened staff of sorts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ithuriel's Harp", "This tiny harp has been grown from a single\npiece of red oak, sized specifically for the\nsmall stature of Ithuriel. It has engravings\nof vines and leaves across its body, and\nfifteen short strings that give a higher\npitch. A small engraving of the Winterleaf\ncraftsmans' symbol would be on the back, with\nIthuriel's name carved there as well.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lillith Winterleaf.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Life Gem", "A faint blackish smog leaks forth from this\ngem, which actively seeks out life. Those\nthat come in contact with the smog would feel\nthemselves weakening to it's embrace, while\nplants would begin to slow wither away.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Adniel.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Frog Friend", "A very large frog, which follows around\nspecific people. Ribbit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Large Frog.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("⍇⍃⌻⌺⌻⍄⍈ ⌷ Ｃｈａｒｍ ⌷ ｏｆ ⌷ Ｙｅｕ＇ｓ ⌷ Ｗａｒｍｔｈ ⌷ ⍇⍃⌻⌺⌻⍄⍈", "A small bronze figurine made in the image of\na aengullic being, that gives off a magical\nwarmth. The figurine is 3 inches tall, and\nweighs 250 grams. The figurine depicts a\nsimplistic image of a 4 armed, winged, one\neyed woman. One pair of the woman's hands is\nclasped together infront of her waist in a\npraying position, whilst the other pair of\narms is raised upwards. The woman bears no\nvisible mouth, and only one eye. There is a\n⨂' shape where her other eye should be. 4\nsimple wings come off her back, 2 above her\nshoulders, and 2 below. The wings are flat,\nand look like arch shaped wafers coming from\nit's back. The charm radiates a notable\nwarmth in a one meter radius, making it feel\nas if one is in the summer sun.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:totem_of_undying", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Silver Necklace", "An elegantly made silver necklace rests in\nyour hands, upon the end would be a\nbeautifully crafted duck. The eyes being made\nfrom small carefully cut emeralds. Should a\ndruid be wearing this when using their gifts,\nthe necklace would give off a soft purple\nglow. This would be made possible due to\nkuila dust being added into the metal. On the\nback of the duck would be the engraved\nmarking of a tree with the word \"Ith\" on the\ntrunk.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Moonlight Druid] Eryn N Aureon.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Duckie Plushie", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Present", "A teeny tiny cuboid parcel, which could fit\nin the palm of the average Descendant.\nWrapped in black paper and tied with a cloth\nribbon, an emerald green in colour. A tag\nreads, \"Larionnii, Merry Krugsmas. With love\nfrom Nivndil.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Plagued Staff", "A staff shaped object cloaked in a thick\nblack hide with a rough texture and many\nrips, revealing a sharp long black spine from\na beast, bent and twisted into shape. At the\nend is a sharp, rough textured claw, able to\npierce someones skin easily. At the top of\nthe staff is an eye, forced onto the spine,\nstaring at the holder no matter what they do.\nAsh' is carved into the thick hide at the\nhandle of the staff, a pair of sharp fangs\ndangling from the edge of the staff.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Forever Glow", "This bottle contains a thick fluid that\nproduces a soft light. A label on the bottom\nidentifies it a 'Forever Glow', an alchemical\nmixture that will never expire. There is a\nwarning not to drink it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Caraway", "This flower can easily be identified by its\nfeathery leaves and main stem that supports\numbrels of small white or pink flowers. It\ntypically grows in warm and sunny locations\nthat hold rich soil. The fruit it produces is\nparticularly aromatic and can be used in a\nculinary style for spices or as part of\nherbal preparations for its protective\nproperties, increase of libido and general\nwell-being of one's person.", "minecraft:allium", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiritual Bath Salts", "This small container holds a crystalline\nsubstance which can be dissolved in water to\nperfume and soften it. These bath salts mimic\nthe natural properties of mineral baths or\nhot springs. As the bath salts mix with your\nbath water, purple swirls give off a\nfragrance of Myrrh, Frankincense, and\nSandalwood.", "minecraft:magenta_dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Pendant", "A somewhat round stone pendant which has a\ncircle carved into the center.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Elwen's Art Book", "An old leather-bound book held closed by a\nblue sash adorned with a silver clasp. When\nopened, there are many well-drawn pictures of\nfantastical events and realms long past, as\nwell as portraits of people, mostly elves. It\nis well cared for, though rather ordinary,\nbearing no enchantments or special\nproperties; it is simply a book full of\nbeautiful art.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roxforbraynz.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Scale Arm-Guard", "This arm guard would be made mostly out of\nMeteorite steel and cockatrice scales ,\ngiving it a blueish-blackish tint. The scales\nwould cover most of the upper section of the\narm guard while the black meteorite steel\nwould cover the rest. At the back of the hand\nof the arm guard would be an engraved three\nheaded hydra, indicating its creator.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Gusmarzku.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Walnut Druidic Staff", "This beautiful stave's shaft seems to be made\nof walnut and entertwined with another softer\nwood. As it made it's way up, it seems it was\nwrapped in dried vines that tied their way\nabout the entirety of the hardwood staff. At\nthe top, it would end into what seemed to be\na crescent moon. Within the center was a raw\nchunk of emerald that seemed to be cut in a\nnon geometic form. The precious gem seemed to\nbe held within the center by the same vines\nthat coated the staff itself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by VenymNyx.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Walking Stick", "", "", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystaline flower", "", "minecraft:oxeye_daisy", ""),
        StaticItem("Haler'okar", "A fine steel shortsword, the blade curved and\npointed at the end. Along the side of the\nblade fine elven swirls would be carefully\nchiseled in and smoothed out, a finishing\ntouch of the veteran smith.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Remembrancer’s Sword", "A double-edged sword made of iron with a\nleather wrapped hilt. The sword notably lacks\na crossguard, and bears a blue ribbon tied\nright above the hilt. Though elegant, its\nedge is well sharpened, and despite its\nceremonial appearance it is still more than\nsuitable for use in battle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arveldir Des'Nox.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ahern'ii", "An ornate luminous aurum dagger. The blade\nwould curve gently inwards towards the edge,\nwhich would be as sharp as sin. The hilt\nwould be a nice, varnished dark oak, a thin\naurum trim going along the upper and lower\nends of the hilt, ending in a round aurum\npommel. Though a dagger, it'd be nothing to\nscoff at, the blade ending at about a 10 inch\nlength. On the bottom of the pommel would be\na single swirly initial. A~\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Acal'ilum", "A luminous aurum nandao blade. It’d be much\nshorter than a regular nandao, meant to be\nheld in one hand only. The hilt would be\nwrapped in a tough leather, dyed blue and\nblack striped pattern, and the pommel would\nbe a simple ring, its only use to keep the\nsword from slipping out of the user's hand.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Uhier'tillun", "A steel bastard sword. It would have a nice\nlight weight to it, flowing evenly as it\nmoved within the user's hand. Carved\ncarefully into the flat of the blade would be\ngentle elven swirls, smoothed out. The hilt\nwould be wrapped in fine black leather.\nPlaced on the pommel on either side would be\ntwo finely cut peridots, the work of an adept\nstonemason.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Avanite Dove", "", "minecraft:quartz_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Mug o' Rum", "", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Butter Churn", "A large wooden cylinder and paddle used for\nturning milk into butter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("its literally a mushroom", "", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Cider", "Alike its counterpart, the glass has been\nrefined to imitate your stereotypical Witches\nvial. Ripe with an orange substance that too,\nbubbles consistently with an alluring mixture\nof cider and pumpkin extract; truly, a\nmasterpiece of the Halloween spirit. This\ncider was brewed, bottled, and labelled by\nthe avant-garde Saelian of Linandria.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Velvet Cookies", "Decadent and warm, these cookies would be\nquite filling and extra delicious.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("White Lace Doily", "A doily made of white lace, with a 4 way\nsymmetircal design. Completly useless and\nprobably very difficult to make, it is still\na aesthetically pleasing ornament, suitable\nfor decoration wherever one would find merit\nputting it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Unicorn Plush", "Stitched delicately, with the white\nhorse-like being holding a pink horn atop its\nhead, a pair of blue-button eyes stare out\nfrom the unicorn plushy. It would carry a\ngoofy modicum of the grace it's real\ncounterpart holds, the stitch-work detailed,\nwith the plush slightly stiffer than most of\nit's make to keep the shape of it's horn\nintact, lest small children break it off\nplaying.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hareven Lorenthus.", "minecraft:white_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Shadbush Sapling", "Amelanchier, also known as shadbush, shadwood\nor shadblow, serviceberry or sarvisberry, or\njust sarvis, juneberry, saskatoon, sugarplum\nor wild-plum, and chuckley pear is a genus of\nabout 20 species of deciduous-leaved shrubs\nand small trees in the Rose family\n(Rosaceae).Amelanchier is native to temperate\nregions of the colder Hemispheres, growing\nprimarily in early successional habitats.", "minecraft:birch_sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Pellis de Serpentum", "This elegant glass vial contains an ashen\ngray tonic, corked off and sealed. A muted\nbitter aroma releases when opened. Should the\nmix be injested, it would cause one's skin to\nstain permanently ash gray. Side effects\ninclude: Mild irritation and secretions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Earth_Evocation.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sturdy Leather Backpack", "A Brown leather backpack held closed by a\nflap and buckle. It can easily carry books or\nother belongings. Worn over one shoulder or\nboth. Inside it's innitialed C.T.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dwyn Tinuvial.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Sundisc", "A small wooden disc, given an eccentric\nbright yellow paint job to look similar to\nthe sun, even with bits of glowstone into the\nmix as to glow in the dark. If thrown\nhorizontally, the disc would glide through\nthe air, effectively a wooden frisbee.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:sunflower", ""),
        StaticItem("Plush Lettuce Giraffe", "A handsewn plush depicting a long necked\ngiraffe with fluffy long ears, green and\ntanned like the leaves of a plant. Its face\nis set in an unending smile, the plush's eyes\nlittle black beads.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dwyn.", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Potato Skins", "Small red skinned potatoes that have been\noven roasted and cut in half. The pulp mixed\nwith chives, cheese and bits of bacon before\nbeing broiled in the oven again.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Barley Bread", "A small, circular loaf of bread made with\nhoney and barley flour. The bread bears a\nvaguely salty sweet taste. The outside of the\nloaf is somewhat flakey, whilst the inside\nbears a softer texture. The bread bears a\nbrownish crust, and a yellowish tan inside.\nThe loaf of bread is 4 inches high, and 8\ninches in diameter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Breadsmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Orchids", "Usually given to one who\nis already in a relationship,\nthis bouquet would signify\nthe desire to keep a long lasting\nand stead relationship.", "minecraft:blue_orchid", ""),
        StaticItem("Fishing Spear", "A wooden spear meant for fishing. Two prongs\nat the end are sharpened to points. Around\nthe shaft there are leather strips meant as\ngrips. The whole spear is about an inch and a\nhalf in diameter.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Coloring Book", "This book is filled with outlines of\npictures, including no colors at all. Seems\nlike the perfect gift for a child that likes\nplaying with colors.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JuniperSelkie.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Cuban Cigar", "This cigar is fat, filled with tabacco, and\ndone in the style of Cuban Cigars.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Viltaren.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Pig Hide", "A very undamaged pelt of a large Greymane\nBoar, its only harm would be a hole near its\nspine from some sort of damage.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 00000Gae_Frogs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Barbu'barbu'barbu", "A basic steel knife, sharp on the bottom edge\nof the blade, meant more for utility than\nfighting. The hilt would be wrapped tightly\nin a dark brown, almost black leather.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arveldir Des'Nox.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Padded Play Sticks", "A small aspen wood stick with a thick\ncylinder of cloth wrapped around the end,\nuseful for playtime with other children. It\nis useful for drumming against things, or\neven as a playmace, unharming for all but the\nstrongest of adult-strength blows.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Lined Cloak", "A leather cloak lined on the inside with\nthick, soft wolf fur. It's clasped together\nby a emblazoned broach, a stag on a mountain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dwyn Tinuvial.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sewn Warrior Doll", "A small stuffed doll made of dyed linen. It\nappears to be a snow-skinned man, with grey\narmor, and helmet with horns on it. It is a\nplush doll, and despite what can be seen as a\nharsh exterior, its surprisingly soft, with a\nsmiling, gentle face ,black button eyes sewn\nonto it's visage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Letter of Allowance", "I, Regent Lady Steward Amuril Des'Nox, herby\ngrant Olnin amnesty and protections under the\nnew laws of Caras Eldar, capital of the\nDominion. I also hearby grant Olnin\ntemporary, pusuedo-citizenship to allow for\nfree and equal opportunity within the borders\nof the Dominion of Malin. This entails fair\nand equal treatment both professionally,\nfinancially, and morally while also placing\nthe actions of Olnin criminally in the hands\nof the local law enforcement officers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lady Steward Regent Amuril Des'Nox.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Mask Permission Slip", "The individual known as Acaele is allowed to\nwear his wooden mask within the lands of\nElvenesse.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by High Prince, Belestram Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspectu de Serpentum", "This elegant glass vial contains a deep\ncrimson tonic, corked off and sealed. A stark\nearthy aroma wafts out when opened. Should\nthe mix be injested, it would cause one's\nirises to stain permanently red. Side effects\ninclude: Temporary loss of vision and a mild\nheadache.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Earth_Evocation.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Cherry Wine", "Sweet Cherry Wine for my Sweet Cherry Wine", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ginger Root Tea", "A warm, home steeped tea, compromised of\nginger root, honey, mint leaves and lemon\njuice. Perfect for relieving any symptoms of\nnausea and improving digestion\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kythaela Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Slime Plushie", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Horse Hide", "The tanned hide of a brown wild horse.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Eagle Feather", "Evidently a large feather harvested from an\neagle's wing. It boasts a brilliant and\ncolorful array of brown, black and white in a\ngradient meeting into the boney bristle.\nFeatherless bone display some scriptures only\ndiscernable by the owner.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern-Shaped Stick", "This stick appears to have been lightly\ncarved so that the end appears to resemble a\nwyvern, and the branch is a rather\nluminescent white, white to such an extent\nthat it may even hurt your eyes slightly to\nlook at it if the sun is high in the sky.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Sister Tsunami ❤", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceriddwen Statuette", "A small statuette depiciting the Aspect\nCeriddwen, intricately designed with\nexpertise and precise carvings. A truly\nbeautiful piece of artwork.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden flute", "A beautifully carved flute made from a cherry\ntree branch. All along the flute itself are\nbeautiful floral carvings that appear to be\nthe result of hours of work. The beauty\ndoesn't end there though for the music played\nfrom the instrument would also be beautiful\nonce the person playing it learnt how to use\nit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DrususTheDumb.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Stick Wrapped in Flower Triva", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Erin's Dagger", "A pretty, silver butchers knife lies in your\nhand. The silver was sharpened quite nicely,\nmaking the knife quite effective at cutting\nup pieces of meat and descendants alike. The\nhandle, which is made of dark oak wood lies\ncomfortably within your hand. The name “Erin”\nis engraved in the silver, near the handle,\nindicating the owner.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arockstar26.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rupert's Slayer Steel Longsword", "A slayer steel longsword, masterfully forged\nand sharpened to the point one can shave with\nit. The crossguard and the pommel have sharp,\naurum ends, adding to the versatility of the\nweapon. The hilt is made of dark oak, and has\nRupert' engraved into it in artsy letters.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ink and Quill Writing Set", "A custom made Quill, made from a beautifully\nlarge black feather. The inks the set came\nwith were colored. Black, Orange, Yellow and\nBlue. They were boxed together in an ornate\nwooden container on which the Loden House\nshield was etched.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Emberthorn Sword [T3]", "Short sword made of steel with ornaments on\nthe hilt, on the middle of it a ideogram\ncould be seen, it has the shape of a rhombus\nwith other smalls rhombus that look like\nspikes, if the ideogram is tapped it would\ninvoke a layer of golden soulfire along with\nthe blade with small spikes made of the same\nsoulfire, the fire would burn the tissues of\nbeings of corrupted soul and cause them\nunbearable pain. (( 2 emotes are needed to\ninvoke the soulfire, msg Suxals for more\ninformation ))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fennic Fighting Staff", "A finely made staff, crafted by the masterful\nsmiths of Fenn. The shaft would be hand\ncrafted out of Elder Spruce, its wood left\nslighty rough to allow its user to keep a\nstrong grip. The ends of the staff would be\nforged from Iron, hardened to deal a heavy\nblow against those at its other end.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Necklace of Lorraine", "A lavashly adorned necklace forged from the\npurest gold of Oren's mines. A cross hangs\nfrom the chain that hooks it in place, the\nformer engraved for texture whilst the chain\nstyles a comfortable, classic design. The\njewel serves to demonstrate your devotion to\nthe Church, funds will be donated upon\npurchase.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Zaza's Zawa Liquor", "Its a fifth of some sorta hallucinagenic\nbooze. Drink it and trip balls, what more\ncould you want from a drink?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Vertillian Infinite Sweet Mead", "Deliciously sweet honey mead, plenty strong.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by AstralPlatinum.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Oak Music Box", "A Finely Crafted Music Box, made of Oak Wood.\nThe Music Box would be decorated with Designs\nof Branches and Leaves, filled with Green\nGlass. Once Opened, the Box would emit soft\nsounds, Perfect for falling asleep to.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Edrahil Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Simple Wedding Ring", "A ring carved out of an old gnarled oak,\nclearly very old in age.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ivoryyy_.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Plushie", "A stuffed rabbit with foax fur. It is\nsoft to the touch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheRiddleSphynx.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Poop", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Elephant Plushie", "An old stuffed elephant, that has obviously\nbeen the favorite toy of a little girl\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Dark Elven Warrior", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cotton Candy on a Stick", "Delicious strawberry flavored cotton candy on\na stick.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by COTTON CANDY MAN DAN.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Rosewood Lute", "a 5 string guitar like instrument. The\ngeometry of the lute soundbored is relativly\ncomplex, itd have a system of bearings that\nplaces braces perpendicular to the strings at\nspecific lengths.The stringes insutrument\nwould have a unique sound , it would be\nalmost aluring when someone would play it\ncorrectly. On the neck of the lute would be\nthe Initals M.Luf.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MayRndz.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Yellow Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Magenta Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Tree Ornament", "", "minecraft:player_head", ""),
        StaticItem("Doughnuts", "A delicious looking doughtnut, baked to\nperfection by an expert baker. Upon ingesting\nthe delectable treat, it would taste of\nraspberries, sweet but tangy! Though, once\neaten, one would begin to feel a dull, but\nnoticeable high encroaching on them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor Al'Abass.", "minecraft:cookie", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_45(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Brownies", "A perfectly baked pastry, made by what seemed\nto be a skilled baker. Upon smelling the\ntreat, it would fill one's senses with a\nsweet but tangy scent. Once eaten, one would\nbegin to feel the same effects as if they had\ntaken a hit of Babys Brain. The effects\nwouldn't be as strong, but they'd still be\nthere, and for onlookers it'd be hilarious to\nwatch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor Al'Abass.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Satchel", "A sturdy, well stitched, tanned and treated,\nleather satchel, with a sky blue button\npinned to it. The inside would be lined with\nwool, keeping things safe when placed inside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elinor Al'Abass.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Pan Flute", "A typical looking pan flute, excellently\ncrafted by hand, finely tuned to emit a\nbeautiful sound. Upon the top side of the\nflute were images of rain drops and flora\netched into the wood, and on the underside\nalong the piece that held the instrument\ntogether was the name \"Elinor Al'abass\ncarved into the wood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Demigryph.", "minecraft:sugar_cane", ""),
        StaticItem("Sorrow Blade", "This expertly crafted blade had a hard wooden\nhandel with a grip for top two fingers. Above\nthe handel was a little hilt on one side of\nthe dagger shortsword, this had a small part\nwhere swords could get stuck often. The blade\ntook a snake like curve, a small signature in\nunreadable text, at the end of the snake\nshaped blade was a very sharp point, both\nsides of the blade are sharpened. Made of\nReinforced Steel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Shepherd's Staff", "A lengthy and sturdy wych elm hewn crook,\nreaching well over six feet in length. Along\nthe staff's gamut are small etchings and\ncarved knots, which convene in a helical\nshape at the pointed tip of the crook's\ncurve. The staff is swaddled in flowering\nvines.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blistering Fungal Fumes", "A small ceramic jar sealed with a cork\nstopper. Growing inside is a self-contained\nculture of blistering toad fungus, which\nsubsists upon a small bed of compost, cocoa\nbeans and bark. If opened, one would find a\nsquat red mushroom sitting inside. When\ndisturbed, the 'shroom will dispense a cloud\nof ember-orange spores, which painfully\ncorrode the soft tissue of the throat and\nairways. The effectiveness of these spores\nhas been amplified using Druidic Gifts. (T4)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Steamy Romance Novel", "This book appears blank and innocent on the\noutside, but within its pages are contained\nthe details of a fantastical whirlwind affair\nbetween two men.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Elm Tree Carving", "A small statue of an elm tree, hewn from the\nvery same wood it is depicted in. Along the\nroots to the canopy, the carving is minutely\ncarved, thin engravings across the body to\nsignify bark, and individual leaves.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Shepherd & The Stallion", "Within your hands rests a small but detailed\nwooden carving. The carvings etched into a\ndark ebony wood, and it depicts a tall bulky\nman, with a shepherds crook in his hand, and\na tall beautiful stallion standing next to\nhim. The shepherds hand resting upon the\nstallions back, calming the horse down.\nDruids can sense a small amount of druidic\nenergy stored within the heart of the\ncarving.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:log2", ""),
        StaticItem("poopy bread", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Panda Mask", "A small helmet like mask, the perfect size\nfor a child. At each side of the mask would\nbe cute teddy like ears of that of a panda\nand on the nose would be a small little\nbutton\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Polar Bear Plushie", "A soft and cuddly Polar Bear plushie. When\nheld it would feel warm to the touch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("An Especially Picked Daisy!", "A rather large daisy rests in your hand,\nthough commonly found in the visor of Hyrja.\nThe petals would bloom with life and smells\noddly wonderful - this flower was picked by\nDariyah Rovin for Ms Daisy!", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon Chalk", "This bright lemon yellow chalk easily stays\non skin once it makes contact!", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Participation Ribbon", "Congratulations! You've participated in one\nof the many contests that took place at the\nBlue Moon Festival. Give yourself a pat on\nthe back.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("White Bokolo Plushie", "A massive white bokolo plush, extremely soft\nand one of a kind", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Checkers Piece", "This small golden checkers piece is said to\nbring good luck to those whom hold it. Or at\nleast that's what the gossipers say!", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Crepe", "This chocolate crepe is neatly wrapped,\nfilled with a yummy cream and drizzled with\nmelted chocolate and crushed nuts! If one bit\ninto this yummy desert, they would find that\nthey constantly make random animal noises\nwhen they try to speak. This lasts for 15\n(irl) minutes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("A bag of skittles", "A bag of skittles.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Ring", "", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sapphire Chalk", "This dark, shimmering sapphire colored chalk\neasily stays on skin once it makes\ncontact!for both the blue", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Handful of Seeds", "A handful of seeds, perfect for feeding stray\nbokolos.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rella101.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Shogging Shovel Of The Light And Day", "An all powerful Shogging Shovel\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("A Signed Rag", "A signed rag, with 'Pasquale Calabreeni\nwritten in very faint ink.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("CAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKE", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xalid.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Raven: True Loyalty", "A short story written by Corvus Keint\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.\nSignature: Corvus Keint", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Belvitz Tax Papers", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by TrendE.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Pay Slip", "A single pay slip issued to Legionairres on a\nweekly basis. Each slip is redeemable for 25\nminas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nonival.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackjack", "A sturdy blackjack, made of a metal pipe\nencased by black leather. It featured a strap\nat the end, through one could put their hand\nto prevent loss during a fight. It would be\nan effective bludgeoning weapon.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Grilled Kielbasa and Cabbage", "Grilled Waldenian sausage, salted, marinated\nand cooked to perfection. It would be\naccompanying it would be cabbage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Watch of Embers", "A golden pocket watch that, when touched by\nthose of impure souls, will burst into a\nbloom of emerald flames and burn their flesh\nand bones with Auengelic ferocity. (OOC:\nEnchanted with a T5 Emberthorne)", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Freshly Picked Flowers with a Card", "Freshly picked flowers, accompanying it would\nbe a card, \"Missed you Mama! Love Rommie\nwould be on the card\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Bauernbrot", "Freshly baked Bauernbrot, a staple side of\nmany dishes. Butter is often times\naccompanied with it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Waldenian Potato Salad", "An old recipe Waldenian Potato Salad is a\ndish often served at feasts and gatherings.\nIt would have assorted spices and bits of\nvarious meats in it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StackLoot.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Greatsword of Brandished Wrath", "This blade would have many illegible runes in\na language unknown engraved down the base of\nthe ebony shaft, upon battle they would\nalight allowing the blade a blue glow, and\nfreezing the user's palm forcing the blade to\nnever leave their hands until they falter in\nbattle (Death.) (Unshaking Grip)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dalek's Revenge", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tempest", "This peculiar blade is made up of Arcanic\nenergies, which are akin to the finest Steel.\nSimilar to an Arcanist's abilities the blade\nitself takes the color of it's weilder's\naura. A large diamond gem rests within the\ncenter of it's Magegold hilt, along with\nvaring arcanic wisps adorning it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Damascus Steel Gladius", "A Damascus steel gladius with a tapered\npoint. The handle of the weapon is made from\nDark-ash wood, treated with boiled Tung oil.\nThe entire blade was only 30 inches.The\ngladius' handle provided a solid grip by a\nknobbed hilt with ridges for the fingers. Its\ncrossguard was rhomboidal, consisting of the\nsteel tang and the Dark-ash wood handle. This\nweapon weighs approximately 2 pounds. It's\nblade was darkened, a near black surface.\n[[Ｔｈｉｓ ｗｅａｐｏｎ ｉｓ ｐｕｒｐｏｓｅｄ ｆｏｒ ｈａｃｋｉｎｇ ａｎｄ\nｓｌａｓｈｉｎｇ. Ａ ｇｌａｄｉｕｓ ｃａｎ ｉｎｆｌｉｃｔ ｗｏｕｎｄｓ ｔｈａｔ\nｍａｙ ｃａｕｓｅ ｌｉｍｂｓ ｔｏ ｂｅ ｄｅｐａｒｔｅｄ ｆｒｏｍ ｔｈｅ\nｂｏｄｙ.]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Emil.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Azienda", "Azienda was made from a Aurum-Ferum alloy,\nthis ornate blade sports a bejeweled pommel,\na bone hilt. Bearing the words of house\nd’Montelliano, 'It’s just business' in\nIllatian, the guard of this blade is a broad\none.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Draco Galeati", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Draco Ocrearum", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:golden_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Sword of Antonius", "Soulbound II\nThe golden inlaid Zweihänder of Antonius\nHoren. When Antonius was banished to Aeldin\nby his father King Aurelius, the blade was\nleft to his son Mariusz for one purpose; to\nbehead Eimar the fat.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Draco Pectus", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:golden_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Draco Tabernus", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:golden_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("A Miniature Portrait", "This miniature portrait of a woman with fair\nhair and grey eyes, small enough to fit in\none's palm, is painted in minute detail by\npracticed hands. The small token is bordered\nby a thin rim of gold, inscribed with the\nwords: \"So I may always be with you.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Flame Ward Ring", "Magic Resistance I\nArcane I\nAn arcaurum ring bejeweled in fine flawless\ndiamonds all around its loop. It shimmers\nwith unseen power, imbued with arcane\npotential. If one is to wear this ring a T3\nward against fire evocation is shrouded\ninvisibly around their form, dampening\nattacks of that variety for a limited amount\nof power. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skinning Knife", "A skinning knife.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvernbone Armor", "A beautiful set of wyvernbone armor lies in\nyour hand. It would cover about the same area\nas a set of plate armor would, and be more\ndurable than plate, but also heavier. It\nfeatured finishes on the edge of each slab of\nwyvernplate, which was magnificently studded\nwith gems, giving it a fancy appearance. The\narmor would have some degree of\nfire-resistance, and the bone would be\nslightly sturdier than steel!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Kadarsi Royal Sigil", "A small copy of the Kharadeen Sigil. made of\npresious jewels. A esteemed gift given as a\nsign of Friendship.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("1  SECRET DRINK [663] 1", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("【 Cristal ◆ Rosé 】", "The rosé champagne is announced with a rich\nbouquet of fruity and floral aromas,\nenhancing the vivacious nature given by its\nbrilliant grapefruit-pink color. Although the\npalate is dominated by flavors of red fruit,\nthe subtle brioche and woody notes deliver a\ncrisp yet complex finish. Perfect blending of\nchardonnay and red still wines boasts the\ndrink's festive nature. The bottle shape\nresembles an elongated diamond, sparkling\nbrightly as it reflects light off its many\nfaces. Made exclusive for the Imperial\nWedding of 1689.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wonk Head on Jungle Wood Panel", "Taxidermy Wonk head mounted on to a jungle\nwood panel. It appears the frog like creature\ncaught the wrong end of the blade of some\ntrophy hunter. Great decoration for the\nparlor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclops Eye in a Jar", "A cyclops eye floating around in a dark rum\nfilled, larger than usual jar. It's massive\nsize is only glimpse at the creature it once\nbelonged to. Used for 'alternative medicines\nor for display.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Master Bobo.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Concubine Coupon", "This coupon entitles you to one free\nconcubine for a month.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Architecus.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Creamcake", "A cake made with love from Octavia. The icing\nwould be a bit scattered and messy!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Powerful Qalasheen Bow", "A Powerful Qalasheen Bow Reinforced with\nQalasheen Steel, the draw weight of this\nmighty bow is 80 pounds. A thorn bristle\ndesign covering it, matching the Shamshir.\nThe string would hold strong. The handle\nwould be cushioned and feel comfortable when\npulling the strings on the bow back.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("A Magnificent Qalasheen Shamshir", "Crafted with Kadarsi steel. A design of thorn\nbristles would cover the face of the blade,\nmatching the qalasheen bow. The hilt a\nbeautiful piece with an assortment of gems in\nthe center. The shamshir would be light, the\ncurve perfect. Overall a superb sword, meant\nto be wielded by royalty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Qalasheen Falcons", "The Qalasheen Falcon is 22 in length with a\nwingspan of 51 in. Its mighty broad blunt\nwings give it a shadow similar to gyrfalcon,\nbut its plumage is more similar to a lanner\nfalcon, as it is precise and deadly. This\nQalasheen Falcon has a brown upperbellie and\ncontrasting grey flight feathers. The head\nand underparts are paler brown, with\nstreaking from the breast down. It is swift\nand powerful, as it’s talons are of 5 inches\nof terror.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cuirass of Penance", "An aurum-ferum alloy chainmail set with an\nornate and jewel covered chestplate.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("GF de Narth", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Billy's Special Soup", "", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Enchanted Electrical Sword", "A sword with a diamond attached to the pomel\nof the blade. When one taps the diamond it\nglows a green aura, activating it and imbuing\nthe blade of the sword electricity. (Takes\n1-2 emotes to activate) (Has 10 charges\nbefore it has to be recharged) [PM Nekkore\nfor info]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Smoking Pipe", "A smoking pipe of seemingly elf origins, it\nis carved from wood with a blue jewel bowl.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("◈ Enforced Shackles ◈", "A pair of iron shackles, designed to cover\nthe hands completely and making it near to\nimpossible to move any fingers around. The\nsigil of the Ministry for Magical Affairs\nrests on the front of each shackle, while\nseveral locks on the lower side keep the\nshackles fixated.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:cobblestone_wall", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Baton", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Reformed Gamer League Cookie", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Crozzier of High Pontiff Daniel V", "", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Silken Sash", "A soft, pink sash made of the finest silk.\nThe letters 'WINNER' would be neatly\nembroidered in fine white letters. The sash\nwould be given to the Imperial Patron of\nFashion and Courtly Attire upon the Imperial\nBall to commemorate the union of His Imperial\nHighness Augustus Horen and Princess Helen\nElizabeth Horen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Blagofruit.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Fool's Sword", "Half of a jagged sword, the upper portion of\nthe blade snapped off. It's cut off at the\nmidway point, the hilt still intact.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by liam_barnett.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Scrap", "A collection of battle-scarred Red Vaeyl\narmour, scavenged from the ruins of Lasthope.\nA blacksmith could use this to make a\nrepaired suit of mail.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Tissues", "For when an individual loses a fight, a\nGMreq, or literally anything on Lord of the\nShaft.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TrendE.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Bread Pudding", "A square of cinnamon-flavored breaded\npudding, seasoned in various sweet spices.\nThe pudding is coated in a white caramel\nsauce that also smells of rum.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Cross of Lorraine", "A cross blessed by an unknown entity. When in\nthe presence of undead or evil creatures, the\ncross will branch out a beam of light in the\nshape of a sword. Strange indeed! PM\nFlyingHalfMast with questions.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Quena Flute", "A simple but finely crafted flute made of\nbamboo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bayou Salad", "A sizeable bowl of various greens, mixed with\ncooked mushrooms, carrots, and cucumbers. The\nsalad is coated in a thick dressing, brown in\ncolor.", "minecraft:leaves2", ""),
        StaticItem("The Fisher King's Fishing Rod", "The fishing pole of the late Fisher King\nRaigeki Kato from the Konigreich of\nAesterwald. The pole would be made out of a\nflexible, sturdy bamboo with red twine tied\naround the nodes. By the pole's reel is\nwritten in Oyashimian script: これは偽物です。", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Jeweled Rosary", "A rather gaudy silver cross, inlaid with\nvarious finely cut diamonds. It hung on a\nstring of light blue glass beads, each tied\ntogether finely to prevent losing any if the\nstring snapped. A raven was imprinted on the\nback of the silver cross, a makers mark of\nsorts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by rosediode.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Wendigo Head", "http://www.ancient-origins.net/sites/default/files/Wendigo-caring-a-human.jpg\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Homunculus Bile", "A small covered jar of the bile of an Air\nHomunculus. It bubbles disconcertingly,\nthough it smells surprisingly soapy. It is\nwell utilizable as a moderate strength air\nsymbol for use in alchemy.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gislocinovi-Atheros Salve", "This topical salve would be comprised of the\njuice of a gislocinovi flower and crushed\natheros root. The former flower, though\npotent, is equally infamous for its fatal\nsymptoms associated with overdose. As a\nresult, this salve uses it very\nconservatively, ensuring the danger is\nminimal except when applied in overwhelming\namounts. Though its healing properties are\nmitigated in turn, it nonetheless functions\nas an improvement over alcohol or other crude\ndisinfectants when cleaning or dressing\nwounds. The atheros root would make up the\nlions share of this ointment, providing\nmoderate pain relief in large part to its\nconjunction with the gislocinovi flower.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Theldryn's Oathblade", "The blade is of straight make with a duel\nedge down its length. The body of the blade\nlacking a fuller making it heavier than\nperhaps a more experienced smith would make.\nThe guard is a simple wooden crucifix in\ndesign with a beveled handle before ending in\na simple wooden ball for the pommel. the wood\nof the handle appears to be made of 3\ndifferent woods.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Theldryn.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eldritch Gladiatorial Helmet", "A helm of a lost civilization, looking like\nan average gladiator's helmet, made of a\nbronze-like eldritch material. The armor\nwould be larger than the average man's head,\nand would be characterized by one large\nunicorn-esque horn at the top of it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Boulf's Club", "The Branch-Club of Boulf the Cyclops. While\nit isnt much more than just a Piece of Wood,\nThe Weapon would have been used by One of the\nDeadly Creatures.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:wooden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bubblegum Drop!", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vincent", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sanguis", "A fitted ring, carved out of the finest red\ndiamond, the most valuable of all diamonds,\nin the middle lay another large gem of\nemerald. Around the ring's body were other\nexpensive jewels: Sapphire, Diamond, Fire\nOpal and Serendibite.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Veriya", "A perfectly crafted golden ring - though the\ngold itself is hardly visible as it is\ncovered, dusted almost in two-carat diamonds.\nA large, flawless jewel is set in it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Appreciation Token", "A thank you gift from your favourite admin!\nKnox213\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("my shtummy hurt", "", "minecraft:wooden_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("FURRY HEAD!", "A furry's head, taken in the great furry\ngamer war! From your fellow gamers!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Leonard Harrison James Apollo Shaquille Horen", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Banana Buza", "A Banana Buza is frozen, within a cone,\nfreshly made of milk and smashed banana and\nsuger. it is smooth and creamy, and\ncold!(Qalasheen Icecream)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ibraheemc2000.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bonsai Tree", "A tiny bonsai tree in a lil painted pot. Trim\nit every so often and watch it be pretty.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("BIG POW Warhammer", "A slayer steel warhammer reinforced enough to\nbe considered unbreakable. It's effective\nagainst unholy beasts but needs to be wielded\nby a strong individual due to the weight of\nthe weapon.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Robert Sigismund's Special Tea", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("A jar of sweet smelling herbal medicine. When steeped for ten minutes and drank it would alleviate headaches or joint pain.", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("INCANDESCENCE", "An ancient book, barely held together.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Razorskarner Venom", "A glass vial of Razorskarner venom. Oddly\nenough this black ooze doesn't melt through\nglass though if poured onto armor or flesh it\nwould melt through it within seconds. The\nliquid would have the consistency of glue. It\nwould contain about 100mL of the strange\npitch-black liquid, a very small amount.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pulsating Parasitic Blade", "A sword formed in imitation to one held by a\nReichwald Greatsword. An authentic, aged\ndesign, the blade would be a rather\nbelievable copy of a Zweihander once held by\na human swordsman.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Edge Stick", "It's really just a stick, but it has a dark,\ntroubled past.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahariae.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ratcatcher Business Ledger", "This is the business ledger for The\nRatcatcher Tavern, it details shipments,\npurchases, and sales.", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Windsor Ramen Co. 'End of the World Special", "A delicious ramen EXPERTLY prepared by The\nRt. Hon. Lord Nathaniel Windsor, Baron and\nLord Protector of Belfoire, Imperial\nAdministrator and Officer of the Renatian\nLegion. The broth is unrivaled, being the\nbest in Atlas. Fresh Meats are also placed in\nthe bowl, allowed to cook with scalding hot\nbroth with is poured over the dry noodles.\nEat with Caution, This Soup is HOT.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lord Chef Nathaniel Windsor.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Kat Daddy Burbon", "Made with complex with hints of caramel, oak,\nvanilla and brown sugar, this distinctly\nSantegian bourbon distinguishes itself as\nsuperior to all others.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Kaethryn's Broadaxe", "An axe with various intricate carvings in the\naxehead. Lightweight and manueverable, this\naxe has more deadly and lethal capabilities\nthan most of it's counterparts.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("rat mask", "the head of a rat king, widely known to have\nharass people over discord", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Flowers of Tippen", "A FOUL smelling purple flower yanked from the\nground by the root. ‘Tippens Root’ can be\nmade into a salve that will stop any bleeding\nwhen applied. The smell is very strong, do\nnot breathe through your nose.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Uruk's Shroom", "This tasty looking munchable will send you\nback for quite a while, offering a\nhallucinogenic experience you'll likely never\nforget.", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("hahaha just look at your hair", "a strong weapon used to kill subhumans", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Crudely Smelted Iron Ore", "This iron ore has been crudely smelted. While\nstill usable, it's not of the best quality.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamong", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Brooch", "A silver brooch, inlaid with lapis lazuli in\nthe middle. The design along the edges of the\npiece would remind someone of a tree's\nbranches. Forged by Siegmund Adler of The\nBroken Lance Arms and Armor, part of the\nWorshipful Companie d'Aryn.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FireCrimson.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll club", "A troll's wooden club, covered in throns.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SaintPaint.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Lucky Seven: Clover's Foot", "This silver-mounted left hind foot of a\nsnowshoe hare has the word \"Godspeed\" and a\nfour-leaf clover etched onto its cap. A black\ncord runs through a clasp attached to the\ncharm, allowing it to fit as a necklace.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Pinecone", "Masterfully carved from Shortleaf Pine wood,\nit fits almost too well in your hand. A small\ncross is etched onto the top of the wooden\npinecone. Waxed and shined to perfection.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Statuette of an Imperial Dragon Knight", "A small, golden plated statue of an Imperial\nDragon Knight. Its shield bears the visage of\na dragon with two emeralds embedded in for\nthe eyes. A note is attached to this reading:\nWhoever brings this back to the Imperial\nPrince Commodus Horen may ask for one favor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Commodus.", "minecraft:totem_of_undying", ""),
        StaticItem("Smiley Face Great Helm", "Rozmeo's peculiar styled helmet. The eyehole\nand vents are unconventionally shaped in\nconjunction to form a smiley face. The helmet\nis colored with a dark taupe paint.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elder Red-Oak Timber Blowgun", "At around 12 inches in length, it was made\nfrom an Elder Red-oak timber, delicately\ncarved out was a mouth-piece one could blow\nthrough in order to propel a small item\nthrough the hollowed shaft. Just below the\nmouth-piece, 'G' was carved within. The wood\nwas treated with sandpaper and glazed over\nwith Tung-seed oil.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BGT-Six.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Legion Expedition Backpack", "This simple yet sturdy bag is able to carry\nup to 70 kg worth of items. The exterior of\nthis large bag includes multiple straps and\nhooks, good for securing weapons. A belt\nbuckle keeps the flap tightly covered over\nthe bag's opening. The shoulder straps would\nbe reinforced with extra stitching and padded\nfor comfort. Inserted into the bag is a\nhighland yew wood frame. The stamp of the\nImperial Armory can be seen centered on the\nleather flap.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Otus, The Messenger Owl", "This Austral Pigmy Owl is trained extensively\nas a courier, mastering flight through harsh\nconditions. While not having natural homing\nabilities, it has learned to search and track\ndown the associates of its owner. A small,\ncylindrical pouch is attached to the owl's\nleft leg, optimized to fit rolled-up papers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rozmeo.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Polelance", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Head of Sighard af Markev", "This is the head of Sighard af Markev, small\nbits of his neck still remains attached as it\nseems it was hacked up roughly. A hole sticks\nfrom the left side of the skull looking to be\nabout arrow sized, as it's green eyes look\nforever forth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jondead.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Paleman's Remains", "The petrified and frozen remains of a\nreanimated Paleman, once belonging to the\nMarked Man mimicry known as the Ophidian\nInitiative. Though mundane at first glance,\nto carry this fragment of bone upon one's\nkeepsake, the cold of Thanhic winter seems\nless severe and numbing. That is not to say,\nof course, that to feel something is to make\nit reality...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Geidleth.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Fire-Rune Blade", "A fine dwarven blade. Runes are etched along\nthe face of the blade. A rune of creation and\na rune of fire. A known word must be used to\nactivate them. A rune of Dungrim is etched in\nthe handle. If a theif were to touch it a\nbrand will be burned into them. A small\nblacksmith mark is seen on the blade near the\nhandle, DI.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant's Skull", "The bony structure that forms the head in the\ngiant's skeleton. The skull is fractured,\nwith a large crack going down the back of the\nskull.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Oathstone Dust", "The shattered remains of the infamous\nOathstone. To what extent will someone go to\nuphold their Oath?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Poisoned Bread", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("The Ring Of Imperial Wedding", "Forged for Ser Seth Renault and Ophelia\nHoren, this silver wedding ring holds a\nsubtle teal lustre. 'Finally' is engraved\nupon the inner ring of the band, while vines\nclimb the exterior to frame the resplendent\nopal center stone. Upon a quietly spoken\nphrase, the runes carved about the opal may\nemit a gentle stream of flame. This fire\nwould be natural in origin, and capable of\nlighting a candle or setting a small\nconflagration. [PM _Fid_]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fëanor Sylvaeri.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blessed Shield of Redemption [T3]", "Light blackferrum shield abandoned by\nMordring's forces during their retreat from\nthe Westerlands. A long time ago it was\ntainted and touched by malice, but no longer.\nIn defiance of the darkness this shield has\nbeen Infused with the holy flames of the\nArchaengul. A small ideogram of five golden\nembers is fused to the handle, a symbol that\nclearly has a higher meaning. When a being of\ndark nature bearing a corrupted soul comes\ninto direct contact with the shield a thin\nlayer of golden soulfire would envelop the\nwhole item and burn the flesh of the unholy.\nThis isn't just a simple shield, rather a\nmessage and example about redemption and how\nan instrument designed to do evil could be\nused as a weapon against darkness.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("White And Blue Vase", "It's fragile like your feelings.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Alloy-Formed Ring", "A gigantic ring, made for use within siege\nweaponry. Made finely out of pure gold and\nsilver.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Clay Pipe", "A simple clay pipe for smoking stuff.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Stick cat scribble", "A crude drawing of a stick-cat with superb\nshading.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chumpchump.", "minecraft:ladder", ""),
        StaticItem("How I got a Pineapple in my head", "The story of a man who was brain dead.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Pay Slip x8", "A pay slip worth that of eight Legionairre\npay slips. Redeemable for a total of 200\nminas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nonival.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Pay Slip x4", "A Legion pay slip with four of a single pay\nslip. A single x4 pay slip is redeemable for\n100 minas.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nonival.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Caius II Horen", "In a bundle of white and golden fabrics laid\na sleeping child of the Imperial House of\nHoren. His hair was lighter brown, with dark\ngreen, timid eyes.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Training Spear", "Hand whittled Oak spears\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by 3andD.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Legionnaire Steel Halberd | Valtin Halberd", "A well-crafted halberd which was comprised of\ntwo main parts and two main materials. The\nshaft was made from a sturdy Dark-elm wood,\ntreated from quality Tung-seed oil. Whilst\nthe spear and axe-head were made from high\ncarbon steel. The weapon was 6 feet 2 inches\nin height and weighed approximately 4 lbs.\nThe axe-head was quite large and well thinned\ntowards it's edges, making a well-defined\nhook towards the upper shaft. Most of the\nmiddle of the handle was wrapped with\nleather, woven in like intricately. Signed\nupon the leather with an etching tool was,\nＥｍｉｌ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Emil.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Man Milk", "", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Onyx Ring", "A glittering ring made up of a teardrop\nshaped piece of onyx, and a deep blue\nsapphire around the size of a pea that rests\nbelow it's point. It is set in silver,\nseemingly designed to be worn on the index\nfinger. It induces an odd feeling of dread,\nevident when worn. ((MESSAGE TwigTheTwig#4321\nON DISCORD IF BOUGHT))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ThatWeirdGirl.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("v-buck", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Polar Bear Rib", "A rib of a Polar Bear, it is about twenty\ninches long and is slightly cracked.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Waraxe", "A stout axe of frost-tempered bronze, used by\nthe Knights of the Vaeyl Order and plundered\nfrom the storerooms of Lasthope. Its\ncrescent-moon axe head is engraved with\ncursive Aex letters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wooden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Panoply of the Dragonrider", "Behold, the armaments of a Dragonrider.\nFull-body plate mail comprised of\ninterlocking plates of wyvern bone is worn\nover a hauberk fashioned from wyvern scales.\nThis combination of armors provides the\nwearer with superior protection against\nphysical attacks (especially slashing and\npiercing) as well as moderate protection\nagainst fire. Due to the lightweight hauberk\noffsetting the weight of the plate, the\npanoply weighs only slightly heavier than a\nsteel set of the two armors.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Stettin Tax Papers", "Tax Papers for the Hamlet of Stettin, due\nonce a stoneweek\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cranky_Varangian.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Lemonade", "A nice refreshing pitcher of Lemonade infused\nwith slices of Strawberry straight form\nAldenburg and a pinch of sugar. Perfect for a\nhot, summer day!", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Monkey Bread", "This sticky pinch-me cake, consisits of\npieces of soft baked dough sprinkled with\ncinnamon.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Cake", "You hold a medium sized round carrot cake,\nroughly larger than your head. The sponge\nseems moist and well baked, topped with\nvanilla butter-cream and orange meringue\npiped into the shape of a carrot at the\ncenter.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Enhanced Nightsap", "A sweet tasting syrup, blessed by a T5 druid.\nAfter consumption, the syrup would induce a\npowerful sleep lasting up to an elven hour.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("-+- Superior Black-Steel Kiteshield -+-", "A kiteshield wrought in blacksteel, it's\nedges lined in a fine trim of gleaming\nsilver. The shield was not flat, two slopes\nthat would meet together to create an arched\nridge vertically along the center of it.\nInlaid upon the shield would be the crest of\nHouse Horen, a three headed dragon that\ndisplayed itself proudly atop the shield.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Blacksmith.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Kha-bob", "Marinated Kharajyr cuts from inhumanely\ntrapped Kharajyr. Served glazed on skewers\nwith roasted peppers, cherry tomatoes and\nonions.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Signet of Montelliano", "A golden signet ring depicting the coat of\narms of the illustrious house of Montelliano,\nit's band bejeweled with rubies and inside\nthe band, the montelliano's words, \"Sono solo\naffari\" were engraved in silver.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Illuminare.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gaekgrin Gang Shooter - Oak Longbarreled Slurbow", "A long-barreled shooter which had a complex\nmechanic, it was made from simple Oak-wood\ntreated with an adhesive, and the only iron\npieces were the barrel, mechanics and\nbutt-cap. that could be pushed up to reveal\nthe open slot to slide a very specifically\nnarrow bolt in, where it would rest on a\nsmall pedestal that was attached to the\nbowstrings. On each side of the wooden part\nof the barrel, would be two long pieces that\ncould be expanded to act as a bow. Ｔｈｉｓ\nｗｅａｐｏｎ ｔａｋｅｓ ａｔ－ｌｅａｓｔ ｆｏｕｒ ｅｍｏｔｅｓ ｔｏ ｆｉｒｅ.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Graekin Gang.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Juice", "Freshly Pressed Apple Juice", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ailis' Eyedrops", "A small sample of Lesser Acuity Potion,\nbrewed cauldron-style with a reagent offset\nlending toward a longer duration, with weaker\npotency. It is sorted into a small vial with\na narrow opening, to help keep track of\nconsumption. It steadily flows in sizes of\nsingle drops.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Chest", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Candy Box", "A box filled with a plethora of delicious\ncandies!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Chest", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dated Wine", "A wine dated to 1610. Is it still safe? Don't\nknow.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Sword of Pertinax Horen", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Engraved Gold Necklace", "A silver chain was plated with golden\ntrimmings that shifted from a dusky yellow to\norange with light, a cursive 'R' as a\ncenterpiece for the signature piece, crafted\nby delicate hands with perfect precision.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("señor Bogart", "These are the dusty remains of a pet parrot\nNolan O'Hara once owned before the tyrant and\ncuronite killed him. This is sad times for\nNolan as he mourns over the death for years,\nhunting every Curonite he comes across,", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Internum Adiutor", "A frothy, rough substance with a delicious\ntaste, when drank patches up internal\ninjuries for a prolonged period of time,\npreserving them unless bruised or harmed\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firephantom37.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl and Diamond Brooch", "A coiled snake wrapped around a thin, golden\nspear which hooks into clothing, holding a\nbutton-shaped pearl, the head inset with a\ncushion-shaped diamond, ruby eyes, the body\nhighlighted with diamonds.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("No One likes Lufu", "", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Tainted Chimera Claw", "A single, warped and twisted claw of some\nsort. It was colored dark with stained blood,\nand is incredibly sharp.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Offical Stool Tax Slips", "The Offical Kaz'Ulah Stool owners tax slip!\nAt the end of each week, place one of these,\nand only one, in the \"Tax slip chest\" Located\nnext to your stool!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Offical Shop Tax Slip", "The Offical Kaz'Ulah shop owners tax slip! At\nthe end of each week, place one of these, and\nonly one, in the \"Tax slip chest\" Located\nnext to your shop!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Yagami.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Hope Druid", "", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Sun Necklace", "What appears to be a lovely necklace of a\ncarved oceanic shard; shaped to appear as if\na sun. It possibly holds another part due to\nits ragged edges, indicating another bit fit\ninto it. A message is etched onto its back;\nTo my lovely Sunniva, haelun.\" [Contact\npapikite for further interaction]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melia Finnigan.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Flower.", "A flower, thriving in its pot! Various forms\nof ivy hang over the pots edge, complimenting\nthe tall white bloom nicely! It appears very\nwell cared for.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("hello  Stormsinger Staff   hello", "A staff of smooth, unblemished bronze. It is\nfashioned with a strange, curving hole at the\ntop that causes the wind to whistle when it\nblows through it. This was the staff used by\nVaeyl Stormsingers to shift the weather.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Meteor Crystal of Power", "This massive glowing crystal came from a\nmeteor which fell outside the gates of the\nImperial Capital on Atlas. The crystal weighs\nabout 180 pounds, and is around the length of\na longsword. It glows red under the light,\nand in darkness seems to emit a faint light.\nIt responds to no magic, but can be moved by\ntelekenisis. It would notably be quite\nfragile, and one would assume that to try and\nbreak it apart, would shatter the crystal,\nand ruin its grandure. It is cool to the\ntouch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ankalagon_.", "minecraft:black_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("A bag of Gold Dust", "A bag filled with gold dust, which could be\nused for a variety of purposes, from making\ngold lines, to throwing it on ghosts! Not\nadvisable that you use it to decorate cake,\nthough.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("ebin bepis dlabe ::----DD", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hawwison.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("TestS", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("TestSO", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Raevir Sheggit slayer", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Caesar's Walking Cane 2.0", "A long, wooden stick about 4'6 feet in\nlength. The top of the cane comes with a\nfitted hook, mainly for grip but could also\nbe used to grab onto items. The wood seems to\nbe that of a dark color, topped off with a\nglazing on it that shines in the sunlight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thomas Browne.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Rakult (Dwarven Axe)", "A Dwarven Style Axe with a handle made of\ngold reaching the height of 24 cm. This one\nwould have a steel blade sharp to the touch\nwith moss wrapped around the handle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Endershadow292.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pouch of Gold Coins", "A pouch of gold coins one could discreetly\nwear around their neck to avoid a pickpocket.\nThe coins by no means resemble mina and only\nhave a Rhodesian Cross etched into each of\nthem. The pouch itself has an emblem of a\nlarge tree.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of neonultraviolent", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Narthok's Girlfriend", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Ash Aftershave", "A sweet woody smelling aftershave, the earthy\ntones appealing to most who smell it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Punisher8817.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("24.62649376232566 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Alle walen Weg", "Met deze stam kan je alle Walen uit je land\nverbannen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Endershadow292.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Vantigern's roman gladius", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cosimo, Heavy Greatsword of Medici", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by HeliosDeWeird.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~+= Peacekeeper =+~", "An ornate and uniquely-beautiful sword,\nforged of steel and layered upon with finely\ncurving designs of gold. Upon one side of the\ncrossguard, the roaring dragon of Horen is\nwrought in gold, its eyes set by glittering\namethysts which sparkle in the light; upon\nthe other, a great branching Ash Tree of\nmoon-silver is tinged with finely-hammered\ncopper in the shape of flames. The\npommel-stone is carved in the shape of the\nold Krag, towers of stone upon a craggy\ncollection of peaks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("۞ Permit for Maly'thill ۞", "This official-looking document is a permit\nfor Maly'thill, a Man of Elven blood, who can\nbe distinguished by his heavy-looking armor\nand raspy voice. The permit has been\nofficially signed by the Minister for Magical\nAffairs, His Excellency Vahyru Daluon. By the\nrights of this document the named person is\nlegally allowed to cast the following forms\nof magecraft within their permit’s\nboundaries; Transfiguration, Telekinesis,\nVoidal Translocation, Arcanism.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ragnio.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Uthred's Grilled Ribs", "A beautiful set of spare ribs, nicely cut and\nprepared on a grill. A good mix of rib rub\nand barbecue sauce would give this piece of\nmeat a subperb taste. Surely, these ribs\ncould make one's day.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Almonds", "They're almonds!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Cheese Curds", "A cluster of cheese balls fried in bread\ncrumbs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("A Small Golden Cross", "A hand-crafted Golden Cross, made of Gold and\nhas a small piece of emerald embeded into the\nmiddle of it... This is worth nothing,\nliteraly nothing.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cursed staff", "", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Magician's Modified Bow", "The bow's riser seems to be made partially of\nmagegold, by the portion which an arrow would\nrest. It can be used as a casting implement.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Heater Sharp", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurelius I Horen Commendation for Exemplary Service", "Ser Phillip Marshall has been awarded this\ndistinction given to those Legionnaires\nexhibiting exceptional honor, unwavering\nvalor, devotion to duty, and selfless service\nof the highest order.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Cups and Plates.", "Various cups and plates are stacked on the\nshelf here, the fine china decorated with\ndelicate flower patterns. Not a saucer in\nsight, for whatever reason!", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("<< White Tulip Flower Crown >>", "A tediously weaved crown made of white\ntulips, the inner ring is lined with some\nfabric so it gently rests on the wearer's\nhead.", "minecraft:red_flower", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_46(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Scepter of Valgoth", "A smoldering brimstone & bronze composed\nweapon, this scepter had it's energy drained\nin the battlefield outside of Santegia in the\nAsh Barrens fighting Wem, Iros and Sophia.\nThis weapon would have an empty slot affixed\nin it's hilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Boot knife", "It's what you'd expect, really.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurelius I Horen Commendation for Exemplary Service Medal", "Given unto Ser Phillip Marshall is a gold\nmedal, tediously polished. The face bears the\nsigil of the Imperial Legion and is\nemblazoned with the motto \"Service and\nSacrifice.\" It hangs from a tri-colored\nribbon of purple, black and gold. These\ncolors, together, represent courage, honor,\nand valor.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of UltraGreyFox", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Double Flail", "The Fox' is a double headed flail. The\nspiked masses on each of the two chains are\nvery heavy and dense, moreso than normal\nmetal. The shaft of the flail has enough room\nto be used by both hands or just one. It is\nexpertly weighted to be light enough for\nrapid swings but still hit with brutal force.\nShould one of the spikes penetrate skin, the\nvictim would find themselves struggling hard\nto stop the bloodflow. This mace is a more\nthan formidable opponent granted the\ncombatant knows how to use it. The metal of\nthe balls is a blue-black and the chains are\ninfused with red from superheating. The shaft\nis blue leather and untreated ironwood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SoulStrung.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Letter", "A crumpled piece of paper with a note,\nseemingly written by a small child. \"Im rea\ndy for skool to be a d oc ter! - Oc ta via\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TarreBear.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("3c Shined Diamond Ring", "The ring would be shined to perfection, a\ngolden base would hold the 3 carat diamond in\nplace, once you place it on your finger, it\nwould fit perfectly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Accrayer.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Solidor Cup I", "The Trophy from Solidor Cup I! Robert\nDenhardt is engraved on a plaque on the base.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlugalMC.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cheap wine", "Wine of low quality.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Elixir of Life", "This small vial is wrapped in a remarkably\nillustrious label of the famous \"Apothecarium\nSociety.\" Beyond the design, the clear glass\nacts as a window into a dull, yet vibrant,\npurple fluid. While imbibing this solution\nhas no evident effect, it surely tastes\npleasant. ((Contact Dardonas for more info))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dardonas.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Metal Flute", "This metal flute seems to emit a tune when\nblown into it that allows the person to\nsummon two brownish falcons...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jarsek Myrsta.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Crown of Stars", "A fine, ornate crown. Its metal crafted of\nebon metal and twinkling white; the crown\nresembling the night sky. This well forged\ncrown has comfortable cloth inside to comfort\nthe wearer's head; and opal stones settle\nbelow each protrusion, resembling cosmic\nworlds surrounded by space time. Glory be who\ndons this crown.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Stamp", "A small and simple stamp depicting an eagle\nwith a sword in its talons. This stamp can be\nused for a one time usage at the Belvitz\nPostal Service, part of Belvitz’ First\nGeneral Store.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arthur Blaze.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Rapier", "A smooth ferrum rapier about three feet in\nlength. Its hilt offers a leather grip and a\nhand-guard that would cup around the fist,\nprotecting the user's grip. The blade itself\nisn't very sharp along the edges, being very\ndull. The point, however, is incredibly\nsharp, easily able to puncture skin and thin\nclothing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the Nordengradic Smith.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("☀☾ Syzygy ☽☀", "Arcane I\nAn immaculate aurum blade whose sheen\nglimmers in the moonlight. A symbol akin to a\nbrazier is seen upon the hilt, garnished with\nwhite diamonds. When touched the blade\nignites in a dazzling display of holy white\nfire that banishes nearby darkness. The\nflames are exceptionally painful against\ncorrupted flesh, and prolonged contact might\nset a dark being on fire. (Contact Jallentime\nfor further information.)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dry skull", "The dry skull belonging to once a comedic\nliche lays within your hands. It's wearer\nonce \"allive\" now purified. The skull could\nmake for a fine decoration.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tide1.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll of Balefas", "Within the sealed brimstone scroll lies text\nwritten by Balefas, ally of the descendants\nand rogue Pyre of the Firelands.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Longbow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("New Belvitz Tax Paper", "The new official tax paper of Belvitz. Worth\n50 minas.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Orvari Roundshield [Big Round Woodshield]", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Tainted Chimera Pelt", "This pelt would be white as a base, though\nmostly brown as it seemed covered in fungi\nand various mosses. The creature was clearly\nwolflike in nature, though more humanoid -\nwith digitigrade legs and rotted pieces to\nit. An undead chimera.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Exquisite Pelt", "It had shining white fur and was very soft to\nthe touch. The leathered skin was quite\nsturdy, but would better be used for fine\ncrafting.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Behemoth", "An ancient staff created by the late Coltaine\nWick rests before you. The length would have\na large series of pale gems all of which glow\nwith a pale light. Each gem would be\nenchanted to cast any number of spectacular\nillusions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Circlet", "An overtly large crown of solid emerald. A\ngrand prize to be given to the Doves upon the\ndancing of the roses.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Crown", "An overtly large crown of solid emerald. A\ngrand prize to be given to the Doves upon the\neve of Maria's ball", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Ser Phillip's Bastardsword", "A well forged steel bastardsword with\nsharpened edges and polished to a high gleam.\nThe blades handle is wrapped in a fine dark\nblue and grey leather with a hilt of gold and\na large sapphire inlaid as the pommel. The\ncrossguard of the blade features a higly\ndetailed set of litanties inscribed in High\nImperial. near the hilt of the blade the year\nof production is stamped marked 1456.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Owyn's Justice", "An arming sword of a seemingly regal nature,\nwith a saphire engraved pommel. The flexio\ntext \"Owyn's Iustitiae\" is etched along the\nlower fuller, or spine of the blade. However\nthe impressive sharpness and overall weight\nof the weaponry suggests a combative\ncapability. The hilt itself is encoiled in\nfine leather with a small stamp pressed into\nthe side, reading: 'Rhy'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Greater Mending", "A potion of greater healing, not to be\nmistaken for a potion of regeneration, is\ncapable of returning sight to a cut eye,\nrepairing shattered bones, and healing\notherwise mortal wounds. After applied, it\nwould take 1-2 ic hours depending on the\nwound severity to heal. However, the patient\nwould find themselves unable to use the area\nthroughout the duration of the mending, and\nfurthermore feel exhausted thereafter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Moribundity.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Greatsword", "A masterfully crafted aurum greatsword by the\nfamous blacksmith Kalviin Ireheart.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Salvia Divinorum", "An unassuming member of the mint family, the\nherb salvia is known to be a hallucinogenic,\ncausing drowsiness quickly after consumption.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Needles", "The needles were in neat packs, coated with\ndangerous Poison Vile which tinted the\nneedles green. They were perfect size for\nthrowing or stabing into the neck.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("* Golden Rose *", "", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Mantlet", "Technically a shield but too large to be held\nin the hand. it is a large shield that is\nplaced on the ground. They can be for a\nsingle person or even large enough to protect\nsiege equipment like siege towers and\ntrebuchets.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Imperial Fancy Shortsword", "A finely forged sword of steel. This agile\nshortsword has a finely detailed aurum handle\nwith several rubies encrusted into each side\nof the hilt. The grip is a wine red leather\ngrip and below that rests the gold Lion head\npommel. Upon each egde of the blade near the\nhilt is the stamp of the Imperial foundry\nalong with the date of manufacture 1604.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Imperial Armory.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhic Alloy Sword", "This thanhic alloy iron sword is brittle in\nnature, yet holds thanhic properties, making\nit dangerous to mage and warrior alike should\nit enter them; however sacrificing the blade\nitself.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Boomsteel Handbomb", "A small cylinder of stable boomsteel alloy\nfilled with thanium. When the boomsteel is\nlit, it will take a few seconds before the\nheat from the flaming metal outside overloads\nthe thanium within. The thanium will explode\nsending hot shrapnel in a few meters radius.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Witchers Broadsword", "A broadsword made of pure Aurum; specifically\ndesigned to slay monsters, demons,\npoltergeist, ghouls, supernatural,\nparanormal, ghosts, zombies and anything else\nout of the ordinary - like that crazy old hag\nthat lives down the street!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mullraugh.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kolol Eron Khrothein", "The Staff of the Dumbass Walter Marshall\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MCPancakes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Legionnaire's Arming Sword", "A worn and chipped sword from an era bygone.\nIt appears that the blade itself would falter\nand give way under any bit of pressure, one\nof the quillons is missing, torn. '1590' is\ninscribed along the spine of this weapon\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Meduesculor Pistol", "An ornate pistol with the ability to\ndischarge small arcane bolts. ((5 shots per\nmana gem, takes two emotes to fire. Contact\nknghtArtorias for more information should you\nget this item.))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Sledgehammer", "A battered sledgehammer used to inflict blunt\nforce on a person.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Anime Girl Poster", "A poster to put on your wall of a super\nkawaii anime girl. You'd wish she were real.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Shinraidekiru.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Pale Purple Candle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Love Rose", "a lovely rose for a lovely person\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Original_Potato.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of wolf", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Illusionary Ring", "Soulbound II\nA delicate silver band rests before you,\nshaped to resemble fragile vines, clasped to\nthe ring would be a skillfully cared emerald\nin the shape of a leaf. When one taps the\nemerald thrice, it would begin to shimmer\nenchanted to disguise the wearer as an\nindividual of regular skin tone. ((2 emote\nbuild up. Contact HurferDurfer for more\ninfo!))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("36.85111216655882 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Owlbear Set", "A full set of leathers and mixed plate. The\nset of armor is comprised of a gambeson,\nleather jerkin, steel pauldrons, a bracer,\nand all that fit inbetween. Within the right\npauldron a small engravement is present,\nreading: 'Rhy'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Wild Boar Tusk", "A foot long tusk taken from the corspe of a\nwild boar. They are wickedly sharp, still\nstained with blood from their last victim.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Conspirator_.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Unwillingly", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Thief's Bane", "This thin and incredibly sharp dagger is\nforged out of refined dwarven steel, with\nornate runes decorating the blade. A\nStarbreaker Sigil, an anvil with a broken\nstar hovering above it, is emblazoned in the\ndagger’s center.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of lucasking321", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Nectorist", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Kelly's \"Blessing of the Harvest\" c.1695", "A sweet, light bodied white wine which has\nundertones of caramel and a floral\narrangement within the palate. The acidity is\nhigh enough to contrast the sweetness,\nexpanding upon the tongue and creating an\nenjoyable experience to those who consume it.\nPairing this with tart foods and aged cheeses\nwill make this a delight to any function.The\nbottle is plastered with an elaborate label,\nwith a simple bunch of purple grapes and the\nword “Kelly Winery and Co.” With the year\nwritten in cursive\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ScreamingDingo.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem o' Life", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Cock Blaster", "This sword is known for blasting the dicks\noff of Orenians. Found off in the hands of a\ndead Snow Elf, this sword has killed many\nOrenian Screamers\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bobzre.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Spider Venom", "This poison is one of a small vial and is\nenough to expose a halfling for a good while.\nFortunately, this is not fatal to other\ndescendants, but extremely painful if the\npoison is in an open wound.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoke Bomb", "A bottle containing a thick black smoke, if\nthrown to the ground the bottle would shatter\nin a small explosion letting out a black\ncloud (5x3x5 area), you can't see trough nor\nsee when inside, if inhaled the smoke causes\nirritation\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gioia24.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Carcoran Claw Dagger", "The dagger is made of an impressive 12 inch\nclaw from the deadly Carcoran slewn in\nJohannesburg many decades ago. The steel hilt\nis finely polished and well fashioned to sit\nfirmly in the hand, the sigil of House Horen\nis engraved on the right side of the handle.\nA shining emerald sits upon the pommel of the\ndagger shining brightly when light would fall\nupon it. The Carcoran claw itself is as razor\nsharp as the day it was taken from the beast,\npolished a sheening dull white, there is a\nchip in the upper edge from where it roughly\ntore apart the plate armor of a long dead\nOrenian soldier.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanic Alloy Blade", "This thanic alloy bluesteel sword is a\nformidable weapon that holds thanic\nproperties, making it dangerous to mage and\nwarrior alike should it enter them; much\nstronger than its iron counterparts, the\nblade will not break after one use.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LeoWarrior14.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Estoc", "A finely crafted estoc with a rather ornate\ncrossguard, the blade would be made of black\nferrum along with dark leather wrapped around\nthe hilt. The sword would seem rather similar\nto a rapier in design and light-weight in the\nhands of most, although it would be just\nright for a particular Elf that the blade was\nmade for.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of Horen", "Once a jewel, the object shines and reflects\nlight at it's edges. In the center burns an\nall seeing eye - vivid, captivating, and\nterrifying.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiger striped rug", "A colorful tanned and skinned rug, made from\na Kha's fur.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bow of Plenty (greater)", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Ysellian", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Permission for Expansion", "Permission granted by the Seneschal\n(LithiumSedai) and Grand Marshal (zePato) to\nexpand the Rhysten smithy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by zePato.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Shame or Glory", "A simple steel sword belonging to the Reiter\nGwyntaran. The hilt is smooth and worn, and\nthe blade seems old, yet in pristine\nconditions.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Bloodnight", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Stallion Rum", "A tantalizing blend of mellow oak and vanilla\naromas deliciously intertwine with banana,\nraw brown sugar, and golden-sweet honey to\nyield a raptuously delightful banana custard\nflavored rum that tickles the tongue and\nwarms the blood.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrier Pigeon", "A pigeon of no discerning value from the\nnaked eye. It seems loyal to his holder.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:fermented_spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("THE ROYAL RUMBLE BELT OF GOLD AND AWESOMENESS", "It has a hefty weight to it\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Navin_.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower Circlet", "A crown composed of an assortment of aromatic\nflowers, the colorful token created\nespecially to sit upon the head of whichever\nwoman held the Imperial Patron of Combat's\nfavor, who would be crowned upon the second\nday of the Imperial Prince Augustus' wedding\ncelebrations.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Blagofruit.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("James Sigismund's Axe", "A rather well crafted woodchopping axe.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Birdcage", "A bird cage that is able to store a duo of\nbirds and has a skeleton carved into its\nbase. Its oddly old and seems to always have\ndust on it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ZachsSlayer.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Simple Sword", "A sword. Could it be simpler?", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Collard Greens", "A bowl of dark green collards cooking turkey\nthighs and chicken broth. Seasoned with\ngarlic and crushed peppers.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Seventian Rights Lobby Activist Sign", "A lobbyist's dream.", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Ring", "The ring is made out of a very polished\nferrum with no imperfections in the\ncraftmanship.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Map #6 (U)", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Map #2 (T)", "A ripped segment of parchment paper would be\nscribbled with the following passage: ‘The\nfuture belongs to those who believe in the\nbeauty of their dreams.’\n1191, 118, 649\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Map #4 (U)", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Map #1 (F)", "A ripped segment of parchment paper would be\nscribbled with the following passage: ‘The\npast cannot be changed. The future is yet in\nyour power.’\n-571, 113, 3805\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Map #3 (R)", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Map #5 (E)", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Arrowhead", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Fragment", "A sharp, durable bone fragment that appears\nto have been used as the tip of an arrow.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("White Tundra Fur Coat", "Its a heavy but very comfortable fur coat!\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Tarot Cards", "In a small leather pack you would see a\ncollection of tarot cards. Many different\npaintings could be seen on each parchment\nslit, each with a different meaning. (Use\nOnline Tarrot Card Reading for this.)", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Antique Halfling Fishing Rod", "The fishing rod would be made of smooth\nwillow, which has been worn down over many\nyears of use. It has a small gold etching on\nwhich would read \"Lilio Tealeaf 1602", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Joint", "", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("test egg", "a testy egg", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sunken Spear", "Upon contact with this polearm, one is\nflooded with a sense of platonic longing, and\nthe love held with their significant other\nbecomes fleeting as you begin seeking an\nunrealistically fulfilling relationship.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Gorget.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Iced Pearl", "The pearl would glisten in water and in the\nsunlight, its snow and iced center would\nremain in constant dance and never dim", "minecraft:packed_ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Anabella Stone", "A small, palm-sized piece of flat granite.\nThe simple material held many ancient and\nmagical carvings upon it's surface. This\nrune, when activated, compels the user to\ntell the truth and only that.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner of Heinrik Carrion", "A Crimson Banner with a Golden, Lorraine\nCross in the center, owned by Heinrik\nCarrion.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Chinchilla Blanket", "A fairly large blanket that provides the\nluxury of comfort and oozy warmth, this\nblanket's material is incredibly soft and\nplush as it's enough to wrap around your\nwhole persona, the grayish fur shimmer and\nglisten the more you look at it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Jungle Panther Fur", "This is green jungle panther fur. It is soft\nto the touch, but displays an inflexibility\ncharacteristic of the hides of jungle cats.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Bracelet", "A fine leather bracelet made in the Relourian\nstyle.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Crescent Amulet", "A crescent necklace made from brass, when\ntapped twice it would give the wearer blue\neyes, and perfect teeth, or so it seemed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Magnificent Dwarven Forged Gem", "This Gem shines in the light. It is\nmagnificently cut, if held up to the light\nthe light will pass through and fracture,\ncreating beautiful blue flares on any wall\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by L0rdT0mas.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Cosmos", "It was as if looking into infinite nothing, a\nshard made of some unknown material and the\nshape of a quarter of a circle of something.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Muyakelgism.", "minecraft:concrete", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Treasure Box", "A treated mahogany box fortified with bronze\nlinings and a single latch upon it's front.\nThe box is one square foot in volume, and can\nhold roughly 70 pounds with no issue or\nstrain. The mahogany the box is made out of\nhas been sanded to smoothness, treated with\nlinseed oil, than painted over with a\nblack-blue paint. The bronze comprising the\nlining of the chest has been nailed in with\nbronze studs, and is properly sanded and\nshined.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Letter in Low Chant", "I WILL SEE YOU IN SERRIMOR, YDVR\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Serris of Deep Harbour.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Cabernet Sauvignon", "An Elvish Red. It smelled pleasantly of\ngrapes, with tinges of a floral pattern\ndecorating its palette. The wine was aged\nfinely for about sixty years.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blowgun Darts(M. Ruggine)", "Blowgun darts that are wooden with iron\nendings coated with a peculiar liquid. This\nLiquid would be the Moderate Ruggine poison\nthat works by injecting poison into your\nblood stream that lessens oxygen\nconcentration in your body and eventually\nknocking you unconcious. This unconciousness\nlasts based on the strength of your lung\ncapacity.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Licorish.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Forktail Wyvern Scales", "*Moderator Approved*\nAengoth approved this item.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Blowgun", "A hollowed out, polished bone that serves as\na blowgun (2 emote load & fire)", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cerridwen Feathered Pin", "This pin is in thape of the sigil Cerridwen ,\nmother of life. It made with iron and dyed\nwith blue decorations.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sailor", "In your sights is an indescribable Pearl\nchoker, diamonds of 100 Carats encrusted on\nthe sides. The entire piece would stretch\nabout three inches upwards, and when fully\nlaid flat about 8 inches in length.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ragged Teddy Bear", "An incredibly old looking teddy bear. It was\nbeaten and torn, stuffing of the arms nearly\ncompletely depleted. One of its button eyes\nbegan to dangle from its face, threads\nwearing thin. It seems to have suffered water\ndamage, much of its pigment absent.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Loriens.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Blow Gun", "A rather finely crafted blow gun, the\nmaterial of the piece is carved from what\nseems to be the bones of a small animal - the\ninside hollowed out to fit a dart.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blind Folded] Quillian Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Chiir'ii", "A rather well crafed bone dagger would be\npresent, the pommel of such an item would be\ntightly bound in an unfamiliar animal hide.\nThe bone was well polished and clearly used,\nthe edge of such a dagger was well sharpened.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ['V'OnCheek] Quillian Caerme'onn.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("hurf wuz here", "he wuz here\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Covered Basket", "A covered picnic basket. Inside the basket\nwould rest many array of chocolates, white,\ndark, cocco, raspberry, rose, blueberry, and\nblackberry. Each is about the size of a human\nhand, wrapped in cool cloth. On top of the\nbasket is a green cover.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by firegirl7892467.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Quillian's Dagger", "Quilian Serene's dagger.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag of Rocks", "A rough sack filled with rocks.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Mother and Father Tapestry", "This Five by five foot tapestry bears the\nstitchings of the Mother and Father in a\nloving embrace, on the side of the Mother\nholds plantlife them overseen by sunlight. On\nthe side of the father bears dead trees\noverseen by darkness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Simochii.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Renna's Dagger", "An unremarkable iron dagger, visibly rusted\nand bloodied by decades of mishandling and\nmurder, retrieved from the Morghuul's latest\nstab victim - overwhelming the holder with a\nsense of horrid repulsion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by LithiumSedai.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Orenian Coin", "A single minas. An old coin minted in old\nOren. It has a cross minted on one side, and\non the other is a picture of a King, though\nit's hard to tell who.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("109.07801772136207 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mana-Infused Giant Raven Feather", "These enormous feathers were quite beautiful\nin appearance. Miniscule voidal energies\nlingered along its dark-coloured length,\nthough nothing dangerous.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaurs Battle Axe", "An almost comically massive battleaxe rests\nbefore you, double edged and cruelly sharp,\nno mortal man would find the weapon easy to\ncarry , let alone use.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("⚝ The Crow's Claw [T5] ⚝", "Bass Knuckles made of black ferrum with a\nsharp curved blade on one of the extremes, on\nthe middle of the blade there would be a\nsmall golden ideogram infused with golden\nsoulfire, if The Crow’s Claw enters in direct\ncontact with taint or beings of corrupted\nsoul a thin veil of soulfire would be invoked\naround it, causing an unbearable pain and\nburning the corrupted matter that is next to\nit. (Contact Suxals for more info.)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Skull", "The skull of a broad minotaur. The skull\nwould be cracked at the top, but still in\nfairly decent condition.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Voidal Mage", "A staff used by a servant of the Frost Wyrm\nin the South. Carvings can be seen along the\nstaff, some carved with purpose and some out\nof desperation or perhaps madness. At the\nhead of the staff, a small blue gem is seen\nprotruding from the tip, its purpose\nremaining unknown.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Codex der Zweihander", "An old, decaying codex that schools the\nreader on the effective use of greatswords\nsuch as the Zweihander or Flamberge in\nvarious situations of combat.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Pomegranate Juice", "Pomegranate juice, served in a tall glass.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Morea’s claw", "A dagger in which the blade is made from a\nBlack Ferrum core and forge welded Slayer\nSteel edge shaped in the likeness of a wolf's\nclaw measuring around twelve inches. The\nhandle expertly crafted and polished from a\npiece of wood from the reat trees in Caras\nEldar giving it a dark sheen. The dagger of\nthe pommel would have a wolf’s tooth set in\nthe metal to hold it in place. Etched near\nthe base of either side of the blade would be\nthe seal of Gladewynn, made more apparent by\ngold inlay.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lynxy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoking pipe", "A simple yet elegant handmade pipe, made out\nof a piece of Briar wood. The Upper half has\na dark brown/red shade, whereas the bottom is\nblack. The word \"Ithrunnazka\", followed by\nthe letter \"B\" is carved into the side\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Orchid Tea", "A beautifully brewed cup of Blue Orchid Tea.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lich's Mask", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of OtakuPan", "One of the First Members of the Cult..Who has\nseem to have forgotten about the cult last\nseen..", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("warhammer", "", "minecraft:stone_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wood 3", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pork loin", "", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Ladel", "A large spoon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by draja.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Spork", "A spoon-like object with three pointed ends,\nas if a mix of a fork and a spoon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by draja.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Wedding Band", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Mapstone", "A peculiar shard of black marble stricken\nwith white veins. When held tightly, it seems\nto gently pull in a certain direction.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Aevitas", "A beautifully crafted hunter-case watch. The\nexterior of the watch was wrought from\nblack-ferrum, granting the watch a dark yet\nrefined look. The metal lid that closed over\nthe watch-dial and crystal was spring hinged,\nand its surface was carefully detailed -\netched into it were a myriad of swirling\npatterns made from white-gold, at the center\nwas a serpentine dragon attempting to consume\nits tail, an Ouruboros. The interior of the\nwatch was made with Verdantium, giving it an\nemerald hue.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Doriftu.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Elano'sil", "+", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengul Eye Ring", "A golden ring which has intricately designed\nsilver snaking around it, in the center would\nbe beautiful, flawless Aengul eye gem, light\nwould brilliantly reflect off of it\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Cælitum", "A somewhat unassuming pendant, the chain\nwrought from silver. Upon a closer look, one\nwould notice that the gem held by the chain\nglowed faintly - A managem. The enchantment\nplaced upon the jewelry would change the\nappearance of the wearer's skin to that of\nolive, their hair to that of dark chestnut,\nand the irises of their eye to an emerald\ngreen hue. However, the illusion is not\nwithout its flaws as much movement can cause\nflickering to occur. ((Contact Vandameer more\nmore information))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Fire", "A pale green liquid that emits a faint glow\nalong with being slightly cooler compared to\nits surroundings. Much like Alchemist's Fire,\nthis substance is highly volatile and should\nbe handled with great care and caution.\nExposure to even the heat from a candle,\ntorch, or bright sunlight can lead to the\nsubstance combusting violently - burning as\nhot as Alchemist's fire. This would be stored\nwithin an oddly shaped glass flask, with a\nglass cork on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Riftblade.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Moderate Strength", "A flask that contains a vibrant red fluid. If\none were to drink the contents of this flask,\nthey'd feel a surge of strength throughout\ntheir body - capable of greater feats of\nstrength than would have seemed impossible\nprior to drinking the potion. With great\npower though comes quite the price - whoever\ndrinks this potion may be overcome by great\npain, their muscles torn and perhaps their\nbones may even be crushed. It would be wise\nto drink such a potion in small doses.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Doriftu.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Messenger Cod", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Salmon Fish", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Silk Blanket", "A fancy silk blanket. Those who are under the\nblanket will have their scenery change around\nthem as if they were transported to a large\nforest. The sky is dark and full of stars\nwith a full moon peering down at those below.\nA gentle breeze can be felt as the sounds of\nwildlife can be heard around the user. The\nemotions of the wielder will be ever so\nslightly lessened while using this. ((Contact\nFlamboyantRage for more information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Cuff", "A cuff made from the bones of a once\nSeptember bonded human. Carved into it are\nshort elven prayers, and other decorative\nmarkings!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelin.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ikurnam'onn Sil", "A sword with an iconic elven curve, its blade\nfeatures the grain of wood, but it is as hard\nand sharp as honed steel, and twice as light.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Confindo", "A tomahawk with an axe-head fashioned from\nSlayersteel. The weapon's handle was bound\nwith darkened leather made from the hide of\nsome fallen beast. Swirling patterns were\netched into the gilded surface of the\naxe-head, inlaid with silver. A handful of\nbrown feathers, belonging to a falcon, adorn\nthe weapon as well. A weapon not necessarily\nmeant for the thick of battle, though it\nwould make for a fine keepsake.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Doriftu.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Winterleaf Crested Shield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Spriggan Bits", "", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Miok's Special Pearl", "A shiny, petite pearl given to Miok by a\nstranger. The little sprite carries it around\nwith her everywhere, as it reminds her of her\nbest friend, Chii.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Azalea Flower", "A beautiful Azalea flower that emitts a\ncaptivating scent. The petals are soft blue\nin colour, quite unique and seems despite the\ntime that moves onward, does not wilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Torkoal_Tom.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Phoenix Feather", "A feather of a Phoenix, an offering in honour\nof one of the Dominion's greatest Princes.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Pestle", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Wooden Boat!", "The broken front half of a wooden boat toy.\nSome say it has magical powers... others say\nthat its just a bad broken toy...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hyrja.", "minecraft:acacia_boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Chicken Broth", "Broth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by draja.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Spear of White Gold", "A long spear-headed staff made of white hued\naurum. The staff bears a plethora of runic\nsymbols carved along the shaft forming an\nundecipherable sentance which glows a light\nblue luminescence.. What lies within the\nmagical artifact is a mystery..\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Canoe Apparator", "", "minecraft:birch_boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Feather", "A crystalline feather created in a bygone\nera, deactivated runes seemed to be scrawled\nalong the surface of this strange artifact.\nOnce imbued with great power, now falls\nsilent long passed like its creator. The\nleader of the Golden Lance Simon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by booklight12.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Bludgeon", "A simple wooden bludgeon used to impart\nnonlethal blunt force upon a foe. Bearing a\nsimple handle with a leather strap wrapped\naround it, the head of this tool is comprised\nof a simple rounded section with a metal ring\nwrapped around it to secure it.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Blow Dart", "Light darts with a length of 15 cm designed\nto fit into a blowgun, though you could\nprobably throw them with your hands too. Up\nfor a round of darts, anyone?", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Lightroots", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Blue Powder", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Exotic Fish", "An exotic fish in a bag. It has large wavy\nfins and a fat body. Docile and beautiful\nthis fish which hold all the colors of the\nrainbow makes for a perfect pet!", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Weighted Net", "A weighted net made for use in combat, when\nthrown it extends to cover a target, when\npulled, the net constricts and leaves the\ntarget stuck inside of the net until pressure\nis released\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by IclapYOURcheeks.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Note", "Hey there Joker.Soulbinds last until death,\nhence why we advise you do not take items\ninto warzones ect. You will need to either\nget more soulbinds through voting or buy some\nmore - PunifiedZombie\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by PunifiedZombie.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Hidden Dagger", "A dagger decently well hidden and can be hard\nto find at times", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stalin", "I'll put you in a Collective Farm", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of StrawberryCatto", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Apologies", "I Zokhamli Silvervein would like to Apologize\nfor my Clan's actions against your Wife?...\nSome of my men get rather \"intimate\" about\nwomen and it is also Rare to have anything\nbut Dwarves live within the City, I hope we\ncan move on from this incident and forget the\nwhole ordeal. With this letter i have given\nyou one my watches i made allong with some\nother items, Again my Sincere Apologies!", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhic Crystal", "A thanhic crystal mined from deep ice pits.\nWhen held, the crystal would begin to start\nproviding a chilling effect. Prolonged\nholding of the crystal would lead to ice\nburns and major frost bite.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Iron Blade", "An old blade from an old land, rusted over.\nIt's seen much use...", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pelt of a bull", "A pelt of a bull. Maybe someone could find a\ngreater use for it...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("1  SECRET DRINK [221] 1", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Winged Screamer Bone.", "Winged screamer bone. This bone once belonged\nto the infamous winged screamer its light and\nlarge like what you would expect from a bird\nthis size.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Tail", "It looks like a long, thick scorpion tail, 4\nfeet long and tipped with a venomous head.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A peace of clothing", "A green colored clothing piece.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blindfolded] Raven Foggs.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Flint", "A small Bag holding, Sand, Flint, Dirt, and a\nFew Small Rocks. Good for blinding your\nEnemies and Running away, though it needs to\nbe a Good throw.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Briolette Pendant", "A beautiful diamond pendant.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Ring", "A ring made of rather cheap material. It\nhas an odd phrased carved into its side,\nreading \"I'm broke, and you're an\nasshole.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Anti-Elle Shroom", "", "minecraft:red_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Fall Wreath", "A fall wreath made of holly berries,\nthe Amber Festival held in Cerulin in 1508.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Day Lilies", "A bouquet with colors as warm\nand bright as the summer's\nsun. Typically given to one\nwho could use a bit of cheer.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Norm", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Earring", "A beautiful pair of emerald earrings.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Numbing salve against burns", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Recovered Sinew", "Sinew that is half-rotted. Some of it is\nstill seemingly attached. Good for composite\nbows!", "minecraft:beetroot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bird Cage", "This simple-looking iron cage holds a young,\nblack, rested raven within. The cage itself\nis well looked after, with the floor beneath\nthe raven cleaned regulary.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Fine Grain Cactus Green", "", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Elvish towershield", "", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Blacksteel Cane", "A Blacksteel cane reaching one's hip in\nheight. Its heel would be sharp like a\nspear's shaft, leaving small holes on soft\ngrounds. The handle would be Y-shaped and\nmade of steel instead.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("[R.F.E Made.] Flaming Tipped Hunting Spear", "Simple spear honestly what do you suspect\nit's shaped like that of a boar hunting\nspear. The tip made of steel as most would\nhope while also having a round gem seeming be\npartly infused in the metal. The pole then is\nsimply made of oak that's a bit older than a\nlot most younger descendants at this time.\nNow if one would tap the gem two times a dim\nlight bluish color come off of it before\nafter another moment the spear's head would\nbecome alight with flames. (2-3 emotes. Pm\ndarkelfs on more info)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Robyn Vulnear.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Rogue Centennialis", "A bottle of fine red wine with a vintage date\nof 1600, commemorating the beginning of the\n17th century.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Abel's Map", "Abel's very precious map, he like's it alot\nyes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Abel.", "minecraft:filled_map", ""),
        StaticItem("Prosperiously Fertile Blessed Soil of Krugmar Sponsored By Krug & Co", "A very..strange, but special chunk of soil\nhaving quite the exotic smell and dark\ntexture it bleaming with fertility and grace.\nIt even has a special metal nugget enscribed\nwith a K on the several sides of the chunk of\nsoil. It smells of epic!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by jhon_boat.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
