        StaticItem("Woodchopping Axe", "A rather simple iron axe with a small head.\nIt is made for chopping wood and nothing\nmore, though, it could be used in combat in\nneeded.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TitanOfTheDepths.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pure Carbarum", "A fist-sized chunk of Carbarum. It is quite\nheavy and will easily shatter from the strike\nof a hammer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ellenora.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Stud Earrings", "Be the picture of elegance with these pink\ndiamond stud earrings! The tiny jewels dot an\noctagonal setting , twinkling even in the\ndimmest of lights. Traditional in style, this\nshimmering pair is secured with 4 claws of\nblue kyanite and set within 20ct white gold,\nfitted to perfection. This item truly\nexhibits superb craftsmanship and quality.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Throwing Stone", "A heavy stone for throwing. It takes two\nhands to lift this stone, but when thrown it\ndeals a crushing blow to enemies. ((Three\nemotes to lift. If connected is heavy enough\nto crush bones.))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:emerald_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Local fish", "One mark per six.", "minecraft:cod", ""),
