        StaticItem("Mournstone Wrath", "Bright red crimson colored. Intense vanilla\naromatics balanced with notes of strawberry,\nblack cherry and black pepper. The vanilla\naromatics carry through on the palate and\ncompliment subtle flavors of red currants\nleading into the dry, long finish featuring\ncoffee and a hint of tobacco.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Xalid Mournstone.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mournstone White", "With an aroma of green apple and a floral\nundertone, this wine displays a smooth\nelegance. The aromas and flavors show nuances\nof baked apples and cinnamon, ending in a\nrich oak finish.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Xalid Mournstone.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
