        StaticItem("Mournstone Sweet", "Lithe and filigreed, displaying dried citrus,\npineapple, and apricot as vibrant acidity and\nfinishes with ripe berry and sweet honey\nnotes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Xalid Mournstone.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or Miruel (Haelun'or Red)", "A deep purple wine with a strong taste, best\nsuited to be enjoyed alone or with roasted\nfoods or rich meats. The wine is produced\nfrom the Valmuel'feta grape, aged in dark oak\nbarrels to add to its rich taste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or Reserve Tea", "A creamy blend of vanilla and citrus, this\ntea delights those that want something\ndifferent. It is sweet, yet not as sweet as\nother teas. It is balanced, with hints of\nvanilla mixed amongst other, slightly bolder\ncitrus flavors\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun’or miruel (Haelun’or red)", "A deep purple wine with a strong taste, best\nsuited to be enjoyed alone or with roasted\nfoods or rich meats. The wine is produced\nfrom the Valmuel’feta grape, aged in dark oak\nbarrels to add to its rich taste.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
