        StaticItem("Akal'suikaonn (Golden Sweet)", "A sweet golden/amber wine, perfect for\ndesserts or leisurely consumption. The wine\nis produced from the Len'tuveh grape, aged in\njungle wood barrels to ensure a well rounded\nand soft finish to the wines taste.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BronCloch.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
