        StaticItem("Haelun’or ibar (Haelun’or white)", "A soft white wine of a pale yellow color,\nperfect for spicy cuisine, fish, and chicken.\nThe wine is produced from the Len’tuveh\ngrape, aged in birch barrels to added to the\nsoftness of the wine.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or Ibar (Haelun'or White)", "A soft white wine of a pale yellow color,\nperfect for spicy cuisine, fine, and chicken.\nThe wine is produced from the Len'tuveh\ngrape, aged in birch barrels to add to the\nsoftness of the wine.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or Mint Tea", "A soft, sweet tea made from spearmint leaves.\nIt is a Mali'aheral favorite, for it's soft\ntaste and lingering scent. It is served by\nitself or mixed with other tea flavors to\ncreate sweet concoctions.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bodin's Nordengradic Merchant Licence", "An official document bearing the Ruric seal.\nIt grants Bodin of Nordengrad the right to\nconduct business in the Earldom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("In a variety of hues!", "We carry White, Light grey, Grey, Black, Red,\nPink, and Cyan. Custom colors can be\nrequested. One mark per twenty wool.", "minecraft:white_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Wilfred's Mill Licence", "An official document bearing the pursers\nseal. It grants Elenyr Wilfred the right to\nfell trees and operate a lumber mill within\nthe Earldom of Nordengrad.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Mining Pickaxe", "A standard iron pickaxe used by miners. It is\nutilized for gathering metals, stones, and\ngems from beneath the earth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ellenora.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Bear Skull", "The skull of a giant bear, whoever took it\ndown must be an impressive hunter!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B3ast_Mod.", "minecraft:skeleton_skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ravenous", "This pitch black greatsword would be as tall\nas a man, dark misty energy would linger\naround the blade giving it an ominous, near\nsuffocating feeling to whoever nears it. On\nthe body of the blade would be an engraving\nof a three headed hydra.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bastion", "A relic of the past, this kite-shield would\nhave a strange black luster to it. A dark\nmisty aura is visibly coming from the shield\nwhile a three headed hydra would be carved at\nits front. Due to the material used to make\nthe shield it would give those who stare at\nit a feeling of dread.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Desert's Wrath", "Crafted from a scaddernak's exo-skeleton, the\nchestpiece would let out an intimidating aura\nsimilar to a ferocious beast. It would be\nblack in color but would let out an ominous\nred glow from it's gaps. The chitin is held\ntogether by meteorite and has the fur of iron\nskinned bear inside of it to act as padding.", "minecraft:diamond_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Greymane Boar Hide", "The Hide of a Greymane Boar, grey fur striped\ndown the middle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:brown_wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A large, jagged diamond about the size of an apple.", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Clay Slug", "This slug seems to be a compound of bone,\nsand and mostly clay. They are prone to dry\nout if not provided with water.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur Pelt", "The pelt of a minotaur. The fur is rough and\nquite bloody. Perhaps someone could find a\ngreater use for it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Special Wine Skin", "A wineskin made from the skin of an Iron Skin\nBear, making it harder damage and easier to\nclean due to the steel like texture of the\nmaterial", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("A Lovely Plumed Peacock Feather", "A lovely plumed peacock feather, well-kept\nand easily distinguished by the eye-shaped\narea at the top. It is surprisingly soft,\nthough the tip is dyed black with the\nremnants of past writings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by countessem.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Tip Needle", "Except for its Diamond tip, this needle is\nmostly made out of steel. Thicker than the\naverage needle it seems it was made with\nusing special materials in mind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by B3ast_Mod.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Coin", "An absolutely ancient-looking disc of bronze.\nThe design that was once pressed into its\nsurface has been lost to rust. This coin\nseems to have belonged to a civilization long\nforgotten.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A Blank Parchment", "A vacant piece of paper made of sheepskin --\nA heart etched into its upper, leftmost\ncorner; One may consider using it for listing\nsecret fancies, lost loves, or romantic\naspirations.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Videl, The Young", "A wide, one handed broadsword forged for the\nadept swordsman. The sword itself seems easy\nenough to learn, but may find best use in the\nhands of a more experienced fighter. The wide\nblade gives weight and strength, while the\nthickness makes it usefull for smacking\nthings. The crossguard of the blade is\nflanked by two thick aurum triangles which\nhug the lower end of the blade. The edge is\ncomposed of shining bluesteel, while the\ninner part is made of a dark, durable ferrum\nof sorts, jet black in color. A truly\nremarkable weapon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LordRoberto.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle with yellow liquid.", "this bottle contains a yellow liquid, it\nsmelling like urine when opening it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by APurfectNobody.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
