        StaticItem("Sandvich", "A Sandvich, the perfect Sanvich made by\nAhtoh, the 2nd Perfect Olog-Man, Given out by\nAhtoh, or Sold by Ahtoh.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blacksmith] AHTOH.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
