        StaticItem("Caliph royal Shamshir", "A royal Caliph Shamshir past down from\ngeneration to father to son, a jewel of the\nSoulstone found by Caliph faiz is place in\nthe hilt", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kronos Noril", "A Black-Ferrum case, Forged in the great\nforge of Mynebor, it has been forged just so,\nthat when two the bottles and sack of Pure\nThanium are detonated, the blast will go in\none direction with far more potential energy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Forge Lord] Balrog Grandaxe.", "minecraft:stonebrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Lumière mystère", "Shining over a pure silver ring, was a set of\nthree, large rubies, intertwined between a\nsparkling diamond that effervesced a charm of\nclass and luxury. In the curve of the ring,\nindented in small, neat handwriting: “La\nBetroix Bijoux.”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Illiran Drennan.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Kadarsi Golem Hand", "A Golem Hand, The Outside completely Visible\nunless Covered Up; It also must be powered\nSomehow and has to be attached to the bone.\nIt's made with a Golem hand, and Repair\ntools.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Mr. Cluckerz Corpse", "The corpse of the late chicken, Mr. Cluckerz.\nHe was brutally murdered by Frederick\nMatias' Santiago. Rest in Peace, Mr.\nCluckerz\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Blind] Aayliah.", "minecraft:chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Warning Slip", "This is an official warning from the GM team.\nYour conduct against the Dominion was found\nto be excessively and unnecessarily trolly in\nnature. The intent of the interaction was\nclearly to harass the playerbase and\nreinforced by no rp compulsion\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
