        StaticItem("Egg Ornament", "An ornate, egg shaped decoration with a white\nbase color. Elaborate blue swirl and flower\npatterns had lovingly been painted on with\ngentle gold accents. Clearly, the maker had\ngone all out to ensure the quality was\noutstanding.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Down Under Bed", "Everything is in reverse. It's unsettling...", "minecraft:bed", ""),
