        StaticItem("September's Bane", "This well made sword has Beautiful carvings\nin it's hilt, Making it stand out in a crowd", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elvish Fountain Pen", "An ornately crafted Elvish fountain pen. It\nwould be housed in a darkly stained wood,\nvine patterns crawling throughout it. A\nsingle band of bronze separates the body from\nthe cap. The tip of the fountain pen itself\nis made of a beautiful silver, which shimmers\nslightly when not doused by ink. Upon the end\nof the pen is the insignia of a flaming leaf\n- signature of the Silma smiths.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Loriens.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Ingot", "A Reward Medal, for doing 2 or more\nObjective's Correctly! The Writing on it\nwould say \"Congradulations! 1698 Kadarsi\nFestival\" It would also have a smal picture\nof The Kadarsi Palace on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Spriggancraft Amber Glaive", "An oversized and heavy glaive towering at\neight feet tall. Its staff is formed of\nhealthy, living wood adorned with gnarled\nbark and beautiful autumn leaves. The\npolished amber blade glimmers sunset orange\nin the light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Spriggan Matron] Yew.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Red Cloth Doll", "A rather simple looking doll made entirely of\ncloth with button eyes, and a frilled dress.\nThis limp ragdoll smiles from beneath the\ncover of a white and red bonnet, obviously\ncrafted with care.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Knight's Note", "The note found on the Body of a Strange\nKnight. The notr would read, \"Find Grand\nPrince Aelthir of Fenn. He, along with many\nother nobles, must fall. You know what to do\n~P.A\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Redstone Comparator", "A Miniture Arcane Relay, Much Faster than a\nbird, and the Fence post that normal holds\nthe ball is 1/4 of a stick holding a a ball\nthe size of a marble!", "minecraft:comparator", ""),
        StaticItem("Lapis Lazuli", "A Janissary Captain Figurine, Molded by Blue\nClay, Painted the proper Colors for a\nJanissary Captain, Small sword and Janissary\nCaptain Clothes, and Janissary Captain Hat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Mutton", "Pure Chocolate Shaped like Mutton", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Drink Mix", "A pinkish powder in a pitch treated leather\nsac that smells heavilly of strawberries.\nMeant to be discerningly poured into milk for\nthe purpose of making a strawberry flavoured\ndrink.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Blasting Blueberry Pop Powder ⌘", "A very small packet of blue, edible powder.\nUpon tasting it, it tingled and gently popped\non the surface of your tongue. The blueberry\nflavour was intense for the first few\nseconds, and eventually died down for a\npleasant time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kid Scouts Bakery and Shoppe.", "minecraft:concrete_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Brass-Nickel Knuckles", "Knuckle dusters made of a Brass-Nickel Alloy,\ndurable and capable of withstanding a large\namount of force, keep away from children.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("God bread", "The almighty, God bread", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugilite", "A Purplish Stone, Called Sugilite, Used for\nHealing, It can heal anyone old or young,\nrace or different race. It is used in the\nHealing arts as both Healing Magic and a\nItem.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Marble", "A Balck Gem, Called Onyx, One of the Gems in\nthe Gem Set, it is used to Enlighten people.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Small bit of paper!", "Apon this small bit of paper read a small\nlittle message, it read \"The darkness is\ncoming for you doctor, enjoy your time while\nit lasts", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Ronia's Monk Bread", "A spicy twist on the regular Monk Bread, it\nhas Sesame Seeds on the top and Sunflower\nSeeds on the bottom. It also has a slight\nnote of Cayenne Pepper!", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Forjador the Fireweaver", "A Mighty Smithy Hammer, Made of Thamnium, for\nonly the Finest Goods, and is slightly bigger\nthan a average Smithy Hammer. There would be\nBlue Runes imbedded in the Top of the Hammer,\nglowing whenever it makes some type of Item.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Halsworthy - Tokoko peace treaty", "This is the peace treaty made on the 9th of\nthe first seed, 1698. Signed by Randal Bordet", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Lubba Scale Shield", "A Shield, made of a 2x Young Lubba Scales.\nThough the Shield is light, it is Just as\nPowerful as Wrought Iron. The Shield looks\nBeatiful, with the Lubba Scales.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Fendravur", "An ornate smithing hammer made of a polished\nmetal that seems to pulse with power in your\nhand. Engraved on the side of the head is the\nphrase 'Kerikfend al'Nimdravur', which glows\nunder certain circumstances.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Pledge", "A small lapia statue of a rearing stag with a\nsilver orb between its antlers. This is a\ntoken gifted to clerics who have passed the\nTrial of Experience.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kender123.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vegan Cheesecake", "A scrumptious treat made to resemble a real\ncheesecake! This is an alternative created\nwith a blend of various ingredients such as\nvanilla extract and cashews. For those that\ncannot bear dairy products for one reason or\nanother! There's a delicious strawberry glaze\nspread on its top! Yum!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Velulaei Elillera.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Keint Family Longsword", "A well crafted double edged longsword, forged\nby a master smith. An old phrase is inscribed\nalong the length of the blade, reading:\nTreun anns a' chath.' The crossguard extends\nout to give as much protection to the\nwearer's hands. A gemstone is fastened to the\ncenter of the crossguard, it gleams\nbrilliantly with green and blue hues, like a\nsubmerged forest, the pommel has been\nreshaped in the form of a lion's head\nroaring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Vorgraven.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvrun's Fury", "A beautifully made slayersteel Crowsbeak\nhammer. On the head, there would be a gem\nencrusted into it, and once the user taps the\ngem twice in quick succession, an electrical\ncharge would start to form, which would rush\ninto anything the crowsbeak head impacts\nwith! (PM FlemishSupremacy for more details.)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Smithing.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Betrothal Dagger", "A 15 degree curved blade is held by a grip\nwrapped in red leather. The grip is protected\nby a jagged, curled guard of gold leaf eagle\nwings. The blade itself measures 12” and\ncarries an intricate almost flowing water\nlike design. The dagger’s tang is concealed\nby leather and polished bone fixed by bronze\nrivets.((OOC this is a damascus steel\ndagger))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Faceless Priest.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dead Coyote Head", "The head of an undead coyote, rotten and\nbashed in. The neck is cut crudely, a poorly\npreformed execution.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Headless] Dead Coyote.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Mantle", "A mantle of thick black leather, falling to\njust below the shoulders. The leather was\ntreated with mobility and insulation in mind.\nA scabbard hangs on a leather band behind one\nshoulder, and the interior is lined with row\nupon row of pockets.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ComboFodder.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Owl Badge", "A tarnished iron signet denoting the face of\nan owl; History buffs may recall this\ncoin-like badge was afforded to a few\nindividuals capable of great feats of magic\nduring the Westerland's war against Mordring.\nThey were awarded provisionally and thus this\nbadge lacks an engraving of a specific name,\nbut it appears to have been buried for quite\na long time, safe from the elements. Perhaps\nthere's some way to identify it. [ PM Gallic\nfor information. ]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Energy Spike", "A Dark Energy Spike, from Jarsek", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Wavy Greatsword", ".", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Water", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Mini Marble Chess Set", "A checker-patterned piece of marble and glass\nmade for the purpose of chess! The squares\nare hued white and red, and the chess pieces\nare a standard design albeit also made from\nmarble. It measures at only about one foot by\none foot and therefore is some what\nminiature-sized.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Velulaei Elillera.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Shovel", "A Citar ;looks like a OOC Guitar; It has A\nDrum Attached to it, along with a Whistle,\nflute, and Apple for eating", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Carpet", "A Small Cloth Sack full of Food Taken from a\nPicnic place at the Druidic order, Taken by\nOsman Kharadeen\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Pickaxe", "A Steel, Pickaxe, the Head bent, and Steel\nadded to it, to make a Iron/Steel Mace. It\ndoes good Damage against Wooden Sheilds.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Door", "A Shield Made of Steel, Spikes Covering it, 2\nEye Holes at the Top for looking, Made to be\nput on the ground whenever. A Very Heavy\nShield.", "minecraft:iron_door", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Trapdoor", "A Steel Armgaurd, Leather Patting on the\nInside, it is not only Comfyish but Solid as\na Rock.", "minecraft:iron_trapdoor", ""),
        StaticItem("End Rod", "A Warmth Stick, when Shaken only last for 20\nSaints Minutes, Only able to be Shaken 5\ntimes, And does burn Lower Parts.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Oyashimi Cherry Blossom", "A colorful flower originating in the south of\nAeldin in the Oyashimi Shogunate. It's bright\nshades stir a sense of serenity.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _WACKO.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ban Potion", "Drinking this potion will either get you\nbanned or let you unban/ban whichever player\nyou want. Choose wisely.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mystery GM.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Smoothie", "SssssLlllUuuuRrrrrPppp.\nSsssTttttHhhhhLllllUuuuuuRrrrrrPpppp", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Tissue Box", "Good for you if you wanna blow out some\nGoober's or Cry out some Tears", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dim Sum", "Some Yummy Soup, In a Bamboish Type Basket...\nYum!", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Boom Stick", "", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Bardiche", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Plant with eatable berries", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pufferfish Soup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Elena Aladeen", "A Janissary Figure, not to different but\nlooks like A beatiful Ibraheem in a Janissary\nOutfit, and Janissary Hat, of which is a\nwoman.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Just a normal.. ordinary stick :3", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Custom Item Receipt", "These receipts seem to be special custom item\nreceipts from Jarsek's Smithing Shoppe,\nwaiving the normal charge of 500 mina.\nOne-time use per receipt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jarsek Myrsta.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("String", "Bondage ropes", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Sign", "Cailben's Shit", "minecraft:sign", ""),
        StaticItem("Preserved Badger Thigh", "A dried and preserved thigh of a badger. The\nbadger's thigh still has it's fur, though it\nis now stringy, and dried out. It bears a\npleasant fragrant scent, seemingly to have\nbeen treated with myrrh.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Irawyn.", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Hindered Bread", "A molded gleaming sandwich.. being anything\nbut pleasing looking as Eldrich slugs squirm\nthrough-out it, attempting to consume it's\nlife-force to no avail.. Mold dotting the\nsurface of the bread - (OOC: PM Nafari for\nReference. )\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thalanil Avern.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Butcher Knife", "A butcher knife, inscribed on its metal is\nthe signature, 'Made by Caleb Crider, Master\nSmith.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Hoe", "The Staff has a few things Engraved in it,\nthe Staff also has a Hidden Sword Able to\ncome out at the Staff's \"Handle\" and a Pocket\nKnife at the bottom of it, The Two Hidden\nBlades are Hardly Able to be Seen.", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Jimmy Slopper", "Clan Gorkil best Clan. Laks have blue balls.\nRaguks have small cocks. Lurs are gay and\nYars suck nugs :)", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bag o' Poo", "A steamy bag of [redacted]", "minecraft:soul_sand", ""),
        StaticItem("Star Shaped Earrings", "A pair of dazzling diamond earrings, the\nwhite golden base fluttering a sophisticated\nstar shape, coated in a sea of diamonds of\nall shapes and sizes. At the base of the\nwhite gold, ‘Black Rose Company’ Would be\nneatly engraved.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Walter the Rave Crab's Eye", "A Eye plucked out from Walter the Rave Crab,\nnext to the Dominion, Plucked out by: Rafias\nDrazorver.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Satchel", "A Satchel Holding a Book along with a\nModerate Healing Potion, Moderate Strength\nPotion, and Moderate Speed Potion, along with\na Few Bandages\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RhythmrhymE.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Broth", "A rich, hearty broth made from the bone\nmarrow of cow, deer, and boar. Herbs would\nhave been steeped in it, giving it extra\nnutrients.", "minecraft:beetroot_soup", ""),
        StaticItem("Training Sword", "A fine, hand carved sword. It would be finely\npolished, so the wood would have a golden\nhue. Delicate designs would be etched into\nthe 'blade'. They'd depict interwoven plants\nand animals, showing a unity of nature. The\noverall design would resemble a regular\nsword. It would be weighted perfectly, so as\nto teach the owner how to move with a\nbalanced blade. It would be the perfect size\nfor a child to train with.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemical Bomb", "A light blue, whispy substance would swirl\naround in the bottle. When thrown, the potion\nwill create a concussive explosion, similar\nto that of a regular bomb. The blast will\nincinerate anything within four blocks of it,\nand severly burn anything within thirteen\nblocks. The explosion also leaves blue\nflames, which burn where the explosion\noccured and will quickly spread. The vial\nrequires at least two emotes the throw and\nyou only have one emote to get away.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Alfius Elpyne.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hammer Holder", "Arcane I\nA large green leather pouch with a string\ncord to tie it shut. if one were to look at\nthe bottom of the leather satchel they'd find\na large fist sized emerald infused into it.\nWhen the correct phrase is murmured a brown\nvoidal rift should be created in the bag\nallowing something like infinite storage.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ElfenLie.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Al-Mahdi Walking Staff", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("BlackHeart", "A bastard sword that reaches five feet from\nthe bottom of the hilt to the tip of the\nblade. The handle is wrapped in a darkened\nleather and each side of the hand guards\ncurve upwards into jagged points. The sword\nitself has been crafted from a darker mixture\nof iron, giving the blade a deeper, onyx\ncoloration to it's already imposing features.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cup of tea", "This steaming hot cup of tea would smell\nwonderful, And warm you to the core as you\ndrank it, It would taste of berries and have\na sweet aftertaste", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Compass", "A small object, the glass cracked due to\ndamage. When you hold it, it only points to\nthe North.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Augustus' Sword", "A 35 inch long cutlass, belonging to Captain\nAugustus Septimus. The blade itself is rusted\nbut the handle still Golden showing wealth.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("OwO", "What dis", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Invigorating Biscuit", "A dainty biscuit that fills the eater with\nease and relaxation.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Roast beef", "", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("ANARCHO-CAPITALISM FOR DUMMIES", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("cash money dispenser", "When in main hand:\n+7 Attack\n-3 Armor", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("First Kill on BattleF. [Lucas84775]", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Baby Slime Pet", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Quavinir's Pouch of Caltrops", "A medium sized, hardy leather bag, filled to\nthe brim with sharp caltrops, made with the\nintent of piercing leather boots. It is tied\nclose with a white drawnstring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("Nam Gloria Her", "This war axe is weighted, giving off a blue\nshimmer. The claws and teeth of various\ncreatures are displayed around the eye and\nbeard of the axe, hanging from a small, black\nrope. The body and throat of the handle have\nbeen wrapped in dark brown leather, while the\nknob has been rung through and fortified for\na rope. The double-edged bit has been\ntediously sharpened, with seemingly obsessive\nstrokes. The back handle is as inscribed: \"Ad\nDominatorem Meum\".", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Captain Boots ⌘", "The boots of the Belvitzian Captain Rutledge\n(1_Language_1)", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Fate", "When Fate takes you far out, there is always\na way home.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Mute] Cohan.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("<< First Aid Kit >>", "This cyan first aid kit is stitched with a\nlarge, white, medic’s cross on it. Inside\nwere compartments for vials. This kit\ncontains a refillable, clearly marked, vial\nof each of the following: Blissfoil, Tippen’s\nroot for basic wounds, and Aqua Nymph Oil for\nburns wounds. In an adjunctioning\ncompartment, a pouch is filled with\nGiscolovini-coated bandages, while another is\nwith needle and thread.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Matthias Rutledge.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cap of the Gnome", "This hat is lightly stiched with tender\naffection. Its a rather small fit for most\nheads, but it does feel as if it connects you\nto the world.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Default Adrian Guard Ale", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dried Ker'lomi Mushrooms", "A small bag of dried and spiced cave\nmushrooms. These fungi, while not\nparticularly edible-looking, dissolve in hot\nwater to make a rich and flavorful umami\nbroth.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Adunian Claymore", "A four foot five inch long blade weighing at\nfive and a half pounds. It has Adunian runes\ninscribed in the blade and embedded in the\nbutt of the hilt and on both sides of the\nhandles are three illustrious sapphires.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Belvitz Tax Paper", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Diddyski.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ur Child", "Type /ss for more information", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruined Ratiki Spear", "A smaller spear set on aged and rotten wood.\nOnce it seems it may have been an effective\nweapon, though time has ruined it to near\nuseless. Nevertheless, it is a fair trophy;\nstolen from a Ratiki camp\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Orthodox Cross", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Thermia Vial", "A orange tinited liquid sits inside the\nbottle, which smells strongly of peaches.\nOnce ingested, this potion boosts body\ntemperature, though not in an uncomfortable\nway. It maintains a stable temperature which\nmakes the body more resistant to frostbite\nand hypothermia, though not immune. It also\nkeeps the consumer more warm in colder\ntemperatures. Common side effects include\nmild anger and the general effects last about\na day. Consuming in large quanities may\nresult in severe body overheating.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netherworld15.", "minecraft:potion", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_48(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Gladewynn Conscrip Kite-Shield", "The standard Gladewynn Conscript Kite-shield\nsizes up to the average man's Elbow with the\nkited end reaching halfway towards the\nshoulder. This shield has been reinforced by\ntreatment techniques to add additional\ndurability upon the elder spruce frame. The\nshield weighs around 7kg (15 lbs) oddly\nheavier than a normal kite while more\nprotective with additional leather bordering,\nthe shield in whole sum will protect the user\nwhen properly wielded with expertise,\nadvisably used for bashing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Thorvn Bronwyn.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Peace Keeper", "An artisan longsword with a blue hued blade\nthat has swirling patterns, denoting it as\nthe light, sharp, and durable, Damascus\nSteel. A rare type of alloy. The crossguard,\nwhile ornate with the same swirls, has\nextensions on the side, little nails to catch\nweapon strikes. On the sword's rainchappe is\nthe Ouroboros with an eye residing in a\nflask. The hilt is finely wrapped and the\nthreaded pommel is diamond shaped.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus of Heldenburg.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Prince Treelord Sap", "Within the vial would be a strange, swirling\nmixture of purplish sap from a September\nPrince's treelord husk. It emits a strange\naura that can only be felt to those attuned\nto nature.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by niceguynorman.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Off Wooden Flesh", "The item held in question would be the wooden\nflesh from a September Prince's Treelord. It\nheld a strange aura to those attuned to\nnature. The visual look of it would be a more\ntwisted, darker wood with bits of dried\npurple sap here and there.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by niceguynorman.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Twisted Treelord's Right Arm", "The limb held in question has a strange,\ntwisted aura emitting from it to all those\nattuned to nature. It being from one of the\nSeptember's Soul Trees itself. The look of it\nwas more a dark wooden texture that held\nstill some oozing, purple sap deep within it\nif one were to cut it open.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by niceguynorman.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Branch of a Prince's Soul Tree", "The branch held would be similar to an aspen\ntree yet the leaves itself almost as if\ncrystal in look with a strange, viridian\ngreen hue emitting from it. To those attuned\nto nature, it held a strange aura. The bark\nwould be rather hard to break, mimicking that\nof a Soul Tree's durability.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by niceguynorman.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Solvent", "This bottle of dark red fluid is actually an\nacid, one capable of dissolving organic\nmaterial, albeit not instantly. Over the\ncourse of minutes, it would break down and\neat away at the afflicted area, coagulating\nblood and eventually eating right through the\narea. Use with caution, and if affected, be\nsure to get it off or somehow dilute it. Once\nactivated, it lasts for thirty minutes before\ngoing inert.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tax Exempt", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by SaintPaint.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ambrosia Ale", "A modest bottle of ale. The glassware\ndesigned by something of an artisan; evident\nby the shape of an elixir that was acid\netched onto the glass. The orange-gold\nalcohol inside is something to behold; a\nsweet and spiced drink, balanced out by a\nslight tartness, though it compliments the\nfull-bodied, and almost fruity taste. A great\ndrink to enjoy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Plagueweed", "Two strands of very foul smelling Plageweeds\nthat are a Torture to every descendants nose.\nCould make a very horribly smelling tea\nperhaps?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of org_the_robo", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Signet Ring", "An elegant ring made of silver; it appears to\ndepict a rising sun made of rubies, at it's\ncenter a dark sapphire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Illuminare.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Crocodile Skin", "A crocodile skin. It's thick and quite rough.\nPerhaps someone could turn it into\nprotection, or find some other use for it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Pot of Shekels", "A large-sized steel pot gleaming with a\ngolden tint. If one were to look inside, they\nwould marvel at the spectacle offered by many\nshiny shekels of pure gold.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Minor Potion of Celerity", "A thin, light green liquid would sit inside\nthe bottle. The contense, if swallowed, would\nslightly increase the reflexes and agility of\nthe one who ingested it. They would be able\nto move quicker and dodge faster for about\ntwo minutes before have slowed reflexes and\nmovement for three minutes. If one were to\ntake multiple, the effects would be\nmultiplied accordingly, as well as the after\neffects.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Netherworld15.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Text", "Notes, political documents, letters, and\nessays written in an ancient language.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Fagouli's Premium Soup", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Franklin the Spider", "A small spider, roughly the size of an\nadult's palm, would scurry about before you.\nIt has many red eyes and is covered in fine\nblack hairs. It tends to like to burrow into\nclothing and sitting atop heads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Horse Figurine", "This polished wood sculpture depicts a\ngalloping horse, mounted by a woman in\nleather armor. Every detail is exquisitely\ncarved, and the wood is child-proof, devoid\nof any splinters or jagged ends.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Filled Urn", "A container rife with the ashes of those\ndeceased", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("pistachio nuts", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("THE BLADE OF BIG PATTY", "OPON THE TRIAL OF THE CENTURY, WHEN ADRIAN", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Global warming isn't real", "Deal with it. It just isn't.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Blogus's Swollen Balls", "After an incident with a pufferfish Blogus's\nballs needed to be healed by the holy powers\nof Belka. They are now a sought after\nROLEPLAY item amongst collectors", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("A Light in Shining Darkness", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("<---- You cant see this", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Man at Arms] Umar Ibn Salem the 'Bloodied Fist'.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Vladov Prime Rib", "A cut from the Vladov Holsteins. A truly\nvalued cut.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Kid_Mackin.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("The Baby Maker", "*A hefty stick, full of sea men. It was\nwrought with the babies of many a cunt, and\ncoated in jews. Should it slay you it would\nimpregnate! The touch would be warm and\nslimey slithery and silky!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Moorke.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ass-Eater", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Goat's Foot Lever", "A clever device that fits the body of a\ncrossbow, hooking onto the string and\nallowing the user to pull the lever to cock\nthe weapon. The device is cast out of pewter,\nan adjustable screw down the center lets you\nadapt it for your crossbow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Transoxiana.", "minecraft:tripwire_hook", ""),
        StaticItem("Resolve; Struggler's Blade", "A twisted zweihander with great powers.\n[www.tinyurl.com/ya74xgwa for more\ninformation]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Communion Ash", "An odd, shimmering lump of ash. It commands a\ncurious aura, and when beheld, one can almost\nhear faint whispers ...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Mage Gloom", "A dagger of fairly simple make. The dagger's\nhandle was bound in darkened leather, giving\nthe wielder a comfortable grip on the weapon.\nWhat was most unusual about the dagger was\nits blade - the blade had a somewhat purple\nhue to it, giving it an almost otherworldly\nlook. If a practioner of Voidal magics were\ncut by this blade, they'd feel great pain due\nto the Void Horror's blood in which this\ndagger was quenched. The crossguard was\nwrought from steel, intricate patterns etched\nonto it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gamma_Byte.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Messer", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Naakh", "The seemingly mundane branch of a willow\ntree, snapped to suit the purpose of a\nGoblin's staff. PM thekingofthemoon to\ninteract!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheKingOfTheMoon.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Boomascus Hammer", "A fine warhammer fit for one or two handed\nusage. The grooved head carries patterns akin\nto damascus steel, with a moveable sparkwheel\nattached to it and a mechanism on the well\nwrapped handle. When the mechanism is\nactivated via a lever on the handle, the\nwheel turns and ignites the steel to be a\nredhot; what's even stranger is the grooves\nseem to be able to store small amounts of a\nmaterial for some use. ((PM Niv_Mizzet for\nmore info))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hyperthinking.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("KagWurt", "", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Order Sickle", "A short-hand scythe frequently utilised by\nthe Vaeyl Executioners of the Vaeyl Order's\n3rd Banner. It's a razor sharp and lightning\nquick blade that can be easily concealed. It\nis well-suited to the assassins and spies of\nthe 3rd Banner.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Entrapping Rods", "These collapsible metal rods brandish a set\nof gems and focal crystals. Within the\ncreations are small rift that generate mana\ntowards the arcane power; the items, when set\nup -- and once a phrase is uttered -- will\nspan an arcane barrier towards each rod,\ncovering the sides, above, and below. The\nfarther these rods are away from one another,\nthe weaker the barriers.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Voidgazer's Monacle", "A fine disc of eldritch material mounted on a\nhighly refined arcanium base. Crafted from\nthe eye of a dark one, the otherwordly\neyepiece warps the vision of those whom are\nbold enough to gaze through it, presenting\nthe wearer with the ability the ability of\neffortlessly percieve the magical value of\nthe world before them. The guard is fixed\nwith assorted jewels. It shimmers a whimsical\nglow, portraying the plethora of enchantments\nlaced in its framework.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Elad_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aluneth, Greatstaff of the Voidgazer", "An odd staff, forming an impossible design\nthrough standard woodworkers. The ebon\nboughed shaft brandishes purple leathery\nstraps which fit snuggly onto the wood, bound\nby magegold to keep it in place, though its\nhead is truly the oddity:ripped and connected\nby arcane streams, stabalizing and suspending\nthe head: metallic purple alloy that sported\na spiky design which curled about an abyssal\nrift the size of a fist. The rift tears open\nholes in reality, displacing incoming hazards\na meter away.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Elad_.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Vaeyl Pavise", "A thick, bronze-layered wooden shield once\nutilised by a Vaeyl Orderman in the defence\nof Atlas. It is painted in the black and\nwhite of the Vaeyl Order, and its light\nweight and sturdiness render it to be a\nuseful tool of defence. It was found among\nthe dead at the Battle of the Wastes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Encrypted Notes", "An old book with cracked leather binding. It\nlooks like it holds extensive notes, but all\nof them are encrypted.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Voidgazer's Compendium", "A thick tome which exudes an eerie light. One\ndares not open it, for fear of the raw power\ncontained within its bindings. The pages\nripple and distort upon view; visions of\ngreat relics stored within pockets of the\nvoid. The ethereal parchment serves as a key\nto retrieving the antiquities cached deep\nwithin the depths of the great arcane plane.\nTo gaze upon its contents is near blinding.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Elad_.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Gorloth Staff", "The staff bears a bright red gemstone\nlevitating at its tip, illuminating the area\naround it with a deep red hue. Engraved down\nthe side of the staff is the word\nHiishtgul'.\n★Lore Master Approved★\nSigned by Wretched.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Combustionary.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Gleamlight", "Arcane I\nAn intricate handle with a small lantern-like\nhead. When the arcane power is activated, it\nemits an unnatural light - able to glow dimly\nor brightly. ((One action to activate.\nContact Niv_Mizzet for more information.))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("The Voidgazer's Companion Stone", "A gem of impeccable quality. A rune of\narcanic nature sits in its center, pulsating\na deep violet. The stone houses a being of\ncelestial energy.Its body seems reminiscent\nof Archons and thus provides a boon similar\nto them. Lacking a true physical form allows\nthe Celestial to exist freely without\npersecution of mortal weapon. A constant veil\nof energy is let off from its translucent\nbody. [Celestial: Orithur]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Menorcressaen Hookspear", "This polearm is wretchedly aged, yet has been\nmaintained with enough care to retain both\nits function and its deadliness. Once wielded\nby the Captain of the Menorcress Guard, this\nspear bears both an aurum-alloy point and a\ndivergent, hook-like curve, intended for the\ntearing of flesh and the removal of pieces of\narmor, such as the helmet. For ages has it\nbeen drenched in the venom of primeval\narachni, causing mortal wounds to feel as\nthough on fire, as if echoes of Mori' malice\nlinger its make.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Dagger", "Centuries old, this dagger faintly glows with\nancient runes. A strange weapon for the\nstrange knight who once wielded it. It\nshimmers more brightly near life.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mangled Silverfish Corpse", "An emalgamation of Silverfish bodies, some\nmelted by acid, others sliced by a scorching\nblade. At least they don't need to cut open\nfor examination. You did need that already.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("The Voidgazer's Compendium: Blundermore's Bellow", "An page torn from the elusive archon's grand\ntome. Contains a relic which summons forth a\ngale wind to knock an enemy off their feet.\nNamed for the Ascended Blundermore's prowess\nin air evocation, but shares no other\naffiliation with mage.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Elad_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Staff", "One particular staff of incredible power.\nImbued within is the power to rouse an animal\nto anger, or sate to placidity. Four uses\nleft. Contact ET when used to reduce charge.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treshure.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Stave of Wood", "A hunk of wood widdled with round contours\nand plenty of small inscriptions. It holds an\naurum snake at the top which is held on by\ncurled wood and wire of aurum. Woahzers!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melia.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Patron's Wrath, Spewer of Fire and Purity", "A powerful holy blade composed of Arcaurum shines brightly\nin your hand. Enchanted by the former Prophet of the Order\nof the Golden Lance, Herun Athna, one of the three\nenlightened siblings of Hilan, founder of the Order of the Golden\nLance. The blade feels warm to the touch as it envelops the\nuser in a blissful aura. Abjuring the effects of dark magics as\nthe sword beckons to it's wielder. Demanding only to be held\nby only the lionhearted of men. The sword itself expunges a\nholy light. Purging evil wherever it strikes as it inflicts extreme\npain upon those that dabble in dark arts as it invokes the wrath\nof the Aengul of Justice, Tahariae in the form of a blaze of\ngolden flames.\n*Moderator Approved*\nTsuyose approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Whiplash", "A flanged mace with a segmented shaft. It\nappears oddly light in the user's grasp,\nallowing them to exert more force. When\nactivated, the segmented shaft can seperates,\nbound by arcane. This gives it the potential\nto be used as an extended mace, and the\npotential to be used as an elongated flail.\nThis weapon can be further augmented. ((1-2\nemotes to activate, PM Niv_Mizzet for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Bog's Stave", "A staff of swamp wood. Along the bough of the\nstaff are vines and a leather grip, trailing\nupward to a leather and metal wrapped head,\nhaving a head similar to a flanged mace and a\nballed end. The item gives off a slight\narcane presence. (PM knghtArtorias for\neffect)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Solloway", "A black ferrum targe shield with a thich,\nlengthy spike protruding from its center.\nWhen a certain word is shouted, the shield\nreleases a powerful gust of wind that would\nburst forch from the surface and collide into\nanything three meters in front of it. The\nright enarme has something etched into it, as\nif with a jagged material: \"Spiro\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("A Lost Man's Shield", "This battered shield is weathered and worn,\nthough despite that remains study and\nsteadfast. Perhaps that's why it's original\nowner held onto it for so long, as he\nremained steadfast in his attempt to set\nthings right\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Urchin's Sting", "A silver ring, with a collection of sea\nurchins engraved into the body for\ndecoration. At its crown sits a small round\nturquoise stone on a hinge that could be\npushed aside to reveal a little needle. In\nthis spot there is space enough to perhaps\nstore a small amount of liquid, to coat the\nneedle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MickMeist.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Boggen's Maimed Head", "The maimed head of a Boggen, a fabled\ncreature known to drive poor fools with\nterrifying illusions within thick fog. This\npale, undead head is broken and bloodied, as\nif something was pulled from its forehead.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Scholar", "This Side sword is formed of an odd alloy,\none which allowed for intricacy of both\nphysical and magical properties to be enlaid\nonto its form. The double-edged sword is\nengraved with a plethora of runic tongue and\nquils filled with silver, varying the color\nof the metallic purple blade. The knuckle\nguard itself holds no special properties,\nhowever it is modified to protect digits and\nknuckles while being an effective bludgeoning\ntool. This weapon exudes a frigid slash\nwhenever it meets its target, potentially\ncausing frostbite to the skin of its foes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Witch Hunter's Dirk", "A dirk of an odd alloy. This weapon is\nappears to have the ability to switch its\nform, being able to morph from a dirk to a\ncutting blade, or even made for piercing.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Divu’khel", "The branch of an ancient tree carved into a\nstaff. The wood is grey and withered,having\nbeen cut from a dead tree. It is topped with\na gnarled crown, the end of the branch\nwovento contain a large cut gem. In the hands\nof a mage, the gem can be made to give off\nlight.A low burn for lighting dark rooms, or\na quick flash of bright light which, in\ndarkness, may beof use in distracting or\ntemporarily handicapping enemies. The light\nwould, of course, be of no use in a lit area\nor in the sunlight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Burster", "A circular item forged of jutting metal and\nimbedded glass. Inside the item is a deadly\nmixture, should it be ignited via a fuse this\nitem will explode (1 meter radius explosion),\ncausing flame, some force, and metal and\nglass shrapnel to scatter about the area.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Hefty Lion Head", "A large, lion-like head. Though substantially\nlarger than that of a normal lion's, a\nManticore to the trained eye.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Leshen of Oakshade's Skull", "A gnarled, crude wooden skull made of warped\nOak. The hollow eyes seem to glow green at\nnight.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Stifler's Amulet", "Arcane I\nA finely crafted amulet with small, riveted\nonyx chains that are bound to a latched\ncapsule. From the latch, the capsule was\nnarrow, however growing a tad wider as it\nprogresses to its end; along the onyx, a few\nholes on the side, along with a small opening\nexposes a sapphire gem that is fit snuggly\nwithin its containment. Along with its basic\ndesign, the amulet has lighter gray flecks.\nThis item carries an arcane power, when\nactivated, the wearer can supress their\nbloodlust.[PM knghtArtorias]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Trickster's Ring", "An artisan crafted ring, fitted for Joanna\nPaige's middle finger. The ring itself is\nimbued with an odd power, allowing a striga\nto go undetected by animals and their own\nkin; it masks their scent with something\nmortal.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by NailmasterSpiffy.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Reinforced Knife", "A rather simple cutting instrument composed\nof what seems to be steel. This single-edged\nknife is longer than the average, ideal for\ncutting and chopping great quantities of\ningredients at a time. A peculiar sturdiness\nis felt therein the metal, rarely would it\never dull or chip, giving off a pristine\noutlook through whatever wear is placed upon\nit. A stamp is pressed into the grip, reading\nRhy'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pin-Shot", "Arcane I\nAn item that appears like a crossbow, albeit\nwith a circular metal formation before the\ncrank; the firing groove is covered by a\nbarrel, and the limbs are smaller, lacking a\nstring. Through magitech, a mechanism causes\nkinetic energy to occur inside the device,\npropelling what object is loaded in\nhigh-speed, with the force of a\nheavy-crossbow. ((2-3 emotes to use. Contact\nNiv_Mizzet for more information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by NailmasterSpiffy.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Leshen of Oakshade's left Arm", "A crudely formed and twisted bit of wood,\nresembles an arm and a scrawny hand. The\nfingers extend far, almost the same length as\nthe forearm.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Sohaer", "A beautifully wrought staff made from white ferrum. Decorated with\nintricate spirals of the purest silver \"kae ito merache illeral\" is engraved\nin the staff in radiant mage gold. Twisting at the top and pulling reveals\na long narrow dagger.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Claws", "A bundle of Manticore claws from a singular\npaw, all about three inches in length, ending\nin horrifically jagged points capable of\nrending most commonplace material.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Venomous Stinger", "A large stinger, that of a Manticore. Packed\nwith a thin venomous fluid incurring nigh\nimmediate paralysis on those it enters the\nbloodstream of.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:netherrack", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Gizzard", "The hanging giblets from a Cockatrice's jaw,\npacked with a thick, petrifying grey sludge.\nContact with large quantities of oxygen in\nthe air caused the fluid to turn a thin\nvapour, turning whatever it contacted to\ncrumbling stone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:netherrack", ""),
        StaticItem("Snake Fang", "A jagged fang rid of a giant serpent from the\nsandlands, pry directly from the maw in rough\nforce.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Carnivorous Solvent", "A vial of horrific, churning fluid. Upon\ncontact with organic matter, it will eat away\nat it, even carving through bone. It is a\ndeadly substance, sealed inside its\ncontainer. Only oils can truly block its\nhorrifying hunger.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Elemental Affliction", "A clear, carbonated liquid that one might\nstruggle to identify as an any known potion.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Soul Tether", "An odd, blue-coloured elixir that seems as\nthick as tar. It's impossible to predict what\nkind of effect would be incurred upon\nconsumption.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Reinforced Retort", "A small metal container, wrought of what\nappeared as steel or some similar material. A\nlong neck-like tube protruded from one of\nit's sides, angling downwardly. Hardly ever\nwould the metal falter or give way to wear,\nappearing pristine, nearly idyllic. A small\nengraving is upon the neck, reading 'Rhy'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Sheep Blood", "The liquid inside the bottle would have a\ndark red colour. If opened, it would smell\nbadly. On the cork, it reads \"Sheep Blood\".", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Land's Nurture Concoction", "A swirling green liquid housed inside a\nbottle. When it seeps into the earth, the\nearth it touches will be able to nurture any\nplant or animal that stands on it, regardless\nof the situation its in. Furthermore, if one\nwas to drink it, it would sustain them for\nthe day.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Yatl Flame", "A unique breed of flower that seems to thrive\nonly in the desperaste, desolate winds of the\nYatl Wasteland. It is a complete anomaly that\ndefies the laws of nature.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Boots of Consistant Filth", "Item Level 25\nBinds when picked up\nmatter how hard you scrub these boots, they\nforever seem to stay dirty.\nFeet\nLeather\n9 Armor\nSell Price: 1 M\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by calabreeni.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Bones", "A small collections of skeletal remains,\nthick and strong. They belong to that of a\nManticore.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Vodnik Head", "The decapitated head of a Vodnik. Vodnik's\nare vicious creatures, able to withstand\ndecapitation and fight on, they're also\ncapable of paralysing even the largest of men\nand devour them whole\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Salier.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Entrapment", "An odd box which resonates a powerful aura;\nit houses a Voidal Horror Elemental, one\nwhich embodies wind.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The First Enchanters Compass", "The compass will point towards any recent\nmajor disruptions of the void in the realm,\nthis can be voidal nodes, hollows, an event\nof massive circling, Horrors being summoned,\nor possible Arcane artifacts that give off a\nstrong Signal. It usually only points towards\nit for a few days before resetting. The\ncompass is elegantly forged of mage gold,\nrefined with ferrum to make it durable.\nElegant arcanic symbols would be engraved\nalong the edges of the compass face, with no\nreal meaning.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Elad_.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("The Leshen of Oakshade's Core", "A black orb made of crystal. Several runes\nglow green, spread seemingly randomly along\nit.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of the Vodnik Abomination", "The gargantuan head of an Olog Vodnik. It\nseems to be kept well intact and its body\nwould have been quite large. Only master\nhunters would be able to use this trophy as\nbragging rights to the other denziens of\nAxios.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Hide", "The tough, ridiculously repurposable hide of\na Manticore. Particularly resilient to\nslashing and piercing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Boggen's Head", "The head of a Boggen, a fabled creature\nrumoured to stalk battlefields, and engulf\nunwary survivors in a thick fog, wherein they\nare said to go mad. The skin on this\nNecrophyte's face is mottled but not decayed,\nand a dim gemstone is embedded in its\nforehead.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Reinforced Tongs", "A set of metallic tongs, the lengths cross\nover each other and are bound by a bolt at\nthe epicenter. A certain sturdiness was felt\ntherein the metal instrument, hardly ever\nwould it chip or dull. No matter the wear the\ntool gives off a pristine outlook, almost\nidyllically so. A stamp is pressed into the\nleather grip, reading 'Rhy'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rhysten Smithy.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Chancellors Bucket", "The wielder of this bucket is invested with\nthe full power of Ducal authority in Adria,\nto be recognized as chancellor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Chumpchump.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Muscle Sinew", "This is a large collection of muscle sinew,\nfar too large to have come from any normal\ndescendant or creature... Perhaps it was\naquired from a giant?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Half Ratiki Shield", "It seems that the shield was partly destroyed\nby an acidic liquid... some of the symbol is\nstill visible, altough the metal frame and\nsurface of the shield have been severely\ndamaged!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by D4NNA.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Kaalglu's Sword.", "A 14ft long zweihander with a flamberge\nblade. The weapon seems to be typical steel\nand is overly massive for any normal person\nto to reliably wield.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Grimiore of the Court", "An innocuous tome whose pages bear foreign\ndiagrams of hellspawns and implings, along\nwith notations in a simmering, glowing, yet\ncrude scripture. The jaundiced pages sport\nvarious shredded bookmarks and the hardcover\nwas decorated by hanging baubles, wherever\nthe chain and padlock that wrapped around it\ndid not touch, marking the most valuable of\nforbidden knowledge held within. (PM Jelonny\nfor more information.)\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantRage.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("The Chain of Flame", "An eight foot length of barbed heavy steel\nchains home to a Flamegeist. Should a mortal\ncome into physical contact with the chain,\nthey would feel an intense burning sensation\nakin to fire, though upon removal they would\nfind no physical damage or burns from the\nenchantment bar lingering feelings of\nimmolation. Such anguish would interrupt most\nforms of spellcasting (especially in the case\nof Frost Witches), being bound in the chains\nthe sensation would eventually cover the\nvictim’s whole body.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheKingOfTheMoon.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Crow's Beak polearm", "A polearm meant for breaking and piercing.", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusted Sidesword", "A fine sword, useful as a sidearm when the\npolearm doesn't cut it. Rust is on the flat.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Machete", "A machete styling runic markings along the\nblade at all points except its edge. It\nfashions tribalistic feathers, along with a\nsturdy leather handle and no pommel to be\nseen. Anyone well-versed in the Kharajyr\ncould tell the runes were ancient\nheiroglyphs.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Tainted Crimson", "A vial of off-colored liquid. At first\nglance, it appears to be nothing more than\nblood. Something about it is just.. 'off.' -\nPM RancidHound for interactions.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("A Giant Ulna", "A giant ulna, about two meters long.\nSurprisingly, one would find that it isn't\nall too heavy, and can easily be carried or\ndragged along.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Null-Round", "A bolt with a reinforced tip that houses a\nstrange, silvery bolt head that gleams odd in\nthe light. This strange shot has the\ncapability of ripping through spells and\ndisabling both mages and supernatural\ncreatures. The silvery head alone appears to\nbe fairly brittle. ((Contact RollForWitches\nfor more information))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Lark_.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("A very large collection of Organs", "A large collection of organs- literally. They\nconsist of a liver, stomach, and heart, all\nabout 7x the size of a normal descendant. It\nwould take either someone very strong or the\nhelp of a mule to carry these all at once.\nNothing seems odd about them, just... very\nlarge innards.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("A Giant Tooth", "This tooth is about the size of a watermelon,\nquite yellow and overall looks disgusting...\nIt seems to have a forming cavity on it. Ew.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:quartz_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Tanned Skin", "A large patch of skin taken from a giant,\nbeing about three inches thick. Pores are\nvery much visible, and there are many thin\nhairs poking out from the surface. Perhaps\nthis could be made into armor that could\nprovide more protection than normal leather,\nthough not enough as chain. Easier to pierce\nthrough than slice.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Lich Blade", "An ominous blade pried from the hands of a\nfoul Undead. Partially scorched and twisted\nby dragonflame, yet still bearing significant\nenergy from its Pure Aurum make and late\nuser.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ternate.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Halberd", "A long shaft of wood at one end, at the other\nend of the shaft, the end pointed towards the\nenemy, a combination of three things existed.\nAt one side of the shaft’s other end, an axe\nblade was fitted and at the back of the axe\nblade, a useful hook was provided which was\nused to dislodge horsemen during combat. The\nstaff culminated in a sharpened pike which\nformed the third key aspect of the halberd.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Clock", "A palm-sized clock, telling the time of day\nregardless of your position. A woodland scene\nhas been carved into the rim of the clock,\ndepicting a bear, a fox, and a hound in the\nmiddle of a hunt.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Gold Dust", "finely grounded gold Aurum, which has been\nbroken down into a near dust like form!", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Fox", "The plush stuffed toy is hand-stitched from\nreal fox fur using a natural sinewy twine.\nThe corners of its ears have been worn down\nby use over the years and on its stomach is a\nsmall stitched 'J'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RedfaceKilla.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Rheged", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Promise (Hunting Knife)", "Despite being merely a dagger, it is as\ngraceful as it is sturdy. While at first\nglance the blade seems to be ornamental, in\nactuality it was designed with lethal intent.\nThe blade is made out of a jormungdic black\nsteel, which holds enough durability to\nwithstand a blow from an axe, while also\nmaintaining a razor sharp edge. The weapon\nseems to have an aura about it, as if a\npromise was made to protect and care whoever\nheld it; On blade there is Wulffrey's rune.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Merisify.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Yari", "A traditional steel Yari rests here,\nmeasuring 6.5 feet long with a foot long\nblade set at the end, perfect for someone\nwith high dexterity and a penchant for\nstrafing the enemy. The edge of the Yari was\nset clean and straight, perfect to slash a\ndeep wound into flesh or to penetrate through\nthin layers of armour. Engraved on the side\nare the words \"September will Fall\". A rune\nwith the initials of 'WD' are set at the base\nof the blade, to note who created the artisan\nweapon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ｅｎｇｒａｖｅｄ Ｂｒｏｎｚｅ Ｔｏｏｌ Ｋｎｉｆｅ🌿 🌿🌱🌱🌳🌳🌳🌳🌳", "A simple single-edged knife with a teak wood\nhandle. The edge of the blade is shaving\nsharp, and tapers upward to a point. The\nhandle of the blade bears no crossguard, but\ndoes taper outwards near the base of the\nblade to avoid one accidentally slipping\ntheir fingers onto the blade. The handle of\nthe blade is carved with thorned vine like\nfiligrees that end with the design of a rose\nat the base of the handle. The design is\nsymmetrical on both sides of the handle. The\nblade seems to have a continuation of the\nengraving, bearing thorned vine-like\nfiligrees that wind and swirl up the blade,\nending in a swirl at the blade's tip. The\nhandle is made from linseed oil treated teak\nwood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Chalice", "This exquisitely crafted and polished Chalice\nis made of pure gold. A few Rubies adorn each\nside with an elegant engraving lining the top\nin a zig zag pattern. It's craftmenship would\nbe very prestiged.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheesus_Crustt.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Artists Pot of Paint", "A collection of pots containing inks, oils,\npaints, glues and pigments.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rolled canvas", "A painting, removed from its stretcher bar,\nis rolled up and bound with some leather\ncord.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ponder III of Krugmar", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("what a shit test lol", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Longsword.", "Soulbound II\nA steel longsword forged by a castle\nblacksmith. Belonging to the Knight Ser Dion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by UnusualBrit.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Storm's Edge: Static Absolver", "A black ferrum claymore, pristine and and\ndeadly in its make. A worn sun is on the\npommel, chipped and marred by time's maw;\nyet, this sword holds power - the ability to\nshroud its blade with electrical energy as\none runs their hand along the sword's length.\n((Contact knghtArtorias for more info))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Heilige Flamme", "The glint of red and black hues swirl this\nspear in arrangements that only a Master\nSmith can forge. The length of the spear\ncomposed of black ferrum and reinforced with\ncoiled strands of steel through it's center.\nThe upper hilt appears to have the shape of a\nseven headed hydra through which the spear\nhead protrudes, red as blood.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vrakian Heater Shield, Standard", "Reinforced with Iron, Reiter Heater Shields\nhave been developed to provide sufficient\ndefense and mobility, while on foot or\nhorseback.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Snow Plough!", "Shovel snow with super efficiency!\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Halbhersteller, The Black Claymore", "A beautifully made black-ferrum claymore, a\nblack hydra is embossed near the crossguard\non the blade, the metal chiselled away around\nthe image. The grip in red-dyed llama\nleather. A inscription reads 'Forged by Caleb\nCrider.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Taryian Necklace", "A traditional heirloom, passed down from\ngeneration to generation. The now extinct\nTaryian house was absorbed by the House de\nAryn roughly two hundred centuries ago. The\nnecklace, however, was proclaimed as a symbol\nof strength for the family, as once the two\nhouses became one, their numbers grew and\ntheir accolades stacked up. The necklace\nsymbolises the merge and strength of two\ndynasties, and is worn by each male within\nthe Main Dynasty. This necklace once belonged\nto Lystor.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Calderic I de Aryn.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Daemon Steel Blade", "Inscribed in the blades hilt is a quote of\nthe All-father, \"... and may your Flames\nnever die.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vergessene, Reiter Siege Arbalest [*****]", "A powerful siege arbalest, with reinforced\narms and drawstrings; the body is fit with\nmetal plates as to keep its durability; the\nwood treated to avoid rot. Most notably, a\nmagazine of sorts is strapped to the side,\nand with the actioning of a crank, it will\nslip a loaded bolt onto the nock, though it\nis recommended this heavy beast of burden is\nalready nocked before. Else it is useless. (5\nemotes to fire).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Klaus of Heldenburg.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Worn Reiter Longsword, Heavy", "Forged with precision, this blade once drew\nblood past chain and surcoat. However, this\nparticular blade appears to be aged and\nriddled with scars of battles long forgotten.\nThe interface between the blade's base and\nguard display a hydra, the symbol of the\nReiter Mercenaries.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blodberget", "a pavise shield made of a fine, polished\nredwood. Along the wood, a black metal trim\nassists in giving the item stability. And\nwithin the center, a dark blue rooster with a\nlifted talon and a blue heater shield etched\non its chest. It is imbued with arcane power,\nallowing the user, when doing a specific\naction, to conjure up an arcane barrier to\nshroud to the shield and provide both offense\nand defensive augmentations to the item.\n((2-3 emotes to activate contact Niv_Mizzet\nfor more information on the shield and its\nabilities.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Portable Carpet Making/Treating Kit", "", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Sea Serpent's Skull", "Killed by the Rex Vrogak'Gorkil\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Readicti.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodied Handkerchief", "Tattered and bloodied, this handkerchief\nappears to have been folded in fourthes, at\nthe bottom right corner of the piece one\nwould barely manage to read the word\n/VRAKAI/.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Golem Ticket", "A waver that allows one to get a golem! ((PM Bokratz))\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bog Child's Teardrop", "A flower from the Far Glade. It's said to\nrepresent the tears of the child of the bog.\nUnfortunately.. It doesn't appear to have an\nimmediate use.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Keeper of the Glade.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Skull", "The skull of a medium sized straadoth. The\nbase of the skull is chipped by what one\nwould say is pure blunt force. There are dry\nflecks of blood on the skull.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("((Read this by mousing over it in inventory))", "Come visit The Jayamen Retreat! A great\ngetaway for you and some friends, you and\nyour partner, or just yourself! We have many\nfun activities to do there! Send Jaya Jayamen\n((Sofetios)) a bird to get a room, rooms, or\nto meet to show you there!", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Hog Handling", "Item Level 9\nBinds when picked up\nWhat\nappears to be a long staff with a burnt end,\nsome poor hog likely found this prodding into\nthem at one point or another.\nTwo-Hand\nStaff\n10-14 Damage\nSpeed 3.60 (3.41\ndamage per second)\nDurability 40/40\nSell\nPrice: 1 M\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by calabreeni.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Glock", "A weird shaped weapon that shoots small\nlittle stones at a semi automatic rate.\nPerfect for those that wants many people dead\nin a specific place at a specific time,\nthey'd only be alive if they had stop messing\nwith you.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Crab Chitin", "A hefty size of bright orange chitin, around\nthe size of an average man's torso. The edges\nare jagged, and the surface shows some marks\nof wear. A bit on the heavy side.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Purse of Rosewood Marbles", "A small leather pouch, with a yellow\ndrawstring, filled with 12 small red balls,\nsanded and finished as to be shiny and\nsmooth. They seem less suited for any serious\ntask, and moreso for a child's toy, or\nplayful diversion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll Fingers", "The fingers cut from a Troll. It is roughly\nthe size of a carrot, with the fingernails\nsharp, dirty, and ingrown. The bottom would\nhave flesh and bone marrow sticking out from\nit. The finger is colored pale blue.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MrBamPow.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Child's hand", "A skeletal hand once belonging to a child,\nlikely long dead.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrine Water", "a leather flask that holds water from a\nshrine far to the east!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Evert Lyons.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Whirlwind", "This ranseur is made from thick, dark rose\nwood. Both handles are made with red leather,\nthe blade itself being wide. Two spikes on\neither side of it made it well crafted for\nslicing or smashing. The name 'Whirlwind\nwould be carved into it, then filled with\nliquid obsidian.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Baltas Bee's Honey", "A small ceramic pot filled with raw honey,\nsweet to taste and thick as muck. Its secret\ningredient helps ward off illness and pain\nand calms the user. Made in Belvitz, on the\nshores of the Baltas River.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Scruffy the puppy ~", "This small puppy was left at your door in a\nbox on Krugmas eve, and answers to the name\nScruffy", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of _Bany", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Lion", "In your hands rests a masterfully crafted\npine wood staff with the bark shaved off it's\nupper half and replaced with an aurum and\nsteel alloy. At the lower half, the bark\nremains aside from a small section with a\ncomfortable leather grip for the staff to be\nheld by. At the highest point of the item,\nthe head of a lion with a parted maw is\ndepicted.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TheTri.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of alphapuch", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of Varys", "A staff of a decent size, seeming to be\ntailored to fit a specific person. The staff\nis made of a hard yew wood, the end made of a\nlightly colored mineral, seeming to be\nbluesteel. It holds a hefty weight, and a\nhefty price at that, truly a valuable item.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Mali'ata Action Figure", "A pale figure of a man with pale skin, dark\nhair and red eyes. He bears an angry\nexpression and holds a kitchen knife in his\nhand.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("some cummies", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Maer Boots ⌘", "The boots of the Belvitzian Maer Darius\n(TrendE)", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Reaping Graven Skull", "A smelly, mossy skull taken from the rotting\ncorpse of a Graven. Ashes to ashes, dust to\ndust.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Thanhium.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Tail", "The long wyvern-like tail of a Cockatrice. It\nwould be very durable and could be made into\nsomething perhaps.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("A testimony that Darius was healed by Nilth. Signed by Nilth", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Burger's Burn", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Frost Wolf Head", "This is a large skull of a gaint wolf of the\nsouth you are very scared about what else\nroams the wilds of that region.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Chromatic Salamnder Hide", "The hide of a chromatic salamander. It\nchanges color gradually, shifting between all\nthe hues of the rainbow. Otherwise, it is as\ntough as the leather of any dire lizard.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Forest Titan Pegleg", "A pegleg made from the wood of a slain Forest\nTitan. It would have the durability of iron.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Makeshift Grappling Hook", "", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Blue Fluffy Blanket!", "A large 7ft by 6ft blanket, lovingingly\nknitted, despite the maker not having much\nskill. A few imperfections dot this blue\nwoollen blanket, which sports a basic\nsnowflake shape in the middle. Perfect for\ncold nights!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Jaded] Katrina Atmorice.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Awlpike", "A spear with a sharp, tapering point,\nreinforced with langets and crossguarded with\niron lugs. The haft is light, and its easily\nmaneuvered tapering point is ideal for\ndriving deep into faults in your opponent's\narmor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Csaba.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon", "", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("F", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Leeuwenhof Pinot Noir", "A wine from the vineyards beyond Leeuwenhof,\nwith the label capturing a beautiful barony\nin the sunset. The wine itself is rather\nsweet, but still holds a bit of a kick.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearthfire shortsword [T5]", "A standard steel shortsword bearing an odd\nideogram upon its hilt. Should one who is not\ncorrupted touch the patterning, a few holy\nembers will manifest around the weapon,\nbefore the entirity of its blade will erupt\nwith a cloak of teal soulflame, causing a\npainful burning pain to any corrupted being\nit comes into contact with, and igniting them\nafter prolonged contact. [PM Farryn for more\ninfo]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of RockerKidd", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mr. Hammer (Warhammer)", "", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Toasty Lordish Gambeson", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Warbringer", "If there is any blade for a true Warrior it\nis Warbringer, the Jorgundic black steel\nblade which can block even a heavy blow, and\ndent armour with a strong strike. This\ndagger, has a very strong guard, able to hold\nup against blades five times its size if held\nwith a firm hand. It’s pommel is decorated\nwith a beautiful engraving of an open eye,\nthe pommel is mostly black wood, reinforced\nwith black steel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jacobcraft04.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Pupuzlee", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Miko0322", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Crown", "A tiara carved out of smooth oak wood, with\ngemstones' engraved onto the front. It seems\nto have been made in the hands of a\nprofessional craftsman.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of moofmoof8", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Spiky Sheild", "A sheild with a giant spike on the frount,\nthere would also be six side spikes along the\nsides of the sheild used for close rang melee\ncombat.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("CR-07: Marshal Vladan Valic", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("lol", "boo, im a ghost", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of OhmygodItsKathy", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Medium Cobalt Key", "A heavy, rusty blue key. It seems to easily\nfit the size of someones palm.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Voidal.", "minecraft:blue_glazed_terracotta", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Calming Collars", "An experectly made leather collar, created to\nfit snuggly around a Bokolo's neck. Upon the\ninside of the collar would rest a single\nemerald giving of a slight glow. This gem\nwould house the calming enchantment making\nthe creatures easier to tame, and keep calm\n(Pm Whiteknight_19 for more information)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Violet Mage] Serenity Al'Abass.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Frog's Tongue", "", "minecraft:netherrack", ""),
        StaticItem("killer sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Direbear's Ribs.", "A cut of an adolescent direbear, slain by\nNordengrad's hunters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by B7W4.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Fallen Renatus Mans Shield", "The shield of a fallen Renatus man. It has\nnumerous slashes against it, whoever wield it\nmust've been a skilled fighter, who fought to\nthe complete and bitter end.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Highschool Graduate", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Knox's Vengeance", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ful'zahkrii", "An artisan crafted dagger of elven design.\nLight seems to cascade down its single\nseamless edge. The blade is made of pure\naurum and a mana gem is socketed into the\ncrest of the hilt. The item has been imbued\nto act as a casting catalyst for Nasir. The\npommel has been finely engraved with the name\nDrakon,\" in reference to the former name of\nthe elf from whom it originated from.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Frog Slime", "", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Congrats! c:", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Dank Joint", "", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Baton", "", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blade of Souls and Death", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("an RPG", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand Telescope", "A small, oak stalked and brightly shining\ntelescope of a rather powerful resolution", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Straadoth Rib Bone", "This long and curved rib bone would radiate\nthe aura of Kotrestruu. Upon the bone would\nbe two black seared hand prints and when\nhands were laid in their place a vision of a\nformer memory of Nazak'Gorkil's would play\nout. [PM _Jandy_ for details.]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Jandy_.", "minecraft:quartz_stairs", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_49(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Ball Invitation", "You are hereby invited to The Royal Ball in\ncelebration of Princess Analiese Barbanov's\ncoming of age. It will be a night full of\ndancing, food, and drinks! ((OOC: Saturday,\nSeptember 29. Time to TBA on post))", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Carved Bone Pipe", "A femur bone that has been hollowed out\nthrough it's center. At one end is a hole, it\nbeing around an inch opening, that narrows\ndown to allow an assortment of herbs to be\npacked into it. The other end has another\nhole, purposely aligned, allowing the user to\nsmoke from. The head is slightly scorched and\nblackened from use.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bucket of fake gold", "A large pot filled with small nugget sized\nrocks, dipped in gold paint.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by moosehunter123.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Foreskin Fondler V3", "A long curved blade lined with gilded-silver.\nIt's hilt was bound with leather and\nencrusted with jewels of every kind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Grand Exchequer Falk Rottencock.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aleksei's Dagger", "A dagger specifically made for Aleksei. The\nblade's craftsmanship would be fine. In fact,\nit seemed almost as if the metal was directly\nshaped, never once actually touching a forge\nor hammer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stilletto Dagger", "A thin bladed dagger with an extremely sharp\npoint, the sheath would be made of leather\nwith embroidery of 'M' near the top of the\nsheath. This blade would be extremely\neffective against chainmail.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Replica of the High King's Crown", "A crown molded from Iron. Fake jewels are\nencrusted along it's circumference.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("The Conservatoire Stamp", "A golden coin, the edges of the token formed\ninto an octogon. The front of the coin has an\nillustration of a book and quill inscribed\nonto it. On the back, a large \"C\" is carved,\nand under it, the phrase \"Scientia est\nPotentia\" is scribbled.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked Jawbone Skirted Jig", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Cooked River2Sea 190 Whopper Plopper Topwater Lure", "", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Flask o' Gibberish", "This glass would be filled with a sky blue\npowder, specs of purple and pink in it.\nShould someone breathe the substance in, they\nwould find themselves unable to speak\nproperly for fifteen (irl) minutes. Their\nwords would come out as nonsense and absolute\ngibberish! Perhaps it could be used to prank\nsomeone, or even humiliate them...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Unwillingly.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Pure Electrum Ring", "A very big ring\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Zil's Diamond for Red", "A treasured possession, given to Red by Zil\nbecause they are best friends", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver-Inlet Dagger", "A beautiful dagger, silver-inlets line the\nhilt and blade, in some artistic design. The\npommel, hilt, and crossguard are in the shape\nof a fleur-de-lis. A signature reads 'Forged\nby Caleb Crider'.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("[Lucky Bell]", "A jingling bell that seems to bring luck to\nthe bearer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ratiki Tail", "This Tail has been cut off perfectly and\nseems to belong to a lesser copy of the\nspecies. It weighs a lot for a rat's tail and\nis interspersed with a circular pattern. A\ndelicacy?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Stair] Gourmet Master.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of TheMaster2003xxx", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Claymore, Halbhersteller", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Waraxe", "The steel of the waraxe is trimmed in dark\nred runes. They glow softly at the touch of\nthe warrior who wields it. Masterfully etched\nby the Arcadian Runesmiths, the axe itself is\na powerful weapon. With each strike, the\nrunes flare and the blade is engulfed in a\nflash of fire. It seems to protect the\nwielder from any backlash beyond the handle\nof the axe.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by MrMineLoveDude.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Morgan's Sword", "An Elven Blade with Damascus Styled Metal,\nSlightly Curved on both sides and curved to\nthe tip, the back of the blade would only be\nsharp two inches away from the tip however.\nthe blade’s hilt bared a bronze inlay with\nthe character ‘M’ in it, the grip of the\nblade had thinned Deerhide strips wrapped\naround a dark oak handle [PM Puddlemancer Pro\nfor further Info]", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ourobouros Longsword", "An intricate Marked Blade, made in the\nOurobouros style, the blade long and thin,\nwavy patterns running the length. Treated\nwith horror-blood beastsmithing techniques,\nthe weapon will no doubt do plenty of damage\nto voidal creatures. The pommel is in the\nshape of a lizard, the grip wrapped in llama\nleather. Inscriptions read 'Forged by Caleb\nCrider, Belvitz'.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Child in a Bucket", "A young child sits in this bucket, he seems\nto be enjoying himself. Jakin", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Painted Figurine of Timeo de la Baltas ⌘", "This painted, limited edition figure is of\nthe troubadour Timeo! He sports a broad\nsmile, as well as a blonde moustache and a\nset of mutton-chops, as well as blue eyes.\nTimeo’s features are complimented by a\nburgundy beret, and a light magenta coat. He\nhas an open book in one hand, and in his\nother hand, is raising a white feather plume.\nA drawing is attached:\ntinypic.com/r/2z8aiva/9\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Timeo de la Baltas.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("⌘ Root for Rutledge Hardhat ⌘", "The official hardhat of the \"Root for\nRutledge, Root for Adria\" Prefect campaign.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("LT Warning", "Warning reasons: Lore breaking, unauthorized\nusage of Ents, with full knowledge of what\nwas being broken. Please see A_Keefy for any\nfurther details\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by PunifiedZombie.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Luck -rp", "An ornate amulet inlaid with a hefty diamond,\nit seems to imbue the wearer with luck!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Red.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Feywild", "The black ferrum dagger is polished with a\nsilver pollish on the edges to make it 2\ncolours, the edge is as hard as dragon scales\nable to pierce ferrum armour without effort.\nThe hilt is bound by a blood red leather\nstrip on the ferrum handle.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Doll", "A small black doll with golden little hay\nlocks and two red button eyes, and a smile\nmade from a pink dye..\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nafari.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Bayonet Dagger", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Nemesis - The Serpent of Wood", "Nemesis is a natural long & hard-oaken branch\nbearing a wavy figure similar to a snake's\nbody. It's been carefully carved to a staff,\nit's top ending with thick & extended thorns\nprotruding to act as pointy daggers. Marks of\nancient human history are also engraved along\nthe shaft, portraying numerous bygone druii\nof mankind tending to nature. Below the\nstaff's peak rises the head of a snake,\nbaring fangs & spreading it's ribs to form a\nregal hood. The rest of the staff is toned to\nreplicate a snake's body.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Olgierd.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Serial Killers Sword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Popcorn", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("98.75001831054688 Minas", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Blade", "", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Icebane", "This tempered steel blade is adorned with the\nsignature \"R.R.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Qyehm.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Sugar Glider ~", "This small, omnivorous, arboreal, and\nnocturnal animal is full of engery and has\nVERY soft fur. It likes sugary foods like sap\nand nectar and its ability to glide through\nthe air, much like a flying squirrel", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sigil", "A Golden Sigil, bearing the Crest of a\nBurning Tree. The Sigil would seem to be made\nof Pure Gold, unlike most Golden Alloys.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Dishevelled Mace", "A mace wielded by the undead Amyas men,\ndefending the Carrion Crown to their last\nbreath. It was wrought with rust and\ndishevelled with age.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by C18H10N2O4.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Entertainer's Stone", "This stone was granted to the champions who\nhad defeated the three challenges presented\nto them by an unknown entity in an outlandish\nrealm filled with yellow miamsa.. the stone\nwould have unknown origins of mineral\nproperty however those attuned to the light\nwould be very drawn to the object, almost as\nif hungering for its withheld power... It is\ncapable of realm-travel as seen in the\nprevious encounter with the fallen object in\ncloud temple. (This item continues an event).\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Plate", "This eating plate would be made of pure gold!\nA beautiful and lusterious gift!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheesus_Crustt.", "minecraft:light_weighted_pressure_plate", ""),
        StaticItem("~ Grizzly Bear Statue ~", "A finely crafted bear, resting on all fours.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Slayer Steel Heavy Glaive", "Within your grasp rests a specialty crafted\nGlaive. The shaft itself is carved of hard\noak wood, carved with intricate celtic knots\nand designs, the length stands at 3ft.At each\nend of the staff would shine two long blades\nof dragon forged slayer steel, their sharp\nedges catching the light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Numirya.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Fancy Gambeson", "", "minecraft:iron_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Sigmar's Warhammer", "This warhammer the once belonged to famous\nSigmar Vladov, famed for being the one of the\nmost masterful warriors to ever have served\nin the Adrian military.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Yellow Potion Bottle", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Elven Body Pillow", "The body pillow of a Warhawkian Mali'ker\nWoman, owned by Zhulik. Circa. 1685\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2SYZ3CR\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TitanOfTheDepths.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Soul", "The bronze dagger is a sturdy build with one\nsuper sharp edge, able to cut through paper\nwith ease. the blade had the engraving: Soul.\ninto it making it one of a pair with the\nother half sepperated with only the\nattachment studs in place", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruined Ratiki Dagger", "A ruined and aged dagger, with rusted metal\nforming its curved eight inch blade. The\nfront end of the crossguard has been snapped\noff. This trophy was stolen from the hands of\na dead Ratiki.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pagan Bonechimes", "A whimsycal set of bone chimes, made not to\nbe spooky but instead to serve as some kind\nof totem. They seem to be cut from some kind\nof cervid, mostly, ornamented with the\nfeathers of an 'Felsen Rock Dove', or... A\ncommon city pigeon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Stellar Wand", "An intricately carved length of wood. A\ndepiction of the cosmos is etched across the\nbody of the wand, and it is headed with a\ntiny crystal shaped to look like a star. The\ncrystal exudes a soft glow.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cloakedsphere.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Roasted Venison", "Deer meat that\nhas been roasted.", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Rune-Etched Dirk", "A steel dirk, with various red carvings\nrunning along its metalic length, close to\neither of its edges. Should this dagger's\nrunes find contact with blood, they would\ntake on a sudden, deep red glow! And wounds\nhenceforth inflicted would be truely grusome\nand bloody! Along with this, these wounds\nwound take two additional emote to close, as\nper bloodmagic lore. Pm Lhindir_ For details!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Khroll.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Screamer Talon", "The jet black talon of a screamer. It would\nhave a very sharp feel to it and could easily\npierce a piece of leather if enough pressure\nis applied.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Firsthope Rubble", "How on earth did you get this when the Wall's\nstill closed?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Ruskan Cross", "", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Anton's Door-shield", "A large door-shield, made out of wood and\nmetal. The OSL banner decorating it.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Clockwork Shard", "A shard of what used to be a large piece of\nclockwork engineering. It seemed to be a\npiece of a gear, once instrumental in however\nthe machine it was incorporated in\nfunctioned. It was a soft, glossy bronze\ncolor, and it looked like a well-made piece\nof a larger puzzle.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Shortspear", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Figurine", "A painted figurine carved from sturdy dark\noak in the shape of a foot-soldier. Inscribed\nupon the base, it reads: 'Ser Stefan\nMorovic', Baron of Llewynstein, Nauzican\nLieutenant. 1st Ed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by orangedelight.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange skull", "An odd, old skull. It's whole surface oddly\ncovered with a number of symbols and runes,\ndrawn with some doubtful, crimson substance;\nno less than blood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jentos.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesser Potion of Strenght", "A yellow substance of medium potency. This\npotion is able to grant a man the gift of\nsuperior strenght, perhaps even doubling his\nphysical capabilities for an extended\nduration. However, the potion's after effects\nwill cause a great amount of pain to whoever\nwould wish to drink such a thing, and a\nconsiderable weakening of the muscles for an\neven longer preriod of time.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jentos.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ducal Drowning Stones", "", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of EternalSaturn", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of HazeOrb", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugsmas Snowman Nose", "This nose was claimed Lysimachus after\nslaying the evil snowmen overlord and saving\nCarolustadt from his wrath! Krugsmas had been\nsaved!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MCPancakes.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Coarse Dirt", "this is a bunch of shit, plant people\nfertilzier\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Potato", "", "minecraft:poisonous_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Rejuvinated Meladmiriel Seed of the Unison", "A greater meladmiriel seed exuding a verdant\naura. To all attuned druids they would feel\nthe sentient seeds more as dormant eggs\nwaiting to hatch. [PM Hedgehug for more\ninformation].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Oatmeal Raisin Cookie", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Grimaldi Arbalest", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Beehive (Orange)", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Midget Slicer", "This perfectly balanced longsword has\nstraight lines carved into the hilt, as if\ncounting kills,\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Josefwho02.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Maukta Tribe Crossbow", "The crossbow comes in at the length of a foot\nand a half. Its stock being a lightly\ndesigned with carvings into the side with the\nname Maukta carved into it. The crossbow\nbeing averagely darker and having flakes of\nsand arest along the bow with the drawback\nstring being made of spider-silk making it\nslightly easier drawback along with more\ndurability.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Leon's Longsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hay Doll", "Something like a hay voodoo doll, though\nmarginally less spooky because it had a tiny\nstitched on face.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by nightmaremachine.", "minecraft:hay_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Poleaxe", "A basic poleaxe, still useful for a fight.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Qalasi Elite Scimitar", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by furusiyya.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Turtle Shell", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Jurin's Spud", "", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Liz's Cookie", "", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Ducal Drowning Rope", "", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Staff", "The golden staff would seem to\nshine in your hand. The item\nitself looks to be holy in construct.\nThe head would have the symbol of\na Mongoose engraved into it. A\nsecond engraving of a scroll\ntied with a ribbon which loops\nmany times around decorates\nthe length of the staff. When\nactivated by someone with a\nconnection to the song of Aeriel,\na silver light would pulse from them.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Decorated Thornbark Longbow", "+52% Arrow Velocity", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Dagger", "The golden dagger would seem to\nshine in your hand. The weapon\nitself looks to be holy in construct.\nThe hilt would have the symbol of\na Mongoose engraved into it. A\nsecond engraving of a brazier\nlit with the outline of a what\nappears to be a flame decorates\nthe base of the blade. When\nactivated by someone with a\nconnection to the song of Aeriel,\na silver light would pulse from them.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Old sword", "An ashen, aged blade of iron, it's blade\nslowly gathering rust, markings adorning it's\nedges. From it stems a feeling of dread.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Grimlag Bone", "This precarious bone is tainted with an ashen\nradiance, once belonging to a creature that\nwould send shivers down even the most\nexperienced and hardened of hunters.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Smawton.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Elumeria’s Cocktail in a Bottle", "This pure and blue drink overwhelms your\ntaste buds with sweet soft blueberry,\nwatermelon, apple and … something else. After\na moment, a nice taste of mint fills the\nmouth, removing the alcohol’s arguably bad\ntaste. Even though the taste of alcohol can\nhardly be felt, it is quite a strong drink.\nNonetheless, it makes you thirsty for more. -\nElumeria’s Wild Brewery", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Eyes of Night", "A pair of glasses made up of brass crafted\ninto a classic dwarven weave and black\ntourmaline set into the knots of the weave.\nAsides from appearing to be made for a face\nmuch narrower than a dwarf, one of the lenses\nappears significantly thicke\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by lucasking321.", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of uracow", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bjor's Brain", "Wow, just Wow, you'd see how small it is and\njust think, wow", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("The tongue of Theldryn", "The tongue of Theldryn was brutally ripped\nout of his mounth, after he was declared a\ndishonor to his own kin and believes by a\ntrail. The tongue would have lost its red\ncolor over time and now it is just a symbol\nof someone slandering the name of the passed\naway and brathmordakin.", "minecraft:mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Breadbowls", "In these breadbowls are eggs and cheese, the\ntwo combined perfectly to make a perfect\nbreakfast.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Da Rym eron Gotrek", "The gauntlet before you is crafted with black\nferrum and is of dwarven make, unable to be\nworn by non-dwarfs. Carved with intricate\ndwarven patterns at the back of the Gauntlet\nnear the knuckles is a symbol, the symbol of\nthe Starbreaker Clan.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by lucasking321.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("You're gonna get banned <3", "", "minecraft:potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Whip of Teclis", "A sturdy leather whip, worn down slightly.\nThough obviously used in plenty, there\nappears to be little to no blood on it. How\nodd!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Teclis Kaeronin.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Fluffy Pink Handcuffs", "This set of fluffy wooly handcuffs seems to\nbe aluring to anyone in them, they also seem\nto smell oddly, I wonder why!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Teclis Kaeronin.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Fluffy Clamps", "A set of strong fluffy clamps... they are\nquite small? Strange...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Teclis Kaeronin.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Sturdy Glowing Rod", "A Strange Glowing Rod of unknown\norigins.Sturdy and long make it seem quite\ndurable.It has no sharp edges and a think\nrounded tip.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Teclis Kaeronin.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem of the ancients.", "This Gem is from an ancient dwarven subrace\nof dark skinned green eyed dwarves is\nproperties unknown to those who have it but\nit glows a bright green [pm overlord8000 to\ninteract.]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by overlord8000.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of undead cult bear", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Smoke Runestone", "A surfaced flatstone, round in shape and\nhardened to touch, appears to be held within\nyour hand. Engraved deep into the flat\nsurface would be what seems to be an\nintricately carved rune, one any speaker of\nAncient Dwed or pracitioner of the\nRunesmithing art would recognised as a 'Smoke\nRune'. Through verbal activation of the\nDwedmar word 'Smoke', smoke would pour from\nthe surface of the rune.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena Izalith.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot of Love", "This Carrot was made with love in the steamy\nfarms of Clan Kaeronin after the Night of a\nHundred Moans.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Teclis Kaeronin.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Kitchen Knife", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze \"Horned\" Shortsword", "A simple bronze shortsword, with a handguard\nforged into it. The blade of the sword is\ntriangular, and is shaving sharp. The blade\nis well shined. The sword bears a metal\nhandguard that extends in to two slight\nhorn' shapes that dip down horizontally from\nthe hilt. Despite the appearence that they\nhave been attached, the 'horns' are actually\npart of the tang of the blade. [For OOC\nreference, this is a \"Mycenaean Horn Sword\"]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Bronzesmith] Quavinir.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sigisfrey's Warknife", "Soulbound I\nA mighty war knife. Single edged, with\nSwordbreaker indents on the backside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by chaotikal.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of Love", "Thank you for helping me, much love!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Moose Trophy", "The head of a male moose which would have\nsome dried blood splathers on its brown fur.\nThe head would have a pair of majestic\nantlers which both would still be in a pretty\ngood state. The beast would have been\nmurdered by Cottonwood strength.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Afoc17.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Rainbowscale Trout", "This is a whopping Rainbowscale Trout, fished\nfrom the highest peak of Atlas within a\ntranquil hidden pond, this fish looks\ndelicious just to touch! (Legendary\nIngredient)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Orangegloom Carrot", "This enourmous carrot is freakishly big, with\noddly less green attached to it. It would\nalmost weigh about a halflin' and was big\nenough to be used for a [Grand Dish]...\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Gourmet] Chef.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Paradise Coconut", "There is no fuller and sweeter coconut like\nthis, stemming from the lonely palm, this\nfruit is a rare delicacy. The milk can be\nused for many purposes. It is also an\nexcellent thirst quencher with delicious\npulp.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hermit.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Chef hat", "A chef hat, used by master chef Sugartits\nhimself to grant to his cooking students on\nwhich he would pass his knowledge from his\nyounger years. A little symbol of a carrot\ncould be found inside of the hat.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [High Chief] Bjor 'Sugartits' Cottonwood.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("My Tears", "So very salty... ;-;", "minecraft:water_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("1686 The Idea", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of R_azam", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of LadyViolet123", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Cleaver", "An old Dwarven blade, one side extremely\nsharp, the other blunted to add weight. It's\nwide golden blade is decorated on both side\nwith geometric depictions of a Dwarf riding a\nboar, splitting greenskin in half with a\nsingle swing.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GoblinDaddy.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Lunarah's Bronze Greatsword", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ozneat's Guan Dao", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of the Destroyer", "The head of a being so vile and evil, all\nmentions of it have been scrubbed from the\nhistory books. Those who have been\nunfortunate enough to see the creature and\nlive have been reduced babbling loons, never\nto recover.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Kadarsi Dwarven Battle-Axe", "A Dwarven Battle-Axe crafted with a mixture\nof Kardasi and Ferrum. Its incredibly\nresilient metal has a beautiful water\npattern, and the twin heads of the axe are\ncomplimented with finely sharpened edges.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("THE EYES AND TONGUE OF A SATYR (Mason Jar).", "Floating around the murky preservative\nliquids in the airtight mason jar were two\neyeballs trailed by their optic nerves. At\nthe bottom of the jar sat a tongue. A note\naccompanying this jar reads: 'WARNING. KEEP\nTHIS IN A COOL PLACE IN THE DARK. CONTAINS\n2xSATYR EYES, 1x SATYR TONGUE.", "minecraft:end_crystal", ""),
        StaticItem("Poisionous mushroom soup", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Absurdly Large Carrot", "A carrot so very large, that it's a wonder\nhow it came to be. Its length and weight is\nsuch that it could be used as a club. The\nfern-like tuft at the top hangs loosely,\nstill green and fresh. +5 against 'Gnomes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nivndil.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bane Of The Gnomes", "...A stick...shoved into a raw carrot...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Bjor Cottonwood's Carrot", "", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Big Carrots", "Juicy carrots that are much larger in size\nthan most", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Astoundingly Large carrot", "An astroundingly large carrot, which would\nhave the proportions of an arm from a fully\ngrown human. It would have been influenced by\ndruidic magic in its growth, thus the cause\nof its large proportions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tevi Yelvairene.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("The black carrot of 1687", "A carrot prepared by Bjor Cottonwood. The\norange vegetable would be completely charred\nin a campfire during a meeting with Ozneat\nTreebeard, father of the founders of the\nCottonwood clan.", "minecraft:carrot", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Helm", "A Helm carved out of a large carrot. It bares\ngrooves from previous fights. It is\nsurprisingly sturdy\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Chest Piece", "A chest piece carved from a large carrot,\ngroves are placed to allow for movement of\nthe arms and bending of the chest. Designs of\na dwarf killing gnomes in various brutal ways\nare carved into the piece\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Pants", "Grieves carved from a large carrot. well\nplaced groves allow the bending of the joints\n. They are surprisingly sturdy\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Shoes", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by kido122.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Bjor's Majestic Cake", "A colorful, crayon-filled cake, well-formed\nand well-risen with an articulate amount of\nfrosting. Multiple shiny, iridescent specks\nwould be laid out atop the cake, as well as\nbeautiful-looking cookie crumbs laid atop.\nThe cake would be topped with a gnome's\ncrayon, set right in the center.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("BIG CARROT CAKE", "Oh BOY is this carrot cake delicious! Crumbly\nand carroty, this cake is everything a stupid\nDwarf could want to shovel into his drooling\nmaw. A Forest Dwarf could just not possibly\nbe more impressed by a cake made by Anabelle\nherself.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of periklis02", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Tall Magician's Hat", "A tall top-hat that once belonged to a\nmagician. It would be composed of a black\nvelvet, and smelled like an animal had been\ninside it. At the top of the hat would be a\nsmall compartment, as if it was used for\nstoring something discreetly.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Whiplashist.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Prince Alfred's Seed", "The truly magical seed of the Prince of\nCuron.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Guava", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bison Leather", "The hide is Ebony and very thick.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Beast720.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Pelt", "The pelt of a large boar, suitable for harsh\nwinter weather. The surface would be rough\nand slightly prickly.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("First on 1.10 Award: Askuzai", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Kowaman.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Ardenian Bastard Sword", "Forged from refined daemonsteel, this\nWaldenian-influenced bastard sword reaches a\ntotal of 48 inches in length. The blade\nitself is undecorated, but seemingly new.\nAlong the blade’s length is a thick fuller,\nallowing the sword to be notably lighter when\ncompared to the average bastard sword; it\nweighs in at approximately 4.2lbs. The 5”\nhilt is composed of black, crosshatched\nleather that ends at a twisted cylinder of\nweighted steel. Engraved within the hilt is a\npair of initials; “KA.”\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Keening.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kjartan's Battleaxe", "", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("❀ Wedding Garter ❀", "- A beautifully made wedding garter. It is\nmade of a soft white lacing, with floral\ndesigns around it. -", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Quaterstaff", "", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Bec de Corbin", "Otherwise known as \"the beak of the crow\" a\nBec de Corbin is easily compared to a poleaxe\nwith a metal head mounted to a length of wood\nby langlets. One side sports a long, curved\nspike while another has a blunt hammerhead.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pink Tulip", "A thin strand of white cloth holds this\nbundle of three pink tulips together. The\ntulips emit a soft fragrance.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Weighted Bola", "The bola consisted of a bear of weighted\nbearings bound together by a length of chain.\nUsually bolas are used in during hunts for\nsnaring big game.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Horen's Wraith", "A sharp double-edged Damascus Slayer-steel\ngladius with a tapered point. The handle of\nthe weapon is made from Elder Red-elm,\ntreated with Tung oil. The entire blade was\n35 inches.The gladius' handle provided a\nsolid grip by a knobbed hilt with ridges for\nthe fingers. Its cross-section was in the\nshame of a 'U' following around the start of\nthe blade, consisting of the steel tang and\nthe Elder Red-elm wood handle wrapped with\nleather intricately.\n－\nhttps://tinyurl.com/lotc-id9 －\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Emil.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Kopis", "A Kopis; shortblade weighed lighter than the\naverage arming sword. It was made from\nwrought iron and steel, a duo that proved\nit's durability. Sharp on one end, it was\nmeant for hacking and slicing, a deadly\nflourish of style and handling.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Omar.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Reaping Graven's Boots", "A pair of hide boots with ferrum bottoms and\nsmall platings along the tops of each boot.\nEach one of them weighs around 6 lbs each.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Thanhium.", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Predat'de na pre'ga (Boneclub)", "This is a gorundyr based club. This bone club\nwas made from the corpse of a bear and a\nwolf, There still seems to be blood on the\nbones left there for the design perhaps. A\nfew brown, black and gray feathers a tied to\nthe bottom of the odd club while various\nrunes are carved into the handle and a bone\ntooth necklace hangs from the bottom of the\nhandle. \"Dailur'je gjuf\" is nicely carved\ninto one of the bones on the club. This\nweapons has a gorundyr like aura to it. This\nwas made masterfully.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by XxEnderking.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Grand Norlandic War Axe!", "Sleepy Ireheart is scratched upon the handle\nof this axe.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Long Bow", "A long bow crafted by orcish smiths, worthy\nof fighting with a 200 pound draw weight.\nOnly strong orcs can draw its string.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Dress", "A long, deep green dress of simple, yet\nelegant design. It fastens around the neck\nwith a small, gold brooch, with a woven\npattern originating from it, designed after\nvines. A small silk band wraps around the\nbelly inside, allowing its size to be\nadjusted outwards considerably, for pregnant\nwomen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MinusOneMorale.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck's Frog", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Statue", "A small statue of a Norlandic soldier, the\nsoldier bears the armor of a man of Seahelm.\nThe soldier has his sword raised upwards,\nsymbolizing his faith to the Father.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Maukta Tribe Hatchet", "This hatchets handle is slightly darker\nweapon and is one and a half feet long at the\nhilt while the head adds an extra 8 inches\natop as it is engraved into the metal with\ntallies marked into it to represent the kills\non the weapon, the handle being wrapped with\nleather multiple times and the bottom stump\ncurving out ever so slightly then having a\nmetal liner at the bottom", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("~Silver Caged Heart Necklace~", "A delicate caged heart pendant with silver\nchain. The caged heart designed into\nswirls,holds a large 50 carat diamond.The\ndiamond polished and with no imperfections\nadds the perfect amount of sparkle to any\noutfit. Crafted in White Peak,1664.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aldyth var Burgundar.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Konungur'je Ristjal (Heavy Greatsword)", "A grand zweihander of Gorundyr make. The\nweapon's length is 70 inches while the blade\nitself is 58 inches. The parrying hooks are 4\ninches from the crossguard and the crossguard\nis a total of 10 inches in width. The length\nof the grip is 12 inches with a diamond\nshaped pommel at the bottom. The weight of\nthis greatsword is 6.4 pounds and it is\nperfectly balanced. Upon the length of the\nblade are number of Gorundyr runes. The grip\nis cross-woven leather that is tied nicely at\nthe crossguard. This Gorundyr blade is made\nof slayersteel, and it will easily cut\nthrough any undead being with the effects of\naurum, yet with the structural strength of\nsteel being present.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by PosidonX7.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Build-A-Charles \"The Bald\" Bear", "A stuffed bear in the shape of dwarven legend\nand hero, Charles \"The Bald\". The stuffed\nCharles \"The Bald\" would be very soft and\nenjoyable to overall hold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Atandt Irongrinder.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Edlynn Fiscere's Licence of Commerce", "A formal looking document of paper sheafs\nheld between two fold sof leather. The front\nwould hold a Rurikid seal. The pages within\nwould grant one Edlynn Fiscere the right to\nconduct the sale of mud pies. The bottom of\nthe page holds a Rurikid wax seal and the\nsignature of Thoromir Ruric.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wrothful.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Thoromir's Hunting Knife", "A 7.8 inch long weapon, with a steel blade.\nOn the blade you'll notice ancient Norlandic\nText. The handle itself is a smooth oak, with\ncloth wrapped around it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Book and Quill", "a very important book detailing the origin of\nnorland 10.0 and the holocaust", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("❖ Crystal Glass ❖", "Carefully crafted crystal goblets purifying\nthat which you pour in them.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of xXninja_mageXx", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("&Celestial Aegis&", "This Vambrace would be fit for an Orc in\nsize, mounted on the arm, jeweled with a\nlarge Diamond upon its centre and detailed in\nthe iconography of a Cockatrice. A single\nCockatrice feather would sprout from it. Upon\nusing the command word to activate the\nEnchantment the Brace would emit an Arcane\nShield of Octarine white Hue forming a disc\nabout 2 meters in radius. The Enchantment\nwould be capable of shrugging off all but the\nmightiest of blows.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Helmet", "This blessed Crown was forged by the\ngoldsmiths of High Pontiff Jude I for the\nCoronation of Achilius Horen in the Deep Cold\nof 1657. The Crown is encrusted with yellow,\npurple and black gemstones. A large purple\ngemstone would sit toward the front of the\nCrown. Engraved beside the gemstone would sit\na Dragon, with a Steed sitting on the\nopposite side, signifying the House Horen &\nHouse de Savin. It would also bear the seal\nof the Pontificate along with the Cross of\nHoren.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RollForWitches.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Kauri's Surfboard", "A 7ft surfboard made out of wood with the\nword Alpha carved in the middle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lucahz.", "minecraft:birch_boat", ""),
        StaticItem("✿ Rosenyr Signet ✿", "", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Proof of Rank", "A document detailing official membership\nwithin the Legion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by zePato.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("#1 Papa Diamond", "This diamond was carefully carved into a\nsmall heart-shaped form with a hole splitting\nit through the side, where one would attach\nit to a necklace thread. On the top layer, a\ncarving was carefully scripted in it's core,\nTo the greatest papa!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Maria-Clara's Ancestral Diamond", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Gentle Elf Cabernet", "A long aged wine from a long aged society of\nthe Mali'Aheral", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone of Egg", "A seemingly normal stone at first glance. It\nwould have a smooth surface and it would be\nno larger than the size of your hand. Though,\nanybody that touches this stone will smell\nlike rotten egg for one IRL hour, becoming\nnoticable to anyone within twelve feet of the\negg-smelling victim.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bluee.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclops's Toe", "A very large toe, belonging to a\nsignificantly big creature. Blood coats\nnearly the entire toe.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vanilla Milkshake", "A creamy, thick frozen drink that tastes\nstrongly of vanilla bean. It's clear that\nthis is homemade!", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Boot", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Moreau Quarter Staff", "A Quarter Staff Crafted by Auguste du Moreau\nfor Personal Use. The Body of the Staff would\nbe Carved out of Mahogany Wood, Measuring\nabout 7 Feet Long. Both ends of the Staff\nwould be Bound with a Rounded Blackened Iron\nCap, one that would Hold Grooves in which\nwould be Very Effective against others. The\nCenter of the Staff would be Wrapped with a\nBlue Leather, Marking the Family's Primary\nColor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auguste du Moreau.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Winter's Wind, Slayersteel Saber", "A slayersteel saber rests here, obtaining a\nhilt of pure ivory and fitted with an\nornamented sheath. The blade itself seems to\nexude some sort of distant reverence,\ninspiring those around with thoughts of\nconquest and victory. The hilt is set with\ntwo fire opals surrounding a single\nmoonstone. Long and domineering, the blade\nwas strong and swaggering, like it's owner.\nIt harkens to distant memories of wartorn\nbattlefields, as if a chilling wind blew\naround it. A regal weapon of cruel purport.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahariayy.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Opal and Emerald Ring of House D'Orleans", "The ring would not be a simplistic piece. Its\ncenter piece would have a leafy green fire\nopal set in side of a ring of smaller dark\ngreen emeralds. For a band the ring would be\na simple ploished silver with the words\nQueen of tarts, and my heart\" scrawled into\nthe outside of the band. the inside of the\nband under the opal would have a small\ntrident with a line through its shaft to sign\nit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Eyes of Yours", "This diamond expels elegance and class, a\nshining colour that could only be described\nas the magnificence of your own eyes'. A deep\ncarving was expertly crafted into the top\nlayer... \"Those Diamond Eyes of Yours.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Accrayer.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Eagle Eye's Tears", "A small White cup filled with a salty liquid.\nIt consists of Eagleeyekk's Tears, from not\nbeing in the Tome of Thegns.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lionbileti.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("A Bundled Baby", "A newborn baby, very carefully bundled up\ninto a soft & warm green blanket. The blanket\nholds the little one with his arms and legs\ntucked into his body, and comes up slightly\nover his head to cover his little noggin &\nhis ears.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sybbyl.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Diamond Ring", "A ring made of a simple gold band, A deep red\ncolored diamond is mounted into the setting.\nThe diamond is cut to look like that of a\nrose in bloom. The initials ‘LDF’ are carved\non the inside of the band.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Jorvik's Ashen Crown", "A thorned crown made of ashwood branches,\nit's simple and lightweight. Circa; 9th of\nMalin's welcome 1687.", "minecraft:wooden_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sceptre of Adreo", "A Recovered Sceptre from the Lands of Adreo,\nonce held by The High Prince. The Shaft would\nbe Crafted out of Lairnic Spruce, Engraved\nwith an Ancient Dialect. The Head of The\nSceptre would be Made of Solid Gold, Covered\nin Rubies.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Treatycole.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Amulet", "An iron amulet, the amulet is shaped in the\ndesign of a hand doing an okay symbol.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Professorus.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Celenus' Morning Bounty", "It is written in the legends of the supreme\nbeauty molded by the delicacy of the patron\nof beauty within the bounty of her heart.\nWithin her soul, the wither has found the\npillar of emerald that has been cursed to\nhold the continuation of purity and sobriety,\nand thus who holds the bounty will be forever\nbeloved by the eyes of their peers. It is\nwritten.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by roseways.", "minecraft:emerald_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Garde de Loyauté", "a long, slender, sharply pointed sword. The\nhandguard of the rapier resembles that of a\nthorny rose vine. the pommel of the blade is\na rounded bulb with the letters 'LDF' carved\ninto it.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Homme | Rapier", "Homme - A poetic piece of metal and leather,\nit had a length of 38\" inches and was\ncomprised of high grade Steel and Aurum make.\nAlong the sides were delicate patterns of\nlines and stars that were created from\nwelding and folding. The exuberant hues\nranged from light purple, yellow and oranges.\nIt had a twisted triangular cross-section,\nand the guard was of a sea-shell design. The\nhandle was wrapped in dark leather treated\nwith Tung Oil. The Pommel was a red-ruby\nwrapped in three steel claws that encased it.\nEngraved on the handle was 'Ａｒｔｙ'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Artemis.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Refined Chalice of the Rosnians", "Crafted from the most lusterious gold from\nthe mines of Adreo, the cupe exudes a loud,\nalmost disarranging aura of ostentation. The\nrim, being made of a highly opaque green\nMurano glass, distorts the light seen through\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cheesus_Crustt.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ardol Baladan", "A beautiful craft of a weapon, clearly from a\nmaster. Wyvern scales decorate the shaft of\nthe axe as well as the bottom of the axe head\nitself.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Khain eron Norkai", "The band of the ring is made of diamonds with\na bit of gold. If you are to look very\nclosely you would be able to see a few\ndwarven words that read “Oz livu thamar must\nnorkai ahran vath nar yoran!” This ring is\nvery ancient.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by lucasking321.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Khain eron Powerumm", "The band of the ring is made of emeralds and\na few gems. If you are to look very closely\nyou would be able to see a few dwarven words\nthat read “ Kavir yol-mer omur, thamar canak\nekorok thamar ovar onlruk kavok.” This ring\nis made for a dwarf.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by lucasking321.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Kill Yourself Rose", "disgusting name", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Rum o’ Myebor", "A home brewed rum, made in Mynebor with an\nextra ingredient of cinnamon and a pinch of\npaprika to give it a sharp but smooth flavor.\nAged for 5 months.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by J33xt101.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Angrist", "The sword used by Toshi Tsuyoshi in the days\nof Oren. Used by him later in the war days of\nCourland and Haense. Now in possession of his\nfriend Edgar.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Chain Links", "", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Ramblings of Durlak", "", "minecraft:written_book", "")
    )

    private fun _ATLAS_50(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Ears of Renee Silma", "Ears of the dagger elf that is Renee\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Knox213.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner Prototype", "A prototype of the new Silvervein Banner\nshowing the Crow that represents the Clan.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by StripezPurple.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Dapper Hat", "This hat has been finely stitched and made to\nfit a dwarfs noggen, it having a grand design\nand resistant to the elements ((minus fire))\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [1M] Vagronda \"Dorzada\" Ireheart.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Leg of Marys Lamb", "A fat leg of lamb seasoned with rosemary", "minecraft:cooked_mutton", ""),
        StaticItem("Spicy Chicken Meal", "A small cornish hen slathered in the hottest\nspices known to Dwarven kind. It served with\na nice heap of mashed potatoes and gravy with\na nice bed of spinach beside that", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Chip Brownies", "Soft morsel of chocolate chip brownies could\nbe seen here, huge chunks of chocolate litter\nthe insides of this pastry", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Eggs & Ham", "This tasty dish is seasoned with green spices\ntainting the meat to the color , beside it\nare nice sunny side eggs which are also\ncolored green.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Pork Heart", "A nice fat pork heart filled with garlic,\nmushroom and onion can be seen here. It\ngrilled and juicy when cut into.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Bucket of Minotaur Blood", "A regular bucket of minotaur blood. It would\nhave a similar consistency to cow blood, and\nwould, over time, begin to grow viscous and\nstain the bucket it was contained in.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by The Trapped Minotaur.", "minecraft:bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Thorgrimm's Dwarven Axe", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Griswald (Viking Sword)", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cottonwood Ale", "A golden hued bottle of ale that i renamed\nfor you. <3", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bogrin's Axe", "An axe, crafted by Gotrek Starbreaker for the\nGrandaxe father. The head of the axe has a\nconsistency of a gold-diamond color. With\neach swing, whether it be practice or not,\nthe user would feel as if they were Bogrin.\nAt times, there would be heart-touching\nvisions of Bogrin protecting his kin with the\naxe.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Grandaxe Pie", "This Pie is very sweat and full of\ningrediants only found in Kal'Bogrin. it was\nbaked by Borin Grandaxe.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Chewable Sunflower Seeds", "", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("3 of Clubs", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Come visit the Jayamen Retreat! A great getaway for you and some friends, you and your partner, or just yourself! We have many fun activities to do there! Simply send Jaya Jayamen ((Sofetios)) a bird to get a room or rooms!", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("4 of Clubs", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ace of Hearts", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kilgrim_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Ace of Clubs", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Queen of Clubs", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("4 of Hearts", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kilgrim_.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("9 of Clubs", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("3 of Spades", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("8 of Clubs", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("The Most Raw Chicken Imaginable", "This chicken is fresh off the bone, blood\nstill dripping off of it with a residual red\ncolour. Legend says that this chicken is so\nraw, that even the hottest of ovens can not\ncook it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Teodus Kastrovat.", "minecraft:chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("Cross of the Golden Steed", "A golden Maltese Cross, bearing a white\nenamel Santegian Stallion upon its face. Its\nreverse is a struck with a portrait of\nLeoiarizaltzu Salbatzaile de Savin, King of\nSantegia, below which is the date '1635'. It\nis held by a crimson ribbon. Presented to\nthose ennobled with a Knighthood under the\nOrder of the Golden Steed, on the 10th of\nSun's smile, 1635.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Lesburdadian", "", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Admin notice this is knox213 msg me when u r online for your 12k minas", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Foraged Finest", "", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Crank Crossbow", "", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Kathael's Flute", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Plain Smoking Pipe", "A simple wooden pipe made for smoking various\nsubstances. It appears to be old and well\nused, dark smudges staining the iron bowl and\nsoot embedded in the wood grain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SinfulSainthood.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ursula's Washbasin", "", "minecraft:hopper", ""),
        StaticItem("@", "", "minecraft:command_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Mirror", "", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("OSP Banner", "", "minecraft:banner", "")
